+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_227_9": "Meeting again after all those years... I wonder what was going through your mind in that moment?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_25_1": "The Humanities Classroom always seems to have a calm, unhurried air about it.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_25_2": "The bookshelf by the window is lined neatly with sample essays and books of every kind, and next to the lectern, the board still holds what Miss Galbrena wrote during the last class discussion.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_25_3": "A few desks still have notes left out on them, and the same question often takes on entirely different meanings in different hands.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_25_4": "Studying the humanities is mostly about dealing with people, society and ideas. The goal isn't one right answer. It's learning to see a problem from many sides.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_25_5": "You can't study the humanities without knowing how to read, analyze, compare, argue and express yourself. A single sentence, a passage, even an idea that seems simple can mean something new when seen from a different perspective.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_25_6": "That's why questions with no apparent right answer warrant careful thought and discussion.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_25_7": "Real learning has never been about picking a single path. It's about connecting the dots across disciplines, giving yourself richer ways to understand the world.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_25_8": "Review what you learned in class here and lock in what you've studied. Or think among the words on these pages, understand this complicated world through feeling, and find your own answers between the lines.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_1": "You knock twice on the door of the Student Council office, then push it open.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_10": "If you're interested in joining the Student Council, {PlayerName}, your first duties would be paperwork.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_11": "Checking records, organizing files, issuing notices... None of it is complicated, but it is tedious. So it's quite a test of patience.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_12": "But if you get these details right first, you'll make fewer slips when the work grows more complex.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_13": "Changli pauses for a beat. Her gaze rests on your hands around the coffee cup, then slowly rises to meet your eyes, warm and tender.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_14": "Hehe... Above everything else, {PlayerName}, I trust that you can do the Council's work well.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_15": "Naturally, you needn't shoulder much at first. It's like laying out a game of Weiqi. Players are told to think three moves ahead, but the stone you're placing now matters just as much.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_16": "Right... Understood. You've got a strategist's mind, Changli.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_17": "Oh? I simply believe all things are guided in ways we cannot see. Perhaps that's how I came to meet you that day, {PlayerName}...",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_18": "But let's leave that be. Once you've grown familiar with the Student Council's work, {PlayerName}, more will naturally come your way.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_19": "And by then, perhaps you and I can put our heads together over the problems that are genuinely difficult?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_2": "Seeing who it is, the Student Council President puts her pen aside and lifts her eyes to you with a smile.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_3": "Caught you at a good time, Changli?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_4": "Ah, you're here, {PlayerName}. Care for a cup of coffee?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_5": "Before you can answer, she's already up and switching on the coffee machine. A warm cup then lands in your hands.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_6": "It's rare that you have the time to visit the Student Council. If you're in no hurry, shall I show you around?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_7": "The Student Council handles all manner of student affairs at the school. Day-to-day administration, planning events, liaising between student organizations and passing on their feedback, and so on.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_8": "If anything at school ever makes life difficult for you, {PlayerName}, do come to me.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_300_9": "Changli gestures for you to sit at the guest table. With a slight nod, she pushes a tidy pile of files your way.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_30_1": "There is always a quiet, contemplative atmosphere to the Science Classroom.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_30_2": "All kinds of equipment cover the lab benches, while half-erased formulas linger across the blackboard. Even the models tucked into the corners of the cabinets bear the wear of countless experiments and observations.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_30_3": "Miss Verina's potted plants sit on the windowsill, softly unfurling their leaves in the sun and wind.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_30_4": "To study science is to tease order out of chaos. It means dismantling complex problems, constructing models, and anchoring every conclusion in rigorous calculation, experiment, and proof.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_30_5": "Every measurement, every calculation, every verification is there to bring you closer to the real answer.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_30_6": "And asking a question worth pursuing is the first step toward discovery.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_30_7": "Real learning has never been about picking a single path. It's about connecting the dots across disciplines, giving yourself richer ways to understand the world.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_30_8": "Review what you learned in class here and lock in what you've studied. Or search among formulas and numbers for the laws that make the world run, dismantling this tangled world with reason until you uncover answers of your own.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_1": "Oh, {PlayerName}!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_10": "The Orchestral Music Club is a good example. Each piece calls for its own sectional rehearsal before the full ensemble plays it through. You could keep a list of what's going wrong, {PlayerName}, and then we'd work through them one thing at a time.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_11": "Once you've gotten used to the Club Association's work and have the hang of it, {PlayerName}, you'll be ready for bigger challenges.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_12": "So mostly it's coordinating the clubs' affairs and helping out with club activities. Right?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_13": "Mm-hm, exactly!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_14": "Cartethyia raises her hand for a high five, her bright eyes all but bouncing with eagerness.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_15": "I've always hoped I'd get to fight alongside you someday, {PlayerName}!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_2": "Cartethyia's head pops up the moment you walk in, and her face breaks into a sunny smile. She drops her armful of files on the desk and rushes over.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_3": "Hehe, welcome, {PlayerName}! This is the Club Association's main activity room!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_4": "I don't know if you've noticed, {PlayerName}, but our school has always had lots of clubs. Actually, I'd say having so many is part of what makes this school special. Same as the hotpot parties!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_5": "Everyone has their own training schedules and plans, and sometimes a few of them want to get together for a mixer. But if they book the same time or the same place, uh-oh.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_6": "That's where the Club Association comes in. We coordinate and keep it all running. What do you think, {PlayerName}? Wanna give it a try?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_7": "She edges closer, eyes bright, a hopeful gleam in them as she watches you.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_8": "Things like sorting out each club's training needs, or scheduling the activity rooms and the art room!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_400_9": "Hmm... And you could also join in and help with everyone's everyday training yourself, {PlayerName}.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_500_1": "Welcome, customer.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_500_10": "Very well. Please come again.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_500_2": "Would you like to buy a \"Pero-licious Second Solaris School Coming-of-Age Ceremony Limited-Edition Handmade Cookie\"?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_500_3": "I baked them fresh this morning, in all sorts of flavors.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_500_4": "<color=#e46969>Buy</color> a handmade cookie.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_500_5": "No, thanks, Roccia.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_500_6": "That's a mouthful... Could I just get one cookie, Roccia?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_500_7": "I will need the item's exact name, customer. Otherwise I can't be sure I'm giving you the right product.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_500_8": "...One \"Pero-licious Second Solaris School Coming-of-Age Ceremony Limited-Edition Handmade Cookie,\" please.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_500_9": "Thank you for your purchase, customer. We hope to see you again.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_550_1": "Today's \"Pero-licious Second Solaris School Coming-of-Age Ceremony Limited-Edition Handmade Cookies\" are all sold out.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_550_2": "Thank you for supporting my little shop, {PlayerName}, my valued customer.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_550_3": "I had a very good day today. Did you like the cookies, {PlayerName}?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_550_4": "They were delicious.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_550_5": "Some flavors were... interesting.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_550_6": "I'm glad you liked them, {PlayerName}.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_550_7": "Hmm... Really? I thought they were rather fun.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_550_8": "Should I make a bigger batch next time...",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_1": "You push open the restaurant door, and the familiar bell chimes softly. It's the middle of the rush, and the place is a lot livelier than on your last visit.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_10": "Sorry, it's been so busy today that I almost forgot you were coming to help out... Okay, let me give you a quick rundown first, {PlayerName}.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_11": "Most of the work here is greeting customers, taking orders, bringing out food, clearing tables, and some simple prep. You can start with the basics, {PlayerName}, and get used to the pace of the place little by little.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_12": "Once you've got some experience and know how everything works, you can gradually take on more. Like trying out the register at the front counter, for example?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_13": "Okay, got it.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_14": "It's different from school, so it might feel a little strange at first... But wherever you are, the job's the same: do what's in front of you, and do it right.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_15": "Good luck, {PlayerName}. If anything's unclear, just ask me.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_2": "Sunlight falls through the windows onto the spotless floor. Now and then, the bright clang of a spatula against a pan rings out from the kitchen, and the air still holds the wheaty smell of fresh-baked bread and the warmth of a rich soup.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_3": "Customers waiting to order sip their drinks by the window, while Chisa hurries out of the kitchen with a stack of gleaming plates in her arms.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_4": "Welcome! Today's special is... Oh, it's you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_5": "Before she can finish, a customer at another table calls her over. Chisa quickly breaks off to answer them, then gives you an apologetic smile.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_6": "Coming, right away! Have a seat, {PlayerName}. I'll be with you shortly.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_7": "You nod to her and sit down at the nearest empty table. Business here is even busier than you'd imagined.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_8": "Still, even with more customers than expected, Chisa doesn't seem flustered. Every step she takes is calm and orderly.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_5_9": "She's changed into a simple apron and is weaving around the restaurant, tackling one small task after another. But she's every bit as earnest and focused as she is at school, when she's absorbed in her classes and inventions.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_600_1": "With the ensemble performance done and the venue briefly rearranged, the elimination round moves on to its last event.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_600_2": "The solo assessment, which each club's core members take on alone. The scores from it also count heavily toward the elimination round's rankings.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_600_3": "Next, each of them faces the judges alone, demonstrating technical skill and a firm command of their section's part.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_600_4": "Drawing a deep breath, you set your score in place, then nod to the judges.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_600_5": "The solo assessment of the Nationals elimination round officially begins.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_701_1": "Hehe, trusting you was the right call! I just knew you could do it. You saw it all the way through, like a knight of the old tales!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_702_1": "Nicely done! Teaming up with you always puts a smile on my face, {PlayerName}.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_703_1": "You've worked hard. With you on the job, I can always rest easy. Shall we... take a short break over a cup of hot tea?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_704_1": "All settled, and neatly. Everything is in order, so neither of us need trouble ourselves over it any further.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_705_1": "Mm... It's resolved without a hitch. When I'm with you, I can always work through problems calmly.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_706_1": "That went just as smoothly as I expected. Let's work side by side next time, too.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_707_1": "Let's celebrate with my portable confetti popper. I knew it would be fine with you there, {PlayerName}.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_708_1": "A perfect finish. And now, a round of applause for our best helper—{PlayerName}.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_709_1": "Now I can finally breathe again... Thank you, {PlayerName}. I'm glad I asked you for help.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_710_1": "Phew... Everything went well. Thank you for all your hard work, {PlayerName}. It was a little tiring, but it's a memory I'll treasure.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_711_1": "Good work, {PlayerName}. Job's done. Want to go grab some ice cream?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_712_1": "Mm. That's the trouble dealt with. We make an efficient hunting team.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_713_1": "Oh, so this is the miracle of hard work bearing fruit! Thank you, {PlayerName}. And don't forget to rest up properly, okay?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_714_1": "Wonderful! Thanks to your help, {PlayerName}, I got to share in the joy of the harvest too!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_715_1": "Now, that was an adventure! Getting to write a story like this with you made my day!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_716_1": "What a lovely ending! Ideas for new music are flooding in. So, what do you feel like hearing today?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_717_1": "Hm, it all went smoothly. Thank you for your hard work. We'd have spent a lot longer on this without you.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_718_1": "This result is even better than my initial projection. Working with you always brings a few pleasant surprises.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_719_1": "Ooh, not bad, not bad! Looks like I picked the right person for this job.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_720_1": "Whoa, nice one, Boss! Once you're on the case, no problem's too big to crack!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_721_1": "Heh heh, I just knew you'd pull it off! C'mon, time to celebrate over a good meal!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_722_1": "Just as I expected! You on the job means smooth sailing, obviously. Let's go, let's go. My treat today!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_801_1": "It's fine! Even the knights in stories miss a swing now and then. Let's get our footing back and give it another go together!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_802_1": "There's no need to dwell on the result, {PlayerName}. One misstep doesn't undo everything you've put in, and experience counts as a gain, too.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_803_1": "It's okay. A less-than-ideal result doesn't disprove the method. Next time, we'll just adjust it to the situation.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_804_1": "No rush. I'll keep at it with you, {PlayerName}. But right now, I think what you really need is a rest.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_805_1": "If you're tired, please take a break. Don't force yourself. I'm sure you'll manage it next time, {PlayerName}.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_806_1": "Didn't see that coming... If you get knocked down, you get back up, until the problem's dealt with for good. A failed operation still has lessons to teach.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_807_1": "Just as breeding flowers never goes smoothly, everyone hits a rough patch sometimes. Next time, let's figure it out together.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_808_1": "Don't worry, a curtain call isn't the end of the show, you know. Besides, a story always needs a few bumps along the way, or the later chapters wouldn't be half as fun!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_809_1": "Thank you for trying. It looks like something went wrong at one of the steps. If you're free, we could track down the cause together.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_810_1": "Aw, no biggie, no biggie! With Boss's skills, you'll make it back next time, no doubt!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_811_1": "Hm? Don't tell me you were just too hungry, {PlayerName}. C'mon, let's go get something good to eat together! Heh heh, can't do a thing on an empty stomach, right?",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_900_1": "{PlayerName}! Got a sec in that schedule of yours? I need a hand with something!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_900_2": "I'd feel a lot better about this if we put our heads together on it.",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_901_1": "Hey, uh, {PlayerName}... I've got a bit of a sticky situation going on...",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_901_2": "Got time to help me sort it out? I kept going back and forth, and honestly, it's gotta be you...",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_902_1": "Oh, I see... Bad timing for you? Hey, no sweat. Really!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_902_2": "You really have been swamped lately, {PlayerName}. I totally get it!",
+  "ACTION_AVGspecial_902_3": "Just don't forget to take breaks, and get plenty of rest!",
   "AMS31_1_1": "(Look at her.)",
   "AMS31_1_2": "...",
   "AMS31_1_3": "You look toward \"Aemeath.\" She is quietly resting on the sofa, eyes closed.",
@@ -1307,6 +1700,2089 @@
   "ATYDZH_9_7": "Gladiators don't say sorry.",
   "ATYDZH_9_8": "Yes, sir.",
   "ATYDZH_9_9": "We speak with steel. We dance with death. We live and fall for glory.",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_1": "Haiya, Boss! Looking to boost your popularity?",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_10": "You got it! Lemme cook up something good...",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_11": "After a moment's thought, Buling starts hammering away at her keyboard. Soon, a thread with a catchy title and a hot take on a trending topic hits the forum's front page, bringing your exploits at school to everyone's attention.",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_12": "Your Popularity has increased significantly.",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_13": "Th-That much...?!",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_14": "Heh... Hehehe... Finally! A chance to unleash my FULL POWER! Say no more, Boss! I'm going ALL OUT!",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_15": "Buling takes a deep breath. Her fingers become a blur, hammering the keyboard so furiously that sparks seem to fly. The moment she hits Post, the forum's front page is flooded with traffic. In less than three minutes, students are flocking in with their phones, all desperate to see the legendary thread for themselves.",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_16": "For months afterward, the thread holds the top spot on the forum's rankings, while its contents spawn memes that take the entire school by storm and show no sign of dying out.",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_17": "Your Popularity has skyrocketed! You've become the school's newest legend!",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_2": "I can spread the word about you on the forum! Fair prices, no scams, satisfaction guaranteed!",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_3": "Make a shitpost.",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_4": "Post some quality content.",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_5": "Make a legendary post.",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_6": "Maybe another time.",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_7": "You got it, Boss!",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_8": "Buling's fingers fly across the keyboard. It's just a throwaway post, but enough people scroll past it that your name starts looking familiar around the forum.",
+  "AVG_BLLTFT_1_9": "Your Popularity has increased slightly.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_1": "Welcome to the Namipon Gym, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_10": "In the script... there's Transport Namipon, who punches faster than the eye can see and can knock a big truck flying.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_11": "Detective Namipon, with an IQ of 5,000, who can see a few seconds into the future.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_12": "And Courier Namipon, who sits above the law of cause and effect. It's so fast it can take an enemy down before they even notice.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_13": "So, {PlayerName}. Which one will be your partner?",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_14": "Transport Namipon.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_15": "Detective Namipon.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_16": "Courier Namipon.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_17": "Mm. That was also just the script.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_18": "You showed up late, {PlayerName}, so this Regular Namipon is the only one left.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_19": "That's not fair!",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_2": "Here, every student who has turned ten gets a Namipon of their own.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_20": "It's fine. I just know this one's the strongest.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_21": "Hm. That twist is written in on purpose... Your first partner needs a touch of \"fate,\" after all.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_22": "That anime has a scene just like that. I'm a fan myself, actually. That's why I'm helping out.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_23": "By the way, I'm playing Professor Namipon.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_24": "Anyway, go on. Your adventure with your Namipon starts now.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_3": "Together with your Namipon, you'll meet new Namipons, grow side by side, battle tough rivals at Gyms, collect badges... until one day, you become a Namipon Master.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_4": "...Mm. Or so the script says.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_5": "Bit over the top, isn't it?",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_6": "You got it. Namipon Master, here I come!",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_7": "Shh. Truth is, everyone at the Capybara Cafe watched too much anime, and now they're role-playing.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_8": "I see. Looks like you'll get along with the Namipons just fine, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_1_9": "First, pick one of the three Starter Namipons to be your first partner.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_2_1": "Phew... I think that battle was exactly what the Namipons wanted. Thank you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_2_10": "Oh, that reminds me. The Namipons look tired, so I'll take them back to the Capybara Cafe.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_2_11": "Until next time, {PlayerName}. Have a good Ceremony.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_2_2": "Please take this Lucky Draw Ticket as a memento of your visit.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_2_3": "The Namipons and I made it together. In the script, it's the reward for every Trainer who conquers the Namipon Gym.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_2_4": "...Though if you ask me, the Namipons just wanted to use the Coming-of-Age Ceremony as an excuse to goof around with us.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_2_5": "After all, they're the town's mascots. They must love this school as much as we do, and want to do their part to protect it.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_2_6": "Thanks. I had a blast.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_2_7": "Never thought I'd see this side of you, Chisa.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_2_8": "Mm. Goofing around like this... It was fun.",
+  "AVG_BZDG_2_9": "Well... Didn't you go through that phase as a kid, {PlayerName}? Setting off on an adventure with your one and only partner, and all that...",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_1": "You step into the family restaurant and nearly walk straight into Chisa on her way out.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_10": "I was actually on my way to find you. But since you got here first, please accept my congratulations.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_11": "Thank you, Chisa. I came looking for you too.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_12": "To... say goodbye?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_13": "Not so much a goodbye as... I just missed the food here. And the coffee.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_14": "Okay, then sit down. I'll make you a cup of coffee.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_15": "You nod and settle onto the sofa. Chisa comes over with a cup of coffee.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_16": "You take it and watch the steam curl upward slowly. Then the sofa dips as Chisa sits down beside you.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_17": "After graduation... will you be leaving town, {PlayerName}?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_18": "Probably. I came here to study, and now that's done, I can finally go home for a while.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_19": "Home. The word feels familiar and distant all at once. You can't quite picture what that even looks like.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_2": "When she sees it's you, her eyes widen.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_20": "I see. Looking back, so much has happened this year since you came to this town. We all had such good times together.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_21": "This family restaurant, the Liaison Center... you've helped me so much.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_22": "I know it's not really time to say goodbye yet, but since it's just us two, I'll go ahead and say it now.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_23": "Chisa looks up, her eyes earnest as she meets your gaze.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_24": "I will catch up to you one day, Senpai.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_25": "Catch up to me?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_26": "...Senpai?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_27": "You're a year ahead of me, so you'll graduate first. But I want to make a promise with you.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_28": "...Not used to me calling you that?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_29": "You're a year ahead of me, so you'll graduate first. But I want to make a promise with you.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_3": "Oh, {PlayerName}...",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_30": "Once I've finished my studies, I'll come visit you. No matter where you are, I'll come find you. With confidence. Head held high.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_31": "And by then, you'll see a brilliant Kuchiba Chisa who lived her campus life with no regrets.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_32": "Then it's a promise.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_33": "I believe in you, Chisa.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_34": "Mm, yes. We'll have plenty of opportunities to see each other in the future.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_35": "She presses her hands together, her smile brimming with anticipation.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_4": "Chisa is dressed to go out, bag already on her shoulder. The restaurant is empty save for her, and the chairs and tables are all neatly in place.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_5": "Were you just heading out?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_6": "Mm-hmm. But I don't think I need to anymore.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_7": "...?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_8": "Chisa takes a long, quiet breath before looking into your eyes and smiling.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_10_9": "Happy graduation, {PlayerName}!",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_1": "As you finish your coffee and get up to leave, Chisa hurries up beside you.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_10": "You'll be leaving soon, so take it with you. As a keepsake.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_11": "I'll hold on to it.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_12": "Chisa's eyes are sincere. Everything you've shared seems to shimmer there in a faint glimmer.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_13": "Every last thing… her irises flowing like starlight.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_2": "Wait. There's something I want to give you.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_3": "You pause, staring at Chisa's lowered head as she holds out a paper card with both hands.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_4": "I just finished it recently. Please, take it.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_5": "It was my first attempt, so it took a fair amount of paper...",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_6": "You take it and realize the card is a folded piece of kirigami. Carefully, you unfold it.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_7": "Silhouettes of buildings rise from the solid-colored base, and at the center of that little townscape stands a familiar black-haired girl.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_8": "Blue skies, cherry blossoms in full bloom, the peaceful scenery of my hometown... and everything we've been through together...",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_11_9": "Everything <ano=Kuchiba Chisa>I</ano> hold dear is right here.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_1": "You arrive at the Orchestral Music Club's activity room. The moment you open the door, a bright melody greets you.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_10": "Good point. Guess we can have a proper goodbye after all.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_11": "The results for the Nationals aren't out yet, and it's far too early for goodbyes.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_12": "What we're really here to do is... \"celebrate your graduation.\"",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_13": "A wistful note slips into Cartethyia's voice.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_14": "When we first met in the school square, I was still imagining what campus life would be like.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_15": "Turns out, it was even livelier and happier than I'd imagined. I keep thinking of everyone's smiles. And... all the time I spent with you.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_16": "Ah, no, no. When did I get so sentimental?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_17": "She gives her cheeks a quick pat, then clenches a fist and proceeds to give herself a pep talk.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_18": "<ano=Everyone's>Our</ano> story is nowhere near over, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_19": "Graduation is only an epilogue. You're simply setting off on your next journey a little earlier than the rest of us.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_2": "Cartethyia is playing the trumpet. She skips over to you, light on her feet, never taking the trumpet from her lips.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_20": "One day, our paths will cross again... And one day, we'll stand side by side once more.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_21": "I'll be looking forward to that day, Cartethyia.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_22": "Yes. I will be, too.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_23": "Cartethyia tucks a stray lock of hair behind her ear and smiles at you, her heart at ease.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_3": "...?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_4": "She circles you once, and the melody comes to a close.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_5": "Con-grat-u-la-tions!",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_6": "Well? How do you like the little graduation tune I put together for you?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_7": "Thank you. How'd you know I'd come here?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_8": "Knowing you, I figured you'd spend today visiting everyone. So I came here early and set up a little \"ambush.\"",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_20_9": "If I'd gone somewhere else, you might've had a hard time finding me. Wouldn't want to make things difficult for you, would I?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_1": "Just as you're about to leave, Cartethyia calls you back and holds up a finger.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_10": "You carefully take the puppets from her with both hands.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_11": "Ahem. And now, I, playing as the Blessed Maiden, shall bestow a blessing on the knight before his travels.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_12": "...May your journey be filled with laughter and joy. And... may every wish in your heart come true.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_13": "In the pale golden dusk, she folds her hands and murmurs her blessing, almost like a prayer.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_14": "You watch her for a long while, trying to etch the image of this girl and this light into your memory.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_2": "Oh, I almost forgot. I have a present for you. Close your eyes first.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_3": "You do as she says.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_4": "All right. You can look now.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_5": "You open your eyes. Both her hands are now wearing hand puppets, one a knight with a majestic aura, the other a rather wicked-looking sea monster.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_6": "Today's story is... the great battle between a righteous knight and the wicked sea monster!",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_7": "The puppets come alive under her hands. Knight and monster trade blow after blow, an even match, neither giving ground.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_8": "As the sea monster falls at last beneath the knight's blade, Cartethyia pushes both hands forward and offers the puppets to you.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_21_9": "I made them myself back when I was at the orphanage. They got me through plenty of hard nights. From now on, let them keep you company during your journeys in my place.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_1": "You walk into the Student Council room and find Changli alone in the spacious office.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_10": "Changli studies you meaningfully for a moment.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_11": "Well, since you're the one suggesting it... would you mind keeping me company while I unwind?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_12": "Changli seems to have anticipated your offer. She reaches into her desk drawer and takes out an elegant tea set.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_13": "Soon the room fills with the rich aroma of tea. She pours you a cup, then settles beside you with one of her own.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_14": "...I wish there was more I could do for the school before I graduate.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_15": "The way I see it, you've already given it everything you have, President Changli.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_16": "Thank you.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_17": "...Hm?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_18": "With my health the way it is, I never could've done any of this without you and the others.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_19": "This school year with everyone is a memory I would not trade for anything.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_2": "She's leaning against the desk, gazing out the window, turning something over in her mind.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_20": "Neither would I.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_21": "What a year it's been.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_22": "The two of you sit quietly, drinking your tea without a word.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_23": "It's a little bitter at first, but soon a delicate sweetness lingers on your tongue.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_24": "Tell me. You'll be leaving town once you graduate, won't you?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_25": "You nod. For an instant, something dims in Changli's eyes, though her smile remains calm.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_26": "As for me, I think I'll stay here and rest for a while before deciding what comes next.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_27": "I'll come back and visit this town again one day.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_28": "Hearing your words, Changli holds your gaze for a long moment. Then she lowers her eyes, and her smile loosens into something close to relief.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_29": "Encounters and partings are both a part of the journey. What matters is cherishing the present. And for me...",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_3": "You're still wondering whether to greet her when she turns toward you, a gentle warmth lighting her eyes.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_30": "The moment at hand is the best present.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_4": "There you are, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_5": "What were you thinking about just now?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_6": "Oh, we're expecting quite a few important results tomorrow. The Qualifying Exam results, placements for the National Music Competition...",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_7": "Regardless of whether the school meets Celestial Steed Corp's evaluation criteria, the Student Council must do everything in its power to protect the students' interests.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_8": "We've prepared contingency plans in advance, of course. But they're far from perfect in the details.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_30_9": "If nothing is getting settled until tomorrow, why not take today to relax? And if there's anything I can help with, just say so.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_1": "As you're about to leave, Changli hands you an elegant letter.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_10": "Give it a try when the time comes, and you'll find out.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_11": "You're still trying to decipher the meaning in her eyes when something warm closes around your wrist.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_12": "Changli leans in, takes hold of your wrist, and presses the letter into your hand without another word.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_13": "Judging by the way she hands it over, she fully expects a letter from you before long.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_2": "Crimson bird feathers adorn the envelope, giving off a clean, refreshing scent.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_3": "You... wrote me a letter?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_4": "I'm afraid I must disappoint you. The paper inside is blank.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_5": "Changli smiles at your puzzled look.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_6": "If you think of me on your travels and wish to speak with me, write what you want to say on the paper.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_7": "No matter where you are or how far apart we may be, your message will reach me.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_8": "Is this some kind of magical item?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_31_9": "Wait, you're serious?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_1": "You make your way to the school auditorium and find a familiar figure on the stage with her back to you.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_10": "You can always come back whenever you feel like it. I'm sure Principal Abby won't mind.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_11": "Haha, you're right! I'll definitely make time to come back for a visit.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_12": "I wonder what the Orchestral Music Club will be like in the years to come. I'm honestly looking forward to seeing what those kids come up with!",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_13": "Speaking of which, do you have someone in mind to take over as club leader after you graduate?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_14": "Oh, I've had that figured out for a while now.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_15": "Under your curious stare, Ciaccona presses one finger to her lips.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_16": "That's a secret for now! Once the National Competition results come out tomorrow, I'll tell everyone who's taking over.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_17": "Well, then... happy graduation, {PlayerName}!",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_18": "Ciaccona clasps her hands behind her back, and a smile as clear as a blue sky spreads across her face.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_19": "You too, Ciaccona. Happy graduation.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_2": "Da! Da-la da-da-la da-da! da-da-la da-da!",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_20": "Phew! I'm glad that's over.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_21": "How so?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_22": "I was so worried this would turn into some tearful farewell. When I said goodbye to a few of the younger club members in private, they were already getting misty-eyed.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_23": "That's not my style.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_24": "If I started crying, it would make you feel awkward, wouldn't it?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_25": "Haha, you're so you, {PlayerName}. You always keep your eyes forward, no matter what.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_26": "Ciaccona walks to the middle of the stage, hands still behind her back, and glances back at you over her shoulder.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_27": "I've always believed...",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_28": "Every goodbye brings us one step closer to our next hello!",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_3": "Ciaccona strolls across the stage, humming under her breath. She notices you and turns.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_4": "Oh, {PlayerName}. What brings you here? Let me guess... You were looking for me?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_5": "I had a feeling I'd find you here. Did you come just to see the auditorium one last time?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_6": "That's right. There are a lot of memories in this place.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_7": "Ciaccona looks around the hall, taking in the furnishings, her expression a little wistful.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_8": "Remember the School Anniversary? We all pitched in and put on such a wonderful show here. And now, just like that, it's time for us to go our separate ways.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_40_9": "Thinking about saying goodbye to this place after graduation... just makes me a little sad, is all.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_41_1": "As you turn to leave, Ciaccona calls after you.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_41_2": "Oh, I almost forgot. Since you're here—",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_41_3": "Ciaccona picks up a green notebook from a nearby shelf and holds it out to you. Musical notes adorn its cover.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_41_4": "Think of it as a memento. All the music I wrote during my time at school is in there.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_41_5": "You accept the scorebook from her with both hands.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_41_6": "I'll take good care of it, Ciaccona.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_41_7": "There's a little bonus, too! I can hum some of the pieces for you. What do you say?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_41_8": "You nod, and the girl's distant, lilting melody once again fills the hall.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_41_9": "Perhaps as long as her singing doesn't stop, the \"summer\" in this hall will never fade.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_1": "As you round a corner on your walk down the street, you hear Xiangli Yao's voice.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_10": "His gaze settles on you, warm and steady. He raises his hands and gives you a light round of applause.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_11": "Congratulations on graduating, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_12": "You too, Xiangli Yao.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_13": "Have you decided what you want to do after graduation?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_14": "Principal Abby put me in touch with a prominent professor. He's agreed to take me on as his student, so I'll be continuing my studies at his university.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_15": "So that was the professor you were talking to just now?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_16": "Xiangli Yao nods, a faintly wry smile tugging at his lips.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_17": "Mm. He seems rather strict and meticulous. He's already given me a list of papers to read.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_18": "And you? What are your plans?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_19": "I haven't decided yet, but I'll probably go home and visit my family first.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_2": "He's leaning against a wall with his phone to his ear, apparently in the middle of a call.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_20": "That makes sense, there's no need to rush. Take your time to think it through.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_21": "If you ever need help or advice in the future, just let me know. I can help you find research materials at the very least.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_22": "Will do. I'll leave a message on the Student Council's portal if I need anything.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_23": "Surely there's no need to file a formal petition with the Student Council?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_24": "For once, Xiangli Yao actually pushes back on one of your jokes. A few seconds later, you both break into grins.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_3": "...Yes, understood. I'll look into the relevant papers. Thank you for the recommendation, Professor.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_4": "I won't take up any more of your time. Goodbye.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_5": "Xiangli Yao lowers the phone and spots you standing nearby. He smiles in your direction.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_6": "What a coincidence, {PlayerName}. I was just on my way to see you.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_7": "A private goodbye before the ceremony?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_8": "Something like that. We're both graduating, after all. And we'll both be leaving the school soon after.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_50_9": "Once the Qualifying Exam results are out tomorrow, we might not be in such a relaxed mood. So I thought today would be a good time.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_1": "Noticing Xiangli Yao has fallen a few steps behind, you stop.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_10": "You take the robot from him. It's surprisingly light, and its casing shows signs of wear, but it's clear that his younger self put a great deal of care into its design.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_11": "You turn it over in your hands, watching the little face on its screen change as you move it. Happy, sad, calm...",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_12": "What's its name?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_13": "Beep-Boop. Hm... if it's not to your taste, you're welcome to give it a name you prefer.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_14": "Since it's a gift from you, I'll keep the name you gave it.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_15": "All right.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_16": "In the gentle evening breeze, you stroll down the streets bathed in twilight, chatting without a care for the time.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_17": "At least for now, you're walking the same road, with neither of you in any hurry to part.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_2": "He's holding a small gray robot in his hands. On its front screen, a pixelated face flickers to life.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_3": "That robot...",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_4": "It's the first thing I ever built as a child. I only recently found it in storage and managed to get it working again.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_5": "Here, try patting it on the head.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_6": "Xiangli Yao hands it to you. Not quite sure what to expect, you give its head a gentle pat.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_7": "Happy graduation, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_8": "...Did you prepare this for me?",
+  "AVG_DAOBIERI2_51_9": "I did. A little while ago, I started thinking I should get you a graduation gift. After giving it some thought, I decided on this.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_1": "The usually lively classroom is quiet now. The windows are half-open, and pale winter sunlight streams through the gaps, casting a grid of shadows across the floor.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_10": "You know, every student's graduation is special to a teacher.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_11": "It's like watching a plant you've cared for with your own hands finally bloom. I'm so happy to see you all grow, and I'll miss you too.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_12": "Happy graduation, {PlayerName}. Everything you worked so hard for during your time at the school, every bit of effort you put in... I saw it all.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_13": "And thank you, too, for giving me such precious memories to look back on.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_14": "I hope you'll hold on to that earnestness of yours and keep growing at your own pace.  Wherever life takes you, I hope you'll always have something to look forward to.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_15": "And of course, the most important thing is to take good care of yourself. Don't go making your family worry too much while you're out there!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_16": "Okay, I will. Thank you, Miss Verina. What about you? Will you keep teaching here?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_17": "Mm-hmm, I will. Once the new semester starts, these empty desks will be full again, and the classroom will be lively once more.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_18": "And by then... spring will be just around the corner. It's such a lovely season, when everything starts growing again.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_19": "You choose the right seeds for the soil, and teach each student in the way that suits them best. That's why they say teachers are gardeners, too.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_2": "Verina stands by the windowsill, gently loosening the soil around a little potted flower in bloom.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_20": "You too, {PlayerName}. When you have time, make sure to come back and visit me often.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_21": "I will. And I'll always remember everything you've taught me, Miss Verina.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_3": "Every now and then, a breeze slips through the window, making the leaves tremble. Each time, she quickly cups the flower in her hands and turns her back to shield it from the cold.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_4": "Seeing this, you hurry over and close the window.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_5": "Miss Verina.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_6": "Oh, you're here, {PlayerName}. I was just wondering if you'd stop by today.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_7": "See this? This flower was just a tiny bud a few days ago. I didn't expect it to bloom so soon. It's still winter, but it doesn't seem to mind the cold winds at all.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_8": "Once a flower blooms, it produces seeds. They find their way to new places, take root, and sprout after the rain. And one day, they'll bloom into flowers of their own.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_100_9": "Verina looks up and gives you a gentle smile.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_1": "You weave past clusters of people saying their goodbyes and reach the far side of the square. On a bench nearby, a fair-haired girl in school uniform sits alone.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_10": "Miss Phoebe, we...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_11": "It's all right. Mind stepping back a little? You can wait where you can still see me. We won't be long.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_12": "Oh, and would you please keep an eye on our surroundings? Don't let anyone come too close.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_13": "I'd prefer it if no one overheard our conversation.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_14": "The bodyguards exchange uneasy looks. Finally, they shoot you a glare, one part threat, one part warning, one part sheer bewilderment, and slip silently into the shadows.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_15": "At Phoebe's invitation, you sit down beside her.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_16": "She closes her book and tucks a stray curl behind her ear. Her gaze drifts to the Teaching Building nearby, and she lets out a soft breath.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_17": "I admit, when Mr. Fenrico first... When my father told me he was planning to acquire this school, it didn't strike me as strange.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_18": "To him, everything has its value and a price tag to match.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_19": "You understand what Phoebe means.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_2": "The trees lining the square have lost their green. Only a few yellow leaves still cling to the branches, shivering in the winter wind.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_20": "A century of history, the school's reputation, its location, the land and buildings under its name, and the social influence it built up over the years... All of it can be reduced to lines of data in an acquisition report.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_21": "In Fenrico's eyes, Second Solaris School is just an asset to be appraised and assigned a value, nothing more.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_22": "A plot of land can be redeveloped. A company can be bought out. A brand can be repositioned. So naturally, a \"school\" is no exception.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_23": "You know... What I learned growing up at Celestial Steed Corp was exactly that. How to understand, and make use of, that kind of \"value.\"",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_24": "Her voice catches. After a few seconds of silence, she turns to you, her gentle, tranquil gaze tracing the lines of your face.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_25": "Until I met everyone... and you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_26": "My time here has been irreplaceable. I want to remember it forever. And I just can't bear to watch an acquisition turn this school into something it isn't.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_27": "So...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_28": "I did some \"digging\" into you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_29": "...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_3": "Phoebe cradles a hefty hardcover, head bowed, eyes tracking the page. Sunlight spills gold across her shoulders, haloing her profile and the loose strands by her cheek.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_30": "Caught off guard, you look at Phoebe in surprise and see her eyes sparkling with laughter. She... meant nothing bad by it.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_31": "{PlayerName}, do you remember that dinner we all had in the Student Council room, first semester? Xiangli Yao said that...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_32": "A fairly large portion of the school's funding is coming from unidentified sources.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_33": "My father would never allow such unclear accounts in a project he plans to acquire.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_34": "He looked into where those transactions came from and why, and I \"happened\" to see the report on his desk.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_35": "All of those unexplained transactions came from Principal Abby's personal account.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_36": "The school has always waived tuition for local students. Principal Abby has been covering the shortfall that created out of its own pocket all along.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_37": "It's Abby...? Huh, didn't expect that. But that's Abby for you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_38": "Yes. Apart from that, I also happened to notice another really strange large transaction.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_39": "And the account holder for those funds... is you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_4": "Behind Phoebe stand several bodyguards in black suits—silent, hands clasped in front of them. Their expressions are stern as they keep a watchful eye on the square around them.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_40": "Still, being so financially savvy at our age is quite impressive. Should I start calling you {PlayerName} Moneybags now?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_41": "I didn't think you'd catch on so fast. But I guess it shouldn't come as a surprise that you're so sharp. After all, you are the Celestial Steed Corp heir.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_42": "Huh? Come on, don't call me that...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_43": "But you're right, Phoebe. I do have a decent stash saved up.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_44": "Phoebe stares at you for a beat, then glances around. She lowers her voice and leans in to whisper in your ear.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_45": "What if your funds were to match what Celestial Steed Corp has offered for the school... what would you do, {PlayerName}?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_46": "Only now do you realize that the wealth you've amassed is even more ludicrous than you imagined.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_47": "At that moment, an idea you'd never even considered, one you might even call \"utterly crazy,\" pops into your head.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_48": "Maybe... you really could afford to buy the school. There's no single answer in life, and the same goes for saving the school.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_49": "I'll buy the school before Celestial Steed Corp does.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_5": "As a second-year, she still has one more year at the school... If Fenrico allows it, that is.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_50": "I have no intention of using this money to buy the school.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_51": "Since I have enough money myself, there's no need to go through Celestial Steed Corp's final evaluation anymore.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_52": "I'll reach my own acquisition agreement with the school before they can finalize their deal.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_53": "Somehow, that's very much your style, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_54": "You've never helped anyone just to get something back.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_55": "And now that you have the means to make a difference, {PlayerName}... the first thing you think of is protecting what everyone holds dear.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_56": "You glance at Phoebe, then lean back against the bench and look up at the clear blue sky with a short sigh.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_57": "Thank you, Phoebe. Even so, I know this probably won't be as easy as I hope it'll be.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_58": "A new School Board, school administration, operating fund, and direction for the future... None of that's been settled yet. Ultimately, buying the school is just the beginning.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_59": "You're right. But if there's really someone who can keep this school the way it is, I'm willing to believe in them and help in whatever way I can.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_6": "Phoebe.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_60": "If you're willing to cover the school's operating costs and preserve its original educational philosophy, {PlayerName}, leave everything else to me.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_61": "I'll contact as many members of the school's administration as I can and help you work out the details of the acquisition. Not on behalf of Celestial Steed Corp.... but as \"Phoebe.\"",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_62": "Even if the road ahead is full of thorns... as a student of Second Solaris School, let this be my responsibility, too. Let me fight alongside you this time, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_63": "All right. I'll start making preparations.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_64": "You and Phoebe exchange a glance, then both burst into laughter.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_65": "She lifts the book from her lap to hide the lower half of her face and the faint blush spreading across her ears. Only her eyes remain visible, crinkling into crescents as she looks at you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_66": "\"Buying the school yourself\"... it's certainly an unexpected solution, bold enough to be a little frightening. But without a doubt, it's a good outcome that only you could bring about.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_67": "Even if that's the case... I don't intend to use that money to buy the school. Not for now, at least.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_68": "I might be able to stop Celestial Steed Corp this time, but I can't guarantee the school won't end up in the same position a few years from now.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_69": "This time it's Celestial Steed Corp. Next time, it might be Pack Mule Corp. And then another company after that, and another... This just isn't a lasting solution.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_7": "Good day, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_70": "Mm. You make a fair point, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_71": "Money can solve a lot of problems, sure, but I still don't think... money alone should be how we prove this school's worth.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_72": "Like Abby always says, what we need to prove is the potential of this school and the young people in this town.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_73": "So I still want to save the school by helping it pass the Celestial Steed Corp's final evaluation.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_74": "I understand. If that's what you've decided, and that's what your heart tells you, I'll support you however I can, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_75": "Thank you, Phoebe.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_76": "Phoebe meets your gaze and smiles softly. She picks up the book from her lap again and turns back to the chapter she'd been reading.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_77": "\"Buying the school yourself\"... it's certainly an unexpected solution, bold enough to be a little frightening.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_78": "But if there's a safer way to resolve the crisis at hand, there's no need to take such a gamble...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_79": "Oh, right. It might be a little early to ask, but have you thought about what you'll do after graduation, Phoebe?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_8": "Phoebe looks up at your voice, a familiar smile breaking over her face. She nods, scooting aside to offer you the other half of the bench before turning to the security guards behind her.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_80": "After graduation...? I suppose I'll return to Celestial Steed Corp. I don't want to run away from who I am.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_81": "Besides, the longer I spend with everyone, the more I realize... If you truly want to change something, standing on the sidelines voicing objections and complaints won't solve anything.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_82": "You have to step in, take on your own responsibilities, and take action. That's the only way things can change for the better.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_83": "Just like you... {PlayerName}. Whether it's tackling the evaluation head-on or using your own fortune to solve our predicament, perhaps these are things only you can do.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_84": "I'm sure there are things I'm meant to do, too. Things only I can do. I want to... protect something with my own hands, too.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_85": "You glance at Phoebe's profile. The resolve and courage in her eyes shine in the winter light, dazzling.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_86": "Shining with a reassurance strong enough to light up the darkest hour with calm and hope.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_87": "I'll be rooting for you, Phoebe. You've always had courage and sincerity in your heart.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_88": "I'm going to look around the rest of the school for a bit, so I'll get going now.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_89": "Okay. Goodbye, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_9": "I'd like a moment alone with {PlayerName}, please.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_90": "Happy graduation!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_10_91": "In the days to come, no matter how far your journey takes you, may love and light shine on you, and may good fortune circle you always, like birds in the sky.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_110_1": "Verina gives a small, satisfied nod at your answer. Then she rummages through her shoulder bag for a moment before pulling out a gift box and holding it out to you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_110_2": "Oh, and I've prepared a little graduation gift for you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_110_3": "I only got to teach you for a short year, but you're still one of my star pupils.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_110_4": "Here, take it. I hope you'll remember this story, and all the wonderful days you've spent with everyone here.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_110_5": "After you wave goodbye to Verina, she picks up her watering can and returns to tending her plants.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_110_6": "That's how it's always been. And how it'll stay. Miss Verina will keep tending to everyone at this school in her own thoughtful, attentive way.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_110_7": "Just like... flowers that need patient tending before they bloom.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_1": "The sports field lies quiet beneath the winter sky. With graduation drawing near, even this familiar place feels a little emptier than usual.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_10": "Hehe, you don't have to flatter me like that. Well, being principal is busy. And tiring. I haven't had a decent night's sleep in ages! But, you know... it's pretty fun, too.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_11": "Every morning, I get students saying \"Good morning, Principal Abby!\"Gotta say, that feels pretty nice!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_12": "Still, this year really flew by, huh? Feels like I only picked you up from the station last week.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_13": "You weren't even sure about calling me your \"uncle\" at the time. So, how about now? Haven't I done a pretty good job?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_14": "Thank you, Abby.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_15": "It'd be even better if I got a little more spending money.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_16": "Come on, don't mention it. That's what uncles are for!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_17": "Alright, alright. I'm your \"uncle,\" after all. If you ever come back and want to spend some time with your favorite \"uncle,\" I'll cover all your expenses!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_18": "Hard to believe you're already graduating. I'm really going to miss you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_19": "All right, enough of that mushy stuff. I'm no good at it. Besides, \"graduation\" is a good thing!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_2": "The track is deserted. A cold wind sweeps past the stands, stirring the bare branches of the trees along the field.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_20": "Starting a new chapter in life, setting off on a new journey, heading to new destinations, trying new desserts you've never had before...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_21": "I mean, Poached Chicken, Aureate Fried Rice, Lotus Pastry, Stuffed Tofu, Rising Loong, Oaknut Honeycake, Laurel Shrimp in Nimbus Reduction, Sweet & Sour Pork, Smoked Meat Stew, Crab Braised Fish, Sizzling Jade Stir-fry... They're all super tasty, but if I get the chance, I'd like to try something new.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_22": "...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_23": "If you really want to try out new food, Abby, why don't we go together?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_24": "Let's set off on a new journey.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_25": "Huh? I can't do that. I'm the principal! No matter what happens to this school, I have to stay here and see everyone through to the end!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_26": "Your class is graduating, but there'll be new students next year. And the year after that, and the year after that... I wouldn't trust anyone else to look after this place!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_27": "Wait, something feels off here... Being principal... A journey with {PlayerName}...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_28": "Abby trails off, as if a thought has suddenly crossed its mind. It furrows its brow and tilts its head, puzzling over something for a moment before quickly shaking it off.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_29": "Eh, never mind, forget it. Anyway, I have to admit, your idea's got me kinda tempted, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_3": "You were only passing through when you happened to spot a familiar figure lingering at the edge of the field. Abby is just standing there, all by itself.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_30": "Then it's settled. Once I'm no longer the principal, you and I are gonna go explore places far, far away!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_31": "With you as my travel buddy, I just know it'll be one heck of a journey!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_32": "Mm, it's settled then. We'll travel far and wide and see all the sights the world has to offer.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_33": "Great! And we'll get to eat all kinds of delicious food together! Just thinking about it gets me excited. Hehe...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_4": "You're a little surprised. Running into Abby at the cafeteria is one thing, but out on a athletic field?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_5": "Abby? What are you doing here?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_6": "Oh, it's you, {PlayerName}. Well, the semester's almost over, so I'm checking whether any facilities around the school need fixing up over the break.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_7": "Look, the rubber track is peeling at the edges, and the surface is all worn down. I should get someone to fix it.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_8": "You really are a great principal, Abby.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_120_9": "Abby scratches its cheek and shifts around, sheepish and pleased all at once, its mouth twitching into a smile.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_1": "You weave past clusters of people saying their goodbyes and reach the far side of the square. On a bench nearby, a fair-haired girl in school uniform sits alone.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_10": "Thank you, Phoebe.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_11": "It might be a little early to ask, but have you thought about what you'll do after graduation?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_12": "After graduation...? I suppose I'll return to Celestial Steed Corp. I don't want to run away from who I am.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_13": "Besides, the longer I spend with everyone, the more I realize... If you truly want to change something, standing on the sidelines voicing objections and complaints won't solve anything.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_14": "You have to step in, take on your own responsibilities, and take action. That's the only way things can change for the better.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_15": "I want to find things I'm meant to do, things only I can do. Just like at the anniversary, I want to... protect something with my own hands.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_16": "You glance at Phoebe's profile. The resolve and courage in her eyes shine in the winter light, dazzling.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_17": "Shining with a reassurance strong enough to light up the darkest hour with calm and hope.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_18": "I'll be rooting for you, Phoebe. You've always had courage and sincerity in your heart.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_19": "I'm going to look around the rest of the school for a bit, so I'll get going now.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_2": "The trees lining the square have lost their green. Only a few yellow leaves still cling to the branches, shivering in the winter wind.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_20": "Goodbye, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_3": "Phoebe cradles a hefty hardcover, head bowed, eyes tracking the page. Sunlight spills gold across her shoulders, haloing her profile and the loose strands by her cheek.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_4": "Hello, Phoebe.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_5": "Good day, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_6": "Phoebe looks up at your voice, a familiar smile breaking over her face. She nods, scooting aside to offer you the other half of the bench.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_7": "You walk over and sit down beside her.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_8": "Happy graduation, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_1_9": "In the days to come, no matter how far your journey takes you, may love and light shine on you, and may good fortune circle you always, like birds in the sky.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_20_1": "Just as you rise from the bench and turn to leave, Phoebe suddenly calls out from behind you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_20_2": "Oh, right! Wait a moment, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_20_3": "Even though we've only known each other for a year, {PlayerName}, I'm... truly grateful for the time we've spent together. I've treasured it.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_20_4": "I've prepared a graduation present for you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_20_5": "Please accept it.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_1": "*Creak—*",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_10": "Traveling all over sounds great to me! Shredded Fish Soup at one place today, pretty scenery somewhere else tomorrow, then making a few new friends the day after that...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_11": "Of course, you can still call it \"cultivation,\" right? Getting to know the world firsthand, picking up new experiences along the way.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_12": "The more you experience, the more your mindset, your perspective, even the way you handle things start to change. The journey itself is your \"cultivation.\" Everything you see and hear adds to your knowledge, and every person you meet helps you understand the world and yourself a little better.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_13": "Buling pauses, then tilts her head and smiles at you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_14": "Besides, I don't think goodbyes have to be such a sad thing.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_15": "You're right. Every \"goodbye\" is also a new \"hello.\"",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_16": "Yep, saying \"goodbye\" today doesn't mean we won't see each other again. Who knows? Maybe I'll be wandering around one day and, wah, end up right where you are!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_17": "Sure. I'll make sure to give you a proper welcome when that happens, Buling.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_18": "And once I've graduated, I'm counting on your forum posts to keep me up to date on all the school's fun stories and gossip.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_19": "I'm going to look around the rest of the school for a bit, so I'll leave you to it.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_2": "A gust of icy air slips through the door as you push it open, only to be chased away by the warmth inside. The sudden change in temperature fogs the glass with a thin layer of white, blurring the view of the sky outside.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_3": "You glance around the room. Buling looks up from her computer and waves you over.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_4": "Hey, Boss! You made it.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_5": "Happy graduation, Boss! Hope everything goes nice and smooth for you from here on out. May you go wherever you wanna go and live however you wanna live!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_6": "Haiya, don't worry about a thing! When I read people and their fortunes, I always \"bling it\"! Trust me, as long as you believe in yourself, there's nothing you can't pull off!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_7": "Thank you, Buling.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_8": "What about you, though? Graduation's still a ways off for you, but have you thought about what you'll do after?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_30_9": "Me? Well, a girl can't stay in one place forever, right?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_1": "*Creak—*",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_10": "You take the cup from her. Its warmth slowly spreads through your palms, chasing the chill from your fingertips.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_11": "While you sip your tea, Buling looks you up and down with a serious expression.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_12": "Hmm, let me see... Not bad, not bad at all!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_13": "...What are you looking at?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_14": "What else? Your graduation fortune, of course, Boss!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_15": "Unfurrowed brow, bright eyes, clear forehead, rosy cheeks. Full of spirit! These are all signs of good fortune coming your way!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_16": "Oh? Really?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_17": "Hehe, no doubt about it. Trust me, Boss. When I read people and their fortunes, I always \"bling\" it!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_18": "Looks like smooth sailing after graduation for you! Lots of fun new places to see, lots of new friends to make.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_19": "Buling's tone is light and certain. She grins and gives your shoulder a pat.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_2": "A gust of icy air slips through the door as you push it open, only to be chased away by the warmth inside. The sudden change in temperature fogs the glass with a thin layer of white, blurring the view of the sky outside.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_20": "All right. I'll take your word for it, Buling.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_21": "There you go! Now, come have a look at my latest discovery.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_22": "Buling turns her laptop toward you and gestures excitedly at the screen.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_23": "It displays the school's latest forum traffic. The view counts on a few threads are climbing at an abnormal, if not terrifying, rate.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_24": "And every single one of those threads has something to do with you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_25": "What about it? The numbers are pretty impressive, but... it's just forum chatter, isn't it?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_26": "No, no, no, if it were just forum chatter, I wouldn't have bothered showing you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_27": "Look! Visits to the school's official website, clicks on the admissions inquiry page, people watching our promotional videos all the way through... Everything's shot way up.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_28": "She flicks her mouse around at lightning speed and pulls up another page.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_29": "I also pulled a few records from the website's inbox over the past few days. Quite a few media outlets have started contacting the school again, asking about the anniversary celebrations and that wager with Celestial Steed Corp.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_3": "You glance around. A few unsorted files from the school's business partners are piled on the Liaison Center's desk, with pens scattered beside them. A folder lies half-open, its pages washed pale by the sunlight.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_30": "And the most important part? They all want to interview you!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_31": "...Me?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_32": "Come on, Boss, you're a super big celebrity now! People are saying they only heard about our school after seeing what you did.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_33": "There are even a bunch of people commenting in the threads saying they wanna get into our school just so they can be in the same campus as you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_34": "I just pulled some numbers from the school's admissions office. Phew! The projected applicants for the new school year have shot up tenfold!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_35": "So how about it, Boss? Wanna strike while the iron's hot and crank up the publicity? Help the school bring in more new students?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_36": "You quickly grasp what these numbers really mean. The improvement in admissions has changed the school's financial outlook as well.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_37": "While the school is still under financial pressure, with enrollment recovering, more media partnership opportunities, and renewed public interest, it now has a real chance of recovering on its own.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_38": "In other words, if enrollment keeps growing at this rate, the school may well be able to balance its books through its own operations.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_39": "Maybe... this really is a path you'd never considered before. A truly \"unconventional\" way forward.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_4": "*Clack-clack, clack...*",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_40": "There's no single right answer in life. And saving the school might be no different...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_41": "Let's use my influence to help the school attract more students.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_42": "No... The school's future can't depend on my fame alone.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_43": "Celestial Steed Corp first considered acquiring the school because it was struggling to stay afloat, and enrollment kept dropping.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_44": "But now, if I become the face of the school, if my name gets more people to know it and attracts new students...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_45": "All that attention could help bring back up the school's future tuition income, public standing, and brand value.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_46": "And that would take a serious bite out of the profits Celestial Steed Corp was hoping to make by buying the school on the cheap.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_47": "If they go ahead with the acquisition now, they'll end up paying more in negotiations and operations, all while taking the risk that the school's future growth falls short of expectations.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_48": "Uh, I kinda lost you halfway there. But if you say it's the way to go, Boss, I'm sure you've got it figured out!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_49": "So, basically, we just need to get your name out there along with our school's century-old heritage, and plenty of people will apply just because they \"want to go to the same school as {PlayerName},\" right?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_5": "The keyboard taps ring out clearly in the quiet room. Sitting at the computer, Buling types away at lightning speed as lines of text race up the screen.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_50": "That'll mean more fame, more students, and more tuition money. Problem solved! And as long as the school isn't struggling to stay afloat, Celestial Steed Corp won't have any reason to buy us out.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_51": "Buling gives your shoulder a pat, then flashes you a thumbs-up. The corners of her mouth curl into a confident grin that says, \"Leave it to me!\"",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_52": "Publicity is my middle name. I'll make sure everyone and their grandma knows your name, Boss. And the moment they hear it, they'll think of our century-old school!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_53": "Hehe, who knows? Maybe people will be lining up to enroll. Principal Abby would be over the moon if it heard about this!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_54": "Thanks, Buling. Let's do our best for the school.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_55": "You and Buling exchange a look and grin. You both raise your hands, and with a sharp \"smack,\" your palms meet in a crisp high five.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_56": "\"Saving the school with your own fame\"... It's certainly an unexpected solution, bold enough to be a little frightening. But without a doubt, it's a good outcome that only you could bring about.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_57": "Enrollment is growing much faster than expected, which is great. But the school's future can't depend on my fame alone.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_58": "At the end of the day, my influence blew up by sheer luck. There's no guarantee people will stay interested in me for years to come.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_59": "As time goes on, new topics and trends will take over the headlines, and the attention I'm getting now will eventually fade.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_6": "She doesn't seem to notice you until you walk right up beside her.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_60": "Maybe a lot of people will apply to this school because of me this year, but what about next year? Or the year after that? The school's value shouldn't be overshadowed by one person's popularity.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_61": "I see... Fair point, Boss. Riding on your personal popularity would only work in the short term...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_62": "Yeah. Like Abby always says, what we need to prove is the potential of this school and the young people in this town.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_63": "So I want people to choose the school for what it has to offer and for its heritage, not because of me.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_64": "So I still want to save the school by helping it pass Celestial Steed Corp's final evaluation.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_65": "Got it! I see what you're getting at, Boss. I'll do my part, too! I'll make sure more people hear about our school's century-old history and its educational philosophy.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_66": "\"Buying the school yourself\"... It's certainly an unexpected solution, bold enough to be a little frightening.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_67": "But with a safer way to resolve the crisis at hand, there doesn't seem to be any need to take such a gamble...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_68": "Thanks, Buling. Let's do our best for the school.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_69": "Wah, we've been so busy talking about all this, I almost forgot the most important thing...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_7": "Oh! Hey, Boss! You made it.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_70": "Happy graduation, {PlayerName}!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_71": "Hope everything goes nice and smooth for you from here on out. May you go wherever you wanna go and live however you wanna live!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_72": "It's a long road ahead, but don't worry about a thing. As long as you believe in yourself, {PlayerName}, things are bound to work out.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_73": "New sights, new friends, new stories... They're all waiting for you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_74": "And if you run into trouble along the way, no matter how far away you are, I'll come help you out of it, {PlayerName}. So don't you worry, Boss.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_75": "Buling lets out a hearty laugh and stretches as far as she can, then turns to look out the window at the hazy outline of the Teaching Building.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_76": "Besides, I don't think goodbyes have to be such a sad thing.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_77": "Every \"goodbye\" is also a new \"hello.\"",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_78": "Yep, saying \"goodbye\" today doesn't mean we won't see each other again. Who knows? Maybe I'll be wandering around one day and, wah, end up right where you are!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_79": "And when that happens—",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_8": "It's freezing out there, isn't it? Here, this'll warm you up.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_80": "She counts on her fingers, deep in thought.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_81": "First, you take me out for a meal, Boss. Then we check out all the fun local spots, snap some pics, and update the hot-topic thread on the forum... After that, we listen to some new songs together or play some online games!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_82": "How's that for a plan? Pretty good, right?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_83": "Sure. When that day comes, I'll be sure to give you a proper welcome, Buling. And once I've graduated, I'm counting on your forum posts to keep me up to date on all the school's fun stories and gossip.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_84": "Deal! Next time we meet, you'd better come back with new stories, {PlayerName}. And make sure I'm the first one to know.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_85": "You got it.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_40_9": "Buling gets up in a hurry and pours you a cup of hot tea.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_50_1": "Just as you open the Liaison Center door and prepare to head somewhere else, Buling calls out behind you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_50_2": "Wait, wait, wait! Hold up, {PlayerName}!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_50_3": "She hurries over, pulls a small present box from her pocket, and holds it out to you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_50_4": "We've only spent a year together, Boss, but I'd say we've gotten past the surface-level stuff, haven't we?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_50_5": "I got you a graduation present. Nothing fancy, lah, but it's a little something from me to you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_50_6": "Here, take it, take it!",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_1": "The school store is just as it always is, its shelves packed with all sorts of little knickknacks. Looking around, you'd think there was nothing Roccia didn't sell.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_10": "She glances down at the cardboard box beside her and gently pats the lid.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_11": "If you'd like, I could turn your story into a new script and make some new props for it, too.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_12": "Then I can give them to the school's Drama Club and Film Club, so everyone could keep telling your story in their own way.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_13": "Thank you, Roccia. Speaking of which... what about you? Do you have any plans for the future?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_14": "I want to stay here at the school. There are new props to make, new shows to put on, and lots of things I haven't finished yet.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_15": "Life in this little town is nice and free. And when people come to visit my shop and talk with me, they often leave with a smile.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_16": "What I've always wanted is for everyone to feel free to express their happiness, anger, sorrow, and joy. Without fear. Without sadness.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_17": "That's why I like performing, and why I like doing improv comedy inspired by everyone's stories. I hope no one at the school gets weighed down by exhaustion or disappointment. And I also hope...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_18": "I hope you'll find lots of happiness in the life ahead of you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_19": "The small girl looks up, the corners of her mouth curving into a tiny crescent. Her usual poker face breaks into a sincere, radiant smile.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_2": "Just like the first time you met her, Roccia is nowhere to be seen behind the counter. All you can hear is faint rustling.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_20": "Customers come and go at the school store, each with a different story to tell.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_21": "These everyday moments might seem ordinary, even a little dull, to anyone else. But to Roccia, they're precious little treasures to keep tucked away in her boxes.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_22": "She keeps everything in the store neat and orderly, always keeping herself busy and enjoying every minute of it. Her eyes are as bright and clear as the morning star, and her heart is as pure as gold.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_23": "I'll come back to visit whenever I get the chance. I'm sure your store will still be full of laughter when I do, Roccia.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_24": "Okay. You're welcome to visit anytime, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_3": "Roccia?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_4": "A moment later, Roccia pops out of a cardboard box beside the shelves.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_5": "Welcome. What can I help you find today...? Oh. {PlayerName}, it's you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_6": "Happy graduation, {PlayerName}. Did you come to say goodbye?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_7": "Yeah. After I graduate, I probably won't get to stop by your store much anymore, Roccia.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_8": "That's okay. Life has more than one stage, {PlayerName}. When you go somewhere new, a new stage will be waiting for you. The lights will come on again, and the curtain will rise once more.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_60_9": "New actors will take the stage, and a new audience will cheer you on. Together, you'll start a brand-new chapter of your story.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_70_1": "Oh, I just remembered...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_70_2": "Roccia hurries over to the shelves and rises onto her tiptoes to carefully take down a beautifully wrapped gift box. Then she turns and holds it out to you with both hands.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_70_3": "This is for you. It's the graduation present I prepared for you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_70_4": "I truly treasure this year we've spent together. And I'll miss the unique stories we performed together, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_70_5": "Even though this chapter with me and the school is about to come to an end for you...",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_70_6": "Next time, let's meet again on a new stage, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_1": "The empty classroom feels much bigger than usual.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_10": "Congratulations, {PlayerName}. Today, you graduate.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_11": "I've seen how hard you've worked during your time here. And now, at last, you've given this chapter of your life an answer of your own.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_12": "So... when you leave here, keep being honest with yourself. When the time comes to make a choice, don't back down out of fear, and don't let past regrets make you lose sight of what you believe in.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_13": "Most importantly, never forget who you want to become. And protect what truly matters to you.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_14": "Thank you, Miss Galbrena. Will you stay on to continue teaching?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_15": "Of course.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_16": "Galbrena looks around the empty classroom, her gaze softening a little.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_17": "Welcoming new students, watching you all grow, graduate, and head out into the world to start the next chapter of your lives... This classroom is my battlefield.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_18": "I've already found what I want to protect. So I'll keep moving forward, doing whatever it takes to see things through. And if I fall along the way, it'll be for something worth fighting for. No regrets.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_19": "Galbrena turns to you and pats your shoulder, a faint smile quietly tugging at her lips.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_2": "The desks and drawers have all been cleared out, the blackboard wiped clean, and only a few basic teaching tools remain on the lectern.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_20": "There. I'll leave you with that final lesson. May things go in both of our favor in the future.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_21": "Be proud of yourself, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_3": "Galbrena stands alone behind it, quietly taking it all in.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_4": "Miss Galbrena.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_5": "Ah, it's you, {PlayerName}. Came back for one last look at your old classroom?",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_6": "Yeah... Even if it was only two semesters, it's still a little hard to say goodbye. I probably won't get another chance to sit in on one of your classes.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_7": "Is that right? Some of life's best moments vanish in the blink of an eye, like frost flowers melting away. Guess that's what makes the genuine connections we forge all the more worth holding on to.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_8": "Still, I'm glad you enjoyed my classes.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_80_9": "She walks over to stand in front of you. Her tone is as calm as ever, but there's a quiet weight to her words now, and a reassuring strength beneath them.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_90_1": "Ah, yes. I brought you a graduation gift, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_90_2": "Don't overthink it. Just take it. Something to remember me by.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_90_3": "All right, that's enough from me. You were planning to look around the rest of the school, weren't you? Go on, then.",
+  "AVG_Farewellday_90_4": "Galbrena waves you off, her gaze following you until you disappear through the classroom door.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_1": "Classes are over for the day, yet Cartethyia is still in the classroom.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_10": "Ah, {PlayerName}!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_11": "The moment she spots you at the door, her eyes light up like you're her last hope. Part begging, part dragging, she grabs your wrist and hauls you over to her desk.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_12": "{PlayerName}, you're great at the academic stuff, right? Could you teach me? Please?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_13": "I have to pass tomorrow's quiz. No matter what...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_14": "You picture Cartethyia in class, head down, scribbling away. Someone that diligent shouldn't be scoring like this. Unless...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_15": "Cartethyia, mind if I see your notes?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_16": "Sure! Here!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_17": "Beaming with pride, Cartethyia holds out her notebook with both hands, every page crammed edge to edge with writing.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_18": "Most of what the teachers say goes right over my head... so I copied out every point dozens of times to make it stick!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_19": "...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_2": "In a right triangle, the sum of the squares of the two legs equals the square of the hypotenuse... In a right triangle, the sum of the squares of the two legs equals the square of the hypotenuse...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_20": "Line after identical line fills the page. You don't know whether to sigh at her stubbornness or admire her sheer grit.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_21": "Cartethyia, rote memorization won't get you there. You have to understand it.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_22": "Like the Pythagorean theorem here. Try picturing it as...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_23": "You pull out your own textbook and slow things way down, walking her through the basic formulas and theorems in terms she can grasp.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_24": "So that's what it means...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_25": "Hehe, when you're the one explaining, {PlayerName}, it actually makes sense!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_26": "She nods along to your every word, and bit by bit, the confusion on her face gives way to a smile.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_27": "Time slowly slips by to the rustle of pens on paper.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_3": "Okay, I've definitely got it this time!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_4": "With a very serious nod, Cartethyia snaps her book shut and starts reciting.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_5": "In a right triangle, the sum of the squares of the two legs equals...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_6": "...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_7": "Ugh, why is memorizing so hard?!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_8": "At this rate, I'm never going to graduate...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_1_9": "From the doorway, you watch her agonize and can't hold back a quiet laugh.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_1": "Ever since that first session, you and Cartethyia have been meeting in the classroom after school as a little study group.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_10": "And...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_11": "Her voice falls away, and something wistful flickers across her face.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_12": "For a lot of the seniors, this is their last game as players.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_13": "Third year means buckling down on studies, and most sports club members hang up their cleats. For them, this match is goodbye.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_14": "Suddenly her enthusiasm makes sense, and so does her invitation.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_15": "Then this weekend, let's cheer them on together.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_16": "Yesss!!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_18": "Watching her light up like this, you can't help but wonder about something.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_19": "If you love soccer that much, why the Orchestral Music Club and not a sports club?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_2": "I passed! I actually passed the quiz! And it's all thanks to you, {PlayerName}!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_20": "Um...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_21": "I love it when everyone pulls together toward one goal. Soccer or trumpet, that part's exactly the same.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_22": "And, well...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_23": "Cartethyia hesitates. The tips of her ears go faintly pink. You keep watching her curiously until at last she ducks her head and answers in a tiny voice.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_24": "Actually... I did try soccer.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_25": "But my very first shot sent the net and the goalposts flying right off the field... Nobody's played with me since.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_26": "...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_27": "For every study session after that, your jaw never quite makes it back off the floor.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_3": "Oh! As a thank-you, would you come watch a game with me this weekend? If you're free, I mean.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_4": "Team Leviathan versus Team Imperator, from the Soccer Club! It's going to be so exciting!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_5": "The moment she brings up the teams, her eyes practically sparkle.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_6": "Rooting for Team Leviathan?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_7": "Rooting for Team Imperator?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_8": "Hmm... I'll admit their \"win at any cost\" style has a certain fire to it, but my heart's still with Imperator! I just love watching everyone fight side by side for the same dream!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_2_9": "Exactly! The way Team Imperator's players go all-out for the same dream... it gets me every single time!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_1": "\"GOAL! Team Imperator takes the match by one!\"",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_10": "{PlayerName}, look, look!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_11": "You follow where she's pointing. Streamers tumble through the evening glow, but the light in her eyes outshines the sunset itself.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_12": "You reach over to pluck a gold streamer from her hair just as she turns. Suddenly you're face to face, eyes locked.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_13": "...!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_14": "Oh... Th-thanks...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_15": "Her voice shrinks to almost nothing. Maybe you're imagining it, but as you hold each other's gaze, a flush rises in her cheeks.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_16": "The roar of the crowd ebbs away like a tide going out. All that's left is her quickening breath, and your own heart pounding louder by the second.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_17": "{PlayerName}, I...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_18": "Cartethyia drops her gaze, lips pressed together, hesitating. With celebration all around, a shadow of sadness crosses her face.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_19": "I was thinking... you'll be graduating soon too, right?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_2": "The announcer calls it, and the whole stadium erupts.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_20": "There are still so many problems I can't do, so many formulas that only make sense when you explain them, and so many things I want to see with you...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_21": "Once you've graduated... can I still come see you?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_22": "The crowd is still roaring. And amid all that noise, you see yourself reflected in her eyes.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_23": "You smile and offer her your pinkie.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_24": "Of course you can, Cartethyia.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_25": "Graduation isn't goodbye. It's a promise: we'll see each other plenty more after this.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_26": "...Mm!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_27": "The wind sweeps the cheering off into the distance. She links her pinkie with yours, and through the blaze of the setting sun, you watch her tears give way to a smile more dazzling than the sky.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_28": "Promise! We'll see each other again after each and every farewell!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_3": "Yes! Imperator won!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_4": "Before you've even processed the score, Cartethyia has shot out of her seat and wrapped you in a crushing hug.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_5": "Getting to share this moment with you, {PlayerName}... I'll remember it for the rest of my life!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_6": "You feel her warmth, her joyful laughter ringing right in your ear, and in that moment you hug her back just as tight. Two people's joy swells and overlaps there in the stands.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_7": "At center field, the two teams face off in two rows, bow, and pull each other into hugs.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_8": "Some are laughing through their tears; others hoist their jerseys high overhead. Winning and losing don't matter anymore. Each of them, in their own way, is bidding one last, grand farewell to the field and to their youth.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_3_9": "The crowd roars, flinging flags and streamers skyward until the air over the stadium becomes a downpour of color, a carnival raining from the sky.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_1": "The Student Council's routine meeting wraps up, and as you head out, someone steps into your path.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_10": "Go with the white.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_11": "Why choose? Get both.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_12": "Hehe, is that your pick? Then the black one it is.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_13": "Hehe, is that your pick? Then the white one it is.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_14": "Oh? Great minds think alike, it seems.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_15": "Faced with something we truly admire, neither of us can help being a little greedy. We're alike that way.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_16": "Answer in hand, Changli pays without delay and sets off with her new spoils toward the next shop.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_17": "Eventually, though, your curiosity gets the better of you, and you ask.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_18": "Why me, for a shopping trip?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_19": "Aren't you going to wear any of it?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_2": "{PlayerName}. Might you spare a moment?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_20": "Because I had a feeling you'd be just the right person, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_21": "Hehe, well, if you really want to see me in them...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_22": "Sadly, none of it is meant for me.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_23": "Next week, the Student Council is holding a charity auction for the whole school. Everything we've bought today will go up for bid, with all proceeds donated to the town orphanage.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_24": "And since the students are the ones bidding, I want to be sure every piece suits their tastes.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_25": "I'm a little embarrassed to admit it. I was raised from a young age to inherit the family business, so I seldom join in student activities or spend much time among them.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_26": "Planning, coordinating, drafting proposals for them, those I can manage well enough. But knowing what they actually like... that calls for a counselor who's genuinely one of them.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_27": "And as a token of my gratitude—",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_28": "Her gaze wanders, then comes to rest on the one shop on the corner you haven't set foot in. You follow it and find an understated yet exquisite jewelry boutique.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_29": "For the final stop of today's commission, keep me company in there, won't you?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_3": "There's a matter I'd like your help with. Think of it as an official commission from your Student Council President, hm?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_30": "There's a necklace in there I've had my eye on. It's finely polished, exquisitely crafted, and set with a golden gem that shimmers in the light.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_31": "I think it would suit your eyes perfectly.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_4": "Hmm... Between these two dresses, the black is exquisitely tailored, while the white has a charm all its own. It's hard to part with either.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_5": "{PlayerName}, which would you choose?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_6": "You never imagined that Changli's so-called commission would turn out to be a shopping trip.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_7": "From perfume to ornaments, you've hit every shop on the street, and the bags keep multiplying in your arms. Now you've stopped at a clothing boutique.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_8": "You study the two dresses in her hands, deep in thought.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_4_9": "Go with the black.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_1": "After school, you put in some time on the Student Council's usual paperwork. When you finally glance up, Changli is watching you with a smile.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_10": "Hehe. Well? How is it?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_11": "The Student Council is compiling a \"Freshman's Guide to Campus Life,\" you see. If this shop earns your approval too, I plan to list it among our picks for new students.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_12": "Smells amazing...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_13": "But how did you find this place, Changli? It doesn't exactly seem like your kind of spot.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_14": "The tighter my family held the reins, the more I wanted to slip them now and then.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_15": "Back then, slipping out for a bite of something I loved was the happiest thing in the world.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_16": "With a faint smile, Changli nudges the condiments your way.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_17": "Go on. Eat it while it's hot.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_18": "Fair warning, though. They simmer their chili oil in-house from scratch. If you aren't braced for it, the kick at the end can be a little...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_19": "...!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_2": "Good work today, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_20": "Too late. The noodles were in your mouth before she'd finished the sentence. The heat spreads fast: your tongue goes numb, sweat springs up at your temples, and you're fairly sure that if you opened your mouth, flames would come out.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_21": "So good... but so HOT!!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_22": "...Pfft.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_23": "Watching you suffer, Changli lets out a rare laugh. She cracks open the cold drink she hadn't touched and pushes it toward you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_24": "Here. This should help.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_25": "One cold gulp, and the fire finally dies down. You let out a long breath, only to meet Changli's smiling eyes.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_26": "There. No more burning, no more pain, hm?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_27": "Shared between two, it seems to taste even better than before.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_3": "If you have time, accompany me somewhere. As before, think of it as a commission from your Student Council President.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_4": "Once you're off campus, Changli turns down a side alley you've hardly ever taken and stops outside a noodle shop.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_5": "It's a tiny place, spotless and tidy. The second the door swings open, the smell of chili oil hits you full in the face.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_6": "Well, look who brought a friend! The usual, Changli dear?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_7": "Yes, the usual.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_8": "You've barely sat down before two steaming bowls land on the table.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_5_9": "Thin noodles gleam under a layer of red chili oil, crowned with minced pork, lean and fatty both, and scattered with sesame seeds and scallions... Your mouth is already watering.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_1": "Uh-oh...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_10": "Maybe it's the damp chill in the air, or maybe it's how close you're walking, but for the first time, you notice how much warmer Changli is than you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_11": "Nice and warm, hm? Come closer, if you like.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_12": "There's still a long road ahead of us, after all.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_13": "At the coast, Changli guides you onto a narrow trail tucked away among the trees.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_14": "Hiking in the rain is no picnic. More than once you both nearly lose your footing on the slick trail, grab each other's hands, and break into smiles. Under the dense canopy the umbrella is doing nothing at all, so eventually you just leave it behind.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_15": "You lose track of how long you've walked. Then the trees fall away, and there at the end of the path stands a little cottage.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_16": "This is...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_17": "An old coffee house no one uses anymore. When its owner left, I made it mine.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_18": "Changli turns up the heat, sheds her rain-soaked coat, and sets about brewing two coffees at what must once have been a bar.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_19": "Warmth closes around you, and feeling this safe, you start to drift. When you surface again, a heavy blanket is draped over your shoulders and Changli is gently patting the rain from your hair.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_2": "Watching the sudden downpour, you quietly regret not checking the weather forecast before you left.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_20": "Mm... Sorry. I must've nodded off.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_21": "Oh, right... I haven't even done your commission yet.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_22": "Shh...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_23": "Changli says nothing. Following her gaze to the window, you realize the rain has stopped.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_24": "Beyond the floor-to-ceiling windows of the viewing deck, the sea glimmers a muted slate blue, while the setting sun breaks through rifts in the clouds to spill a river of molten red and gold across the water.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_25": "Lovely, isn't it?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_26": "Quiet. Far away. No one to intrude, like the very edge of the world. Even all by yourself, you don't feel lonely here.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_27": "Today, though...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_28": "The surge of the waves rises outside and ebbs away. Changli looks at you, and in her eyes flows the color of the sunset, along with an emotion you've never seen there before.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_29": "I wanted to find out... with you beside me, would the loneliness creep in, or disappear entirely?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_3": "Yesterday, you took on another of Student Council President Changli's commissions and arranged to meet her by the coast.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_30": "It won't come back. I'll make sure of it.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_31": "...Hehe.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_32": "Changli gives a soft laugh. A corner of the blanket lifts from your shoulder, and a moment later, another warmth, even deeper than your own, slips in beside you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_33": "And at last, she lets her head come to rest on your shoulder.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_34": "Which means you fulfilled this commission long before you knew it.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_4": "Without an umbrella, though, you're now stranded at the bus stop.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_5": "Waiting for someone?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_6": "Someone with an umbrella steps up beside you. You look up into a familiar smile.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_7": "As it happens, so am I, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_8": "Changli shifts the umbrella to cover you too, and shoulder to shoulder, the two of you walk off through the rain toward the end of the road.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU2_6_9": "The street is all but empty. For a while, the world shrinks to two sets of footsteps and the soft, endless drizzle of rain.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_1": "You run into Phoebe in the corridor and head toward the Student Council together.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_10": "Sure, things are pretty loose around here, but it's not so dangerous that you need bodyguards...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_11": "Mr. Fenrico places great hopes on me. To him, I am the future heir of Celestial Steed Corp.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_12": "\"I can't entrust <ano=The Corp's future>your safety</ano> to a principal who only thinks about food.\" Those were his words.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_13": "So that's how he sees Principal Abby?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_14": "That really does sound like what he would say...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_15": "Don't worry. We've agreed they're not to intrude on anyone's school life. They only follow me from a distance, so they won't bother us.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_16": "At that, you lower your voice until only Phoebe can hear you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_17": "Phoebe, do you want to shake them off?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_18": "Huh?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_19": "The girl lets out a startled breath, then falls quiet, as if thinking it over.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_2": "A sudden feeling makes you glance back. Someone in a black suit has stopped, slipping into the shadows along the corridor.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_20": "...Would you help me? Right now?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_21": "You take Phoebe by the wrist and break into a run. Right on cue, the footsteps of the black-suited guards rise behind you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_22": "Knowing your way around campus, you lead Phoebe down a long corridor and around a corner, then along a path to the old school building.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_23": "Hah... Hah...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_24": "Breathless, you and Phoebe slump against the old school building's wall. The black-suited guards who had been chasing you are nowhere in sight.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_25": "So, how are you feeling now?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_26": "Pfft... Hahaha!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_27": "To your surprise, Phoebe laughs out loud, so unlike her usual self.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_28": "Thank you, {PlayerName}. That was so much fun.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_29": "Though she's out of Celestial Steed Corp's sight for only a moment, Phoebe gives you a smile straight from the heart.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_3": "{PlayerName}, is something wrong?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_4": "We're being followed.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_5": "You recall the first time you met Phoebe at the family restaurant. The security staff gathered around her had dressed just like that.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_6": "...I'm sorry. Please, don't mind them. The corporation sends them to keep me safe here at school.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_7": "Phoebe looks slightly embarrassed, one hand gripping her other shoulder.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_8": "I've told my father... no, Mr. Fenrico, many times, but he refuses to withdraw them.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_10_9": "To his mind, this school is far less well-run than the church school I attended before.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_1": "You're sorting paperwork in the Student Council office when Phoebe opens the door.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_10": "They're... gifts people gave me.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_11": "Your classmates gave you all this?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_12": "So you get \"fed\" at school these days?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_13": "Mm. Sometimes I come into the classroom in the morning and find a gift on my desk, with no idea who left it.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_14": "There were more than usual today. I'm only leaving them in the office for now. I'll take them home after school.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_15": "...Is this bothering you?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_16": "Phoebe pauses and then quickly shakes her head.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_17": "How could it? It's their kindness. If anything, I'm delighted.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_18": "Yet as she speaks, Phoebe's voice grows quieter.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_19": "I know... everyone's being nice to me because I'm Mr. Fenrico's daughter.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_2": "She carries what look like gift boxes in her arms. Her eyes are downcast, her mind seemingly elsewhere.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_20": "...I just wish they'd hand the gifts to me themselves, so I could thank them properly.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_21": "But I think some of them give you gifts for more than your father's name.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_22": "It's because you're Phoebe, a Student Council Officer who's always there when people need a hand.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_23": "Phoebe looks at you, a glimmer stirring in her eyes.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_24": "...Thank you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_25": "You're right. I've been too caught up in... my own worries. I can't simply take people's kindness for granted.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_26": "Tomorrow I'll ask everyone, one by one. Anyone who gave me a gift, I'll repay twice over.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_27": "...I'm not sure that's what I meant?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_29": "The outcome isn't quite what you expected, but Phoebe has certainly regained her spirits.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_3": "Phoebe? Hello?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_30": "You spend the rest of the day sorting papers together, and time slips by without you noticing.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_4": "Your voice makes her shoulders jump. She blinks, returning to herself as if waking from a dream.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_5": "Oh, {PlayerName}. You're helping out at the Student Council today.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_6": "She walks to her usual seat and sets down everything in her arms.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_7": "Your eyes drift over before you can stop them. Beside a few beautifully wrapped gift boxes are drinks and snacks from the school shop.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_8": "What are these...?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_11_9": "Phoebe glances at you, looking a little embarrassed.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_1": "You've spent days preparing this \"escape\" plan. Now the moment has finally come.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_10": "It seems to be a small wish she's always cherished as the heir of Celestial Steed Corp.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_11": "I suppose I do. When I was little, my mother often told me stories about voyages at sea.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_12": "The sea wasn't always kind in those stories. But people always found a way through the storms and the waves, to a warm harbor at the end.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_13": "I've always wanted to go out to sea, to feel the adventure in those stories. But... my family never allowed it.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_14": "You gave me that chance, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_15": "She smiles at you, perfectly at ease. Moments of such freedom seem rare for her.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_16": "If we're sticking to the plan... it's time to try some fishing.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_17": "You take out the fishing net you prepared ages ago. Roccia ordered it for you through her special channels.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_18": "I have a feeling the fish are right up ahead.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_19": "And so the two of you enjoy a delightful stretch of time out at sea.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_2": "You steer Phoebe clear of the bodyguards' watch and onto a bus arranged through the Student Council.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_20": "Dusk falls as the boat comes back to port, heavy with your haul—some netted, some hooked.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_21": "Once you're back ashore, you receive a call from an unfamiliar number.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_22": "At first there's only silence on the other end. After a long pause, a middle-aged man's voice speaks quietly.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_23": "Next time, you'd be wise to ask Celestial Steed for a larger, safer boat.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_24": "The call ends there.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_25": "You lower your phone, puzzled. Phoebe walks over, and you decide to ask her something.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_26": "Phoebe, is there anything else you've been wanting to do besides going out to sea?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_27": "Hm? Well... quite a few. I'd like to ride a roller coaster at an amusement park, or bring my plushie along for a nap on the grass...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_28": "Then we'll have plenty more chances to make wishes come true, just like today.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_29": "Phoebe looks at you for a long moment and nods, as though she might burst into tears.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_3": "It's bound for the seaside.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_30": "At last you exchange smiles and walk back toward the familiar campus together.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_4": "A motorboat carries you and Phoebe across calm waters, leaving a white wake behind you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_5": "Phoebe stands at the bow, one hand on her sun hat, as she watches the far line where sea and sky meet.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_6": "May the gentle breeze bring a bountiful catch.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_7": "...I've always wanted to say that.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_8": "Do you like the sea, Phoebe?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_12_9": "When you asked where she wanted to go, Phoebe answered right away that she wanted to be out on the water.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_1": "Today, you and Chisa clean the family restaurant from top to bottom. It's kept spotless day to day, so the work goes quickly.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_10": "All right. I'll sweeten it by eye, then. It might turn out very sweet.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_11": "Then I'll skip the sugar. Without it, the beans come through all the more clearly.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_12": "What a coincidence. It seems we have the same taste.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_13": "Chisa tips the beans into a hand grinder and works the crank with practiced ease. Before long, the aroma of coffee winds through the restaurant.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_14": "She offers you a cup. You take a sip—deep, rounded, exactly what you wanted.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_15": "Cradling her own cup, Chisa settles onto the sofa beside you. Dusk light spills through the window, gilding her cheeks with a soft glow.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_16": "...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_17": "Chisa starts to say something, then doesn't. You look up and find her eyes already on you. Then she quickly looks away.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_18": "Something on your mind, Chisa?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_19": "...Nothing. Honestly, I'm not much good at conversation. Usually it's school affairs, or whatever gadget I've been working on...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_2": "While you settle onto the sofa to rest, Chisa comes over cradling a bag of coffee beans, and she seems to be in fine spirits.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_20": "As she speaks, Chisa's hand drifts to the capybara on her bag, kneading its head as if she means to polish it.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_21": "But take those away, I... I don't really know what to talk about.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_22": "Friends don't need to fill every silence. Besides, it's a day off. We're supposed to be relaxing.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_23": "Still, it's rare to get time alone with you, yet here I am being such dull company. It feels... rather rude of me.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_24": "Then why not tell me about that capybara on your bag? I still don't know where it comes from, and you see it all over town.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_25": "Chisa blinks, then works the plushie loose from her bag and holds it out to you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_26": "It's called Namipon, the town's most famous mascot.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_27": "I got lost one night when I was little. I wandered a pitch-dark alley for a long time, and it was a Namipon billboard that finally pointed me home.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_28": "Actually, I have other Namipon plushies as well. A detective, a railway worker, a maid...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_29": "On a familiar subject, Chisa opens right up.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_3": "{PlayerName}, thank you for helping out today. It's a rare day off for us. Would you like a cup of coffee?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_30": "You and Chisa talk for a long while in the empty restaurant, the conversation drifting from Namipon to all sorts of other things.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_31": "Your school days, the homework that trips you both up, cafeteria dishes worth complaining about, the novels and films you love...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_32": "Maybe it isn't your imagination. Today, her smiles come a little more freely than usual.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_4": "Sure. Didn't take you for a coffee drinker.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_5": "I do, from time to time, especially over my exercise sheets, or when I'm turning over how to make my inventions better.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_6": "My parents have been thinking about expanding into coffee lately. I don't know how you like yours... Sugar?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_7": "Full sugar. I like it sweet.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_8": "I'll have mine the same way you do.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_1_9": "No sugar for me.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_1": "By Roccia's store, you catch sight of a face you don't often see around here.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_10": "A little cold doesn't bother me. Sometimes chewing snow is how you stay alive.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_11": "When exactly does life get harsh enough for that?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_12": "If I'm not mistaken, aren't you supposed to be in class right now?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_13": "The teacher's eyes seem to sharpen.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_14": "If I'm not mistaken, aren't you supposed to be teaching Humanities right now?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_15": "Your eyes meet and hold for a few seconds. Then you both smile.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_16": "Luckily, we have independent study today, so I could sneak out for some fresh air. Mm.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_17": "She takes another bite of her ice pop, then tosses something your way. You catch it, feeling the chill against your palm. It's an unopened ice pop.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_18": "My treat.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_19": "If you hadn't come along, she might have eaten both herself.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_2": "The tall woman leans against a vending machine, holding a pale purple... ice pop.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_20": "You open the wrapper. It's the same flavor as hers.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_21": "Thanks, Miss Galbrena.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_22": "You take a big bite, just as she did. And as expected... it's freezing!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_23": "Then the two of you enjoy a leisurely ice-pop break beside the store.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_3": "Mmm. Mm.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_4": "She takes two brisk bites, leaving great chunks missing. At this rate, she'll finish it in no time.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_5": "You've been staring at me for a while. Need something, {PlayerName}?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_6": "She looks your way. Apparently, she's known you were there all along.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_7": "No. Just looking around.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_8": "You've got strong teeth, Miss Galbrena.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_20_9": "Is that so? Just looking around.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_1": "While you're on classroom cleaning duty, you find a stack of handouts on the teacher's desk. They look like Humanities materials.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_10": "...The photo isn't where I left it. Did you see it?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_11": "Sorry. I wasn't looking through them. It slipped out on its own.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_13": "Galbrena gives you a searching look, then speaks evenly.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_14": "The Discord Slayer Task Force. \"Angel.\"",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_15": "I used to work for an international military contractor, dealing with... well, transnational crime.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_16": "You had your suspicions. Still, hearing the answer from her own mouth catches you off guard.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_17": "Then how did you end up teaching Humanities here?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_18": "Retired. And Principal Abby said the school was short on staff, so here I am.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_19": "...That simple? I didn't know Principal Abby had that much pull.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_2": "(These are probably Miss Galbrena's. Better get them back to her office.)",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_21": "It's not a bad place. Peaceful, fresh air. No attack sirens to worry about, no stray bullets to catch.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_22": "And more importantly, the students here are an interesting bunch.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_23": "When she says \"interesting,\" Galbrena glances your way, a hint of a smile on her face.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_24": "If you have time, would you tell me about your past?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_25": "Sure, it's no secret. But don't expect much. It's only the story of someone scraping by on the battlefield.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_26": "You and Galbrena chat about this and that, drifting between the present and the past until dusk settles in.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_3": "As you pick up the handouts, a photograph slips out and lands on the desk.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_4": "You stop short at the sight. It seems to have been taken out in the wilderness.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_5": "Before a towering transport plane, several young people dressed like mercenaries stand shoulder to shoulder for a group shot, all swagger and steel. Each one is tagged with a codename.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_6": "\"Beholder.\" \"Dullahan.\" \"Flame Demon.\" \"Chimera.\" And... \"Angel.\"",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_7": "Angel has a familiar head of short, snow-white hair. She wears a leather jacket, her eyes cold and piercing, and the black pistols in her hands glint ominously in the sunlight.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_8": "After some searching, you find Galbrena at the Liaison Center and return the handouts.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_21_9": "Thanks. So that's where I left them.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_1": "You meet up with Galbrena in town, having agreed to go camping on the outskirts tonight.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_10": "You take her advice and move nearer the fire, feeling its warmth spread through you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_11": "You teach Humanities, but somehow everything I learn from you is anything but.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_12": "That's because you don't listen in class.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_13": "Right, Miss Galbrena.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_14": "Galbrena spares you a glance, then turns to the bright fire, a smile rising on her face.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_15": "Something wrong? You've gone quiet.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_16": "...Angel and Galbrena. Which one's your real name?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_17": "Maybe both. Maybe neither. What do you think?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_18": "Angel.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_19": "Galbrena.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_2": "Night has fallen by the time you arrive. Galbrena takes the camping gear from her bag and pitches the tent with practiced ease.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_20": "Mm. Right here, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_21": "Just then, a long, low growl rises somewhere nearby. It sounds like a wild animal.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_22": "...There are wolves outside town?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_23": "Don't worry. Even if they surround us, I know how to drive them off.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_24": "She rolls her wrist gently, closes her hand into a fist, then lets it relax.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_25": "But not as a mercenary. As a teacher. Nothing's going to hurt my student.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_26": "Whatever else may be true, one thing is certain—beside Galbrena, you feel safe.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_27": "For the rest of the night, you talk and gaze up at the stars overhead.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_28": "Until drowsiness washes over you and carries everything into sleep...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_29": "Just call me Galbrena.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_3": "She barely gives you a chance to help. You blink, and the firepit is already stacked and burning downwind of the camp.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_30": "You watch the faint smile on her face, and find yourself remembering the story she once told you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_31": "The ruthless mercenary she once was, the gentle teacher before you now... Which one of them is the real...?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_4": "The quiet night, the bright flames, the occasional crackle of the fire... It all feels so peaceful.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_5": "Have a seat, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_6": "Did you camp out a lot before?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_7": "You could say that. Out on missions, you end up sleeping rough sooner or later.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_8": "That's when survival skills matter. Whatever the situation, however cold the night, get a fire going and it's easier to bear.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_22_9": "Come sit a little closer. It's warmer.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_1": "Today, you and Chisa have plans to go shopping for supplies for the Liaison Center.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_10": "A shop is looking to partner with the Liaison Center. They've brought the supplies we meant to purchase straight to our door.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_11": "Well, that's good news.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_12": "The Liaison Center's reach just got a little wider.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_13": "It is. Saves us the trip to pick everything up.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_14": "You could say that. We can contact them whenever we need more supplies like these.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_15": "But now we have the rest of the afternoon free. What... should we do?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_16": "Chisa lowers her gaze, looking a little hesitant.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_17": "Since we don't need to shop, we could go somewhere else. I'm free all day, so it's up to you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_18": "Chisa nods. She thinks for a moment and then smiles.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_19": "Then... shall we go down to the sea?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_2": "You arrive at the meeting spot in the afternoon. After a short wait, a familiar figure comes into view.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_20": "The warm sea breeze carries the damp of the water, brushing softly against your cheeks. Beyond, the blue stretches unbroken to the horizon.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_21": "I don't often come to the seaside. From what I remember, the view here always lifts my spirits.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_22": "Her long hair sways gently in the breeze. Hands clasped behind her back, she walks slowly along the path.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_23": "You follow, and the two of you stroll along the coast, one a few steps ahead of the other.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_24": "Say, {PlayerName}... What do you think is on the other side of the sea?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_25": "Probably more land.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_26": "Somehow I picture a lighthouse out there... and a giant whale...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_27": "Maybe there's nothing there.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_28": "I see. Whatever's beyond the sea, it's a world outside our little town. I've always wanted to see it, but never had the chance.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_29": "Then why not take a break sometime and go see it for yourself?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_3": "Phew... Did I keep you waiting?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_30": "Mm. Come to think of it, you're not from around here. Tell me a little about your life before you came to town, will you?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_31": "I... want to know more about you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_32": "Chisa stops and turns toward you, gazing at you with quiet eagerness.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_33": "You rack your brain, trying to recall your life before coming to town, but nothing comes to mind. The earliest memory you can reach is still that same station.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_34": "I don't remember.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_35": "(Stay silent.)",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_36": "...Oh? It's all right. After all, the you I know is the one who's here with me, in this town.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_37": "It's okay if you'd rather not talk about it. After all, the you I know is the one who's here with me, in this town.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_38": "If we ever get the chance, we could—",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_39": "A few gulls sweep past, close enough to cut Chisa off mid-sentence. The two of you watch them skim away across the sea.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_4": "From the looks of it, she ran the whole way.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_40": "...Sorry, what was that?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_41": "Chisa only smiles and shakes her head.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_42": "...Nothing. Now, would you keep me company on the beach a little longer?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_43": "Of course. We still have plenty of time today.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_44": "Chisa nods and turns toward the beach. You step up beside her, the two of you walking side by side.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_45": "And so, you spend the rest of the day in peaceful ease by the sea.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_5": "Not at all. I just got here myself.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_6": "You shake your head, and catch something strained in Chisa's expression.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_7": "I'm sorry. We won't be able to get our supplies today.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_8": "Did something come up?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_2_9": "Trouble at the Liaison Center, perhaps. Or the shops along the street shut for the day. Every possibility that flickers through your mind is an unwelcome one.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_1": "With a fresh batch of sponsor names sorted at the Liaison Center, you and Chisa slip off to a quiet spot on campus to take a break.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_10": "...Senpai.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_11": "...?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_13": "You give Chisa a puzzled look. She lowers her eyes, suddenly hesitant.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_14": "I'm not sure why... Sometimes I just want to call you that. There's a familiarity to it I can't quite place.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_15": "{PlayerName}? Classmate? Senpai...? What would you like me to call you?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_16": "It's only what you call me. Whatever it is, it won't change what we mean to each other.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_17": "So go with whatever comes naturally to you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_18": "Chisa nods and smiles, then rises to her feet.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_19": "{PlayerName}, remember what I left unsaid at the beach?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_2": "Here. A little thank-you for the help.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_20": "Of course I do.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_21": "Uh... What was it again?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_22": "If we ever get the chance, we could...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_23": "Chisa puffs out her cheeks in a show of annoyance. You wave a hand to let her know you're joking.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_24": "If we ever get the chance, we could...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_25": "Go see what's beyond this town together.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_26": "She looks you straight in the eye, perhaps for the first time without looking away.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_27": "Life in this town may turn out to be only a passing stop along our road.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_28": "In a future not so far off, I... Kuchiba Chisa... want to go and see a wider world with you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_29": "And maybe, in the end, we could open a little cafe of our own.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_3": "Chisa hands you a can of fruit juice.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_30": "Amid the dancing cherry blossoms, she finally confesses her feelings to you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_31": "Pale pink petals follow the wind's path, slowly drawing your hearts closer together.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_32": "Then when the time comes... I'm in your hands, Chisa.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_33": "You answer without much thought. Chisa pauses, then her face lights up again.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_34": "And I'm in yours, Senpai.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_35": "In that moment, her bright smile, like the cherry blossoms at their fullest, prints itself vividly in your memory.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_4": "You take the juice and sip it as Chisa settles onto the bench beside you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_5": "Whenever I'm feeling down at school, or stuck on an invention, I come here.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_6": "Because it's quiet and hardly anyone comes by?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_7": "Yes. Somehow, when I sit here and let my thoughts settle, most things find their answer.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_8": "Chisa turns to you with a faint smile.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_3_9": "This is... a special case, I suppose. I've never had anyone come here with me before.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_1": "It's a quiet afternoon when you step into the computer lab. What greets you is the clatter of keys, and...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_10": "Of course! Someone's gotta keep the forum in good shape. If it's all clickbait headlines, what's even the point?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_11": "But haven't you posted some pretty over-the-top headlines yourself?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_12": "At your words, the girl gives an awkward little cough.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_13": "Ahem. Well... sometimes the forum gets quiet. Somebody's gotta liven things up!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_14": "And I don't post like that all the time! Check my posting history if you don't believe me!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_15": "No need, no need. I was only kidding.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_16": "Heya, Boss {PlayerName}! You hardly ever drop by. Come on, sit down and keep me company?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_17": "I've picked up a whole bunch of juicy school rumors lately.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_18": "You pass a leisurely stretch of time in the computer lab, listening to Buling's half-true rumors.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_2": "You're accusing ME of abusing admin powers? Please! I don't need that to take you on. Your like count isn't even a fraction of mine!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_3": "What's with all the shouting? Picking another fight on the forum?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_4": "Oh, hey, Boss {PlayerName}. It's nothing. Just someone dropping another tall tale on the forum's urban legends board.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_5": "You look at Buling's computer screen. The school forum is open.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_6": "The headline screams, \"Shocking! Eerie Voices Echo Through the Club Association Building at Night!\"",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_7": "Ghosts? Don't make me laugh. That building's PA glitched out a while back and started looping bits of some campus interview recording.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_8": "I debunked it right there in the replies, and the poster lost it. Now they're trying to start a whole comment war with me!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_40_9": "...Is this part of your job as a forum admin?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_1": "A familiar voice calls out to you near Roccia's store.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_10": "What's the occasion? That's a lot of gifts.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_11": "Oh, no occasion. They're for friends on the forum. Just thanking them for helping me out before.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_12": "Connections mean intel. These gifts are how I keep my network of informants, on and off campus, in good shape.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_13": "...Your network? On and off campus? Wait, so the forum's got people from outside the school on it too, not just students?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_14": "Of course! We've got alumni from past graduating classes, as well as teachers and students from our partner schools. There's Master Qing, who teaches zither and swordsmanship, and Jianxin, whose family runs a martial arts school.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_15": "Buling leans in and lowers her voice, suddenly looking very serious.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_16": "Psst, just between us—that famous artist Encore has a secret account on the forum too.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_17": "You really know some fascinating people.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_18": "Haha, you know what they say: Out in the world, you lean on friends. If I run into trouble I can't handle, I just call on my forum buddies.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_19": "And if something totally unexplainable goes down, I can put up a post and let the experts weigh in.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_2": "Hey, hey! Boss {PlayerName}, give me a hand!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_20": "And lately? I'm eyeing a whole new line of business. The forum's branching out. Cutting deals with a few companies off campus.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_21": "If the school ever has to \"go to war\" with Celestial Steed Corp, the more helping hands on our side, the better.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_22": "Put it that way, and it does make a bit of sense.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_23": "See? See?!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_24": "Buling beams at your approval.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_25": "You stroll alongside Buling while she pours out the grand design she's been nursing in her heart. And so the hours slip away...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_3": "You turn to see Buling clutching a small mountain of gift boxes. You step forward and steady the teetering pile.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_4": "Thanks! You saved me.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_5": "Before long, a courier arrives with a cart, and Buling loads all the gifts onto it.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_6": "Just send them to the addresses on the boxes. Thanks a bunch!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_7": "You got it! Eekky Logistics: We Promise, We Deliver!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_8": "The courier wheels the gifts off, and you turn to Buling.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_41_9": "What's up, Boss? You're staring at me like I'm about to be dinner.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_1": "Lately, you and Buling have been going out to investigate some of the stories posted on the forum's urban legends board.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_10": "Late at night, you walk together down the old building's corridor. Buling sweeps her flashlight across the abandoned halls as she chats with you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_11": "Boss, I've decided to upgrade your forum account to Gold VIP.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_12": "Practically admin-level access, with the special perk of never getting muted.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_13": "Sounds too good to be true.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_14": "It's a thank-you for putting up with all my nonsense lately.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_15": "Buling, I don't think I've asked you before. Why are you so keen to debunk these stories?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_16": "For once, the girl beside you pauses to think, rather than answering right away.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_17": "...Because it's fun, maybe? If there really are ghosts or supernatural things out there, I'm not gonna miss them!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_18": "Too bad all we've found so far are fakes. Posts with that kind of over-the-top clickbait deserve to be locked.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_19": "You're almost at the classroom where someone once claimed to see a white ghost. Even with all your experience, you both feel a little nervous.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_2": "There's the \"piano playing in an empty activity room.\"",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_20": "Just as you're about to enter, something white catches your eye up ahead... a cat.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_21": "Inside, the light is dim, yet you're certain that the cat narrows its sly eyes and smiles at you both.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_22": "A blink later, it vanishes into thin air, as if it had never existed.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_23": "Boss... tell me you saw that.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_24": "You nod without a word. No truth uncovered this time, but you may have found... the real thing.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_25": "You and Buling trade an awkward smile, then back out of the old school building the way you came.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_26": "In the end, the incident never makes it onto the forum. It remains a secret between the two of you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_3": "The truth? Age has caused the piano keys to shift out of place.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_4": "Then there's the \"invisible player kicking a soccer ball on the Athletic Field.\"",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_5": "The truth? Nothing but grass stirring in the wind, tricking the eye in the dim night light.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_6": "And there's the \"statue in the art classroom that moves on its own.\"",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_7": "The truth? The classroom floor slopes ever so slightly, letting the statue slowly slide downhill.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_8": "Buling posts your findings on the forum, to the dismay of its urban legend enthusiasts.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_42_9": "At last, the day comes when you take on one of the school's Seven Mysteries: the \"monster in the old school building.\"",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_1": "After school, you return to the classroom and run into Miss Verina there.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_10": "What is it? You've been watching me without a word.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_11": "I don't see many people carrying a watering can around...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_12": "It's become a habit. Sometimes when I see flowers and plants around the school that no one's looking after, I can lend a hand.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_13": "I've got gardening gloves and a trowel on me as well, not just the watering can.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_14": "One gardening tool after another comes out of Verina's bag. Hard to believe it holds all of this on top of her teaching supplies.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_15": "So... you really are fond of gardening, Miss Verina?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_16": "Mm, it's a hobby of mine. Tending to flowers helps me relax.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_17": "Oh, {PlayerName}, now that you're here, how about a little extra tutoring?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_18": "I remember quite a few mistakes in the homework you turned in last time. Mistakes you shouldn't be making.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_19": "Oh, I just remembered, there's something I have to do...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_2": "In the last light of sunset, she takes a small watering can from her shoulder bag and waters the plant on the teacher's desk.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_20": "Miss Verina, I'll just grab my textbook and go!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_21": "Despite your repeated protests, Miss Verina blocks your path, trowel in hand.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_22": "And so, you end up in a one-on-one tutoring session after school.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_3": "You watch her in silence. Before long, she finishes watering and notices you standing in the doorway.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_4": "Ah, {PlayerName}. You haven't gone home yet?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_5": "I left a textbook behind. Are you... watering the plants?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_6": "Miss Verina blinks, looks down at the watering can in her hand, and then smiles.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_7": "The soil in this pothos's pot had dried out, so I thought I'd come and water it.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_8": "Its leaves are going limp already. It's probably been thirsty for a while.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_50_9": "She slips the watering can back into her bag with practiced ease. Apparently, she carries it everywhere.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_1": "You reach Miss Verina's office right on time, ready to lend a hand sorting her course materials.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_10": "The drawings are only simple lines and patches of color, yet each plant's shape and species is easy to make out.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_11": "Each illustration is paired with thorough, careful notes. It's plain how much of herself Verina put into these pages.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_12": "The more care you see in its pages, the more one question grows in your mind.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_13": "Why did Miss Verina end up teaching math at the school?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_14": "Verina finishes tending to the potted plant on the teacher's desk and looks over at you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_15": "Oh, by the way, would you like to go sightseeing with me this weekend?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_16": "You've been such a help to me lately. Think of it as my thank-you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_17": "Sure! Where are we going?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_18": "...That's a secret for now.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_19": "Miss Verina winks at you, quite unlike herself. Since she wants to keep it a surprise, you don't press her.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_2": "Miss Verina isn't there yet. Reaching her desk, you find a notebook left open on it.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_20": "You spend a satisfying stretch of time sorting course materials together.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_3": "On the page is a simple map of what looks like the town's outskirts, with several points marked in red.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_4": "Those are my field notes, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_5": "Miss Verina enters the office, wearing her usual gentle smile.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_6": "Field notes?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_7": "Mm. When I was in college, I went out on field studies all the time. I kept this notebook back then.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_8": "I thought I'd lost it. Then I found it hiding in a stack of old books. Take a look, if you like.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_51_9": "You nod and leaf through the notebook. Alongside the maps are hand-drawn illustrations of plants.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_1": "On the weekend, you meet Miss Verina on the street. As promised, she's taking you out for a change of scenery.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_10": "Verina picks a white flower from among the blossoms and holds it out to you, smiling.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_11": "This one's for you. Be happy, all right?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_12": "You take the flower and study it. White petals surround its yellow-green center, making it look like a little star.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_13": "It's an improved variety I bred back in college. I call it the \"Starflower.\"",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_14": "Over the years, I've planted it here among the others. Come blooming season, the whole place turns into a sea of blossoms.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_15": "So that's what makes it your \"secret hideaway\"?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_16": "Yes. Whenever I come here, my heart feels a little lighter.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_17": "Verina looks across the flowers, her gaze softening. She seems lost in thought.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_18": "I never told you this. Teaching wasn't my first dream. What I really wanted was... to be a plant breeder.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_19": "I pictured myself raising plants in a greenhouse, tending to them every day and occasionally doing fieldwork.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_2": "We're going outside town. I have a little \"secret hideaway\" there.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_20": "But in the end, you chose to teach here?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_21": "At that, Verina turns to you, a warm smile on her face.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_22": "Mm. Because... raising students and raising flowers aren't so different.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_23": "What I do now isn't so far from that old dream. I'm still waiting on <ano=Students>flowers</ano> to bloom.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_24": "And I still tend to plants in my spare time. Even if it can't be my career, I can keep it as a hobby.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_25": "That's Miss Verina for you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_26": "That's my homeroom teacher for you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_27": "Well then, since you've come all this way, why not take your time and enjoy the view?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_28": "And just like that, you and Verina while away an unhurried weekend in the flower fields.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_3": "Verina dangles a set of car keys in front of you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_4": "I'll drive us there.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_5": "So... you have a car?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_6": "Of course! I drive to work every day. I got my license as soon as I was old enough.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_7": "You climb into Miss Verina's car. She drives steadily toward the outskirts of town.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_8": "After a drive of half an hour or so, you reach your destination—",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_52_9": "Beneath a brilliant blue sky, grasses sway in the breeze. You and Verina stand amid a sea of flowers.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_1": "That afternoon, you walk into the Student Council office to find Xiangli Yao at a computer by the door.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_10": "Yes. Students send in questions, notices, and wishes. Over the years, it's become a tradition of the school.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_11": "Looks like the mail server had a hiccup earlier. A bunch of messages got stuck in the queue, and it's only spitting them out now.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_12": "But it's all right. I can ask Xiang-LEE to take care of them.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_13": "Xiang-LEE?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_14": "A program I developed. It sorts emails and replies to them automatically.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_15": "Xiangli Yao types a few commands. A little gray-and-white robot appears on his desktop.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_16": "Xiang-LEE sorts emails by priority and generates summaries. It saves us a lot of time sifting through them.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_17": "After that, it's up to <ano=Student Council>us</ano> to figure out how to address the students' concerns.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_18": "So the Student Council is a bit like a \"Wish Lodge\"?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_19": "At that, Xiangli Yao looks at you thoughtfully.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_2": "He looks up as you come in and lifts a hand in greeting.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_20": "Perhaps. More often than not, that's the role the Student Council plays: making the students' wishes come true, as far as our abilities allow.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_21": "You look after the site's backend and handle every wish that comes through. You're practically the owner of the \"Wish Lodge.\"",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_22": "Xiangli Yao shakes his head with a smile.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_23": "No. Every Student Council member is an owner of this Lodge.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_24": "Just granting a few simple wishes and smoothing out students' troubles already takes the whole team.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_25": "After that, you browse the emails and chat with Xiangli Yao. The time passes pleasantly...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_3": "Good afternoon, {PlayerName}. Something I can help you with?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_4": "Still had some paperwork to finish up, so I figured I'd stop by.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_5": "Beep-beep! Beep-beep!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_6": "A flurry of incoming messages cuts your conversation short. Xiangli Yao taps quickly at the keyboard.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_7": "I see... Something's gone wrong with the backend of the Council site.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_8": "You glance at his computer. Emails scroll endlessly down the admin page...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_60_9": "People write to the Student Council this often?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_1": "One quiet morning, you spot a familiar figure in the square.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_10": "He's always trying to best me academically. This journal is his declaration of war. It contains his paper on algorithms.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_11": "You're a little surprised. Publishing academic papers seems worlds away from high school life.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_12": "I'm afraid he'll be disappointed this time. My last paper appeared in a higher-ranked journal with a better impact factor.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_13": "He should receive the copy I mailed him in a few days.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_14": "So, it seems this is how the two of them get along.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_15": "...I didn't realize you were such an accomplished researcher. And yet you're still at the school?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_16": "Principal Abby once suggested I skip ahead and continue my studies at a prestigious university, and even offered to write me a recommendation letter.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_17": "But I gave it some thought, and in the end, I declined.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_18": "Why give up an opportunity like that?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_19": "Several reasons. Someone has to keep the Council's website running, and the finances aren't easy to hand off to anyone else.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_2": "A brown-haired boy stands beneath the shade of a tree, a package in his hands. You decide to go over and say hello.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_20": "Besides, staying at the school doesn't keep me from doing research. This paper got published thanks to the sheer size of the training dataset Xiang-LEE can draw on here.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_21": "Xiangli Yao smiles at you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_22": "More importantly, I've come to quite enjoy the company of people here.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_23": "And you've done a lot for the Council lately. I'd like to thank you. May I reserve a little of your time?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_24": "You nod to Xiangli Yao, glad to accept.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_25": "Together you cross the square toward the Student Council office. The walk is peaceful and easy.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_3": "Xiangli Yao notices you, and his expression warms into a friendly smile.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_4": "It's good to see you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_5": "Someone sent you a package?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_6": "Xiangli Yao nods and opens it. Inside is what looks like a computer science journal. He flips through it briefly, looking a little resigned.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_7": "Just as I thought... He's trying to outdo me.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_8": "...Huh?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_61_9": "Oh, I haven't told you about him. I have a friend studying overseas. His name is Pascar.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_1": "One evening, you meet Xiangli Yao at the Student Council office and head up to the roof of the Teaching Building.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_10": "A star cluster comes into view, so beautiful it steals your breath. Bright stars wander among softly glowing nebulae, each one a sapphire.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_11": "{PlayerName}, this is the sight I wanted to share with you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_12": "I was young when I first saw distant stars clearly through a telescope. I couldn't take my eyes off them.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_13": "Until then, my parents' work as scholars had immersed me in algorithms, theorems, and formulas. I thought that was what truth looked like.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_14": "The celestial bodies of deep space revealed the beauty of truth to me in tangible form—cosmic tides, rising out of order and law.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_15": "So I want to spend the rest of my life pursuing those truths, hidden out in the wild dark.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_16": "At his words, your gaze leaves the telescope's eyepiece and settles on the boy beside you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_17": "He looks up at the sky in silence. Against the night, he seems to stand among the stars.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_18": "I think you'll find the truth someday.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_19": "He pauses, turns to you, and smiles.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_2": "You watch him take a long, tube-shaped lens, a tripod, and several intricate-looking devices from his bag.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_20": "Then I'll hold you to that, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_21": "I've told you my wish, so how about you tell me yours?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_22": "Enjoy my school days.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_23": "Head toward the future together.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_24": "I'm still figuring that one out.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_25": "I see. Then I'll do what I can to help make your wish come true in the days ahead.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_26": "Sounds like what a story's hero would say. You're always surrounded by people's laughter.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_27": "I see. There's no rush. Mull it over as the days go by. You'll find it eventually.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_28": "I hope we get to share many more nights under the stars like this.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_29": "You and Xiangli Yao share a smile, and without a word, both of you look up at the night sky.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_3": "This is...?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_30": "Above, the stars shine on as they always have, pouring their light over the silent school...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_4": "An astronomical telescope. It's a standard model, but I've made a few simple modifications, so the image comes out a little sharper.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_5": "You watch Xiangli Yao assemble the observation gear with practiced hands, and wait quietly as night falls—",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_6": "A gentle evening breeze brushes your cheeks. Above, the night sky brims with stars.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_7": "...A town this size doesn't have a big city's glow at night, so there's no stray light to get in the way.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_8": "He tweaks the telescope's position and angle, then lifts a hand to beckon you over.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_62_9": "You walk over, lean in, and let the telescope carry your gaze out into the distant starfield.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_1": "You find Ciaccona in the Orchestral Music Club's room, though something about her seems different today.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_10": "I am! Inspiration struck just now. I wanted to get it down before it slipped away.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_11": "I'm not slacking off. I'm writing a story! Inspiration struck just now. I wanted to get it down before it slipped away.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_12": "So you didn't know I was into this?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_13": "You nod at her untroubled smile. You had no idea she had interests beyond music, and now you're curious.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_14": "What kind of story is it?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_15": "Hmm... a fairly classic hero's journey, I'd say.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_16": "A \"hero's journey\"...?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_17": "A hero endures a long, troubled journey and comes away with something to show for it.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_18": "To be more exact, it's about... a vast world, mysterious underground ruins, an evil dragon, and a legendary adventure!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_19": "Each time a key phrase slips out, something bright kindles in the girl's eyes.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_2": "...Before the dragon's flames... the buildings melted away like butter...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_20": "I've loved listening to fantasy stories since I was little. After I came to the school, I started writing one of my own in my spare time.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_21": "If you don't mind... could I take a look?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_22": "Of course! But stories like this are more fun read aloud.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_23": "Ciaccona props her open notebook on the desk and motions for you to sit across from her. Once you do, she clears her throat and adopts an old-fashioned storyteller's voice.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_24": "It was a night of wind and snow.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_25": "In a forgotten corner of SOL-3, there stood a tavern, dimly lit but alive with chatter—",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_26": "You listen quietly as Ciaccona reads her tale, and before you know it, you're drawn into its world...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_3": "At the desk, Ciaccona murmurs to herself as she writes.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_4": "You leave her to her work and take a seat farther away. For a while, the only sound in the quiet clubroom is the scratch of her pen.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_5": "Before long, Ciaccona sets down her pen. When she looks up, her eyes land on you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_6": "Ah, {PlayerName}! Sorry, sorry! I was so deep in it I didn't even notice you come in.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_7": "You look over. An old notebook lies open before Ciaccona, its pages seemingly covered in writing.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_8": "Are you writing a story?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_70_9": "Are you slacking off?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_1": "At dusk, you stroll with Ciaccona near the Athletic Field.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_10": "I want to paint that story, and see what sort of legend is born from my pen.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_11": "Carty, for one! In a world like that, she'd surely be a mighty... Blessed Maiden!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_12": "The sort of Blessed Maiden who would lead the people, longsword in hand. Though I'd bet she'd sneak away now and then to enjoy a little freedom from her role.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_13": "You picture Cartethyia in a Blessed Maiden's armored gown, raising her sword before the crowd.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_14": "...I wonder what she'd think if she heard you say that.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_15": "And then Phoebe! With that personality and bearing of hers? A devout, kindhearted priestess, no question.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_16": "The devoted sort. Prayers right on schedule, and a smile that leaves you bathed in holy light.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_17": "And with that, Ciaccona turns a meaningful look your way.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_18": "{PlayerName}, you'd make a truly remarkable character.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_19": "...Me?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_2": "She hugs her old notebook full of fantasy stories, the pen cap pressed to her chin while she thinks.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_20": "I think you'd be the hero. Maybe even the savior of the world.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_21": "You'd carry the world on your shoulders, rushing from one crisis to the next with hardly a moment to rest. Luckily, you'd always have all sorts of companions by your side, ready to help.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_22": "Then I'll give everything I've got to fight alongside my companions.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_23": "I just want to live long enough to collect my pension.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_24": "I knew you'd say that. There's something about you that draws people together without them even noticing.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_25": "Hahaha! That's the spirit. Say what you like, but I know you'd give it your all when the time came.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_26": "What about you, Ciaccona? Who would you be in that world?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_27": "Me? I've never really thought about it... I'm not much of a fighter, and adventuring isn't really my thing...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_28": "Ciaccona gazes thoughtfully at the sky, then smiles.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_29": "...I think I'd be a bard.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_3": "{PlayerName}, I just thought of a new story idea.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_30": "I doubt I'd have any great deeds of my own to speak of, but I could write down everyone else's adventures and share them far and wide.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_31": "Wherever I go, I want to bring people those little joys and quiet courage no one else ever hears of, in verse and in song.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_32": "Then I'll be counting on you in that fantasy world.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_33": "Splendid! Then it's a promise.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_34": "You keep walking along the edge of the Athletic Field as the last light fades and night takes over...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_4": "And just for the record, this is not me dodging a score I can't finish, or an old story whose next page I can't find.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_5": "Right. Of course.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_6": "Well, now I know why.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_7": "Ahem. Anyway, I want to write a fantasy tale starring the teachers and classmates around us. Starring us!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_8": "You'd base it on us?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_71_9": "Yes! If we went on an adventure in a world of swords and magic, who would we be? What would happen to us?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_1": "During the lunch break, you slip up to the roof of the Teaching Building for some fresh air, and come across a familiar figure nearby.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_10": "Compared with the rest of the school, the open rooftop really is a quiet place.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_11": "The sky is a clear blue and the view stretches wide. You seldom see Ciaccona looking so calm.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_12": "Ever since I was small, I've loved to gaze up at the sky. It always hangs so high, so far away, so full of mystery.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_13": "A wistful note slips into her voice.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_14": "Come to think of it, this sky hasn't changed one bit since I was a child.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_15": "From here I can see what's beneath it, too. The school buildings, the Athletic Field, the streets, even the distant shore... All those familiar sights of our little town.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_16": "{PlayerName}, do you think the sky I'll see beyond this town will look different from the one we know?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_17": "Same sky, I'd bet.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_18": "Somehow, I think it'll be different.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_19": "You think so? Then I'll just have to see for myself once I graduate.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_2": "The red-haired girl leans against the railing, her face tilted toward the sky.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_20": "You're saying...?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_21": "Ciaccona holds down the bangs the wind has mussed and smiles at you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_22": "Once I graduate, I'm going to see the whole world. All of it!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_23": "I'll go see what lies past this town, learn things I never knew, hunt down stories, and set every place I pass to music.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_24": "After all, we're third-years now. This year, we graduate.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_25": "Graduation means leaving the school behind. It means goodbye. And for the first time, you seem to feel how heavy that word is.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_26": "When the time comes, I'll head out to see the world. We might not be able to see each other very often.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_27": "Ciaccona clasps her hands behind her back and meets your eyes. You stand together in silence for a while before you speak.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_28": "Then when that day comes, let me be your audience, Ciaccona.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_29": "...Huh?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_3": "Just as you approach her—",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_30": "And the next time we meet, share the sights and stories you've written down along the way.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_31": "Ciaccona's eyes widen a little. Then her expression softens into a smile.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_32": "It's a promise!",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_33": "For the rest of your time together, you and Ciaccona gaze quietly up at the sky.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_34": "And the two of you lose yourselves in the blue sky...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_4": "A breeze sweeps across the roof and stirs her hair. She senses you nearby and turns.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_5": "I don't see you up here often, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_6": "Did you come up here to practice something?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_7": "Ciaccona shakes her head. She doesn't seem to have brought an instrument, either.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_8": "I used to. Nearly became another one of the school's Mysteries, so I stopped.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_72_9": "...I just wanted somewhere quiet to look at the sky.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_1": "On a quiet morning, you help Roccia sort a new shipment at the store.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_10": "You nod. The chest isn't locked. You lift its lid to reveal its content...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_11": "The first things to catch your eye are the gleaming gold trophies. More than one lies neatly and orderly inside.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_12": "And past the trophies, an assortment of other things: award certificates from performance contests, scripts with sticky notes slipped between the pages, stills of Roccia in performance...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_13": "These are...?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_14": "Things I kept from my child star days.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_15": "There are stage props in the box, too: a half mask, a feathered headdress, party poppers, a cane...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_16": "Props from my Troupe of Fools performances. I did films as well, but improv comedy was my real trade.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_17": "Roccia follows your gaze, then explains it all in that calm, matter-of-fact way.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_18": "You turn to the petite store assistant at your side. Hard to imagine a career that dazzling behind her.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_19": "But you still came back to town, to work in a little store like this?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_2": "In a corner of the storeroom, a striking leather-covered wooden chest catches your eye.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_20": "Roccia hums an assent and tilts her head slightly, looking at you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_21": "Is that strange?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_22": "...A lot of people would call it the ideal life: a grand stage, your talent on display, everyone watching you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_23": "I like my life the way it is now.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_24": "Back then, my happiest moments were watching the audience smile. And now, in the store, I still get to see people smile all the time.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_25": "Her gaze is clear, untouched by doubt or confusion.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_26": "\"Whether you stay onstage or not, follow your heart and enjoy the freedom you believe in.\" That's what Brant, the private detective, once told me.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_27": "I don't fully understand it yet. But right now, I want to spend more time with everyone.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_28": "When she says \"everyone,\" Roccia looks straight into your eyes. Her gaze holds a maturity and resolve far beyond her years.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_29": "All right. We'd better get back to work, too.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_3": "It looks like a treasure chest from a seafaring film. A fine layer of dust coats it. Apparently, no one has opened it for a while.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_30": "You give her a smile and shut the chest. Roccia smiles right back.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_31": "Plenty of goods still need sorting. No slacking now...",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_4": "...What are you looking at?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_5": "Roccia's voice comes from behind you. You turn to find her watching you curiously.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_6": "This chest looks unusual.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_7": "That's a spare chest I used to sleep in.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_8": "Roccia has always liked sleeping in chests. Looking closer, you see that this one does resemble the chest she usually sleeps in.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_80_9": "If you want to see what's inside, I don't mind. You can open it.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_1": "You spot Roccia coming toward you in the school hallway. She notices you at the same time.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_10": "It's Pero.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_11": "...\"Pero\"?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_12": "It's my imaginary friend. We met back at the theater, a long time ago.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_13": "Seeing your puzzled look, Roccia clasps her hands behind her back and paces before you as she tells you about her past.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_14": "I'd only just started performing, so I wasn't used to all those eyes on me. And all those dark camera lenses scared me even more.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_15": "I was scared of getting my part wrong, and scared I wouldn't be good enough for the audience.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_16": "When it got really bad, I'd hide alone in a chest backstage, too scared to go out onstage at all.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_17": "I remember one big competition. I'd hidden inside my chest and was just about to give up when I saw Pero there in the dark.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_18": "Pero floated around in front of me and talked to me. That encouragement helped me take an important step onto the stage.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_19": "At that, Roccia smiles and looks at you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_2": "Roccia looks up, and her eyes seem to brighten.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_20": "The warmth and hope Pero gave me back then... I want to pass them on to you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_21": "You nod, take a Pero biscuit from the box, and hold it up to the sunlight, studying it closely.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_22": "Pero, Pero—",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_23": "For some reason, you can almost hear the biscuit in your hand making those sounds.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_3": "{PlayerName}, there you are! I baked you some biscuits.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_4": "Here you go. Thank you for helping me out these past few days.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_5": "She holds out a neatly wrapped box of biscuits. You thank her and take it with both hands.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_6": "The box is still warm. She must have baked the biscuits just a little while ago.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_7": "What are these...?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_8": "The biscuits inside have an unusual shape, nothing like the coffee biscuits Roccia usually makes.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_81_9": "Each one is a little cartoon creature, blue-purple all over, with two hands and two horns—just like the ornament on the tip of Roccia's hair.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_1": "At dusk, you arrive at the store. Roccia steps out from behind the counter to greet you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_10": "This is the \"stage\" I made.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_11": "You look around. Beyond the spotlight, there are balloons and streamers, and a painted backdrop covering almost the whole wall.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_12": "I want to put on a play for you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_13": "It's called \"Pegasus.\" That was the first play I ever performed onstage.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_14": "Then I'll enjoy the show.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_15": "A nearby speaker crackles to life, and the girl beside you settles into a dancer's pose.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_16": "—Beyond high walls we fly, through mist where dangers lie. With courage as our guide, we'll find hope on the other side.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_17": "As the deep, lingering song swells, Roccia becomes an explorer, crossing the mists of a labyrinth, searching for freedom and hope.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_18": "Then, after a whirl of steps, she reaches out to you and beckons you into the performance.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_19": "Gladly, you take her hand. For a moment you are a knight, laurel on your brow, a sword in your grip.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_2": "{PlayerName}, perfect timing. Do you have a little time to spare?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_20": "Together you face the monster's looming shadow, and with blade and bullet you break the haze that has haunted this land.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_21": "—A thousand stars light up the air.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_22": "—Freedom blooms like flowers wide.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_23": "—As hope, the North Star, is our guide.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_24": "As the play nears its end, the party poppers around you burst with a bang, all at once.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_25": "Amid the falling streamers, you exchange a glance, then bow together to the empty seats.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_26": "The storeroom is hardly a stage, and neither of you wears a lavish costume. Yet together, you've put on a truly wonderful show.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_27": "Roccia lowers her head and says nothing for a moment, then looks up at you. A flush of color glows across her cheeks.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_28": "Thank you for playing along with me, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_29": "You smile and nod, then survey the mess the performance has left in the storeroom.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_3": "There's something I want to show you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_30": "Let me help you clear the props and streamers off the floor after this.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_31": "Something else seems to be on Roccia's mind. She hesitates, then lifts a hand toward you.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_32": "Um... if I ever return to the stage, would you come and be in my play?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_33": "I'd love to.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_34": "I'll pass.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_35": "Roccia holds your gaze for a long moment, and then she smiles.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_36": "When that day comes, we'll bring laughter to even more people.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_37": "Roccia lowers her head, but soon looks up at you again.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_38": "It's okay... Whenever you're ready, you can always come find me.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_39": "Together, you and Roccia tidy up the storeroom. As you work, she shares stories from her days as a child star and imagines all sorts of possible futures.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_4": "At your nod, Roccia locks the glass door and hangs a \"Closed Today\" sign on it.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_40": "Perhaps one day she'll return to that wondrous stage she speaks of and bring laughter to people everywhere.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_41": "Or perhaps she'll stay right here behind this little counter, friends close by, living one peaceful day after another.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_42": "But no matter what the future holds, as the chest lid clicks shut, that little box will always hold a quiet sea of freedom that is hers alone.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_5": "...?",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_6": "Before you can get a question out, Roccia tugs at your sleeve and leads you through the back door, into the storeroom.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_7": "The storeroom is unlit, and it looks pitch black. With no idea what she has in mind, you step into the dark beside the girl.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_8": "A few steps in, you hear a click, and a bright light suddenly washes over you and Roccia.",
+  "AVG_HAOGANDU_82_9": "Only then do you realize there's a makeshift spotlight hanging overhead.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_1001_1": "You take a walk with Chisa through the town park and sit on the swings together, chatting about all kinds of things. Together, you enjoy a quiet, warm stretch of time.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_1001_2": "Mom and Dad used to bring me here when I was little. Every time I sit on these swings, it's like I'm back in those days, when nothing weighed on me at all.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_1001_3": "But sitting here with you, {PlayerName}, it feels different.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_1001_4": "I've learned so many things I never knew, had so many thoughts I'd never have reached on my own. It's as though a whole new view were opening up in front of me.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_1001_5": "I don't know what to call this feeling yet, but right now... I genuinely feel happy.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_101_1": "You and Cartethyia try a role-playing adventure game together, and after plenty of fumbling, you just barely clear it.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_101_2": "Agh! That sly demon dragon pulled out Aero Resistance, of all the dirty tricks... My ultimate didn't even scratch it!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_101_3": "We only made it through thanks to your Separation skill, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_101_4": "But it was so much fun! Being a knight is even more thrilling than I imagined!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_101_5": "{PlayerName}, promise you'll keep playing games with me... Ahem, I mean, supervise my knight training!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_10_1": "You go with Chisa to her family's restaurant and help develop a new dish.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_10_2": "Roast it instead of pan-frying, and ease off the lemon a little... Mm, I'll pass that along to Mom and Dad.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_10_3": "Thank you. Having you here made their whole day.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_10_4": "Once the new version is ready, I'll invite you in for a tasting. Please do come by again then.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_1_1": "You take Cartethyia to the town museum, and she stops in front of almost every exhibit.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_1_2": "{PlayerName}, did you see those swords?! The placard says they all belonged to a knight from centuries ago!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_1_3": "The Sword of Discord, the Sword of Divinity, the Sword of Virtue... the stories behind them are fascinating.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_1_4": "I'm sure it's because that knight's noble spirit still guides people to this day. That has to be why they still shine like that!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_1_5": "I'll keep working hard so that one day I can be someone like that too!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_201_1": "You visit a board game shop with Changli, trying all sorts of games together. You're both completely caught up in the fun.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_201_2": "Hehe, now that was delightful.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_201_3": "Some of these games test your logic and strategic thinking. Others are a contest of odds and reading people.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_201_4": "I came expecting mere pastime. Instead I got real matches, and a glimpse of a side of you I rarely see. A rather pleasant surprise.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_201_5": "I'm curious what strategy you'll bring next time.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_2_1": "You watch a newly released horror film with Changli, though she seems more curious about your reactions than the film itself.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_2_2": "All fear comes down to two things in the end: powerlessness and the unknown.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_2_3": "Keep a clear head, act without hesitation, and it loses its grip on you.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_2_4": "Though lecturing like this in front of a work crafted with such devotion is hardly good manners, is it?",
+  "AVG_Invetation_2_5": "Let's talk about something more interesting, then. If you were in the lead's position, what would you have done?",
+  "AVG_Invetation_301_1": "You go to an amusement park with Roccia, and for once she lets her playful, childlike side out.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_301_2": "The merry-go-round, the Ferris wheel, the pirate ship, the roller coaster—",
+  "AVG_Invetation_301_3": "And the super Namipon balloon you bought me—",
+  "AVG_Invetation_301_4": "I'm going to stuff all of today into my memory, the way Brant stuffs Troupe Strength into his crates. Then I can open it up whenever I want and be happy all over again.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_301_5": "Come talk to me more often from now on, okay?",
+  "AVG_Invetation_3_1": "You watch a foreign opera with Roccia, and she is completely spellbound.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_3_2": "{PlayerName}, did you know?",
+  "AVG_Invetation_3_3": "The most famous piece in this opera is the \"Queen of the Night Aria.\" It's all about hatred, rage, and madness.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_3_4": "But my favorite is the happy one, the \"Pa-pa-pa Duet.\" Everyone smiles when they hear it.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_3_5": "If you like it too, I'll teach you to sing it sometime.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_402_1": "You visit the zoo with Miss Galbrena, and for some reason, the fierce beasts all cower under her pressure...",
+  "AVG_Invetation_402_2": "The trick to taming a beast? Let it figure out on instinct that you're not worth the trouble. That's it.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_402_3": "Anything alive backs down from something stronger. No exceptions. Remember that if you're ever lost in the grasslands or a rainforest.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_402_4": "After that, keep it hungry and feed it on a fixed ration until it obeys your commands... assuming, of course, you want to keep it as a pet.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_402_5": "Don't bother memorizing it. Just call me if it comes up.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_4_1": "You invite Miss Galbrena out to a dessert shop, and it turns out she's a die-hard ice cream fan.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_4_2": "The blueberry parfait here isn't bad.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_4_3": "Hm? Expecting a grand life lesson? Don't waste the time. Eat your ice cream.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_4_4": "Life's short, and it melts faster. Eat.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_501_1": "You visit the orphanage with Miss Verina and spend a joyful while with the children there.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_501_2": "Hehe, look what the children gave me.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_501_3": "Every child here has been through something awful, and look at them, still living so bravely... Oh no, now I'm tearing up.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_501_4": "Maybe when I retire, I'll come back here and help look after them myself.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_501_5": "Ah, no, no—I shouldn't talk like some old lady... {PlayerName}, no laughing at your teacher!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_5_1": "You visit the botanical garden with Miss Verina, who knows every plant there inside and out.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_5_2": "Honeysuckle, lemongrass, noctemint... hehe, look how well they're all doing!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_5_3": "For plants to grow up strong, they need sunlight, dew, and a gardener who pays attention. And it's no different for any of you!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_5_4": "I'd like to be that gardener. Someone who brings a little beauty into the best years of your lives!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_5_5": "And {PlayerName}, always remember that whenever you need someone to lean on, your teacher's right here!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_601_1": "You head out with Buling to the site of a local urban legend and shoot a debunking video.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_601_2": "Bwahahahaha! Turns out the legendary \"Water Hooscamp\" was really just a Namipon balloon that fell in the water!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_601_3": "Post this video on the forum and the numbers gonna blow up!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_601_4": "Thanks for playing along with the shoot, Boss. You and me together, running that forum is already a done deal!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_6_1": "You try livestreaming a chat session with Buling, and the whole thing feels wonderfully new.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_6_2": "Haha, and that's streaming for you. Hook them with the right topic and the viewers come running!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_6_3": "You carried today, Boss! Completely different vibe from my usual stream, and the gifts went through the roof. You've got real viral potential!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_6_4": "Come by more often when you're free, Boss. Good for you, good for me!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_701_1": "You go into the countryside with Ciaccona to gather inspiration, and come back with plenty of it.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_701_2": "The spray of a leaping fish, the scent the wind carries across the fields, the line a shooting star draws on the sky... Every one of them can become poetry and music.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_701_3": "Hehe, I came up with so many new melodies just because you were here!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_701_4": "Just you wait! The moment the new piece is finished, you'll be the first to hear it!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_7_1": "You and Ciaccona give an open-air performance in the park, and passersby stop in crowds to listen.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_7_2": "Yay, the show was a huge success!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_7_3": "Today's improvisation was themed on the bustle of everyone making the class bulletin board, and the sound of chalk striking slate!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_7_4": "No matter how small the moment, feel it with your whole heart and it can become music that moves people!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_801_1": "You try the latest co-op game with Xiangli Yao, and with seamless teamwork, you clear it with a high score.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_801_2": "Think I'd be bad at games? Haha, that's a misconception about researchers.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_801_3": "However flashy the packaging, a game is still arithmetic stacked on arithmetic. And I happen to be good at that.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_801_4": "But what truly captured my heart was the emotional interplay and resonance we shared as we played.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_801_5": "You always bring me something the formulas can't. Whatever you want to try next, count me in, won't you?",
+  "AVG_Invetation_8_1": "You ask Xiangli Yao to help with your homework, and your efficiency improves by leaps and bounds.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_8_2": "Anything you still don't understand?",
+  "AVG_Invetation_8_3": "Hehe, these are simple enough for me, but what I actually find interesting is watching how you get there.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_8_4": "Bouncing ideas off you gave me a few interesting new angles of my own. I hope we can put them to the test together someday.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_901_1": "You go with Phoebe to the Capybara Cafe. Though she tries very hard to hold back, she's clearly smitten with these wonderful creatures.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_901_2": "They're so round. So soft. So warm when you hold one... Aww, they're simply irresistible.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_901_3": "Father once said I mustn't grow too close to small animals... but I believe they're all friends worthy of love.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_901_4": "{PlayerName}, next time we get the chance, let's go see them together again.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_901_5": "...Oh, and p-please, you must keep this a secret from Father!",
+  "AVG_Invetation_9_1": "You go fishing by the sea with Phoebe, who always seems to sense where the fish are.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_9_2": "The sea breeze is so pleasant, isn't it, {PlayerName}?",
+  "AVG_Invetation_9_3": "We have the divinity's mercy to thank for a catch like this.",
+  "AVG_Invetation_9_4": "Ah, that just slipped out! Old church-school habit... P-please, pretend you heard nothing.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_100_1": "Stacked neatly on the desk are braided cords in all kinds of colors. Beside them sits a small pile of carefully smoothed feathers and glittering ornaments.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_100_10": "Fancy some fresh air? The weather's not bad today, perfect for taking in some breeze by the sea.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_100_11": "Sure.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_100_2": "First, strap the cord onto the rattan hoop.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_100_3": "She gives you a demonstration, wrapping the cord around the rattan hoop, her fingers flying as she ties a firm knot.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_100_4": "Next, keep winding like this, one loop at a time.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_100_5": "The thin cord passes between her fingers: around the hoop, pulled tight, then threaded back from the other side. With each pass and each tug, the messy cords gradually form a neat, circular web pattern.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_100_6": "...Uh... So it loops around like this?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_100_7": "You're a bit off. Try adjusting it toward the center. No rush. Take your time.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_100_8": "After a good half day of work, and with Galbrena's guidance, you've gradually gotten the hang of weaving Dreamcatchers. Nearly half of the materials prepared have been used.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_100_9": "Nicely done. You're a quick learner. Let's call it a day.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_1": "Expired files, aged papers, faded record sheets, fuzzy handwriting that is nearly illegible...",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_10": "Students in old uniforms stand in neat rows in front of a teaching building. The school looked different back then, comprised mostly of low, old-style buildings.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_11": "And right in the center of the photo is a strikingly familiar face...",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_12": "Huh? Isn't that you in the photo, {PlayerName}?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_13": "Phoebe, who happened to be passing by, leans out from beside you with a curious look.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_14": "Wait, it seems off... This person looks like {PlayerName}, but as the opposite gender. Oh, I know! This must be the \"legendary student from a century ago\"!",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_15": "Now that you mention it, they really do look alike.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_16": "In a flash, Buling plucks the graduation photo from your hand, sidles up beside you, and holds it next to your face for a closer comparison.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_17": "She looks at the photo and tilts her head toward you. Then she stretches her arm out straight before pulling the photo back toward her face, until her nose nearly touches it.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_18": "...No, no, no, they're practically identical! Say, Boss, are the two of you like some kind of distant relatives or something?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_19": "I don't think so. My parents never mentioned anything like that...",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_2": "In preparation for the promotional materials for the anniversary, the Student Council digs out years' worth of school archives from the cabinets and begins sorting them based on the year and event category.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_20": "Besides, we just look similar. It has nothing to do with me. Probably just a coincidence.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_21": "Speaking of this legendary student, though, rumor has it that {Male=she's;Female=he's} the culprit behind a lot of our school's wacky regulations.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_22": "For example, \"No using motorbikes to play badminton,\" \"No climbing the outer walls of Teaching Building to find your classroom under the excuse of being lost,\" \"No turning the Athletic Field swings into a wrecking ball\"...",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_23": "\"Only use elevators or the stairs when going downstairs,\" \"No 'Crack & Bolt' fish jar in the Principal's Office.\" Oh, and this one: \"No squeezing the hat during the Departmental Placement Assessment. The hat doesn't talk.\"",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_24": "Um, what kind of regulations are these...?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_25": "So is being called a \"legend\" a good thing or a bad thing...?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_26": "I have newfound respect for this friend I've never met.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_27": "I guess both. After all, {Male=she;Female=he} did carry the school to its peak a hundred years ago.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_28": "I know, right? Regulations aside, there's no denying that {Male=she;Female=he} did carry the school to its peak a hundred years ago. Worthy of being the legend of legends of legends!",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_29": "But looking at all this, being the principal at the time must have been really rough.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_3": "You open the innermost cabinet, and an old file folder slips out of a gap and slides down the cabinet leg onto the floor.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_30": "And why is our school always stuck in some random crisis all the time... Apparently it was the same a hundred years ago, when they made a bet with Fractsidus High next door, and whoever lost had to move out of town.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_31": "Really?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_32": "Buling spreads her hands helplessly, her shoulders lifting in a shrug.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_33": "I only read about it on the forums. Stuff people toss around on the internet.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_34": "They say no one's ever seen the actual face of Fractsidus High's principal, even to this day. As for what really went down, I guess that's something only that \"legendary student from a century ago\" would know.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_35": "Now it's piqued my curiosity as well. I'd love to hear the whole story if I ever get the chance.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_36": "(The story of a \"legendary student\" who looks just like me, and a \"crisis\" a hundred years apart...)",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_37": "(Whatever happened in the past, the present and the future are in our own hands.)",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_38": "(Rather than trying to retrace someone else's footsteps, I'd rather forge a new path of my own, one steady step at a time.)",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_39": "You glance at the open folder in your hand, then at the student records scattered across the desk, and in the end, carefully slip the graduation photo back into the folder.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_4": "The folder is well-worn due to age, its corners frayed. Much of the writing on the cover has faded. You squint at it for a while, and only barely make out the year.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_40": "On the windowsill, a white cat enjoying the sunshine lazily stretches out its legs and uncurls its body. It lifts its head and watches you all for a while through half-closed eyes.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_41": "The white cat rises lightly to its feet, takes a few steps along the edge of the sill, and leaps. In the blink of an eye, it vanishes beyond the window, as if it was never here.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_5": "(Is this... a record from a century ago?)",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_6": "The flap has long since come loose. Getting at its contents is easy, and you take out the papers one by one.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_7": "(Wait...)",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_8": "Your hands pause. A photo tucked among the documents has caught your attention.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_10_9": "It's a graduation photo. The edges have turned yellow, the corners curled, and the surface is etched with tiny scratches left by the years.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_1": "After a quick clean-up of the feathers and cords, you head to the shore with Galbrena. The sea breeze is damp, and white surf washes over the sand, spreading a thin sheen of water at your feet.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_10": "Why? I don't look the part?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_11": "You nod a little hesitantly. Galbrena stops walking, turns to glance at you, and a faint smile touches the corners of her lips.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_12": "If anything, having spent all that time in the Discord Slayer Task Force, I realized just how rare and precious a night of peaceful sleep can be.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_13": "In the past... I hunted down countless forms of darkness and evil. Even the wind that brushed past me always carried a scent of blood.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_14": "Cold gun chambers, scattered brass, silenced cannon barrels, endless smoke, and blood spilled across the floor...",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_15": "She shakes her head to herself, bends down to pick up a seashell at her feet, and slowly starts walking again.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_16": "Every night, in countless overlapping dreams, I would find myself locked in an endless battle with my enemies. Getting a good night's sleep was a luxury.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_17": "To solve this, I learned to weave this \"dreamcatcher\" thing out of feathers, hoping it would help me hold on to a moment of peace.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_18": "Did it work?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_19": "Well... Not as well as I'd hoped.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_2": "The town's shoreline isn't exactly bustling. The path running along the coast is narrow, with the occasional bench along the side for people to rest.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_20": "But when I tried giving the spare dreamcatchers to kids who were also having trouble with nightmares, they worked just as they were meant to: the kids were no longer haunted by the nightmares.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_21": "I don't know why it worked, but it gave me some comfort all the same. More often than not, it's only after a sound night's sleep and an easy dream that you wake up with the strength to keep going.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_22": "Dreamcatchers work not because of the threads they were woven from. Maybe it's the care you put into them, Miss Galbrena.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_23": "Hm? Did you forget what I taught you in class? Science is facts, always. And when you run into something science can't explain, guns out first, ask questions later.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_24": "Even if a dreamcatcher can't get rid of someone's nightmares for good, at least when they see it at night, they'll remember...",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_25": "That you wished them a good night's sleep, Miss Galbrena. That you hoped they could make it through each night in peace, and wake up ready to face the dawn.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_26": "That's exactly what gives it the special meaning and the magical powers.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_27": "Sigh...",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_28": "Galbrena stares at you for a moment, then lets out a long, rather exasperated sigh. She lifts her index finger and gives your head a light tap.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_29": "You know, if you could write something this touching in your exam essays, I'd be smiling in my sleep.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_3": "Near the shore stands a small pier that has seen many years of use. Its planks are weathered by the sea wind and tides, and a few small boats are quietly moored beside it.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_30": "...I'll do my best, Miss Galbrena.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_31": "Still. Thank you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_32": "The sea breeze across your face carries a faint tang of salt. Now and then a fishing boat passes by, sounding its long whistles.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_33": "You and Galbrena stay silent. You simply walk side by side, following down the shoreline.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_4": "The soft, fine sand sinks slightly beneath your steps as you walk one behind the other. Each time you lift a foot, a scattering of grains rises from your soles and patters back down in the sea breeze.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_5": "I remember you asked me why I came to teach here a while ago.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_6": "Well, to me, fighting crime and teaching students are the same thing.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_7": "No fear, no crime, no danger that could strike at any moment... Only in a safe world can kids sit in a classroom and study in peace, growing up without a care.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_8": "In the end, I was doing the same thing all along: protecting a stretch of time in which you can all grow up safely, and watching you take one step after another toward your futures.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_110_9": "So is that why you wanted to make dreamcatchers for us, Miss Galbrena? That's... kind of unexpected.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_120_1": "There, now we're pretty much good to go.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_120_2": "Thank you for helping out these past few days, {PlayerName}. Doing all of this by myself would've taken forever.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_120_3": "Galbrena raises her hand and hangs one of the dreamcatchers you wove in front of the office window.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_120_4": "I'll bring these to our next class and give them out to the third-years.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_120_5": "Life gets hard with exams and daily stress, and I know how tough it is to actually unwind. Still... I really hope every single one of you gets to have sweet dreams.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_1_1": "(Changli mentioned that the Student Council is still short-handed with preparations for the school's 100th anniversary... I should go check in.)",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_1_2": "Changli is sorting through the anniversary budget papers when you walk into the Student Council office.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_1_3": "Perfect timing, {PlayerName}. There's something I'd like to ask of you.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_1_4": "The first day of open house will attract a considerable number of alumni, parents, and members of the public alike. So I'd like your help preparing some material that displays our spirit.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_1_5": "School history archives, our educational philosophy, outstanding student work, life on campus... They may seem small, but they're precisely what will show our guests what our school's hundred years of heritage is all about.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_1_6": "I'm currently occupied with other matters. Sorting the budget is one of them... So I'm afraid I'll have to trouble you with putting together the introductory materials for the anniversary.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_1_7": "Easy peasy. I'll take care of it.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_20_1": "Thank you for all your hard work, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_20_2": "As you can see, a school is not just characterized by the honors written in its history...",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_20_3": "With this serving as an opportunity for first-time visitors to learn of our school, I suppose everyone's efforts have not been in vain.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_30_1": "(Right, there's going to be an Arts Gala on the day of the anniversary... the Club Association could use a hand too. I'd better go take a look, just to be safe.)",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_30_2": "Cartethyia's eyes light up the moment she sees you appear in the Club Association's activity room.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_30_3": "Ah, {PlayerName}, you're here. Perfect timing. Do you think you could give me a hand with the anniversary Arts Gala?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_30_4": "Every club should have their performance ready by now, but we still need to collect all the sign-up forms, build the schedule, lock in the final lineup, and review each act...",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_30_5": "I'm busy with rehearsal for the Orchestral Music Club, so if you're not too busy, I'd really appreciate the help.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_30_6": "Okay, got it.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_1": "In preparation for the Arts Gala on the anniversary day, the Club Association has opened up sign-ups to all students.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_10": "Celestial Steed Corp?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_11": "Celestial Steed Corp is a large conglomerate. Real estate development is its core business, but that's far from all it does.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_12": "That's right. It also has divisions in financial services, commercial operations, asset management, and more. It's a truly massive corporation.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_13": "Here's what they have to say about this year's anniversary performances:",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_14": "As partners in industry-academia collaboration, and to strengthen the Second Solaris School's image for its 100th anniversary, ensure event safety, and elevate the overall standards of the event, Celestial Steed Corp proposes a joint review of all current performances.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_15": "Huh? What are they even babbling about? Aren't sign-ups, selection, and reviews for the anniversary performances our own responsibility?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_16": "That's exactly what I told them, but...",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_17": "This year's anniversary is held under special circumstances, with the open house involving densely crowded areas. Per Celestial Steed Corp's safety management requirements, all performances must be submitted for review in advance.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_18": "If the school fails to ensure that the anniversary meets Celestial Steed Corp's requirements, a reassessment of our sponsorship of the event will be conducted.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_19": "Of course, the school is free not to make any adjustments.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_2": "As the sign-up forms come in, you and the others start coordinating each club's rehearsal schedule and performance category to finalize the lineup.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_20": "However, Celestial Steed Corp is the sole provider of all stage equipment and security for this anniversary. Should the school insist on proceeding with its original performance plans, we will have no choice but to withdraw support.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_21": "Sounds like they're threatening us. The school anniversary isn't a stage for their product launch event!",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_22": "This is... really upsetting.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_23": "(Celestial Steed Corp is being awfully hard on us. This looks less like quality control and more like an attempt to muscle in on the school's right to make its own decisions.)",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_24": "(Miss Verina mentioned that a news station would be covering the whole anniversary. Looks like Celestial Steed Corp is set on using this as an opportunity to promote its corporate image.)",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_25": "(Then again, were things really this tense between Celestial Steed Corp and the school? Or is there something else going on behind the scenes...?)",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_26": "If it's a safety review, there should be a specific set of criteria, right?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_27": "I asked them about that too. But they brushed it off, claiming it's the Corp's classified internal regulation, and refused to disclose it to us.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_28": "Well, if that's how they wanna play it, our Arts Gala performances also count as classified school information, and can't be disclosed to outsiders.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_29": "What do you think, {PlayerName}? They want an answer by the end of today.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_3": "The Drama Club's improv skit. The Dance Club and the Cheerleading Team. The Poets Society, plus the solo performances...",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_30": "Plans concerning the anniversary are the school's call to make.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_31": "Let's submit a version of the plan for review first, just to be safe.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_32": "Existing partnership or not, the contents of the anniversary events should be arranged by the school alone.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_33": "If Celestial Steed Corp's \"support\" comes with strings attached, there's no reason we have to accept it.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_34": "Well, if it's just for safety concerns, we can submit a version of the plan first and work with Celestial Steed Corp regarding inspections of the venues, stage equipment, and fire safety.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_35": "But as for reviewing the content of the performances, that should be arranged by the school alone. If Celestial Steed Corp's \"support\" comes with imposed conditions, then there's no reason for us to give in.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_36": "So... what you're saying, {PlayerName}, is that we stop relying on Celestial Steed Corp's support?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_37": "Chisa, if we reach out to new sponsors now for stage equipment and security, would the Liaison Center have time to make it happen?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_38": "Chisa lowers her head and thinks it over for a moment.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_39": "Hm, I'll do my best. Equipment alone should be fine. But it probably won't be ready in time for rehearsals, and the scale might be a bit smaller than what the Corp originally promised.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_4": "Hmm... The Drama Club's show needs a full stage set. Maybe we shouldn't put them between two performances that both need scene changes?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_40": "Maybe Eekky Logistics could... Anyway, I'll figure something out.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_41": "As for Celestial Steed Corp, tell them we'll be revising our preparation plan for the Arts Gala, and the school will arrange its own stage equipment and on-site security.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_42": "And in the meantime, we'll stick to our original plan with review and scheduling of the Arts Gala performances.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_43": "Ciaccona turns her head to glance at you with a grin, then reaches out and gives you and Chisa each a pat on the shoulder.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_44": "Then I'll leave it all to our school's most reliable duo!",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_5": "Oh, right. The Dance Club and the Cheerleading Team say they both want to rehearse in Central Square, but they have a scheduling conflict with each other.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_6": "I'll take care of it.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_7": "You're in the middle of sorting the performance materials piled on the desk when you hear knocking on the door. Chisa opens the door, peeks into the room, then hurries inside.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_8": "Sorry to interrupt, everyone. This just came in at the Liaison Center.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_40_9": "Celestial Steed Corp has asked to conduct a \"risk assessment and joint review\" of the performances for the anniversary Arts Gala.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_50_1": "{PlayerName}, I've received a reply from Celestial Steed Corp.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_50_2": "Since the school prefers the students to handle the preparation of the performances themselves, Celestial Steed Corp respects the school's choice.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_50_3": "However, considering that Celestial Steed Corp is a long-term partner of this anniversary, we wish to retain our corporate branding and promotional booth during the event.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_50_4": "I see... Can't say I'm too surprised.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_50_5": "Yes. Our stage equipment problem has also been taken care of. Eekky Logistics has agreed to provide us with sound and lighting equipment.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_50_6": "By the way, is our school's relationship with Celestial Steed Corp really just an industry-academia collaboration?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_50_7": "I'm not really sure... But they definitely have people on the School Board. Changli might know the details.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_50_8": "Either way, I think that's a wrap for sign-ups and reviews for the anniversary Arts Gala.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_50_9": "Well done, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_60_1": "Hello, {PlayerName}. Hope you're not too busy lately. I have a new botany project, and I'd like to invite you to take part.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_60_2": "I started breeding some new seeds a while ago.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_60_3": "The same plant can sometimes grow into completely different forms under different environments and growing methods. The shape of the leaves, the color of the flowers, even the size of the fruit... all kinds of interesting changes can happen.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_60_4": "If you have time, do you mind helping me look after them? Once we've collected enough samples, we can add them to the school's Ecology Guide.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_60_5": "Hmm... Let's just call it a small plant observation session.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_60_6": "No problem. I'll help.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_1": "After a period of careful tending, at long last, a few vegetables among the seeds you planted with Verina are the first to be ready for harvest.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_10": "She picks up a knife and briskly cuts the thicker stalks into short pieces, then cuts the tender leaves into bite-sized portions. The root vegetables are peeled and sliced thin and even.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_11": "Next, she picks up a cluster of fresh mushrooms. First, she trims off the culture medium stuck to the base, then gently wipes the fine bits of dirt off the surface with a piece of paper towel and cleans up the stems.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_12": "You see, this mushroom is shaped just like an open umbrella, which is why it's called \"Umbragricus.\" And this one with the thicker stem is \"Edodes.\" It's tender, juicy, and rich.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_13": "This black mushroom with the white frilled edge is called \"Coriolus.\" It's a rare fungus that often grows alongside ancient trees and has high medicinal value.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_14": "And this one with the cyan netting under its cap is \"White Jade Beauty.\" It's delicious, but mildly poisonous. If consumed raw, it'll make you nauseous and dizzy, and cause hallucinations.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_15": "As she speaks, Verina smiles sweetly and takes the bowl and utensils that are placed in front of you.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_16": "So until the dish is ready, I'm afraid I'll have to confiscate your bowl and silverware.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_17": "Mushrooms don't have to be diced too much. You can just tear them by hand into pieces of equal size. They'll have a better texture when cooked that way.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_18": "Next, Verina takes out a pot, pours in a clear broth, and adds in the prepared root vegetables first.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_19": "Tiny bubbles soon rise from the broth as it gradually comes to a boil. Verina gently stirs the broth with a ladle so the vegetables heat evenly.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_2": "Verina carefully picks the ripe produce and records each one in her logbook.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_20": "Then the rest of the vegetables go into the pot one after another. The tender leaves unfurl as soon as they touch the hot broth, and the aroma of mushrooms spreads across the surface.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_21": "Verina scoops up half a ladle, gently blows across it, and takes a small sip to taste.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_22": "Hmm... Almost there. It could use a bit more savoriness...",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_23": "After adding a pinch of salt, some seasoning, and a handful of chopped Lemongrass, Verina turns the heat down low and puts the lid over the pot.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_24": "There. We'll let it simmer a little longer, let the flavor of the vegetables soak into the broth, then it'll be ready to eat.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_25": "Do you cook for yourself often, Miss Verina? You're really good at this.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_26": "In fact, I do. Through a plant's growth, you are able to see the entire cycle of life. And while cooking, you get to look forward to the joy of harvest.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_27": "Both take time, but are equally worth the wait.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_28": "Before long, a steaming Morri Pot is brought to the table. Verina ladles you the first bowl, scooping in a few pieces of soft, tender vegetables and topping it off with extra clear broth.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_29": "Careful, it's still hot.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_3": "Hmm... They've grown even better than I expected.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_30": "Here, have a taste. The very harvest you nurtured with your own hands.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_31": "You pick up a piece of richly simmered Edodes and, a little impatiently, pop it into your mouth.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_32": "A fresh and savory taste overwhelms your taste buds. The natural sweetness of the vegetables and the rich aroma of the mushrooms blend perfectly into the broth. Nothing is over-seasoned; even after you swallow, a faint sweetness lingers.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_33": "At the lightest touch of your chopsticks, the soft, juicy vegetables split apart along the grain.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_34": "Well? It's pretty good, isn't it? I'd say it's my signature dish.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_35": "It's delicious. I never thought vegetables could make a broth this sweet and savory on their own.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_36": "In other words—\"The cap is thick, the flavor is rich, a perfect ingredient for soups.\" Good, we can add that as an extra entry to the school's Ecology Guide.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_37": "But the ecology records can wait. For now, let's focus on enjoying our meal.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_38": "{PlayerName}, as you remember this flavor, I hope you'll also hold on to the joy of this harvest.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_39": "The road ahead is long. Keep your feet on the ground and move forward. Just like... tending a plant, and waiting for it to ripen.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_4": "She examines the vegetables in her hands intently, then turns to you with a gentle smile.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_40": "With that, you enjoyed a warm meal of Morri Pot with Miss Verina.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_5": "Perfect. We can turn these vegetables into a dish, and you can see what \"harvest\" tastes like. Think of it as my thanks for all your attentive care of the plants these past days, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_6": "Chisa, do you mind if I borrow your kitchen?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_7": "Of course not! If you need any help, just call me anytime.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_8": "It's all right, Chisa. Go and get some rest. I happen to be quite a good cook, you know.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_70_9": "Verina ties on an apron, carefully washes the dirt off the vegetable roots, then separates the leaves one by one, rinses them clean, and lays them neatly on the cutting board.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_80_1": "After entering the last entry into the Ecology Guide and double-checking everything is in order, you can't help but stretch and loosen up a bit.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_80_2": "Thank you for your hard work, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_80_3": "From planting the seeds, to nurturing them, observing them, and recording how they grew, all the way to today's harvest... We'd added this many new entries before we even knew it.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_80_4": "I couldn't have finished this so quickly on my own. Thank you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_80_5": "If you come across any interesting plants in the future, be sure to record them right away, okay?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_80_6": "After all, it's through things like these, little by little, that our lives become ever richer and more colorful.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_90_1": "Sorry to bother you, {PlayerName}. There's a personal request I'd like your help with.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_90_2": "I've been watching the third-years lately, and between the upcoming competitions and exams this year, I know you're all pushed to your limits.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_90_3": "Young people with a lot on their minds often struggle to get a sound night's sleep.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_90_4": "As your teacher, keeping an eye on your well-being is my job. So, I'm planning to make some dreamcatchers for the class. They say hanging one by your bed helps you sleep a little sounder.",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_90_5": "Problem is, there are quite a few of you, and my crafting skills alone might not cut it. If you've got some free time, care to lend me a hand?",
+  "AVG_Specialapproval_90_6": "Sure, count me in.",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_14_1": "Next up, logic.",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_14_2": "<u>Facts can be tested against evidence, while opinions express a person's judgments, feelings, or stance.</u>",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_14_3": "So sorting fact from opinion comes first in any logical analysis.",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_15_1": "Now for history.",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_15_2": "Primary sources are <u>original material left at the time of an event or by those involved</u>. Secondary sources are <u>material that later people compiled, retold, or analyzed</u>.",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_15_3": "When you use a source, look closely at where it comes from, its stance, and its purpose.",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_16_1": "For this lesson, we'll be learning plane geometry!",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_16_2": "<u>In a right triangle, the sum of the squares of the two legs equals the square of the hypotenuse.</u>",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_16_3": "And that's what we call the <u>Pythagorean theorem</u>. Be sure to remember it!",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_17_1": "In this lesson, we're learning physics!",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_17_2": "In a single uniform medium, light travels in a straight line. When light is reflected, <u>the angle of reflection equals the angle of incidence</u>.",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_17_3": "You'll need this to solve the diagram questions, so keep it in mind, okay?",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_18_1": "Everyone, let's find out what makes up an orchestra!",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_18_2": "Most orchestras are built from four main instrument families: <u>strings, woodwinds, brass, and percussion</u>.",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_18_3": "No one makes beautiful music alone. It takes all of us, in harmony!",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_19_1": "Everyone, let's get to know our instruments!",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_19_2": "Sound is produced by vibrating objects. <u>Pitch is mainly determined by the frequency of the vibration, and loudness mainly by its amplitude.</u>",
+  "AVG_TestQuestion_19_3": "Your instrument is your partner. Treat it kindly!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_100_1": "(So this is what the sea feels like... I should look around first.)",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_101_1": "(I've got plenty of material to work with... Now to see how different compositions and lighting change the scene.)",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_102_1": "(After looking around, this spot has the best composition and lighting. Time to start painting.)",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_103_1": "(The color palette, perspective, and overall mood are all in place. Now to refine the details, bit by bit.)",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_104_1": "(There we go! Finally finished... It's the exact seaside scene I envisioned.)",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_10_1": "You've got a good grasp of the basics. Why not try analyzing some more challenging texts next?",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_11_1": "Even that tricky question couldn't stump you? It seems you've truly grasped the essence of the text.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_12_1": "You're quite familiar with the course material by now. When you're free, come help me organize the handouts and try walking the class through a few questions.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_13_1": "Well explained. I'll leave the examples and practice questions for the next lesson to you.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_14_1": "You've explained the tricky parts well. As class rep, you'll lead everyone through reviewing the rest of the exam material.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_20_1": "You followed the procedures well, and your report looks great. I think you're ready to try something more challenging.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_21_1": "Now that you know the steps, why not design your own experiment next time? Don't worry, I'll help you check it over.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_22_1": "You've got the hang of lab work! How about helping me prep the materials and show everyone the ropes?",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_23_1": "A great demonstration. You explained everything really well, too. Why don't you take the lead on the next set of experiments?",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_24_1": "I'm proud of you! You even handled those unexpected situations so well. You're ready to take on a bigger role in class now.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_30_1": "The checklist checks out. The order is correct... Looks like you've got the whole ordering process down.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_31_1": "{PlayerName}, you even took different suppliers' prices into account. I think I can leave the larger orders entirely in your hands from now on.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_32_1": "You're familiar with the Liaison Center's business partners now. Next time, let's meet with them to discuss sponsorship for school events.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_33_1": "Impressive... I didn't expect you to convince such a demanding partner to sponsor us so quickly.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_34_1": "It's a comprehensive proposal. Next time, why don't you handle the negotiations with the business partners? I'll be there to back you up.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_40_1": "The sorting and filing are spot-on. Everything's much easier to find now. I think you can try handling more complicated applications next.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_41_1": "You even caught a minor issue like that in the budget. You have a keen intuition for numbers.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_42_1": "You've gotten quite familiar with Student Council affairs. How about a change of pace? You could try your hand at publicity work next.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_43_1": "Your write-up was quite delightful! Several students have already come to inquire about the event after reading it.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_44_1": "From the preparations to answering questions on-site, you handled everything beautifully. May I ask you to take charge of our next major promotional event as well?",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_50_1": "Everyone's keeping up with your lead now! Let's see how well we can bring all the sections together!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_51_1": "You caught even the tiniest slip and got everyone back on track in no time... You've got a real gift for conducting!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_52_1": "Hmm, our rehearsal space keeps getting taken lately... Pleeease, could you help me coordinate the rehearsal space and schedule?",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_53_1": "The venue and schedule are confirmed ahead of time! No more worrying about things going wrong. Thanks to you, everything's going so much smoother!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_54_1": "You even handled that last-minute stage trouble like a pro! Can I count on you to organize our next rehearsal? I'll back you up all the way!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_60_1": "Keep it up! Your breathing gets steadier with every run!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_61_1": "Wow, look how far you've come! Next time, you're taking the lead! Now, let's charge for the finish line like true knights!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_62_1": "You've got the basics down! Ready to kick things up a notch and take on some tougher training together?",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_63_1": "Much steadier this time! And you kept your rhythm right to the end! Let's take a quick breather, then give the next set a go!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_64_1": "Whew... Whew... We made it through the whole routine, and you kept going strong right to the end! Next time, let's push ourselves even further!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_70_1": "Whoa, Boss! Really going all out with the cleaning, huh? Hold on. I'll whip up a few posts to sing your praises!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_71_1": "Whoa! I'm not even exaggerating. The whole square looks good as new! Boss, just say the word, and I'll make sure the whole town hears about what you've done!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_80_1": "You learned the whole menu so quifckly, and can even recommend dishes to suit each customer's taste... I think I can leave all the orders to you now.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_81_1": "You even managed to keep everything running smoothly during the rush. A few tables went out of their way to leave you glowing reviews. That's nice to hear.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_82_1": "{PlayerName}, you've gotten the hang of things around the restaurant. How about trying your hand at the register next? Don't worry. I'll show you how.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_83_1": "You're quick at the register, and you haven't made a single mistake... Thanks to you, we didn't end up with a long line at the counter, even during the rush.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_84_1": "Mm... Mom and Dad think highly of you, too. It'd be nice if you could keep helping out here... Sorry, just forget I said that.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_90_1": "You've memorized where everything goes in the storeroom. That'll make restocking so much easier!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_91_1": "Look how neat the shelves are! And everything's sorted just right. That makes me very happy.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_92_1": "You know all our products now. Why not try helping customers next? If you're not sure what to say, just call me over.",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_93_1": "That customer really liked your recommendations. You're great at helping people find just what they need!",
+  "AVG_XINGWEITIP_94_1": "...Customers are even coming in just to ask for your recommendations now. My store can't do without you anymore.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_1": "You weave through the bustling shopping street, surrounded by all sorts of tempting goods. Modern life certainly has its perks.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_10": "Think it over.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_11": "A budget-friendly shop like this is perfect for a student! You lose yourself among the crowds and knickknacks, enjoying the simple pleasure of browsing.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_12": "Wait a minute. Is a little shop like this usually so crowded? And why are all these customers tall men in suits...?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_13": "Sure enough, a flash of brilliant golden hair catches your eye at the center of the crowd.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_14": "Mm...",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_15": "Hey, Phoebe.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_16": "You actually shop at a place like this?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_17": "O-oh! {PlayerName}! G-greetings...",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_18": "Huh? {PlayerName}... You caught me...",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_19": "Everything Father supplies me with comes from our family's companies. But sometimes, I'd just like to have some cute little things, like my classmates do.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_2": "How will you spend your time?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_20": "You peek into Phoebe's shopping basket: a Namipon pen, a rainbow eraser, a notebook covered in mysterious little creatures, a shell necklace... Looks like even a privileged young lady like her has the same tastes as any other girl.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_21": "Please, everyone. {PlayerName} is with me, so there's no need to worry. Would you allow us a little more time to browse?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_22": "At Phoebe's request, her guards finally give you some space, and the two of you enjoy a relatively peaceful shopping trip.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_23": "Still, Phoebe's sizable entourage attracts plenty of attention... Before long, rumors spread around school that Celestial Steed Corp has taken an interest in you.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_24": "Books are the ladder of human progress. You decide to drop by the bookstore and nourish your soul.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_25": "Hey, here to browse the books too?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_26": "Xiangli Yao gives the book in his hand a little wave. The title on the cover seems to read... Landau's Course of Theoretical Physics? You grimace.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_27": "Catching your expression, Xiangli Yao closes the book and smiles at you.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_28": "Haha, it might look a bit intimidating, but once you get into it, it's actually fascinating.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_29": "\"We gauge the universe from within a nutshell.\"",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_3": "Wander around aimlessly.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_30": "If it piques your interest, why not start with this one?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_31": "Xiangli Yao takes a popular science book from the shelf and hands it to you. As you flip through it, unfamiliar ideas seem to find their way into your mind in the most curious way.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_32": "You and Xiangli Yao then spend a rewarding stretch of time reading together at the bookstore.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_33": "Crystal chandeliers cast a soft glow, the marble floor gleams like a mirror, and a faint perfume lingers in the air... So this is what money smells like.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_34": "Just then, the sound of beautiful piano music draws your attention.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_35": "You follow the music to a corner of the mall packed with spectators, many of them elegantly dressed socialites. And there, at the center of it all, is Ciaccona, playing the public piano!",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_36": "Oh?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_37": "Noticing your approach, Ciaccona flashes you a playful smile without missing a note.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_38": "This next song is for a certain classmate who's always inspiring me!",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_39": "The tune beneath Ciaccona's fingers grows bright and playful, drawing even wider smiles from the crowd. When the last note fades, everyone bursts into applause.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_4": "Enjoy the thrill of shopping.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_40": "Buoyed by the music and the warmth of your friendship, you stay in high spirits for the rest of the day.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_41": "You've saved up a bit of money. Might as well buy something while you're at it.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_42": "As you browse, you think about what your friends might like and what you need yourself. In the end, you decide to buy...",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_43": "Tea.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_44": "A handheld game console.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_45": "A repair kit.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_46": "Nothing.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_47": "Decision made, you leave the shops feeling pleased with how the outing turned out.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_5": "That's right. Sometimes the best part of shopping is just wandering around.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_6": "With so many shops lining the street, you decide to pop into one that catches your eye. Which will it be...?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_7": "A variety store.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_8": "A bookstore.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_1_9": "A luxury mall.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_1": "After class, a girl you've never met suddenly stops you.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_10": "?!",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_11": "Could you please... give this present to Changli for me?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_12": "Before you can even protest, the girl presses an exquisitely wrapped box of tea into your hands.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_13": "...?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_14": "Hehe... I once sent a letter asking the Student Council for help, and Changli solved my problem right away. She was so gentle when she spoke to me... I haven't forgotten that day since.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_15": "So I just have to thank her properly!",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_16": "But Changli politely refused the gifts I tried to give her before... So I asked around on the forum, and everyone said you're the closest to her!",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_17": "I'm sure she'll accept it if it comes from you!",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_18": "Wait—",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_19": "Before you can get another word out, the girl leaves the gift in your hands and scurries off.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_2": "H-hi! Um, are you {PlayerName}?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_20": "You never even told me your name...",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_21": "I guess I'll just tell her it's a thank-you gift from someone she once helped...",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_22": "And so, the gift is eventually accepted by Changli as a thank-you to the Student Council. All's well that ends well.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_3": "That's me.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_4": "What is it?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_5": "Are you here to confess?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_6": "Oh, thank goodness! I finally found you!",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_7": "Oh, thank goodness! I finally found you!",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_8": "Yes!",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_2_9": "Ah! N-no, not to you, {PlayerName}! I meant I want to tell Changli how I feel!",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_1": "As you draw, the waves break in a steady rhythm, over and over, until you start to feel sleepy...",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_10": "After all, isn't this story called \"Unwritten Dreams\"?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_11": "To the steady sound of the waves, you slowly open your eyes.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_12": "(Mmph... I must've dozed off.)",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_13": "(Was there a cat here just now?)",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_14": "A trace of warmth seems to linger on your lap. But after looking carefully around, you find no sign that anything was ever there.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_2": "Half-asleep, you feel something soft and warm settling onto your lap... and lying down?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_3": "An illusion filled with beauty, or a reality filled with pain... Which would you choose, meow?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_4": "A beautiful illusion.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_5": "A painful reality.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_6": "I just want to be there for everyone.",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_7": "Mmm... Is that so?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_8": "Why do you ask?",
+  "AVG_XWSJ_3_9": "You're a little too curious for now, meow. Close your eyes and enjoy the dream. That's what you should be doing right now.",
+  "AVG_YFS_13_1": "{PlayerName}, want to play the Eekky Logistics Lucky Draw?",
+  "AVG_YFS_13_2": "You can join with the Lucky Draw Tickets you've collected. Hand your tickets to me, draw a slip like this, and then, boom! You might win a big prize.",
+  "AVG_YFS_13_3": "Each slip comes with a tier, and your tier decides which prize you walk away with.",
+  "AVG_YFS_13_4": "Oh, and if you don't have enough Lucky Draw Tickets, you can always pay for a draw instead.",
+  "AVG_YFS_13_5": "So, care to give it a try?",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_1": "Footsteps hammer in from every side. You can't help but hold your breath.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_10": "It is both the dependable elder who looks after you and the friend who never leaves your side. Your relationship never changes.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_11": "So, {PlayerName}, what're we eating later?",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_12": "You catch yourself genuinely deliberating. This is, after all, a matter of great importance.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_13": "And of course, the question of your future is still there, waiting.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_14": "Maybe, like many of your classmates, you'll take a job in town or a nearby city and let the days pass gently.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_15": "Or maybe you'll gamble on something bigger and chase your dreams somewhere much farther away.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_16": "With everything still undecided, the hours you spend with Abby feel that much more precious.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_17": "After all, not everyone gets the chance to pause and clear their head like this, or to have days this quiet and unhurried.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_18": "But what if...",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_19": "If you'd made a different choice back then, would your life look completely different now?",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_2": "The final safe zone. There is no way back for you and your companion now. All that remains is to fight with everything you have.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_20": "The thought pulls your eyes to the friend beside you, gaze locked on the TV, utterly absorbed.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_21": "So you grip your controller tighter. The next round is about to start...",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_3": "Bang!",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_4": "At the very end, you hear a gunshot, and everything goes dark—",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_5": "Ughhh, we lost! Those guys were cracked!",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_6": "It's alright. We just had a bad round. Again?",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_7": "Bring it. No way we lose twice!",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_8": "After graduation, you still haven't decided on your next step, so you stay put for now, under the same roof as Principal Abby.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_1_9": "In the days that follow, Abby is your gaming partner and your movie buddy. You bicker, but you always make up quickly.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_2_1": "After leaving the school, you throw yourself into advanced study and research, and before long, you're making a name for yourself in academia.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_2_2": "Building on the work of the scholars who came before you, you chart a path of inquiry all your own.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_2_3": "Out on the ocean of truth, you are a captain cutting through the waves, holding on to the same humility and stubborn devotion all the while.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_2_4": "Years later your name turns up in textbooks, printed beside the great scholars of history...",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_3_1": "The line on the board climbs, and climbs, and the trading floor erupts in cheers.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_3_2": "All eyes on you. Once again, the markets bend to your hand.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_3_3": "With astronomical sums now under your management, you've forged an unbeaten legend in the market.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_3_4": "Prudence, insight, strategy. With those, you slip every trap and take every win...",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_4_1": "The music pours through the opera house, carrying the audience into a golden sea of stars.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_4_2": "Your arms sweep wide. The whole orchestra answers at once, driving the movement to its grand climax.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_4_3": "After graduation, your solid grounding in music theory sets you on the path of an orchestra conductor, and you light up the stage.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_4_4": "Now you stand as the heart and soul of a world-renowned orchestra, hailed as the resounding echo of an era...",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_5_1": "After leaving the school, you turn your eyes toward the mountains few ever tread.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_5_2": "Peak after steep peak carries your tracks, and countless people take courage from your story of challenging yourself.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_5_3": "Right now you're eyeing the ridgeline going gold in the sunset, picking your next target.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_5_4": "Past one mountain is always another. And you know you'll keep climbing, all the way to the world's edge...",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_6_1": "In the classroom where you once sat as a student, you gladly take the offer letter from Principal Abby's hand.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_6_2": "You look at the students clapping below. All that youth in their faces reminds you of your own good days at school.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_6_3": "Maybe that's why you gave up your chance at a wider world to come back and teach here.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_6_4": "Just as your teachers once did for you, you want to pass on everything you've learned to the kids sitting before you now...",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_7_1": "To keep the school from ever facing closure again, you decide to... become an idol.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_7_2": "You debut with the whole school and even the whole town cheering you on, yet for a long while your career never quite catches fire.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_7_3": "Then a clip of you performing blows up online, and your name goes from a small town to the whole country, fast.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_7_4": "Suddenly the offers come down like snow. Variety shows, commercials, all of it. You don't let it swell your head and just keep sharpening your craft.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_7_5": "Stage, television, film... and your fans are there for every glittering step.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_7_6": "Right now you're shooting promotional photos for your new film, \"I Am Town Legend.\"",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_7_7": "You don't know where stardom will take you next, but you can't wait to meet every single day of it...",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_8_1": "\"Richest person in the world\" doesn't quite say it anymore. Maybe you simply have a superpower called \"being rich.\"",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_8_2": "Backed by your funding, Second Solaris School expands again and again, growing into one of the finest campuses in the country, with a faculty to match.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_8_3": "The whole town takes on a new life thanks to you. High-rises go up one after another, alongside a public library and a gymnasium you donated.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_8_4": "Some days it's a comfort: there's almost nothing money can't fix.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_8_5": "Other days it's a burden: however wildly you spend, the number in your account only goes up.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_8_6": "Some midnights you drift back to school. You had nothing like this wealth, yet you seemed just as content.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_8_7": "Fireworks crack open overhead. You lift your glass to the friends around you and smile.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_8_8": "It's because this life feels like a dream that the present is all the more worth holding onto.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_1": "Please welcome Mayor {PlayerName} to the podium for the inaugural address!",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_10": "Haa...",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_11": "You let out a long breath, and at last, you know what you want to say.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_12": "Not a word of it is on the page in front of you.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_13": "From where we've been, I want to walk into tomorrow with all of you.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_2": "Amid thunderous applause, you step into the spotlight.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_3": "Countless lenses turn your way, flashes popping until the white light swallows you whole.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_4": "It all flickers past like a carousel. The candidacy you filed as a joke, the speeches and campaign stops, then the vote.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_5": "The friends you made at school carried you here. Without them throwing everything behind you, none of this would have happened.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_6": "And now they're down there in the seats, eyes fixed on you, waiting for you to begin.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_7": "You prepared in meticulous detail, from the pace of your entrance to every word of the speech.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_8": "There's so much you want to say. What this win means, what you see ahead, what you'll do for the school, the town, and the whole city.",
+  "AVG_ZYEND_9_9": "But somehow, looking at all those faces, familiar or unfamiliar, the words won't come.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_1": "Cartethyia hurries into the restaurant. The second she spots you, her eyes light up.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_10": "Sounds great! I haven't had the pasta here in ages. One order, please!",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_11": "Shortly after, you carry a plate of freshly made Nuvola Pasta over to Cartethyia.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_12": "Wow... look at that color. How do you even do that?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_13": "She's clearly pleased with the dish, already twirling up a forkful before she's even finished speaking.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_14": "Ooh, yes! Then I'll try the new dessert, please!",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_15": "Shortly after, you carry a freshly made Nuvola Fruit Mille-Feuille over to Cartethyia.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_16": "That smells incredible. Digging in! Mm...",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_17": "One bite of the mille-feuille, and she's cupping her cheek, absolutely blissful.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_18": "Pizza? That'll definitely fill me up. One, please!",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_19": "Shortly after, you carry a Pizza Tropicale, fresh out of the oven, over to Cartethyia.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_2": "Oh, {PlayerName}! So you're working here today.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_20": "Huh? Wait a second, is that fruit on top...? You can't call this pizza anymore!",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_21": "For all her protests, Cartethyia still chokes back tears and finishes every bite.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_22": "And so, Cartethyia enjoys her meal at the family restaurant.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_3": "She waves hello, then claps a hand to her stomach. You think you hear a faint rumbling from her direction.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_4": "Order, please! I'm starving.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_5": "Right away. What can I get for you today?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_6": "Hmm... I'll skip the salad today. What do you recommend?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_7": "Recommend the pasta.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_8": "Recommend the dessert.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_1_9": "Recommend the pizza.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_1": "In walks a familiar red-haired girl. She spots you behind the register and smiles.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_10": "...\"Blazing Feather Spicy Meat Bento\"?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_11": "It's the store's extra-spicy bento. Hardly anyone dares to order it. Seeing your puzzlement, Changli's eyes narrow just a touch.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_12": "A little spice keeps the mind sharp when work is busy. Something quick like this will do for lunch today.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_13": "Eating spicy food when you're busy might not sit well with your stomach.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_14": "Alright, alright. I won't get it next time.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_15": "You heat the bento and ring her up. Bento in hand, she's already heading for the door.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_16": "I'll get going, then. Oh, since you...",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_17": "She halts by the door, mulling something over. You look her way and catch those knowing eyes of hers.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_18": "Since you're so concerned about how I'm eating... once our schedules clear up, why don't we sit down for a proper meal together?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_19": "You nod, and she takes her leave, looking pleased.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_2": "Oh, so you're working part-time here today. And here I was wondering why you hadn't stopped by the Council.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_3": "How long have you been at it?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_4": "Since this morning.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_5": "Just started.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_6": "Hard at work, I see.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_7": "Then my timing couldn't be better.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_8": "Changli takes a moment browsing the shelves, then sets a bento on the counter.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_2_9": "That's the one. Could you warm it up for me?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_1": "A familiar figure catches your eye on the street. Chisa, crouched by the flowerbed, is watching a calico cat.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_10": "Noticing you've been watching for a while, Chisa shifts to the side and opens up a spot for you.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_11": "You nod, drop down next to her, and the two of you study the cat side by side.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_12": "Let it get used to your scent first. Then, slowly, like this...",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_13": "Chisa talks you through it, running a gentle hand over the cat as a demo.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_14": "Soon she withdraws her hand and looks at you, signaling it's your turn. You reach out the way she showed you.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_15": "The cat flinches at your hand, then edges forward and sniffs your fingertips.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_16": "Mm. I think it's warming up to you.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_17": "Chisa turns to you with a smile, and you meet her eyes. The evening light traces the curve of her cheek, dusting it with a soft glow.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_18": "...There. Go ahead and pet it.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_19": "You run your hand along the cat's back, feeling the softness of its coat.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_2": "She reaches out carefully. The cat closes the distance first.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_20": "The two of you spend a quiet, unhurried time playing with the cat.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_3": "Good kitty... There we go...",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_4": "Murmuring softly, Chisa gently rubs the cat under its chin. It clearly loves the attention, its eyes narrowing to slits as it melts under her touch.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_5": "You keep your distance and simply watch, letting the two of them have their moment. Then Chisa turns her head and spots you.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_6": "Oh, {PlayerName}, what are you doing here?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_7": "You seem pretty popular with cats?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_8": "I guess so. I've never had one, but they always seem happy to come up to me.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_3_9": "...Want to give it a go?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_1": "You're taking a break on the field when something nudges your arm.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_10": "No pack on your back, no rough terrain to cross. Trust me, this is the light version.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_11": "A flicker of a smile tugs at the corner of Galbrena's mouth.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_12": "You've asked plenty. So, care to join me?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_13": "You wave a hand to say you're not interested.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_14": "Come to think of it, I did take over your PE class. Let me make it up to you. Want me to teach you?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_15": "Wait, we're making up that class right now?!",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_16": "And that's how you end up having a very pleasant workout with Galbrena.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_2": "You look up. Galbrena is standing over you, a bottle of mineral water in her hand.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_3": "Here. It's room temperature.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_4": "Galbrena doesn't leave you room to say no. She thrusts the bottle into your hands. You murmur thanks, crack the cap, and take a few sips.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_5": "Galbrena begins loosening up beside you, apparently getting ready to exercise.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_6": "You training too, Miss Galbrena?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_7": "Mm. Stay cooped up in an office and the body rusts.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_8": "Today's just a warm-up. Ten kilometers.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_4_9": "That's your idea of a warm-up?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_1": "While cleaning up the square, you catch sight of Phoebe on a nearby bench.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_10": "Oh. I nodded off while reading. I'm so sorry, that was terribly rude of me.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_11": "It's fine. Weather like this is made for naps.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_12": "You look up at the white clouds drifting across the blue sky as a refreshing breeze brushes past your face.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_13": "It is. So, shall I help you clean the square?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_14": "You're still weighing whether to accept the young lady's help when you feel eyes on your back.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_15": "Turning around, you find a few figures in black suits standing at a distance.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_16": "Now you understand why no one else is around Phoebe.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_2": "Under the empty shade of the trees, the blonde girl is asleep against the back of the bench, an open book lying on her lap.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_3": "Phoebe's face in sleep is so calm it seems to have hushed the air itself.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_4": "The whole scene looks plucked from a picture book, or a painting in an old gallery.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_5": "Mm...",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_6": "Phoebe's lashes tremble. She slowly opens her eyes and looks up at you, still groggy.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_7": "Mm... {PlayerName}?",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_8": "Good afternoon, Phoebe.",
+  "AVG_zydaily_5_9": "Only then does she seem to fully wake, sitting up with a sheepish expression.",
