   "Bossch_detail_88": "[Resistance]: This enemy has a higher Fusion RES.\n\n[Tarnished Dredge]: When a Resonator successfully triggers a Counterattack, Resonators in the team gain 1 stack of Occultation for 8s, stacking up to 5 times.\n\n[Occultation]: The Resonator's total DMG is increased by 5%, and their Vibration Strength Reduction Rate is increased.\n\n[Dream of Annihilation]: A successful Dodge recovers 3% of the Resonator's Max HP, and grants Resonators in the team 1 stack of Phantom Froth for 8s, stacking up to 5 times.\n\n[Phantom Froth]: The Resonator takes 5% less damage.\n\n[To the Void]: 3 minutes after the battle begins, Resonators deal 10% more Total DMG every 10s, up to 100%. Resonators take 10% more Total DMG every 10s, up to 100%.",
   "Bossch_detail_89": "[Resistance]: This enemy has a higher Fusion RES.",
   "Bossch_detail_90": "[Resistance]: This enemy has a higher Fusion RES.\n[Prison Bound]: When the Myriad Snare is enraged, it loses HP each second and takes more Vibration Strength Reduction. When Myriad Snare isn't enraged, it takes 10% more total DMG.\n[Doomed Fire]: After 3 minutes into the combat, Resonators deal and take 10% more total DMG every 10s, up to 60%.\nAfter 4 minutes into the combat, Resonators deal and take 100% more total DMG. They receive 100% less Healing.",
+  "Bossch_detail_91": "[Resistance]: This enemy has a higher Aero RES.",
+  "Bossch_detail_92": "[Resistance]: This enemy has a higher Aero RES.\n[Forged Might]: Resonators in the team gain 1 stack of Impeccable every second. Each stack of Impeccable makes the Resonator deal 1% more total DMG, up to 100%.\nResonators gain and lose Impeccable through the following actions:\n- Casting a Dodge Counter or Counterattack grants 10 stacks.\n- Casting Basic Attack, Heavy Attack, Resonance Skill, or Echo Skill removes 2 stacks.\n- Casting Resonance Liberation removes 10 stacks.\n[Way of the Forged Empyrean]: 3 minutes after the battle begins, Resonators deal and take 10% more total DMG every 10s, up to 60%.\n4 minutes after the battle begins, Resonators deal and take 100% more total DMG. They receive 100% less Healing.",
