@@ -13477,6 +16041,265 @@
   "CJBOC_9_1": "(There's a photo this time?)",
   "CJBOC_9_2": "With a careful examination, you find it to be a group photo of four Plushies in Plushie Village.",
   "CJBOC_9_3": "(Did Fulmine help them take this photo? I should ask him about this.)",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_1": "On the day of the fireworks festival, the girl sits alone in her hospital room.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_10": "...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_11": "The fireworks are about to start. Why are you here instead of with the others?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_12": "That show is the fruit of your shared efforts. Shouldn't you be there to witness it with them?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_13": "I took the day off.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_14": "After all, the fireworks festival wouldn't be happening so smoothly without the decision you made.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_15": "Wouldn't it be a shame if you couldn't see it with your own eyes?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_16": "With that, you open the window of the hospital room.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_17": "Changli looks out with you. Even the Student Council President, a master planner who has weathered all manner of situations, cannot help but look surprised. There, standing firmly in place, is a ladder leading straight from the window to the ground outside.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_18": "You climb through the window first and hold out a hand to Changli.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_19": "Come on. Don't you want to see it together?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_2": "The room is on one of the lower floors, and the hospital is some distance from the school. Even through the window, the school in the distance is hidden behind layer upon layer of buildings. But the girl simply gazes quietly in that direction.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_20": "...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_21": "...Pfft... Hehe... hahaha!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_22": "A master player always breaks the stalemate first. I quite admire your thinking.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_23": "She takes your hand.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_24": "The ladder is remarkably sturdy. Even with the two of you stepping onto it one after the other, it barely sways. To your surprise, Changli—usually bent over her desk, absorbed in paperwork—seems strangely familiar with this sort of thing.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_25": "Perhaps this well-to-do Student Council President has a history of climbing over walls to sneak out of her own home?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_26": "You make it safely to the ground and walk side by side beneath the night sky. The evening breeze is cool, so you drape your jacket over Changli's shoulders.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_27": "She accepts your kindness. In return, she offers you the warmth of her palm.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_28": "Here we are. Look.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_29": "This is...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_3": "Ten minutes to go.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_30": "This is a hill not far from the hospital. From the summit, you can see the distant outline of the school. It is far from clear, but enough to let you see the changes taking place there.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_31": "For instance, right now—",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_32": "It's about to start.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_33": "Three, two, one—",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_34": "Fireworks light up the night sky.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_35": "Gold suddenly blooms across the sky, unfurling from a single point and spilling outward. Then comes another burst, and another. Their light drifts across the town and settles softly upon the two of you, radiant yet gentle.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_36": "The most important part of a fireworks festival has to be making a wish, right?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_37": "What's your wish, Changli?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_38": "The girl raises her head, letting those glittering lights fall into her eyes.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_39": "My wish... is for a peaceful world where everyone finds fulfillment.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_4": "She remembers the photo {PlayerName} sent her. Everyone in it was smiling brightly, brimming with energy as they looked forward to the fireworks festival.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_40": "She shakes her head, almost bashfully, avoiding your gaze. Then her tense fingertips slowly relax.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_41": "...I hope no one in this town has to know solitude.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_42": "You understand. This is the wish of the Student Council President—and, perhaps, of the person who may one day be entrusted with the town itself. But—",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_43": "What about a wish for yourself, then?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_44": "For myself...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_45": "She looks at you with a smile.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_46": "In that smile, you realize she was waiting for this question. She already had her answer ready. This isn't you asking her. This is her leading you exactly where she wants you to go.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_47": "You were never the one making the move.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_48": "I asked for solitude to never again keep me company.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_49": "And that wish, I've already made for myself.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_5": "At the thought of it, the corners of her lips curl into a smile.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_6": "It'll be a good one.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_7": "Then she hears footsteps outside the door. Tap, tap, tap—",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_8": "The girl recognizes who they belong to. What she cannot understand is why that person would come here at a time like this.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1000_9": "Good evening, Changli.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_1": "Everyone, I've decided to hold a fireworks festival.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_10": "You know little about event planning, but even you can tell from everyone's questions that putting together this festival will be anything but as easy as Changli makes it sound.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_11": "(The Student Council feels completely different when it's in session.)",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_12": "I understand everyone's concerns. Please, take a look at this proposal.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_13": "For the funding, please refer to the sponsorship plan on page three. The fire safety requirements are covered on page seven, under compliance.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_14": "As for cooperation from the Club Association, once the plan is finalized, I'll meet with the club leaders in my capacity as Student Council President to confirm the arrangements.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_15": "The rustle of turning pages fills the Student Council meeting room. You read through the proposal. It addresses everyone's concerns, along with venue arrangements, security measures, emergency medical care, and more.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_16": "By the time everyone finishes reading, the confusion on their faces gives way to a measure of admiration, much like your own.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_17": "But, President Changli!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_18": "Just as everyone thinks the proposal is about to pass, a student who has remained silent until then suddenly raises an objection.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_19": "This school might not even be here next year. Is there really any point in doing all this?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_2": "During a regular Student Council meeting, Changli announces her decision.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_20": "...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_21": "The Student Council falls silent as the pointed question hangs in the air.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_22": "It is, after all, the elephant in the room. Even if no one says it aloud, the thought has been lingering in everyone's minds. But hearing it stated so bluntly still makes people instinctively hold their breath.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_23": "In this very moment, you're all waiting for Changli's answer.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_24": "Um...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_25": "To everyone's surprise, you are the first to speak.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_26": "Isn't that exactly why we should hold it? Because we don't know how things will turn out?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_27": "Your words stir a small commotion in the room.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_28": "Everyone's eyes shift between you and Changli, and a twinge of regret hits you. The proposal is hers. Perhaps you shouldn't have spoken for her.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_29": "And yet, you know exactly why you're doing this. You've felt Changli's sincerity, and you want to see the fireworks festival happen.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_3": "From a business perspective, this will help enhance the school's reputation and build momentum for the Student Council and Club Association.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_30": "...Hehe.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_31": "Changli begins to clap softly.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_32": "No one understands why, and they exchange puzzled glances.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_33": "Just as {PlayerName} said.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_34": "Ever since we first heard that the school might be shut down, many students, including {PlayerName}, have been working tirelessly to prevent that from happening.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_35": "The fireworks festival is our way of telling them that, whatever happens, their efforts deserve to be celebrated.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_36": "And if they succeed—",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_37": "This fireworks festival will be a grand celebration of their efforts and the opening chapter of this school's rebirth.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_38": "...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_39": "With a sharp clap, Xiangli Yao, a Student Council Officer, starts the applause.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_4": "It would also lift the students' spirits, so they can head into final exams without regrets.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_40": "Chisa, Phoebe, and more members of the Student Council soon join in. Even the student who raised the objection moments ago begins to clap, completely won over.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_41": "Amid the applause, Changli smiles at you, as if inviting you to share in it.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_42": "And with that, the plan to hold the fireworks festival is officially approved.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_43": "(President Changli really knows how to get things done.)",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_44": "After the meeting, you feel a little tired and sit down alone in the rest area to relax.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_45": "Then a familiar figure in red catches your eye.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_46": "{PlayerName}.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_47": "With the meeting still fresh in your mind, you instinctively stand and straighten your clothes.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_48": "What a coincidence, President Changli.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_49": "Are you here for a break, too?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_5": "Does anyone have any objections to this proposal?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_50": "Hehe, don't be nervous.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_51": "As if she's seen right through you, Changli gives you a faint smile.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_52": "I'm here for you.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_6": "President Changli, how do you plan to handle the funding?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_7": "A large-scale event will require cooperation from all the clubs. Do we have a plan for that?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_8": "Um... What about fire safety?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_1_9": "Faced with Changli's proposal, everyone begins raising their concerns.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_1": "Then, I'll get straight to the point.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_10": "You're better placed to bring them on board than I am as Student Council President.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_11": "As you talk, the waiter brings over your drinks and desserts one by one. You notice that, besides the portions for the two of you, there is another sizable order already packed to go.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_12": "There's no need to answer right away. This cafe's Black Forest cake is excellent. It's rich and fragrant, sweet without being cloying. It would be a shame not to try it while it's fresh.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_13": "And the one packed to go can be a little gift for Principal Abby.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_14": "(With a gift this generous, there's no way Abby could refuse... Talk about owing someone a favor.)",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_15": "You cut off a piece of cake with your fork. Perhaps the sweet chocolate cream wins you over, or perhaps Changli's sincerity opens your heart. After giving it some thought, you give her your answer.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_16": "I'm in.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_17": "But I'm not familiar with the specifics of organizing an event like this. What exactly would you need me to do?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_18": "It's simple. I'd like you to be my \"representative.\"",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_19": "I'll prepare the data, reports, and materials you'll need for the cooperation. All you need to do is bring everyone together in your own way and make the arrangements happen.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_2": "At a cafe, you sit across from Changli.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_20": "If everything goes smoothly, I'll also persuade the school to recognize you for your work afterward. An award, a bonus, and a letter of recommendation for further study. How does that sound?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_21": "...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_22": "For you, it's a deal almost too good to pass up. But Changli is the one proposing the festival and doing most of the work. She's getting so little in return.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_23": "Just as you are about to say something, Changli raises a finger to her lips and motions for you to be quiet.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_24": "Please consider these rewards a small token of my sincerity.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_25": "There's one more reason I want to work with you. The most important one.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_26": "You love the students here, just as I do. Isn't that right?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_27": "As you'd expected, Changli looks at you with her usual smile. But this time, there is something gentler in it than usual.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_28": "You smile back.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_29": "That's right.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_3": "{PlayerName}, I'd like you to help me organize the fireworks festival.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_30": "It's a deal.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_31": "After you agree to work together, the conversation grows easier, and you finally dig into your dessert.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_32": "Just as Changli says, the Black Forest cake is excellent. You finish it in only a few bites.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_33": "Then you notice something rather strange.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_34": "Changli, aren't you going to eat anything?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_35": "Changli orders plenty to eat and drink for you and even Principal Abby, but all she has in front of her is a glass of warm water. She's taken just a few small sips.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_36": "...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_37": "Don't mind me. I just don't have much of an appetite.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_38": "Afterward, Changli sends you the materials by text, piece by piece. With you handling the arrangements, preparations for the fireworks festival move along smoothly.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_39": "What you don't see coming is that, one day soon after, Changli simply vanishes from school.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_4": "Half an hour ago, she'd told you she had something to discuss with you and brought you to this newly opened cafe off campus.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_5": "She looks at you with a polite smile, yet you can't quite figure out why she's sought you out.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_6": "Why me?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_7": "I'm not really anyone special...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_8": "Hehe, don't be so modest.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_2_9": "You're much closer to Principal Abby than most students are. Around campus, you're also on good terms with key people in the Student Council, Club Association, Liaison Center, and even the school shop.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_1": "{PlayerName}, the Liaison Center has sent over their response. I'll leave it to you.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_10": "You know Phoebe means well. She's only guessing.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_11": "But while she means nothing by it, the rumor that \"President Changli abandoned the school to inherit her family's business\" quietly begins to spread around campus.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_12": "Haven't you heard? President Changli went overseas to take over her family's company. She's not going to bother with us anymore.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_13": "Makes sense. The school is going to shut down next year anyway. Might as well leave us holding the bag...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_14": "(I should probably tell Changli about this.)",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_15": "You send Changli a brief text summarizing the rumors going around school and the current situation, and tell her that you hope she'll step forward and reassure everyone.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_16": "The message remains unread for a long time. It isn't until noon the next day that Changli finally replies.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_17": "\"I'll do my best to make it back before the next school-wide assembly.\"",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_18": "Her answer gives you nothing certain. You hold on to hope, even as unease lingers, and pray for the better outcome.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_19": "At last, the day before the school-wide assembly arrives.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_2": "For the two weeks following your agreement with Changli, you act as her representative, communicating with the various parties involved.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_20": "...Still nothing from President Changli?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_21": "No message, and we can't reach her by phone, either.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_22": "M-Maybe she's on a plane and doesn't have any signal...?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_23": "...Sorry. I just thought that might make everyone feel a little better...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_24": "With no word from Changli, everyone's spirits sink. Still, it's time to come up with a solution.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_25": "I'll speak at the school-wide assembly.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_26": "You know exactly what awaits you. Rumors are spreading across campus, and Changli, who is due to speak, is nowhere to be seen. As her stand-in, you'll face the full force of everyone's disappointment, doubts, and hostility.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_27": "To be honest, you aren't confident you can handle all of this. But as Changli's representative, there is only one thing left to do: grit your teeth and step forward.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_28": "...Someone has to take responsibility.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_29": "You don't have to.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_3": "Changli, meanwhile, takes a leave of absence citing family matters and stops coming to school.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_30": "As the voice comes from outside the door, everyone turns to look. A familiar figure in red appears in their line of sight.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_31": "Changli!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_32": "I'm sorry. I was tied up with family matters and made everyone worry.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_33": "I'll be the one speaking at tomorrow's school-wide assembly and announcing the details of the fireworks festival.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_34": "And while I was away, I'd also like to thank—",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_35": "But then Changli's voice falters unnaturally.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_36": "Only then do you notice Changli bracing herself against the table with one hand, rather than standing tall as she usually does. She bites her pale lip through the pause, as if enduring something.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_37": "But the moment passes almost instantly. The next second, her expression returns to its usual confidence and composure.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_38": "—thank {PlayerName} for making this wish of mine a reality.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_39": "At the meeting that follows, Changli briefly goes over the arrangements for the next day, then claims she has some documents to deal with and dismisses everyone.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_4": "Your communication with her remains perfectly normal. As promised, Changli regularly sends you materials by text, and whenever you run into a problem, she promptly provides a solution. Under your direction, preparations for the fireworks festival continue smoothly.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_40": "You go to the storage room next to the Student Council's office and check the materials needed for the fireworks festival once again.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_41": "(The Baseball Club borrowed some of the fencing a while ago... It won't affect the event in the end, but I should let Changli know anyway.)",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_42": "To your surprise, even after you've finished checking the materials at nightfall, the text you've sent her still shows as unread.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_43": "(Why can't I reach Changli now, of all times...?)",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_44": "At the worst possible moment, you recall Changli's strange pause during her speech. You can still see her biting her lip, as if enduring something.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_45": "Perhaps just to put your mind at ease, you call her.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_46": "——♪",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_47": "...?!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_48": "(It's coming from next door... Is Changli still in the Student Council's office this late?!)",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_49": "The phone keeps ringing. No one picks up or declines the call. A sense of dread builds, and you all but run to the Student Council office.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_5": "Still, there are times when you find yourself wondering.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_50": "Changli!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_51": "...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_52": "I'm sorry... Could you help me up?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_6": "If Changli wants the fireworks festival to go ahead so badly, why would she leave at a time like this...?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_7": "Um... I heard from my father that President Changli's parents are renowned entrepreneurs, too.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_8": "It's just that their company's headquarters are overseas, so not many people in town know about them.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_3_9": "Do you think President Changli might have been away so long because she had to go overseas to take care of some business...?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_1": "Everyone, I'm {PlayerName} of the Student Council.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_10": "From the way the doctor spoke to her, it is clear this is far from the first time something like this has happened.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_11": "Doctor, I understand your advice. But...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_12": "No buts.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_13": "Miss Changli, if you want to live a normal lifespan, you need to follow your doctor's orders.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_14": "The doctor says nothing more and simply turns to adjust the IV drip before leaving the room.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_15": "Silence fills the room. Trying to ease the tension, you glance at the medical chart the doctor has left behind and reach for it to take a look.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_16": "...No need to read it.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_17": "Whatever it is you want to know... I'll tell you.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_18": "You lied to me.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_19": "You never told me you were sick.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_2": "President Changli is unable to attend today's school-wide assembly, so I'll be introducing the details of the fireworks festival on her behalf.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_20": "...Yes. I'm sorry for keeping it from you.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_21": "As the doctor said, I've had a chronic illness since birth. Most days I can live normally. But when it flares up, I'm weak and in pain. I'm fully conscious, yet I can't even hold myself up.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_22": "If my illness hadn't been so severe lately... I wouldn't have had to ask you to handle the fireworks festival.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_23": "So that's the real reason you asked me to be your representative.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_24": "I may know a lot of people at school, but you're the Student Council President. I'm no better placed to negotiate partnerships than you are.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_25": "You just needed someone you could trust to represent you, while your illness kept you from being there yourself.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_26": "...That's right.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_27": "I deceived you. If you resent me for it, I won't make excuses.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_28": "Of course, you don't resent her. Whatever her reasons may have been, you know her desire to see the fireworks festival succeed has always been genuine.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_29": "There is only one question that has remained in the back of your mind.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_3": "As you walk to the front of the stage, a wave of murmurs sweeps through the crowd. For a moment, voices questioning whether Changli has abandoned the school can be heard from all around.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_30": "Changli, why didn't you tell us the truth?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_31": "...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_32": "At your question, Changli lowers her eyes in silence. Moonlight filters into the hospital room and settles on her hand, where the IV is attached. She presses her lips together and gives you a faint, lonely smile.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_33": "Because... the students at this school need someone they can \"rely on.\"",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_34": "They were swept into the heart of the storm before they were old enough to weather such upheaval. Like seabirds lost at sea, they need a lighthouse to show them the way.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_35": "And the person they rely on must never fall.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_36": "...",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_37": "But isn't that cruel to you?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_38": "Hehe... Not at all.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_39": "When I was a child, it hit me one day that my parents weren't coming back from overseas. I had no one to rely on but myself. Ever since, one wish has stayed with me.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_4": "You take a deep breath.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_40": "—I don't want anyone else to ever have to endure that same helplessness.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_41": "With that, Changli turns her gaze toward you.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_42": "So I have to attend tomorrow's school-wide assembly. {PlayerName}, can I ask you to help me?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_43": "Now you understand completely why Changli has done all this.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_44": "Once caught in the rain, she now wants to offer others an umbrella. Once helpless, she now wants to be someone the students can lean on.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_45": "And so, knowing how much this request means to her, you make you choice.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_46": "But I refuse.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_47": "At the school-wide assembly, the students are thrown into an uproar, just as you'd expected. It's fine. Everything is unfolding exactly as you'd planned.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_48": "Everyone, please come up now.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_49": "Hi, everyone. I'm Chisa from the Liaison Center. I'll be in charge of setting up the venue for the fireworks festival. I hope more students will join me and help out.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_5": "So, for this fireworks festival, I'd like to do things a little differently—",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_50": "I'm Xiangli Yao, a Student Council Officer. I'll be handling the festival's finances. Hmm... If anyone has an idea they'd like to make happen at the festival, maybe I can help.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_51": "I... will stock the store with everything we need. I'd be really happy if someone could help me carry it all.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_52": "Da! Da-la da-da-la da-da! da-da-la da-da!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_53": "Everyone, come join the Orchestral Music Club and help us spread the word about our fireworks festival!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_54": "Uh, Boss Ciaccona can handle the in-person stuff. I started a thread on our school forum, so come on by and post away, bosses!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_55": "A-And... I'll convince my father to sponsor us, too!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_56": "As everyone finishes speaking in turn, the murmurs of suspicion and hostility from below gradually give way to excited whispers.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_57": "To organize the fireworks festival ourselves... Actually, that doesn't sound so bad.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_58": "Sounds pretty fun. Why don't we give it a try?",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_59": "Even if President Changli isn't here, this school still has us!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_6": "Let's all put it on together! All of us!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_60": "You watch suspicion fade from the students' faces. They exchange glances, each hopeful that they can help, too.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_61": "Everyone, let's prove we can make this school shine on our own!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_62": "Now then—here's to a successful fireworks festival!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_63": "To a successful fireworks festival!",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_64": "From her hospital bed, Changli quietly watches everything unfold on the screen of her phone.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_65": "As if sensing Changli's gaze, the transfer student with black hair on the screen turns back toward the camera with a confident smile and flashes a V sign.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_66": "This fireworks festival is also our way of telling President Changli, who can't be here with us—",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_67": "You've passed that spirit on to everyone.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_7": "Miss Changli, I told you—you need plenty of rest. Going out and overexerting yourself will only hinder your recovery.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_8": "You'll need to stay in the hospital for at least two weeks.",
+  "CL_AVGcharacter_4_9": "The night before, you brought Changli, who had collapsed in the Student Council's office, to the hospital. The doctor immediately arranged for her to be admitted.",
