   "DungeonRewardHsinToken_Text": "Thousandfold Petals",
   "Dungeon_BanItem": "You cannot currently use this function",
   "ELoginStatus": "Login Status: {0}",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_1": "Makeshift activity stalls have taken over most of Central Square, colorful streamers and club signs swaying overhead in the breeze.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_10": "It's a <b>Special Scratch-Off Event</b> sponsored by Eekky Logistics! Here, let me give you the rundown.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_11": "Buling leans over the edge of the table, inching closer with a mysterious air.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_12": "If you've already checked out the other activities, you must have picked up a few Lucky Draw Tickets, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_13": "Basically, you can use your Lucky Draw Tickets to play the scratch-off game here. Each play wins you a random prize!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_14": "And hey, if you run out of Lucky Draw Tickets, you can always pay for another chance to play!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_15": "So whether you walk away with what you want all comes down to how hot your luck is running today, Boss!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_16": "Plus, since today's a special event, we've loaded up the prize pool with tons of exclusive stuff. You definitely don't wanna miss out!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_17": "With that, Buling slides the scratch-off board a little closer to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_18": "What do you say, Boss? Why just think about it when you can give it a try? Go on, scratch one!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_2": "STAAAAR PRIZE! Lucky you, Boss!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_3": "The host draws out her words in an exaggerated sales pitch. The moment she finishes, the crowd erupts into cheers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_4": "Following that familiar voice, you spot the person behind the booth—it's Buling, of course.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_5": "Behind her stands a board covered in pictures of prizes, with all sorts of rewards neatly displayed beside it. But she has deliberately hidden which prize belongs to each tier.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_6": "Spotting you in the crowd, Buling's eyes light up. With a slap, she smacks her flyer down on the table.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_7": "Haiya, if it isn't Boss {PlayerName}! Come on over!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_8": "Perfect timing. Wanna test your luck today?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_100_9": "What's this...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_10_1": "—THUMP!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_10_10": "It seems the only way to continue is to try opening one of the doors.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_10_2": "A deafening thud erupts right beside you. A half-open door slams shut in a sudden draft, crashing against its frame and sending echoes ringing down the corridor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_10_3": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_10_4": "The flickering lights go out entirely. You stand rigid in place, grip tightening on your flashlight.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_10_5": "The narrow corridor is barely lit by the thin beam in your hand. Walls, floor, and the shut doors on either side hover at the edge of the light.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_10_6": "The moment the dim light drifts even slightly, the darkness swallows everything again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_10_7": "A strange sound reaches you from nearby, like a girl hidden somewhere in the dark, stifling her sobs.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_10_8": "The broken crying drifts along the dim corridor, its source impossible to pin down.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_10_9": "You look around. There are only a few shut classroom doors on either side, and no other way forward.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_1": "Walking along the side of the Teaching Building, the atmosphere around you shifts before you even notice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_10": "Is this run by the Liaison Center?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_11": "Not entirely. The Liaison Center took the lead, and we put it on together with the Drama Fan Club and the Film Club.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_12": "Everyone agreed that a school anniversary open house is a rare occasion, so we had to do something memorable. That's why we got permission to use this entire floor of classrooms and turned it into a haunted house.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_13": "You glance up at the half-open door behind the desk and think it over for a few seconds. Well, since you're already here...",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_14": "Alright then, I'll give it a try.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_15": "Pushing aside the heavy curtain at the entrance, you step alone into the dim corridor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_16": "You look around. Several yellowed oil paintings hang on the walls, their frames deliberately chipped and weathered.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_17": "Dim yellow bulbs dangle overhead and flicker with a faint electric hum, plunging the scene into brief stretches of darkness.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_18": "From a speaker in the corner comes a rustling, like fabric rubbing together, or something dragging its feet slowly along the other side of the wall.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_19": "A few muffled whispers bleed in, though you can't make out a word.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_2": "The corridor is draped in swaths of black cloth. Dim light seeps through the gaps, casting the mottled walls in an even gloomier shade.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_20": "The classroom doors on both sides all stand ajar. The doorplates keep their original shape, but the familiar room numbers have been covered with distressed paper, as if this place was abandoned years ago.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_21": "The light ahead flickers again. You switch on your flashlight and press deeper, one step at a time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_3": "A few artificially aged posters hang crookedly on the wall, their yellowed surfaces marked with blurry crimson handprints and several distorted, barely recognizable figures.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_4": "The edges are deliberately torn, as if they've hung here for ages. Listening closely, faint shrieks drift from the end of the hall, mingled with bursts of stifled laughter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_5": "By the entrance stands a makeshift sign—\"Old School Building: Midnight Stories.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_6": "A \"haunted house,\" at school...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_7": "A desk sits at the entrance, where a student on registration duty asks those coming out how they enjoyed the experience.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_8": "A few students who have just finished pass by. One looks pale, while another can barely stop both legs from shaking.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_1_9": "Oh, {PlayerName}, you're here too. It's not every day we get a chance like this. Want to try the haunted house?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_1": "Heading down the tree-lined path beside Central Square, a striking poster catches your eye.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_10": "The whole office basks in warm sunlight, the plaid tablecloth and commemorative cards gleaming faintly, while the menus and tableware catch a soft sheen.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_100": "Hearing your answer, Xiangli Yao lets out a soft, helpless sigh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_101": "Student Council Magic...",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_102": "From a scientific standpoint, \"magic\" is simply the principles of nature that we have yet to perceive or comprehend. There is no eternal ignorance, nor eternal truth. Only eternal exploration.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_103": "In other words, it's an illusion produced by influencing consciousness and projecting that influence onto the world around us, because so-called magic can't actually change the physical environment, but a sufficiently impressionable mind can be influenced by another person's subconscious suggestions and consequently become convinced that it has witnessed magic...",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_104": "But clearly, none of that matters now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_105": "As Xiangli Yao launches into a rapid-fire scientific lecture you can barely follow, you clearly see him begin to levitate.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_106": "White light swirls dramatically around his figure, and a soft, iridescent rainbow aura radiates from atop his head.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_107": "The magic is real. Xiangli Yao can fly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_108": "Overwhelmed by an indescribable shock, you slowly slump onto the table.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_109": "Nice special effects, \"Xiang-LEE.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_11": "Welcome, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_110": "Oh, almost forgot... Ahem. Truth and knowledge, science and exploration—Student Council Magic, wash away {PlayerName}'s confusion.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_111": "A little robot named \"Xiang-LEE\" flies out from behind Xiangli Yao, its screen eyes curving into a smile as it circles around you once.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_112": "You've worked hard getting the School Anniversary ready all this time, {PlayerName}. For now, just take a little rest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_113": "You enjoy a short yet refreshing nap at the Student Council Cafe. When you wake, the fog in your head has cleared, and the fatigue built up over these past days has vanished along with it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_114": "Your custom drink has been thoughtfully packed up, with a handwritten note tucked under the cup. In elegant handwriting, it reads: \"A special treat for {PlayerName}. Happy School Anniversary!\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_115": "Time to check out other places.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_12": "Phoebe greets you with an energetic smile, hurrying over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_13": "(Milady—!!)",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_14": "(Milady, this is...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_15": "Well, for some reason, you get the distinct feeling several razor-sharp glares are tracking your every move from the shadows.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_16": "Phoebe?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_17": "Happy School Anniversary, {PlayerName}! I'm here as the cafe's special server today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_18": "The Student Council Cafe is open for a limited time during the centennial. Please do relax and enjoy yourself today, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_19": "So, honored guest, would you like to try our fully customizable \"Student Council Magic\" drink?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_2": "—\"School Centennial Special: Student Council Cafe\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_20": "Let's start with a base drink.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_21": "Coffee.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_22": "Hot black tea.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_23": "Fizzy soda.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_24": "Coffee? All right, just a moment please.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_25": "Today we're serving a medium roast. The first sip carries a toasty aroma followed by a gentle bitterness and a hint of fruity acidity.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_26": "It has a full-bodied yet balanced mouthfeel, with lingering notes of cocoa and nuts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_27": "Hot black tea, was it? Understood.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_28": "We've carefully selected the black tea we're serving today. Its aroma is softer when enjoyed hot, but let it cool a little, and the tea's naturally sweet notes become more pronounced.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_29": "It's lively everywhere during the School Anniversary. Sitting down for a cup of hot tea now and then is a nice way to give yourself a little break.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_3": "(So this is an event using the Student Council's own coffee machine...?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_30": "Fizzy soda... what a festive choice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_31": "Cool and lightly fizzy, it's wonderfully refreshing—especially after a day of exploring all the activities around campus.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_32": "Also, we've specifically dialed back the sweetness, leaving just a crisp, slightly tart fruitiness that goes down clean.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_33": "Now that your base drink is set, what add-ins would you like, {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_34": "Special sweet-and-sour sauce.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_35": "Spicy chili powder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_36": "Rainbow Wonder Cup Noodles.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_37": "Fresh lemongrass.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_38": "O-okay, noted. Sweet-and-sour sauce...",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_39": "It's an unexpected choice, but perhaps that's what makes it creative. It could add a rich, sweet-and-tangy twist to your drink.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_4": "Alongside the coffee and pastry descriptions, the poster specifically notes a \"School Anniversary Special Menu\" and \"Commemorative Event.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_40": "Chili powder... I see.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_41": "Well, being brave enough to try new things is part of our school spirit, isn't it? If regular drinks are too bland for you, this should add quite a kick.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_42": "Um, you mean... adding noodles to your drink, {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_43": "Well, I suppose it would add a distinct savory note, making the overall flavor more, uh... complex.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_44": "Though at this point, I'm not sure we can call it a drink.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_45": "Lemongrass, right? A very refreshing choice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_46": "Its featured citrusy aroma adds a delicate tartness on entry, followed by a crisp herbal finish, making it more refreshing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_47": "For your second add-in, what else would you like, {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_48": "Viscum Berry.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_49": "Sea Bunny Meat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_5": "(Today's special... A customizable drink called \"Student Council Magic,\" made just the way you like it?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_50": "Climbing Fig.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_51": "Viscum Berry... Eek, that sounds so sour—",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_52": "Ahem! No problem at all, dear guest. You heard nothing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_53": "...S-Sea Bunny Meat?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_54": "I know it's tender and succulent, but why is that even on a cafe's menu...",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_55": "Well, if you feel your drink could use a little... taste of the sea, then I suppose this could be an interesting choice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_56": "Climbing Fig is a classic dessert ingredient.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_57": "It gives the drink a soft, silky texture and makes the whole mix feel satisfyingly filling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_58": "All right, then your base drink and two add-ins are all set.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_59": "I'll go prepare the add-ins. As for how vigorously to shake your drink, I'll leave that to our other special server today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_6": "Following the poster's directions, you head into the cafe—a temporary transformation of the Student Council office.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_60": "Phoebe gives a small bow, offering you a warm, composed smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_61": "Tucking away your order slip, she takes two polite steps back before turning toward the prep counter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_62": "Hello, {PlayerName}. I'm today's special server.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_63": "It's you, Xiangli Yao. How's business at the cafe today?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_64": "Quite good. Everyone finds it rather novel. Coffee has always been one of the Student Council's trademarks, and now that you can enjoy it without joining, it's naturally drawn a good deal of interest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_65": "Back to the matter at hand. How would you like me to shake your custom drink?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_66": "A gentle shake.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_67": "SHAKE! IT! HARD!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_68": "Don't shake it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_69": "A good drink should know how to shake itself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_7": "The usually tidy entrance is decked in anniversary streamers and potted blooms, lending the room a festive air.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_70": "Understood. That allows the flavors to meld gradually without disrupting the original texture.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_71": "Xiangli Yao nods, holding the shaker in both hands as he rocks it smoothly up and down with practiced care.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_72": "Oh? Understood. You want the flavors to collide with force, I suppose?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_73": "The shaker becomes a blur in his hands as he works it vigorously, the mixture inside clattering in a rhythmic tempo of crisp and heavy thuds.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_74": "No shaking? All right, that works fine.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_75": "Certain drinks are best enjoyed layered, allowing each flavor profile to unfold naturally on the palate in sequence.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_76": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_77": "After a brief silence, Xiangli Yao sets the shaker back on the table and slowly withdraws his hands.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_78": "Hm... perhaps a truly great drink can, by its own power, make its different flavors understand and blend with one another... right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_79": "I'm not entirely sure how to go about it, but for now, let's simply wait a while.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_8": "The moment you push open the door, a warm, inviting aroma washes over you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_80": "Moments later, Xiangli Yao opens the shaker, tilts it slightly, and pours the finished drink into a coffee cup.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_81": "Now, your custom drink is finished, dear customer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_82": "Next it's time for some \"Student Council Magic.\" You may invite one of the cafe's special servers to work a little \"magic\" on your drink, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_83": "Phoebe's Magic.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_84": "Xiangli Yao's Magic.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_85": "Huh? But no one mentioned this during the training...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_86": "(...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_87": "(Attention, all units! Under no circumstances must Milady's reputation be tarnished!)",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_88": "(Prepare to move!)",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_89": "From the shadows behind the curtain, a row of black-suited guards suddenly steps out. The chief strides forward, planting himself in front of Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_9": "The air is thick with the aroma of freshly ground coffee beans, with a toasty note, rich but not overpowering.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_90": "Leave it to me, Milady!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_91": "You! What kind of magic do you want? Name it!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_92": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_93": "Somehow, you don't really want it anymore.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_94": "It's all right, I'll handle this. I may not know much about \"Student Council Magic,\" but I do know a thing or two about \"Sweet Dream Magic.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_95": "You seem busy all the time, {PlayerName}. I rarely see you rest... Could it be you can't sleep?",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_96": "The blonde girl steps forward and accepts the staff from one of the guards.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_97": "The staff rises high, tracing an elegant arc through the air, and the golden bird that sweeps down with immense force taps you lightly on the forehead.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_98": "Soft and fluffy, bright and golden, miracles and hearts aflutter—Sweet Dream Magic! Sweep all of {PlayerName}'s tiredness away!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_200_99": "Then, wearing a serene smile as if bathed in holy light, you collapse straight onto the table.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_1": "Creeeak—",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_10": "\"It... iiiiittttt... it's already seen you—\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_11": "A burst of shrill static rips through the air, then the classroom falls utterly silent. All you can hear is your own heartbeat and the recorder's hiss.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_12": "Somehow, the door you came through has been locked from the outside. To get out of the room, you'll have to find another exit.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_13": "You raise your flashlight, sweeping its beam slowly across the dark and cluttered room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_14": "A desk in the corner suddenly lets out a soft sound, as if something just fell off it...",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_2": "The hinges let out a shrill groan.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_3": "Beyond the door, the room has been dressed up as an abandoned classroom. A dim light hangs from the ceiling, barely lighting one corner.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_4": "A few old desks sit crooked, coated in dust, with chairs scattered around as if shoved aside in a hurry.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_5": "The blackboard is crammed with incomprehensible formulas and scribbles, alongside a few crooked faces defaced beyond recognition with red paint.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_6": "On the podium, an old tape recorder crackles, its damaged cassette playing back a hoarse voice in fits and starts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_7": "\"Everyone, please do not open your textbooks... Leave... at once...\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_8": "\"Bzzzt—bzzzt—\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_20_9": "\"Do not turn around... Do not answer... There are no... classmates here. No... people.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_30_1": "Slipping out through the hidden door behind the false blackboard, you find yourself back in the dark corridor. Only this stretch feels... narrower than before.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_30_10": "As the initial shock begins to wear off, you gradually notice something strange.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_30_11": "The \"ghost\" makes no attempt to chase you. Instead, she keeps repeating the same few movements, as though waiting to see how you'll react...",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_30_2": "The walls are crowded with shabby decorations—faded mottos, yellowed notices, and old certificates with curling corners. Cobwebs dangle from the ceiling, nearly brushing your shoulders.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_30_3": "An old wall clock's hour and minute hands both point at \"12,\" yet the second hand keeps quivering on the dial.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_30_4": "\"Click... click...\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_30_5": "You instinctively quicken your pace. Just as you pass a row of old lockers, one door flies open beside you without warning.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_30_6": "The metal door slams against the neighboring locker with an earsplitting clang.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_30_7": "A \"ghost\" in a worn-out school uniform pokes her head out of the locker and shoots out a hand to grab you by the arm. Long, disheveled hair spills over her shoulders, her pale face looming mere inches from yours.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_30_8": "Startled, you stumble back a step, the flashlight beam jerking and sweeping across the \"ghost's\" pale face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_30_9": "A pair of eyes peers out from behind the curtain of long hair, fixed unblinkingly on you. Her ghastly face flickers between light and shadow, as though something monstrous might leap out of the darkness at any second.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_1": "Pushing open the back door at the end of the hall, the world suddenly floods with light.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_10": "Could've been scarier...",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_11": "It'd be nice if there were more rooms and surprises along the way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_12": "That was so much fun! I'd love to go again!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_13": "Hmm... I see. We'll try to spice things up with more sound effects and better set designs next time!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_14": "We didn't have much time to prepare, so I couldn't make as many props as I'd hoped. But we'll try to get more classrooms next time!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_15": "That's not likely, I'm afraid... To provide the best experience for everyone, we only let one person in at a time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_16": "There are still quite a few students waiting outside. If you want another go, {PlayerName}, I'm afraid you might not make it through the line again...",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_17": "Oh, right! We've also got a reward for everyone who makes it through—Lucky Draw Tickets you can use at the School Anniversary festivities. Here you go, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_18": "Thanks for all your hard work, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_19": "(Time to check out other places...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_2": "The black curtain falls behind you, and the glaring sunlight makes you squint on instinct.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_3": "Congrats on making it through, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_4": "The Club Association members waiting outside gather around you and break into applause.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_5": "You made it! Congratulations!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_6": "Awesome! Another challenger made it through!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_7": "Congrats!!",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_8": "You glance back at the exit behind you. Despite the scares, looking back on it now, it all feels like a pretty fun experience.",
+  "EVENT_AVGanniversary_40_9": "How was it, {PlayerName}? Any feedback?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_1": "You arrive at the Club Association during usual club hours.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_10": "Come to think of it, we haven't hung out together ever since summer training started, have we?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_11": "Mm-hmm. I don't have to help out at the restaurant this afternoon, either.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_12": "Shall we?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_13": "Our knightly adventure begins!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_2": "In the hallway, you can still hear sounds coming from other clubs' activity rooms: students discussing new training plans, carrying equipment, and the occasional laughter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_3": "Familiar footsteps and voices mingle in the lively bustle that fills the halls almost every day after school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_4": "You're all here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_5": "Yep. It's not often we get a day off.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_6": "Oh, right! We don't have anything urgent going on at the Club Association today, either. Since we're taking a break for once... want to go hang out outside?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_7": "Sounds good!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_8": "The forum's full of new posts like, \"Ten Shops You Absolutely Can't Miss on Shopping Street! Skip 'Em and You'll Regret It!\" Come on, let's go check it out!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_100_9": "Hearing Ciaccona and Buling's suggestion, Cartethyia's eyes light up too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_1": "At dusk in the central square, several new members of the Orchestral Music Club stand shoulder to shoulder in a row.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_10": "To avoid interfering with one another, the sections practice in separate locations around campus. The wind players train in the central square.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_11": "I hope you'll remember the breathing patterns and techniques we've practiced and apply them in your performances going forward.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_12": "All right, that's it for today. We'll meet in the Club Association's activity room tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_13": "Thank you for coming, everyone. Please be careful on your way back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_14": "Cartethyia waves goodbye to the others, puts away her metronome, and hurries over to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_15": "Sorry to keep you waiting, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_16": "You've worked hard today, Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_17": "The heat lingers even at dusk. After a busy afternoon, Cartethyia's cheeks are flushed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_18": "You hand her a bottle of water. She twists off the cap, tips her head back, and gulps down nearly half of it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_19": "You've become someone the newer members look up to, Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_2": "At the front, Cartethyia turns up her palm and slowly raises it to the beat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_20": "Oh, I still have a long way to go before I'm as good a leader as you or Ciaccona, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_21": "But I'll keep honing this sword of mine... I mean, the sound of my trumpet! Maybe you'll see me in a whole new light soon, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_22": "I know you can do it, Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_23": "You've already impressed me, Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_24": "Hehe. I won't let you down, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_25": "Hmm... But I'm not there yet. I still have so much to learn and such a long way to go.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_26": "Cartethyia rises onto her toes, hands behind her back, and eyebrows raised, her eyes crinkling with delight.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_27": "Ciaccona should be about done by now. Want to go see her? We can pick up some fresh-baked chestnut bread on the way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_28": "It's best straight out of the oven. Tear it open while it's still hot and blow on it between bites. It burns your fingers a little, but it's so good!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_29": "Soft bread around a smooth, sweet filling... Then the warm chestnut fragrance slowly spreads across your tongue...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_3": "A chorus of soft, indrawn breaths rises at once. The new members instinctively puff out their chests, their shoulders rising with them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_30": "That's my own special secret! I'm only telling you because we're friends!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_31": "That does sound tempting... Should we get one for Ciaccona?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_32": "If things go well on her end, we should be able to settle on the pieces for the public performance this week.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_33": "Come to think of it, {PlayerName}, we first met at one of the club's open rehearsals.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_34": "We had a really great time...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_35": "Back then, I didn't know what a double bass was until {PlayerName} pointed it out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_36": "Now I'm a member of the Orchestral Music Club... I wouldn't have found the courage to join if it weren't for your words of encouragement, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_37": "That piece you love is called <b>With Glory I Shall Fall</b>, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_38": "After you told me about it, I looked up the story behind the piece...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_39": "Oh?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_4": "Everyone, relax your shoulders. Don't breathe from your chest. Feel the lower section of your stomach and the sides of your waist slowly expand as you breathe in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_40": "It really is an epic about a brave, selfless Blessed Maiden who leads her people ever onward.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_41": "She calls for freedom, dreams of a legendary life and thrilling adventures... Following the path of glory, she sweeps aside every enemy before her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_42": "But just as you said, she holds on to hope, breaks the shackles of darkness, and never accepts the fate laid out for her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_43": "It's a beautiful piece.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_44": "Thank you for telling me all that, {PlayerName}. Knowing you like the piece too... it makes me really happy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_5": "Listen to the metronome. Breathe in for four beats and slowly out for eight. Control the airflow. Don't let it all out at once.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_6": "Winds, steady breathing is the foundation of pitch control, tone, and endurance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_7": "Everyone releases their breath along as Cartethyia's hand slowly lowers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_8": "Most of the newcomers have no formal music training. As club manager, you decide not to start them off with a tough training schedule.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_10_9": "The wind players focus on breathing and breath control; the strings work on holding their instruments, bowing, and pitch; the percussionists practice rhythm, striking technique, and coordination.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_1": "It's an outing decided on the spot, so you have no special plans. You simply wander down Shopping Street together, stopping whenever something catches your eye.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_10": "Don't overthink it, guys!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_11": "Buling holds up her bag of snacks and offers it to everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_12": "We're out to have some fun! Oh, is that a new game shop over there? Gotta check it out!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_13": "You've been peeking at that shop nonstop, haven't you, Buling?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_14": "Wait for me! I'm almost done paying!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_15": "Hm? What are you buying?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_16": "The sword of a legendary wandering knight! In the stories, not even the Windmill Demon King who never stops spinning stands a chance against it. That's what I call a Cartethyia-style victory!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_17": "You lean in for a look with curiosity. In her hand is a tiny wooden prop sword.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_18": "Just as you are about to say something, you meet Cartethyia's radiant smile. You pause, swallow your words, and smile back in understanding.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_19": "The group walks on, chatting and laughing away. When you pass an old record store, Ciaccona turns to listen and comes to a stop without realizing it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_2": "This is the liveliest street in town, with shops standing shoulder to shoulder on both sides.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_20": "This style and the rhythm... This is perfect for us. Maybe we could draw a little inspiration from it for our original piece for the finals...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_21": "The Orchestral Music Club of a few months ago would have struggled with a passage this fast.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_22": "But the ensemble is more mature now. Even if someone falls a little behind the beat, the other sections should be able to follow and adjust quickly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_23": "Ciaccona's voice grows lighter, and her gaze settles somewhere far ahead.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_24": "Time really flies.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_25": "From when I first met Cartethyia and {PlayerName}, to the recruitment show and all those rehearsals... Our story will soon reach its final movement.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_26": "The Orchestral Music Club now has what it takes to compete for gold in the National Music Competition.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_27": "Alright! Let's keep this momentum going. I won't miss a single chance to promote our club!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_28": "With that, she pulls a thick stack of flyers from the instrument bag on her back and starts handing them out to passersby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_29": "Hey, Cartethyia, where did you get that popsicle? And it's the Shopping Street limited-time flavor, if I'm not mistaken... I want one!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_3": "Shop windows display the latest seasonal goods, bright sale posters cover the glass, and colorful signs jut out from beneath the eaves.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_30": "Give it back, Ciaccona! That's the last one—",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_31": "Whoa, careful, Cartethyia! My chips! You're going to spill them!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_32": "Ciaccona, your flyers are slipping... Got them! That was close.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_33": "Hehe, come on! {PlayerName}, give me a hand with the flyers!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_34": "Looking at the clamor and your giggling friends, you can't help but laugh too. Amid the cheerful commotion, you turn the next corner together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_35": "To first place in the Nationals finals, Orchestral Music Club!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_4": "The setting sun sinks toward the far end of Shopping Street. Orange-red light slants between the eaves, bathing the signs and passing figures in warmth.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_5": "Streetlights flicker on one by one. A nearby food stall sends up plumes of steam, while the evening breeze carries the scent of grilled and fried snacks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_6": "It feels so nice to just wander around and enjoy the evening breeze once in a while.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_7": "As she speaks, Ciaccona lifts her arms high and stretches.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_8": "I'm still on my feet, but somehow all the exhaustion just melted away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_110_9": "I know! Usually I'm either practicing trumpet or in class during this time. It feels strange not having a schedule to worry about for once.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_1": "Oh, {PlayerName}'s here!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_10": "You have to believe a future is attainable as you work towards it, don't you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_100": "Depending on how they're played, instruments within the orchestra fall into three main families: wind, string, and percussion sections.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_101": "Hmm... Let's start with the wind section.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_102": "Cartethyia introduces the instruments in each section one by one.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_103": "(They don't seem to know much about orchestral music. Maybe they're curious and want to give it a try over the break.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_104": "(Club manager, huh...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_105": "(If I've got this right, I'm supposed to handle scheduling, coordinate the members, manage supplies, and see to competition matters so the club can train and perform.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_106": "(While Cartethyia gets the newcomers acquainted with the club, I should...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_107": "Sort out the members list.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_108": "Check the instruments' condition.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_109": "Even with recent recruits, the Orchestral Music Club only has twelve members, which is barely enough to cover a few sections.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_11": "Exactly. People often need to believe in themselves before they'll take the first step.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_110": "But orchestral music isn't a one-man rodeo.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_111": "Even a reasonably small orchestra needs enough players in strings, woodwinds, brass, and percussion.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_112": "That means around twenty people at the bare minimum.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_113": "The other problem being: the club doesn't have enough instruments, either.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_114": "Even if every member is assigned a part, some sections still can't perform together without their intended instrumentation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_115": "A few spare instruments sit in storage, but hardly any are ready for immediate use.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_116": "Not to mention some of the instruments the club is already using haven't been maintained in a long time, and they're not in great shape.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_117": "Consumables and cleaning supplies need restocking too: strings, bow hair, reeds, rosin, and the like.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_118": "Judging from the rate the club will be going through them during summer training, these supplies may not last long.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_119": "The other problem being: the club barely has enough members to cover a few sections.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_12": "By believing, trying, and persevering, time after time, a future that was once only possible can become reality.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_120": "When the full ensemble finally comes together, there will probably be many empty chairs.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_121": "Even if every member is assigned a part, some sections still can't perform together without their intended instrumentation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_122": "(Besides recruiting and training, I'll need to find a way to buy or borrow more instruments...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_123": "(Posters and flyers can only do so much. Why not let people listen to our performance, as we did at the start of the school year?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_124": "(But from what Cartethyia mentioned, Ciaccona probably won't have time for the next few days. I'll talk to her about a public performance next week.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_125": "(Speaking of publicity... maybe Buling can help. I'll ask her before the weekend.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_13": "That's the spirit! Having a little humility and caution is a good thing. How does that one saying go again...? \"Honor what you have achieved, then assess those that you have missed\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_14": "I like that. We should value what we've achieved and not take all that hard work for granted.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_15": "Exactly. Recognize your efforts and be honest about your shortcomings. That way, each success can become the beginning of something more.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_16": "Love the energy from you, {PlayerName}! Since we haven't started our practice for today, let me catch you up on the club and our plans for the summer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_17": "I'll be honest... everyone was there for the qualifiers, but a few members dropped out before summer break so they could focus on the Qualifying Exam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_18": "After the qualifiers, Leader Ciaccona and I recruited new members while the excitement was fresh. But everyone is still getting to know one another.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_19": "Not to mention we aren't the most popular choice among the other clubs in the Club Association...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_2": "The moment you step into the Orchestral Music Club's activity room, Ciaccona's eyes light up at the sight of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_20": "Practice usually runs long, and it takes a lot of hard work, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_21": "Stamina matters a lot, especially if you play standing up or perform a longer piece. That's why physical training is also part of our regular training.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_22": "So to sum up—",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_23": "The club was short on members already, and now things are even worse?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_24": "You don't hold back, do you, {PlayerName}...? Ahaha... Though now that you mention it, I guess we really have been in recruiting mode.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_25": "Thanks to Celestial Steed Corp, the club isn't at risk of shutting down for now, at least. But we still don't have enough players for an ensemble, so everyone has to practice separately.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_26": "Ciaccona slumps facedown on the table and wilts there miserably for a while before lifting her head to go on.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_27": "You know... the club's previous leader transferred during my first year.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_28": "I was new, but since I had experience in a wind band before, I went ahead and took over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_29": "Maybe it was because all the club's veteran members were about to graduate, but everyone was still hyped to be in the Nationals that year.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_3": "Cartethyia looks up from polishing her trumpet and gives you a shy, grateful smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_30": "Even with a rookie like me leading them, we got first place... Not that it meant anything.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_31": "Huh? First place... that didn't mean anything?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_32": "Correction. First place in the National Music Competition's elimination round.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_33": "Sounds pretty cool, but advancement from that round depends on where your team finishes in the ladder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_34": "We didn't make the top three, so we never reached the finals.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_35": "That's when I made a vow to myself: I'd lead everyone to the National Music Competition finals and win the actual first that truly meant something.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_36": "But this year, I'll be graduating too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_37": "As club leader for three years running, Ciaccona looks from the fresh-faced juniors beside her to you, standing there to help out. A gentle, genuine smile spreads across her face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_38": "Well... with that out of the way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_39": "The club might be facing a membership crisis, but...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_4": "Good morning, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_40": "As long as everyone has fun playing music and cherishes the time we spend together, that's more than enough for me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_41": "Besides, graduating doesn't mean we'll never get to see each other again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_42": "Goodbyes are just preludes to reunions. If we get all teary over the result of one competition, it would be awkward when we meet again, don't you think?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_43": "You've worked so hard for this club, Leader Ciaccona.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_44": "We will bring the trophy home this year.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_45": "The Orchestral Music Club can't be the only club running activities over summer break. I'm pretty sure there would be plenty of other students coming back to campus.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_46": "If recruitment is a problem we can't ignore, let's use this chance to put on another public performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_47": "Um, actually...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_48": "The real problem we can't ignore is... on Ciaccona's end.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_49": "Cartethyia gives Ciaccona a nervous look. She wants to say something, but holds it in, her face full of exasperation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_5": "Ha! I knew Cartethyia would get you here. With {PlayerName} on our side, we could win ten gold awards at the Nationals, no sweat!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_50": "Ciaccona scratches her cheek uneasily and gives you a sheepish smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_51": "Well, um... You know what they say: you can't be good at math and orchestra at the same time!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_52": "(That sounds like something Miss Verina would say...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_53": "While preparing for the qualifiers, Ciaccona practiced her fingering during study halls and even on the way home. At night, she often stayed up late studying the scores.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_54": "It got in the way of her finals. She overslept in the morning and missed her math exam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_55": "She missed it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_56": "As Cartethyia speaks, her expression darkens. Storm clouds seem to gather in the activity room, ready to break at any moment.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_57": "She missed it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_58": "Even during the days before the makeup exam, she was busy planning our summer training. And she didn't pass that one either.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_59": "She failed the makeup exam? But I was always under the impression that Ciaccona was a straight-A student.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_6": "Make that twenty!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_60": "Hearing your question, Ciaccona averts her eyes with a peculiar look on her face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_61": "Uh, I got so wrapped up in the scores that I mixed up the date for the makeup exam... so, uh, I missed it again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_62": "So for this week, our Club Association representative at Second Solaris School and leader of the Orchestral Music Club, Ciaccona—",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_63": "—Will be spending every moment outside of summer training in Miss Verina's office.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_64": "You didn't have to spell it all out, Acting Leader Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_65": "A newcomer from across the sea takes charge the moment she arrives. Come on, tell me that's not a great story...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_66": "Well, look at the time. I'll leave today's new-member training to you two.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_67": "I-I need to go check in at Miss Verina's office!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_68": "Ciaccona presses her palms together and bows twice in quick succession, her face all but saying, \"I'm counting on you two!\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_69": "The words are barely out of her mouth when she spins around, darts out of the activity room, and flees from your sight.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_7": "That's a bit much, Ciaccona.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_70": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_71": "Oh, I almost forgot! Make sure you give our <color=#d19f27>Club Manager {PlayerName}</color> a rundown of the summer training, Acting Leader.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_72": "Ciaccona doubles back and leans halfway into the room from the doorway.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_73": "She fires off the reminder, then darts back behind the door with a \"whoosh\" and vanishes again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_74": "Then I'll leave it to our Acting Leader to fill me in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_75": "Club manager? Nobody told me...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_76": "The National Music Competition finals include two categories: a set piece and an original piece. I'll be organizing training for the set piece.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_77": "Ciaccona will take the lead on the original piece.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_78": "She'll decide on its style and overall structure, then arrange the instruments to suit the players we have.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_79": "You're thoughtful, and you know the members well. So we'd like you to be our club manager, {PlayerName}, and help coordinate the club's everyday workings.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_8": "That's the spirit! Now, how does that one saying go again...? \"First imagine it, then make it happen\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_80": "Yes. We'd like you to be our club manager, {PlayerName}, and help coordinate the club's everyday workings.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_81": "The National Music Competition finals include two categories: a set piece and an original piece. Ciaccona and I will each take charge of one separately.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_82": "You're thoughtful, and you know the members well, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_83": "With you supporting us, the core members can focus on training and the competition.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_84": "It's tedious, demanding work, and we decided all this without your consent...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_85": "Don't worry about it. I can handle it. I want you all to be able to take the stage without having to worry about anything else.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_86": "Cartethyia pauses at your unhesitating answer. Then her eyes light up, and her voice is much lighter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_87": "I'm so glad you're willing to help, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_88": "I've always believed you'd be the final light that brings our stage to life, {PlayerName}. A light for all of us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_89": "You brush a stray lock of hair from Cartethyia's face. Your fingertips accidentally graze her ear, and you feel how warm it is.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_9": "What Leader Ciaccona means is... even if events have not yet come to pass, you can picture a desirable outcome for yourself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_90": "Outside the window, the cicadas' tireless, piercing chorus grows louder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_91": "Cartethyia lowers her head. With just the two of you in the activity room, even the air conditioner's cool breeze seems to grow warm.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_92": "Sorry to interrupt...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_93": "Excuse me, is this the Orchestral Music Club?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_94": "Oh, hello! Are you our new members? Here for the summer training?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_95": "Mm-hmm...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_96": "The two new members arrive just in time to break the summer heat and silence, holding you and Cartethyia captive.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_97": "I'm Cartethyia. Acting Club Leader. I play the trumpet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_98": "This is our Club Manager, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_1_99": "Have either of you had any experience with orchestral music? If you're not familiar with any of the instruments, I can give you a quick introduction.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_1": "You and Cartethyia arrive at the sitting area behind the Teaching Building. Ciaccona sits leaning against the back of a bench, arms folded, gazing up at the sky.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_10": "Sorry about that. I got a little carried away thinking about the music.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_100": "You exchange a look with Cartethyia, and the two of you share a knowing smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_101": "Buling arrives at just the right moment, immediately clearing the gloom settling over the group.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_102": "I didn't expect to find you here, Buling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_103": "I was just passing by! I saw this new post on the school forum that went something like...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_104": "Go to the school sitting area at dusk. Wait quietly behind the seventh bench under the third cherry tree, and you'll hear...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_105": "Buling pauses for effect. Chisa and Cartethyia hold their breath.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_106": "...A sudden singing voice, one that belongs to an angel.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_107": "But once you let your guard down, the song gradually turns into...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_108": "Ciaccona's expression suddenly changes. You notice her fingers slowly tightening their grip on the bench.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_109": "The other two swallow nervously, eager to hear what comes next.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_11": "It went well. Everyone gave their best. Here, Ciaccona, this is for you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_110": "Could it be... a new school ghost story?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_111": "...Waves of strange, faint shrieks! And every so often, rapid, senseless muttering repeats a few words nobody can make out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_112": "You guys hearing this? The story gets weirder every time someone tells it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_113": "There are no such things as ghosts and spirits in the world. People fear the unknown, then make up whatever they've heard secondhand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_114": "As the saying goes, \"You can't fear what you can name.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_115": "Once you can name what scares you, you're able to recognize it and explain it. Nothing to be afraid of then.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_116": "That's why I came to get to the bottom of this myself. No point leaving everyone on edge.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_117": "I see. We are the only ones using the sitting area today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_118": "Yeah, everyone in the comments sounds scared out of their minds.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_119": "The latest sighting was posted today, so I came straight over to investigate.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_12": "You and Cartethyia sit at the other end of the bench and hand Ciaccona a warm paper bag giving off a fragrant aroma.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_120": "The commenter said they saw a red-haired girl on a bench, singing while she kept scribbling in a notebook.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_121": "Ciaccona's cheeks burn hotter by the second. She hides her face behind both hands, but her ears, glowing red through her hair, give her away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_122": "If Buling and Cartethyia keep going, steam might start pouring from the top of Ciaccona's head.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_123": "The Orchestral Music Club's leader struggles in visible agony for a while before speaking in a tiny voice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_124": "But perhaps you've already guessed the answer to the ghost story.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_125": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_126": "...That... was me writing music.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_127": "I was coming up with an original piece for the finals...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_128": "I have to factor in how it'll sound in an actual performance, which sections we have, the number of instruments needed, and what the principal player of each instrument group can manage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_129": "That's why I wanted to start early... And once I've written a bit of music, I have to hum the melody to hear how it sounds.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_13": "Chestnut bread. Fresh out of the oven.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_130": "But inspiration doesn't just magically appear. When I get stuck, I sometimes make these weird noises without meaning to...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_131": "Huh?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_132": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_133": "Cartethyia freezes. Then she quietly turns her back on Ciaccona, shoulders shaking with suppressed laughter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_134": "She tries so hard to hold it in that her clenched fingers turn white.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_135": "It's okay, Carty. I can already hear you...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_136": "Hey, someone just posted a comment! Let's see... Huh? They don't believe the explanation? Ugh, how stubborn...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_137": "Haha, I'm doomed. A club leader turned into a ghost story. How are we ever going to get anyone to join our club...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_138": "Ciaccona closes her eyes in despair and sits rigid on the bench like a statue.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_139": "Oh, you know what, Ciaccona? That idea of yours might be a huge hit!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_14": "It's still hot, but that's when it tastes best! Give it a slight blow as you tear off a piece and enjoy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_140": "Buling, you mean...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_141": "Yes, you guessed it! I know just the plan to promote the club!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_142": "I see where you're going. No wonder you're the school forum's moderator.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_143": "Wait, what was that about? You two were talking too fast. I'm completely lost...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_144": "Hang tight. I'll start a new thread on the forum and give it a headline people can't ignore.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_145": "Where does the mysterious singing at dusk come from? What unspeakable secret lurks behind those eerie sounds that ring out from time to time?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_146": "Who is the red-haired girl waiting for as she lingers at the school sitting area long after sunset?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_147": "What has she written in that dark notebook? And what strange turn will her words bring next...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_148": "This thread takes you straight to the scene, uncovering the truth behind these uncanny events!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_149": "Whoa, that headline is enough to fill several episodes of <b>Departing Science</b>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_15": "Oh, I like the sound of that... Mmm, it smells wonderful! This is from that old bakery in town, isn't it? It tastes just as good as it did when I was little.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_150": "I see it now. You're using everyone's curiosity to draw attention to the Orchestral Music Club.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_151": "Although I admit this doesn't feel entirely right. I'm sorry, Ciaccona.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_152": "It's fine. It might actually work wonders as advertisement.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_153": "I'll be honest, even I'm starting to look forward to seeing how this goes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_154": "Ciaccona gives you an encouraging fist pump, as if to say she'll take care of everything.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_155": "I'll do my best as the star of the school's ghost story... and tomorrow's top story on the school forum!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_156": "I'm so sorry, Ciaccona. But this'll probably bring in a lot more people than handing out flyers or putting up posters.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_157": "And people might be interested in coming to investigate the mystery themselves!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_158": "Yep. Once we draw them here, they can watch the Orchestral Music Club's rehearsal and performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_159": "After the rehearsal, we can explain what really happened and apologize to everyone. Which I think should be fine.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_16": "Ciaccona tosses the chestnut bread back and forth in her hands, trying to cool it. As it drops toward her palm, she quickly tears off a small piece and pops it into her mouth.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_160": "Buling nods in agreement, then grows serious.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_161": "I think so too. All coins have two sides. As long as no one gets hurt, a rumor can be a handy tool if we use it right.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_162": "Oh, and Buling, we'll need quite a few performers for the recruitment show. Can you find us some?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_163": "Right now, the Orchestral Music Club doesn't have enough members for a complete ensemble...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_164": "Finding people? Piece of cake.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_165": "I'll pin a post on the school forum and ask if any former members want to come back for a show, or if other clubs can lend a hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_166": "That would be a huge help, Buling! You can have all my Pasta Bocadillo! No, wait. How about I treat you to dinner instead?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_167": "Which one do you like? Pizza Classica or Pizza Tropicale?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_168": "Cartethyia shoots her hand up and answers before anyone else can.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_169": "Laurus Salad Pizza!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_17": "It's still a bit hot. Ciaccona's cheeks puff out, and she can't quite close her mouth, but a blissful sigh escapes her anyway.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_170": "If you don't mind... would you all like to come to my family's restaurant for a meal together?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_171": "It's getting late today. Let's all go another time. We can discuss more with Chisa about the performance venue then, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_172": "Of course. The Liaison Center has connections with plenty of sponsors.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_173": "So choosing our music is all that's left, right? Cartethyia and I better get to work then.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_174": "You can count on me, Leader!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_18": "Whoa... That's really good!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_19": "Right? It's enough to make your exhaustion go away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_2": "A light breeze brushes a few strands of hair across her forehead. Ciaccona stays still, her brows faintly furrowed. Occasionally she lets out a long sigh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_20": "If only picking a piece worked like enjoying chestnut bread... One warm bite and inspiration would come flowing in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_21": "Hit a snag?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_22": "More like all sorts of snags...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_23": "Ciaccona counts her fingers, listing each issue.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_24": "Finding a venue, adapting the scores to fit our lineup, designing flyers, whether or not we should invite other clubs for a joint performance, and whether we offer on-site sign-ups after the show...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_25": "Leave it to your club manager.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_26": "Then it's my time to shine.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_27": "That's what I like to hear, {PlayerName}. Honestly, it's really reassuring knowing you're here for support...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_28": "Oh! That was such a cool thing to say... And I agree. You really have a way of solving these problems, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_29": "I'll handle the promotional materials, the venue, and rehearsal schedules. You and Cartethyia can focus on choosing the pieces.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_3": "Sheets of staff paper lie spread across the other end of the bench beside a pencil, an eraser, and a notebook with curled edges. Inside it are several scores covered in markings and labels.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_30": "I'm the club manager now, so it's only right that I do my part.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_31": "...I'll be honest, I had quite a few pieces in mind for the public performance at first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_32": "Ciaccona takes the scores from her notebook, puts them in order, and spreads them over her lap. Her fingertips linger on the top page.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_33": "I thought we'd pick a few and try them out in rehearsal. But once I actually looked at the scores, I realized it's not as easy as it looks...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_34": "First, this one: <b>The Trepak</b>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_35": "Oh, I know that piece!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_36": "It's so full of energy and passion, and the melody practically makes you want to dance to it. It really would be lovely for a public performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_37": "So it's a piece that sounds... festive?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_38": "Exactly. Even someone hearing orchestral music for the first time could easily fall in love with it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_39": "The problem being, <b>The Trepak</b> needs a fairly complete string section. Violins, basses, and the inner parts that fill out the sound... We can't do without any of them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_4": "It's clear the piece selection isn't going well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_40": "And, well, you both know how many people we have at the moment.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_41": "In that case... should we try combining a few sections on the spot for a better performance?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_42": "If we're careful about it, that could work.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_43": "But it might affect the overall sound.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_44": "The full orchestral version does rely on a complete string section to underpin the melody.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_45": "As Chisa pointed out, we could try combining parts that play similar roles.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_46": "As long as we preserve the core rhythm and main harmony, we won't lose what makes the dance special.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_47": "Hmm... That means adapting the score and reworking the instruments line up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_48": "It's doable, but if we're aiming for the finals, maybe we should avoid playing around with the arrangements for now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_49": "True...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_5": "Hi, Ciaccona. I brought {PlayerName} with me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_50": "But if this public performance is meant to attract new members, we should let the audience hear how different sections resonate with one another.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_51": "If we make too many changes to the original score to match our current numbers, they may not get to hear what really makes orchestral music exciting.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_52": "True. If our goal is to reach the finals, perhaps we should avoid arrangements for now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_53": "Ciaccona pops the last piece of chestnut bread into her mouth and picks up the second score beside her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_54": "Huh? Wait, Chisa? When did you get here...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_55": "Oh, I didn't know Chisa was here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_56": "Mm. You all seemed deep in discussion, so I didn't want to interrupt you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_57": "A few days ago, some students from the Club Association came to me about holding a small exhibition on campus, and I came over to check on possible venues today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_58": "I'm so sorry! We got so caught up in our discussion that we didn't notice you...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_59": "Ciaccona waves a hand sheepishly. You and Cartethyia shift along the bench to make room for Chisa between you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_6": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_60": "I brought some chestnut bread. Would you like some, Chisa? They're still warm!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_61": "For... me? Thank you, Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_62": "Mm, the sweetness... My classmates used to say, \"If you frown too much, your blood sugar will drop.\" So they'd sometimes give me chocolate bars or other candies.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_63": "Sweets really are an efficient way to replenish energy, though.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_64": "You've got a crumb on your cheek, Chisa.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_65": "Right here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_66": "Chisa freezes for a moment, then reaches where Cartethyia is pointing. Her fingertips soon find the tiny crumb.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_67": "She brushes it away with the back of her hand and turns her head aside slightly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_68": "Ahem... Since you're here, Chisa, we'd like to hear your thoughts on piece selection.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_69": "Let's see, the other one is... Hmm, this instrument layout is a better match for us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_7": "Cartethyia's call fades into the air without an answer. Ciaccona remains on the bench, face tipped skyward, without so much as shifting position.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_70": "<b>Wind Octet</b>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_71": "...That's a hard one!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_72": "You're not very familiar with the piece, but the moment Ciaccona says its name, Cartethyia cries out in surprise.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_73": "Seeing Chisa's puzzled expression, Cartethyia points to a short passage in the middle of the score and explains softly:",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_74": "Starting from here, several parts change rhythm at once, and the handoff between instruments has to be extremely on point.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_75": "Let's see... It sounds a little like... \"Pow!\" And one of the instruments comes in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_76": "Then another part goes \"da-da-da!\" right after it, stops with a \"bam!\" and then, \"clack,\" they all change rhythm together as a new passage cuts in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_77": "Yes, yes! That's exactly it. Wow, Cartethyia, maybe you really are an orchestral genius...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_78": "The explanation is vivid enough, but for some reason you can't help smiling at how serious Cartethyia looked while she made all those sound effects.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_79": "One so clear that even Principal Abby would understand it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_8": "Ciaccona? LEADER CIACCONA—",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_80": "In a traditional orchestra, a mistake in one part can sometimes be masked by the sound of the others.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_81": "But in <b>Wind Octet</b>, the interlocking rhythms and shifting dynamics between instruments leave no room for anyone's mistake to hide.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_82": "If we're going to choose this piece, I'm afraid we'll be spending most of our rehearsal time on refining technical problems.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_83": "I don't suppose... the point of a public performance is to prove how good the Orchestral Music Club can play a certain difficult piece, is it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_84": "Right. If we make everyone practice over and over just for the sake of playing a difficult piece, they might not even enjoy performing anymore by the time they're ready.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_85": "Seeing that everyone understands the situation, Ciaccona decides there's no need for more examples and slips the remaining scores back into her notebook.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_86": "How do we come up with a piece that's truly ours...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_87": "She leans back, pulls another chestnut bread roll from the paper bag, now cool enough to touch, and tips her head up to gaze at the sky again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_88": "Nom!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_89": "Om, Nom nom... Munch!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_9": "Oh! There you are. How did the wind training go?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_90": "H-hey! That's my chestnut bread!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_91": "A few quick munches, and most of the bread in Ciaccona's hand is gone before she can react.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_92": "At some point, a girl with pale blue hair has slipped up behind you. While Ciaccona is distracted, the girl leans in and takes a few quick bites off of the bread in Ciaccona's hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_93": "After a few mouthfuls, Buling swallows the last bite with a satisfied gulp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_94": "She wipes a few crumbs from the corner of her mouth with the back of her hand, then sits at the end of the bench beside Ciaccona.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_95": "Hiya! Good afternoon, everybody!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_96": "And thank you for the chestnut bread, Ciaccona. I appreciate the generosity!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_97": "The cramped bench bears more weight than it ever expected to in its life as a bench. All five of you somehow squeeze on, shoulders pressed together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_98": "Ciaccona pouts and gives Buling a few sharp nudges with her elbow, as payback for the stolen bread.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_20_99": "Then, apparently realizing how childish she's being, Ciaccona is the first to laugh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_25_1": "After discussing the program, the Orchestral Music Club begins preparing for next month's public performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_25_2": "With your, Buling, and Chisa's coordination, the venue, promotion materials, and performers are settled one by one. The club members throw themselves into training with fresh resolve.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_25_3": "Summer training passes in a flash, and the summer break you share with the Orchestral Music Club is already half over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_25_4": "It's now August. The public performance, which you hope will introduce more members to the club, goes ahead as planned.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_25_5": "But once you step onto the stage... one problem follows another.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_25_6": "Far fewer people came to watch than expected, and no new members join after the show.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_25_7": "The club finishes every piece, but after the disappointing result, the weariness and hopes you have carried through all this training weigh heavier than ever.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_25_8": "After so much training, the gap between your hopes and the result leaves some members dissatisfied and doubtful. During another rehearsal not long afterward...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_25_9": "The complaints and tensions building for so long finally erupt in the Orchestral Music Club's activity room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_1": "...I know you've been thinking that if we put on a show first, people will get to know about the club and want to join.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_10": "Recruitment was out of the question. It took determination just to finish the performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_100": "All I want is for us to enjoy orchestral music together, then step onto bigger stages and go further than we ever have.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_101": "Ciaccona suddenly bends forward and bows to everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_102": "I'm sorry, everyone. As leader of the Orchestral Music Club, I'm responsible for the exhaustion and pressure you've all experienced.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_103": "We're still a long way from the National Music Competition. But if we keep moving forward, we'll be closer to that goal than we are today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_104": "Even if it's just one small step, I still... don't want to give up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_105": "Ciaccona keeps her head lowered, her shoulders trembling faintly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_106": "Cartethyia strides over to stand beside Ciaccona.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_107": "The blonde girl turns to give you a determined look, then bows just as deeply.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_108": "Please, everyone. Please don't go.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_109": "Let us perform together again... and give it everything we've got.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_11": "We're not saying the performance doesn't have a meaning. But that \"meaning\" you're talking about is just something you tell yourselves to feel better.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_110": "Buling and Chisa exchange a glance and join them. All four stand shoulder to shoulder and bow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_111": "Please stay.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_112": "Please!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_113": "I'm sure some people may watch our performance and still end up not joining. But for a new student, it might be the first time they learn our school has an Orchestral Music Club.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_114": "Maybe next month, maybe next semester, maybe next year, or maybe even after graduation, they might still remember that performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_115": "Like Ciaccona said, the feelings people poured into music long ago echo through time. Follow the notes, and we can meet again in that very music.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_116": "So please give the Orchestral Music Club another chance. And have a little more faith in yourselves.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_117": "Next time, I'll promote the show like never before. Raffles, prize draws, surprise gifts... Leave it all to me!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_118": "I'll reach out to students in other clubs and ask if they'd like to perform with us, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_119": "If people want something more popular, I'll make some tweaks, and we can play them as our encore.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_12": "You can't pretend the show wasn't a failure just because you found it meaningful.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_120": "And then... let's put on another performance at the end of summer break.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_121": "The world is vast and wild. This is only our beginning. There's so much we need to do, and so much we can do.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_122": "Let's give it our all, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_123": "Cartethyia winks at you. She walks over, rises on tiptoe, and leans close to your ear.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_124": "Thank you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_125": "The way you handle things is truly reassuring, {PlayerName}. And it's also...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_126": "...Really cool.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_13": "You keep saying it's for recruitment, so we need people to hear about the Orchestral Music Club first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_14": "But I doubt anyone who sat through our last performance could even tell which sections we're missing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_15": "Last time we didn't recruit a single qualified member. Do we really have to do it all again? Practice our fingers to the bone on another pointless piece?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_16": "Everyone, please calm down...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_17": "Exactly. The training's already more than we can take.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_18": "When I joined, you said we'd get to relax and enjoy performing music together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_19": "And now? You're forcing us to enter the National Music Competition.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_2": "But do you really think one show is enough to get everyone interested? That was a bit of wishful thinking on your part from the start, wasn't it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_20": "...My fingers are killing me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_21": "I can't take anymore of these rehearsals. Who knows how many more boring shows we'll have to do? And competing at Nationals... That's just a pipe dream.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_22": "I'm out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_23": "Me too. I've been blowing into this thing every day my lips are numb.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_24": "Before you even enter the activity room, you can clearly hear a heated argument through the door.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_25": "Enough is enough. In a real orchestral club, the leader doesn't decide what everyone plays on their own.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_26": "If we're really aiming for the Nationals, we should master the set piece instead of spending time on easy music for a public show.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_27": "We'd be better off putting on a show people actually like to see.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_28": "Honestly, even a simple raffle might draw more people than just a musical performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_29": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_3": "If performances really brought in members, we'd already have filled the club at the open rehearsal before the semester started.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_30": "Come on, everyone. Just because one show didn't work out doesn't mean the direction is hopeless, does it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_31": "Everyone... If you have ideas for the public performance, feel free to send them my way after today's practice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_32": "If they're feasible, the Liaison Center will do its best to help coordinate them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_33": "Tch...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_34": "That's enough.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_35": "Arguing now won't help. I know you've all worked hard all this time, and it's natural to feel frustrated.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_36": "But we have our reason for entering the National Music Competition. Whatever happens, please set your differences aside for now and work together as a team.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_37": "Ooh, easy for you to say. And what's this \"reason\" you're talking about?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_38": "After listening quietly for a while, you begin to understand the argument. You push open the door to the activity room and look around at everyone inside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_39": "Their faces reveal different feelings, but the air between them is taut as a drawn bow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_4": "...But...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_40": "Ciaccona stands by the window, head lowered, one hand lightly holding her arm. She remains quiet. Across the room, Cartethyia also looks down, but her hand is clenched tight at her side.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_41": "Chisa's face gives nothing away, but there is a faint displeasure in her bearing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_42": "Next to Chisa, Buling folds her arms and shakes her head helplessly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_43": "The last public performance didn't bring in nearly enough new members, falling far short of everyone's expectations.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_44": "Long hours of practice, hopes pinned on recruitment, and then disappointment...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_45": "Today, the frustration building inside the club members finally boils over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_46": "Thank you for working so hard these past few weeks, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_47": "You give them an encouraging look and stride into the middle of the group.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_48": "The Orchestral Music Club has had a difficult road. Our previous performance only came together thanks to your hard work and support.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_49": "I understand your concerns.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_5": "Not long ago, the Orchestral Music Club put on a public performance in the hope of recruiting new members.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_50": "Address the training intensity.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_51": "Address the music choice for the performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_52": "As club manager, I didn't plan our training carefully enough. That's partially why you're all exhausted and sore.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_53": "So for tomorrow and the day after, you can decide whether to attend practice based on how you're feeling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_54": "If you need a break, no need to push yourself. Take some time to rest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_55": "Since we're all here today, we can also talk about the music scores for our future performances.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_56": "As you said, one person shouldn't decide the music for a whole orchestra.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_57": "If you need a break, don't push yourself. You can skip practice tomorrow and the day after and get some rest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_58": "But since we're all here, let's talk about what we should play for future performances.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_59": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_6": "On the performance day, several members called in sick at the last minute because of stage fright. Every section had to make adjustments.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_60": "I think we could play something more popular. Something like... a Fleet Snowfluff song.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_61": "Most people who listen to orchestral music are already interested in classical music or orchestras. Pop music might draw a wider audience, don't you think?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_62": "Playing a pop song on orchestral instruments could be an appeal in itself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_63": "Or we could just play easier beginner pieces. Then students thinking about joining wouldn't be put off by difficult music.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_64": "If they feel they could play a whole piece themselves after some practice, they'd be much more motivated.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_65": "I still think handing out gift boxes or running a raffle would work better.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_66": "Besides, Chisa from the Liaison Center is helping us, isn't she? Finding a few sponsors to donate some prizes shouldn't be a problem.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_67": "Hm...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_68": "Ciaccona slowly bites her lower lip, a shadow settling over her face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_69": "Chisa, unexpectedly drawn into the conversation, doesn't respond. She turns her head away in silence, averting her gaze.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_7": "Once the performance began, the club struggled. The last-minute changes led to mistakes in rhythm, pitch, and transitions between parts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_70": "I think I have a general idea of everyone's suggestions. What do you think, Ciaccona?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_71": "Me...? Haha. I think they're all good ideas... All of them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_72": "Ciaccona.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_73": "You interrupt her and offer a question to everyone present.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_74": "Do you have a passion for music?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_75": "I... Of course I do.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_76": "A melody isn't always full of beauty and hope. But our hearts can still give it a meaning of its own.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_77": "Even if we live in different eras, we can follow the notes... cross the ocean of time, and join hands in music and poetry.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_78": "Whether it's a glorious symphonic epic, the passionate, free counterpoint of a chaconne, or a movement that carries sorrow and parting...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_79": "The feelings our predecessors poured into them pass from one performer's hands to the next, echoing through eternity.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_8": "The more embarrassing part... far fewer people came to watch than you had expected.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_80": "To share those almost miraculous feelings with more people through melody... That's why I picked up an instrument and began performing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_81": "Ciaccona keeps her head down, but there is a faint note of relief in her voice. She clasps her hands against her chest, releasing her hold on her arm.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_82": "The others fall quiet too, avoiding your gaze as though a little ashamed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_83": "What about everyone else?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_84": "I enjoy seeing everyone's smiles. That's why I love orchestral music and the time we spend playing together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_85": "I love the rehearsals, performances, and sharing tasty treats with everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_86": "When I'm with everyone in the club, even the air is full of sweetness and laughter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_87": "I-I feel the same way, actually.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_88": "As the club's manager, I want more people to join us just as much as you do.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_89": "I've listened carefully to all your suggestions, and there are quite a few that are worth trying.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_9": "The venue was in the middle of nowhere on campus, and the scheduling was poor. As if a bad venue and bad timing weren't enough, other clubs were holding events nearby that same day. The handful of people who came listened for a while, then got up and left.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_90": "You step forward and gently pat Ciaccona's shoulder, letting her know you'll handle what comes next.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_91": "I trust that every one of us is here because we care about the Orchestral Music Club. So I'd like us all to think about something.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_92": "If we did all that, would we still be the Orchestral Music Club?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_93": "Are we performing just to recruit members, or do we want more people to hear us because we love the orchestra?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_94": "Recruitment matters, of course. But it's never been our ultimate goal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_95": "That's right... Ciaccona and I want more people to join because we want them to pick up an instrument and play the music they love together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_96": "If we give up the music we truly want to play just for attraction...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_97": "Even if the performance draws new members, they probably won't stay in the Orchestral Music Club for long.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_98": "To me, at least, that would be the opposite of what I had wished for.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_30_99": "Whether it's a recruitment show or the National Music Competition, whether you're an audience or a performer...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_35_1": "Ciaccona and Cartethyia's words touched everyone present.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_35_2": "Even if a performance brings in no new members right away, it can still leave a memory of orchestral music with those who listened.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_35_3": "As emotions calm down, everyone feels a twinge of regret and decides to give each other a second chance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_35_4": "Getting gold at the National Music Competition remains the goal. The club also adjusts its promotional strategy and program for the public show, while preserving each piece's core and the character of orchestral music.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_35_5": "Training flies by, and the days quietly pass in rehearsals and ensemble practice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_35_6": "Page after page of sheet music turns, and familiar melodies sound again and again. Evenings grow cold, and the afternoon sun loses its midsummer heat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_35_7": "Before you know it, summer break is nearly over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_35_8": "In the final week of summer break, the day of the Orchestral Music Club's second public performance finally arrives...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_1": "Two months pass in a blink. At long last, the demanding, yet productive training comes to an end.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_10": "Before Cartethyia can finish, a cold raindrop lands on the back of your hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_11": "A few more drops follow. The sky, bright only moments ago, has vanished behind heavy clouds.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_12": "Fat raindrops hammer the stage canopy, their rapid patter almost drowning out every other sound.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_13": "Startled cries ripple through the crowd. In just moments, the orderly venue descends into chaos.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_14": "The bright square is drenched in an instant. Water glints on the stage floor, soaked programs crumple, and dark stains spread across the seats.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_15": "Huh? Where did this rain come from?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_16": "The rain suddenly grows heavier, and the crowd rushes for the nearest Teaching Building or roof.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_17": "Within minutes, the square so carefully prepared for the final performance only holds a rain-washed stage and curtains of water streaming from the eaves.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_18": "Hold on a minute. The weather forecast said it would be sunny today!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_19": "Get everyone out of the rain first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_2": "During the final week of summer break, a stage stands in the center of the square. Decorations still hang untidily around its edges.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_20": "Move the wooden instruments inside first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_21": "Quick, everyone! Get inside and out of the rain before you catch a cold!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_22": "Students from the Liaison Center, please give us a hand with putting up a rain shelter. We can't let the equipment get soaked!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_23": "Chisa, let's have everyone move the equipment indoors first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_24": "Quickly, everyone! Strings and woodwinds, lock your cases. Don't let the instruments get soaked!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_25": "Everyone else, get inside and out of the rain before you catch a cold!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_26": "Got it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_27": "The preparations dissolve into chaos. Ciaccona scoops the sheet music off its stand, then looks back at the rain-shrouded square before leaving.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_28": "...Sigh. When it rains, it pours. Literally.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_29": "After a frantic scramble to dismantle and move everything indoors, you manage to get most of the sound equipment and wooden instruments into the Club Association room before the rain reaches full force.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_3": "The sound and lighting equipment are in place. Chisa and several students from the Liaison Center pace back and forth, checking the wiring and equipment one last time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_30": "And the performance is due to begin in less than half an hour...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_4": "Rows of chairs stretch neatly out before the stage. On each seat lies a handwritten program the club members made over time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_5": "Brief drumbeats, stray notes from tuning instruments, simple sound-check melodies, and the members' words of encouragement mingle in the air.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_6": "Thanks to Buling's promotion, students gradually gather nearby, looking on with curiosity.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_7": "Then a faint, crisp sound comes from the canopy of the makeshift stage...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_8": "Tip-tap.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_40_9": "Say, {PlayerName}, do you feel...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_1": "Ciaccona stands at the door of the activity room, silently gazing at the jumble of music stands piled inside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_10": "Cancel the performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_100": "But everyone in the Orchestral Music Club was very welcoming and patient with us... So there's nothing to worry about.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_101": "This takes all of you by surprise. And yet, when you think about it, perhaps not that surprising.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_102": "Countless rehearsals, melodies refined again and again, all those times you kept playing till the end even without an audience... One storm can't wash away the work you've put into it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_103": "Perhaps this unexpected applause and the new members stepping forward are the finest reward for all your care and persistence.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_104": "The world is a stage, but your lives don't require a crowded house.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_105": "You don't need a cheering crowd to make this worth pursuing. You don't need to be seen for it to mean something.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_106": "Perhaps someday, when you hear those familiar melodies again, you will remember the summer you spent together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_107": "You will remember the afternoon you sat side by side sharing chestnut bread, the days you practiced until you were exhausted, and today...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_108": "Rain pours outside the windows, yet inside an empty activity room, you sounded the trumpet's first note.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_11": "Go ahead with the performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_12": "This venue here isn't ideal, and everyone is soaked. Maybe we should call it off today. As for the performance... we'll get another chance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_13": "Oh...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_14": "No, a smaller venue isn't necessarily a bad thing. If we can get the reverberations right in the activity room, the walls and ceiling can concentrate the sound.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_15": "We may not have a stage, but as long as people can hear our music, that's more than enough.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_16": "Actually, a smaller venue could work in our favor. The central square is more spacious, but sound also gets scattered easily.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_17": "We don't have many people to begin with. Outdoors, background noise could partly drown out the strings and woodwinds.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_18": "But in the activity room, the audience should be able to hear more clearly how the different sections work together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_19": "And everyone will be closer together. If the audience can see each performer and how they play their instrument, they may take more interest in the orchestra.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_2": "The room is tiny compared to the central square. The stage, formations, and program designed for the square are almost useless here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_20": "I agree. Maybe students who were just passing by will stay to get out of the rain.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_21": "Ciaccona, can you adjust the program so every section has a chance to play a solo?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_22": "I'll work on adjusting the equipment.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_23": "Then I'll post about it on the forum right now and make a digital program while I'm at it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_24": "Rain continues to patter outside. Students sheltering from the downpour gather in the hallway, drawn to the bustle inside the activity room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_25": "There is no big stage, no ample equipment, no varied program as planned, no carefully arranged seating...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_26": "But you still have music, and a team who wants to play it. So why keep imagining the show from your original plan?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_27": "You set aside the soaked programs, their corners curled by rain, and let out a heavy breath.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_28": "Ready, everyone? It's almost time for the performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_29": "The members open their scores before them. Instead of standing in fixed formations by section onstage, they now stand side by side.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_3": "Inside a small indoor space like this, sound reflects off the ceiling and walls. There is barely any room for the music to breathe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_30": "Meanwhile, the Liaison Center students decorate the blackboard with a few stars and hang streamers around the walls.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_31": "Carty, mind opening the show for us with your trumpet? Its sound should carry all the way into the hallway, where the people outside can hear it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_32": "Buling, I'll leave the snare drum to you again. Give us a steady beat, and that marching feel.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_33": "For the main melody... I'll play it on the violin.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_34": "Chisa, could you echo my melody on flute in the high register? Add some quick notes to brighten the piece.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_35": "Ciaccona turns her head and meets your eyes just as you look up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_36": "I got you. Leave the conducting to me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_37": "A bright, clear trumpet call bursts from Cartethyia's lips, ringing through the room and piercing the curtain of rain.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_38": "Outside, wind drives the rain against the windowpanes in rapid bursts. The unbroken downpour seems to fill the entire Activity Center.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_39": "Yet that bright melody rises above the clamor and travels down the hallway.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_4": "Pieces that sound bright and powerful outdoors turn crowded and muddy. Even the sections' positions need adjusting, not to mention the whole program that was originally planned.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_40": "There is no applause, no audience that came to watch.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_41": "The storm is merciless. Music meant to reach an audience can only echo slowly through this room hastily turned into a performance space.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_42": "As the piece unfolds, a violin quietly joins in. Ciaccona draws her bow across the strings, adding a gentle warmth to the bright trumpet line.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_43": "As you conduct, you trade brief glances with the others. Disappointment shows on every face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_44": "A few club members' eyes are red. They press their lips together and blink hard, trying to hold back their tears.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_45": "Their disappointment is only natural. Things rarely turn out as simply or as perfectly as you'd hope.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_46": "Beyond the window, rain still blurs the distant view. Trails of water slide down the glass, breaking the whole world outside into fragments.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_47": "A page of music turns. Chisa's flute enters softly, its short, nimble notes skipping through the air.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_48": "Drumsticks dart against the drumhead. Their crisp beats seem to find the rhythm of the players' hearts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_49": "(There is no audience... so what? Everyone worked two whole months to get here.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_5": "More pressing still, you hear a string of sneezes around you. Several members seem to have caught a chill in the sudden downpour.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_50": "(All those rehearsals, all those passages reworked again and again, all those times we started over from scratch... We did it all to share this one moment of orchestral music.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_51": "(We're here... so we have to play.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_52": "(And give everything we've got to deliver the best performance ever!)",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_53": "The second passage sounds more resolute. The strings swell in layers, and the percussion joins them, gradually filling out the thin sound.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_54": "The different sections weave together, and the melody flows out through the open door of the activity room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_55": "Footsteps hurrying past suddenly stop at the door. A few students sheltering from the rain glance into the activity room in surprise.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_56": "Are they... putting on a show?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_57": "Looks like the Orchestral Music Club is doing some kind of performance...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_58": "You hear them talking in hushed voices. A few figures enter the activity room and, almost without noticing, move forward until they are nearly at its center.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_59": "More and more students pause at the door. Even those just passing by with books in their arms are drawn to the gathering crowd, their bored expressions turning intent.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_6": "Should we... cancel the performance?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_60": "The endless rain no longer sounds loud. All you hear now are the instruments weaving together and your own heartbeat growing stronger.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_61": "The opening piece's final movement builds toward a climax. The trumpet's bright high notes rise suddenly, and the violin follows close behind.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_62": "The clear flute line sweeps above them. A quick succession of drumbeats carries every feeling to its peak.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_63": "A moment later, you hear scattered applause.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_64": "Phew...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_65": "Your back to the door, you are so intent on conducting the ensemble that you only turn around when the last note falls away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_66": "Behind you, more than a dozen students now sit in chairs that were empty before. You have no idea when they got here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_67": "Thank you, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_68": "Ciaccona bows deeply to the audience, picks up her bow again, and catches your eye.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_69": "The second piece begins. Some students were attracted by the applause, some came with friends, and others stopped at the sound of a familiar tune. One by one, they gather at the door of the activity room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_7": "Sigh... Promoting the same show a second time might not make nearly as much of a splash, Boss.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_70": "The doorway, once empty, is now filled with people. Those who arrived later have to stand on tiptoe to peer inside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_71": "Students already inside shift aside to make room for the newcomers. The empty chairs fill row by row, even those at the very back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_72": "The Orchestral Music Club plays with stronger devotion, but no one is trying to win applause with a brilliant high note or a showy flourish.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_73": "They pour everything they have built over the past two months into their performance, holding nothing back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_74": "All their dedication and passion, and their simple love of music.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_75": "By the end of the third piece, you turn to find that not a single seat is empty. A few latecomers crowd into the hallway, quietly waiting for the next piece.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_76": "Ciaccona stays silent. She gazes at you and at the members beside her, still caught up in the music's afterglow. Then she smiles softly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_77": "Tears glimmer in her eyes. Her lips curve upward, her eyebrows soften, and the light in her eyes trembles with her smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_78": "This time, the applause comes not from a handful of people, but from the whole room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_79": "Those drawn by the melody may know little about orchestral music. They may not even know why you are playing here...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_8": "If we have to rent the performance equipment again... we'll also need to renegotiate with the sponsors.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_80": "But they can hear the heart you put into every note.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_81": "Great work, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_82": "Cartethyia is the first to raise her head. Her eyes shine at the sight of the packed audience. She wipes the sweat from her brow with the back of her hand, unable to hold back a smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_83": "Her gaze moves from face to face before settling on you, her smile gentle and bright.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_84": "You look at her, then at the members around you still glowing with excitement, and warmth rises in your heart. At this moment, everyone is simply happy about the performance you have given together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_85": "Other members onstage let out a long breath together. Their tense shoulders finally relax, and they wipe their sweaty palms.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_86": "Holding their instruments, the members break into delighted smiles, one after another.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_87": "You reach for one another's hands. More than twenty pairs of hands clasp together, holding firm.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_88": "Then you all bow deep to the applauding audience at the same time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_89": "That was an incredible performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_9": "But is there really no other way? The summer break's almost over. Once classes start, everyone will have even less free time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_90": "And next one... I know we'll do even better.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_91": "The applause continues, and some audience members are already quietly discussing their favorite piece.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_92": "The students who have listened from the doorway gather in small groups, excitedly gesturing to their friends.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_93": "Then a girl in the crowd takes a hesitant step forward. She looks up at all of you and speaks softly, sounding a little shy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_94": "Um... I'd like to join the Orchestral Music Club.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_95": "Where can I sign up?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_96": "I want to join as well, but I've never played an instrument before. Is that okay?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_97": "Yes! That's perfectly okay! I'll get application forms for both of you right away!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_98": "Here it is! Here are your sign-up sheets. I already have them ready for you!",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_50_99": "It's okay if you don't have any experience. Buling and I weren't very good at playing instruments when we started, either.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_1": "Summer... It really is a wonderful season.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_10": "I trust the friends who walk beside me. And that includes you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_11": "Chisa freezes for a moment at your words, then her eyes widen slightly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_12": "She tilts her head and gently tucks the long hair falling over her shoulder behind her ear.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_13": "Tomorrow's the last day of summer break, isn't it? It'll be the end of this summer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_14": "I'd like to invite everyone to my family's restaurant tomorrow evening to spend some time together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_15": "To celebrate the end of our summer training... let's have another hot pot party. Together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_2": "Chisa leans against the rooftop railing and gazes toward the far edge of town. A summer breeze brushes her face, lifting a few long wisps of hair from her forehead.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_3": "I remember summer nights when the breeze smelled sweet with star candy and fresh with chilled watermelon. A hand fan stirred the air as fireflies danced overhead...",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_4": "This summer has been a bit different... But it'll be one I never forget.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_5": "Thank you, {PlayerName}. Before this summer, I never imagined I'd be up onstage performing in an orchestra.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_6": "You turn toward Chisa, only to meet her eyes beneath gently curved lashes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_7": "I think once you find the courage to try, endless possibilities will arise. Don't you agree?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_8": "{PlayerName}... Weren't you ever worried that a few newcomers like us might ruin the show the Orchestral Music Club worked so hard on?",
+  "EVENT_AVGclubCenter_60_9": "No. I've always believed in you, Chisa.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_1": "After the last homeroom ends, the days slip quietly forward, marked by the unchanging cadence of the opening and closing bells.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_10": "Just days ago, the competition still felt safely in the distance. Yet in the blink of an eye, the Orchestral Music Club is already going over travel plans, meeting times, and last-minute reminders before taking the stage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_11": "You're all making steady progress toward your goals. But the busy days fly by so fast there's no time to stop and look back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_12": "It isn't until the last day on the calendar that it finally hits you...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_13": "Tomorrow, the Qualifying Exam begins.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_14": "And the National Music Competition finals are just around the corner.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_2": "Throughout this month, you keep hurrying from one corner of the school to another.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_3": "By day, you go to class and review with everyone, help sort out study materials, and confirm the Orchestral Music Club's joint training schedule.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_4": "After school, you also carve out some time to handle work for the Student Council and the Club Association.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_5": "You catch Changli and Roccia going over key exam topics together, and run into Xiangli Yao walking classmates through the hardest problems between classes...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_6": "You watch Ciaccona and Cartethyia drill the same stubborn, off-pitch notes again and again, until the once-stiff passage finally smoothed into a lilting melody.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_7": "Study sessions and rehearsals split each day between them. By the time you finally make it home, the sky is usually dusted with stars.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_8": "And just like that, the month rushes by.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1000_9": "One day you're still fretting over the mistakes on your practice tests. The next, you're confirming exam halls and subject schedules with the Student Council.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_105_1": "Ah, {PlayerName}? You're here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_105_2": "Yeah, I happened to be passing the <color=#d19f27>Student Council</color>. Thought I'd drop in. Are you busy, Changli?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_105_3": "Just the usual routine. Approving campus events, managing budgets, maintaining order, and weighing in on major school decisions... That's essentially what <color=#d19f27>Student Council</color> work boils down to.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_105_4": "Sounds like a lot of work...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_105_5": "Hehe, there's no need to worry. It's simply the Council's duty.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_105_6": "If you're interested, {PlayerName}, why not come and try the <color=#d19f27>Student Council's</color> work for yourself sometime?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_105_7": "<color=#d19f27>Paperwork</color> and <color=#d19f27>campus talks</color>... these things might seem basic, but hands-on experience is how you know the school piece by piece.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_105_8": "With your talent, {PlayerName}, I'm sure you'll be handling far more responsibilities in no time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_1": "Welcome to your new home. Like what you see?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_10": "I get an allowance?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_11": "...An exam?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_12": "Abby blinks at your question for a second, then gives a firm, emphatic nod.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_13": "'Course I do! They wouldn't have shipped you off to me otherwise. Hang on... they didn't mention me at all, did they?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_14": "...Maybe I just forgot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_15": "Well... you'll need it. Commuting, school lunch, hanging with classmates, buying things you want... Can't get far with empty pockets.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_16": "Yep. Honestly, I'm still not sure why you'd transfer school at a time like this... But whatever, I get it. None of my business, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_17": "All right. Get settled in. Fifteen minutes, and I'm taking you to try out some of the local specialties.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_2": "It's a nice place. I like it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_3": "It's spacious. Just a bit empty, I guess.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_4": "Heh-heh. 'Course it is. I spent all weekend tidying it all up!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_5": "Uh... it's been years. I had no clue what you're into these days. Kids, man. Can't read 'em, won't pretend to try. So I went light on the decor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_6": "Anyway, here's your key. This room's yours for the <color=#d19f27>next year</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_7": "Decor, furniture, hosting friends... that's all your call.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_8": "I'm pretty chill as far as guardians go. But you've got an exam to worry about. So don't stay out too late, or I might have to tighten the purse strings.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_10_9": "Do you know my family well, Abby?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_110_1": "Oh, {PlayerName}, you're here. Dropping by to check out the club activities?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_110_2": "I was just passing by and thought I'd say hi, Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_110_3": "I see. Then this works out nicely. How about I show you around?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_110_4": "Most club affairs here are handled by the <color=#d19f27>Club Association</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_110_5": "For example, things like registering new clubs, managing resources, guiding activities, and settling disputes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_110_6": "Honestly, it's not quite what I imagined club life would be... But Leader Ciaccona is the one actually running things.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_110_7": "She's assisting a teacher today, so I'm covering for her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_110_8": "If you have time, {PlayerName}, we'd appreciate a hand with <color=#d19f27>rehearsals</color> or <color=#d19f27>general management</color>. We're really short-handed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_110_9": "Once you get used to how things run, it'll all come naturally.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_115_1": "Welcome, {PlayerName}. What can I get you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_115_10": "Then I'll get back to work. Enjoy your meal, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_115_2": "The place is busy again... Any recommendations, Chisa?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_115_3": "Recommendations? Let me think... How about the Lemon-Scented Sukiyaki?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_115_4": "Beef and wild greens simmered in a rich broth with a hint of fragrant lemon. The sweet-and-sour flavor cuts through the richness, leaving a tender, comforting flavor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_115_5": "It's actually the very first dish my parents taught me to make.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_115_6": "Though, if you're dining alone, the portion might be a bit large. Maybe bring Principal Abby along next time?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_115_7": "That's fine. I'll have the Lemon-Scented Sukiyaki, then.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_115_8": "All right, got it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_115_9": "Oh, by the way, if you're ever interested, you're always welcome to try a part-time shift here when you're free.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_120_1": "The <color=#d19f27>Liaison Center</color>... You remember Chisa mentioning it before. Maybe you can pick up <color=#d19f27>part-time work</color> there.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_120_2": "Better go check it out <color=#d19f27>after school</color> today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_1": "When you arrive at the Liaison Center, Chisa is sorting through a stack of documents on the desk.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_10": "Whenever they need help, they register here first. We sort through the listings, then post them for everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_11": "They're usually simple tasks, but stepping into a new role and meeting different people can be a really fun experience.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_12": "Of course, taking on work depends on your schedule, {PlayerName}. If you're ever interested, come check the board to see if anything catches your eye.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_13": "Got it, thank you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_14": "Taking on <color=#d19f27>part-time work</color> when you have free time is a great way to earn extra <color=#d19f27>money</color> and build up your <color=#d19f27>reputation</color> on campus.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_15": "However, overworking can <color=#d19f27>build up fatigue</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_16": "As your school routine settles in, <color=#d19f27>plan your schedule wisely</color> to <color=#d19f27>pursue the path that fits you best</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_2": "Hello, {PlayerName}. Welcome to the Liaison Center.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_3": "It was on my way after school, so I thought I'd stop by. Are you busy, Chisa?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_4": "Not really. I'm just tidying up our list of past sponsors.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_5": "The title \"External Liaison Center\" may sound a bit formal, but simply put, this is where the school keeps in touch with the outside world.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_6": "Let's say, buying event supplies, securing sponsors, coordinating with off-campus organizations... we handle all of that.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_7": "\"Eekky Logistics\" is one of our longtime sponsors. From shipping supplies to event prep, they've been a huge help to the school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_8": "Sounds like a lot of work... Oh, right, you mentioned before that the Liaison Center also posts part-time jobs?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_125_9": "Exactly. My family's <color=#d19f27>restaurant</color>, Roccia's <color=#d19f27>store</color>, some jobs here at the <color=#d19f27>Liaison Center</color>...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_130_1": "Past the end of the road, a vast coastline unfolds. The breeze sweeps in with a faint salty tang, scattering the stifling heat until only the rhythm of the tide remains.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_130_2": "Far out, the sea rises and falls under the sun, sky and water merging along a gleaming horizon.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_130_3": "Waves break against the shore, dissolving into fine white foam before receding into the deep. Seabirds skim the water, their distant calls cutting through the rush of the surf.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_130_4": "Far from the bustle of town, the coast offers a quiet refuge—whether to capture a moment of light and shadow, hunt for inspiration, or simply clear your mind.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_130_5": "Perhaps sitting here in silence is enough to let new ideas drift in with winds and tides.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_1": "On the first weekend after classes begin, you finally get to sleep in, cozy and unhurried, without the blare of an alarm.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_10": "Haven't figured that out yet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_11": "Well, it's your weekend, so spend it however you see fit. I'm not one of those uptight guardians, after all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_12": "There are plenty of spots in town worth exploring, and if going solo sounds dull, you can always invite a friend.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_13": "Having fun with friends is good for young people like you. Just remember to be home before dinner.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_14": "I barely get a chance to catch up with you. Weekend evenings are my only chance to breathe, so the least we can do is share a proper meal. Let me play the good guardian for once...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_15": "Getting all sentimental all of a sudden...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_16": "Hey! Even if it's been years since we last met, I still care about you!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_17": "Anyway, take the weekend and relax properly!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_18": "Okay, I will.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_2": "After a quick wash-up, you head to the dining room and surprisingly spot a familiar figure.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_3": "Yo, you're up? Perfect timing—breakfast's still warm.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_4": "Abby sets down its chopsticks and waves you over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_5": "...Abby?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_6": "All week, Abby has been swamped with administrative duties, leaving early and returning late, always rushing off after leaving you a note. Today, for once, you actually sit down at the same table together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_7": "So, how's your first week in town been? Settling in okay?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_8": "Pretty good. Everyone's been really friendly, and classes aren't too hard.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_135_9": "That's a relief. Any plans for the <color=#d19f27>weekend</color>?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_137_1": "Hey, did you check out Roccia's <color=#d19f27>school store</color> this week? I heard they got a bunch of new stuff in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_137_2": "Not yet. Wanna go check it out?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_137_3": "(The <color=#d19f27>school store</color>...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_137_4": "Nothing urgent to do right now. Maybe I should head over and take a look as well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_140_1": "Welcome to the school store, customer. How may I help you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_140_2": "Hi, Roccia. I heard you've got new stock in?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_140_3": "Yes. We bring in new arrivals <color=#d19f27>every week</color>, alongside <color=#d19f27>routine restocks</color>. Please, feel free to browse.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_140_4": "Hmm... Sometimes we bring in <color=#d19f27>seasonal goods</color> as well. If you're interested, you should drop by often, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_140_5": "Also, if you would like a taste of daily life at the school store, you are always welcome to help out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_140_6": "Things like assisting with <color=#d19f27>sales</color> and <color=#d19f27>organizing sundries</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_140_7": "Sure. Got it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_140_8": "Mmhmm. Once you get used to how things run here, there will be plenty more you can help with.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_145_1": "...A gift?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_145_2": "Opening the gift box on your desk reveals a brand-new <color=#d19f27>planner</color>, its pages neatly segmented into weekly layouts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_145_3": "Class schedules, club activities, part-time shifts... everything fits right in. It's clear Abby didn't pick this up on a whim. It's a thoughtful nudge toward your new life here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_145_4": "When you have a moment, take the time to map out your <color=#d19f27>schedule</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_1": "Hmm? They say \"spring makes you drowsy and autumn makes you weary,\" but morning reading has barely started! Why is everyone yawning already?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_10": "The students, half-asleep just moments before, snap straight to attention and whisper about plans for the anniversary celebration.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_11": "Also, the town is heavily promoting our centennial and bringing in a TV station to film interviews throughout the day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_12": "In other words, you might all get a chance to be on TV, or catch yourselves on the news even. So, if a camera gets pointed your way, what are you going to present?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_13": "What, no volunteers to share their thoughts? Well then... I guess I'll just pick someone myself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_14": "How about you, {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_15": "A star's presence that commands every eye.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_16": "Unrivaled strength that stands above the crowd.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_17": "A refined grasp of culture and aesthetics.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_18": "A fierce, ambitious drive for learning.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_19": "Oh? So you dream of stardom, {PlayerName}? Come to think of it, I believe we actually did have a school idol before...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_2": "Standing at the podium, Verina claps her hands sharply and raises her voice,",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_20": "Huh? Showing off raw strength? I don't mind the passion, but this isn't the kind of school where students start calling themselves \"crows\" or fighting for the top spot among the Big Four...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_21": "Cultural literacy and aesthetic sensibilities... They really do matter when building a good image for the school. Though... should we try painting all the apples and rabbits blue for the celebration, then?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_22": "True... Principal Abby values that a great deal. Still, we aren't exactly running a school of the elite here. So how should we go about showing off that kind of academic rigor...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_23": "Anyway, no hiding behind each other the moment you spot a news camera, okay?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_24": "Anyone who wants to sign up for anniversary activities can see me or Changli after class for a registration form.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_25": "Just as she finishes going over the anniversary plans, the bell for morning reading rings. Verina gives a satisfied nod to the class and leaves the room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_26": "{PlayerName}, do you have any plans for lunch today?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_27": "Changli hands you a flyer that looks familiar.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_28": "Isn't this... the menu from Chisa's restaurant?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_29": "Oh? So you two are acquainted? Perfect. Lunch is on me. Let's order delivery and eat together. There's something I'd like to discuss with you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_3": "I know it's been a long week, but it's not the weekend yet! Come on, everyone, perk up—don't let me catch you sleeping in other classes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_30": "Something to do with the anniversary?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_31": "Gladly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_32": "Hehe, exactly. Talking to someone clever always saves time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_33": "I've been looking for an opportunity to catch up with some friends, anyway.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_4": "When Verina finishes, the classroom barely stirs. A couple of front-row students sit up half-heartedly, while someone in the back hides a yawn behind their hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_5": "...Sigh, kids these days. The moment Friday hits, your minds leave the building.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_6": "Seeing the students' sleepy faces, Verina shakes her head. Nagging clearly won't work today. She pauses, tapping lightly on the podium.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_7": "Ahem. Oh, right, I almost forgot to mention. <color=#d19f27>Next month</color> is our school's <color=#d19f27>centennial celebration</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_8": "This year's <color=#d19f27>School Anniversary</color> is a joint effort between the <color=#d19f27>Student Council</color> and the <color=#d19f27>Club Association</color>, so we'll have both an Arts Gala and a full School Open House.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_155_9": "Every class and club will prepare a themed event or booth for the celebration. Starting next week, on top of your regular studies, you're all going to have your hands full.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_1": "Here is your beef and tofu hotpot, Principal. Dipping sauces and drinks are over there. And this... is an automatic hotpot defoaming device I developed based on suggestions from my classmates.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_10": "She handles the school's <color=#d19f27>liaison work</color> and tinkers with gadgets in her spare time... though her inventions can get a little too creative.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_11": "As for the Principal title... Huh? Didn't your family mention it in their letters? The current principal of this century-old school you're about to enroll in is yours truly—Abby!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_12": "You're actually the Principal? That means I can...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_13": "It's hard to picture.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_14": "Hold it. I know exactly what you're thinking. Rule one for principals: absolute fairness. I have principles, okay!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_15": "Excuse me?! I might be small, but there's no rule saying a Principal has to ooze charm, okay!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_16": "Anyway, we don't play favorites at this school. But I did promise your family I'd look after you. That, I can do.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_17": "So, from now until the Qualifying Exam, come to me with anything. I'll help however I can. Just like the old saying goes—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_18": "\"This is going to be the most important year of your life!\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_19": "Kind of hate having to hear that...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_2": "After setting the dishes on the table, the black-haired girl in a school uniform brings out a strange device attached to a motor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_20": "The most important year... because of the exam?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_21": "Ahaha... Gotta say something grand to keep the School Board and parents happy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_22": "Yep. We're talking about a life-defining exam here. One that could \"shape the entire course of your future.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_23": "Abby scoops some cooked food onto your plate, urging you to eat while it's hot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_24": "But if you ask me? Sure, the <color=#d19f27>Qualifying Exam</color>'s important. But it's just a sorting mechanism. A way to pick out talent.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_25": "Exams have only one right answer. Life doesn't.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_26": "I'm sure your family sent you here because they want you to find your own answers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_27": "(Abby being this serious feels kind of weird...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_28": "Hehe... Alright, enough serious talk. I'm starving! Let's dig in. Tomorrow, I'll give you a proper tour to let you soak in that century-old heritage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_29": "Dinner with Abby is a delight. The special broth, with just the right kick of spice, really is exceptional.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_3": "Would you like to try it? It's a two-part design, fully powered and highly efficient. I made sure it's completely safe this time. Still, please watch your fingers when you—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_30": "As you chat about the school over the meal, the lingering exhaustion of your travels finally melts away. Somehow, the distance between you and Abby feels a little smaller.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_31": "Still, just the two of us for hotpot feels a bit quiet. Once you make some <color=#d19f27>new friends</color> here, we'll throw a massive hotpot party!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_4": "Ahem. That's... great! I'll give it a shot later. Thank you, Chisa! Care to sit down and grab a bite with us?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_5": "At last, the black-haired girl smiles and quietly slides a \"Feedback Form\" across to Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_6": "Perhaps next time, Principal Abby. We're quite busy today. I need to help my parents. Enjoy your meal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_7": "Chisa gives a slight bow and leaves with the empty tray.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_8": "That girl... she's from the school? She called you Principal?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_15_9": "Yeah. That's <color=#d19f27>Chisa</color>, a second-year student. Her parents own this restaurant.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_1": "When you and Changli arrive at the Student Council Office, Chisa is waiting by the door, \"holding hands\" with an oddly designed robot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_10": "Chisa nods to you both and leads the Delivery Bot into the office.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_11": "So you ordered from her restaurant because of...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_12": "...The School Anniversary sponsorship?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_13": "Hehe. Let's just say I'm taking this chance to return a favor or two. After all, every event at the school, big or small, needs funding.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_14": "Correct. Every event at the school, big or small, needs funding.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_15": "But the school's budget only goes so far, so when necessary, the Liaison Center steps in to seek outside partnerships and financial backing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_16": "Chisa has been working at the Liaison Center for a while now, mainly handling contact with sponsors.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_17": "As Changli speaks, her gaze keeps drifting toward the elevator.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_18": "I see. But by the look of it, we're expecting someone else?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_19": "Mm, one more. She's a transfer student, just like you. Also, she's the one I originally mistook you for... Ah, here she is.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_2": "On closer inspection, the tray in the robot's hands seems to hold the very meal Changli just ordered.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_20": "You follow Changli's gaze toward the elevator, where a blonde girl steps out with a solemn expression. She scans her surroundings, and the moment her eyes meet yours, she heads straight in your direction.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_21": "To anyone out of the loop, her distant demeanor, paired with the terrifying rumors swirling around campus, is more than a little intimidating.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_22": "If you're not mistaken, this is the girl whose very name makes even the school's principal blanch—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_23": "Well, Phoebe? It's been a few days. Have you made up your mind?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_24": "Phoebe gives only the slightest nod, saying nothing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_25": "Hehe, as sparing with words as ever, I see. Go on in, please. Everyone else is already here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_26": "Phoebe nods to you and Changli, then pushes open the door to the Student Council Office, head lowered, and steps inside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_27": "...Hm? {PlayerName}, what's with that look?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_28": "Don't tell me she's that \"new student from the School Board\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_29": "Just a feeling... she seems like someone with quite a background.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_3": "Oh, good afternoon, Changli, {PlayerName}. I've brought over the Student Council's order for you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_30": "Oh? So you've already noticed. There's no need to worry, though. Phoebe may come from a distinguished family, but she hasn't a trace of arrogance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_31": "I can hardly blame you for thinking that. After all, her adoptive father is... Well, pay it no mind. Phoebe may come from a distinguished family, but she hasn't a trace of arrogance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_32": "I invited her simply because she's well suited to Council work.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_4": "That thing you're holding is...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_5": "I didn't expect you to be the one making the delivery, Chisa.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_6": "This is a Delivery Bot I modified myself. Its navigation system isn't fully calibrated yet, so I have to guide it for now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_7": "Mhm. Mom and Dad called to say Changli had placed an order, so they asked me to run it over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_8": "Thank you, Chisa. Why don't you stay and eat with us? I ordered enough for six today. And there's plenty I'd like to ask you about the School Anniversary sponsorship.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_160_9": "If you need me for anything... I'll do my best to help!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_1": "All right, that's just about everyone. Since we happen to have a few new friends with us today, allow me to make a brief introduction.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_10": "While my Student Council duties cover what the President mentioned, I actually spend most of my time assisting Principal Abby with the school's finances.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_11": "Which is how I happened to discover that a fairly large portion of our incoming funds... comes from unidentified sources.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_12": "After the local tax bureau sent the school a... ahem, \"reminder\" on the matter, I began trying to trace the exact origin of these funds—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_13": "All right, that's enough, Xiangli Yao. Anything more would be inappropriate.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_14": "For a moment, the only sound left in the room is the glug of the bubbling hotpot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_15": "Ahem... And this lovely newcomer on my left is the <color=#d19f27>representative of the Club Association</color>—<color=#d19f27>Cartethyia</color>, from the Orchestral Music Club.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_16": "Cartethyia rises to her feet, smooths her clothes, carefully adjusts the bangs over her forehead, and puts on a serious expression.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_17": "Hello, I'm Cartethyia. Leader Ciaccona is still busy revising the sheet music for our ensemble, so I'll be attending in her place today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_18": "Steam rises from the copper pot. The once-placid broth begins to roil, and a rich, tempting aroma drifts out with the white mist.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_19": "—The very next second, she is swallowed whole by the rising steam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_2": "The six of you sit around the round table. Noon sunlight streams through the carved window lattice, casting patches of light and shadow across the dark, vintage wooden table.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_20": "The formal atmosphere she worked so hard to build vanishes. Cartethyia stands straight, doing her best to act as if nothing has happened. Yet she can't quite stop herself from sniffing at the hotpot, and her throat bobs as she swallows...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_21": "After a brief silence, Chisa can't hold back a laugh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_22": "Sorry... it's just, your entrance was really something, Cartethyia...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_23": "A-anyway! Please rest assured and leave the School Anniversary's Arts Gala to the Club Association. We promise to put on the most spectacular show for everyone!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_24": "Thank you, Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_25": "As Cartethyia said, the Club Association will have full charge of planning the program for this year's School Anniversary Arts Gala. If anyone has questions, please feel free to ask her directly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_26": "As for coordination and planning beyond the gala, along with everything concerning the school open house, the Student Council will take care of it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_27": "Um... Changli, sorry to interrupt, but there's actually something other than the School Anniversary plans I'd like to ask.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_28": "The steam churning over the table is impossible to ignore. Right now, what we need is the greatest invention in the world—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_29": "Does anyone need an automatic hotpot scum skimmer?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_3": "Were it not for the sizable copper pot bubbling away in the middle, the scene would look terribly solemn.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_30": "(You give Chisa an approving look.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_31": "Wait, shouldn't we be asking why we're eating hotpot at school in the first place?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_32": "Oh, right! There's also the Hotpot Steam Vision Obstruction Eliminator modified by the skimmer. Would you like one, Cartethyia?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_33": "Uh... thank you, Chisa... But why does the Student Council Office even have a copper pot on hand...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_34": "I'm more curious about why we're allowed to have hotpot at school...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_35": "I was wondering the same thing...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_36": "Come to think of it, the fact that the Student Council Office keeps a copper pot on hand is already strange enough...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_37": "Eating hotpot at gatherings is a tradition this school has kept for a hundred years. Or rather, you might say hotpot itself holds a special symbolic meaning for this place.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_38": "Phoebe and Cartethyia nod thoughtfully, seemingly accepting this premise with surprising ease.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_39": "(...Why do I get the feeling this is a \"tradition\" that Abby made up?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_4": "(She actually ordered hotpot...?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_40": "All right, back to business. There are still two important friends I'd like to introduce.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_41": "First, our formidable support for the School Anniversary: {PlayerName}. Though I doubt anyone here needs an introduction.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_42": "Next is <color=#d19f27>Phoebe, a second-year</color>, who is also this year's grade representative. She'll be working with the <color=#d19f27>Student Council</color> from today onward.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_43": "(A \"grade representative\" who's only just transferred in? Her background must be something special...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_44": "Phoebe rises to her feet, folds her hands in front of her, and bows slightly to the group.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_45": "Greetings, everyone. I'm Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_46": "Phoebe is as poised and proper as ever. The moment she speaks, even the broth in the pot seems to settle down.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_47": "\"Gurgle\"—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_48": "But in that very instant, a sound like a growling stomach comes from Phoebe's direction.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_49": "It isn't loud, but against the gentle bubbling of the hotpot, it's impossible to miss. Heads turn as everyone searches for the source.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_5": "On my right is <color=#d19f27>Xiangli Yao</color>, a Student Council Officer. He currently handles email feedback and website maintenance for the school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_50": "Of course, from the way everyone suddenly wears a look of blank innocence, it's clear that nobody wants to be the brave soul who \"calls out\" Phoebe's rumbling stomach.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_51": "Sorry, that was actually me. I'm hungry.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_52": "How about we all eat first?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_53": "How thoughtless of me. Thank you all for coming today. If anyone leaves hungry, I take full responsibility.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_54": "Well, everyone's introduced now anyway. Thank you all for coming today. If anyone leaves hungry, I take full responsibility.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_55": "Between anniversary prep and Student Council duties, this lunch was a bit rushed. Please forgive the modest setup.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_56": "But I assure you that once the centennial wraps up smoothly, we'll pick a proper venue and host a real \"hotpot party\" as the victory feast.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_57": "I don't know if any of you have heard the rumors going around lately about our school's partnership with Celestial Steed Corp... But that isn't something any of us can control.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_58": "Principal Abby actually talked to me about this year's School Anniversary a while back. What it said was...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_59": "\"Fill this anniversary with happy memories. If this is our last one, make it the most unforgettable of all.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_6": "Nice to meet you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_60": "\"As for all those complicated, headache-inducing, and annoying problems? Just leave them to us adults to handle.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_61": "\"After all, what you should be looking toward is the future you're running for, not how to say goodbye to the past. If you keep dwelling on what you're about to lose, that's when you'll truly miss everything right in front of you!\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_62": "So, for the next month, I'll be counting on every one of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_63": "The Student Council has already secured morning <color=#d19f27>class exemptions</color> for everyone here, starting next week. So please, join me in writing the story of our school's hundredth year.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_64": "Changli's gaze moves from face to face around the table. Her composed smile fades slightly, her expression turning sincere.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_65": "Of course, I know the upcoming exams are an unavoidable concern for many of you. That's why participating in the preparations is entirely voluntary.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_66": "Whether you choose to help or focus on your studies, the Student Council and the school will fully respect your decision.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_67": "For those willing to lend a hand, we have plenty of paperwork and promotional work where your help would be invaluable.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_68": "My only hope is that when this centennial ends, none of us are left with any regrets.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_69": "And if anyone's interested in preparing for the Arts Gala, the Club Association could use more hands, too!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_7": "Xiangli Yao smiles and says nothing more, as if that settles it. Changli shakes her head helplessly and waves for him to say a bit more.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_70": "Whether it's rehearsals or backstage coordination, anyone willing to pitch in is more than welcome! Leader Ciaccona and I will make sure there's afternoon tea for everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_71": "The Liaison Center will also do everything in its power to provide whatever official resources we can for the School Anniversary preparations.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_72": "Also, beyond the usual sponsorship funds, I can provide a few more tools as well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_73": "So Chisa's inventions count as \"official resources\" as well?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_74": "Don't tell me you actually carry a four-dimensional pocket full of gadgets...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_75": "Huh? It's just a hobby of mine.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_76": "No, no—it's just an ordinary multi-purpose case.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_77": "She speaks in a breezy tone, all while pulling one unheard-of device after another from the small satchel at her hip.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_78": "I actually brought a few samples today. Feel free to test them out, everyone. Here's a one-handed anniversary banner deployer, an automatic flyer folder, a delayed-launch confetti cannon...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_79": "If we put all of Chisa's inventions on display and promote them properly, it might end up being the most popular exhibit at the whole anniversary.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_8": "Fine, then...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_80": "Promotion... As far as I can tell, online media and emerging social platforms will become key channels for spreading information in the foreseeable future.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_81": "On that note, it may be worth asking Buling, the school forum moderator, for some help.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_82": "By mobilizing people to run dynamic, high-volume campaigns on these platforms, we can quickly generate buzz and drive engagement.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_83": "Mm, I've asked the school's sponsors about this before, too. They also think this approach will gradually replace traditional street promotion and brand advertising as the more effective way to get the word out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_84": "Let me think... So basically, Chisa's modified Delivery Bot might end up on TV?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_85": "Huh? If you need to get in touch with the TV station, I might be able to help too...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_86": "With the heavier topics set aside for now, everyone gathers around the steaming hotpot, chatting about plans and arrangements for the anniversary.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_87": "(Changli mentioned the partnership between the school and Celestial Steed Corp. Maybe that's what's been troubling Abby all along. But both of them chose to steer around the subject.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_88": "(Over at the Club Association, Ciaccona's up to her neck in work, too...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_89": "(Then there's Phoebe. Who she really is has always been hard to pin down. Everyone can tell there's something unusual about her background, but no one can say exactly what.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_9": "Hello, everyone. I'm Xiangli Yao, a Student Council Officer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_90": "(It seems the school's current situation is nowhere near as simple as Abby and Changli made it out to be.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_165_91": "If you want to help prepare for the <color=#d19f27>School Anniversary</color>, you'll need to organize your <color=#d19f27>schedule</color> carefully starting <color=#d19f27>next week</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_170_1": "Changli tells me you're all starting on <color=#d19f27>School Anniversary prep</color> next week. So? Got your schedule figured out yet?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_170_2": "Ahh, nothing beats being young. So much energy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_170_3": "It's getting late. You should turn in early tonight too. Tomorrow, it's back to the grind...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_175_1": "Starting today, you can jump in and help with <color=#d19f27>the School Anniversary preparations</color>. But the Student Council and the Club Association both seem badly short-handed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_175_2": "You can't afford to let your basic coursework slide, either. After all, the Qualifying Exam is right around the corner...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_175_3": "Either way, first things first: plan out this week's schedule.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_185_1": "As Abby said, there may be plenty to look forward to during the School Anniversary.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_185_2": "Better budget your spending wisely from here on out and <color=#d19f27>set a little money aside</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_187_1": "Honestly, I thought this year's School Anniversary wasn't going to happen at all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_187_10": "Wow. Your skin's thicker than the school walls. That was NOT a compliment!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_187_2": "Same here. Haven't you noticed? The prep this time feels super rushed. Tons of plans got changed last minute, and even the decorations aren't as nice as other years.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_187_3": "Can't really be helped. I mean, look at our enrollment the past couple of years... Who knows how much tuition Principal Abby's been covering out of pocket? It's a miracle we're still holding events at all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_187_4": "True. And the Celestial Steed people have been in and out of the school a lot lately.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_187_5": "A few days ago I saw them talking with teachers over by the offices... What's this industry-academia collaboration thing really about?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_187_6": "No idea... but Celestial Steed Corp isn't exactly a charity.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_187_7": "Okay, so word from the Student Council is the school's really strapped for cash right now. And Celestial Steed Corp just happens to show up now? There's definitely more to it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_187_8": "If you put half that snooping energy into studying, you'd have gotten an A ages ago!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_187_9": "Hehe... Stop, you're making me blush.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_190_1": "Oh, {PlayerName}, it's you. I was just about to come find you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_190_2": "Chisa peeks out from behind a stack of documents piled nearly waist-high and slides a few forms across the desk toward you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_190_3": "The supplies for the School Anniversary just arrived today, and the Student Council is short on hands. So they're hoping everyone from the Club Association can pitch in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_190_4": "And the TV station's filming and interviews happen to be set for tomorrow. Want to come scope out the place with me, {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_190_5": "Sounds like you're handling the TV station too, Chisa. That's a lot on your plate.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_190_6": "Mm. It's part of the Liaison Center's job, after all... Even if I'm not very good at getting close to people, or dealing with them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_190_7": "But everyone still trusts me, just as I am, and they're willing to leave these things in my hands. Being able to help them makes me feel... happy, in a way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_190_8": "Ah, sorry, I think I'm drifting off topic. Anyway, let's head out and take a look together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_1": "The Liaison Center's preparations move even faster than you expected. Pennant flags strung beneath the cherry trees and bright streamers run along the flagstone path all the way to the central square. Now and then, petals drift lazily from the branches, brushing past sleeves and hair.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_10": "That's correct. Under the original plan, the interview and filming were set for tomorrow. However, the station notified us at short notice that the schedule had been adjusted.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_11": "As the school's partner, Celestial Steed Corp wishes to document the authentic process of the students' anniversary preparations in advance, showcasing the admirable spirit of a faculty and student body actively engaged in campus life.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_12": "This will further expand the public influence of this year's centennial while ensuring the coverage is more natural and rich in content.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_13": "Naturally, to ensure the school's major events are carried out smoothly, the partner is also obliged to fulfill its oversight duties.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_14": "(...? And where did you people come from?!)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_15": "(Then again, that grandiose tone has Celestial Steed Corp written all over it.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_16": "Excuse me, which of you is the student representative in charge of the centennial?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_17": "As if on cue, everyone turns to look at you. Meeting their gazes, you clear your throat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_18": "That's me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_19": "Then, as a member of Second Solaris School, what do you think is most worth reporting about this centennial?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_2": "Beside the benches tucked in the shade, a few makeshift open house display boards already stand. In freshly opened boxes by the flower beds, rolled-up posters and decorative bouquets of fresh flowers peek out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_20": "The school's century of history and its educational philosophy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_21": "The Club Association's Arts Gala performances.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_22": "The Student Council's open house stalls.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_23": "The cafeteria's limited-time anniversary menu.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_24": "I think what's most worth reporting is the school itself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_25": "Second Solaris School has a hundred years of history. It started out as a single teaching building and grew into one of the town's top schools. It's been through a lot of changes, but it has always held on to its educational philosophy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_26": "The teachers and Principal Abby don't rush to decide our futures for us. Instead, they try to give us enough opportunities to learn and try things, so we can find our own answers and what our futures could be.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_27": "I think the Club Association's Arts Gala deserves attention. Especially the finale the Orchestral Music Club has prepared.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_28": "This year, the Orchestral Music Club has just over a dozen members. For a full orchestra, that's a pretty limited size. Even some of the section principals only joined this semester.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_29": "But they didn't give up on performing. They rearranged the music, reworked the parts, and saw the finale all the way through training and rehearsals.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_3": "It's so lively. Everyone's busy, but they're all smiling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_30": "If I had to pick, it'd be the open house the Student Council has organized.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_31": "For students who aren't comfortable performing and can't join the Arts Gala, the open house is something everyone can take part in. Every class and club has set up its own hands-on stall.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_32": "For anyone visiting for the first time, the best way to get to know the school is to walk around and experience a normal day here, not just read about it or look at displays.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_33": "Well, for the students... the cafeteria's anniversary menu is something to look forward to.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_34": "Plus, students helped design quite a few dishes on this limited menu. After all, our principal's motto is \"Skip one meal and you'll starve.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_35": "(Principal Abby, do you really have a motto like that...?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_36": "I'd also recommend trying them at the cafeteria yourself. Like the \"Midnight Blunder Cup Noodles,\" the \"Chili Oil Flash-Fried Plumpcake,\" the \"Sledgehammer Bread,\" and the \"Spaghetti with No. 42 Concrete.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_37": "Uh, thank you for the recommendations, {PlayerName}. They certainly sound like very... \"creative\" specialties.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_38": "Honestly, I only said that for the camera.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_39": "Of course, Second Solaris School has always encouraged students to be bold and try new things. I'd say that's part of its educational philosophy too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_4": "Well, they've got a legitimate excuse to skip class. For most people, what could be more relaxing and fun than that?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_40": "All right, understood. Next question... If you had to introduce this school to our viewers in one sentence, what would you say?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_41": "Let me think... Second Solaris School is where we all share the same sky and aim for the same sea of stars. We get through the long nights together with our friends, and we keep moving forward as one.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_42": "Cut me in! Cut me in! I spotted you guys a while ago. This is a TV interview, right? One sentence about the school, huh...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_43": "This is a school where something fresh and fun happens every day, and where students' voices and ideas always get heard.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_44": "For me... even ordinary school days here give me tons of inspiration, and together with the friends around me, I can write stories nobody else could tell.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_45": "Roccia? You're here too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_46": "Mm-hmm. Everyone prepared a few little activities for the School Anniversary. So I'm handing out flyers now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_47": "My answer is this: it is a school that not only encourages students to voice their own ideas, but is also willing to grant you a degree of freedom and opportunity to put those ideas into practice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_48": "Good day, everyone. I came to confirm the open house stall arrangements and happened to be passing by.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_49": "It's a school with a rich club culture, where everyone can find their own passion and their own melody! Da, da-da-da-da, da-da!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_5": "Hm? I can't say I feel that way... But there are some people like that in my class. Whenever it's their turn to sweep the central square and they get to skip a self-study course, they get so excited.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_50": "Carty and I just finished rehearsing, so we came to the rest area for a breather. But looking at all this, did we pick a bad time?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_51": "No, you came at just the right time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_52": "Hehe, that's good! Oh, right. This is a school where... even if you've only just arrived, you'll quickly find lots of new things worth trying and make lots of new friends who share your interests.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_53": "Second Solaris School is a school that respects its students' opinions, and one where students take part in building and running the campus themselves.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_54": "Changli, you're here too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_55": "Changli gives a slight nod, her gaze settling on the Celestial Steed Corp staff beside the reporters. She studies them for a few seconds, then casually turns her head aside and lowers her voice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_56": "There are a few matters regarding the anniversary budget I still need to discuss with Principal Abby. May I leave things here in your hands?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_57": "Sure, leave it to me. But from the way you put it, Changli, is something wrong with the budget?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_58": "Nothing serious, really. As for a more detailed expense breakdown... I'll prepare an extra copy for you as well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_59": "Next time, if we have the chance, I'll tell you all about it at leisure.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_6": "Hello, you two. Excuse me, is this where the school's centennial preparations are taking place?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_60": "Changli smiles and gives you a little wave, then turns and leaves with unhurried grace.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_61": "Your answers are all very touching. Though the theme of our report is \"A Century-Old School,\" your answers all seem to be about more everyday things?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_62": "The school's history, its mottos through the years, its traditional and modern teaching philosophies... Those are all part of its century of heritage, sure. But if that's all there was...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_63": "You glance at the friends beside you and share a knowing smile. Your tone eases considerably.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_64": "It'd just be a tour of the school history museum.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_65": "Mm. The past one hundred years of the school isn't made of a single anniversary celebration. It's made of the students living, learning, and growing here, one grade after another. It's made of us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_66": "Yep, yep! If all you covered was \"the big events of the school's last hundred years,\" how boring would that be? Sure, it'd sound super historic, but it'd feel kinda distant too, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_67": "Exactly. \"A century\" isn't just \"a hundred years gone by.\" It's a hundred years built up from countless students and countless ordinary school days.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_68": "It seems that even for a school with such a long history, boundless vitality and youthful possibilities are still taking root.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_69": "Perhaps this year's School Anniversary is a chance to look back on the past and treasure the present, and to open a new chapter in this long history.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_7": "I'm the on-site reporter for Second Solaris TV's live coverage and broadcast. We'd like to interview the student organizations preparing for the centennial.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_70": "Thank you all for taking part in our interview. Next, let's step further into the anniversary preparations and get an up-close look at Second Solaris School as it is today...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_71": "Amid the chatter of the crowd, the reporters and camera crew gradually move off. The Celestial Steed Corp staff who were trailing them also leave one by one.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_72": "Only once the group has disappeared into the crowd does the golden-haired girl, who has been watching from a distance, finally loosen her fists. She hadn't even noticed she was clenching them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_73": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_74": "Phoebe gazes at the busy, bustling scene before her. Students passing by in twos and threes instinctively step around her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_75": "The question the reporter just asked is one she has seriously considered, too: if she had to introduce this school in one sentence.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_76": "She already has her answer, Phoebe thinks. And she wants to... do something for this school, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_77": "Phoebe turns and hurries off toward the Club Association.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_8": "You and Chisa turn toward the voice behind you, only to come face-to-face with the black lens of a camera.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_195_9": "Oh... Hello. I'm Chisa, from the Liaison Center. But if I remember correctly, the interview we arranged with your station wasn't scheduled for today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_1": "Attention, passengers. We are now approaching the final station of this line. Please take your belongings and prepare to exit from the platform on the right. Thank you, meow...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_10": "Hey, over here! Quit gawking. I'm right here—look down!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_11": "Y-you... you can talk? Sorry, I thought you were a plushie someone left here. You're, uh... Abby?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_12": "P-Plushie?! Kids these days. Zero respect for their elders!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_13": "...Hah. Whatever. Guess it makes sense you don't remember me. Been years. Come on, we'll catch up in the car.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_14": "Abby... uh, Uncle Abby? Have we met before?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_15": "Are you kidding me? I held you when you were a baby! Here, hand me your luggage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_16": "(Feels like I just gained memories that don't exist... Were Abby and I really that close?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_17": "(Abby, Abby... Ab...xasra? Abraxas? Abracadabra?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_18": "You can't say why, but... somehow, that's just how Abby's name is supposed to feel.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_19": "As for why you can't remember anything from before, it's likely because you slept through the entire train ride when you first arrived here. Hard to make sense of anything while you're still dreaming.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_2": "(I... I fell asleep on the train? Looks like this is the end of the line. I'd better get off...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_20": "Paying no mind to your bewildered look, Abby turns around, grabs hold of a suitcase three times its size, and hauls it forward with all its might—advancing a legendary four inches.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_21": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_22": "Um, I'll just carry it myself. Uncle... Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_3": "The other passengers seem to have left long ago, leaving the train car empty but for you. You glance around, gather your few belongings, and step out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_4": "An aqua-blue butterfly flutters from a gap in the luggage rack. It lingers in the empty car for a moment, then gently follows in your wake.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_5": "The hum of a radio broadcast, the rain-drenched scent of grass and trees on the wind, and a clear sky unbroken by a single skyscraper...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_6": "After eight long hours of travel, you're back in the <color=#d19f27>small town where you lived as a child</color>. For the <color=#d19f27>next year</color>, this will be your home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_7": "(After getting off, head straight along the sidewalk to reach the reception area. Someone will be waiting by the second pillar to the right of the reception desk.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_8": "Right, this should be the place from the message. But... nobody's here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_1_9": "Excuse me? Your Uncle Abby's been waiting for thirty minutes already.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_2000_1": "Morning, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_2000_10": "Time to wander around town and chat with the friends.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_2000_2": "Results are out tomorrow. This year totally flew by, huh?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_2000_3": "I promised your parents that once your exams were over and the results were out, I'd send you home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_2000_4": "...So soon?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_2000_5": "Every journey has to end somewhere. And this is just one short year of your life.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_2000_6": "Aren't you going to see your friends today? I'm sure we'll all have hotpot together once the results are out, but you should treasure the chance to spend time with each of them, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_2000_7": "Our town isn't that big anyway. You can see most of it in a day. Don't leave yourself any regrets.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_2000_8": "As it happens, I've got some things to take care of today, too. See you at school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_2000_9": "See you at school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_200_1": "Since the <color=#d19f27>School Anniversary</color> is tomorrow, I won't be assigning you any homework today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_200_2": "Galbrena pauses, then breaks into a bright smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_200_3": "Of course, I'll be passing that along to Miss Verina too. Enjoy yourselves tomorrow, everyone. Class dismissed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_200_4": "The lunch bell rings out, met by a roar of cheers from the students.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_200_5": "Just then, a figure in a baseball cap appears on the athletic field, waving hard up at your window.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_200_6": "Looks like it's Cartethyia... Come to think of it, the final rehearsal for the Arts Gala is this afternoon.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_200_7": "Go take a look. After a month of hustle, whatever the final result, it's time to put all that effort to the test.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_20_1": "...\"Trustworthy,\" but can't pass up a snack?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_20_2": "Still, it's nice to walk around on my own.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_1": "In the middle of the athletic field, Cartethyia is waving you over, two paper bags stamped with a fast-food chain's logo in hand. One whiff of the fried aroma drifting out of them, and you can tell she's gone for the highest-calorie combo again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_10": "Still, if you say so, {PlayerName}, I'll be more careful when I order next time! Thanks for the advice, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_11": "You sit shoulder to shoulder with Cartethyia in a corner of the field and polish off the \"crispy\" lunch she brought just for you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_12": "The afternoon sun warms your shoulders. The students' laughter drifts past, and a breeze sweeps over the grass, carrying the fresh scent of green.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_13": "Time really does fly... It feels like just yesterday we were all having lunch together, and in the blink of an eye, the big performance is here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_14": "Are you nervous, Cartethyia?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_15": "Hehe, I'd be lying if I said I wasn't.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_16": "The Orchestral Music Club used to be so disorganized, but the School Anniversary brought us together. Working shoulder-to-shoulder for the same goal... it really is amazing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_17": "If we can keep this spirit alive, then maybe... we could even make it back to the Nationals stage...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_18": "Cartethyia catches herself mid-thought, trailing off into a quiet headshake before continuing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_19": "But I don't feel nervous at all, just happy and excited. Tomorrow, we finally get to share the music we've poured our hearts into with everyone.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_2": "Good afternoon, {PlayerName}. I brought you lunch too. Here you go.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_3": "Since when did you start ordering takeout?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_4": "Well, rehearsals have been tough on everyone. So I talked it over with Leader Ciaccona, and we decided the Orchestral Music Club would take care of lunch for everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_5": "And it hits me! Treat everyone to something tasty at lunch, especially crispy fried food like this, plus a fizzy drink... and they're all fired up at afternoon practice!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_6": "Won't everyone get sleepy after eating all this...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_7": "You've got to keep your diet balanced.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_8": "Oh, it's fine. Rehearsals burn through tons of energy anyway.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_210_9": "Huh? But carbs, veggies, protein, and fats... they're all in there already, aren't they?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_1": "By the time you and Cartethyia reach the venue, the final rehearsal for the Arts Gala has just begun. Only... it doesn't seem to be going well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_10": "Within seconds, flickering blue and green lines sketch out a scene. Clouds floating by, and... from the way the image moves, you can tell it's a girl crouching down and gazing down into the camera.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_11": "If it weren't for the shot number in the top-left corner, you could easily mistake the footage for a piece of surreal, experimental art...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_12": "Um, is this... the final cut?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_13": "I don't get it at all...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_14": "Of course not, this is just the storyboard draft made by the great artist, Encore! So vivid, isn't it? A boy falls from the sky and is woken by a girl out on a walk, and so begins a grand journey—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_15": "Oh, really? I thought it was a classic story opening. A boy falls from the sky and is woken by a girl out on a walk, and so begins a grand journey—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_16": "What I mean is... the real performance is tomorrow, isn't it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_17": "Haha! We haven't swapped in the final video assets yet. This opening bit is just temporary placeholder footage for the projection test.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_18": "A bright laugh rings out from behind. Somehow, Ciaccona, leader of the Orchestral Music Club, has slipped into the seat behind you and Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_19": "Relax. The outsourcing company promised me they'd deliver the final cut before noon tomorrow!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_2": "Hello? Hello? Is this mic acting up again...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_20": "When was the last time they contacted you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_21": "An outsourcing company?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_22": "Well, the last time our contact replied to me, Cartethyia was probably still practicing her lip trills... Uh, that was about two weeks ago?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_23": "Yeah. Our deadline's tight and we're short-handed, so outsourcing it just made more sense. I happened to spot a video production company in the forum's ad section, so I gave them a shot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_24": "I think the contact went by \"AAA Viral Video Creative Scriptwriter Cris\"? And if I remember right... the company's full name should be \"Phro Tech Games Media Advertising Creative Film & TV Directing Catering Co., Ltd.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_25": "...Is this an outsourcing company or a shell company?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_26": "Ciaccona scratches her head, a little embarrassed, and flashes an apologetic and impish grin.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_27": "Ah... haha. Well, it has been a while, but at this point, all we can do is trust them...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_28": "Just have faith! If you wish hard enough, the final cut will definitely show up! It's as simple as that!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_29": "We'd better get a backup plan ready.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_3": "Sigh. Why does everything go wrong the closer we get to the real show?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_30": "Of course I'd trust Mr. Cris... if he were actually trustworthy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_31": "Let's organize the footage we already have. That way, if the outsourcing company flops, we'll at least have <color=#d19f27>a fallback</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_32": "Good point. The raw material is fine, but re-assembling the entire cut on our own... we honestly can't spare the people or the time right now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_33": "I have a friend who knows her way around the internet. She could help.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_34": "I have a very handy friend who could help.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_35": "Uh, I'll try other ways...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_36": "Ooh! You mean Buling, who runs the school forum? Cartethyia told me about that! Back when you all had hotpot at the Student Council, Xiangli Yao said something about, uh...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_37": "...About mobilizing online communities to, uh, dynamically saturate... well, it's all good! Anyway, I'll head back to the Club Association to get our raw footage sorted. I'm counting on you!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_38": "So, Carty, I'm putting you in charge of helping {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_39": "Copy that! Consider it done!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_4": "At that, Chisa darts up to the front of the stage and hands him the megaphone the crew uses in rehearsals.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_40": "A really handy friend? Ooh, I know! You mean Roccia from the school store, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_41": "Then I'll head back to the Club Association to get our raw footage sorted. I'm counting on you!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_42": "Oh, and Carty, I'm putting you in charge of helping {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_43": "Copy that! Consider it done!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_44": "It's quite alright. Don't push yourself too hard, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_45": "Besides, I just checked Phro Tech's recruitment page. They're still desperately hiring chefs, so the company must be doing great! There shouldn't be anything to worry about...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_46": "Er, though I have no idea why they're hiring crisis managers, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_47": "He's a viral-hit screenwriter, right? Then let him finish this footage and show everyone!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_48": "You know, I'm actually tempted to send them my resume...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_49": "Hm? Not sure why you're suddenly so fired up, but... that's right! It's as simple as that!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_5": "All right, we work with what we've got... Ahem. Thank you for that address, Principal Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_50": "Ciaccona breaks into a bright grin and pats you and Cartethyia on the shoulder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_51": "Anyway, let's all just be patient for now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_52": "R-Really?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_53": "I heard there's even an application bonus.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_54": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_55": "Alright, let's all just be patient for now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_56": "It's quite alright. Don't push yourself too hard, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_57": "Besides, I just checked Phro Tech's recruitment page. They're still desperately hiring chefs, so the company must be doing great! There shouldn't be anything to worry about...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_58": "Er, though I have no idea why they're hiring crisis managers, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_59": "He's a viral-hit screenwriter, right? Then let him finish this footage and show everyone!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_6": "A century of passing the torch, united in a single moment of celebration. On this milestone, we are honored to receive warm wishes from generations of our alumni.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_60": "You know, I'm actually tempted to send them my resume...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_61": "Hm? Not sure why you're suddenly so fired up, but... that's right! It's as simple as that!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_62": "Ciaccona breaks into a bright grin and pats you and Cartethyia on the shoulder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_63": "Anyway, let's all just be patient for now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_64": "R-Really?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_65": "I heard there's even an application bonus.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_66": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_67": "Alright, let's all just be patient for now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_7": "Their connection to this school remains as strong as ever. Years of memories converging here today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_8": "Now, please enjoy the centennial commemorative film created by our alumni: <b>Waking of a World</b>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_220_9": "A white beam cuts through the darkened hall, illuminating the projection screen.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_1": "You and Cartethyia race all the way to the Activity Center. Sure enough, there's Buling in the computer classroom, pounding away at the keyboard.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_10": "But up against Cartethyia's sparkling, hopeful gaze, Buling finally caves.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_11": "Fine, fine! Can't leave my friends hanging in an emergency!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_12": "Tell you what, Boss. Pay me this much, and I'll rally my forum buddies for an all-nighter and get the whole thing sorted for you. Deal?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_13": "As she says this, Buling holds out a hand in front of you and spreads all five fingers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_14": "No problem. I'll pay cash.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_15": "I'm a bit short on cash right now. Can I pay you later?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_16": "Now that's what I like to hear, Boss! Hehe, just leave it all to me. Even if we can't get the final cut back from Cris, I'll have an edited version in your hands by tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_17": "Sorry, {PlayerName}... I've made you spend so much money.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_18": "It's a good thing you're here. Otherwise, if something went wrong tomorrow, we'd be in real trouble. Once the rehearsal's over, how about I treat you to ice cream? Just to say thanks!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_19": "It's just a small gesture, so no saying no, okay?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_2": "Heh-heh... Talk to me like that, will you? Let's see if you can still log in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_20": "Well, since you put it that way, I won't hold back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_21": "Of course. You can have as many scoops as you want.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_22": "Ah, it's getting late! I need to get back and prepare for the Orchestral Music Club's rehearsal, so I'd better get going! See you later, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_23": "...I'll pay! It's fine!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_24": "After a moment's hesitation, Cartethyia grits her teeth, fishes her allowance out of her pocket, and hands it to Buling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_25": "Now that's what I like to hear! You're a generous boss too, huh! Hehe, just you watch. Leave it all to me. Even if we can't get the final cut back from Cris, I'll have an edited version in your hands by tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_26": "Sniff... My allowance... I saved it up for so long...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_27": "But if it means the Arts Gala goes off without a hitch, a sacrifice like this is nothing!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_28": "Thanks for stepping up, Cartethyia. Once the rehearsal's over, let me treat you to ice cream.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_29": "Really? Then I'm taking you up on it!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_3": "Buling, do you have a moment?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_30": "Ah, it's getting late! I need to get back and prepare for the Orchestral Music Club's rehearsal, so I'd better get going! See you later, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_4": "Haiya? If it isn't Boss {PlayerName}! Now there's a rare visitor!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_5": "Buling, there's something really important we need your help with!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_6": "Together with Cartethyia, you explain the situation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_7": "It's not that I don't want to help. This one's just... kinda tricky. I mean, the boss of that company you mentioned? He's already on the official deadbeat blacklist.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_8": "Buling shrugs and spreads her hands, making it clear she doesn't have a better idea either.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_225_9": "Pleeease, Buling—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_1": "When you and Cartethyia race to the store, Roccia is curled up inside a box, fast asleep.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_10": "(Working overtime from behind bars... that's a whole new level of depression.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_11": "A private detective?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_12": "Mmhmm... that's right. He calls himself an \"improvisational detective\" who solves cases through \"fictional deduction\" and \"following the current and wind of intuition.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_13": "According to him, step one to catching the culprit is setting your course. Step two... is total improvisation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_14": "At least, that's how he introduces himself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_15": "Sounds amazing...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_16": "That's wonderful! Thank you, Roccia!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_17": "But last night, after he finished work, Detective Brant downed several bottles of that fizzy \"juice\" in one go.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_18": "Given his tolerance for that kind of \"juice,\" he's probably still asleep.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_19": "I'll need something to help clear his head. Since you didn't come prepared, you can pick some up here at my little store first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_2": "Mm... Good afternoon, customers. Is there anything you need?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_20": "No problem. I'll pay cash.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_21": "I'm a bit short on cash right now. Can I pay you later?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_22": "After counting up all the bags, Roccia hefts a case packed with hammers and wrenches and heads out the door.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_23": "Alright, then. I'm heading out. You'll have an answer by tomorrow, guaranteed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_24": "Sorry, {PlayerName}... I've made you spend so much money.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_25": "It's a good thing you're here. Otherwise, if something went wrong tomorrow, we'd be in real trouble. Once the rehearsal's over, how about I treat you to ice cream? Just to say thanks!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_26": "It's just a small gesture, so no saying no, okay?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_27": "Well, since you put it that way, I won't hold back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_28": "Of course. You can have as many scoops as you want.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_29": "Ah, it's getting late! I need to get back and prepare for the Orchestral Music Club's rehearsal, so I'd better get going! See you later, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_3": "Well, Roccia, there's something really important we'd like your help with.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_30": "...I'll pay! It's fine!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_31": "After a moment's hesitation, Cartethyia grits her teeth, fishes her allowance out of her pocket, and hands it to Roccia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_32": "After counting up all the bags, Roccia hefts a case packed with hammers and wrenches and heads out the door.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_33": "Alright, then. I'm heading out. You'll have an answer by tomorrow, guaranteed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_34": "Sniff... My allowance... I saved it up for so long...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_35": "But if it means the Arts Gala goes off without a hitch, a sacrifice like this is nothing!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_36": "Thanks for stepping up, Cartethyia. Once the rehearsal's over, let me treat you to ice cream.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_37": "Really? Then I'm taking you up on it!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_38": "Ah, it's getting late! I need to get back and prepare for the Orchestral Music Club's rehearsal, so I'd better get going! See you later, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_4": "Together with Cartethyia, you explain the situation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_5": "Making a video... I'm not very good at that sort of thing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_6": "Without a moment's hesitation, Cartethyia crouches down, takes Roccia's hand, and looks up at her with eager eyes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_7": "Pleeease, Roccia—help us out! I'll buy the store's annual membership for the next three years!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_8": "If I remember right, a few days ago my big brother Brant, who's also the town's private detective, arrested one of that company's employees.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_230_9": "Maybe I could put in a good word with Detective Brant and convince him to let the person finish his work first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_240_1": "Work on <color=#d19f27>the backup plan</color> has already begun. You don't know how it'll turn out, but at least it's one more safety net.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_240_2": "Better head back to the main venue. If you go now, you should still make it in time for the Orchestral Music Club's final rehearsal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_245_1": "You wait patiently all day, but no word comes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_245_2": "It seems your only hope now is a reply by tomorrow morning. Perhaps Mr. Cris is the sort who gets more efficient the tighter the deadline...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_245_3": "Better head back to the main venue. If you go now, you should still make it in time for the Orchestral Music Club's final rehearsal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_1": "...And with that, this year's Anniversary Arts Gala comes to a close. Thank you all for coming.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_10": "That peace of mind and confidence came from you. They can enjoy school life as it's meant to be up on that anniversary stage only because the Student Council had their backs all along.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_11": "Changli is silent for a moment, then picks up a folded document from beside her and hands it to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_12": "...What's this?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_13": "An itemized expense report for this year's Anniversary. Though... this is a version I've specially \"edited.\" I'd like you to deliver it to Principal Abby tonight, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_14": "I hesitated to drag you into this matter, but now it seems my worries were unnecessary.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_15": "A specially \"edited\" version? So there are other budget reports, then?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_16": "This \"matter\"... it's about the school and Celestial Steed Corp, isn't it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_17": "Heh, that's right. This is the one version the board members must never see. But I believe Principal Abby will make the right judgment once it's in its hands.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_18": "You... really are as sharp as ever.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_19": "This is the one version the board members must never see.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_2": "As the host's closing remarks end, the venue's ambient lights dim one by one. The curtain falls on the final rehearsal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_20": "Changli motions for you to open it. Alongside the detailed figures, the pages carry a host of notes marked in red.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_21": "This budget... it's much higher than I expected.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_22": "Mm. The school invested a lot into this year's anniversary so that everyone could take part. On paper alone, it does look like we went over budget.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_23": "But some things can't be measured in numbers—lighting, prop upkeep, club subsidies... Without them, the Arts Gala loses its heart.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_24": "If these expenses are necessary, why go through the trouble of editing them?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_25": "Changli's gaze drifts across the figures, letting out a soft sigh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_26": "Because... the school isn't as well-funded as it once was.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_27": "To the Board and Celestial Steed Corp, every number here just reads as \"rising operating costs\" and \"declining asset value.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_28": "So relations between the school and the Board aren't exactly friendly?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_29": "No, they aren't. Principal Abby has done everything to mediate, but this problem runs deep.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_3": "You and Changli sit in the darkened audience seats, offering your applause for a rehearsal that has gone off without a hitch.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_30": "The school has never been especially well-off. Years ago, when our results were strong, the Board was willing to invest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_31": "But these past few years... even keeping enrollment up is a struggle.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_32": "Young people are leaving for the big cities. Enrollment shrinks every year, and our finances are stretched to the limit.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_33": "If someone convinced the Board that handing the school over to a corporation was best for both the school and the town...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_34": "How long do you think it'd take for them to say yes?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_35": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_36": "This company... could it be the Celestial Steed Corp that was mentioned in the news?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_37": "Hehe... sharp as always, {PlayerName}. But nothing is set in stone yet, and Principal Abby is still fighting for us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_38": "There's no need to worry about it for now. Tomorrow's the School Anniversary. Be sure to enjoy yourself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_39": "You too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_4": "In just one month, the Orchestral Music Club's performance has been completely transformed. Ciaccona was right, indeed. Cartethyia really has breathed new life into the club.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_40": "Changli smiles and says nothing more, her gaze still resting on the stage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_41": "Once you get back, you'll need to ask Abby what's really going on.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_5": "You put in a mountain of work yourself, Changli.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_6": "Hehe... the Student Council just handles schedules and budgets.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_7": "In the end, it's all tedious work meant for the \"grown-ups.\" Living out your youth on stage... Isn't that what school life is meant to be?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_8": "\"What school life should be,\" huh? I don't think so. Like you said, maybe this work really is \"tedious,\" but...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_250_9": "Without someone securing the schedules, fixing the budgets, and keeping things running, we couldn't have poured ourselves into this without a care.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_1": "The town street is neat and quiet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_10": "Yes?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_11": "Mm... you're welcome. That uniform suits you well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_12": "There's an inexplicable intimacy and familiarity in her words, as if she's known you for a long time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_13": "Have we... met before?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_14": "Thanks. You look good in yours too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_15": "The girl smiles gently, then waves a soft goodbye and says no more.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_16": "Maybe... it's just your imagination. The school bus horn sounds from nearby. You shake your head and hurry toward the bus stop.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_17": "A wind sweeps by, and the resting butterfly startles into flight. It spreads its aqua-blue wings, circles in midair for a moment, then flutters gracefully after the figure receding into the distance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_2": "Children laugh and tumble across the park lawn without a care. Cascades of wisteria hang like purple waterfalls, while lush shrubs peek over the garden walls.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_3": "A gentle breeze drifts by. The flagstone path glows softly in the sunlight, and the window decorations retain the styles of years past... Everything feels just as it did in your childhood.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_4": "It's been so long that I can't quite remember the way... I should ask someone for directions to the school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_5": "Hello, could you tell me how to get to <color=#d19f27>Second Solaris School</color>?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_6": "Just follow this road to the bus stop ahead. You can catch the school bus there. It's only two stops.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_7": "Okay. Thank you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_8": "At your thanks, the girl goes still for a moment.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_25_9": "Thank you...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_1": "So that's more or less how it went... Changli asked me to give you this budget report.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_10": "I think it's about time we laid our cards on the table.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_11": "Is the school's situation really just \"not looking great\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_12": "After a tense silent standoff, Abby's shoulders slump in defeat. With a heavy sigh, it trudges back to the couch and sits down.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_13": "Like I said, this was for the adults to worry about, but... having you students worry about it is my failure as principal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_14": "The truth is, by the time I took over, our financial deficit was already past the point of no return.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_15": "...It's that bad?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_16": "Yeah. Enrollment's been dropping for years. This school used to be the town's crown jewel, but our results and placements have been sliding forever... Continuing like this only digs us deeper into the red.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_17": "And by this year? The losses piled so high that the board finally lost their patience.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_18": "So that's why the school set up an industry-academia collaboration with Celestial Steed Corp?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_19": "Sounds like our school is about to be put up for sale...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_2": "Abby barely skims the figures before its face twists into an expression even more pained than when Phoebe's name came up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_20": "Ugh, \"industry-academia collaboration\" is just the pretty label they put on it. In reality, it's the first step in Celestial Steed Corp's plan to buy us out completely.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_21": "Celestial Steed Corp has their eye on our land. They want to rebrand us into a branch campus for an elite private academy, and scrap the free tuition and scholarship programs that let local kids study here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_22": "Ah, um... yeah, that's basically what it is. This \"industry-academia collaboration\" is just the pretty label they put on it. In reality, it's the first step in Celestial Steed Corp's plan to buy us out completely.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_23": "Celestial Steed Corp has their eye on our land. They want to rebrand us into a branch campus for an elite private academy, and scrap the free tuition and scholarship programs that let local kids study here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_24": "They're after the reputation and prestige this century-old school built up, and they plan to commercialize every last bit of it with the media's help.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_25": "Of course, I was dead set against it. A school is a school... How can you put a price tag on a place like this?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_26": "So over the years, I've tried cutting administrative costs and hunting for outside donations, but... it barely made a dent.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_27": "...Hey, hey, what's with that face? It's way too early to be hitting me with those pitying eyes!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_28": "Is there really no wiggle room at all?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_29": "Heh, as if it were that easy. The chairman of Celestial Steed Corp, Fenrico, just happens to be the most powerful, shadowy, and ruthless member on our board.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_3": "A long silence settles over the room. At last, Abby lifts its head, forcing a couple of strained laughs.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_30": "I hear that anyone on the Board who ever dared to oppose that man has already been...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_31": "Abby bares its teeth and draws a finger sharply across its throat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_32": "Huh? Is it really that serious?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_33": "Is this some kind of crime syndicate controlled by a mysterious mastermind?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_34": "Yeah, terrifying, right? A shadowy corporate titan pulling all the strings from behind the curtain...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_35": "Yeah, terrifying, right...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_36": "The board members keep insisting that selling off the school is what's best for its future and for the town's.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_37": "But if the kids who grew up here can't even afford to go to school, where exactly is this town's future?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_38": "Oh, right. You remember that transfer student, Phoebe? She's Fenrico's daughter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_39": "She's only his adopted daughter, but Fenrico's serious about raising her as his heir to Celestial Steed Corp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_4": "Ha... haha...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_40": "If we can't make her feel welcome here, then forget the school's future. I'm afraid the whole town is finished.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_41": "So that's why you're going to such lengths for this year's Anniversary?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_42": "So... what exactly is Principal Abby's \"visionary leadership\" here?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_43": "Part of it, yeah. I want everyone to have an unforgettable hundredth anniversary. But honestly? You kids work so hard every day. When a rare chance like this comes along, you deserve to let loose and enjoy it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_44": "Er, it's not like we're completely out of options just yet...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_45": "The plan Changli and I drew up hinges on using this Anniversary to show Mr. Fenrico what this town's youth are truly capable of.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_46": "After all, no matter what happens, it's you young folks who are going to build the new era.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_47": "College acceptance rates and national medals aren't the only ways to measure a school. Are we supposed to write off our students' potential just because we don't have shiny awards to parade around?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_48": "So it's basically playing the sympathy card, huh...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_49": "Hey! You really don't pull your punches! Have a little consideration for your Uncle Abby's feelings, would you? As principal, I've been worrying myself sick over this!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_5": "This is even worse than I imagined... but I just couldn't bring myself to crush the students' passion.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_50": "Abby tries to toss it off in a nonchalant tone. The silence stretches between you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_51": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_52": "This is exactly why I hate sharp kids. I never should've told you everything.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_53": "Leave tomorrow's School Anniversary events to us, Uncle Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_54": "Just you wait and see what tomorrow's School Anniversary brings, Principal Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_55": "I'll be the one to change this school's fate. A hero never runs from a fight!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_56": "Hmm? Where'd all this sentimentality come from all of a sudden? Still... Uncle Abby really does feel how much you care, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_57": "But if it were up to me... I'd rather you just go out there and enjoy it, plain and simple, instead of carrying a weight that heavy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_58": "Oh my, getting all formal on me now? I'm really not used to that... Still, Principal Abby does feel how much you care, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_59": "But if it were up to me... I'd rather you just go out there and enjoy it, plain and simple, instead of carrying a weight that heavy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_6": "Anyway, {PlayerName}, it's getting late and tomorrow's a big day. Off to bed with you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_60": "Huh? What are you mumbling about?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_61": "I don't know where you picked up a hot-blooded line like that, but good old Abby really does feel how much you care, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_62": "But if it were up to me... I'd rather you just go out there and enjoy it, plain and simple, instead of carrying a weight that heavy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_63": "Alright, off to bed with you! Kids shouldn't be staying up late brooding over stuff like this. You've got a big show tomorrow!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_64": "And so, Abby shoos you off to get some rest...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_7": "Uncle Abby needs to go rummage through some drawers and see if there's a time machine hidden away...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_8": "Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_260_9": "You step forward, blocking Abby's path back to its room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_270_1": "The word \"really\" is printed in thick, extra-bold type on the note. You can't help a wry smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_270_2": "It's just as Abby told you on your very first day: far more than the school's future, all it truly wants is for you to enjoy a happy, fulfilling student life.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_270_3": "Abby's as busy as ever today... If I get a moment later, I'll swing by Roccia's stall and see if she's got any snacks it likes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_280_1": "Copy that! We're pulling out now! Enjoy the School Anniversary, Chairman—and you too, Milady!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_280_2": "The security guards, crisp in their suits, stand in a neat row and bow at a textbook-perfect, almost rigid ninety degrees, bidding farewell to a middle-aged man and the girl beside him.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_280_3": "You can't shake the feeling you've seen this exact scene before...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_280_4": "As expected, it's Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_280_5": "(So the middle-aged man beside her must be the one Abby mentioned—Fenrico, chairman of Celestial Steed Corp.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_280_6": "Phoebe turns and murmurs a few words to Fenrico before slipping into the crowd as if making an escape, hurrying toward the Arts Gala's backstage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_280_7": "After a wave of astonished whispers, the nearby onlookers are quickly lured back by the dazzling array of club stalls, surging toward Central Square with laughter and chatter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_280_8": "There's still plenty of time before tonight's Arts Gala kicks off, so you can take the chance to wander around campus. You can't remember the school ever being this lively.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_1": "{PlayerName}—!!!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_10": "Ciaccona... You... let go of me first...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_11": "Oops... Haha, sorry, sorry! I got a little excited and hugged you the way I always hug Carty.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_12": "You finally wriggle free of Ciaccona's overly enthusiastic \"back hug\" and rub your neck on reflex, just to make sure you can still breathe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_13": "You turn to her, not sure whether to laugh or sigh, and toss it out half-joking—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_14": "So this is how you thank everyone who helps out, Leader Ciaccona?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_15": "Of course not. Carty's a reliable club member and an adorable junior. You, though...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_16": "...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_17": "You're the big hero who saved the School Anniversary and a friend who matters a lot to everyone here. So of course I should give you an extra-warm thank-you too!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_18": "But I wouldn't say \"I\" saved the School Anniversary.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_19": "Huh? What makes you say that?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_2": "You've barely set foot in the square when a familiar voice rushes toward you. Before you can even turn around, it's already right beside your ear, warm breath brushing against your skin.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_20": "—It was \"us.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_21": "Chasing the same goal with everyone, standing shoulder to shoulder to see this day come—that's what I've been doing all along.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_22": "Such a {PlayerName} answer... But you're right. Having everyone here is what makes today's ensemble feel whole.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_23": "All right, no more heavy talk. Now for the good part: Leader Ciaccona's reward time!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_24": "Before she's even finished, Ciaccona leans in with a smile and, without giving you a say, presses a stack of prize vouches into your hands.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_25": "Here you go! <color=#d19f27>Lucky prize vouchers</color> you can use during the School Anniversary.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_26": "It's not much, I know, but think of it as a special thank-you from all of us at the Club Association, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_27": "Well, I'd better go get ready for the Arts Gala. Have a wonderful day, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_3": "?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_4": "My-my neck... cough, cough...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_5": "Before you can react, her arms are already crossed at your neck, her whole weight draped over your shoulders.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_6": "In a sense, you could say Ciaccona has literally seized your fate by the throat. Were this a wrestling match, the ref would've blown the whistle by now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_7": "The edges of your vision are going black and your breath is coming short... Even so, one thing is unmistakable: Ciaccona is so carried away that she doesn't know her own strength.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_8": "{PlayerName}! We're right on time!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_290_9": "That friend you recommended? Total lifesaver! The video came together right on time, and it turned out even better than we'd hoped. Thank goodness we had you, {PlayerName}. We really owe you two, big time!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_1": "The school is far livelier today than usual. Stalls of every kind already line both sides of the square, students drift through in twos and threes, and the whole campus hums with festive chatter and laughter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_10": "But what's the point of \"having money\" if you don't spend it on moments like this?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_11": "Roccia, could you help me pick something Abby would like?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_12": "Roccia nods, deliberating over each treat before dropping in a few generous extras, then bundles the bag tight and ties off a perfect ribbon bow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_13": "Here you go, {PlayerName}. This one's on the house. Principal Abby does so much for the school, after all. We all know that.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_14": "But if you want some for yourself too, {PlayerName}, then I'll have to charge you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_15": "There you go. Have a lovely day, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_16": "Abby slipped you some extra allowance, but every little bit adds up. Besides, you've always budgeted strictly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_17": "Save enough, and maybe you can even buy the school yourself before Celestial Steed Corp gets its hands on it...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_18": "As you turn to leave, Roccia suddenly calls out to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_19": "{PlayerName}, could you take these pastries to Principal Abby for me?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_2": "You let the crowd carry you along, until a stall's sweet aroma pulls you up short.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_20": "Roccia holds out a bag of pastries to you—noticeably heavier, and wrapped with far more care.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_21": "This one's on the house. Principal Abby does so much for the school, after all. We all know that.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_22": "But if you want some for yourself too, {PlayerName}, then I'll have to charge you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_23": "There you go. Have a lovely day, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_3": "There's Roccia, busy greeting every customer who passes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_4": "Welcome, {PlayerName}. Would you like some festival special snacks? I baked them fresh this morning, in all sorts of flavors.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_5": "On closer inspection, every one of these sugar-dusted pastries is shaped like Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_6": "Abby's been run off its feet with school business. These cost far more than ordinary pastries, but still, they should make a fine School Anniversary gift for the Principal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_7": "It's not every day we have a School Anniversary. Someone ought to treat Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_8": "Maybe next time... Better to save my allowance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_300_9": "Though you've always lived by the wisdom of cutting costs and budgeting every coin with care—hoping that one day your savings will let you buy out the school before Celestial Steed Corp can...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_1": "The town street is neat and quiet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_10": "Yes?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_11": "Mm... you're welcome. That uniform suits you well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_12": "There's an inexplicable intimacy and familiarity in her words, as if she's known you for a long time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_13": "Come to think of it... wasn't she the one who woke you on the train?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_14": "Have we... met before?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_15": "Thanks. You look good in yours too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_16": "On the train earlier...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_17": "The girl smiles gently, then waves a soft goodbye and says no more.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_18": "Maybe... it's just your imagination.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_19": "Oh, please wait.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_2": "Children laugh and tumble across the park lawn without a care. Cascades of wisteria hang like purple waterfalls, while lush shrubs peek over the garden walls.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_20": "Just as you're about to leave, the girl calls out to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_21": "...You dropped this.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_22": "She steps up and places a sheet of paper in your hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_23": "A handwritten piece of <color=#d19f27>sheet music, set upon paired staves</color>. The notes flow in a neat, elegant script, but it looks... only half finished? Several lines of staff on the page are still blank.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_24": "The paired staves tell you it's composed for piano. It's clearly not something you'd carry around.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_25": "Uh, I don't think this is mine...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_26": "But when you look up again, the girl who was just talking softly with you is already gone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_27": "The school bus horn sounds from nearby. With no other choice, you tuck the piano score into your bag for now and hurry toward the bus stop.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_3": "A gentle breeze drifts by. The flagstone path glows softly in the sunlight, and the window decorations retain the styles of years past... Everything feels just as it did in your childhood.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_4": "It's been so long that I can't quite remember the way... I should ask someone for directions to the school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_5": "Hello, could you tell me how to get to <color=#d19f27>Second Solaris School</color>?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_6": "Just follow this road to the bus stop ahead. You can catch the school bus there. It's only two stops.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_7": "Okay. Thank you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_8": "Thanked once again, the girl goes still for a moment.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_30_9": "Thank you...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_310_1": "You've made the rounds of nearly every School Anniversary stall. With the Arts Gala starting any minute, it's time to head to the venue.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_320_1": "Honored guests, teachers, and fellow students—good evening. Welcome to the Arts Gala celebrating our centennial at Second Solaris School.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_320_2": "A century of trials, a flame carried forward. One hundred years ago, Second Solaris School was born alongside our town.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_320_3": "From the fresh green of spring to the white snows of winter, through every greeting and farewell across generations, this school has cradled a century of youth and dreams written by countless hands.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_320_4": "Tonight, we are gathered here...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_320_5": "Xiangli Yao is in top form as host today, and thanks to Chisa's hard work, the stage equipment is running smooth.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_320_6": "Compared to yesterday's rushed rehearsal, the venue is now wrapped in a dignified grandeur you've never felt here before.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_320_7": "In the front row, Changli and Abby seem to be deep in talk with that board member, Fenrico, while Phoebe sits quietly with her head bowed over the gala script and program list.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_320_8": "...Without further ado, please enjoy the centennial commemorative film made by our alumni—\"Waking of a World.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_330_1": "As the screen fades to black, the hall instantly erupts into deafening applause.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_330_2": "A long list of credits and special thanks scrolls slowly past, and there's your name, right at the top, impossible to miss.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_330_3": "Fenrico, seated in the front row, gives an almost imperceptible nod and begins to applaud slowly. His face never loses its composure, yet a hint of approval glimmers deep in his eyes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_330_4": "A hundred years have passed through this campus, and left behind so much worth cherishing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_330_5": "A few short minutes of film can't tell the whole story of this school, but the memories and feelings inside it... I trust they've reached you all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_330_6": "And today, upon a stage steeped in so many memories, our generation takes up the pen for its own chapter. Without further ado, please welcome the Orchestral Music Club...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_330_7": "It seems the hardest stretch is safely behind you, and the Arts Gala is back on track.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_340_1": "As the abstract doodles—little more than simple line sketches—fade from the screen, a smattering of applause ripples through the hall, then quickly dies away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_340_2": "...Looks like the credits and special thanks were the only finished parts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_340_3": "Without a doubt, Cris, the screenwriter from Phro Tech, never delivered the finished film as promised and bolted with the money.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_340_4": "Fenrico, seated in the front row, wears a cold, stern expression. When the film ends, he lets courtesy wring a few perfunctory claps out of him.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_340_5": "Judging by the look on Abby's face, things are looking pretty grim...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_340_6": "Ahem—thank you all for watching. That was certainly an unforgettable film.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_340_7": "Next up, please enjoy the Orchestral Music Club's...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_340_8": "Whatever happens, the Arts Gala must go on. Here's hoping this one goes off without a hitch.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_1": "For our last performance tonight, let's give a round of applause to an orchestra that has accompanied Second Solaris School through a century.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_10": "You give her a small nod, and she answers with a reassuring smile. For some reason, seeing her smile gets something off your chest, as if you've confirmed she won't simply vanish before your eyes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_11": "It's as if... even if you were falling from the highest reaches of the sky, as long as she keeps her eyes on you, there's still time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_12": "Conductor Ciaccona gently raises her hand, and the low prelude rises. Then a trumpet splits the hush, clean and bright, like the first ray of sunlight after a long night.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_13": "Cartethyia's melody trips through the hall like a sprite dancing through the woods, light yet resolute, drawing an answer from every section in turn.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_14": "The girl who's usually all sparkle now wears a focus you've never seen on her before. Weeks of practice, fatigue, grit, and hope—all of it, poured into every rise and fall of her fingertips.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_15": "Even now, some sections still can't be performed as originally written, and the score has had to be rearranged...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_16": "Yet this is the finest performance the Orchestral Music Club can offer today—their absolute best.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_17": "Different melodies thread through one another, layer upon layer, until the resolve and courage of these young players surges into one grand movement and sweeps through the entire hall.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_18": "Like a knight riding straight into the storm, blade held high, cleaving through the towering waves head-on.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_19": "—Yes. This is it. This is the Arts Gala you come for!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_2": "A century ago, they stepped onto this stage, green and nervous. Since then, they've represented the school at Nationals more times than we can count. Piece after piece, they've used music to bridge past and future.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_20": "Even Fenrico, seated in the front row, seems moved by their performance. He listens in silence for a while, then quietly brings a hand up to cover his face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_21": "(...To think the board member Abby's so terrified of has such a soft side.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_22": "And just then, beside Fenrico, Phoebe too—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_23": "Wait. Phoebe's seat... it's empty.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_3": "A century of trials, the turning of the seasons. Yet whenever their melody rises, stories of dreams, of encounters, and of youth echo here once more.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_4": "Next up, the Orchestral Music Club of the Second Solaris School Club Association brings us a symphonic suite—\"To the New World.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_5": "As Xiangli Yao's words fade, the curtain draws back once more, and one by one the stage lights flicker on.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_6": "The Orchestral Music Club members are in position. The hall, so bustling a moment ago, falls silent, leaving only the faint sounds of instruments tuning.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_7": "You look up, past the audience in the front rows. One by one, familiar and unfamiliar faces pass before your eyes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_8": "Through the weave of the crowd, under lights bright as day, Cartethyia's eyes cross the hall and meet yours.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_350_9": "In that instant, the voices around you fade away, as if, long, long ago, this was always your moment—two glances traded like a secret in the middle of a cheering crowd.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_1": "Past the school's main gate, the central square is roughly a five-minute walk. Supposedly, this is the very spot where the town filmed its promotional tourism ad.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_10": "Oh no... Pitch keeps dropping. Tempo too. Oh, I wish I could help them! If only I knew how to play an instrument...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_11": "The bass section? Wait... that instrument on the far right—is that really a cello? The player is perched on a stool, arm raised awkwardly high just to pull the bow across.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_12": "You're no expert on orchestral music, but you know one thing for sure: the performer's posture is visibly strained...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_13": "The girl in the baseball cap folds her arms, tugging at her hair in utter dismay as she stares at the sky. Seeing this, you venture a word.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_14": "It's the double bass.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_15": "Double bass...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_16": "The girl's gaze locks onto you, and in a couple of startlingly quick strides, she's right in front of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_17": "You see... the one on the far right is a double bass. It's a lot bigger than a cello. It's the instrument with the lowest register in the string section, and it usually lays down the bass foundation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_18": "But the performer seems to be treating it like an ordinary cello. They should at least be standing to play it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_19": "At your words, the girl's eyes light up, and she leans in close with a look of pure admiration.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_2": "It's early spring, just before the start of the new semester, so the square remains largely quiet. Only a few students carrying instrument cases wander about, likely gathered for some club activity.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_20": "Then, as if suddenly realizing how close she's gotten to you, she sheepishly steps back a little and raises a hand to smooth down her hair.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_21": "Oh... um, hi! I'm <color=#d19f27>Cartethyia</color>. I'll be a <color=#d19f27>freshman</color> at this school starting tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_22": "Are you... from the<color=#d19f27> Orchestral Music Club</color> too?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_23": "Actually, I'm their instructor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_24": "No, I'm not.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_25": "Huh? S-so you're a teacher... No wonder you knew where the issue was coming from right away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_26": "Just kidding. I'm not actually.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_27": "Oops, my bad! You knew where the issue was coming from right away, so I just assumed you had to be...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_28": "I'm {PlayerName}. I'm a new transfer student, starting tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_29": "Cartethyia tilts her head, tapping her chin thoughtfully.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_3": "Suddenly, a familiar melody catches your ear—a tune you feel like you've heard somewhere before. You stop in your tracks, straining to listen closely.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_30": "Oh, {PlayerName}, are you here because of that post on the <color=#d19f27>school forum</color>?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_31": "A forum post?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_32": "Yes. The pinned one. It says the Orchestral Music Club will be holding open rehearsals in the square over the next few weekends. Everyone's welcome to stop by or sign up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_33": "Sounds important. But... judging by the crowd, the club's not exactly thriving.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_34": "Yeah. Besides the two of us, hardly anyone else showed up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_35": "Then, as if something has just occurred to her, she presses her palms together and gives you an apologetic smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_36": "...I'm sorry. Just give me one second!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_37": "With that, Cartethyia steps forward, clears her throat, and hums her way into the ensemble.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_38": "Rather than stepping in to call out the players' mistakes, she cleverly weaves her voice in a high register, instantly brightening the heavy, murky melody.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_39": "The conductor catches her voice as well and casts a grateful look in your direction. Only when the baton comes down on the measure's final beat does Cartethyia finally let out a quiet sigh of relief.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_4": "But... whether from a lack of members or lack of rehearsal, the moment the strings make their entry, the ensemble devolves into sheer musical chaos.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_40": "Phew... That song was called \"With Glory I Shall Fall.\" I love it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_41": "(\"With Glory I Shall Fall\"...? Pretty sure I've never heard it before.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_42": "People say it tells a tragic story.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_43": "It's about a Blessed Maiden born from a secret plot, cursed from the start, and fused with the very calamity seeking to destroy the world. She chooses martyrdom. Sacrifices herself to end the evil once and for all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_44": "But I think that \"sacrifice\" was the ending she wanted all along.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_45": "Cartethyia...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_46": "Ah, sorry! I got way too serious, didn't I? I just really love this piece... If I ever get the chance, I want to perform it at the <color=#d19f27>National Music Competition</color> someday.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_47": "The National Music Competition?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_48": "Count me in, Coach!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_49": "Yes! It's a nationwide competition for student musicians. There are multiple rounds and judges scoring on technique and expression.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_5": "Sounds like everyone's a bit off today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_50": "Actually, our school's Orchestral Music Club has won the national gold award several years in a row.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_51": "Heh. Didn't expect you to be so fired up! Once school starts, why don't we join together?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_52": "Besides, if you want to pursue music professionally in the future, doing well at <color=#d19f27>Nationals</color> is considered a great first step into the industry.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_53": "You're only a first-year, and you're already thinking that far ahead?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_54": "Haha, it's something my adoptive parents used to talk about all the time. They were really passionate about the arts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_55": "...Your adoptive parents?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_56": "Cartethyia is about to explain when the conductor, now done with the piece, walks over to you both.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_57": "Hi, there! Sorry to jump in. I'm <color=#d19f27>Ciaccona</color>, the leader of the <color=#d19f27>Orchestral Music Club</color>. Thank you so much for coming to watch today's rehearsal!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_58": "Hello, I'm Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_59": "I'm {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_6": "A few steps away, a girl in a baseball cap watches the performance intently, murmuring to herself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_60": "Our double bass player had taken the day off, so we had a cellist fill in last minute. Never expected it to turn into such a mess... Sorry you had to sit through such a rough performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_61": "And wow, you two are observant...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_62": "Ciaccona scratches her head, forcing a casual tone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_63": "Honestly, even the bass section didn't realize they'd tuned too low right away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_64": "\"A rough performance\"...? No, I liked it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_65": "R-Really? You did?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_66": "Ciaccona's eyes widen in disbelief, while Cartethyia gives a firm nod.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_67": "Even though there were a few mistakes, everyone was so in it. I really felt them pouring their hearts into playing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_68": "Getting to share something you love with friends who feel the same... I think that's something truly special.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_69": "The tips of Cartethyia's ears turn faintly pink, and her eyes shine with anticipation... Nobody that sincere could possibly be sarcastic.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_7": "Rhythm's slowing down... Wait, now the melody's drifting. What's going on?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_70": "Awww!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_71": "Ciaccona suddenly screams and clasps Cartethyia's hand tight.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_72": "That's it! Cartethyia, right? You're the one I've been looking for!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_73": "Please join the Orchestral Music Club, Cartethyia! We'll perform together, inspire everyone, and become school idols! If it's you, I'm sure we can save the club from being disbanded!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_74": "W-wait, what? Ciaccona, I have no idea what you're talking about.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_75": "Bombarded with one unfamiliar term after another, Cartethyia is left reeling. She then shoots you a pleading look.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_76": "Since we're already here, why not give it a try?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_77": "Go for it, Cartethyia! I'll be cheering you on!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_78": "You seem pretty taken with orchestral music, Cartethyia. How about giving the Orchestral Music Club a try?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_79": "But I don't know how to play any instruments...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_8": "You can't help but glance her way. She sways slightly, like she's trying to find the beat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_80": "That's totally fine! Lots of members only started after joining. We can all improve together!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_81": "What about you, {PlayerName}? Want to join the club with Cartethyia as well?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_82": "Since you still had no idea what school life would be like, you thank her for the invitation, but decide not to join any clubs for now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_83": "I see... Well then, I'll see you after school starts, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_84": "You say goodbye to Cartethyia and Ciaccona, then leave the central square.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_35_9": "Brass... Woodwinds... Euphoniums... No, none of them. Which bass instrument is off...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_1": "As the applause slowly dies down, Xiangli Yao takes the stage again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_10": "Phoebe stands at the center of the stage, microphone in hand, quietly waiting in silence for the opening notes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_11": "Murmurs still ripple through the audience. No one can quite believe that Phoebe—a board member's daughter—is taking the stage at the School Anniversary.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_12": "And then, her voice cuts through the hall, clear and resolute—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_13": "Fenrico has been watching the stage with bored indifference, his fingers draped over the armrest, tapping out an idle rhythm.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_14": "But as Phoebe's song unfolds verse by verse, his eyes lock onto the stage, and a flicker of surprise crosses his face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_15": "Backlit against the stage, her silhouette stands out with striking clarity. All her unvarnished sincerity pours through her melody.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_16": "Even Fenrico, it seems, fails to anticipate Phoebe doing something so bold.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_17": "(So this... is what they meant by having a real \"ace up their sleeve\" for the Arts Gala.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_2": "Our heartfelt thanks to the Orchestral Music Club for that magnificent piece. As planned, tonight's centennial Arts Gala would end here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_3": "But...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_4": "A week ago, a student came to the Club Association with a rather unique request.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_5": "She wished to take this stage and, in her own voice, offer a heartfelt blessing to the school that has been here for so many of us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_6": "Adding a performance after the registration deadline isn't standard procedure. Yet after conferring with the Student Council and the Club Association, we agreed without hesitation to make room for this special segment.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_7": "Because we believe this century-old school was built from all of our stories, and that everyone who lends their voice here will be an author of Second Solaris School's tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_8": "So now, please join me in welcoming second-year student Phoebe to the stage for a song of blessing honoring Second Solaris School's centennial.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_360_9": "Slowly, the lights in the hall go dark.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_1": "The town stirs earlier than usual on the morning of the School Anniversary. Second Solaris School is its oldest, most prestigious pride, deeply woven into its fabric for a hundred years.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_10": "There was nothing special about the dream, but when I woke up, I felt so much lighter somehow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_11": "So I'm not nervous at all anymore. I'd rather enjoy playing with everyone than fret about slipping up on stage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_12": "Then think of the Arts Gala today as just another rehearsal with the club. You've got this, Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_13": "It's still early. The faint dawn light has yet to clear the rooftops, casting only a pale wash of gold at the far end of the road.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_14": "A breeze drifts across the street, carrying a hint of morning chill as it ruffles the hems of your and Cartethyia's uniforms.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_15": "You walk side by side, trading idle talk. Now and then you slow for the passersby and step aside together to let them through.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_16": "As you round the next corner, an unexpected figure appears before you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_17": "Standing a short way off is Changli, whose home is nowhere near this route. She smiles and waves at you both, and by the look of her, she's been waiting a while.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_18": "Good morning, you two.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_19": "Changli? I didn't expect to see you here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_2": "The shops lining the way to the school have put up centennial banners, making today's celebration feel less like a school anniversary and more like a festival for the whole town.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_20": "Don't you live in the other direction? Isn't this the long way to school for you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_21": "Yes. There was something I wanted to confirm with Cartethyia before the gala, so I took a little detour today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_22": "You mean the plan to win Mr. Fenrico over through the Arts Gala?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_23": "Exactly. There won't be any problems following the original plan. I trust Cartethyia, Ciaccona, and the rest will put on a flawless show tonight.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_24": "But just in case, we've also prepared a real \"ace up our sleeve.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_25": "Hehe, but we can't tell you yet!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_26": "Cartethyia shoots you a wink, lifts a finger to her lips, and flashes you a grinning shush.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_27": "...Not even me?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_28": "It's our secret weapon! Besides, we'd like to give you a little surprise, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_29": "{PlayerName}, you've been on your feet helping everyone since festival prep began. I imagine you know tonight's program inside and out by now?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_3": "Someone catches up to you from around the corner, calling out a greeting.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_30": "Which is why, for today at least, you should set all that aside and enjoy the surprise like any other guest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_31": "So let yourself be a little excited, okay, {PlayerName}? You'll find out tonight!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_4": "{PlayerName}, good morning.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_5": "Morning, Cartethyia. Get some good rest last night?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_6": "A trumpet case slung over her shoulder, she falls into step beside you with a light trot and raises an eyebrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_7": "Hehe, I had sweet dreams all night!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_8": "So did you dream of the gala wrapping up perfectly?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_370_9": "Not quite. I dreamed about our practice. We were all gathered together like usual, going over the score and adjust the tempo over and over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_1": "The performance is over, but the applause in the hall refuses to die down. After a quick word with Changli and Abby, you slip around the audience seating and head backstage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_10": "A flicker of flustered shyness crosses Phoebe's eyes, and she waves both hands at you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_11": "No, no, no. One song, that's all. The real secret weapon is you, {PlayerName}. You've been working nonstop for the School Anniversary.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_12": "If you ask me, {PlayerName}'s more of a \"trump card.\" Wouldn't you agree, {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_13": "I was just doing my part.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_14": "That's right. I am {PlayerName}, the legendary trump card.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_15": "Everyone here played an essential part in this festival.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_16": "No need to be so modest, {PlayerName}. We couldn't have pulled off this School Anniversary without you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_17": "Mm, I agree. Honestly, no one deserves it more, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_18": "Hehe, I knew you'd say that, {PlayerName}. But you're right. Everyone's worked so hard these past few weeks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_19": "Anyway, now you can finally tell me, right? About that real \"ace up your sleeve\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_2": "Unlike the spotlit stage moments ago, backstage is still a flurry of activity. Student Council volunteers weave through the crowd, while the Club Association gathers up their instruments and stage props.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_20": "Why did you want to perform on stage, Phoebe?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_21": "At your question, Phoebe takes a deep breath, clasps her hands to her chest, and begins slowly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_22": "After I came to Second Solaris School, I realized it was nothing like the schools I'd known, nor like what Mr. Fenrico had described, either.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_23": "Actually... Mr. Fenrico is just my adoptive father.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_24": "My birth parents died in an attack when I was little. It was Mr. Fenrico who brought me out of the orphanage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_25": "At my old church school, every day was packed. General studies, etiquette, social skills, tea parties... Even sitting down for lunch came with its own rules of etiquette.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_26": "We smiled when we greeted one another, exchanged pleasantries, and kept our distance. Nobody showed up late, nobody sneaked snacks under a desk, let alone passed notes in class...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_27": "Everyone was kind and so accomplished... but so very distant.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_28": "I never imagined school could mean sharing your favorite food with friends in the cafeteria, complaining loudly about hard exams, or laughing your head off over something silly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_29": "And after school, everyone stays late for their clubs, then strolls back home with an ice cream, eating as they go.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_3": "After a moment of searching, you spot a few familiar faces.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_30": "I... really love this school. And I love everyone here—so sincere, so funny, giving everything for the same goal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_31": "Phoebe...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_32": "Sensing the worry in Cartethyia's voice, Phoebe gently shakes her head and gives you both a reassuring smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_33": "When she speaks again, her voice carries a new, unshakable resolve.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_34": "To Mr. Fenrico, this school is probably just an asset, something whose value gets weighed. And me? I'm probably nothing more than the heir he's raising for Celestial Steed Corp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_35": "My etiquette lessons always taught me to mind my words and conduct, and never let personal feelings get in the way of proper manners.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_36": "...But to me, this is the place where I met every one of you. A place I want to hold dear.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_37": "If I can't even speak up for a place I love, that would be the real discourtesy. The real cowardice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_38": "I know one song probably can't change anyone's mind, let alone prove anything.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_39": "But I still want to tell Mr. Fenrico: don't dismiss what this school means to me, or to any of us. Don't dismiss everything it's given us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_4": "The composure she wore under the spotlight has melted away. Phoebe has finally let her nerves catch up with her. Head hung low, she whispers to Cartethyia, asking how she did.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_40": "At that, Cartethyia dashes over to Phoebe, throws her arms wide, and pulls her into a fierce hug.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_41": "Waaah, Phoebe... our sweet, wonderful Phoebe...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_42": "—Cartethyia!?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_43": "The girl who just gave that moving speech is suddenly bashful. The ears hidden in her hair go pink in an instant.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_44": "{PlayerName}, wh-what should I do...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_45": "Not even sure where to put her hands anymore, Phoebe shoots you a pleading look.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_46": "You smile wryly and step forward to pat Cartethyia on the shoulder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_47": "Phoebe's had a long day. Let's let her get some rest, Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_48": "Ah! Sorry, Phoebe! What you said just now really got to me, and I just... couldn't help myself!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_49": "Cartethyia takes a step back beside you. Murmuring an apology to Phoebe all the while, she discreetly tugs on your sleeve, silently urging you to say something to lighten the mood.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_5": "That song just now was really moving, Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_50": "Good timing, actually. We were planning to come find you after the gala anyway, Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_51": "We're all heading to Chisa's place tonight for a celebration dinner. You should come too, Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_52": "Wait? I can come too...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_53": "Of course! We've all worked so hard for so long. Celebrating without you would just be wrong. Besides, a hotpot party is only fun with a big crowd.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_54": "She's right. Whatever your adoptive father's title is, to us, you're just our friend.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_55": "Hearing you and Cartethyia, Phoebe lets out a breath of relief, and her smile brightens.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_56": "All right, I'll be there. But I might be running a little late, so please go on ahead, {PlayerName}, Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_6": "See? {PlayerName} says so too. You sang beautifully, Phoebe. You've got nothing to worry about.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_7": "Mm... Thank you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_8": "So your \"secret weapon\"... was Phoebe?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_380_9": "H-huh? \"Secret weapon\"? Cartethyia, is that what you and Changli told {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_1": "Over here, over here! We've been waiting forever.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_10": "Course not! H-how could I ever forget my own student?! I just thought, well, if I'd known Miss Phoebe was joining us, I'd have prepared something a bit more formal...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_100": "Caught off guard by an answer so completely unlike Phoebe, Ciaccona and Cartethyia exchange a look.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_101": "Ugh... I knew it, that was too strange... Please, just forget the whole thing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_102": "It's not strange, exactly... How do I put it? The members of our Rock Club are all your type, Phoebe. You know, \"proper young lady\" types...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_103": "Er, who knows? Maybe rock is all the rage among proper young ladies... Don't worry, Phoebe. If there's something you want to do, just go for it!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_104": "That way, when you look back someday, you won't regret holding back out of hesitation or fear, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_105": "Hehe, and honestly? You're not the only one. Every now and then, I want to sing something different, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_106": "With everyone quietly covering for each other, the room gets put back together, and the atmosphere in the room grows much lighter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_107": "Before long, the hotpot is set up and bubbling again... but every time Phoebe reaches for something, everyone stops and waits until she's done before picking up their chopsticks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_108": "This eerie, unspoken synchronization lasts about three rounds before Phoebe can't take it anymore.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_109": "You really don't have to hold back on my account.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_11": "Abby's voice trails off. Head down, it keeps rubbing its chin, muttering to itself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_110": "No, I... I'm really just a little full. Yeah, I'm full!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_111": "You're the guiltiest-looking person in this whole room, Chisa.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_112": "At least take your chopsticks out of the pot before you say \"I'm full.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_113": "Meanwhile, Abby—still sprawled on the table playing dead—finally twitches its nose. Summoned by the aroma of hotpot, it slowly sits up and blinks blearily at the room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_114": "How long was I out? Did I wander into Somnoire? What happened? What happened?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_115": "Ahem. You're awake, Principal Abby? The deal went off without a hitch. The school's been sold.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_116": "Huh? Sold?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_117": "Impossible. Absolutely impossible! I've got eighty thousand elite students holding this school! There's no way it just got sold—that old geezer Fenrico and I had a deal—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_118": "You made all this up. I'm not falling for it!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_119": "Fenrico... that old geezer?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_12": "...Wait, if Phoebe's here, does that mean... Fenrico's softening up? No, he said he had business to wrap up, so it can't be that simple...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_120": "I'm so cooked. I forgot Phoebe was here too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_121": "The mood that had only just begun to thaw plunges right back to freezing. Everyone exchanges glances, and silence falls once again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_122": "Pfft... Old geezer, haha...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_123": "In the silent room, the only sound is Phoebe's laughter, which she tries to stifle but can't quite hide.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_124": "She raises a hand to cover her mouth, still struggling to keep up her usual poise and composure, but her eyes have already curved into crescents, her lashes trembling softly with every laugh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_125": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_126": "Ha, haha... ha, hahaha—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_127": "Hahaha, hahaha—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_128": "At this point, all you can do is laugh along.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_129": "As the laughter swells, everyone gets swept up in Phoebe's joy, and the awkwardness melts away. All that's left is the relief of letting go, and pure, unvarnished happiness.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_13": "Abby frowns in thought for a while, then laces its fingers across its forehead—the very picture of a mastermind.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_130": "(I'd expect it from Ciaccona and Cartethyia, but I never thought I'd see the Student Council crack up like this. Especially Changli. It's rare to see her this openly happy.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_131": "(Still... maybe it's exactly this kind of peaceful, silly everyday life that's truly precious. That's what real happiness is.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_132": "(And now, Abby's hotpot parties... finally have a full table.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_14": "All right, listen up, everyone! As of this very second, Second Solaris School is calling an emergency war council!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_15": "We might have secured some initial victories during our School Anniversary operation, but the real trial from the School Board and Celestial Steed Corp has only just begun.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_16": "—Phoebe. She may be the ace up Celestial Steed Corp's sleeve, the one it has never played...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_17": "(No, no, no. You're clearly overthinking this, Abby...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_18": "Do we survive... or do we perish?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_19": "Abby slams the table and shoots to its feet, thrusting a clenched fist forward, eyes blazing with resolve.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_2": "Inside the restaurant's private dining room, Abby is hollering at everyone to take their seats. You've never seen so many people packed in here before. Suddenly, the once-spacious room is bursting at the seams.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_20": "Students! In this critical hour that will decide our school's survival, we must show the School Board and Celestial Steed Corp what Second Solaris School is made of!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_21": "Excuse me—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_22": "Just then, hurried footsteps race toward the door of the private room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_23": "Everyone—watch out!! Delivery Bot's recognition system is acting up—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_24": "Beep, beep. Destination reached. Esteemed customer, your \"Hot-Hot-Hot: Extra-Spicy Red Oil Hotpot Broth\" is delivered!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_25": "...Ah.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_26": "Right in front of everyone, the Delivery Bot pulls off a textbook high-speed drift and emergency stop. A split second later, the broth goes flying, tracing a perfect arc through the air—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_27": "Chisa draws a sharp breath.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_28": "Carried by momentum, the broth lands squarely on Abby, who's standing up front and holding that dashing pose.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_29": "Owwww—hot, hot, hot, hot, hot—!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_3": "My apologies for the delay. Cleaning up the venue took a little longer than expected.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_30": "P-Principal Abby? Principal Abby! Are you all right? Principal Abby?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_31": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_32": "What is it that blinds my eyes...? Why is nothing left before me but endless silence and darkness...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_33": "Such fragility... and its name is hotpot!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_34": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_35": "Principal Abby musters one final burst of drama, delivers two theatrical lines, and collapses.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_36": "You're way too into your role, Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_37": "I'll get Principal Abby to the hospital right now. There's still time!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_38": "As she speaks, Chisa rights the toppled Delivery Bot. After a dizzying flurry of button-mashing, it lets out a rapid mechanical whir.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_39": "Next, it spins rapidly in place, its mechanical arms folding and reassembling in a blur—and the Delivery Bot is suddenly a one-wheeled stretcher.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_4": "Phoebe said she'd be a little late too. Let's save her a seat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_40": "Phew... First real test run for the Delivery Bot's first-aid add-on. The transformation went smoother than I expected.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_41": "(Good for her. But why would anyone give a delivery bot a first-aid function...?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_42": "While you're quietly roasting all this in your head, Xiangli Yao has already pulled on an exaggerated look of utter grief, his voice heavy as he speaks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_43": "No, Chisa. It's... too late now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_44": "(No matter how I look at it, Abby's just faking a faint to dodge the so-called \"real trial from the School Board and Celestial Steed Corp.\")",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_45": "How can this be—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_46": "Uh, maybe it's because Phoebe has arrived.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_47": "Hahaha, looks like our school is really done for this time!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_48": "(You've not only accepted it, you're now laughing about it?! I really underestimated you, Leader Ciaccona.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_49": "Amid Ciaccona's hearty laughter, the door swings open, and in step two security guards in dark sunglasses.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_5": "Huh? Phoebe? She's coming tonight too? Then what about her adoptive father...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_50": "Stern-faced, the pair stand with their hands clasped behind their backs, one on either side, and shout in perfect unison:",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_51": "Make way, all of you! Clear out for Milady!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_52": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_53": "You've seen this kind of theatrical entrance more than once, but the corner of your mouth still twitches.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_54": "Looking just as mortified, Phoebe steps out from behind the guards.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_55": "Um... good evening, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_56": "Good evening, Milady!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_57": "For a moment, the private room falls deathly silent. Is never leaving a word of Phoebe's hanging part of their security training too...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_58": "Catching the room's reaction, Phoebe clearly realizes the whole display went too far. Flustered, she turns around and whispers something to her guards.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_59": "You two, please go and get some rest. I'm just having dinner with friends. I'll be perfectly fine on my own.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_6": "Mr. Fenrico said he had some business to attend to at Celestial Steed Corp, so he's already left.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_60": "Milady's safety comes before all else!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_61": "Sigh... You really don't need to stand guard here. If you're that concerned, why don't you two sit down and join us?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_62": "Milady's safety comes before all else!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_63": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_64": "Having given up on persuading them, Phoebe turns to everyone in the room with a resigned look. Only then does she notice—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_65": "Huh? Why is Principal Abby slumped over the table? And is that... a stretcher?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_66": "Abby's in a carb coma. Let it sleep it off for a bit.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_67": "Wake up, Abby. How can you be sleeping at your age?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_68": "It's over, Chisa. Just turn yourself in!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_69": "Huh? Did you all finish a round already? No wonder there's no broth in the pot...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_7": "Principal—Abby—!!!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_70": "Not yet. Abby just ate too many snacks. The broth's still on its way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_71": "As for the stretcher... Chisa was just demoing a new feature on the Delivery Bot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_72": "You've managed to bluff your way through for now, but the guards' still-wary stares say you're far from out of the woods.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_73": "Playing it cool, you pat Abby down and hoist it up under the arms. From where Phoebe's standing, it ought to pass for just a bit worn out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_74": "Principal Abby has been busy all day, and lost its voice. Best to let it rest and speak less.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_75": "Mm. Everyone has all worked so hard these past few days. Principal Abby too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_76": "As for the stretcher... Chisa was just demoing a new feature on the Delivery Bot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_77": "You've managed to bluff your way through for now, but the guards' still-wary stares say you're far from out of the woods.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_78": "It's okay, Chisa. If you come clean now, they might go easy on you...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_79": "—Huh!?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_8": "Ciaccona drags out each word on purpose, keeping a straight face as she feigns indignation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_80": "Chisa's eyes go wide in disbelief at your words. Caught off guard, her gaze darts nervously between you and Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_81": "Chisa mulls it over for a good long while. Just as she finally works up the nerve to speak, Cartethyia jumps in and smooths things over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_82": "Principal Abby's been overworking these past few days. Let's let it get some rest for now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_83": "As for the stretcher and all the \"turn yourself in\" stuff, Chisa was just showing us the Delivery Bot's new feature, that's all!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_84": "I see... Everyone has all worked so hard these past few days. Principal Abby too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_85": "You've managed to bluff your way through for now, but the guards' still-wary stares say you're far from out of the woods.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_86": "Haha, that reminds me—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_87": "As if to break the awkward silence, Ciaccona suddenly changes the subject.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_88": "Phoebe, you were absolutely wonderful on stage today! Ever thought about coming over to the Club Association?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_89": "In the split second Phoebe is lost in thought, Ciaccona, Cartethyia, and Chisa swiftly whisk away the hotpot that took Abby down.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_9": "Phoebe's not just on the Student Council. She was one of the stars of today's Arts Gala, you know? She worked her tail off for the festival, too. Principal Abby, don't tell me you forgot about her?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_90": "Huh? The Club Association... do you mean music clubs like the Orchestral Music Club?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_91": "The Orchestral Music Club is just one part of the Club Association. Though we really are short on members... Sigh. Are becoming school idols really the only door left open to us...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_92": "That's right! We've got plenty of other clubs—Film Club, Track and Field, Literature Club... Just pick whichever one interests you, Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_93": "I see... That's not quite what I had in mind. Although, now that you mention it, there is one thing I've always wanted to try.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_94": "Ciaccona and Cartethyia perk up at that, both leaning in toward Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_95": "Ooh! Tell us, tell us!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_96": "I want to...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_97": "You want to—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_98": "Phoebe swallows hard, shuts her eyes like she's taking a plunge, and draws a deep breath.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_390_99": "Rock!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_1": "Ahh, I'm stuffed.... After a long day, nothing beats a good, hearty meal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_10": "Happy School Anniversary, Principal Abby. Thanks for all your hard work.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_11": "Abby freezes for a moment, then scratches its head bashfully. When it looks up again, its eyes are shining, catching little glints of light.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_12": "{PlayerName}... These are the best, the very best cookies I've ever had.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_13": "Happy anniversary to you too, {PlayerName}... No, no, no. I hope you're happy every single day!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_2": "Abby, I brought you some of Roccia's special School Anniversary cookies.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_3": "You fish the bulging bag of cookies from your backpack and hand it to Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_4": "Aww! I knew you wouldn't forget, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_5": "I lost count of how many times I ran past Roccia's stall today! But nope, always too busy to stop... didn't even get a chance to wait in line. They've been on my mind all day long!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_6": "Gimme, gimme! ...Wait, what?! They're shaped like me?! Look at that dashing little figure! Aw, now I don't even know if I can eat it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_7": "Mmf, mmf... Mm-mm-mm... Oh, delicious! Thank you so much, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_8": "Oh, right, were they expensive? Don't tell me you blew all your allowance on these.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_395_9": "These are a gift from Roccia. On the house.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_400_1": "Looks like the School Anniversary really did change Mr. Fenrico's mind.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_400_2": "<color=#d19f27>Final exams</color>, huh... Guess it's time I got serious about studying.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_1": "Inside the Teaching Building, everything is surprisingly modern—smart multimedia teaching devices, full air conditioning, and central elevators serving every floor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_10": "The abrupt question catches you off guard. Beyond her polite phrasing... the words themselves don't sound friendly at all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_11": "Worth the tuition? Sorry, I'm not sure I follow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_12": "...Hm? My apologies. That was abrupt of me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_13": "Principal Abby informed me that a freshman from the <color=#d19f27>School Board</color> would be visiting. But from what I can tell, you're not here to flash that badge. You just want to be a regular student.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_14": "Could you tell me more about the school?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_15": "Um... I think there may be a misunderstanding.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_16": "You're right. I'm a proud member of the School Board.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_17": "Gladly. Helping new students settle into school life is part of the Student Council's duty. Though whether or not the Principal's information was accurate, it's unusual for a freshman to visit campus the weekend before the semester begins.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_18": "Really? I suppose it is unusual for a freshman to visit campus the weekend before the semester begins. Not to mention, your bearing reminds me of a certain <color=#d19f27>legendary alumnus</color>...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_19": "Hehe. Oh, it's nothing. I got carried away. In any case, helping new students settle into school life is part of the <color=#d19f27>Student Council's</color> duty.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_2": "With the semester yet to begin, the building stands empty. Wind sweeps through the clean, bright corridors, deepening the tranquility. As principal, Abby has clearly invested significant thought into the school's facilities.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_20": "As I expected. Not only is it unusual for a freshman to visit campus the weekend before the semester begins, but you carry yourself with... remarkable composure.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_21": "Please, come with me. I'd be happy to introduce you to the history and current state of our century-old school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_22": "Oh, before we begin, would you like to try this?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_23": "She hands you a cup, still steaming. Judging by the print on the paper cup, it seems to be the school's own specialty drink.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_24": "Is this... coffee?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_25": "If you ever join the Student Council, coffee's on tap, twenty-four-seven.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_26": "Of course, having someone from the Board join us would be an honor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_27": "Nice coffee.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_28": "I really don't have any ties to the School Board...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_29": "Sounds like the Student Council has a lot on its plate.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_3": "Tap... tap-tap—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_30": "It's just from the machine in the Student Council room. Happy to hear it passes the test.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_31": "Modest too, hm? What a shame not everyone on the Board shares that quality.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_32": "You're quite perceptive. Still, I believe that load is one \"we\" ought to shoulder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_33": "Student interests. Academic exchange. Campus culture. Volunteer work. Events, including the big anniversary bash. That's the Council's turf.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_34": "With Changli as your guide, you soon get a feel for the school's layout and surroundings.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_35": "The school is divided into five main areas. The one you're standing in now is the main Teaching Building, where day-to-day classes are held.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_36": "That retro building over there is the Administration Building. The Principal's office and Student Council are both in there.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_37": "Across from it is the Activity Center. That's where the Club Association holds most of its events.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_38": "On the other side of the square is the Liaison Center. It handles school exchanges and corporate partnerships.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_39": "And that rather flashy building by the field, the one with the \"For Rent\" sign? Leftover from the town's tourism push. First floor's been turned into the school store.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_4": "The crisp strike of heels sounds along the floor. Behind you, a soft female voice breaks the silence.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_40": "...It really doesn't fit in with the rest of the school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_41": "It still looks impressive.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_42": "Oh? You think so? Well, I suppose that's one way to see it. When that building first went up, the town had high hopes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_43": "Perhaps. After all the money spent on it, \"impressive\" is about the only compliment left. And for the Board, that's not exactly a point of pride.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_44": "Sounds like there's a story behind it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_45": "Just old baggage. \"Every school has its skeletons,\" as they say.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_46": "At least the students here enjoy their campus life. That's what matters, isn't it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_47": "It seems we're nearly out of time. I still don't know your name, but... let's leave our first \"official\" meeting until after the semester begins—freshman from the School Board.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_48": "I—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_49": "It's all right. I understand. After all... Some people don't want the red carpet treatment just because of who they know.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_5": "Excuse me. You must be the freshman visiting the school today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_50": "For now, let's save the formal introductions for a more fitting occasion.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_51": "You have no idea what she means by \"a more fitting occasion,\" but one thing is clear: she has completely mistaken you for someone else. Still, since she's so insistent, pressing her any further would only be pointless.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_52": "In sunlight cut into a crosshatch by the window frames, Changli smiles and waves goodbye. With little choice, you give her a resigned wave of your own and turn to leave.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_53": "Meanwhile, a blonde girl brushes past you, heading straight for Changli.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_6": "Pleasure to meet you. I'm <color=#d19f27>Changli</color>, <color=#d19f27>Student Council President</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_7": "As you can see, the school is well maintained. Top-tier facilities, excellent faculty. But there's one thing I'm curious about...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_8": "As she speaks, Changli surveys the surroundings alongside you. Her smile is warm and polite, yet her eyes narrow ever so slightly, and when her gaze settles back on you, there's something knowing in it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_40_9": "In your opinion, does this place feel worth the tuition?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_1": "Ring, ring—ring, ring—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_10": "Nationals caps how many teams can get in, so every region runs its own qualifiers first. The top finishers from those move on to the next stage of the competition.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_11": "For the qualifiers, you only play two pieces: one set by the judges and one of your choice. So it's not as tough to get in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_12": "Cartethyia kicks at a pebble with the tip of her shoe, her fingers tightening around her bag strap without her noticing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_13": "Honestly, the success of the School Anniversary Arts Gala gave everyone a huge confidence boost.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_14": "And it left us all feeling the same way: what a shame it'd be to practice here every day and never once reach for a bigger stage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_15": "Climb higher, and the view stretches farther and lovelier. Right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_16": "Wherever you end up, the courage to take that first step is a victory in itself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_17": "So I'll be looking forward to it—to your performance on the Nationals stage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_18": "At your words, Cartethyia cocks her head, flashes you a playful smile, and her voice lifts again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_19": "Mm-hm! We're gonna do our absolute best!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_2": "As the after-school clamor drains from the halls, the buildings are left in hushed stillness. You pack your bag and step out through the school gates into the glow of the setting sun.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_20": "The qualifiers are in early July. If you've got time, {PlayerName}, feel free to drop by and inspect our rehearsals!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_21": "Looks like the <color=#d19f27>mock exam</color> isn't the only challenge on the horizon. For the Orchestral Music Club, a new one has quietly begun.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_22": "Over the days to come, you'll have to decide how to split your time...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_3": "{PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_4": "A brisk patter of footsteps closes the distance, and before you can glance back, a hand claps your shoulder as Cartethyia jogs up alongside you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_5": "Cartethyia? Aren't you supposed to be at Orchestral Music Club rehearsal right now?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_6": "Practice is off for today! Leader Ciaccona wants us all to take a breather and recharge while we've got the chance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_7": "Sounds like the Club Association's got something new brewing?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_8": "Yep! Registration for the <color=#d19f27>Nationals qualifiers</color> is about to open.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_410_9": "...Qualifiers?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_1": "...And that concludes our final lecture of the term. Next Monday kicks off a week of <color=#d19f27>review for finals</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_10": "(But I still have no idea how it turned out.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_11": "One more thing. Since the School Anniversary, has Principal Abby given you any word on the Board?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_12": "No.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_13": "I see... I haven't heard much either. Though a few days ago, my family did mention that Celestial Steed Corp seems to be redirecting its investments.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_14": "Shall we, {PlayerName}? I suspect we're about to find out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_2": "And <color=#d19f27>a week after that</color> comes this semester's final exam, doubling as <color=#d19f27>a mock run of this year's Qualifying Exam</color>. I wish you all the best of luck.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_3": "That said, brace yourselves for whatever results you get. If your grades aren't what you hoped for, take it in stride. Never let a test define your worth.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_4": "Securing the best outcome requires adjusting your strategic deployment to the situation and tailoring your tactics to the field.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_5": "All right, class dismissed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_6": "Maybe the upcoming mock exam is to blame. After class, the room holds less of its usual chatter. Students gather in small groups, sorting notes and mapping out their study plans.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_7": "{PlayerName}, would you care to join me for coffee at the Council office later? Principal Abby says it has something to discuss with us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_8": "Sure, no problem.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_420_9": "(Abby... It's been a month since the School Anniversary. From what it said back then, it should've finished negotiating with the Board and Celestial Steed Corp by now.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_1": "By the time you and Changli arrive at the Student Council office, Abby is excitedly telling Cartethyia, Xiangli Yao, and Phoebe about a certain legendary alumnus.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_10": "Don't you doubt me. It's all in the school archives! I personally annotated and edited them myself. Hmph!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_100": "Beside you, Abby's nose twitches. Then it turns to you with a look like it's about to burst into tears.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_101": "Only its dignity as principal is holding it back. Otherwise it'd already be sobbing into your sleeve.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_102": "{PlayerName}'s right. Instead of \"picking out the five students who might get an A,\" we should inspire everyone to \"aim for an A.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_103": "Which makes the next six months all the more important.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_104": "If we want our footprints on the Nationals finals stage, then from this moment on, let's give it our all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_105": "That's right. It's time to make every second count.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_106": "\"There is only one true heroism in the world: to see life for what it is, and love it anyway.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_107": "The road is long and hard, yet we'll get there so long as we keep walking. Onward together, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_108": "W-waaah... You guys...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_109": "Abby looks back and forth, scanning each earnest, resolute face as it blinks furiously to keep the tears from spilling over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_11": "The more Abby talks, the more worked up it gets, arms flailing through the air. Even its posture starts to slip, as if it's itching to reenact those glory days for everyone right then and there.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_110": "With a deep breath, Abby beams from ear to ear.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_111": "Finals and qualifiers—let's crush 'em!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_112": "Time to show what we're made of, and let the world see just what this school's students can do!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_12": "And yet that very same student went on to smash the all-time record on the Qualifying Exam!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_13": "Thanks to {Male=her;Female=his} influence, that graduating class set admission records this school still hasn't topped.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_14": "And that's not all. That same year, our school swept gold in every single event at Nationals.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_15": "Oh-ho-ho... and here I thought I'd seen it all. Even I had to tip my hat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_16": "You didn't think that was the end of it, did you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_17": "Truth is, years ago our school was hit by a carefully planned attack. They had a gun to our school doctor's head!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_18": "Hearing this, Cartethyia gives a perfectly timed gasp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_19": "One heartbeat from disaster, that student flash-stepped in and closed the distance in the blink of an eye—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_2": "Heheh, {Male=she;Female=he} was something else!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_20": "...Um, Principal Abby...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_21": "After hesitating for a long while, Phoebe can't hold back anymore and interrupts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_22": "The seniors have been standing at the door for a while now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_23": "Hm? Oh! There you are! Come take a seat. I was just giving them a lesson on our school's history.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_24": "Abby clears its throat with great solemnity, its tone turning far more serious.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_25": "So you see, students. As the saying goes, \"The teacher opens the door, but you must enter by yourself.\" When it comes to learning, you're the ones who decide the outcome. Never sell your potential short.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_26": "Is that school history even legit?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_27": "This story would make a pretty good movie.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_28": "You hold the principal's seat now. You must study!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_29": "Principal Abby, a touch of artistic embellishment does make a story more entertaining. The key is knowing when to \"stop.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_3": "A whole pack of teachers had {Male=her;Female=him} surrounded, and {Male=she;Female=he} just blasted right through, then roared off on a motorcycle—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_30": "No problem! Next time I give the school history talk, no more plain facts like today. I'll add some proper seasoning.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_31": "So, that entire story was the \"no embellishment\" version?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_32": "Totally! It'd make a great action movie. We could call it... \"Operation: Back to School\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_33": "How about \"School Fighter,\" or \"The Terrifying Scythe Man\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_34": "How did we go from comedy to horror...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_35": "Huh? What are you talking about? I have no idea!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_36": "Wait, do I have to study too?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_37": "Exactly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_38": "Hey, come on! I just figured that as principal, getting closer to students would get you all fired up to study!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_39": "Abby plants its hands on its hips and looks across the room, its expression turning serious.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_4": "Huh? {Male=She;Female=He} skipped class on a motorcycle? That sounds so cool.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_40": "Now that pretty much everyone's here, let's get down to business. The real reason I called you all here is that the School Board and Celestial Steed Corp have made a new decision.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_41": "After dropping by for our centennial festival, a few board members walked away seeing this school—and all of you—in a new light.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_42": "So after some talks with Celestial Steed Corp, the Board has decided to run <color=#d19f27>one final evaluation</color> before restructuring the school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_43": "Thanks for handling all that, Abby. They didn't give you a hard time, did they?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_44": "Excuse you! I'm the principal, remember?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_45": "A final evaluation... Principal Abby, you went out of your way to call Phoebe and me in today. Does that mean <color=#d19f27>this evaluation</color> involves the Club Association too?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_46": "Exactly. The bar was set at <color=#d19f27>five students scoring an A on this year's Qualifying Exam</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_47": "But after hearing the Orchestral Music Club perform, Mr. Fenrico added <color=#d19f27>an extra condition</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_48": "—<color=#d19f27>Win any gold award in the finals of the National Music Competition</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_49": "<color=#d19f27>Meet either one of those conditions, and the school stays</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_5": "...Wait, Cartethyia. Why do you sound so openly envious...? Skipping class is against school rules, isn't it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_50": "No wonder Ciaccona's been so busy putting together the roster for this summer's regional qualifiers... That was what it was all about.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_51": "From here on out, the <color=#d19f27>Student Council</color>, which handles student affairs, and the <color=#d19f27>Club Association</color>, which represents the school at Nationals, will hold the key to the school's future.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_52": "Both the <color=#d19f27>Qualifying Exam</color> and <color=#d19f27>Nationals</color> are in <color=#d19f27>late November</color>. That gives us <color=#d19f27>six months</color> to prepare before the final evaluation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_53": "Maybe the news came too suddenly. For a moment, nobody says a word.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_54": "Principal Abby, I don't mean to dampen anyone's spirits, but... you do realize what an A on the Qualifying Exam takes, don't you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_55": "Changli is the first to break the near-suffocating silence.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_56": "...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_57": "Seeing your puzzled look, Changli calmly explains:",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_58": "Your choice of school and field won't hinge on the Qualifying Exam alone. Many other factors are considered, including awards from Nationals...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_59": "In other words, you may also pursue further education on the strength of your own talents, by competing at Nationals and earning awards in your field.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_6": "Principal Abby, by your own account, that student was driving without a license. That's a serious offense.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_60": "Still, it's a major exam. Every third-year sits it, no exceptions.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_61": "And of everyone who sits it, only the top five percent overall receive an A.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_62": "As for an S, only two or three in every ten thousand ever manage it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_63": "I-I know it's not easy. But with Changli, Xiangli Yao, and {PlayerName} on our side, it's not totally impossible, right...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_64": "But judging by the current average of our third-years, that target's asking for a miracle. Even if all three of us get an A, where do the other two come from?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_65": "Hmm... As for the Club Association, the Orchestral Music Club has already signed up for the regional qualifiers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_66": "But honestly, the way we are right now... uh, Leader Ciaccona and I will both do our best.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_67": "If we can muster the same fire we had at the School Anniversary, the regionals should be doable... right? I guess...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_68": "And the finals at Nationals... hah... ha...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_69": "Without a word, she drifts to the corner of the office and crouches low, knees hugged to her chest. The light drains from her eyes. Her face settles into the placid calm of someone has transcended all worldly cares.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_7": "Besides, no motor vehicles are allowed within the school area.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_70": "You step beside Cartethyia, lean down, and gently pat her shoulder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_71": "Silence falls over the room again. Eyes drift from face to face in the quiet, but no one speaks up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_72": "Conditions like these... might be a bit too much for us right now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_73": "Phoebe presses her lips together. The hand at her side slowly curls into a fist, her nails digging into her palm.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_74": "...I'll go talk to Mr. Fenrico again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_75": "Hey now, wipe those gloomy faces off! All you've gotta do is move at your own pace and keep chasing your original goals.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_76": "Abby forces a chirpy tone, trying to break the gloom in the room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_77": "I only brought this up to light a fire in you. Give you a reason to reach for something higher. Because hey, the mountain's right there.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_78": "If all it did was load you down with stress, I've completely missed the mark! Think back to the School Anniversary—if the Board sees new potential in you all, this whole thing could turn around!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_79": "All right, all right, no more long faces!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_8": "Pfft, that's nothing!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_80": "(If things were truly that easy, Abby wouldn't have spent a whole month in talks only to be saddled with conditions this harsh.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_81": "(In fact, neither the Board nor Celestial Steed Corp ever believed us could pull it off.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_82": "It seems everyone's thinking the same thing. Abby's pep talk falls flat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_83": "Ahem, kids, haven't I always told you, \"Exams have only one right answer. Life doesn't\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_84": "So you see? My most important job as principal is making sure none of you look back on your youth with regret. That's what I want most for every one of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_85": "Even if the school does get restructured, that's a problem for later. Maybe things won't be as bad as we think?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_86": "Yet if that happens, the barrier to entry for local children will rise, and some will inevitably be stripped of their right to learn.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_87": "I agree with the President. Running the school like a commercial enterprise is fundamentally misguided.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_88": "Most kids raised here grow up looking up to this school... It's no exaggeration to say their parents were probably once students here, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_89": "So this school must hold the memories and dreams of countless people. And if we're talking about \"no regrets\"... we sure can't let it end here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_9": "{Male=She;Female=He} once got rammed square in the midsection by another student's motorcycle, sent flying a good few meters. And yet {Male=she;Female=he} just dusted {Male=herself;Female=himself} off and stood right back up without batting an eye. Not a scratch!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_90": "Me too. I love it here. Being with all of you makes me happy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_91": "As everyone's voices trail off, their disappointment hard to hide, you step forward and stand beside Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_92": "Let's not lose heart just yet, everyone. However things turn out, we still have a full six months before the final evaluation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_93": "The regional qualifiers aren't the only way onto the Nationals stage. There's the sponsor recommendation route too. And this mock exam only measures where you stand today. It doesn't write the ending.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_94": "Like Miss Galbrena said in class, securing the best outcome requires adjusting your strategic deployment to the situation and tailoring your tactics to the field.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_95": "None of those conditions can be met by just a few of us. Which, I think, is exactly why Abby called the Club Association and the Student Council here today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_96": "Sure, we could try to be that one special student. But just like the School Anniversary changed Fenrico's mind, what changes this school's future will never come down to \"one single person.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_97": "So let's take these mock exam results and the regional qualifiers as our starting point, and plan out the next six months together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_98": "And I'm sure we're not the only ones willing to put in the time and effort.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_425_99": "{PlayerName}...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_435_1": "It's the day of the final exam, aka... <color=#d19f27>a mock Qualifying Exam</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_435_2": "Looking back on the prep you've done lately, you seem to have come through more than you'd imagined.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_435_3": "As Abby put it, these scores won't just be a key reference for the Qualifying Exam. The school's future is riding on them too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_435_4": "Everything's prepared. Now all you have to do is perform at your usual level.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_435_5": "So take everything you and the others have poured into these weeks, and write it onto this exam paper.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_437_1": "And so the day arrives—<color=#d19f27>the qualifiers for Nationals</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_437_2": "Over these past weeks, the Orchestral Music Club has put so much into today's performance, all to bring their very best on that stage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_437_3": "From the first notes they ever fumbled to a real competition stage... what a road it's been, all laughter and every kind of challenge.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_437_4": "They're not only playing for a spot in the finals. They're playing so more people can see what this school could become.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_437_5": "With everyone's hopes and all their hard work behind you, go finish this performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_440_1": "Sunlight slants into the principal's office, the swaying curtains slicing the glare into flickering patches that dapple everyone's shoulders and the papers on the desk.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_440_10": "Changli turns the page of the mock exam report, the faint scrape of paper cutting sharp through the muted room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_440_11": "Her tone is as calm as ever, yet the subtle tension creasing her brow betrays what she is holding back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_440_2": "With summer break just around the corner, the school is drenched in sunlight and noise. The sun blazes, the sky is crystal clear, and the cicadas drone on tirelessly in the treetops.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_440_3": "Bursts of laughter and cheering carry over from the athletic field, riding the breeze through the window, while outside in the hall, light footsteps and idle chatter drift away down the corridor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_440_4": "Just like any other peaceful summer day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_440_5": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_440_6": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_440_7": "But inside the office, silence reigns. The noise outside and the hush inside feel like two worlds separated by an invisible wall.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_440_8": "Deep down, everyone braced for disappointment... yet with the scores finally on the table, no one can shake the knot in their stomach.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_440_9": "Allow me to start us off, then.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_445_1": "Overall, the school's mock exam results held steady, with no significant change from previous years. <color=#d19f27>The students who earned an A</color> are <color=#d19f27>myself</color> and...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_445_2": "<color=#d19f27>{PlayerName}</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_445_3": "She pauses and looks up, locking eyes with you for a fleeting beat before exhaling a soft sigh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_445_4": "—Just the two of us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_450_1": "Overall, the school's mock exam results held steady, with no significant change from previous years. <color=#d19f27>The students who earned an A</color>...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_450_2": "She pauses and looks up, locking eyes with you for a fleeting beat before exhaling a soft sigh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_450_3": "—<color=#d19f27>Just me</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_1": "\"Luxury living in the commercial heartland. Savor small-town views and build your dream home here.\" \"Office space available for rent. Contact Celestial Steed Corp United Realty today...\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_10": "Um... this is my home. My grandparents run it, and I just help out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_11": "There's a lot I need to do every day, but as long as I can help people, I'm happy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_12": "I see... So you're the Roccia Abby mentioned before.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_13": "Yes. Is there anything I can help you with? I've got all sorts of stuff.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_14": "Oh, right. Abby asked me to get some pastries for it. Said you'd know which kind it likes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_15": "Roccia nods, rises onto her tiptoes, and pulls two boxes of coffee biscuits off a shelf.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_16": "Here you go, freshly baked today. The second one's on the house. Biscuits always taste better when shared.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_17": "Thank you, Roccia. These coffee biscuits... did you make them yourself?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_18": "Mm-hmm. Besides the stock we order, I also make a few handmade goods for the shop.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_19": "By the way, are you acquainted with Principal Abby?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_2": "Loud, garish real estate ads cover the building's loud facade. By contrast, the store on the ground floor feels warm, homey, and inviting.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_20": "I guess so.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_21": "I'm its master.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_22": "That's good to know. Then this box of biscuits is my welcome gift to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_23": "Oh? Should I congratulate Principal Abby, then? Well, if you're the one taking care of it, then this box of biscuits is my welcome gift to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_24": "Principal Abby... might be all fluff and food on the outside. But on the inside? Trustworthy. Dependable... a dependable \"floof.\" Everyone at school loves Principal Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_25": "But lately, it's been too busy to have snacks with us. Even when it stops by, it always looks troubled.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_26": "It thinks it's hiding it well, but I noticed right away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_27": "Because you have a tender and kind heart, Roccia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_28": "A new customer walks in and joins the conversation smoothly, offering you a polite smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_29": "Nice to meet you. I'm <color=#d19f27>Xiangli Yao</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_3": "You push open the door to find shelves overflowing with a colorful spread of goods, but not a single clerk in sight. Self-service, maybe...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_30": "Hello.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_31": "Hi, Xiangli Yao. We just got a special new drink in stock today. I haven't had a chance to unbox it yet, but would you like to try it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_32": "A special drink? What is it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_33": "I heard it's a drink you know, but I've never tried it myself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_34": "Wait, it can't be...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_35": "Roccia ducks under the counter, rummages around, and emerges holding up a bottle that looks like milk.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_36": "Tada—Sour Soy Milk!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_37": "—Sour Soy Milk...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_38": "Uh... Thank you, Roccia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_39": "Xiangli Yao's expression freezes for a split second as he reluctantly accepts the bottle. Then he turns to you with a smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_4": "...Um, hello? Anyone here?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_40": "How about we try it together? It's a famous local specialty.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_41": "Roccia and Xiangli Yao both look at you expectantly. But honestly? After seeing his face change just now, you're not exactly eager to sample this \"local specialty.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_42": "...All right. It's hard to say no to such hospitality. You take a bottle from Roccia, twist off the cap, and knock back a big gulp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_43": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_44": "First, a subtle saltiness hits your tongue. Then a faint sourness fills your nose. Fine soybean foam clings to your palate, lingering.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_45": "So, how do you two like the taste?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_46": "Not bad. It tastes just like the kind I had as a child. Very authentic.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_47": "Yummy! I'll take another bottle!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_48": "...Thanks, but no thanks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_49": "You like it? If you savor it slowly, you can actually taste a hint of rich soy flavor. Pair it with a Vege Omelette in the morning, and that'll make for a hearty breakfast.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_5": "A brief silence follows before a cardboard box rustles behind the counter. Moments later, a little girl wearing a shop apron calmly crawls out from beneath the register.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_50": "Haha, it's okay. Lots of people find it a bit intense the first time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_51": "Well then, these two bottles are on the house. Free sample.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_52": "Anyway, if you like what you see, please support our little shop! I'll have even more handmade goodies next time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_6": "Hello. Would you like to buy anything?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_7": "Wait, where did you even come from?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_8": "There's child labor here?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_45_9": "Um... from the <color=#d19f27>box</color>. I like to stay inside when the shop's not busy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_1": "Enrollment's been shrinking for years, and overall student performance hasn't improved much either. Put it plainly: set A grades aside, and you can still count the B-grade students on one hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_10": "Th-then what's the bad news? You didn't forfeit, did you?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_11": "No, quite the opposite. A team ranked above us dropped out, and that's the only reason we got in as an alternate.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_12": "In the ensemble category, we passed on fundamentals. But our scores for coordination and artistic expression... only just scraped a pass.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_13": "The thing is, what matters most in an orchestra is how all the sections work together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_14": "But right now we're short on players, and whole sections sit empty. A few of us are doubling up just to keep the sound whole.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_15": "That festival performance worked because Leader Ciaccona had rewritten the score, covering the gaps with other instruments. But... competitions don't work that way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_16": "Cartethyia slowly shakes her head, her voice dropping low.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_2": "Abby slumps into the big chair, shoulders caving in, and the chair sways with the motion. It stares out the window, eyes empty, and starts muttering to itself in a hollow voice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_3": "Ha, haha... Maybe we should all just go home...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_4": "Chin up, Principal. We still have Plan B.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_5": "Feeling lost? See what Cartethyia has to say.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_6": "Mm. The Orchestral Music Club's <color=#d19f27>regional qualifier</color> results are in, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_7": "The good news is, <color=#d19f27>we qualified for Nationals</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_8": "The good news is, <color=#d19f27>we qualified for Nationals</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_460_9": "Those words snap Abby upright, its face running through a dozen expressions at once. You can even see the gulp go down—a big, loud one.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_465_1": "The required piece has strict rules. We can't just alter the instrumentation on a whim.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_465_2": "Cartethyia turns and gives you a deeply grateful look.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_465_3": "{PlayerName}, if you hadn't <color=#d19f27>stepped in and improvised at the last second</color>, and salvaged points, we probably wouldn't even have scraped in as an alternate...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_465_4": "Cartethyia lets the thought trail off, but the unspoken truth is clear enough.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_465_5": "—If they take the stage at Nationals like this, gold is entirely off the table. They'd be lucky just to make it through the performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_470_1": "The required piece has strict rules. We can't gloss over our missing parts through rearrangement.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_470_2": "Say luck hands us an alternate slot this time. But still...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_470_3": "Cartethyia lets the thought trail off, but the unspoken truth is clear enough.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_470_4": "—If they take the stage at Nationals like this, gold is entirely off the table. They'd be lucky just to make it through the performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_1": "The stifling silence settles over the room again, and even the sunlight through the window turns harsh. By any measure, the results are worse than any of you expected.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_10": "Cartethyia, usually so bright and lively, can't hide the exhaustion on her face anymore. And Changli, splitting herself between Council work and exam prep, has picked up faint shadows under her eyes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_11": "And Abby—breezy cheerleader, less-than-reliable principal—has been running itself ragged between Celestial Steed Corp and the School Board for the school's sake.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_12": "And Phoebe, Ciaccona, Xiangli Yao, and those who aren't standing in the principal's office right now...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_13": "The outcome might fall short of what everyone hoped for, but everyone has poured their heart into turning this school around.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_14": "Before you speak again, you draw a deep breath.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_15": "<color=#d19f27>Summer break</color> starts tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_16": "If our mock exam results weren't good enough, we can use the break to catch up. We can go over our mistakes, share study tips, and tackle what we missed, step by step.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_17": "And if the Orchestral Music Club is short-handed, we scout for recruits together and drill until we can play the whole competition piece without missing a beat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_18": "{PlayerName}'s right! One person can only take so many steps on their own, but if we pool everyone's strength, there's no telling how far we can go.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_19": "Indeed... As long as the destination lies ahead, we'll always find a way to reach it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_2": "Outside the office, the cicadas drone louder still.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_20": "Abby, who was forcing a smile just moments ago, watches everyone rally, and its smile gradually turns genuine. Much of the exhaustion and anxiety weighing on the \"Principal's\" shoulders melts away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_21": "{PlayerName}...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_22": "You smile and give Abby a soft shake of your head—no words needed. In that brief exchange of glances, you already understand everything it's feeling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_23": "Mm, then it's settled! Over <color=#d19f27>summer break</color>, the <color=#d19f27>Orchestral Music Club</color> is going to hold a <color=#d19f27>joint training camp</color>!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_24": "As for <color=#d19f27>the Student Council</color>, we'll <color=#d19f27>host a summer boot camp</color> to give everyone's grades the biggest boost we can.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_25": "On that note, I recommend we keep both the school's current crisis and Celestial Steed Corp's final evaluation under wraps for now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_26": "Revealing this might instill a fleeting sense of urgency, but it would more likely sow unnecessary panic and demoralize everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_27": "Besides, I've never subscribed to the notion that \"pressure breeds motivation.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_28": "Changli has a point. Piling on pressure without a plan rarely inspires anyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_29": "I agree too!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_3": "Oh my, oh my... As your principal, I'm genuinely delighted.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_30": "You exchange a knowing look. Then Cartethyia reaches out first—palm down, eyes bright as she looks around at all of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_31": "Changli smiles softly and stacks her hand on top. Abby doesn't say a word, just grins wide at you all and holds out its hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_32": "Last of all, your hand goes on the very top, and you squeeze them all tight.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_33": "Alright, let's give it our best.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_34": "Next time we step into an exam hall or onto that stage, we'll take the courage and strength our friends gave us and go all out for the answer that's ours to find.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_35": "One firm answer rings out, and every hand in the stack shoots up toward the sky.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_4": "Honestly, I thought we wouldn't land a single A on this mock exam. Turns out we're one step closer to where we want to be.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_5": "And don't lose heart, Orchestral Music Club! However you got there, making it to Nationals? That alone says you've done good work.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_6": "Seeing how downcast everyone is, Abby forces some cheer and manages a smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_7": "And hey, luck's part of skill, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_8": "Abby's right. Instead of focusing on how far away we are from the goal, what matters is that we've already taken the first step. And as long as there's still time, it's not over yet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_480_9": "You stand, steady yourself, and let your gaze travel across each face in the room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_1": "The sky is dimming by the time you leave the principal's office. Late sun slants through the corridor windows and lays a soft orange-red over the flagstones at your feet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_10": "That aside... there's actually something else I wanted to say.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_11": "You've taken quite a load off everyone's shoulders lately. A gesture may seem minor, but without someone stepping up to lend a hand, many of our efforts would have stalled before getting this far.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_12": "So, on behalf of everyone on the Student Council, I'd like to thank you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_13": "With a soft smile, Changli produces a small, gift-wrapped box from behind her back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_14": "Of course, a simple \"thank you\" didn't feel like nearly enough.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_15": "We prepared this together. It might not be anything extravagant, but consider it a small token from all of us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_16": "Facing the sunset, you see the soft evening glow trace a hazy outline around Changli. The light spilling past her gently blurs your vision.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_17": "You turn your head slightly to avoid the blinding glare. When you look back, you catch her looking right at you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_18": "The setting sun catches on Changli's shoulders and the gentle sway of her hair. She blinks, her voice carrying a quiet warmth.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_19": "Take it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_2": "The result this time... isn't exactly ideal. It's still a long way from what everyone had hoped for. But thankfully, no one's losing heart over it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_20": "You look into Changli's eyes. The smile there needs no explanation—it already says everything. Right now, words feel almost unnecessary.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_21": "Okay, thanks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_22": "It's getting late. You should head home and rest well, {PlayerName}. As for what comes next, we'll figure it out together another day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_23": "And with a small wave, Changli turns and walks off down the opposite corridor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_24": "Tomorrow... I'm planning to have a chat with Roccia. We'll be waiting for you at the school store, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_25": "See you tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_3": "(Looks like I won't be getting much rest this summer.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_4": "Could I have a moment, {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_5": "You pause and turn to see Changli walking toward you from down the corridor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_6": "How do you feel about the results?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_7": "I'm sure everyone gave it their all. Whatever the results, they only reflect where we stand right now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_8": "At least we know where we fell short, which gives us a clear goal to aim for. That's not necessarily a bad thing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_490_9": "Hehe, it seems we're of the same mind. It was just a mock exam, hardly the final word. That said, I'll be counting on your help for the next half year.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_1": "As you pass the tennis courts, you catch a crisp crack from behind the fence.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_10": "But it's fine! We just didn't nail it this once. There's always next time. So don't fret, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_11": "She rests her racket on her shoulder, curls one hand into a fist, and gives your shoulder a friendly bump. The smile on her face brightens again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_12": "Good timing, though, {PlayerName}. Hitting solo gets old fast. Come play?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_13": "I'm not going easy on you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_14": "Teach me a thing or two, Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_15": "Of course. Going all out is the greatest respect you can show your opponent.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_16": "Hehe, you got it. Going all out is the greatest respect you can show your opponent.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_17": "Taking your places on opposite sides of the net, you two are both ready. Cartethyia turns sideways behind the service line, one hand on her racket, and sends the first serve flying.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_18": "Rackets cracking, footsteps squeaking across the court—the rally stretches on until the final ball drops. Cartethyia leans heavily on her racket, panting softly, strands of hair sticking to her sweat-damp forehead.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_19": "Phew...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_2": "Cartethyia isn't wearing her baseball cap today. She lifts her racket in one clean motion and pivots sharply.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_20": "Both of you let out a long, shared breath. With every hard-hit rally, whatever gloom had been weighing on you quietly burned away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_21": "She hands you a bottle of water. As the sun sinks low, an evening breeze sweeps across the court, stirring her tousled hair, while the faint bounce of tennis balls echoes in the distance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_22": "Thank you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_23": "Huh? What's with the sudden formality?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_24": "The whole Orchestral Music Club knows we wouldn't have made it through the qualifiers without you. Recruiting, rehearsals, all that prep... You're the one who carried the heaviest load.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_25": "With that, Cartethyia walks over to the sideline and picks up a neatly wrapped gift from next to her bag.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_26": "This is from everyone in the Club Association. It's nothing fancy, but every single one of us pitched in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_27": "Next time we stand on the stage at Nationals, promise you'll be right there fighting alongside us, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_28": "Not taking no for an answer, Cartethyia shoves the gift right into your hands and grabs her racket again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_29": "I'm gonna hit a few more today. It's getting late, so go on home, {PlayerName}. Thanks for everything, all this time!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_3": "Her racket snaps down. Thwack. The little green ball skims the net and streaks toward the far court.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_30": "Oh, right! Buling and I are getting dinner at the family restaurant tomorrow. Don't forget to come too, {PlayerName}! See you there!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_31": "Still talking, Cartethyia glances back to wave you off, then jogs back onto the court.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_4": "You keep your distance and just watch for a while, letting her have the court. In a sunset that dyes everything crimson, she stands against the evening breeze and swings, over and over, sending ball after ball back over the net.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_5": "A clean return finally lands. Cartethyia wipes the sweat from her brow and spots you. She grins and hurries over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_6": "Good afternoon, {PlayerName}. I thought you'd be home by now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_7": "I was just about to head back. What about you, Cartethyia? Still out playing?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_8": "Yeah. After all, the result of the qualifiers was... Look, the club made it in, but honestly? I'm not satisfied.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_495_9": "So I came out to hit a few balls. Once the racket starts moving, the mess in my head gets quieter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_1": "A long, long time ago, someone once made a wish for you—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_10": "Right then, the alarm goes off and startles you. The words from your dream, already hazy, vanish without a trace.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_11": "But at least you didn't oversleep. You're still on time for your meeting with your friends as promised.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_12": "Today is the day... the <color=#d19f27>Qualifying Exam results</color> come out. It's also the day they announce the <color=#d19f27>Nationals winners</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_13": "\"Exams have only one right answer. Life doesn't.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_14": "Suddenly, Abby's words echo in your ears.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_15": "\"I'm sure your family sent you here because they want you to find your own answers.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_16": "Find my own answers, huh...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_17": "Before you know it, a whole year has passed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_18": "Abby's dream. The school's future. Where your friends end up. And... \"your own answers.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_19": "At last, the time has come for all of it to be settled.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_2": "She wished that you would never forget how to feel. The sorrow, and the joy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_20": "Time to go.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_3": "For most people in this world, every moment of happiness or heartache is a precious mark on a brief life. They weep. They laugh. They live through each season with everything they have.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_4": "But you, {PlayerName}, are the exception...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_5": "You know all too well that very joy and sorrow you feel is but a fleeting moment in your life. A grain of sand slipping through your fingers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_6": "Even knowing this, you keep going. O Rover, bearer of all hopes, have you ever, if only for a second, wished for a simple, happy life?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_7": "No need to deny it now. Because right now, I want to place that very happiness into your hands.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_8": "As for what kind of future you'll choose for yourself, I... look forward to finding out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5000_9": "Ugh, my head's spinning... Did I not get much sleep last night? I could swear someone was talking to me in my dream...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_1": "As principal, Abby is always swamped with work, so walking home together and sharing a quiet dinner like this doesn't happen often.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_10": "No. I've never once felt this wasn't our responsibility. And I've never thought of you as \"irresponsible,\" Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_11": "Without your efforts, Abby, we probably wouldn't even have this shot at a \"final evaluation.\" And I'm not doing all this because I feel there's something I have to shoulder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_12": "I treasure this school. I love every day I spend here. So as long as there's still something I can do, I don't want to stop.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_13": "The Student Council, the Club Association, the Liaison Center, Miss Verina and Miss Galbrena, and every student here...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_14": "You too, of course, Abby. Getting to give something back to this school with everyone... that's always felt like a kind of happiness to me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_15": "Even that \"legendary student\" from a hundred years ago couldn't have achieved all that for this school single-handedly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_16": "This school didn't get here by itself. It got here because countless people met within these walls, and they worked towards the same thing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_17": "So... I want to stand with all of you, and save \"our\" school, together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_18": "Your words reach it. Something in Abby's eyes shifts—softer, steadier. It sits up straight again and nudges the plates on the table closer to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_19": "...Hah. Listen to you. You really are getting the hang of talking like a grown-up, aren't you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_2": "It's a quiet meal. You got food delivered from the family restaurant, and by silent agreement, neither of you touches the too-heavy subject from earlier today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_20": "Some more? If it's getting cold, I can heat it up. You're a growing kid, gotta eat your fill!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_21": "Another bowl, please!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_22": "No, thanks. I'm full.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_23": "Hehe, you got it! My, my, the cooking at Chisa's place really is something else...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_24": "Glad you liked it! My, my, the cooking at Chisa's place really is something else...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_25": "Oh, right. I know I told you to get home early before. Things were crazy at school back then, and I didn't want you running around all hours.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_26": "Things are different now. And I know I can count on you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_27": "Besides, <color=#d19f27>summer break</color>'s here. Hit up your clubs, hang out with friends, or just hide out somewhere quiet—it's your call.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_28": "Kids aren't meant to sit around indoors, anyway. Back when Uncle Abby was your age, I was roaming from one end of the map to the other...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_29": "Never mind. A real hero doesn't dwell on past glory.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_3": "As the last wisps of steam rise off the bowls, Abby sets down its chopsticks. The easygoing look drains from its face, bit by bit, and when it finally speaks, its tone is far more serious than usual.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_30": "Mind you, freedom's great, but don't stay out too late on weekends! Or I might just have to trim your allowance, got it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_4": "You've been carrying a lot for us, {PlayerName}. Everything you've done around school... I've seen it, all of it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_5": "Fixing everyone's problems, getting the School Anniversary ready, joining clubs, helping the Student Council... you've carried more than your share.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_6": "I mean, sure, as Principal, nothing would make me happier than watching everyone's grades go up...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_7": "But watching you run around from morning till night, it hurts me to see. Pass or fail, things get done one at a time. Just don't run yourself ragged.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_8": "Like I said before, all I ever wanted was for you to have a good, easy school life.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_500_9": "And yet, in the end, the weight that should've been the grown-ups' ended up on you kids instead... Which makes me a pretty irresponsible Principal, doesn't it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_1": "The family restaurant Abby treated you to the other day is packed again... Business here really must be booming.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_10": "Do you always help out at the restaurant, Chisa?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_11": "Hm? No, no, not at all! It's just that waiving tuition for local students is enough to make everyone grateful.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_12": "Not really. I mostly do activities at the <color=#d19f27>Liaison Center</color> during term and only come in on holidays.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_13": "Speaking of which... Do {PlayerName} ever find yourself running low on pocket money? Would you consider picking up a part-time job in your downtime?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_14": "I haven't really given it much thought. Are you looking for extra help?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_15": "Yes. We listed the opening at the Liaison Center, including the pay rate and shifts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_16": "If you're interested, you can check it out once the semester starts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_17": "It might not help much with the Qualifying Exam, but earning a little pocket money or just getting a feel for the community is pretty nice for us students.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_18": "But I guess you're cramming for the Exam too, right, {PlayerName}? Working too much on top of that might wear you out. You don't want your grades or health taking a hit.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_19": "I hope you pace yourself, {PlayerName}. Take more breaks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_2": "Hello. Are you ready to order—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_20": "I understand. Thank you, Chisa. I'll consider it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_21": "<color=#d19f27>Part-time work</color>... A way to trade spare time for School Badges, at the cost of extra <color=#d19f27>Fatigue</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_22": "The restaurant has been getting busier and busier lately, though.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_23": "Chisa lets out a soft sigh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_24": "Because of back-to-school season?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_25": "Not really. I heard...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_26": "Chisa glances warily at the other customers first. Then she leans in close to your ear, cups a hand over her mouth, and whispers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_27": "A new student from the School Board is transferring in, and it's brought quite a few extra people to town.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_28": "—And from what I hear? This freshman's got some real heavy-duty background. Connected, powerful, and totally ruthless to boot!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_29": "Oh. Hi there, Buling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_3": "...Oh?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_30": "Let me introduce you two. This is <color=#d19f27>Buling</color>. She <color=#d19f27>manages the school's forum</color>. And this is {PlayerName}, a new transfer student starting tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_31": "Shh! SHH! Don't just go dropping my identity like that! Everyone still thinks the forum admin's just an auto-reply bot, like the Student Council's website portal!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_32": "Heya, {PlayerName}! If you ever need any juicy insider info, I \"bling\" it. Honest prices, no funny business!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_33": "You seriously charge for that...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_34": "Of course! Keyboards don't buy themselves, you know.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_35": "So... is that freshman from the Board really as terrifying as everyone says?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_36": "Way worse, way worse! They say no one's even seen her face. If you manage to get on her bad side, I swear we're all gonna get...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_37": "Buling cautiously stops herself there. Even so, you can guess roughly how that sentence was going to end.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_38": "Anyway, better watch what you say out there.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_39": "...Got it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_4": "She pauses, then seems to recognize you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_40": "Hello? Excuse me—can I order now, please?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_41": "Milady! You shouldn't be handling this yourself!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_42": "I've told you to stop calling me \"Milady\" in public! You'll make a scene!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_43": "Understood! Milady!!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_44": "...Urgh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_45": "Surrounded by bodyguards in black suits, the blonde girl shakes her head helplessly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_46": "A wall of security surges into the restaurant, almost pushing you and Buling into the far corner.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_47": "Between the shoving and the sudden chaos, it's hard enough to stay upright, let alone catch a look at the \"lady\" at the heart of it. Whoever she is, she sure knows how to make an entrance in this quaint little town.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_48": "But human joys and sorrows rarely align. To you, the whole scene is just noise.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_49": "Chisa, on the other hand, moves without hesitation. Ducking behind her modified Delivery Bot, she uses it as a wedge to part the crowd, carving a quick way out for you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_5": "You're the one who had dinner with Principal Abby the other day, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_50": "I'd better get back to work. See you at school tomorrow, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_51": "Hang in there, Chisa! Catch you at school!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_52": "See you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_6": "After a brief explanation and a quick round of introductions, the girl named Chisa nods in understanding.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_7": "I see. So you were just getting your bearings around town. I can't believe we're going to be classmates so soon.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_8": "Principal Abby is a regular customer of ours. If you ever need help with anything, just say the word.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_50_9": "Abby must be a handful for you guys.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_1": "You hurry to the main entrance of the Teaching Building, where familiar faces gather and are chatting away. Verina is the first to spot you and waves you over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_10": "Then, she smiles and pats your shoulder as if to cheer you on.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_11": "Besides, for {PlayerName}, this is probably nothing to worry about, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_12": "Galbrena still wears that carefree grin as she silently gives you a thumbs-up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_13": "You nod to everyone, then slide your transcript out of the folder in a formal fashion—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_14": "So? How did you do?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_15": "Pretty well. About what I expected.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_16": "No big deal. Worst case, Abby can be my sugar daddy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_17": "Well done. Keep that composure. It'll serve you well in the future.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_18": "...Well now, kids ought to act more like kids sometimes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_19": "{PlayerName}, Changli... none of you even flinched. How are you all so calm about this?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_2": "You're early today, {PlayerName}! Here. Take your <color=#d19f27>grade sheet</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_20": "With all due respect, that's a bit rich coming from you, Miss Verina.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_21": "Huh? Kids these days ought to show a little more drive!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_22": "It's fine. Keep that flexible, easygoing attitude toward life. It'll serve you well in the future.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_23": "Still, seeing you without a care in the world really puts my mind at ease. After all, kids should get to act like kids.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_24": "Sometimes I envy all of you. If I could, I'd love to stay home, get spoiled, and let my parents take care of me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_25": "And with those words, the three of you burst out laughing together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_26": "The well-timed joke quickly eases the tension over the exam results, turning the mood bright and cheerful.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_27": "Time really flies, doesn't it? A whole year's gone by, and now you've already graduated.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_28": "Ah, in a few more years, your class will be out in the world, all grown up. If we meet again then, I'll be so much older...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_29": "You'll always be young in our eyes, Miss Verina.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_3": "Verina hands you a document folder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_30": "Oh stop, you... You're far too good with your words!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_31": "Maybe it's because neither Verina nor Galbrena puts on airs. During most of the time you've spent together, it feels less like teacher and student... and more like friends who can talk about anything.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_32": "Thank you both for looking after me this past year.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_33": "You bow to them, a formal gesture of gratitude from student to teacher.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_34": "Well. That's formal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_35": "Oh, stop... now you're making me embarrassed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_36": "No matter how close a teacher and student are personally, the student is the one who received teachings. A fact that never changes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_37": "One torch passed on to the next, until a thousand more shine.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_38": "Both teacher and friend... I'll never forget our bond.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_39": "Never one to mix business with personal, hm? That is very you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_4": "It's only a few thin sheets of paper, but holding them in your hands, you can't help feeling a little breathless.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_40": "Alright, alright. Message received. Changli and Phoebe are waiting for you in the Student Council office. Aren't you going to meet them?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_41": "Verina gives you a gentle nudge, as if telling you to get going.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_42": "The National Music Competition results are out too. You should swing by the Club Association and catch up with your friends there.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_43": "All right.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_44": "After saying goodbye to Galbrena and Verina, you turn and head toward the Administration Building.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_5": "Okay. Thank you, Miss Verina.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_6": "It's hard to believe that a number, capable of deciding one's future, is printed on a simple piece of paper.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_7": "If you're too nervous to open it yourself, I could take a peek and whisper the results to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_8": "Verina suddenly leans in close and whispers in your ear.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5100_9": "But of course... If you can manage it, I think this first big hurdle is one you should face on your own.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_1": "With summer break just around the corner, the usually bustling school has settled into a quiet lull.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_10": "Changli stares down at her ice cream, a shapeless slump past naming, and lets out a quiet sigh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_11": "I only just got mine. Yours, Roccia, looks completely untouched...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_12": "Then again, cold things and I have never really gotten along.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_13": "Mmm... it can't be helped. Your body runs warmer than most, Changli. Ice cream's bound to melt faster beside you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_14": "But that's fine! Next time I'll fix the recipe and freeze the scoops rock solid.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_15": "Roccia spots you and waves, then fishes a fresh ice cream out of the freezer and offers it up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_16": "Welcome, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_17": "Here, this one's yours. Made it fresh today. It's so hot out, perfect for something cold.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_18": "You take the ice cream and settle in next to Changli. Roccia glances at you, then at her, and asks:",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_19": "So the two of you came here together today. Is there something special you wanted?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_2": "Saturday at midday is particularly dead. Barely a soul walks the halls, and the distant drone of cicadas only makes the quiet feel wider.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_20": "Mm, I do have something I'd like to discuss with you, Roccia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_21": "Changli briefly explains the school's current predicament and the terms Celestial Steed Corp has set for the final evaluation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_22": "Oh... I didn't know any of that was happening...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_23": "So the Student Council is organizing a summer boot camp over the break, giving everyone focused help for the exam. We'll run study sessions too, so students can swap notes, shore up weak spots.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_24": "The reason I came today is that I'd like {PlayerName} and Roccia to join the Council as well, and train with us for this.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_25": "Hm? Me, too?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_26": "...You mean Roccia?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_27": "You glance over at Roccia in surprise. She looks nowhere near your age, after all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_28": "Then again, Verina hardly looks old enough to be a teacher either. Appearances can be deceiving, as they say.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_29": "Judging by your expression, {PlayerName}, you're thinking Roccia is still a bit young?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_3": "(Changli did say she wanted to talk to Roccia today...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_30": "While Roccia does help out at the school store, she's actually also a visiting student here. Isn't that right, Roccia?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_31": "Mm-hmm. I am.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_32": "Hehe, and as far as I know, Roccia's grades have always been stellar.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_33": "Changli smiles knowingly, resting her chin lightly on one hand as she turns her gaze to Roccia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_34": "(Changli certainly did her research...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_35": "Most importantly, the Qualifying Exam has no strict age limit. Anyone with exceptional marks can sit the exam through special admission.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_36": "Eligibility-wise, Roccia is in the clear. And I have no doubt that scoring an A will be no trouble at all for her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_37": "In Weiqi, one commands the board through discipline and seizes victory through cunning. I doubt Celestial Steed Corp ever imagined we had one more piece in reserve.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_38": "I'm more than happy to help. If it helps everyone out, that's what matters most to me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_39": "Grandpa, Grandma, and Brant taught me that real family means supporting one another and healing together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_4": "(Probably about the summer tutoring. I'll go check it out.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_40": "To me, everyone at the school is family, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_41": "Changli nods, her gaze returning to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_42": "Then... what about you, {PlayerName}? Would you care to <color=#d19f27>join the Student Council</color> as well? With your help, everyone would be far more confident.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_43": "The Student Council is ever in search of talented minds. Speaking for myself, there's no one I'd rather have by our side.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_44": "Let me think it over first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_45": "It's quite all right. Take your time. This won't just cost you a day or two, after all. Get your summer in order first, {PlayerName}, and let me know once you have.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_46": "Whatever you decide in the end, everyone on the Council and I are grateful you'd give it serious thought.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_47": "And of course, we on the Council will do everything in our power to get everyone the Qualifying Exam results they hope for.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_48": "For now, let's not waste Roccia's ice cream, shall we? Dawdle much longer, and yours will melt down to sweet water, same as mine.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_49": "Changli's right, {PlayerName}! Try it, quick. People are always lining up for my multi-scoop ice cream.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_5": "Pushing open the school store door, you're greeted by a blast of cool air and a hint of sweet fragrance. Roccia is resting her chin on the counter before a towering, multi-scoop ice cream.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_50": "Only then do you notice that maybe because it's sitting right beside Changli, your ice cream has already begun to slump into a strange shape...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_51": "You quickly grab a big spoonful. Just-right sweetness and a creamy, silky weight spread through your mouth—cold, and somehow rich as anything. It really is good.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_52": "Take the weekend to seriously consider <color=#d19f27>Changli's invitation</color>, and decide <color=#d19f27>what to do with your summer break</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_6": "—And across from her sits Changli, armed with a tiny spoon and waging a losing war against her own dessert.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_7": "Unfortunately, the ice cream isn't about to wait around. What started as perfect scoops is already caving in, chocolate sticks tipping sideways while melted cream streams down the cone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_8": "Changli, I think you should eat it a little faster.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_510_9": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_1": "Before you push open the Student Council door, you can already hear a heated discussion coming from the inside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_10": "Changli is pouring Roccia a cup of tea, and Phoebe stands to one side, fanning her. As for Xiangli Yao, he's busy adjusting his camera, preparing to capture the moment.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_11": "What's this all about...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_12": "Perfect timing, {PlayerName}. We were just celebrating Roccia getting an S-rank on the Qualifying Exam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_13": "Roccia gives you a nod. Clearly, just as the two of you had promised, she's lived up to her full potential.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_14": "How did things go on your end, {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_15": "Your friends look calm on the surface, but they're secretly observing your reaction with bated breath... It's clear how much this matters to all of them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_16": "All good. Nothing to worry about.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_17": "Sorry... I ran into a bit of a setback.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_18": "Congratulations, {PlayerName}. That's hardly a surprising outcome.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_19": "Yes, {PlayerName}. You've always been so reliable.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_2": "So you're saying Roccia managed to bypass the registration limit and actually take the exam using that workaround?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_20": "You get the results you wanted, but in their minds, it seems that was always a foregone conclusion.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_21": "Your friends never doubted for a moment that you'd keep your promise, and you wouldn't let them down.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_22": "...I see. Well, these things do happen sometimes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_23": "Upon hearing the news that you didn't get the results you hoped for, your friends' faces fall. They all seem to be searching for something comforting to say.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_24": "That's all right, {PlayerName}. Nerves get the better of all of us. Don't be too hard on yourself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_25": "(I'd better change the subject...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_26": "By the way, how did Celestial Steed Corp's final evaluation turn out?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_27": "Oh, about that...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_28": "Changli pauses for a moment. After you nod to show she needn't hold back, she fills you in on the situation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_29": "<color=#d19f27>This year</color>, aside from myself, Xiangli Yao, Ciaccona, and Roccia, two students from the summer boot camp also achieved an A-rank evaluation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_3": "Yes. She couldn't declare a major, but she still earned an exceptionally high score.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_30": "Who'd have thought we'd reach our final goal even without Roccia as a safety net? Although, as for the boot camp...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_31": "You've passed the final evaluation set by the Celestial Steed Corp, but hearing that only two summer boot camp students with As still leaves you a little dazed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_32": "Because it means that even after all that hard work and struggle, a few among that small group have still come up just short of a miracle.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_33": "For those who didn't make it, this is already a vast improvement from where they would've been without the boot camp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_34": "I understand. Don't worry.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_35": "(\"Life and exams are not like each other. It has lots of correct answers\"... I'm sure what Abby told me back then has long since gotten through to them.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_36": "That means the Student Council's plan <color=#d19f27>worked</color>, right? Principal Abby can finally breathe easy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_37": "Yeah, Abby's already gone to a meeting with the board members. Probably won't be back until later. I'll let everyone know then.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_38": "After taking a group photo with the Student Council and agreeing to meet up again later, you leave the Council office.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_39": "Next, I should head over to the Club Association and see how things are going.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_4": "But what about the Board...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_5": "The Board didn't include any age-specific requirements, so my results are fully valid.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_6": "Th-that's true! How brilliant!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_7": "...Wait, why is everyone just casually accepting that a child who isn't even old enough to enroll pulled off an S-rank on the Qualifying Exam?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_8": "Because this is Roccia we're talking about!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5200_9": "Phoebe, Xiangli Yao, and Changli are gathered around Roccia as you step into the Student Council office.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_1": "You've barely pushed the restaurant door open when the chime above it rings, clear and bright. Before you can take in the room, warm air rushes up to meet you, carrying the smell of cooking.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_10": "Neither am I.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_11": "They throw their weight in together, wrists tilting toward the tabletop, knuckles blanching white under the strain.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_12": "A second later, the descent halts dead in the air. Clenched tight, each digs her free hand into the rim of the table, perfectly matched, neither willing to yield an inch.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_13": "Ngh...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_14": "Hmph...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_15": "The table groans faintly as the pressure mounts, their locked arms swaying over the center mark. One final push from deciding it all. Until—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_16": "Boss, you're here too... Whoa, hold on, what are you two doing?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_17": "Making next week's top headline on the forum.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_18": "Taking the Amazing Namipon Gym Challenge.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_19": "UNBELIEVABLE SCOOP! Club Association rep throws down with Liaison officer outside school grounds! The hidden motive will SHOCK you...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_2": "The chime swings with the door, ringing in and out of the chatter inside. It's the weekend dinner rush. More than half the tables are taken.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_20": "Throwing down...? Wait, that's not right, Buling!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_21": "That's our Almighty Forum Lord of Thunder Spell.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_22": "Whoa, whoa, whoa! Don't dox my alt account, Boss!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_23": "The Amazing Namipon Gym Challenge... That could actually work as our next school event theme.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_24": "Hold on, let me put up a thread on the forum first. Just needs the ultimate clickbait title...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_25": "—LEAKED! The top 3 Amazing Namipon Gym strats 99% of people don't know about?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_26": "That's our Lord Divine Hearing: Earthly Immortal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_27": "Whoa, whoa, whoa! Don't dox my alt account, Boss!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_28": "So, what were you two up to just now...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_29": "Only then do the two of them notice they're still locked mid-arm-wrestle. They trade a stiff glance, then quietly let go.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_3": "(Cartethyia said she and Buling were having dinner here today. So... where are they?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_30": "We were just chatting about fitness. And honestly? Waiting tables, rehearsing with the orchestra... that all counts as working out, doesn't it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_31": "So, on a whim, we figured we'd settle it with an arm-wrestle.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_32": "Chisa stands and flexes her wrists a couple of times, then nods to you and Buling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_33": "It's about to get busy, and Mom and Dad can't keep up by themselves. I'd better get back out there.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_34": "Not joining us for dinner, Chisa?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_35": "Mm... I'll pass. I'd feel bad sitting here eating while the rush hits. And Cartethyia already filled me in on the Club Association.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_36": "Oh, right, Buling, that discount you mentioned, the 20%-off-if-I-take-two thing...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_37": "Sure thing! I've been keeping them warm for you, Chisa. Only the finest Buling-modified \"treasures\" for my customers fah! The Chainsaw-Response Kung Fu Stove and the Electromagnetic Voice-Control Microwave. Way less effort than twiddling some frequency knob, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_38": "Chisa rises and disappears back into the dinner rush. You and Buling take the opening and sit down across from Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_39": "{PlayerName} and Cartethyia, you two didn't haul me out here just to buy my dinner, did you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_4": "You scan the room. Your gaze lands on the table furthest back, where the noise seems loudest. A couple of curious servers are leaning in to look.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_40": "Then I'll get straight to the point.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_41": "Cartethyia takes a deep breath, as if steeling herself for something momentous, and abruptly shoots to her feet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_42": "That's right, Buling. You have to be the one I've been looking for! Please join the Club Association!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_43": "She leans down over the table and seizes Buling's hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_44": "Let's enter Nationals together, okay? All of us, and we'll win the gold together! With you on the team, I know we won't get dropped!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_45": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_46": "(Talk about deja vu... Did Ciaccona train everyone in the Club Association to recruit people like this?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_47": "Exactly like the day you two first met, Cartethyia shoots you another pleading look.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_48": "Ahem. You seem pretty interested in the Club Association, Buling. Why not sign up and see for yourself?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_49": "Facing the inevitable, you have no choice but to resign yourself to the exact same script.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_5": "—Chisa and Cartethyia sit facing each other, right hands locked, elbows planted on the table.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_50": "Huh? Me? Seriously, ME playing at Nationals?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_51": "Actually, there may be something only you can help us with...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_52": "Cartethyia quickly fills her in on the school's situation and the terms Celestial Steed Corp set for their final evaluation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_53": "Say what?! That's seriously happening?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_54": "Yeah... Truth is, we only scraped through the qualifiers by pure luck. But once we hit the finals at Nationals, the competition's on a whole other level. Luck like that won't strike twice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_55": "That's why we're planning sectional practices over the summer break, along with intensive training on our competition pieces.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_56": "But the way things are right now... before we worry about ramping up practice, we desperately need enough players to cover every part.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_57": "Leader Ciaccona and I have been trying to scout newcomers, but nothing's panned out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_58": "So we figured... if we could enlist your help, Buling, and get some buzz going on the school forum—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_59": "—You'd get way more eyeballs on the Orchestral Music Club, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_6": "(Are they... arm wrestling?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_60": "Yeah... But I know keeping the forum running takes real work, not to mention extra upkeep costs.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_61": "We'll make sure you're compensated for the promo. We'd never ask you to help for nothing!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_62": "You want to compensate me? Whoa, whoa, don't you treat me like a stranger fah!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_63": "Buling shakes her head vigorously, waving both hands as her tone turns noticeably frantic.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_64": "Oh, it's nothing, nothing at all! And honestly, getting to help everyone out? That's the fun part for me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_65": "Boss, back me up here. Talk some sense in to her for me!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_66": "Leave the recruiting promo to Buling. It's what she does best.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_67": "Exactly! Buling, Buling, everything's working!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_68": "Celestial Steed Corp has the nerve to talk like that? Bulk-bought keyboards, huh? Just watch me unearth every dirty little secret they've got.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_69": "You're a lifesaver. Thank you so much, Buling!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_7": "Chisa grits her teeth, dead serious, leaning in without realizing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_70": "Cartethyia lets out a long breath of relief.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_71": "Then she turns your way, fingers twining idly through the hair at her shoulder, and looks at you with quiet hope.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_72": "{PlayerName}, actually... I'd like to invite you to <color=#d19f27>join the Club Association</color>, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_73": "We all feel the same: it'd be like prepping for the School Anniversary all over again. Training with you would put us all at ease. And I'd be... happy, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_74": "Let me think it over first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_75": "It's fine, really! Take your time. A whole summer of <color=#d19f27>joint training</color> is a big ask. It's best to get your other plans sorted out first before making a decision.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_76": "Whatever you decide, no pressure at all. We'll handle our side, and the Orchestral Music Club will give it everything we've got. So... please, believe in us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_77": "Ah, excuse me, everyone—mind giving me some room? Careful, this is hot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_78": "Here's the Laurus Salad for Cartethyia, and the shredded fish noodles for Buling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_79": "Plus our seasonal pick, Lemon-Braised Pork. Do give it a taste, {PlayerName}. Enjoy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_8": "...I won't lose.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_80": "You taste Chisa's recommendation while it's hot. Hours of slow simmering have drawn the lemon's tang deep into the meat. The broth is deep-flavored, never greasy. One bite and your appetite wakes right up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_81": "Outside, the sky slowly darkens. After a long, busy day, you sit down to a delicious dinner with everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_82": "Take the weekend to seriously consider <color=#d19f27>Cartethyia's invitation</color>, and decide <color=#d19f27>what to do with your summer break</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_520_9": "Cartethyia gives no ground either, jacket sleeves shoved up high, a fine sweat beading at her temples.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_1": "When you push open the doors to the Student Council room, Changli is seated behind her desk, reviewing paperwork. The room is just as calm as usual.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_10": "You may have gotten the results you wanted, but judging by your friends' reactions, things aren't as hopeful as you imagined. It looks like everyone's scores might be...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_11": "I see. I didn't expect you to... Well, these things do happen sometimes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_12": "Upon hearing the news that you didn't get the results you hoped for, your friends' faces fall.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_13": "That's all right. Nerves get the better of all of us. Don't be too hard on yourself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_14": "Sorry... So how did everyone else do?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_15": "Oh, about that...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_16": "As Changli trails off, a tense silence falls over the Student Council room. Even the air seems to freeze. Your friends exchange glances, but no one says a word.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_17": "Changli, too, takes a moment to weigh her words. Only after you nod to show she needn't hold back, she fills you in on the situation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_18": "Everyone who received an A-grade score or above is right here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_19": "Many of the summer boot camp students managed to achieve a B-grade. But luck just wasn't quite on their side this time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_2": "Noticing your arrival, Changli caps her pen and sets it aside, her gaze settling on you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_20": "In other words, <color=#d19f27>there won't be five students with As or higher</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_21": "The room sinks into another brief silence, heavy enough to weigh on your heart. Until Xiangli Yao is the first to break it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_22": "Objectively speaking, expecting to close the gap with elite school students in just six months was always a long shot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_23": "For those in the summer boot camp... a B-grade is already an extraordinary result.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_24": "Xiangli Yao seems to be making an effort to keep his reasoning and tone rational. But his expression suggests he's not so much stating an objective fact as trying to convince himself of it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_25": "But still... it's such a shame. Everyone poured everything into preparing these past six months.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_26": "They all worked so, so hard...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_27": "Phoebe lowers her head as if to bury her face in the shadow, yet her fists are clenched at her sides. Having grown up in that kind of family, she knows better than anyone how Fenrico operates.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_28": "To Celestial Steed Corp, a deal is a deal, and there's no room for negotiation. In their eyes, they've already made their greatest concession.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_29": "And the Student Council has <color=#d19f27>failed to meet its end of the bargain</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_3": "Xiangli Yao stares blankly at the display screen, while Phoebe gives you a small nervous wave.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_30": "No need to give up so soon. We still don't know how things stand with the Nationals... I'll go check with the Club Association first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_31": "Mm. Thank you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_32": "You nod to Changli, then turn to leave.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_33": "Oh, right. About what's going to happen to this school ...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_34": "Just before you step out of the Student Council office, you stop and decide to share what Abby told you with everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_35": "I don't think any of you deserve to carry that burden... Since Principal Abby already made its stance clear to everyone back at the anniversary festival.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_36": "Upon mentioning the anniversary, everyone in the room seems to recall something.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_37": "All this time, Abby has cared more about all of you than about the school's future. About its students.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_38": "Its only goal as principal is to make sure every student can look back on their time here without regrets.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_39": "Sure, it's a shame the boot camp students didn't get the results they hoped for. But life's never just about one answer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_4": "Good morning, {PlayerName}. How's everything on your end?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_40": "Our future... everyone's future... should never be defined by a single Qualifying Exam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_41": "What matters more than any single achievement or defeat is never wavering in the confidence to keep moving forward, or the chance to become someone better.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_42": "And I believe all of you on the Student Council have already shown everyone what that means through your actions over the summer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_43": "Maybe it's just your imagination, but Phoebe and Xiangli Yao's expressions do seem to ease, if only a little.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_44": "Oh, you. Always know just what to say to set everyone at ease. Go on, {PlayerName}. Let us know when you hear anything.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_45": "Will do. Catch you all later.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_46": "After promising your friends at the Student Council that you'd meet up again later, you leave the Administration Building.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_5": "All good. Nothing to worry about.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_6": "Sorry... I ran into a bit of a setback.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_7": "Changli nods and lets out a soft breath, as though finally hearing some good news for a change, and a relieved smile crosses her face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_8": "Congratulations. As expected... you always do well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5300_9": "Yes, {PlayerName}. You've always been so reliable.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_1": "<color=#d19f27>The Student Council</color> and <color=#d19f27>the Club Association</color>... both have reached out with an invitation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_10": "Head over to the Club Association on Monday to draw up a solid summer camp plan with Ciaccona. That'll let you plan the coming weeks well in advance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_11": "(Honestly... I don't want to give up on either side.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_12": "(Whether it's <color=#d19f27>scoring an A on the Qualifying Exam</color> or <color=#d19f27>taking gold at Nationals</color>... if there's any way, I want everyone to achieve what they set out to do.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_13": "It won't be easy, but you're confident you can balance both sides and stand by everyone as they chase their goals.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_14": "With your decision made, the real goal is clear: save the school. Spend this summer moving forward together, so everyone can achieve the outcome they're striving for.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_15": "(I should let Changli and Cartethyia know about this decision, too.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_16": "(These next two months might just give us the opening we need to catch up.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_2": "Celestial Steed Corp set two terms for the final evaluation: <color=#d19f27>five or more students securing an A on the Qualifying Exam</color>, and <color=#d19f27>bringing home gold from the National Music Competition</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_3": "<color=#d19f27>Summer break</color> officially starts next week. Before you map out the coming weeks, you'd best <color=#d19f27>decide which side you're joining</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_4": "Join the <color=#d19f27>Student Council</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_5": "Join the <color=#d19f27>Club Association</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_6": "<color=#d19f27>Join both</color> and juggle both schedules.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_7": "The choice is made. Your goal: <color=#d19f27>get at least five students scoring an A on the Qualifying Exam</color>. Time to put in the work this summer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_8": "Head over to the Student Council on Monday to work out the summer schedule with Changli. That'll let you plan the coming weeks well in advance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_530_9": "The choice is made. Your goal: <color=#d19f27>gold at the National Music Competition finals</color>. Time to throw yourself into joint training all summer long.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_1": "The moment you step into the Club Association's Activity Center, a loud \"bang\" goes off right by your ear. A shower of glitter flutters down and blots out your vision.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_10": "Buling, who barely exercises, keeps her eyes locked on the golden trophy. Shrieking in panic, she darts left and right, trying to stop Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_11": "Hey, Boss {PlayerName}! Stop her already!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_12": "You hardly know whether to laugh or cry at the chaos in front of you. Just as you're about to step in and try to talk them down, Ciaccona issues an order as head of the Club Association.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_13": "Batter, Cartethyia!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_14": "W-what? Batter? Right now?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_15": "You heard me!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_16": "Cartethyia blanks for exactly one second. Then, catching Ciaccona's meaningful look, she slips instantly into the role of a \"batter.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_17": "Batter Cartethyia, ready as ever!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_18": "Yes! That's the spirit! Up next—Pitcher Chisa!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_19": "M-me too? Hm... Okay! Pitcher Chisa, ready.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_2": "It takes you two full seconds to process what just happened. It seems... someone fired a party popper right at you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_20": "All right, everyone! Let's show our dear Manager {PlayerName} what we're made of! HOMEEEE—RUN!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_21": "Without a moment's hesitation, Cartethyia grips the trophy in both hands and drops into a ready stance. Poised, radiant, her smile easy and confident—exactly how she looks swinging a bat on the field.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_22": "(Wait, home run?!)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_23": "Copy that, Captain! You can count on me!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_24": "You have no idea why everyone has suddenly started a baseball game, but you quickly recall what a \"home run\" means. The moment it clicks, you whip your head toward the sound on the other side.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_25": "Nothingness... DECONSTRUCTED!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_26": "Behind Cartethyia, right on cue, a brilliant streak of light shoots from the arm of the robot Chisa is piloting.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_27": "Hah?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_28": "???",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_29": "Cartethyia instantly steps forward half a pace. She twists through her hips, drives with her shoulders and arms, pours every ounce of strength into the trophy, and swings hard at the incoming light!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_3": "Enjoy the Symphony of Wind and Verse! Good morning to you, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_30": "Windstorm. SWEEP ALL AWAY!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_31": "The trophy and the spinning ball collide in a burst of sparks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_32": "Aha! Now that we've got the gold, this is exactly the kind of momentum we should be celebrating with!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_33": "Ciaccona isn't about to let up. She grabs the dumbstruck Buling beside her and fires another party popper at the three of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_34": "Here's the Eternal Idyll to our Lasting Summer!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_35": "(Do you really have to shout weird dramatic lines every time you make a move?!)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_36": "Boom—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_37": "Shattering glass, Buling's scream, excited cheers and laughter, the dull thud of something heavy hitting the ground—all tangled together. For a moment, creating a scene much livelier than a full Orchestral Music Club ensemble.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_38": "Dust and smoke fill the room, and amid the chaos, Cartethyia suddenly notices something is off.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_39": "Wait, everyone, look. I think this trophy is a fake.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_4": "The \"suspect\" who set off the party popper turns herself in. It's Ciaccona.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_40": "A few seconds later, Cartethyia steps out of the dust carrying the broken half of the trophy. She rubs the back of her head sheepishly, as if it's the result of her \"losing her grip by accident.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_41": "Huh? A fake?! Don't tell me the competition committee cut corners!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_42": "Where did all that budget and sponsor money even go?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_43": "With that, everyone at the Club Association gathers up at once, tossing comments back and forth on the broken trophy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_44": "You're right. The gold is just a thin outer layer. The inside is filled with cheap white plastic and steel support brackets.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_45": "We can glue it back together, maybe?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_46": "Well, at least we actually won first place...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_47": "It should be fine. At most, it'll... uh, leave some welding marks on the surface... Probably?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_48": "(If Abby sees this, it's going to faint from sheer rage...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_49": "I don't think it matters at all! Real or fake, the fact that we <color=#d19f27>won first place</color> is undeniable!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_5": "With a big sigh, you pick the confetti off your face. Just as you're about to speak, a flash of gold flickers before your eyes, again and again...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_50": "Reporting to Manager {PlayerName}. The Club Association has completed its mission with flying colors!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_51": "Cartethyia snaps you an exaggeratedly formal salute.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_52": "Mm. Good work, everyone. You earned this prize together as a team.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_53": "Here's hoping Celestial Steed Corp's final evaluation doesn't require the trophy to be in one piece...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_54": "Ha... haha... It's just a cheap trophy... They wouldn't hold it against us, right...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_55": "Oh, relax. If worst comes to worst, we'll just have to rely on Cartethyia's true forte.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_56": "Huh? You mean it's finally time to unleash my tempest-like super strength on the Board?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_57": "...Feathered Tempest? Is that some kind of metaphor...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_58": "And this Hybrid V2 Assault Baseball-Pitching Food-Delivery Bot will do its best too!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_59": "...Our Club Association sure is packed with talent.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_6": "This time it's Cartethyia, waving an <color=#d19f27>enormous trophy</color> in one hand. But at least it isn't headed your way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_60": "Aww! The power of music, friends marching forward together, a happy ending... This is a story that deserves to be passed down through the ages!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_61": "After some more commotion, you all tidy up the room together. Then Ciaccona fires one last party popper and announces she's handing the club leadership over to Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_62": "No one is surprised by the decision. After all, every one of you agrees that Cartethyia will lead the Orchestral Music Club to Nationals gold once again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_63": "Much like the Blessed Maiden in \"With Glory I Shall Fall,\" her favorite song, she'll write a story all her own. One that's free and joyful, with friends by her side... a story that shines.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_64": "Amid the laughter and chatter, everyone says they'd like another stroll around campus together, and they invite you along.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_65": "But you still need to head home and wait for word from Abby, so you tell them you'll meet up later and see them out of the Activity Center.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_66": "(Now then...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_67": "Head home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_68": "Rest for a bit before heading back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_7": "{PlayerName}, look! The trophy for taking first place in the National Music Competition is made of real gold!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_8": "She flourishes the waist-high trophy like a magician's cane, juggling it over and over as it whooshes through the air.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5400_9": "Put it down! That's gold! Don't break it!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_1": "The moment you step into the Club Association's Activity Center, a loud \"bang\" goes off right by your ear. A shower of glitter flutters down and blots out your vision.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_10": "It seemed like such a waste to just throw them away, so we decided to put them to good use today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_11": "(\"Never get the chance\"...? So that means...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_12": "Cartethyia gives you a bitter smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_13": "Sorry, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_14": "...We didn't make it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_15": "You freeze for a moment. As far as you can remember, this is the first time you've seen Cartethyia look like she's admitting defeat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_16": "I see...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_17": "They've lost Nationals. <color=#d19f27>The Club Association has missed out on the gold they dreamt of</color>. A plain fact in front of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_18": "Aiya, those zero-talent judges wouldn't know good music if it bit them! Original compositions are on a whole different difficulty scale compared to standard pieces!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_19": "Besides, our member lineup and resources can't even compare to the other schools! The amount of effort we put in, the hurdles we cleared—those people didn't factor in any of that!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_2": "It takes you two full seconds to process what just happened. It seems... someone fired a party popper right at you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_20": "Buling kicks at the scraps of confetti on the floor and grumbles, frustrated. The glimmering flecks fly around, then fall.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_21": "Ciaccona slowly reaches out, claps Buling on the shoulder a few times with a smile, and speaks with forced lightness.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_22": "Now, now. Failing to deliver our best to the audience is still on us as the performers. We can't make excuses there.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_23": "But... they could've at least given us more technical points?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_24": "Buling lowers her head in frustration and mutters a few lines of crosstalk patter from back home. She only joined the Club Association after the anniversary, but she has seen the Orchestral Music Club's rocky climb to the national stage with her own eyes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_25": "\"Don't be too hard on yourself.\" \"All that matters is that everyone did their best.\" By now, you can no longer bring yourself to offer such cheap comfort.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_26": "They each carried their own dreams onto the national stage, only to end up here. What must they be feeling as they force smiles, goof around like always, and wish each other a happy graduation as if nothing has changed?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_27": "You know all too well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_28": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_29": "Great performance, everyone. I'll reach out later once Abby's back, and we can throw a party then.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_3": "Enjoy the Symphony of Wind and Verse! Good morning to you, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_30": "Everyone nods in agreement. You turn to say your goodbyes—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_31": "At least, that's how it should have gone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_32": "But then, Cartethyia draws a deep breath.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_33": "Everyone—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_34": "She lifts her head and holds out her right hand, clenching it into a fist.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_35": "Next year, I'm definitely bringing our team to the finals. And we're taking that gold trophy!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_36": "So please, come watch us shine at next year's competition!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_37": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_38": "This is how Cartethyia is most of the time: full of energy and enthusiasm. Seeing her like this, you can't help but smile, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_39": "If regret is inevitable, then the only thing she will do is make herself stronger the time around.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_4": "The \"suspect\" who set off the party popper turns herself in. It's Ciaccona.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_40": "And if anything stands in her way, she will draw a sharp blade without hesitation, splitting boulders and cutting down every thorn in her path.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_41": "All right. I'll be there.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_42": "You bump your fist against hers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_43": "Roger that, Leader Cartethyia!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_44": "W-what?! You're handing over the club's leadership...? Shouldn't you wait for a more formal occasion?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_45": "Oh, what does that matter? The power of a promise, friends by your side, and a bright future ahead—right now is the absolute best moment for it!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_46": "Ciaccona and Buling come over as well, and you bring your fists together—just as you did to cheer one another on before the Nationals.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_47": "—So, it's a promise.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_48": "After some more commotion, you tidy up the room together. Then, everyone suggests they'd like another stroll around campus, and invites you along.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_49": "But you still need to head home and wait for word from Abby, so you tell them you'll meet up later and see them out of the Activity Center.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_5": "You reach up and brush the confetti off your hair. Just as you're about to say something, two more pops ring out behind you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_50": "(Now then...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_51": "Head home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_52": "Rest for a bit before heading back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_6": "Happy graduation, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_7": "Happy graduation, Boss!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_8": "What's this all about...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5500_9": "I had these confetti ready for the National Music Competition, but it looks like we'll never get the chance to use them now...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_1": "With summer break officially here, the Central Square already feels much emptier than usual.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_10": "Big school, noisy rumor mill. Tell people one at a time and you'll lose your day to it. By the time it gets around, it'll be a whole different story.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_11": "But the forum? That's different. I know exactly what catches fire and what's just people shooting the breeze.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_12": "You hand me the material. I'll sort it, pick the right time to post, and come up with a title that pulls people in...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_13": "Guaranteed—your post lands right in front of the people who need to see it!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_14": "Buling agrees readily enough, but she doesn't end the conversation there. Instead, she lets a beat pass and a knowing smile spreads across her face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_15": "That said, though...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_16": "Though?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_17": "You know the forum doesn't just run itself. Sorting posts, moderating content, all those little odds and ends...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_18": "Server maintenance, site operations... all of that costs money. Sure, it looks lively from where you sit, but the upkeep behind the curtain? Tsk, tsk. Not cheap.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_19": "She gives an exaggerated, helpless shrug and spreads her hands at you, completely unabashed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_2": "On a bench by the bulletin board, Buling is hammering out replies—laptop on her knees, fingers flying fast enough to blur.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_20": "Boss, you wouldn't want to open the school forum one day only to find it's \"ascended to the heavens\" for lack of server fees, would you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_21": "We're classmates. How about a discount?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_22": "No problem. Put the whole forum on my tab.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_23": "Hmm... fair enough. I'll give you the friends' discount.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_24": "Hah, that's what I like to hear, Boss! Tell you what, I'll hook you up with the friends' discount.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_25": "Mm. Favor or not, I'll still pay you what it's worth.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_26": "Rest assured. I'm a forum mod. I won't rip you off! Once <color=#d19f27>the pay</color>'s right, putting up posts and bumping threads for you is a piece of cake.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_27": "Digging up info, spreading the word... anything forum-related, this mod's got you covered.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_28": "News on the forum comes and goes in a flash. Catching the right moment beats sitting on your hands!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_29": "Now that Buling can <color=#d19f27>post on the school forum</color> for you, you won't have to stress over finding the right promo channels anymore.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_3": "You busy, Buling?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_30": "You might even pick up some insider secrets along the way...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_4": "Hm? Nah. Someone forgot their manners, so I'm doing a bit of \"tidying up\" around the forum. What about you, Boss? Central Square for a breather?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_5": "Actually, I was hoping to ask our forum moderator for a favor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_6": "At that, Buling sobers a little. She shuts her laptop and slides down to one end of the bench, giving you half the seat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_7": "You fill Buling in on the summer plans for the Club Association and the Student Council.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_8": "So I was thinking the forum could help spread the word, and get more students in the loop.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_550_9": "Oh-ho? Publicity? Say no more. Smart call, Boss.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_55_1": "A weekend of wandering around has given you a pretty good feel for both the town and the campus.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_55_2": "The Student Council, the Club Association, and the Liaison Center... it seems student life here revolves mainly around these three. Maybe you should try taking part in a few activities during the semester.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_55_3": "For now, it's best to call it a night. You definitely don't want to be late for your very first day of school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_1": "The main Teaching Building, the Administration Building, the Activity Center... A year has quietly slipped past, and this campus, keeper of countless memories, has finally reached <color=#d19f27>the day for goodbyes</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_10": "Thanks to everyone in the Orchestral Music Club, you can read the notes on a score now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_11": "Come, give it a try.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_12": "Shorekeeper tilts her head slightly and gives you an incredibly gentle smile, tinged with a slight hint of sorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_13": "In that instant, a memory that shouldn't exist seems to flood your mind. <color=#d19f27>Have you ever sat with her someplace and played the piano just like you are now?</color> You don't know for sure. The two of you have only met... a handful of times, have you not?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_14": "You press a key, and the vibrating string sings. It's nothing more than the four notes of a D major chord—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_15": "That sounds familiar... I feel like I've heard it somewhere before.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_16": "A long time ago, you taught me how to play it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_17": "At those words, your eyes widen in surprise. \"A long time ago...?\" What is that supposed to mean?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_18": "Did I? I'm afraid... I don't remember anything.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_19": "It's fine. I'll teach you, {PlayerName}. Just like you did for me before.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_2": "It's just that you've been on the go since you left home this morning, barely getting a moment's rest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_20": "Did I forget something important?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_21": "She shakes her head without a word, and her fingertips settle on the keys once more. The melody you play together swells and ebbs like the tide through the empty activity room, as if pouring out every farewell and every lingering ache at once.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_22": "Have we traveled together before, only to be separated for a very long time?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_23": "That's right. This is the town where you lived as a child, after all. Coming back after so many years, it's only natural that you've been away from everything here for far too long.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_24": "So long that... when you first came back, you didn't even recognize Abby waiting to pick you up at the station. Isn't that right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_25": "But where does this strange dissonance that only Shorekeeper carries come from? <color=#d19f27>No... not just her. The piano, the school, this town, even</color> <color=#e46969>you yourself</color>—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_26": "You gaze at Shorekeeper's profile, and a strange, tangled emotion swells until it nearly overflows from your chest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_27": "The music breaks off. Her aqua-blue hair sways gently in the evening breeze, and the unfinished melody stays behind, caught between the pages.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_28": "...The next time we meet, you won't remember what happened between us. But that's alright. <color=#d19f27>I'll remember. Always.</color>",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_29": "Wait! Shorekeeper—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_3": "Time always seems to fly when you're with friends. But now that the bustle has faded and quiet has settled back in, the fatigue you hadn't noticed comes flooding in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_30": "—!!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_31": "Your own scream tears you out of sleep, and your eyes fly open.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_32": "(Did I... fall asleep in the activity room?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_33": "(I think I had a strange dream. What was it...? I can't remember...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_34": "The sky outside darkens. With no time to dwell on it, you hurry to your feet and leave the Activity Center.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_35": "Deep in the silent body of the piano, a blue butterfly beats its wings softly among the strings, then flutters free. It passes over your shoulder and flies on ahead.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_4": "You sit down on the soft piano bench. The autumn evening sun slants through the window and falls over you, and surprisingly, there's some warmth to it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_5": "(Feeling a bit tired...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_6": "See? Just let it flow out of you, like this...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_7": "At some point, the aqua-haired girl, who always seems so familiar, has settled down beside you. You have no idea when or how she got here. It's almost as if... she's been by your side all along.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_8": "...Shorekeeper?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5600_9": "What are you doing here? I don't remember you being a student here... Oh, right. The piano score...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_1": "The road home, walked countless times over the past year, now feels as fresh as the first time you saw it. Scenery you'd long gotten used to suddenly comes alive again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_10": "You glance down at the folder in your hands... Good point.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_100": "But if there's still any doubt in your heart, then it means the time hasn't yet come.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_101": "Don't worry. If you wish to stay here and savor this happiness, I'll always be here... watching over you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_102": "Shorekeeper's words strike the concern buried deep in your heart. She's right. Are you truly ready to face everything?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_103": "You and Shorekeeper stand side by side quietly for a while, until daylight fades and the bus arrives. After saying goodbye to Shorekeeper, you head home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_11": "Well, it could be other documents. Or I could be picking up someone else's results for them, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_12": "Mm... But the look on your face told me everything.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_13": "What look?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_14": "The look of someone lost in thought.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_15": "Every time a journey draws to a close, you always find it hard to part with the people and things around you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_16": "Sounds like... you know me pretty well?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_17": "Mm.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_18": "Shorekeeper's immediate confirmation catches you off guard. As if to keep you from pressing any further, she quickly tosses a new question your way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_19": "<color=#d19f27>Have you decided when you'll be leaving?</color>",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_2": "The peeling paint on the carved window frames along the street, the long-expired concert flyers on the walls, the sodas in the vending machine you never got around to trying... Details you'd once overlooked catch your eye one by one.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_20": "Leave? The question comes more abruptly than you expected. You turn her words over in your mind...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_21": "You mean leaving town?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_22": "You mean going back to the world I came from?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_23": "Yes. After all... the year you spent in this small town is merely a brief interlude in your life.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_24": "I haven't talked it over with Abby yet... but probably in the next few days.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_25": "At that vague \"probably,\" Shorekeeper lowers her head slightly and gives a soft \"Mm.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_26": "For some reason, you catch a flicker of her feelings in that tiny gesture.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_27": "Rather, the reluctance to part... it is more of a kind of involuntary loneliness she can't quite hide behind her polite distance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_28": "How about... I'll let you know once I have a date nailed down?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_29": "Your concern catches Shorekeeper off guard. She freezes for a moment, then smiles.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_3": "Your gaze drifts slowly across your surroundings. Everything is as quiet as always, yet in this moment it feels unusually vivid. As if to commit it all to memory anew, you find yourself lingering a heartbeat longer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_30": "No need. Have you forgotten? We've only met a few times.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_31": "...True. That was a little abrupt. Sorry.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_32": "Shorekeeper smiles at your words, and for a while both of you stay silent. You simply stand side by side at the bus stop, watching the wind toss the willow branches in the yard across the street, shaping them into the form they hold today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_33": "Look after yourself on your way back. Safe journey.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_34": "...That's it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_35": "Yes. Is something wrong?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_36": "You can't tell why, but you just feel she has so much she hasn't been able to say.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_37": "This is enough. We've never needed many words between us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_38": "She's right. The two of you have never needed many words. But why do you and this girl, whom you've met only a handful of times, share such an unspoken understanding?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_39": "—You can't find an answer. Everything has simply fallen into place, so delicately, so perfectly. You happened to be on your way back, and she happened to have been here all along, waiting for you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_4": "Just as you're about to look away, a familiar figure slips into the corner of your vision. You pause without thinking, and a ripple stirs the calm in your heart.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_40": "And yet... can there really be so many coincidences in this world? So many things that just happen to be so?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_41": "Sunset clouds roll in from the horizon, holding a quiet, lingering warmth, and little by little they tint the evening sky in soft orange and pale violet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_42": "The bus seems especially late today. You and Shorekeeper just stand there, with little to say.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_43": "Wind blows in from the far end of the street. As the sunlight fades, distant headlights flicker on, stretching your shadows long until they gently overlap.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_44": "After saying goodbye to Shorekeeper, you board the bus and head home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_45": "Shorekeeper freezes where she stands. A few seconds later, her eyes blink several times in quick succession.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_46": "A butterfly, preserved as a specimen, finally stirs its resin-stiffened wings once more.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_47": "Until this moment, it had rested quietly, silently watching the world. Suspended in time, it had remained frozen before your eyes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_48": "And now, because of your words, this \"butterfly\" breaks free from quietude once again. You gave it the chance to fly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_49": "You... haven't remembered <color=#d19f27>everything</color>, have you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_5": "The aqua-haired girl, who always seems so familiar, is standing by the roadside bus stop once again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_50": "She puts particular weight on that one word, \"everything.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_51": "No. As far as my memories go, I'm just an ordinary student who came back to my hometown to spend a year at school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_52": "Then why do you ask me that?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_53": "I feel like... I've had dreams about you. But I can't remember what happened in the dream...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_54": "...If I had to name it, I'd say it's intuition. Or maybe instinct.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_55": "Shorekeeper... it's like your name. You've never told me what it means, yet it fits you perfectly. Everything about you leaves me with feelings I can't quite pin down or put into words.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_56": "You hesitate for just a moment, then decide to voice the confusion in your heart.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_57": "Like how I can't help but get the feeling... that you're familiar. As if you once stayed by my side for a long, long time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_58": "Shorekeeper stays silent and gives no answer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_59": "Sometimes others would give me that feeling—though never as strongly as what I get from you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_6": "...It's you, Shorekeeper.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_60": "But I can't tell where all this familiarity comes from. That's why I wanted to ask you... Have I forgotten something important?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_61": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_62": "A long, long silence.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_63": "Just like that, you both stand side by side, until finally she breaks the stillness with a helpless sigh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_64": "Has anything about life here... made you unhappy?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_65": "No, I've been very happy here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_66": "Shorekeeper opens her mouth instinctively to say something, but the words stop on her lips. She's already guessed your answer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_67": "Life here is peaceful and happy. Everyone is full of life, looking to the future with hope and confidence. The biggest problems you see are a somewhat unreliable principal stepping down or the school changing hands.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_68": "No disasters that threaten lives, no fear of what tomorrow might bring. Everyone is happy and hopeful, surrounded by loving families... free to find the courage to chase their dreams.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_69": "I can't imagine a better, happier world than this.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_7": "Good afternoon, {PlayerName}. Happy graduation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_70": "But this happiness is precisely why I keep having this faint feeling... that none of this is real.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_71": "Or maybe, it's not this town that feels unreal... It's me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_72": "...I have <color=#d19f27>another destiny</color>, don't I?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_73": "In a world like this, you're the only one who makes me feel like this is real, Shorekeeper.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_74": "You're always able to say things like that with a straight face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_75": "Shorekeeper, I—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_76": "Do you feel that this world... is precious to you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_77": "Cutting you off, Shorekeeper presses on, resolute, with one question after another, each leaving you no way to turn back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_78": "<color=#d19f27>Do you really... want to go back to your original life?</color>",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_79": "<color=#d19f27>I do.</color>",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_8": "Thanks. But how did you know? I don't remember you being a student here...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_80": "I... No. I don't want to.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_81": "<color=#d19f27>Even if that means everything you gained here, all the precious memories and pieces of happiness, will vanish into nothing? You still want to go back?</color>",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_82": "<color=#d19f27>I do.</color>",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_83": "No... I don't want to. It's perfect here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_84": "<color=#d19f27>Even if what awaits you upon your return... is an unimaginably harsh world and an endless, cruel mission?</color>",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_85": "You already know my answer, Shorekeeper.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_86": "True happiness is never something you can have just by standing still. It's a path you have to fight for, seize, and carve out with your own two hands.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_87": "If this really is an ideal world... then all the more reason to carry its scenery with me in my heart when I return to reality, and let the happiness I've found here become the goal that guides me forward.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_88": "To fight. To overcome. To face every crisis in my path, one step at a time, until I make that future a reality.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_89": "Rather than lose myself in this false peace and happiness, or run from the hardships I'm meant to face on my own.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_9": "The exam results are published on this day every year. Besides, that folder you're holding gives it away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_90": "No matter how many times, you never even hesitate.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_91": "If you've truly made up your mind, come find me at the <color=#d19f27>train station platform</color> the night before you leave.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_92": "You nod, taking Shorekeeper's words to heart. A breeze drifts in from the far end of the street. As daylight fades, distant headlights stretch your shadows long, until they gently overlap.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_93": "The bus arrives. After saying goodbye to Shorekeeper, you head home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_94": "Hearing your answer, Shorekeeper seems to breathe a sigh of relief...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_95": "But if there's still any doubt in your heart, then it means the time hasn't yet come.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_96": "Don't worry. If you wish to stay here and savor this happiness, I'll always be here... watching over you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_97": "Shorekeeper's words strike the concern buried deep in your heart. She's right. Are you truly ready to face everything?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_98": "You and Shorekeeper stand side by side quietly for a while, until daylight fades and the bus arrives. After saying goodbye to Shorekeeper, you head home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5700_99": "Hearing your answer, Shorekeeper seems to breathe a sigh of relief...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_1": "After the discussion about the program, the Orchestral Music Club begins preparing for next month's public performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_10": "In the wake of this disappointing performance, the fatigue from months of training and the hopes pinned on the show finally come crashing down.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_11": "At the Student Council's summer boot camp, the more time everyone spends together, the wider the academic gap between them shows.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_12": "The summer days slip by in a hurry.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_13": "The bitter contrast between endless grind and actual results feeds a growing undercurrent of doubt and frustration.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_14": "Unsettled disappointments and lingering tensions quietly build beneath the frantic rush of daily life...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_2": "Meanwhile, you and Changli work out the plans for the summer boot camp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_3": "The Qualifying Exam and Nationals are still a long way off. Willpower alone won't keep everyone going for that long.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_4": "On one side, the performance preparations press ahead at full tilt. On the other, the summer boot camp is gradually finding its right pace...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_5": "And so, running back and forth between both fronts, your summer quickly fills to the brim.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_6": "Together, you lock in the venue, the promotion, and the performer lineup one piece at a time, while the Orchestral Music Club throws itself into even more intensive training.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_7": "Over at the Student Council, the unexpected reward system catches many students' attention. Quite a few even turn up out of curiosity...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_8": "Before you know it, the calendar turns to August.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_570_9": "The Orchestral Music Club's long-awaited public performance goes ahead as planned. But once they actually take the stage, things fall far short of everyone's expectations.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5750_1": "After going through the school's financial records with Phoebe, you find that its debt is far from beyond saving. The school simply runs a chronic operating deficit.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5750_2": "With Phoebe's help, after negotiations with the School Board, asset audits, and the necessary legal procedures, the school formally signs an acquisition agreement with you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5750_3": "You acquire the school for a price matching Celestial Steed Corp's offer and pledge to uphold its educational philosophy going forward.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5750_4": "Once all the paperwork is complete, ownership of the school officially changes hands. From then on, Celestial Steed Corp has no part in running the school, and its planned asset development project is scrapped.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5750_5": "Celestial Steed Corp formally terminates its acquisition of the school. And you let Abby stay right where it belongs, as principal, along with the school's faculty structure, student system, and club traditions.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5750_6": "Yet you know just as well that the value of this century-old school... is never a question a number can answer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5750_7": "There is still a long road ahead, but at least for everyone present, and for the school as it stands, you already have more than enough confidence—and conviction—to continue its path.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5760_1": "Thanks to Buling's publicity push, your personal fame draws endless media attention. The school's brand is steadily recovering, and its future enrollment prospects have improved noticeably.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5760_2": "A shift that catches the eye of Celestial Steed Corp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5760_3": "With your influence behind it, public expectations for the school's future continue to climb, and opportunities for corporate partnerships and sponsorship talks grow by the day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5760_4": "But for Celestial Steed Corp, pushing ahead with the acquisition now means higher negotiation costs and heavier investment.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5760_5": "After reassessing the situation, Celestial Steed Corp reaches a conclusion: as current conditions stand, the cost of acquiring the school and the operational risks that would follow no longer fit the group's original investment plan.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5760_6": "—In the end, Celestial Steed Corp formally terminates its acquisition of the school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5760_7": "Yet you know just as well that the value of this century-old school... is never a question personal fame or online influence can answer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5760_8": "There is still a long road ahead, but at least for everyone present, and for the school as it stands, you already have more than enough confidence—and conviction—to continue its path.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_1": "Good evening, viewers. You're tuning in to tonight's news brief.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_10": "Pfft, piece of cake! Just a little worn out from posing for photos with that old geezer Fenrico all afternoon.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_11": "Once you sit down beside it, Abby gives up the struggle altogether. It shifts into a comfier position and stays sprawled on the sofa, its drooping ears sweeping back and forth across the carpet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_12": "Thanks for everything over the year, Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_13": "Hehe, all in a day's work! I am the Principal, after all!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_14": "You should've seen those old fossils' faces when I showed up with the results today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_15": "Oh?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_16": "Your class has officially put this school on the map! Once you guys graduate, I can't even begin to imagine how many out-of-town applicants we'll get next year...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_17": "When that time comes... next anniversary... if you're free to visit... we can... call up everyone... and... Zzz...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_18": "Abby rambles on to itself until it drifts off to sleep.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_19": "The news continues to play footage from today's interview. On screen, Abby puffs out its chest, one hand clasping Fenrico's, the other flashing a cheeky victory sign at the camera.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_2": "At 5:00 p.m. sharp today, Fenrico, chairman of Celestial Steed Corp., delivered an important speech at our town's industry symposium.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_20": "You quietly turn off the TV, fetch a blanket and tuck Abby in, before heading back to your room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_21": "Over this past year, <color=#d19f27>everyone's efforts have finally earned the School Board's recognition</color>. The school's future is bound to be a bright one.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_22": "Tomorrow... It's about time to start packing...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_3": "The symposium centered on regional industry development, collaborative innovation between industry and academia, and talent development partnerships, drawing representatives from numerous local businesses and educational institutions.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_4": "In his address, Chairman Fenrico stated that Celestial Steed Corp will establish a long-term educational partnership with the renowned local institute, Second Solaris School, and set up a dedicated development fund to support modernizations to the school's teaching facilities and the growth of its club activities.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_5": "Sources say the two parties also held preliminary talks on joint curriculum development, internship and practicum bases, and student employment support, and have reached a consensus on several areas of cooperation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_6": "After the meeting, Chairman Fenrico and Principal Abby spoke with our reporter. Both commented they will build on existing discussions to further refine their partnership plans, with details expected to be announced next month.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_7": "By the time you get home, Abby is sprawled across the couch, exhaustion written all over its face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_8": "When it sees you, it snorts and kicks its legs hard, trying to spring up with a kip-up... Sadly, it fails.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5800_9": "You should get some rest if you're tired, Abby. How was your day?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_1": "Good evening, viewers. You're tuning in to tonight's news brief.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_10": "Don't worry about it. Honestly, I'm about due for retirement anyway. This past year wore me out...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_11": "Thanks for everything, Abby. You did great.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_12": "Hehe, it's fine! At least that old geezer Fenrico got to see how hard everyone fought.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_13": "Even if he's taking over the school, I don't think he'll pull anything too dirty.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_14": "He even promised Changli and the other students that he won't scrap the local admission policy. And moving forward, we'll have more out-of-town applicants than ever before...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_15": "When that time comes... the next anniversary... if you're free to visit... we can... we can call everyone... and... Zzz...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_16": "Likely worn out, Abby rambles on to itself until it drifts off to sleep.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_17": "The news continues to play footage from today's interview. On screen, Abby puffs out its chest and reaches up to remove the badge of the principal's office. It wipes the badge with a handkerchief, then formally hands it to Fenrico.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_18": "The loosey-goosey Principal Abby actually cuts a rather imposing figure while on TV.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_19": "You quietly turn off the TV, fetch a blanket and tuck Abby in, before heading back to your room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_2": "At 5:00 p.m. today, at the town's industry symposium, Fenrico, chairman of Celestial Steed Corp, formally signed a cooperative education agreement with the town government concerning Second Solaris School.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_20": "(At least Abby has already found its answer... Though it may still need some time to adjust to its new life.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_21": "(But then again, so do I...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_3": "Under the agreement, Celestial Steed Corp will take over full operational management of Second Solaris School starting this week, and will spend the next three years modernizing the school's teaching facilities.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_4": "Abby, the former principal of Second Solaris School and the last to serve before the school came under outside management, was also present to witness the signing ceremony. Here's a report from our correspondent on the scene...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_5": "By the time you get home, Abby is sprawled across the couch, exhaustion written all over its face. The moment it sees you, it hurriedly rolls over, as if trying to scramble to its feet...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_6": "Get some rest, Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_7": "Huh? What? Must've dozed off for a second... How was your day?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_8": "Pretty good. I dropped by the Student Council and the Club Association and got to meet everyone. They all seemed to be in good spirits, but...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5900_9": "...<color=#d19f27>Everyone's sad</color> about what happened to the school. I'm sorry.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_1": "Um, {PlayerName}... weren't you all heading over to Chisa's place for hotpot tonight?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_10": "Fenrico?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_11": "...Fine. A few board members, and Fenrico. They say there's still something to talk over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_12": "Routine business, nothing worth fretting over. Forget about me. Enjoy your dinner. School's back tomorrow, so go have some fun tonight.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_13": "Are you sure you'll be fine going alone?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_14": "Relax! Your Uncle Abby's not a loafer!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_2": "Yeah, I'm heading out now. Why are you still on the couch, Abby? Aren't you coming?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_3": "Well, the thing is... ugh, no, no good. My stomach suddenly hurts like crazy. I can't go out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_4": "Putting on a dramatically pained face, Abby clutches its stomach and flops back onto the couch with a thud.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_5": "Abby, did something go wrong with the School Board and Celestial Steed Corp again?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_6": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_7": "The principal, grimacing just a second ago, freezes. Its head droops, and it shoots you a guilty glance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_8": "Why do you have to be this sharp?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_590_9": "Eh, it's no big deal. Just gotta round up a few board members and get us all on the same page—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_1": "It's the last day of summer break, and the usually bustling family restaurant has gone quiet for once.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_10": "No, no, it's fine. The broth hasn't even come to a boil yet, so you're not late. But where's Principal Abby?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_100": "Fenrico barely gets a sentence out before the entire table freezes in sync for half a beat. Instantly, everyone subtly shifts posture, leaning and craning their heads toward his voice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_101": "That said, there remain a few adjustments we expect your administration to... fully implement by tomorrow morning.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_102": "Granted, these items sit low on the review schedule. But given the state this school is in...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_103": "It has to be fast!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_104": "You watch Buling's chopsticks nose around the copper pot. She comes up empty, yet she withdraws them as if nothing happened, and starts chewing the air in earnest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_105": "...Particularly the scheduling regarding the competition... As a sponsor, Celestial Steed Corp will naturally have its own thoughts about events like these...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_106": "Ciaccona sets her chopsticks down too, head bowed over her dipping sauce, like the piled spices might be hiding an earth-shattering secret, worthy of her undivided attention.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_107": "Then there's the periodic assessments after the semester begins...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_108": "...All this outside attention... the constant press coverage... it could cause trouble for what's ahead.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_109": "The lowered voices reach you in pieces through the billowing steam, never quite clear. Even the hotpot's bubbling, a symphony a moment ago, now grates on your ears.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_11": "Before you can answer, a small figure pokes out past the kitchen curtain, balancing a little pot of steaming shellfish broth.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_110": "Xiangli Yao's gaze rests on Fenrico for a moment. The next second his wrist slips, \"carelessly,\" and the spoon at the edge of his plate clatters to the floor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_111": "He bends down as naturally as can be, then drags his chair out a little further as if it were in the way, quietly edging closer to the next table.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_112": "...Radish.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_113": "Roccia seems to be the only one unbothered by any of it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_114": "Oblivious to the chaos around her, she keeps treasure-hunting in the boiling broth, hooks a radish stewed soft and savory, and lays it neat on her plate.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_115": "Tofu.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_116": "Then, without missing a beat, she scoops out some tofu and shrimp and slips them onto your plate and Changli's.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_117": "Her chopsticks stir the broth a few more times and come up with a broth-soaked mushroom for Chisa's bowl.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_118": "You've got this, Chisa.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_119": "Roccia's gaze flicks, barely noticeable, toward the kitchen and the next table. Then she waggles her empty cup at Chisa.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_12": "Someone here can't handle spicy food, so I made a mild broth for everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_120": "She wasn't oblivious to the chaos.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_121": "You were watching everything like a hawk the whole time, Roccia!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_122": "...Okay! Going in!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_123": "Catching Roccia's signal, Chisa gets to her feet and strolls toward the board members, looking perfectly natural.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_124": "She clears a few empty plates from an adjacent table and restocks some drinks along the way, playing the dutiful waitress to a tee.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_125": "Had her hands not obviously slowed down as she passed the Board members and Fenrico, you'd never have guessed she was up to something.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_126": "That's Chisa, the girl who's landed deals with sponsor after sponsor. Give her time, and she'll be a legend across the entire school...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_127": "Good evening. Are you all enjoying your meal so far?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_128": "We'd love to invite you to sample our secret new dish. You'd get a first taste, plus a fifty-percent-off coupon good for both dine-in and takeout.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_129": "On the outer edge, one of the Celestial Steed Corp guards flicks his eyes upward. That icy, detached stare cuts straight through the crowd, pinning Chisa with pure, silent intimidation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_13": "And... Cartethyia, this one's seafood-free. Want to try a sip first?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_130": "Chisa's words choke in her throat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_131": "R-right. I'll let you enjoy your meal, then. Have a wonderful evening.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_132": "Looking away as if she hasn't noticed a thing, she scuttles back, the empty dishes in her hands rattling softly with every hurried step.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_133": "Phoebe...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_134": "Those Celestial Steed Corp guards are terrifying.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_135": "I'm sorry, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_136": "I... Celestial Steed Corp has caused all of you so much trouble. I'll find a way to talk to my adoptive father again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_137": "Phoebe lowers her head, her brow furrowed in crestfallen dismay.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_138": "No. You don't owe anyone an apology, Phoebe. None of this was ever your fault, and you've helped everyone as much as you could.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_139": "You treasure every ordinary day here at school, Phoebe. I treasure the bond we've had since we met just as much.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_14": "—You two, watch out!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_140": "Your kindness, your devotion, your easy grace, and that heart of yours that lights right up for the things you love. We've all seen them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_141": "So don't put so much pressure on yourself, Phoebe. Whatever comes at this school, we take it on together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_142": "{PlayerName}...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_143": "Seeing the mood at the table turn heavier, Changli clears her throat softly and draws every eye to her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_144": "Well then, now that we're all comfortably full, shall we have a little after-dinner entertainment?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_145": "How about... a lot-drawing challenge? I once happened to see the Council members playing it. It's one of the few games I know.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_146": "You mean the one where whoever draws the marked lot has to do whatever the challenge says, President Changli?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_147": "Mm-hmm. I brought playing cards. They can be the lots.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_148": "Number card, you're safe. Joker, you take on whatever challenge the rest of us come up with.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_149": "Um... so the challenge is: tell us the most embarrassing thing you did lately.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_15": "With one hand steadying the loaded Delivery Bot and the other balancing a tall stack of empty saucers, Chisa sidesteps, neatly slipping past Roccia and Cartethyia's outstretched arms.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_150": "And you, Phoebe? Would you like to play?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_151": "I... I'm fine with anything.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_152": "(So Changli's using a game to lift the mood and get Phoebe to relax a little. Smart move.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_153": "Roccia nods and deals a small stack around. Card after card gets drawn, and the joker still hasn't turned up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_154": "It's no accident. Roccia started the deal on Phoebe's far side on purpose, to make sure...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_155": "The final card lands in front of Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_156": "Um, if you're not feeling it, Phoebe, you can always sit this round out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_157": "It's all right. I want to be part of the fun too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_158": "Phoebe gingerly draws the last card and reveals it to the table. Sure enough, it's the mark of the challenger—a \"Joker\" stamped with Roccia's face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_159": "Huh? Is this... Roccia?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_16": "Phew... Crisis averted. Nothing spilled.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_160": "Tada—congratulations, Phoebe! You drew the special limited-edition Joker of \"First Mate\" Roccia. \"Calm and unruffled, Roccia rows her crate through the ship's hold.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_161": "This deck hasn't officially hit the shelves at my shop yet, but production's coming along smoothly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_162": "So... that means I pulled the challenge card?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_163": "At the next table, the two bodyguards freeze solid. Even behind their dark sunglasses, their expressions are darkening visibly by the second.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_164": "(An embarrassing story from the Celestial Steed Corp heir? That's... quite a challenge.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_165": "Ah... haha, so, um, Roccia? What do you say we switch to another dare?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_166": "It's just a game. If Phoebe feels uncomfortable, we can surely change the dare.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_167": "It's fine, really. It's only an embarrassing story about myself. It's no big deal...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_168": "The moment the blonde heir nods through her slight hesitation, an intensely menacing aura flares from the security guards nearby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_169": "After all, from Celestial Steed Corp's perspective, whatever comes out of Phoebe's mouth next could easily make or break their corporate image.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_17": "That's everything. Please take your seats, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_170": "Mm... Last week, I was passing by the music classroom when I heard someone playing the piano inside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_171": "My mother taught me a little piano when I was younger, so I thought I might go in and play a little.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_172": "When I opened the door, none of the pianos were free, so I decided to wait a moment...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_173": "But for some reason, the two students practicing inside suddenly stopped. They looked up and just stared straight at me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_174": "It was awkward, so I just said, \"Please, just carry on.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_175": "Next thing I knew, they'd both stood up, bowed to me in perfect unison, set down their sheet music, and vanished on the spot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_176": "Maybe I was bothering them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_177": "Phoebe says it quietly, and just for a moment the restaurant goes still. Left and right of her, both tables sneak a look at Fenrico.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_178": "Changli raises her cup, face perfectly composed, every bit as elegant as always.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_179": "But a second later, the cup tilts a hair too far, and the tea headed for her lips slips soundlessly into the bowl in front of her. She pauses for a beat, then sets the cup back down.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_18": "Then don't mind if I do!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_180": "The Orchestral Music Club members exchange alarmed looks, huddle up, and attempt something like a secret discussion.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_181": "(Um... Leader, does the music classroom ever have a back door?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_182": "(It doesn't. Three years in this club, and I promise you that it has only one door, at the front. Absolutely. Positively.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_183": "(Don't tell me those two left through the window.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_184": "(Hah?! You mean that post that sat at the top of the school forum all last week—\"someone seen escaping the music classroom with a window\"—was actually real?!)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_185": "Buling and Chisa do lower their voices, but everyone still catches the words \"escaping the music classroom with a window\" clear as day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_186": "At a look from Fenrico, one of the security guards pulls on his suit jacket, puts on his sunglasses, and hurries out the door.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_187": "You still can't quite wrap your head around his professional commitment to wearing sunglasses at night, but it looks like the cleanup is already underway.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_188": "Perhaps we should... move on to the second round now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_189": "Yeah, yeah. So for fairness, round two—no dealing. Everyone grabs a card at random. How's that sound?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_19": "The words are barely out before a flurry of poised chopsticks plunges into the steaming copper pot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_190": "Also, let's keep the challenge the same for anyone who draws the marked lot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_191": "Catching on to what you're after, everyone nods in agreement—a shared collection of embarrassing stories would foster a subtle sense of camaraderie.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_192": "That should smooth over the awkwardness from before.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_193": "I'm fine with that too. Everyone, come pick your card from me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_194": "O-okay!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_195": "Card draw! It's Phoebe's turn!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_196": "With all eyes on her, Phoebe draws the first card from the deck.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_197": "Hmm... Huh?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_198": "In the crushing silence, Phoebe sheepishly holds up \"First Mate\" Roccia once again—the one sailing across the hold in a crate.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_199": "Um... it seems it's me again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_2": "The dining hall's been cleared out just for you tonight. Only your group of students, wringing out the last of summer before term begins.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_20": "Changli draws out a chair for you, meeting your eyes with a faint smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_200": "Before Phoebe can even speak, another bodyguard already has his radio raised, on full alert.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_201": "(Phoebe, your luck... This wasn't part of the plan at all!)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_202": "(Boss, we aren't seriously gonna make headlines like this, are we?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_203": "(Our restaurant... will it even be allowed to open tomorrow?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_204": "(I'm afraid the answer won't please you, Chisa. If I'm not mistaken, they've already strung caution tape across the entrance.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_205": "(...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_206": "Let me think... If I have to share another embarrassing story, it'd probably be... that trip to the cafeteria for yakisoba bread.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_207": "Ever since school started, I kept hearing everyone say the cafeteria's yakisoba bread is an absolute must-try.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_208": "My family is quite strict about what I eat, though, so I decided to slip into line and buy one on my own.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_209": "For some reason, though, whenever I lined up, the students in front of me would quietly step aside, one by one...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_21": "Take a seat, {PlayerName}. After two exhausting months, it's about time we celebrated. Come to think of it... where's Principal Abby?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_210": "I tried bowing an apology too, the way everyone else did. It only made people leave faster.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_211": "Please. Stop. Talking. The guards at the next table are already calling for backup. Any second now, a van full of suited strangers is going to pull up outside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_212": "After all, put this together with what happened in the music classroom, and it really sounds like the whole school has it out for Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_213": "I don't know. Maybe I broke some cafeteria rule... Or maybe I just haven't figured out how this school works yet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_214": "Still, everyone was really kind. They even picked the trash up off the floor before they left.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_215": "(Aiya... how do I tell Phoebe that was absolutely not \"kindness\"...?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_216": "The guards in the restaurant are pulling on white gloves now. Probably to avoid leaving fingerprints and make cleanup easier...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_217": "And when I left, the lady at the counter pushed two rolls into my hands and wouldn't take a single coin. I still have no idea why.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_218": "Everyone at the table drops their eyes in unison... That's not being moved. That's the guilt of people who've done the exact same thing themselves.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_219": "At this point, even a security guard pulling a chainsaw out of his jacket pocket wouldn't surprise you much.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_22": "Did something come up at the last minute?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_220": "Without a doubt, somebody else is even more on edge—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_221": "Wedged in between the board members, Principal Abby keeps mouthing something at you. You squint and piece the words together...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_222": "\"Save me?\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_223": "\"Still hungry?\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_224": "You give Abby a firm, encouraging look in return. Hang in there, Principal Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_225": "Abby, after a battle like that, they'll write you into the school's history—a legendary principal to match the legendary student. We might even owe Fenrico a thank-you...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_226": "Shocking! Nerves like that with disaster bearing down? Principal Abby is bound to be written into school's history as a \"legendary principal,\" standing shoulder to shoulder with the legendary student!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_227": "Come to think of it, we might even owe Fenrico a thank-you... Whether this is a condemned man's last meal or a feast with a knife behind it, at this point it's anyone's guess.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_228": "That was impressive, Principal Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_229": "...Thank you for sharing that, Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_23": "Abby said it had a meeting with a few board members tonight to go over some details. Since we rarely get together like this, it didn't want to crash our party.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_230": "It's all right. Actually, that's the first time I've ever said any of it out loud...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_231": "At first I thought people were just avoiding me. But on second thought, maybe it was just the way I introduced myself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_232": "Before school started, my family kept telling me, \"People may feel intimidated by your family background, so make the first move and show them your sincerity.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_233": "So every time, I'd say it with absolute sincerity, \"Please, just carry on,\" or \"Never mind what I think.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_234": "...Was my sincerity still not coming through?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_235": "Phoebe looks deeply confused.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_236": "(I doubt trying to talk her through it right now will do much good, but... we've come this far. May as well give it a try—)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_237": "Perhaps everyone feels tense around you precisely because you're being so sincere. Most of the time, being relaxed is all it takes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_238": "It's totally fine to keep things casual around here. At this school, people see you as a fellow student and a friend, not a daughter of a School Board member.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_239": "Now that you mention it, that really might be it...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_24": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_240": "Whenever Phoebe gets all formal like that, I can't help but watch what I say and how I act, too, and make sure I look all dignified. It's seriously so hard!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_241": "You're a kind friend to everyone, Phoebe. You're just too nervous... I can tell.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_242": "R-really? So the issue was that I've been too formal this whole time?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_243": "Thank you, {PlayerName}. Still, sincerity matters... That's how my family brought me up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_244": "Perhaps going forward, Phoebe, you might leave out those courteous formalities, such as \"Please, just carry on.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_245": "(To be completely frank, given the circumstances, the awkwardness would still be off the charts even without those words.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_246": "(No, no, no—we've come miles past where this conversation started! And hey, the knife-sharpening from the next table stopped at least, right?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_247": "(Phew... Looks like the restaurant won't need to shut down for \"renovations\" tomorrow.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_248": "(Huh?? How'd my forum alt get banned?! Good thing I've got plenty more...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_249": "Phoebe doesn't seem to notice the whispers around her. She just drops her eyes to the card in her hand—\"First Mate\" Roccia—and laughs, soft and small.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_25": "The lively chatter around the table instantly freezes as if someone hit pause. The hotpot keeps bubbling away, but the conversation dies on the spot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_250": "You know, getting it all out in the open actually left me feeling so much lighter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_251": "I kept thinking, what if everyone finds me... strange? Difficult? All I want is to make friends, and somehow I always make things awkward.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_252": "But today... sitting here with all of you, eating, playing games... I can't remember the last time I was this happy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_253": "So... thank you. All of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_254": "Changli, Roccia, {PlayerName}, and every one of you here today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_255": "It seems my adoptive father and the School Board have still caused you some trouble... but I truly loved today's game.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_256": "(I knew it. It was never Phoebe who struggled to connect. It was the title that came with her.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_257": "The two bodyguards by the table hold their position, straight as ever, but at another signal from Fenrico, the fidgeting stops.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_258": "It seems the chairman isn't entirely unreasonable after all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_259": "You know you can relax around us, Phoebe. Everyone here today is on your side.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_26": "Someone mid-reach freezes with chopsticks hovering over the pot, hesitates for a few quiet seconds, and quietly pulls back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_260": "Remember how well you and the Council got along over the summer?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_261": "I'm really happy when I studied with you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_262": "Yes, yes! The Club Association's always happy to have you drop by!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_263": "I... okay! Thank you, everyone!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_264": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_265": "We'll leave our discussion there for today, Principal Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_266": "Fenrico stands and casts one last look back at you all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_267": "Are you not coming, Phoebe?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_268": "Phoebe...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_269": "After a quiet beat, Phoebe offers you all a calm nod, then stands and bows to Fenrico.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_27": "The Board, hm...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_270": "Please go on ahead without me, Father.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_271": "I want to spend a little more time with my friends.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_272": "The hour is late and the chill has set in, Mr. Fenrico. Forgive us if we do not see you out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_273": "Seeing you all stand your ground, Abby suddenly perks up. Crossing its arms over its chest, it speaks with newfound confidence.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_274": "Well, uh, Fenrico, I've still got business to brief the kids on, so I won't be seeing you out either! Take care now, Board members, safe travels.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_275": "Once the last of them steps outside, Abby inhales sharply and bolts straight to your table.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_276": "I'm starving to death here! Chisa, quick, what else hasn't come out yet? Bring it all, and I'm ready to devour the lot!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_277": "Don't just stand around! Sit, sit! Have some more!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_278": "Pfft. Right away, Principal Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_279": "You might also want this—the fully automatic hotpot defoaming device.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_28": "Just routine business to go over, nothing to sweat—or so Abby said.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_280": "Mmm, so good! This one's great, and so is that! Ah, nothing beats a proper meal...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_281": "Tense the entire evening, Abby can finally let its guard down and dig into the much-delayed hotpot feast.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_282": "<color=#d19f27>Summer break</color>... has ended, just like that.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_29": "If that's what the Principal says, let's give Abby the benefit of the doubt for tonight.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_3": "The tables along the wall have been shoved together into one long spread, packed edge to edge with everything fresh from the kitchen—paper-thin meat, vegetables, mushrooms, meatballs, piled to the brim.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_30": "Come tomorrow, we're back in the same classrooms, the same classes and training, everyone swept up in their own routines again. Tonight, let's just not think about any of it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_31": "{PlayerName}'s right. Both the Student Council's summer boot camp and the Club Association's training camp went off without a hitch, so I think it's fair to call tonight a victory banquet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_32": "As he speaks, Xiangli Yao produces a densely written sheet of paper and lays it on the table with great ceremony.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_33": "Of course. Should any of you still harbor doubts, we have prepared a final report on this summer's special operation plan, and I would be delighted to read it aloud on everyone's behalf.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_34": "Once a plan is finished, the report is where all those tangled thoughts and stray inspirations finally fall into place.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_35": "No! Please spare me the chanting. I surrender, I surrender! Look at that page, how is there that much writing on it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_36": "One more look and I'll be out cold...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_37": "To head off everyone's worries, you stand first and tip a whole plate of meat rolls into the pot. The rich smell rises again, and the last of the stiffness goes with it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_38": "You duck your head for more meat, and use the moment to turn toward Changli, voice low.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_39": "So when did the Council write a report?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_4": "The red broth rolls and burbles in the copper pot, thick white steam curling up until it blurs everything in front of you. The smell of chili and peppercorn washes over you, threaded with scallion and ginger.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_40": "Oh? The Student Council never wrote any \"report.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_41": "True, this summer threw plenty at us that no one planned for. And every mess outdid the one before it...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_42": "But my guess? That's just Xiangli Yao, trying to warm the room with a scratch paper he dug up from who-knows-where.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_43": "Unbothered, Changli smiles, then lifts a thin slip of greens from the boiling copper pot and chews it, face serene.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_44": "Uh... that's the red oil broth. Doesn't it burn your tongue, Changli?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_45": "Is that so? No need to fuss over trifles. I find it... not hot at all, and not the least bit painful.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_46": "A soft smile curves her eyes. She lifts her drink and taps it against yours.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_47": "Thank you, {PlayerName}. You helped everyone see the <color=#d19f27>summer boot camp</color> through so smoothly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_48": "All right. Here's to <color=#d19f27>a brand-new semester</color> ahead.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_49": "Here's hoping everything goes smoothly <color=#d19f27>this semester</color> too! Cheers!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_5": "The staff, usually too busy to stand still, have a rare idle day. No orders flying back and forth, no customer chatter—somehow it only makes the restaurant feel bigger.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_50": "Cartethyia leans forward and stretches her arm out across the table, tapping her glass against both of yours.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_51": "My, aren't we full of energy! To everyone here, and to the music! Cheers!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_52": "And don't forget to visit our little shop this semester. Cheers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_53": "I'll be counting on you all to keep the school forum up and running! Cheers!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_54": "To truth, and to all of you. Cheers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_55": "Cheers. Just let me know if you want anything else. We prepped plenty of food today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_56": "Without anyone noticing, a tall stack of empty plates has built up at the edge of the table, the once-laden spread now half-devoured.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_57": "Chisa's and Buling's chopsticks dart toward the copper pot at the exact same instant, clacking against the rim. Neither lets go of the slice of meat caught between them, eyes locked across the rising steam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_58": "The slice shudders between their tugs, sending broth splashing over the rim. Phoebe quickly leans back, clutching her dipping dish just in time to dodge the spray.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_59": "Carty.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_6": "Outside, the night is deep, and the restaurant's warm yellow lights reflect in the window glass. The heat wraps around you the second you step in, and a fine sweat already beads at your temples.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_60": "Got it, Leader.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_61": "Cartethyia and Ciaccona trade a quick glance. Moving as one, their chopsticks swoop over the bubbling broth, neatly dividing the ill-fated meat roll right between them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_62": "Changli watches the lively chaos around the table, a faint trace of a smile curling at the corner of her lips.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_63": "Turning toward the fogged glass, she watches the streetlights blur into soft halos of pale yellow, like little moons dropped from the sky.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_64": "...Right here, right now. There's no better time than this.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_65": "Steam rises and rolls from the copper pot, blending with the clink of bowls and waves of easy laughter. No one tries to keep a topic alive, yet the warmth never fades.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_66": "The evening breeze moves through the treetops outside, and somewhere in them the cicadas are still going.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_67": "The students crowd around the steaming hotpot, laughing over everything behind them and trading eager guesses about the semester ahead.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_68": "But this moment asks only one thing: raise your cups to the summer that belongs to you—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_69": "And laugh once more.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_7": "You're finally here, Boss.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_70": "Cheers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_71": "—Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_72": "The moment her name is called, the girl flinches slightly. Her spine straightens, and the cup at her lips freezes in place.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_73": "For a moment, she can't believe it. When she gets to her feet, a flicker of shock is still on her face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_74": "All eyes turn to the doorway. The expressions around the table freeze one by one, until the only sound left is the hotpot bubbling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_75": "There, in the restaurant doorway, stands Abby—the one who'd claimed it was busy tonight and couldn't make the party—and behind it, a few School Board members in suits.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_76": "And the one who just called out Phoebe's name is...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_77": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_78": "Mr. Fenrico.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_79": "One of the School Board members. Chairman of Celestial Steed Corp. Fenrico.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_8": "{PlayerName}, over here! We've been waiting for you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_80": "Fenrico doesn't answer. He stands where he is, cold eyes sweeping over everyone at the table, then resting on the steaming copper pot. His brow tightens, almost imperceptibly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_81": "Phoebe. It's time you went home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_82": "Cabbage leaves and a single fish ball ride up on the boiling broth, then sink again, gurgling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_83": "Ahaha, good evening, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_84": "Um, well... Ahem. Things wrapped up a bit earlier than expected. Some of our board members haven't had dinner yet, and while passing by, they happened to catch Phoebe dining with you all...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_85": "It's getting pretty late, and class starts tomorrow. If you're done eating... let's call it a night! Head home, get some rest, and save your strength for the new semester!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_86": "Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_87": "Roccia gets to her feet, grips her chopsticks, and with fierce determination spears the lone fish ball in the pot, dropping it right into Phoebe's bowl.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_88": "Have some more.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_89": "H-huh? Oh... thank you, Roccia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_9": "Sorry, something came up with Abby on my way out, so I'm running a little late.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_90": "Phoebe suddenly snaps out of her daze.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_91": "Without another word to her adoptive father, she lowers her gaze and slowly sinks back into her seat. Phoebe picks up her chopsticks and toys quietly with the food in her bowl, as if nothing had happened.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_92": "Please, come in. We certainly can't leave our guests waiting outside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_93": "We're running low on ingredients, however, so I'm afraid you'll have to make do with today's specials.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_94": "Completely unfazed by the tension, Chisa, legendary master of the family restaurant, moves with practiced speed and pulls out a chair at another empty table.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_95": "Conveniently enough, the table she selects sits dead center in the restaurant, right next to yours, with barely enough aisle space between them for one person to squeeze past.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_96": "In other words, if either side speaks up even a fraction, the other table will catch every single word.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_97": "Maybe the adults simply abide by the rule that \"politeness means never refusing an offer.\" Or maybe the board members just feel obligated to put on an \"approachable\" facade around the students.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_98": "Suited up and stiff, the board members finally settle around the table, looking deeply out of their element.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_595_99": "Ahem. Principal Abby, as for the arrangements for the upcoming semester, we already finalized them at our meeting.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_1": "Attention, passengers. We are now approaching the final station of this line. Please take your belongings and prepare to exit from the platform on the right. Thank you, meow...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_10": "Thank you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_11": "The figure before you shakes her head without a word.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_12": "Before you can get a good look at her face, she's already up and leaving.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_13": "...Hope you'll enjoy life here, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_14": "What?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_15": "Her words are as faint as the flutter of a butterfly's wings, the tail end of her sentence dissolving into the air before you can catch it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_16": "(Never mind... I'd better get off.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_17": "(Looks like she lives in this town too. I can thank her properly next time.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_18": "The hum of a radio broadcast, the rain-drenched scent of grass and trees on the wind, and a clear sky unbroken by a single skyscraper...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_19": "After eight long hours of travel, you're back in the <color=#d19f27>small town where you lived as a child</color>. For the <color=#d19f27>next year</color>, this will be your home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_2": "...Attention, passengers. We have officially arrived at the final station! THAT'S RIGHT, THE FINAL STATION! Please exit through the designated door, meow!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_20": "This will be your home for the next year, right up until the Qualifying Exam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_21": "(After getting off, head straight along the sidewalk to reach the reception area. Someone will be waiting by the second pillar to the right of the reception desk.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_22": "Right, this should be the place from the message. But... nobody's here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_23": "Excuse me? Your Uncle Abby's been waiting for thirty minutes already.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_24": "Hey, over here! Quit gawking. I'm right here—look down!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_25": "Y-you... you can talk? Sorry, I thought you were a plushie someone left here. You're, uh... Abby?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_26": "P-Plushie?! Kids these days. Zero respect for their elders!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_27": "...Hah. Whatever. Guess it makes sense you don't remember me. Been years. Come on, we'll catch up in the car.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_28": "Abby... uh, Uncle Abby? Have we met before?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_29": "Are you kidding me? I held you when you were a baby! Here, hand me your luggage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_3": "Worn out from the long journey, you have dozed off against the window without realizing it, sleeping so soundly that you don't even hear the arrival announcement.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_30": "(Feels like I just gained memories that don't exist... Were Abby and I really that close?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_31": "(Abby, Abby... Ab...xasra? Abraxas? Abracadabra?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_32": "You can't say why, but... somehow, that's just how Abby's name is supposed to feel.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_33": "As for why you can't remember anything from before, it's likely because you slept through the entire train ride when you first arrived here. Hard to make sense of anything while you're still dreaming.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_34": "Paying no mind to your bewildered look, Abby turns around, grabs hold of a suitcase three times its size, and hauls it forward with all its might—advancing a legendary four inches.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_35": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_36": "Um, I'll just carry it myself. Uncle... Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_4": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_5": "...Wake up, {PlayerName}. Time to get off the train.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_6": "Someone seems to be gently shaking your shoulder, waking you from your sleep.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_7": "(I... I fell asleep on the train?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_8": "Awake? The train has reached its final station.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_5_9": "Perhaps because you've only just woken up, your eyes won't quite focus. All you can make out is a hazy, aqua-blue figure.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_1": "Thump—thump, thump—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_10": "Even through the closed door, the moment you hear the words \"Delivery Bot,\" your eyes snap open, and you leap out of bed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_11": "No, not that! I'm awake—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_12": "Aha. Look at you, so full of energy! Glad you're up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_13": "Opening the door, you notice a large stack of cardboard boxes piled up behind Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_14": "Abby, what is all this...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_15": "Handy moving tools! I woke you up early so you wouldn't be scrambling to pack at the last minute.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_16": "I got you a sleeper train ticket for tomorrow at noon. Just bring your carry-on. I'll ship the rest with Eekky Logistics.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_17": "Tomorrow?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_18": "...You knew it would come any day now, but the time to say goodbye arrived a little sooner than you expected.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_19": "Well... there's not much keeping you here anymore. But of course, your Uncle Abby's always got a room for ya!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_2": "Thump—thump, thump—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_20": "You know, graduation is just a new beginning. You've got a mountain of things to handle back home, and your family hasn't seen you in forever.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_21": "As if sensing your hesitation, Abby shoves a thick piece of cardboard into your hands.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_22": "All right, stop dawdling and start packing!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_23": "I organized a hotpot dinner with everyone from the school tonight. We can't be late!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_24": "Fine, I'll get to it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_25": "With Abby urging you to pick up the pace, you go off to pack up your room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_3": "Wakey-wakey! {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_4": "You hear Abby's voice from the other side of the door.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_5": "This is probably the first time Abby has ever knocked on your door in the morning to wake you up. Usually it just leaves a note and heads out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_6": "Five more minutes...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_7": "I'm awake.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_8": "Still lazy, huh? Guess I have no choice but to use Chisa's gift—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6000_9": "Ta-da! The Delivery Bot PRO MAX: Ultimate Rock Classics Remix Edition!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_1": "It's the first day of <color=#d19f27>the new semester</color>, and the classroom still has a loose, drowsy air to it, as if it hasn't quite woken up from the break.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_10": "Miss Verina smiles in the same calm, kindly way as always. Yet for some reason, you have a bad feeling about this.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_11": "Now then, here's today's exam. As you can see, the seal is intact, and the packet is unopened.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_12": "Verina taps the folder lightly against the desk, then lifts it with both hands and shows it to the class, front and back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_13": "To get a better idea of how everyone is doing after the summer break, the school has arranged a <color=#d19f27>start-of-semester assessment</color> on short notice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_14": "The moment the words leave her mouth, the classroom, barely settled, erupts into an uproar.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_15": "A <color=#d19f27>start-of-semester assessment</color>...? Wait, what? An exam?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_16": "You've got to be kidding me. An exam on the first day? I don't even know what we're covering in our first class this semester!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_17": "Wait, did anyone hear about this? Nobody told me!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_18": "You think I'd be sitting here with my jaw open if I'd known?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_19": "I haven't even cracked open a book yet. Who could've guessed the first thing we'd have this semester is an exam?! The school never had a tradition like this, did it?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_2": "Autumn has arrived, yet the cicadas only sing louder. Their cries drift in through the half-open window, mingling with bursts of excited laughter, and somehow sound even clearer than at the height of summer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_20": "Everyone looks around, then turns to their desk partner, only to get nearly the same blank expression in return.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_21": "The chatter grows louder, and the frantic rustle of turning pages rises and falls in waves, as if that alone could dredge up last semester's knowledge from beneath the ease and joy of the break.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_22": "We're doomed. I don't even know what's on the exam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_23": "How is this any different from a hidden boss spawning right next to the respawn bonfire...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_24": "—Quiet, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_25": "Galbrena appears at the door out of nowhere, strides into the classroom, and smacks the lectern a few times.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_26": "The exam mostly covers material you've already studied. Don't overthink. All you have to do is give it your best shot based on how well you've studied.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_27": "Hmm? From your reaction, is this a surprise to everyone?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_28": "Surprise doesn't even begin to cover it. No one is prepared at all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_29": "Miss Verina, can we not take this exam?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_3": "Reunited after the long break, students group in twos and threes, scribbling furiously to finish the summer homework they never got around to while stealing spare moments to trade vacation stories.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_30": "A chorus of agreement rises across the classroom. Verina glances at Galbrena and shakes her head a bit helplessly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_31": "Okay, okay. I'll admit this came at rather short notice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_32": "But don't worry, everyone. As your teacher, I braced myself for anything. No matter how well you do on this exam, I promise I won't invite anyone over to my office for tea.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_33": "...Still, isn't this way too much of an ambush?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_34": "Oh? Great analogy. The exam is a battlefield, and the enemy won't poke its head out to give you a friendly hello before they make their attack.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_35": "Forget last-minute cramming. If you're only realizing now that your gun isn't loaded, it's already too late.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_36": "It's only an assessment exam, so how well you do isn't what matters. What matters is showing us where you stand right now, so we can plan the appropriate lessons going forward.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_37": "Sigh... On the very first day of the new semester...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_38": "Alright, everyone, enough complaining. Come on, let's pass those papers down.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_39": "Hehe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_4": "Even after the bell, the classroom only falls quiet for a heartbeat before hushed voices creep back out of every corner, leaving the room livelier than before.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_40": "You glance at Changli, who's beside you. She's resting her chin on her hand, gazing absently out the window, not a trace of surprise on her face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_41": "Changli, don't tell me this assessment exam was your idea—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_42": "Oh? But of course. The Student Council ran those study sessions for two months. It's only natural we'd want to see the results.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_43": "That said, I'll ask you to keep this between us. I'd rather the Student Council not become a thorn in everyone's side.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_44": "By now, the exam papers have reached your row. Changli turns to you and blinks, her eyes glinting with amusement.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_45": "Let's just call this... the second secret between us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_46": "Good luck on the exam, {PlayerName}. May your first battle be a victory.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_5": "All right, class is in session. Everyone, please settle down.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_6": "Verina walks in just as the bell fades, sets a thick folder down on the lectern, and sweeps her gaze across the room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_7": "It's the first day of the new semester, and everyone looks chipper.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_8": "No rush in sharing your summers with me. We'll have plenty of time to chat after class.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_600_9": "But before we officially begin our first lesson of the semester, there's something more important you need to do.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_60_1": "Miss Verina?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_60_2": "...At least tell me which class I'm in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6100_1": "(Didn't realize I'd accumulated so much stuff over the past year. Packing it all up piece by piece was quite a hassle...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6100_2": "All packed? It's time to go!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6100_3": "Okay, coming.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6100_4": "After taping the last cardboard box shut, you step out of the room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_1": "Compared to the chaos and unfamiliarity you felt a few months ago, <color=#d19f27>this first day of school</color> is rather calm and peaceful... It's honestly a little surprising.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_10": "Wait, what are you two—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_11": "Quick! No time to explain.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_12": "We'll explain everything at the activity room, {PlayerName}. Everyone's already waiting for us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_13": "Without another word, the two of them grab you, one on each side. You don't even have time to settle your bag back on your shoulders before they push and pull you out of the Teaching Building.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_2": "No one is late, no one claims to have forgotten their summer homework, and even Miss Galbrena doesn't spend class sharing her quirky little wilderness survival tips.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_3": "The cafeteria has even crossed those mystery-flavored Squeezy Jellies off today's recommendation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_4": "You rub your aching shoulders and step out of the classroom, worn out from head to toe. Just as you're thinking you can head home and get some proper rest—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_5": "{PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_6": "There you are!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_7": "Two familiar voices ring out behind you. You turn and immediately spot Ciaccona and Cartethyia racing toward you, one close behind the other.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_8": "What's up?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_610_9": "Before you can react, Ciaccona dashes up and grabs you by the arm, while Cartethyia catches hold of your shoulder from the other side.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_1": "In the activity room, the entire Orchestral Music Club is already assembled, waiting just for the three of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_10": "The moment you echo Ciaccona's words in disbelief, an almost eerie silence falls over the activity room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_11": "Wait, didn't we just make the qualifiers before summer break?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_12": "The forum moderator, the last to arrive, braces one hand on the doorframe and the other on her knee, gasping for air. She's clearly rushed over like everyone else.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_13": "I mean... is there any chance they put the date wrong on the announcement?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_14": "No. I checked their website. It's tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_15": "Cartethyia's certainty is the final straw. A flurry of panicked voices erupts from the crowd, and desks and chairs are knocked in every direction.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_16": "We're doomed. Doomed! I still haven't gotten down the harmony part yet!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_17": "Wait, if the elimination is tomorrow... we have to run through the whole program together tonight, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_18": "Run through it once? Take a look at our string section! Some of the newbies haven't even gotten their fingerings down!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_19": "The brass is no better! We were still debating whether we should drop a half step yesterday.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_2": "Still catching her breath, Ciaccona cuts straight to the point.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_20": "What should we do without our principal flute, Leader? She's calling in sick tomorrow...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_21": "Same goes for the snare drum. We're gonna be one man short as well! Should we scramble for a substitute while we can?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_22": "Faced with a scene that can only be described as \"utter chaos,\" and with Buling standing dumbstruck in the middle of it all, you can only sigh quietly to yourself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_23": "After all, taking them as they come is the only thing you can do now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_24": "Since the competition's inevitable, I'd say we should all get our heads straight and get a good night's rest today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_25": "No amount of panicking will buy us an extra day. The effort you all put in over the summer won't lie. Leave the rest to the Orchestral Music Club of tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_26": "Ciaccona grins and lets out a wry laugh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_27": "Ha-haha, fair enough. I do have to say, for the opening chapter of a new semester, this plot is moving a little too fast.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_28": "If you're still uneasy, take everyone and run through the trickiest passages one last time. Once the instruments are all packed away, head home early with everyone and rest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_29": "Yeah. Tomorrow... We'll do just fine. I know it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_3": "Important news, everyone. Going by past years' calendars, eliminations for Nationals normally don't kick off so soon. But...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_4": "...But this year, with there being more teams than there are actual slots, the judging committee decided to add <color=#d19f27>a <b>special elimination round</b></color>. Teams with close rankings will each have to perform another selected piece against each other.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_5": "The organizing committee made a surprise announcement today. Also, we're on the list too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_6": "Oh... so that means we have to change our training plans?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_7": "Huh? You called everyone over just for that?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_8": "—The <b>special elimination round</b> is <color=#d19f27>tomorrow morning</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_615_9": "...Tomorrow morning?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_1": "Pushing open the door to the family restaurant's private room, you find Changli and Cartethyia sitting upright with one seat between them. On that middle chair rests a small trumpet case.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_10": "You hear screeching tires, followed by a bang of something heavy colliding and the sound of shattering glass.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_11": "I just finished fixing this bot—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_12": "Just then, you hear Chisa's voice coming from the kitchen.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_13": "Uh... just to be sure, Xiangli Yao did get his driver's license, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_14": "...He does. Probably.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_15": "What do you mean \"probably?\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_16": "The room's door swings open again. Phoebe leans halfway in, one hand clutching her sleeve tightly, her face pale.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_17": "Uh... Sorry, everyone. We're late.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_18": "Something happened while we were parking. But it's settled now. No worries.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_19": "Xiangli Yao walks in carrying a cardboard box. He circles the table, placing cans of soda from Roccia's store one by one.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_2": "Good evening. Principal Abby. {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_20": "That's not just \"something!\" Xiangli Yao, how could you yield the steering wheel so easily?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_21": "It was fine, really! If you ask me, I'd say it felt more like a saxophone playing wildly out of tune mid-performance!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_22": "That's NOT a music problem, Leader!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_23": "As everyone chats, laughs, and settles into their seats, Chisa trudges in behind Roccia, pushing a serving cart and looking thoroughly downhearted.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_24": "Miss Galbrena's... extraordinary parallel parking technique seems to have triggered the delivery bot's security protocol...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_25": "My bad. I'll cover the damages.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_26": "As if paying tribute to the delivery bot, Galbrena raises a bottle of soda in a small salute. Then her right hand slices straight across, cleaving off the bottle's sealed metal cap...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_27": "Miss Galbrena, a friendly reminder—those sodas in the trunk just experienced a pretty wild ride...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_28": "...Huh?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_29": "With a crisp hiss, Galbrena flicks her wrist, deftly dodging the gush of soda spraying from the bottle.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_3": "As you come in, Changli quietly slides two sets of tableware your way. Cartethyia picks up the trumpet case and pats the chair, inviting you to sit.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_30": "Whoa!!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_31": "But Abby, sitting right beside her, isn't so lucky.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_32": "Ginger soda? Really?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_33": "Yes! New meme acquired!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_34": "Buling instantly whips out her camera and captures the scene... A quick burst of shutter clicks follows. It won't be long before a new king is crowned atop the school forum's trending topics.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_35": "No pictures! Delete that right now! I can't let you ruin my majestic principal image—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_36": "Abby shakes its head, flinging soda in every direction, then, with self-image the last thing on its mind, Abby leaps up to snatch Buling's camera.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_37": "Catch, Leader!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_38": "As Abby lunges at her, Buling panics and tosses the camera away. Ciaccona raises her arm high and catches it midair.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_39": "Heh-heh! Taking photos is free, but deleting them costs fifty each!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_4": "Over here! I saved the middle seats for you two.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_40": "Hand over that camera!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_41": "Well, well... Your turn, Phoebe!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_42": "H-huh? Me? Do I have to throw it too?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_43": "Yes, you do!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_44": "Ugh, now you've unlocked Abbowser Mode! Give me that camera, Phoebe!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_45": "Pass it to me, Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_46": "The camera passes from one hand to the other while Abby plays along, putting on a big show, half annoyed and half laughing. Everyone chases each other around, and the room soon descends into chaos.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_47": "(Come to think of it, this happens every time we have hotpot...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_48": "Lively as always.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_49": "Amid the clamor, Changli, being another spectator on the sidelines, easily falls into trading commentary with you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_5": "You guys are so early! I thought we were the first getting here...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_50": "Mm... Being with everyone always makes me happy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_51": "You're leaving tomorrow, right? Aren't you going to join in on the fun?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_52": "This is good enough for me. I just want to watch them a little longer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_53": "The words slip out before you can think.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_54": "Oh? Care to tell me why?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_55": "Why? Deep down, you feel like you've been through scenes like this more than once.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_56": "Every time you're about to leave for somewhere far away, there's always a lively day like this before you say goodbye to your companions.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_57": "At times beneath a full moon and a sky of fireworks. At times amid a festival of music and revelry.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_58": "And at times, at a graduation ceremony at some other school, one faintly familiar yet not quite like this one...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_59": "You've seen scenes like this many times before in your dreams. Oftentimes, you can't even tell which side is reality and which is the dream.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_6": "Being here early makes it feel formal! Besides, who knows when we'll all be together like this again?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_60": "Yet whether you're dreaming or awake, you're always on a journey... hurrying away like a tumbleweed, drifting alone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_61": "There's no particular reason... really.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_62": "Have you simply grown used to it? You can't help but wonder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_63": "But maybe this noisy, \"not special\" feeling... is what real life is actually about.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_64": "At some point, Cartethyia is standing behind you. You look up and find that your companions have stopped their commotion as well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_65": "Buling reluctantly hands the camera over to Abby. It takes a look at the screen and grins, then shoves it right back into her hands.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_66": "Eh? Did I say something weird?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_67": "...Not at all. You're right.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_68": "The broth in the copper pot is now at a rolling boil. Amid the bubbling, you recall the first time you and Abby ate here together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_69": "\"Once you make some <u>new friends</u> here, we'll throw a massive hotpot party!\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_7": "Where are the others?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_70": "There's no need for a send-off tomorrow. I'll be fine on my own.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_71": "Rather deflating words land on the table, but they don't sink the mood the way you'd feared. The hotpot keeps boiling. Abby scratches its head and slides a bowl of freshly cooked meat slices over to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_72": "Thank you all for everything these past few days. You should all take tomorrow off and get some proper rest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_73": "Ordinary and happy days only feel precious once you look back on them... I'm sure every hotpot from now on will remind me of this year.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_74": "So, thank you all for looking after me this past year. I really look forward to seeing each of you again someday.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_75": "Fine, no send-offs then! Come on, the meat is all cooked! The Principal personally scooped this out for you, so you'd better eat every last bite!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_76": "Come to think of it, every time we eat hotpot, {PlayerName} always gives a speech that sounds like a class president's meeting summary...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_77": "I suppose... that's just part of {Male=his;Female=her} unique charm.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_78": "The room becomes lively again in an instant, chopsticks diving into the pot from every side, as if that earlier \"there's no need for a send-off\" was just a slice of meat dropped into the broth—picked up, enjoyed, and swallowed up by the noise.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_79": "By the time the hotpot is down to a shallow layer of broth, someone suggests, \"How about a group photo?\" And everyone immediately shoves and jostles their way in front of the lens.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_8": "Xiangli Yao's picking them up by car. They'll be here soon—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_80": "Buling props the camera on the table, sets the timer, and dashes back into the crowd.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_81": "Just before the flash, Cartethyia counts down under her breath beside you, while Changli gives your shoulder a light tap to get you to look at the camera.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_82": "Then comes a yelp of protest as Abby is shoved to the very front—and right after, comes the crisp and final sound of the shutter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_83": "Everyone is smiling. The room's light is dim and warm, and the last wisps of steam rise from what remains of the hotpot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_84": "You know the dream will end someday—but the things held in memory will keep on shining.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6200_9": "Screee—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_1": "After saying goodbye to everyone, you tell Abby you'd like to go for a walk on your own.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_10": "You will remember it once you have returned.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_11": "Perhaps... the two of you have only met a handful of times here, but you know she has been by your side all along. And beyond that, there is one thing you know for certain—right this moment, she is avoiding your gaze.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_12": "She would never lie to you. She would only keep from you the part of the truth she'd rather you didn't know.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_13": "You watch the wind stir the strands of her hair, the cold moonlight tracing her outline until a blurred halo of light encircles her whole figure. An uneasy suspicion creeps up like a vine and begins to spread through your heart.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_14": "Why is it that no one but her ever makes you recall the \"real world\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_15": "If she knows the secrets of the world beyond this one, then where does she really come from? Who is this person who's been here all along, never revealing a word?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_16": "But... I want to know about you. The one standing right here, right now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_17": "The \"me\"... standing right here?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_18": "...I see.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_19": "Shorekeeper falls silent for a moment, until another gust of night wind sweeps in from the far end of the tracks and scatters the aqua-blue tips of her hair. Clouds drift in with the wind, swallowing much of the moonlight and hiding her figure entirely in shadow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_2": "Abby can tell something is still weighing on you. It tells you not to stay out too late, then heads off ahead of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_20": "Actually, I have told this exact story many times before.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_21": "You mean...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_22": "This isn't the first time I've asked the question?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_23": "She simply smiles and shakes her head again. Hands clasped behind her back, she turns into the night wind and invites you to walk the platform with her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_24": "No. But as for which time this is, I don't truly know either.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_25": "But this time, please allow me to tell you something a little different.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_26": "...Frequencies. Recurring signals. Things that never cease. Unseen waves arranging themselves in the air. Echoes. Empty vessels. Words once spoken, still lingering, still heard.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_27": "Time, split into identical fragments, holding form even amidst the noise. That was how a tool, born of another's need, first perceived the \"world.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_28": "A tool without shape took on human form. But it had no human \"heart.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_29": "Not until a journey shared with {Male=him;Female=her}. That was when emotions that had no place in a tool began to take root. Quietly. Unknowingly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_3": "By the time you reach the train station, Shorekeeper seems to have been waiting there for quite a while.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_30": "War. Disaster. Grief. Goodbyes... Cities rose, then fell in thunder. Lives bloomed, then faded into cries. Suffering surged like the tide, rising and falling without end.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_31": "Again and again, {Male=he;Female=she} walked into catastrophe. And again and again, {Male=he;Female=she} rose from the wreckage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_32": "{Male=His;Female=Her} journey was never easy, yet even so, {Male=he;Female=she} would still pause for a stranger's wish and offer a hand to anyone in need.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_33": "But if another possibility truly existed in that story, {Male=he;Female=she} wouldn't have to charge into danger, nor face those painful goodbyes. {Male=He;Female=She} would simply be someone who stops to admire the scenery, chat idly with companions, and smile over a simple dinner.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_34": "I want to see {Male=him;Female=her} truly happy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_35": "I... hope I can meet you. The you with that happiness. Under the same sky, retracing the places you once traveled.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_36": "Because I was always the one waiting for you to return... Let me be the one who keeps watch this time, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_37": "The wind sweeps in without warning, spilling across the little platform. The aqua-haired girl brushes the stray strands from her face, tucks a few behind her ear, and smiles.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_38": "It is the faintest of smiles, like moonlight on a spring night that keeps its secret.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_39": "...Thank you, Shorekeeper.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_4": "Sorry... Took a while saying goodbye to everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_40": "I won't glorify suffering. If I could, I'd wish for those no longer with us to still be alive, and for none of those tragedies to have ever happened.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_41": "But we became who we are because we lived through all of it. And what drives me forward isn't the blade in my hand. It's you, all of you, for going down this path beside me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_42": "Since I've walked those paths and felt the pain firsthand, I have all the more reason to make a change. To turn the \"other possibility\" you spoke of into a future within our reach.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_43": "I knew it... This is who you are, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_44": "Looks like you two had a good talk, hm?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_45": "Ahem! Attention, passengers, good evening! The train bound for Solaris is now checking tickets. Passengers traveling to Solaris, please gather your belongings and board in an orderly fashion, meow!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_46": "You have no idea why a train is still running this late at night... but it looks like it's time for goodbye.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_47": "Oh? Not taking her with you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_48": "Shorekeeper, you...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_49": "Well, she can't technically go back with you. She's just a <color=#d19f27>\"copy\"</color> here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_5": "It's alright. Besides, I still think it's best... for you not to be here tonight.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_50": "A \"copy\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_51": "Think of her as... a leaf that fell from the same tree.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_52": "After all, the <color=#d19f27>Second Coming of Solaris</color> is just a dream's reflection of the real world. Everyone you've met here is a <color=#d19f27>projection</color> created from their original's \"data.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_53": "Once the dreamer wakes up, the dream collapses. The projections fade. And this Shorekeeper... she'll disappear too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_54": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_55": "Worry not for me, {PlayerName}. This is <b>my</b> choice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_56": "Ah, I've seen far too many people inside dreams. Some set off full of hope. Others go quiet and stop halfway. But it always ends with hope washing away like tears in the rain.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_57": "And that's exactly why people never remember the tears. What they remember is the courage and resolve that dry their eyes and drive them to walk into the next storm.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_58": "If this is your choice, then...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_59": "No matter what choice {Male=he;Female=she} makes, and no matter how many times, I will always be the one watching over that roving star.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_6": "Her voice is as soft as ever, like the evening's breeze. As it brushes past your ear, you can't help but relax. The platform's signal lights flicker on and off, casting across the curve of her brow a shadow that will not lift.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_60": "This... is what it means to be the \"Shorekeeper.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_61": "Ever familiar, ever reassuring, the girl smiles at you gently, just as she always does.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_62": "Under her gaze, you board the train bound for the world called \"Solaris.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_63": "Do what your heart tells you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_7": "The aqua-blue butterfly you've glimpsed so many times, always by chance, circles past you and settles lightly on her shoulder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_8": "...Before I go, tell me your story, Shorekeeper.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6300_9": "She shakes her head gently, lowering her gaze a little.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_1": "It is early morning, the sky still dark, and a thin mist hangs over the platform.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_10": "Safe journey!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_11": "Safe journey!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_12": "Safe journey!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_13": "Safe journey!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_14": "Safe journey!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_15": "Safe journey!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_16": "Safe journey!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_17": "Safe journey!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_18": "Safe journey!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_19": "Safe journey!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_2": "The departure broadcast plays over the speakers over and over. You pick up your luggage and look back one last time at the little town that has been your home for a year. You'd rather slip away quietly on your own than watch everyone struggle to say goodbye.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_20": "Next time, we'll have hotpot again!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_21": "You follow the voices and look out. Lined up on the road along the railway are the very friends who agreed not to see you off the day before, waving their hands goodbye high in the air.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_22": "You can't help but laugh, even as your eyes grow warm and your nose gradually sore. All you can do is wave back in answer to everyone's well wishes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_23": "As the train rolls on, the figures outside the window shrink and recede, until finally they vanish into the thin morning mist.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_24": "But you know this isn't the end of the story. Because one day, there will be a chance for you to meet again...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_25": "A white cat, its whole body shimmering with a strange light, paw tips and tail faintly tinged with black, lands lightly beside you and lifts a forepaw to scratch at its ear.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_26": "You shoot to your feet and look around the car.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_27": "The train races on, but you seem to be the only passenger.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_28": "The white cat tilts its head and flashes you a rather impish grin.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_29": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_3": "Maybe... someday, when you have the time, you'll come back and visit everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_30": "But what you don't know is that this isn't the end of the story. Perhaps reunion may come sooner than you think.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_4": "Wooo— The train gives a low whistle and eases away from the platform. Familiar scenery slips backward bit by bit. Leaning against the window, you slowly go back over every moment of the past year.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_5": "(And just like that, the year is over.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_6": "(Everything that happened when I first came to town, all the time I spent with everyone... Looking back, it still feels like a dream.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_7": "A strange drowsiness washes over you again, urging you to close your eyes. As if sinking into a deep sleep would spare you from ever having to think about the journey ahead...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_8": "Suddenly, familiar voices call out from outside the window.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6400_9": "Safe journey!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_1": "This is a story about a knight.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_10": "Mm. Not a bad ending.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_11": "The train races smoothly onward, and the view outside streaks past so fast it blurs into a single smear of color.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_12": "You close the old picture book in your hands, its pages curled at the edges from being flipped so many times. It's finally time to fulfill the promise the two of you made years ago.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_13": "...Hello? Why'd you go quiet all of a sudden? Don't tell me the signal's bad because of the crowd?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_14": "The voice on the other end of the line pitches up a little, tinged with confusion.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_15": "It's nothing. I just got a little lost in thought, remembering something from before. I'm almost at the station. How about you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_16": "I'm already at the station. So excited for the first stop on our world tour!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_17": "Long time no see. Can {PlayerName} still recognize me?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_18": "Long time no see, huh...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_19": "...We literally just saw each other a few hours ago.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_2": "Long ago, a great dragon that goes by the name of \"Gehinnom\" appeared out of nowhere, bringing down a terrifying calamity, before vanishing without a trace.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_20": "After all, you messed up with the ticket booking by accident and ended up on different trains. That's all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_21": "Speaking of which, what were you thinking about just now? When you said \"something from before\"... did you mean back at the school?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_22": "Remember when we were locked in that warehouse? You were shouting something as you charged straight out the door...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_23": "Ah, you mean that line...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_24": "Furious tides—split the heavens!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_25": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_26": "Same person, same words—yet the difference in sheer force is... truly breathtaking.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_3": "Under Cadanto's tutelage, a knight named \"Cartethyia\" took up the three finest swords, rode the swiftest horse, crossed the deepest sea, set foot on the most distant island, and defeated the terrible dragon.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_4": "And so, people fondly came to refer to her as the \"Dragon Knight\"...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_5": "Hmm... isn't that a bit too random?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_6": "Fine, fine... Riding her dragon, the knight Cartethyia proudly set out on a new journey. This time, she befriended a brave warrior named {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_7": "Cartethyia and {PlayerName}, with everyone's hopes on their shoulders, set out from the high tower, stormed a palace, and together defeated the wicked great whale...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_8": "At the end of the story, Cartethyia the Knight and the Warrior {PlayerName} set off on a journey to explore the world.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6500_9": "The world is vast and wide. The winds shall never cease. And so, the chapter of the knight and the warrior is about to begin...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_1": "Soft sand shifts under your feet. A few more steps and the rising tide will lap at your toes. Facing the blue coastline, you stretch your arms out wide and give your whole body a good, long stretch.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_10": "The trees along the shore sway gently, and a few yellowed leaves break free of their branches, spinning down to the ground.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_11": "The damp sea breeze brushes past the hem of your clothes and stirs the ends of her hair. You pause for a moment, then your steps quicken on their own as you hurry toward her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_12": "It's you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_13": "We meet again, {PlayerName}. Does this place... feel somewhat familiar to you as well?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_14": "She comes to stand beside you, brushing back the strands the sea breeze has tousled, and smiles gently.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_15": "Just like the last time you met, something about her feels deeply, intimately familiar.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_16": "Are you happy, living here in town?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_17": "You never expected to run into her by the sea. You nod, though there are so many questions you still want answered.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_18": "Your name is...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_19": "I don't think I've seen you around town.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_2": "To prepare for Celestial Steed Corp's final evaluation, everyone at school has packed the rest of their year with plans.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_20": "Why does this place feel familiar to me?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_21": "Me? ...\"Shorekeeper.\" That name suits me well. It stands for a meaning and a resolve that exist because of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_22": "A keeper of secrets, and one who watches over those who leave the shore to wander far from home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_23": "Just like... this shore. The biting wind, the soft sand, the surging tide. Alike, and yet different.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_24": "Shorekeeper...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_25": "Yes, that's me. There are duties only I can fulfill, so I seldom walk about town. Perhaps that's why you haven't seen me around.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_26": "There are duties only I can fulfill. That is why I seldom walk about town.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_27": "Still, I come to this shore now and then. The biting wind, the soft sand, the surging tide... Alike to the shore I watch over, and yet different.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_28": "The shore you \"watch over\"...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_29": "Mm... Please, call me \"Shorekeeper.\" It stands for a meaning and a resolve that exist because of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_3": "After many days of nonstop work, you decide to give yourself half a day off and take a walk by the sea to clear your head.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_30": "A keeper of secrets, and one who watches over those who leave the shore to wander far from home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_31": "Shorekeeper...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_32": "Because I have always been... watching over a certain shore. A shore much like this one, and yet different.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_33": "The biting wind, the soft sand, the surging tide... and those who leave the shore to wander far from home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_34": "So please, call me \"Shorekeeper.\" That name suits me well. It stands for a meaning and a resolve that exist because of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_35": "A keeper of secrets, and one who watches over those who leave the shore to wander far from home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_36": "Shorekeeper...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_37": "Mm. And because of that duty, I seldom walk about town. Perhaps that's why you haven't seen me around.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_38": "\"Shorekeeper\"... A warm, familiar name. Without knowing why, you're certain it's what she's meant to be called.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_39": "It's just that, for a moment, you couldn't recall it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_4": "A sea breeze rolls in, pushing wisps of cloud across the sky. White seabirds skim low over the water, wingtips grazing the crests, trailing long ripples behind them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_40": "Just like you can't recall your past, the occasional bout of \"forgetting\" is perfectly normal in this town.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_41": "It's rare to run into you. Let's take a walk together, Shorekeeper.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_42": "Neither of you says anything more. You simply stroll side by side along the beach.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_43": "Wave after wave rolls up the shore, washing over the damp sand before slipping quietly back from your feet. Under the sun, the crests glint pale gold, then break into fine white foam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_44": "You glance at Shorekeeper beside you. She walks quietly at your side, matching your pace, now and then looking down at the sand or up at the distant sea.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_45": "Yet the silence doesn't feel awkward at all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_46": "You know that on another shore, the two of you have walked like this many times before.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_47": "You know the direction of the sea wind. You know the rise and fall of the tide. And you know the feeling of someone at your side.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_48": "But... why? Why does Shorekeeper feel so strangely familiar, yet somehow off, every time you see her? The two of you have only met a handful of times.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_49": "Haven't you? This is the town you... grew up in. If it feels strange, if you've forgotten things, it's only because so much time has passed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_5": "The early autumn wind has shed the summer's sweltering heat. Cool and crisp, it sweeps in from the sea, thinning out the weariness in your body and the gloom in your heart.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_50": "Shorekeeper, why do I feel like... I've always known your name? Did I... know you, a long time ago?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_51": "Have you... remembered something?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_52": "The question catches you off guard. You hesitate, then slowly shake your head.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_53": "A long time ago... Perhaps. Do you not like everything in this town? Your friends, your elders, everyone and everything by your side that makes up your life... Have you grown weary of it all?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_54": "No. I treasure this time I get to spend with everyone. Every one of them is precious to me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_55": "I see... Then, {PlayerName}, is there something else on your mind?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_56": "None of this... feels quite real.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_57": "I feel like I've forgotten a lot of things.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_58": "It feels like I'm dreaming.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_59": "Not \"real\"...? Like a happy, beautiful dream.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_6": "You lift your head and gaze past the rolling waves to the far line where sky meets sea. The horizon is as vast as ever, but the light has grown much softer than in high summer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_60": "\"Forgotten\"... Perhaps it's because you have yet to wake from the \"dream.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_61": "\"Dreaming\"... So that's how you see it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_62": "Out of nowhere, a white cat appears, padding silently up to your feet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_63": "The white cat tilts its head up, round eyes darting between the two of you, then falls into step behind you on light, nimble paws.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_64": "{PlayerName}, if one day you had a happy \"dream,\" but all its beauty... faded away the moment you woke, would you be sad?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_65": "I'd probably... miss it a little. But I wouldn't be sad.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_66": "All things come to an end. Given enough time, even the stars will one day go dark.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_67": "Something doesn't have to last forever to be beautiful.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_68": "Besides, getting to have a good dream is something to be happy about in itself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_69": "Then what if everything you did in the \"dream\"... also faded to nothing when you woke? Would you feel it had all been meaningless?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_7": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_70": "No.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_71": "At the very least, the me in that \"dream\" lived through something different, made the choices I needed to make, and wrote an ending that... turned out fairly well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_72": "I won't deny how real those feelings were. Nor will I deny everything I went through in that \"dream,\" or who I was there.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_73": "A \"dream\" offers another possibility. If anything, it's because we've known something beautiful that we know what to long for.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_74": "And even when the future falls short of our hopes, we can still find happiness and keep reaching for it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_75": "So if every \"dream\" must end, that just means it's time for me to face my own \"reality.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_76": "Yes... This is you. The {PlayerName} I know so well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_77": "I will remember this answer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_78": "Please, walk with me a little longer, {PlayerName}. Time spent like this, with you... I truly cherish it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_79": "You walk beside Shorekeeper through the sea breeze, the tide rising and falling in your ears.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_8": "A butterfly flits past your shoulder. Not far behind you, you hear the patter of light footsteps.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_80": "The distant coastline curves around the bay, stretching toward an unseen horizon, while your two silhouettes slowly fade into the deepening dusk beneath a hazy, aqua-blue sky.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_650_9": "You turn around on instinct. The aqua-haired girl is making her way slowly toward you along the beach, her hands resting loosely in front of her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_1": "The square is a sea of people. Students in matching uniforms gather, their chatter and laughter mingling with the rattle of suitcase wheels over the pavement.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_10": "Her long golden hair cascades over her shoulders, catching a soft sheen in the sunlight. There's an innate nobility in her every gesture.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_11": "Greetings, Milady! Good morning, Milady!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_12": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_13": "Perhaps aware that all eyes are on her, the girl calmly turns her face away, politely avoiding anyone's gaze.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_14": "Everyone makes way without a word, as if by unspoken agreement. Only one tall, stern-faced woman steps forward to greet her. Judging by the students' reactions, she seems quite popular around the school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_15": "From the murmurs around you, you learn that this woman is the school's <color=#d19f27>humanities teacher</color>—<color=#d19f27>Galbrena</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_16": "Pleasure to meet you, Miss Phoebe. Principal Abby couldn't make it today to welcome you in person and sends its deepest apologies.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_17": "I'll be guiding you through enrollment today. Please, follow me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_18": "The golden-haired girl called Phoebe gives a slight nod, murmurs a quiet order to the security guards behind her, and only then turns to follow Galbrena.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_19": "Understood! We're pulling out! Please take care, Milady! We wish you every success in your studies!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_2": "It's the first day of school, and the school is far livelier than you expected. A roaring chorus of voices echoes over the square, making even this wide-open space feel crowded.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_20": "The suited guards line up in a neat row and shout in unison, seeing Phoebe off with textbook forty-five-degree bows as she walks away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_21": "...!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_22": "For just a heartbeat, Phoebe obviously goes stiff.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_23": "This school really is full of hidden talent.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_24": "Amid the onlookers' whispers, you notice someone quietly tugging at the hem of your uniform jacket.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_25": "You turn around, a little puzzled, and find a girl who looks barely past ten. She's clutching a photo, looking from it to you and back again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_26": "Hello. You must be... {PlayerName}, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_27": "When you nod, the girl finally lets out a long breath. She tucks the photo back into her folder and pulls out a <color=#d19f27>Student ID Card</color> for you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_28": "Follow me, please. I'm <color=#d19f27>Verina</color>, your <color=#d19f27>homeroom teacher</color> for the coming year. We'll get your enrollment sorted, then I'll take you to the classroom.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_29": "Thank you, Miss Verina.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_3": "(Looks like the first problem I'll have to solve today is finding my own class.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_30": "Could it be... Abby seriously recruited a child employee?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_31": "Just like the rumors say. Such a polite one. Never asking questions you shouldn't.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_32": "Aw, are you complimenting how young I look? Thank you, but I'm well past legal age, I promise.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_33": "Though, I must say, I'm not sure how old this photo Principal Abby gave me is. If it weren't for your distinctive eyes and hair, I might not have recognized you at all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_34": "But up close, you really do look remarkably like that <color=#d19f27>legendary student</color> from our school's history.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_4": "You turn sideways and inch forward through the crush. Just as you finally squeeze past a cluster of students, the crowd up ahead suddenly stirs, as if something has caught its attention.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_5": "Following everyone's gaze, you spot a gleaming black luxury car parked right at the school gates. Just sitting there, it looks utterly out of place. Anyone can tell it cost a fortune.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_6": "Several security guards in crisp suits and sunglasses step out first. Their expressions are cold, their movements brisk, and they exude an unspoken air of intimidation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_7": "Then one of them strides forward, bows slightly, and opens the rear door with both hands.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_8": "Alright, this is way too much. Where on earth have you ended up? Is this even a school?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_65_9": "With every eye fixed on her, a girl in the school uniform steps slowly out of the luxury car.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_1": "As evening draws near, more and more people gather along the river. On the last night of the short holiday, the annual riverside fireworks show goes on as scheduled.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_10": "Anywhere, as long as it's with you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_11": "Hm, now that's a clever answer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_12": "Clever? How so?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_13": "Because now the questions and the decisions are all on me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_14": "The buildings across the river have lit up. You walk slowly along the riverside, not really looking for anything in particular, just drifting with the crowd, chatting on and off.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_15": "The river flows slowly, breaking the city's lights into a fine, glittering shimmer that mingles with the stars above on the rippling water.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_16": "The two of you sit down side by side on a bench by the river. The noisy chatter around you fades, leaving only the sound of the night breeze stirring the leaves.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_17": "How much longer until the fireworks?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_18": "Maybe... in a minute?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_19": "So slow...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_2": "Rainbow-like strings of light hang along the roadside, and food stalls line the street. Children run through the crowd waving pinwheels, and not far off, you can hear a street band doing a sound check.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_20": "Yeah, even a minute feels so long right now. I used to think graduation was still a lifetime away... and now, so many years have gone by in the blink of an eye.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_21": "Hehe... Looking back, the last time I watched the fireworks with you at the school still feels like it was just yesterday. Actually, I—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_22": "—Thoom. A muffled boom tears through the night sky, and a moment later a beam of light shoots up from the far bank. Fireworks burst wide, lighting the entire sky as bright as day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_23": "Gasps and cries rise and fall through the crowd, swallowing the rest of her unfinished sentence.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_24": "As if noticing something, you turn your head and find yourself meeting Changli's gaze. Fireworks rise in the distance, their brilliant light playing across her profile. You look at each other, and neither of you says a word.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_25": "Or perhaps, in this moment, there is no need for words. At least tonight, you can still sit side by side, staring at the same sky. And the road ahead... stretches on and on.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_26": "Actually... my wish has already come true.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_3": "Over here, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_4": "Changli, waving to you from across the packed crowd, freezes for a few seconds when she spots you, then suddenly bursts out laughing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_5": "What are you... wearing? Is that a suit?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_6": "Weren't you the one who said it's different this time, so I should dress for the occasion?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_7": "...I only mentioned that in passing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_8": "She says that, but you can tell she's dressed with more care than usual today, and it gives her a particularly elegant air.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_6600_9": "So, where to first?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_1": "After supper, Abby pats its belly in satisfaction and lets out a burp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_10": "Speaking of which, how have your grades been lately? And how are things with the orchestra club?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_11": "Everything's going well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_12": "Things aren't looking too bright.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_13": "Don't you think it's a little late to start caring...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_14": "Well, that's a relief. If you ever hit a snag, don't bottle it up. Talk things over with your classmates.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_15": "The school's future is riding on you kids, after all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_16": "Now, now, no need to be so hard on yourself. Everyone hits a rough patch every now and then.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_17": "Even if this school really does get sold off in the end, everything will be fine. As far as this principal is concerned, as long as you kids are all heading off toward your own futures, that's a good thing in my books.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_18": "Well, this principal's got a lot on its plate, if you haven't noticed! Kids these days...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_19": "Then again, if you're still in the mood for jokes, you must not have hit anything too serious yet, right? That's a relief.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_2": "Ahh, time sure flies, and here we are in October already, the season of clear skies and crisp air.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_20": "And it's not like I don't care about you at all! I've just been really busy lately.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_21": "So, {PlayerName}, have you given any thought to your own future?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_22": "(The future...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_23": "I haven't figured it out yet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_24": "Oh, c'mon, what's the big deal? You're still young! There's plenty of kids your age who haven't figured out what they want to do yet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_25": "No need to rush to find an answer just because everyone else already found one. Life's a long road. There's nothing wrong with takin' it easy for a while and seeing where it takes you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_26": "Keep studying, find a job, go see places and meet people... Whichever it is, someday you'll have to decide for yourself which way is right for you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_27": "Take it from your Uncle Abby, who's been around the block: if you're just rushing to reach the finish line and you miss all the beautiful scenery along the way, it's just not worth it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_28": "Maybe one day you'll run off somewhere far away, make a whole bunch of new friends, study what you love, and be free to do whatever you want.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_29": "And when that day comes, your old uncle here might have to book an appointment just to see you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_3": "If I'm correct, it's just about time we held your <color=#d19f27>coming-of-age ceremony</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_30": "Abby suddenly pauses, as if suddenly remembering something.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_31": "Although... didn't the old you have plenty of cool ideas of your own? Once you set your sights on a path, you'd stick to it no matter what. Gave me plenty to worry about back then.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_32": "The old me...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_33": "You're fully aware that you're a transfer student new to this town. But... why did you transfer?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_34": "If you really stopped to think about <color=#d19f27>\"the past\"</color> and <color=#d19f27>\"the future\"</color>...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_35": "Where were you before coming to this town? Your old school... Before you transferred to the school, <color=#d19f27>who were you?</color>",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_36": "Just... <color=#d19f27>why can't you remember?</color> Is Abby really your \"uncle\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_37": "It feels like... it shouldn't be this way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_38": "You look down at your open palm. Images should be surfacing on their own: the house you lived in as a child, the way home from school, the first time you met Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_39": "Or... <color=#d19f27>anything that would prove those years truly existed</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_4": "A coming-of-age ceremony?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_40": "The further you try to remember the past, the blurrier it gets. It's like stopping to look back, only to find the road behind you cut off somewhere by a thick white fog.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_41": "<color=#d19f27>You can't see anything.</color>",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_42": "<color=#e46969>You can't remember anything.</color>",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_43": "Abby, tell me about my past.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_44": "Abby freezes, clearly not expecting the question. It opens its mouth to say something, but no words come out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_45": "Huh? That's out of the blue. I'm not even sure where to start.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_46": "Well, when you were little... Aw, it's all just scraps. Nothing worth bringing up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_47": "What's got you curious about that all of a sudden? Don't tell me you're starting to doubt the relationship between you and your Uncle Abby now, are ya?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_48": "Sigh... I'm getting old. Even {PlayerName} is getting tired of me now...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_49": "...It's nothing. I just suddenly realized I can't seem to remember anything from before I transferred here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_5": "That's right. Every autumn, the school holds a joint <color=#d19f27>coming-of-age ceremony</color> for all the senior students.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_50": "Abby tilts its head and studies you for a moment, rubbing its chin thoughtfully.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_51": "Now that you mention it, I feel like I can't remember much either.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_52": "Well, whatever. It's not important. If you can't remember, no point tryin' to force it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_53": "Memory's a quirky thing. Some things stick with you crystal clear, while others you can't recall no matter how hard you try. Besides, that's all in the past now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_54": "Sure... The past matters, but the people you meet now, the things you experience, and the choices you make are also becoming part of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_55": "As for things that happened long, long ago... <color=#d19f27>perhaps one day soon, someone who has always watched over you will come with the answers... and find you.</color>",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_56": "You look out the window. The night breeze quietly brushes the treetops, and a butterfly, its wings aglow with a faint blue light, flits past the window and flies off deeper into the night.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_57": "No need to overthink next week's <color=#d19f27>coming-of-age ceremony</color>. Just wear your uniform and be ready to take the graduation photo with everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_6": "After all, once the Qualifying Exam is over, everyone's gonna go their separate ways. This is probably the last chance you'll get to be together here as students.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_7": "If past years are anything to go by, the ceremony should be next week. And unlike the School Anniversary, you won't have to lift a finger preparing for this one.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_8": "Still, come to think of it, it's about time you started thinking about life after graduation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_700_9": "Abby glances your way, putting on its best grown-up's vibe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_1": "After helping you navigate the lengthy enrollment process, Verina guides you through the Teaching Building to show you where the classrooms are.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_10": "Wake up, everyone. I've brought our new classmate up to say hello.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_11": "The class isn't all that large. You glance around the room and notice a familiar face—Changli, whom you've met once before, is here too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_12": "(So she's my classmate... Is that what she meant about saving introductions for a more fitting occasion?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_13": "Either way, the moment has come to face your new surroundings. Beyond basic facts like your name, what matters most about you right now is...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_14": "The pursuit of <color=#d19f27>academics</color> and <color=#d19f27>logic</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_15": "A <color=#d19f27>healthy body</color> and <color=#d19f27>aesthetic refinement</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_16": "A <color=#d19f27>distinguished reputation</color> and <color=#d19f27>great wealth</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_17": "<color=#d19f27>Well-rounded</color> personal development.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_18": "...To score well on the <color=#d19f27>Qualifying Exam</color> and chart a clearer future.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_19": "...To stay healthy, hone your skills, and reach new heights in <color=#d19f27>art</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_2": "The school uses a rotating schedule: teachers and subjects remain in fixed rooms, while students move between classes throughout the day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_20": "...To earn the world's <color=#d19f27>praise</color> and amass astonishing <color=#d19f27>wealth</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_21": "...To grow in <color=#d19f27>every direction</color> and seize every opportunity.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_22": "There's no telling where you'll be a year from now. But for who you are today, this is the goal that matters most.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_23": "Admirable resolve. As long as you know what you want to achieve, you don't need to care what others think. Just keep going.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_24": "Very well, {PlayerName}. Your seat is the second-to-last row by the window. Next to Changli.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_25": "Mm. That's our class, then. Everyone, feel free to mingle. Help our new classmate get up to speed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_26": "When the class hears you'll be sitting next to Changli, you catch a few envious glances. She's clearly well-liked at this school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_27": "You take your seat, and Changli offers a quiet greeting from beside you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_28": "Let's get along, yeah? {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_29": "Finally dropping the formalities, I see.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_3": "According to your schedule, Humanities is currently in session. Since you're joining as a transfer student, Verina accompanies you to the classroom to introduce you to everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_30": "Ahem... I mistook you for someone else. Please just forget about that.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_31": "Or we could keep it as our little secret. Is that okay?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_32": "She seemed a little embarrassed. You glimpse a faint blush creeping to the tips of her ears. You nod, letting her know you understand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_33": "I won't tell anyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_34": "Let's get along, yeah?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_35": "Changli smiles without a word and turns her attention back to her study materials.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_36": "Changli smiles without a word and turns her attention back to her study materials.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_37": "One last thing. Those who dozed off during Miss Galbrena's class, please see me in my office during the break.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_38": "As Verina reads out the names recorded in her black notebook, a chorus of groans ripples through the classroom.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_39": "...Looks like you'll need to stay focused during class.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_4": "When analyzing the function of a passage, consider both structure and content. For indirect inference questions, try to deduce the author's attitude from context...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_40": "Okay, back to the lesson. Next question...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_41": "Analyze the symbolic meaning behind the closing line: \"The fish's eyes gleamed with an eerie glow.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_42": "To be honest? Beats me. What wise guy came up with this question? I doubt even the author put that much thought into it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_43": "Then again... maybe they ran into some deep-sea monster that controls minds.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_44": "In which case, remember what we learned: two shots to the chest, one to the head. Incapacitate first, eliminate second.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_45": "...Some completely useless and oddly specific knowledge lodges itself in your brain.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_46": "Still, it counts as broadening your horizons... Who knows? Maybe someday it'll actually come in handy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_47": "That's all for today. Class dismissed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_48": "Oh—Hey, new student in the second-to-last row by the window! My office is on the east side of the second floor. If you ever have any questions about the coursework, feel free to find me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_49": "Galbrena strides out in a few quick steps. The class quickly settles into the usual break-time hum.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_5": "Inside, Galbrena, the humanities teacher, is summing up how to approach the problem.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_50": "After a simple lunch and a short rest, afternoon classes begin.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_51": "The board fills with notes and gets wiped clean, again and again. Outside, the sunlight slants westward until the dismissal bell rings across campus.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_52": "The first day of school comes to a quiet end, calm and peaceful.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_53": "<color=#d19f27>Tomorrow</color>, your <color=#d19f27>new life</color> here truly begins. As for what <color=#d19f27>the coming year</color> at <color=#d19f27>Second Solaris School</color> holds...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_54": "Everything is worth looking forward to.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_6": "Verina presses up against the back door window, watching the class for a moment. Notebook in hand, she notes down the names of the slacking students. Only when Galbrena completes the example problem does she push open the door and walk in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_7": "Excuse me, Miss Galbrena. Sorry to interrupt you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_8": "A transfer student? Now, of all times? That's rare.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_70_9": "Galbrena nods to the two of you and steps aside from the podium.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_1": "Time really flies... Another year's graduates are about to head out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_10": "I doubt that's all it is. My dad said yesterday that Principal Abby's been having a ton of meetings with the School Board lately.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_11": "He said Celestial Steed Corp sent people over too. Sounds like they're talking about the school's development plans for the next few years.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_12": "Whoa, who knew? You're one of the rich and powerful, huh? Getting the inside scoop on the School Board!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_13": "Oh, shut up! You're making stuff up about me again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_14": "But hey, is it just me, or has Celestial Steed Corp been paying more and more attention to the school this year? Ever since the anniversary, their name pops up at every big school event.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_15": "No clue about the details, but isn't everyone always going on about this \"industry-academia collaboration\"? Wait, that's the bell! Run. Run!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_16": "Oh no, next class is Miss Galbrena's. I can't be late for that!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_2": "Didn't we get a new transfer student this year? You know, the one who looks exactly like that \"legendary student\" from a hundred years ago.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_3": "{Male=He;Female=She}'s graduating this year too, right? Transferring in for the very last year takes some serious guts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_4": "Maybe it's not just the looks. Maybe {Male=he;Female=she} lives up to the \"legendary\" name in every way..",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_5": "Haven't you seen it? That hot thread on the forum, \"Apocalypse Hits Campus: Pick Your School's Protector\"... Tons of people picked {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_6": "Well, the forum mod muted my account a few days ago for spamming ghost-story posts... I haven't gotten around to making an alt yet, hehe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_7": "Oh, by the way, have you noticed people coming to take photos around school lately? Last time I passed the Administration Building, I saw a few guys in suits talking with Principal Abby again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_8": "Probably from Celestial Steed Corp? They've been surveying the school's facilities lately. They even checked out the old buildings nobody ever goes to.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_710_9": "Wait... is it because of the coming-of-age ceremony?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_1": "Oh, by the way, we have a date for the <color=#d19f27>coming-of-age ceremony</color>. It's <color=#d19f27>this Saturday</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_10": "Then what about you, Abby? Do you have any expectations for me?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_11": "Well, {PlayerName}... As long as you know what you want when things come up, learn to make your own decisions, and are willing to own up to your choices, that alone is plenty impressive.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_12": "All right, enough of that. I've set aside some extra spending money for you. Take it, and spend it all on Saturday if you need to. No need to hold back your urge to splurge.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_13": "And then, Saturday night...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_14": "And that's when we all go out for hotpot, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_15": "Heheh, now you're talking my language, {PlayerName}. That's right! We're all heading to Chisa's place for hotpot!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_2": "Get some early nights for the next couple of days. You don't want to show up to the ceremony with dark circles under your eyes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_3": "On Saturday, besides the school activities, we're also taking everyone's graduation photos, so remember to wear your uniform that day and look sharp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_4": "After all, you only get to grow up once, so we should mark it properly. Once you've all graduated and gone your separate ways, you can dig out the photos now and then as a keepsake.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_5": "Okay, got it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_6": "I talked it over with the faculty, and we're skipping the principal's address this year. That way I don't have to memorize a speech, and everyone gets to relax.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_7": "Ugh. Honestly, the most annoying part of every coming-of-age ceremony is those few minutes up on stage giving a speech. Say too much, and it's a lecture. Say too little, and it sounds half-hearted.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_8": "And no matter how you phrase it, it's always the same old lines. Study hard. Live well. Figure out a path that's best for you, blah, blah, blah...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_720_9": "But I really do think a lifetime is far too long for a few words to map out anyone's road for them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_1": "...Good morning. This is the Morning News.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_10": "If you want to focus on your studies, you could ask teachers for extra guidance in the office... or simply go home and hit the books.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_11": "As Chisa suggested earlier, you could also drop by the Liaison Center to scout out available part-time jobs for pocket money.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_12": "If club activities don't interest you, you could check out the Student Council that Changli mentioned.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_13": "In any case, arrange your after-school hours around the growth you want to pursue.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_2": "Today, Second Solaris School Principal Abby meets with Celestial Steed Corp Chairman Fenrico to discuss long-term development for both the school and the town.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_3": "Sources confirm that today's agenda stands as a pivotal point for industry-academia collaboration, following Celestial Steed Corp's steady investments in local education and infrastructure... We will continue to follow these talks and report updates.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_4": "By the time you step out of your room, Abby has already left. Come to think of it, it came home late last night as well, long after you'd fallen asleep.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_5": "The school year has only just begun. Is there really this much to manage? Heavy Student Council workloads, trouble brewing in the Club Association, and whatever secrets Abby is keeping under wraps...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_6": "It seems your new life here promises to be far more complicated than expected.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_7": "Once this <color=#d19f27>school year ends</color>, I'll be <color=#d19f27>graduating</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_8": "Got transferred in for my last year before <color=#d19f27>graduation</color>, so settling in won't be easy. Still, it's time to start easing into school life.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_72_9": "Anyway... starting today, my after-school hours are mine to plan.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_1": "Sunlight filters through the gaps between the leaves, dappling the ground with shifting patches of light and shadow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_10": "You all did a fantastic job, Chisa.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_11": "Yo, mornin', Boss!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_12": "Though... is it a little early to say \"happy graduation\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_13": "Didn't expect to see you here, Buling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_14": "Sure, today's the grad students' big day, but as a forum moderator, I've gotta get the first-hand scoop.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_15": "Perfect timing, actually. The Student Council asked me to help shoot some promo material. Quick, Boss, smile at the camera! Gimme a cool pose, and I'll put you on the forum's front-page headline!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_16": "With a crisp click of the shutter, you wave goodbye to Chisa and Buling and walk on.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_17": "People are already trickling into the gathering spot for the graduation photo. Some straighten their clothes, others are already snapping selfies with close friends, and laughter drifts over now and then.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_18": "Your classmates have mostly arrived too. Before the official graduation photo, why not take a picture with a friend first, and hold on to these school days before they come to an end?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_19": "Three others are graduating with you this year: Ciaccona, Xiangli Yao, and Changli. For a keepsake, you decide to step into the frame with...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_2": "Bustling crowds and bright ribbon decorations play off each other, making the by-now familiar Central Square feel livelier than usual.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_20": "Ciaccona",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_21": "Xiangli Yao",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_22": "Changli",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_23": "Ciaccona, how about we take a photo together?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_24": "Oh? Sure, sure! C'mon, get closer! Since we're such good friends, I'll let you skip the line!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_25": "There's a line for photos with you? You really are popular, Leader Ciaccona.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_26": "Of course! My club members can hardly bear to see me go.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_27": "Ciaccona leans out from beside you, tilts her shoulder, and flashes a \"Yay\" by her cheeks, beaming a bright, carefree smile at the camera.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_28": "On the camera screen, the red-haired girl's eyes curve into crescents, her smile spreading from her lips all the way up to her brows. Her bright eyes hold the warm sunlight of mid-autumn, cheerful and utterly unguarded.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_29": "Those smiling teal eyes hold your reflection, as well as the lively crowd around you. It's as if, as long as she stands with everyone, there's nothing in the world worth worrying about.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_3": "A few classmates hurry past you with boxes full of graduation yearbooks. Student Council members weave through the crowd, reminding students to head to their class meeting points.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_30": "Now that's more like it!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_31": "Yes, that's more like it. Smiling freely and without restraint, together with everyone... Perhaps that, too, is what youth is all about.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_32": "Let's take a picture together, Xiangli Yao.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_33": "Sure, no problem.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_34": "Xiangli Yao shifts half a step toward you and settles in beside you, shoulder to shoulder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_35": "He doesn't immediately face the camera. Instead, he lifts a hand and carefully straightens the collar of your uniform.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_36": "Your collar was up, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_37": "Autumn's here, and the morning wind has picked up. It's getting chilly, so keep warm. You don't want to catch a cold.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_38": "Yeah. Thank you, Xiangli Yao.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_39": "The sunlight clears the roof of the Teaching Building and falls on Xiangli Yao's lashes, casting a small fan of shadow across his face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_4": "Not far off, a Liaison Center Officer stands on a ladder, adjusting the banner strung between the trees. Chisa steadies the ladder from below, glancing up now and then to check the position.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_40": "He turns his head slightly toward the photographer's lens. On the camera screen, his eyebrows are relaxed and his manner composed, a faint, gentle smile at the corner of his mouth.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_41": "Even though it's only been a year, I'm really glad I got to know you, {PlayerName}. Whenever you look at this photo in the future, I hope it reminds you of the days you spent with everyone here at school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_42": "You nod to Xiangli Yao, then raise your arm and bump fists with him.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_43": "Making memories with your companions that belong to you alone, capturing every moment worth treasuring... Perhaps that, too, is what youth is all about.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_44": "Changli, want to take a photo together?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_45": "Oh? Certainly. I'd be delighted.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_46": "Changli smooths her sleeve a little, turns, and comes to stand at your side.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_47": "Here will do, then.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_48": "Autumn sunlight spills down through layer upon layer of branches, the scorch of high summer long gone, leaving only a soft, bright warmth.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_49": "She lifts her eyes to the camera, strands of hair brushing her face in the breeze that sweeps the square. Her expression is as composed and serene as ever, yet the slight curve of her eyes and the smile at her lips add a touch of tenderness to that dignified poise.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_5": "Catching sight of you, she gives you a small nod.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_50": "The crowd around you keeps moving along, students passing you in twos and threes like a slow-flowing river.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_51": "The instant the shutter clicks, a few leaves break free of the branches and spiral down, settling on your shoulder.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_52": "Changli raises her hand and gently brushes the faint yellow leaf away for you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_53": "Let's take one more. A moment like this... we ought to keep a little more of it, for you and for me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_54": "The world around you is still bustling, yet her gaze plays back like slow motion. Every flicker of her eyes, every tiny movement, is etched with impossible clarity before you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_55": "Plans and schedules alone can't make up the entirety of our lives. Holding on to these unexpected, seemingly trivial moments, one by one... Perhaps that, too, is what youth is all about.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_56": "Oh, {PlayerName}? Taking pictures with everyone?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_57": "I hate to interrupt, but... let's see. Mm, we pretty much have everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_58": "I suggest we start heading over to our assembly spot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_59": "If you're late, you'd all be stuck in the very back row for the graduation photo.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_6": "Good morning, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_60": "No need to get all teary-eyed. It's not time for goodbyes yet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_61": "That's right. It's not us being harsh on you, but you should all remember—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_62": "In just two months, it'll be the final Qualifying Exam and the Nationals grand final.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_63": "One by one, the teachers call the students scattered across the square back to their classes' assembly spots.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_64": "The front-row students have already taken their seats in order, while latecomers squeeze onto the steps. You follow the crowd, and just as you find your place, the two teachers' voices ring out from the front.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_65": "Everyone in the back, scootch a little closer to the center!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_66": "Those in the back row, can you see the camera? Come on, take a step forward and straighten up!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_67": "With that, the crowd shifts once more. Everyone jostles one another, hastily smoothing their hair and hems, rising on tiptoe now and then to peek ahead, laughter bubbling up all around.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_68": "The classmate next to you smooths a wrinkle on their uniform, and you raise a hand to straighten your tie.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_69": "At long last, everyone settles into place, and the photographer raises the camera.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_7": "What do you think? Central Square looks pretty today, doesn't it? Principal Abby said there's no need for extra work today, but everyone at the Liaison Center still wanted to do their part.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_70": "All right, everyone. Look at the camera—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_71": "The murmuring from a moment ago fades away, and every gaze turns to the camera lens at once.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_72": "Three, two, one—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_73": "A golden wind blows in from the far side of the square, scattering flecks of light across your hair and collar. You lift your head, look at the familiar faces around you, and are struck by a sudden sense of déjà vu.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_74": "(A graduation photo... the school... and the... Second Solaris School? Solaris...? My school?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_75": "Smile!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_76": "The photographer's cue rings in your ears. You shake your head, toss those far-fetched thoughts aside, and break into your brightest smile along with everyone else.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_77": "One more! Everyone, relax this time, and no blinking!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_78": "The shutter clicks a second time. Everyone relaxes, no longer holding their poses.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_79": "Xiangli Yao reaches out and rests a hand on your shoulder, while Ciaccona flashes a peace sign beside your cheek. Changli stands at your side, her smile serene and gentle.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_8": "Following her gaze, you see ribbons and Abby-shaped balloons decorating the trees and railings on both sides of the path, while a few flags bearing the school crest wave in the breeze.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_80": "Abby shows up out of nowhere as well, popping into the frame for a quick cameo. Verina and Galbrena sit in the very front row, watching everyone with gratified smiles.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_81": "The autumn sunlight, the leaves swaying in the breeze, the familiar companions at your side, and these young faces, each about to head toward their own future.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_82": "Many years from now, you may not remember a word of what was said on this day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_83": "But when you see this photo again, you'll probably still remember the wind and the laughter of this moment, and this campus you've walked through every day and are now about to leave behind.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_84": "Graduation photos done. Go see what other <color=#d19f27>activities</color> are going on around campus.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_730_9": "Clusters of fresh bouquets are arranged around the square as well, lending this festive scene a touch of solemnity.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_73_1": "Did you all catch the news this morning? The principal of Second Solaris School is meeting the chairman of that Celestial Steed Corp today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_73_2": "What's so strange about that? You know how things have been at the school lately. If someone's willing to help out now, the school's hardly in a position to say no.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_73_3": "I wouldn't put it that way. Celestial Steed Corp has always been about the bottom line. Since when do they pour money into anything for nothing?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_73_4": "Besides, the chairman is handling this personally. And I hear the chairman has some ties to the school's Board, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_73_5": "Still, the news only mentioned education and infrastructure. Nothing about how this partnership is actually supposed to work.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_73_6": "...Sigh. It's one of the oldest schools in town, after all. Let's hope Principal Abby knows what it's doing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_1": "Before you know it, it's deep into the night. Most of the colorful neon lights in the shop windows have gone dark, leaving only a few scattered signs still lit, a stark contrast against the pitch-black sky.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_10": "Same. Hotpot is delicious, and when everyone gathers around the pot like one big family, it tastes even better.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_100": "I certainly did not expect Buling to catch me like this.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_101": "I was up late last night with paperwork and felt a little tired, so I took a short nap this morning.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_102": "You should take better care of yourself, Changli.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_103": "You continue flipping through the photos. Next are your two teachers, Miss Verina and Miss Galbrena.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_104": "Galbrena sits in a chair, arm raised, directing students to gather towards the graduation photo area. Verina, having spotted the camera, stands behind her and rises onto her tiptoes—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_105": "—and, with a sly grin, gives Galbrena bunny ears with both hands.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_106": "And the last photo: the group graduation photo, taken by Buling from another angle.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_107": "In the photo, everyone is neatly dressed, standing shoulder to shoulder on the familiar campus. The sunlight is just right at the instant the shutter clicks, and every face wears a bright, spirited smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_108": "The few underclassmen who weren't in the official graduation photo lean in curiously for a closer look.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_109": "So this is your graduation photo...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_11": "Come to think of it, Roccia, you bring up \"family\" quite often.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_110": "The curious chatter gradually dies down, as if everyone has just realized something.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_111": "Of course, graduation is still two months away. Not long, but not exactly short either. And as your teachers said, exams and competitions still lie ahead of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_112": "But right now, looking at Buling's photo together with friends beside you, the word \"graduation\" is suddenly no longer just some distant, hazy date on the calendar.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_113": "Such days... will never, ever fade from your heart.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_114": "Life is more than just one graduation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_115": "From a familiar campus to an unknown future, from one bond to the next encounter, from a regular life to a whole new day—there will be many such moments in your life.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_116": "Perhaps the days behind you were soaked in snow, and perhaps the road ahead will be lashed by rain. Perhaps you will shoulder a duty and mission as heavy as the world. Yet still you will be like a crane parting the clouds in a clear sky, ambition soaring to the heavens, riding the wind straight up to the mountain's peak.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_117": "And after that, you will set out again, and bid farewell to the past like always.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_118": "The long night lies deep, yet this heart remains true and unwavering.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_119": "—May we keep a curious heart and the hunger to learn.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_12": "It's because I don't have parents. Only Grandpa, Grandma, and my brother Brant. But everyone at the school is also my family.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_120": "—May we find, in times of hardship, the steady courage to stand against the dark.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_121": "—May we never turn against ourselves, even having taken the long way around.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_122": "—May we look back years from now with no bitterness and no regret over the choices we once made.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_123": "—May we all be proud of who we used to be.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_13": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_14": "I'm sorry, Roccia... Please don't be sad.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_15": "Hm? I'm not sad. Grandpa and Grandma say they found me inside a big leather trunk by the sea.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_16": "It was as if I appeared out of thin air. Nobody knows where I came from, and nobody ever came to claim me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_17": "Grandpa and Grandma were the ones who raised me. I don't have any memories of my parents, so there's nothing to be sad about.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_18": "Detective Brant protects everyone in the family, and nobody's ever picked on me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_19": "Wait, why do I suddenly get a familiar feeling from Roccia? Like I've seen her somewhere before, a long time ago.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_2": "Through the restaurant window, you can see the town has long since shed its daytime bustle. Streetlights glow one after another, spreading their dim yellow light across the empty sidewalks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_20": "What are you talking about, Buling? Roccia is the shopkeeper at the school store. Of course you've seen her. As for her feeling familiar...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_21": "Must've been your imagination. Haha...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_22": "One look at Abby's eyes darting guiltily around, and you know it: your esteemed principal is hiding something from everyone again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_23": "We already knew, Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_24": "Your nose just got longer, Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_25": "Huh? For real? You guys already knew?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_26": "No, wait. You're just trying to trick me, aren't you, {PlayerName}?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_27": "M-my nose got longer?! Why you... My nose doesn't grow! I'm not some little brat who tells lies...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_28": "I get it now. You're trying to trick me into talking, aren't ya? {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_29": "Fine... Keep this a secret for Roccia's sake, okay? She came back to this little town to study because she doesn't want too many people bothering her. And because she has to look after her grandparents.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_3": "Now and then, a late passerby hurries beneath the lamps, their shadow stretched long before it vanishes around the corner.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_30": "Ah, I remember now! I saw Roccia in a TV commercial!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_31": "That's right. Roccia's been in loads of famous movies. She's quite the big name in Commedia Improvviso with the Troupe of Fools.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_32": "She co-starred in <b>All Silent Souls Can Sing</b> and played the lead in <b>Starry is the Night</b>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_33": "...(Breathes deeply.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_34": "Then let us prepare to set sail. To the isles upon the sea—the land of Echoes blessed by the gods!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_35": "And now, having set foot on this very land, cast aside your worries. For it is time to ride the tide of revelry!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_36": "Whoa, amazing! She slipped into character just like that!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_37": "To a round of applause, Roccia gives everyone a grand, ceremonious bow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_38": "Thank you. You've been a wonderful audience.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_39": "Our little child star Roccia hasn't reached enrollment age yet, so for now she attends classes here as a visiting student.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_4": "Traffic in the distance has thinned out as well. Every so often, passing headlights slice through the darkness, leaving a brief bright reflection on the slightly damp pavement, and then only the fading sound of an engine remains.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_40": "Of course, that isn't strictly by the book. I imagine that's exactly why Principal Abby is in such a bind.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_41": "After all, Roccia is effectively skipping several grades as it is.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_42": "Precisely. So I hope everyone here will keep this a secret for our little Roccia and Principal Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_43": "After all, she's our secret weapon for taking on Celestial Steed Corp's final test.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_44": "I see...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_45": "As for me, I've never met my parents either. I grew up in an orphanage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_46": "But my adoptive parents took wonderful care of me, and without them, I probably never would have fallen in love with music.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_47": "Ever since I came to the school and met all of you, I've been so happy. Everyone here... it's like we're companions on an adventure.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_48": "...Me too!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_49": "I-I grew up with a family, but... honestly, my adoptive father and I don't get along that well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_5": "In this little town, night falls quiet soon after sunset. Only a few lights remain, scattered quietly among the buildings against the dark.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_50": "My parents were strict with discipline, so I was sent to a boarding school at a young age.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_51": "When I was little, my favorite thing was lying on a flower-covered hillside with my animal friends, staring at the clouds. Even the wind that blew past tasted sweet like laurel...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_52": "But my parents always told me I couldn't run off on my own, and certainly not get so close to wild animals...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_53": "Here at the school, everyone shares a mutual trust and looks out for one another. It feels like... being with family.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_54": "Thank goodness Phoebe isn't dissatisfied with life at the school. We're saved...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_55": "Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_56": "I know, I know! Phoebe's a good girl, for sure, but Fenrico really is one tough cookie.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_57": "Alright, alright. I'm sure Phoebe doesn't have nearly as many agendas as Fenrico does.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_58": "Sure, she's always got a whole entourage trailing her, so she seems hard to approach, but deep down, she's a sweet, innocent student, am I right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_59": "Mm-hmm...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_6": "Oh, I am stuffed! Burp! Told ya nothing beats the hotpot at Chisa's place.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_60": "Speaking of which, I've been dying to ask you, Phoebe... A while back, there was a post on the forum claiming someone saw you threatening a classmate?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_61": "Uh, no. I'm pretty sure that was just a misunderstanding...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_62": "Huh? Really? Threatening a classmate... I've never done anything of the sort.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_63": "Allow me to explain... Actually, a while ago, two students in our grade had a tiny disagreement over the taste of a cafeteria special.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_64": "One of them said the new dish smelled like mud and tasted like mud, while the other said mud wasn't all that bad.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_65": "Maybe the daily grind of classes had gotten a bit too boring for them, so in the end they decided to settle it with a duel in the hallway.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_66": "Phoebe happened to be passing by, and she kindly talked everyone out of fighting.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_67": "I believe what I said went something like this...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_68": "Please don't fight with your classmates like this. Everyone should get along with one another.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_69": "Our teachers taught us that classmates should live in harmony and kindness. I hope this little incident won't keep anyone from enjoying their time at the school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_7": "I'm glad you liked it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_70": "Everyone went dead silent, and the two who had been arguing apologized to each other. I think that counts as a good outcome. Right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_71": "Though for some reason, they apologized to me too. They even wrote me apology letters.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_72": "I think I have a clear understanding of what happened...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_73": "Anyway, that's the whole story. Phoebe... I don't think she meant to threaten anyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_74": "Most of the dishes on the table are finished by now, with empty plates scattered here and there. Now that everyone has opened up, they've all completely relaxed, lounging lazily against the backs of their chairs.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_75": "Come to think of it, how did your photos turn out today, Buling? You could pick out a few good ones to use as promo shots for the school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_76": "Perfect timing. Why don't we all take a look at 'em together?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_77": "Buling pulls out the laptop she carries with her and slots in the camera's memory card.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_78": "The first couple of pictures are a few candid snapshots.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_79": "Members of the Orchestral Music Club crowd around Ciaccona, who hides behind Cartethyia, looking helpless and terrified, both hands waving so fast they seem to go flying.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_8": "Mm, I agree as well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_80": "Ha-haha... Everyone wants a button off my shirt, but I don't have nearly enough to go around!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_81": "I never imagined being club leader came with troubles like this...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_82": "The next one shows Chisa sitting on the Delivery Bot's arm, cradling a huge bouquet. The flowers cover nearly half her body, and their soft petals and bright colors make her face look all the more delicate.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_83": "Ah, that was this morning... We ran short on bouquets at the square, so I made a quick run to buy more.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_84": "The one after that shows Xiangli Yao standing in the crowd, going over the list of names.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_85": "The people around him blur into a wash of moving shadows, while he stands quietly at the very center of the frame, head lowered, with tree shadows falling across his shoulders. His posture is straight, his face clear and bright.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_86": "Those are some really well-captured pictures, Buling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_87": "As assembly time drew near, a head count came up one short. But nobody can miss something like the graduation photo, so I had to go through the list again on the spot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_88": "Further down the album is a selfie Buling took at arm's length. Beside her, Roccia is bent over with her hands braced on her knees, most of her face peeking into the bottom-left corner of the frame.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_89": "...Guess I got caught on camera.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_9": "Ever since I was little, my family taught me to practice moderation and never indulge my appetite... but with something like hotpot, where everyone shares from the same pot, I end up eating too much without even noticing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_90": "I was passing by when I happened to see Buling taking photos in a horse stance. I went over for a look out of curiosity.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_91": "Well, I had no choice! If I didn't sink into a horse stance, there was no way to fit both the school crest banner and the Abby balloon into a single shot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_92": "Still, your form was perfect.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_93": "Of course it was! Hehe, I've had my share of practice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_94": "Next comes a blonde girl stepping out of a car, surrounded by bodyguards in black—Phoebe. Her eyes happen to be closed, her uniform jacket draped over one shoulder, and she is brushing a strand of hair from her cheek with one hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_95": "Wh-why did you take that photo?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_96": "Don't worry. You look very elegant in this one, Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_97": "Well... if you say so, {PlayerName}...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_98": "The next photo... is Changli, sitting on the steps, head tilted as she looks at something nearby. With one hand propping up her cheek, she watches the busy crowd with a gentle expression.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_740_99": "You rarely see Changli like this. As president of the Student Council, she's usually buried in duties and coursework, but here she simply sits quietly, savoring a rare moment of leisure.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_1": "Ring, ring—ring, ring—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_10": "{PlayerName}, how are classes treating you on day two? Settling in okay?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_11": "Not bad. Everyone's been friendly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_12": "It makes me sweat just thinking about my future.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_13": "I'm just wondering what to have for lunch.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_14": "Glad to hear it. The workload this year is fairly heavy, so if you run into any trouble, don't hesitate to ask us for help.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_15": "I can't blame you for feeling that way. Everyone here does have quite a personality. But our teachers are all very dedicated. That much, at least, you can count on.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_16": "You sound pretty relaxed. Then again, it's almost lunchtime. The cafeteria has quite a few signature dishes, so now's a good chance to try them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_17": "Oh, I almost forgot. I ran into Principal Abby this morning. It said it'll be waiting for you in its office at lunch. Sounds like it has something to discuss with you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_18": "Abby? Right, it did mention that...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_19": "I'm on my way to the Student Council to process a few event approvals for the upcoming <color=#d19f27>School Anniversary</color>. We can head over together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_2": "As the bell signals the end of class, Verina sets down her chalk.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_20": "The School Anniversary?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_21": "Yes, a <color=#d19f27>celebration for the school's anniversary</color>. It's still in the early planning phase, so I'll fill you in on the details later. Let's get you to the Administration Building first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_22": "Alright, thanks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_3": "Phew... All right, that's it for this morning's lesson. Class dismissed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_4": "Also, your PE teacher has the afternoon off, so math will take its place. Make sure to adjust your schedules accordingly, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_5": "Huh?! It's only the second day of school and the PE teacher is already taking time off?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_6": "Miss Verina, couldn't Miss Galbrena fill in and teach PE instead?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_7": "Verina smiles and shakes her head, though her reply is delivered with quiet firmness.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_8": "You're upperclassmen now. You can't expect everything to go your way, alright?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_75_9": "With that, Verina leaves the classroom, and the hushed chatter slowly swells into a noisy din.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_1": "Welcome back, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_10": "Reality and data can be converted into one another at the Black Shores. Under Tethys's gaze, not a single planet, tide, or frequency that once existed will ever truly disappear.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_11": "Like fallen leaves returning to the earth. Like rivers flowing home to the sea. In the distant future, and the distant past, this place will always be where every journey ends.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_12": "So, you were the one who made \"her\" appear there, weren't you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_13": "I was.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_14": "\"Because I was always the one waiting for you to return... Let me be the one who keeps watch this time, too.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_15": "!!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_16": "Will you... remember any of it someday?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_17": "Perhaps I will. Perhaps I won't. But the fact that \"I\" once shared that journey with you, at least that much will never change.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_18": "Even if I'm the one who forgets everything this time... it doesn't matter. Because you'll tell me again. What it means to be the \"Shorekeeper.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_19": "So, please... tell me the story of the journey you just had. The one where \"I\" was there with you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_2": "How was your journey this time? Is everything all right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_20": "The Blake Blooms sway gently in the sea breeze. She smiles, gazing into your eyes, listening as you recount everything you experienced in your dream—walking side by side with her, wandering through unknown places, leaving behind a story that belongs only to the two of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_21": "And so, through your eyes, she sees you. And she also sees... herself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_3": "Something unexpected happened. I met... another \"you.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_4": "...I see.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_5": "She's... just like you. Carrying secrets she can never speak of, all alone, doing everything she can to watch over the world... until she met me, after I'd forgotten everything once again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_6": "Only this time, I couldn't bring \"you\" home as I did before.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_7": "So this is what has been troubling you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_8": "I know \"she\" isn't the real you. But when \"she\" was standing right in front of me, I couldn't bring myself to see her as... an \"imitation.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_8000_9": "{PlayerName}, please do not feel bad.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_1": "...And so, this is our last homeroom of the school year.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_10": "So there's no need to put all the pressure on this one exam. But since you're taking it, give it everything you've got.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_11": "Galbrena nods as well, her gaze coming to rest on you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_12": "Yes. For the time remaining, each of you should review thoroughly, according to your own needs.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_13": "Exam times, hall assignments, and what to bring will be announced separately before the exam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_14": "You've spent a thousand days sharpening your blade. Now's the time to draw it. Good luck on the Qualifying Exam, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_15": "Good luck! I believe in all of you!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_16": "The two teachers gather their textbooks and teaching materials and leave the classroom together as the bell rings.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_17": "{PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_18": "You turn your head and meet your deskmate's gaze. Changli rests one elbow on the desk, her cheek propped lightly in her palm.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_19": "Feeling nervous? They always say... the year of the Qualifying Exam is the most pivotal year of all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_2": "The petite homeroom teacher closes her roll book, her gaze sweeping across each of you in turn.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_20": "Not really. It's just an exam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_21": "So nervous I'm forgetting how to write my own name.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_22": "What about you, Changli? Are you nervous?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_23": "Indeed... You've always been this way. Entirely unshakeable, no matter the case.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_24": "Heh. If you can still joke like that, your mind must be as steady as ever.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_25": "Oh? Answering a question with a question? No, I won't be nervous. If anything, I'd say exams are rather my strong suit.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_26": "Whatever happens, I believe you will reach the destination you seek. A single exam surely won't be what stands in your way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_27": "Good luck, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_3": "Time flies, doesn't it? You've all grown from tender sprouts into tall little saplings. I'll never forget how each of you looked when you first enrolled.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_4": "There's just one more thing, the most important one, that I need to remind you of.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_5": "There is less than a month left until the Qualifying Exam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_6": "The rounds are chambered. Next month, you will march into the exam hall as soldiers and fight your way through every question.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_7": "Let's not say such scary things, Miss Galbrena.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_8": "As you all know, the Qualifying Exam is an important exam every student has to take.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_800_9": "But your Qualifying Exam results aren't the only thing that decides where you go next. There are other paths too, like winning an award in your field at Nationals.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_80_1": "{PlayerName}, the Principal's Office is right this way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_80_10": "Just like your first encounter, Changli offers only a calm smile and a slight wave before walking away, leaving your question unanswered.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_80_2": "You nod in thanks. Just as you raise your hand to knock, Changli calls out to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_80_3": "That day... I mistook you for someone else, which was quite presumptuous of me. It's a bit late for an apology, but allow me to offer a word of advice instead.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_80_4": "What advice?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_80_5": "Principal Abby likely called you here because of \"that matter.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_80_6": "Still, however bizarre the things it shows you, there's no need to take them to heart.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_80_7": "How you live your life should depend on the choices you make yourself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_80_8": "\"That matter\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_80_9": "How bizarre are we talking?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_820_1": "After the homeroom, the days on the calendar turn one page at a time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_820_10": "The sun sinks low and dusk gathers on all sides. The month is gone in the blink of an eye. But the busy days fly by so fast there's no time to stop and look back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_820_11": "Only one day remains until the final Qualifying Exam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_820_12": "Tomorrow... you will step into the exam hall for the last time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_820_2": "The morning bell rings as it always has, and after school the classrooms still hum with discussion.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_820_3": "The only change seems to be the stacks of practice papers on the desks growing thicker, and the Qualifying Exam countdown on the blackboard shrinking day by day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_820_4": "Withered leaves spiral down from the branches, and the breeze that now and then drifts past the window starts to carry a wintry chill.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_820_5": "This month is nothing but classes, review, and going back over your mistakes and notes. Mock test after mock test, you hunt down the topics you haven't fully mastered yet...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_820_6": "After class, you sometimes find yourself running between the Administration Building and the Teaching Building, helping your friends with their tasks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_820_7": "You catch Changli and Roccia going over key exam topics together, and run into Xiangli Yao walking classmates through the hardest problems between classes...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_820_8": "Scattered errands and appointments fill every gap in your day to the brim.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_820_9": "You close the finished workbook in your hands, lift your head, and look out the window.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_1": "Today is the day of the Qualifying Exam.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_10": "I know, it's kinda cheesy... but look how I plated it! Doesn't it look just like a perfect 100?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_11": "I mean, it's not magic or anything... but hey, it's gotta bring some good luck",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_12": "It's a perfect 100 for sure. Thank you, Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_13": "You sit down at the table and share a steaming hot breakfast with Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_14": "The familiar aroma of home cooking and the easy mood around you gradually soothe your nerves.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_15": "Admission ticket, pens, everything else you need... You've checked it all, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_16": "Don't worry, I've checked everything. I packed it all last night.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_17": "Then off you go! Good luck on the exam!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_2": "With your morning routine all wrapped up, you change into your uniform, push open your bedroom door, and head for the kitchen.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_3": "As you draw near, you hear the soft clink of dishes from inside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_4": "The sight of that familiar figure catches you by surprise. Abby is always so busy, usually out early and home late. It's rare to find it still at home at this hour.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_5": "Morning, {PlayerName}! I was just about to go wake you up. Did you sleep okay last night?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_6": "...Abby?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_7": "What's with the blank look? Today's your big exam day, so of course I'm seeing you off in person. Come on, chop-chop, go wash your hands!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_8": "With that, Abby turns and bustles about, carrying the breakfast it made to the table dish by dish.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_830_9": "I was worried you'd grab breakfast outside and upset your tummy! Nu-uh, homemade is the only thing you can really trust!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_850_1": "The day after the Qualifying Exam ends, the National Music Competition finals begin.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_850_2": "The Orchestral Music Club will represent Second Solaris School on the stage everyone has been dreaming of.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_850_3": "From the very first regional qualifier to the joint training and elimination rounds that filled the summer, day after day...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_850_4": "Every moment you've shared, every note drifting out of the music classroom windows, every tear of joy and every burst of laughter—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_850_5": "All of it blends into one ensemble piece, a melody that reaches every heart.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_850_6": "Thunderous applause rolls through the audience, and every member on stage has a glimmer in their eyes. Perhaps it's tears waiting to spill, or radiant smiles waiting to break.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_850_7": "The Qualifying Exam, the Nationals... Whatever the final rankings may be, today, the final page of this journey is turned.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_1": "Well, well, you're here. So? How are you settling into school life?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_10": "Hmm... As for that transfer student who rides in a black luxury car, asserts dominance on day one, and has a pack of bodyguards trailing her like a gang princess...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_11": "I mean, we live in a civilized society. There's no such thing as \"gangs\" nowadays.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_12": "Wait... you don't mean <color=#d19f27>Phoebe</color>, do you? No, no, no... there's no way it's that big of a coincidence!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_13": "I think her name was Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_14": "At the name \"Phoebe,\" Abby's face scrunches up, darkening as if it just gulped down a mouthful of spoiled raw seafood.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_15": "Oh, crap. This is just great... So this year's freshman rep is... wait, no, isn't she a second-year...? Great, this is really bad...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_16": "Oh, I know! Even if she's not the \"freshman rep,\" she can still give a speech at the opening ceremony. We'll call it... the \"grade representative\"! That'll definitely work...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_17": "Abby mutters furiously under its breath, pacing back and forth across the desk with its hands clasped behind its back. Suddenly, it lunges forward and grabs you by the shoulders.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_18": "Come now, be a good kid and promise Uncle Abby you'll act like you saw nothing and know nothing, okay?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_19": "Huh?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_2": "You push open the door to find Abby lounging in the executive chair, rocking back and forth mid-yawn. At its size, unless you actively look down at the seat, it's... awfully easy to miss.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_20": "Is she connected to what you've been working on?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_21": "Could she be... our school's mysterious \"Boss Lady\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_22": "Sigh... I knew I couldn't keep it from you. You've always been sharp, ever since you were little...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_23": "Huh? Since when did this school have something like that? Aren't there only the \"Seven Mysteries\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_24": "Seven? That's way too many...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_25": "Ugh, forget it. They're called the \"Seven Mysteries,\" but having eight isn't that unusual, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_26": "Anyway, let's just drop it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_27": "It's true she transferred here just this year and has certain ties to the <color=#d19f27>School Board</color>, but you don't need to worry about her too much.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_28": "That's for the adults to worry about, nothing a student needs to fret over. Now, on to what really matters. Take a look at this.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_29": "Abby points to a framed photograph hanging behind it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_3": "The whole school's just brimming with cheerful vibes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_30": "The office walls are lined with decades of institutional history—trophies, awards, and photos of distinguished alumni. Among them hangs a portrait of a student with black hair and striking golden eyes. The face looks vaguely familiar.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_31": "Hold on—this goes well beyond vaguely familiar.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_32": "Wait, is this my long-lost {Male=older sister;Female=older brother}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_33": "Uh, you aren't seriously expecting me to transform into that for school promo work, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_34": "Huh? How did I not know you had a {Male=older sister;Female=older brother}? Are you some century-old relic who hasn't aged a day?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_35": "...As if.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_36": "Hah?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_37": "Hey, what's going on inside that brain of yours? I'd never ask you to do something so absurd, alright?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_38": "Here, let me introduce you. This is the <color=#d19f27>legendary student</color> who once led our school to its peak.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_39": "Back then, under this <color=#d19f27>legendary student</color>'s leadership, that grade set a <color=#d19f27>Qualifying Exam</color> record no one at our school has broken to this day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_4": "I'm getting more and more worried about my future...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_40": "And the Club Association won <color=#d19f27>national gold</color> and went all the way to the world stage.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_41": "You could say that without this student, this century-old school wouldn't exist as it does today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_42": "So this is a historical figure from a century ago? What's that got to do with me?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_43": "Abby takes a deep breath, its expression growing much more serious.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_44": "The truth is, the school has been struggling for two years. Applications are down.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_45": "I realized that if we want to turn things around, we need another key player like this legendary student.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_46": "Every class has its bright spots, but true legends don't come along that easily. Luckily, this legendary student had the foresight to leave this photo behind...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_47": "That's why I reached out to your family the second I heard you wanted to transfer. We need you to come save the day!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_48": "Abby thumps its chest as it talks, all fired up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_49": "With you on board, plus this principal's visionary leadership, restoring this school to its former glory is far from impossible!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_5": "Huh? Sounds like I missed out on the fun! C'mon, spill the tea!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_50": "Do I really look that much like... this person?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_51": "So the transfer... No, so it was you who \"invited\" me here?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_52": "...Was it really \"visionary leadership\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_53": "You do! You really do! One look and anyone can tell you're the true successor! You're absolutely the right person for this. Come on, let me grab a camera and get a photo of you two!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_54": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_55": "D-don't be mad... Okay, maybe I skipped a few details, but our faculty and facilities are state-of-the-art! Plus, your family agreed to it...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_56": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_57": "Heheh, naturally! Just leave it to me! With the two of us working together, we're bound to make this school great again!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_58": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_59": "All right, all right! No need to get bogged down in all that right now. It's only day one. Been running around all morning—I'm starving.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_6": "Aw, how could that be? A century-old school this prestigious, faculty this outstanding, facilities this advanced, plus your Uncle Abby's flawless management! What could possibly make you uneasy?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_60": "I personally taste-tested every dish in our cafeteria. I even saved a meal box for you. Go on, try it! I guarantee it's delicious!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_61": "Abby flips open two lunch boxes on the desk. As the aroma fills the office, its demeanor brightens instantly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_62": "More than the school's grand future, what your Uncle Abby really wants is for you to enjoy this time—to lead a happy, meaningful student life.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_63": "Mmm... so good, so good...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_64": "Anyway, head back to the classroom after you wrap up lunch. You still have afternoon classes to attend.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_65": "Abby's ramblings between mouthfuls of food are comical, but it's obvious it doesn't plan on digging any deeper into the subject today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_66": "Sharing lunch with Abby helps wash away the morning's fatigue. You gain a better sense of the burdens it carries, and the bond between you deepens.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_67": "That said, you still find it hard to believe that Abby is actually... your \"uncle.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_7": "You sum up everything you've seen these past few days.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_8": "W-well, that... I mean, sure, the Club Association hasn't won a <color=#d19f27>national award</color> in a while...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_85_9": "But there are only so many trophies to go around! The more we take, the less everyone else gets... Our school is generous like that. It's about time the other schools got a turn, don't you think?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_87_1": "Lunch break is over... Compared with this morning's somewhat rushed schedule, the time ahead feels much more open.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_87_2": "Take a walk around the school and get more familiar with the place.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_1": "At the usual after-school club time, you arrive at the Club Association.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_10": "Yeah. The Qualifying Exam is something every student has to take.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_11": "Anyway, the Qualifying Exam alone doesn't decide where we go next.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_12": "Huh? Really? I think I heard President Changli mention that...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_13": "That's right. For students with special talents, doing well at Nationals is another path worth considering.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_14": "I see... So, are you feeling confident about the finals, {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_15": "We're going to win that gold.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_16": "Let's just play like we do in practice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_17": "Are you feeling confident, Cartethyia?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_18": "Yeah! I also believe we can definitely win the gold. Everyone's worked so hard this year, especially you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_19": "So it'll be time to reap what we've all worked for soon, right?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_2": "Cartethyia sits with her head bowed over the table, carefully reviewing the sheet music and joint training logs laid out before her, item by item.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_20": "Right... Everyone's already solid in practice. As long as we play like we always do, the finals are just one more practice session.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_21": "And who knows? Maybe we'll even play better than ever!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_22": "Me? Hmm... Super confident! I've been practicing really hard, you know. And as long as everyone's up on that stage with me, I feel so much calmer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_23": "Besides, we've got you, {PlayerName}. Honestly, whenever the club sees you out in front of us, we all just know it'll be fine this time too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_24": "Let's do this, {PlayerName}! It's our last chance to practice!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_25": "Yep. Let's do our best together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_3": "You're here, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_4": "Ciaccona is making final adjustments to our original piece. I've barely seen her lately.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_5": "As she speaks, she nudges the materials on the table aside a little, making room for you beside her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_6": "After all... the Nationals finals are less than a month away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_7": "Time really flies... It's been a full year of training at your side, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_8": "From the very first qualifier to where we are now, sometimes it's wild to think how long we've been preparing for this.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_900_9": "By the way, you're also taking the Qualifying Exam, right? You must be working so hard.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_90_1": "When the final bell rings, Verina is still deep in a lesson she hasn't finished.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_90_10": "Busy with the <color=#d19f27>School Anniversary</color>, maybe... I'll ask her about it when I get the chance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_90_2": "Before solving this problem, we first need to pay attention to the properties of the function...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_90_3": "Verina pauses mid-sentence, glances down at the time, and only then realizes that class has ended.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_90_4": "Oh? Has the bell already rung? Then let's stop here for today. Class dismissed, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_90_5": "And one last piece of classroom advice for today: plenty of things in this world might lie to you, but math won't. Numbers, at least, are honest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_90_6": "So—no slacking off when you get home. Make sure you review what you've learned! After all, there's a quiz in class tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_90_7": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_90_8": "Amid a chorus of groans, Verina breezes out of the classroom with a spring in her step.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_90_9": "You glance at the seat beside you. Changli hasn't shown up all afternoon, but the people around you seem long used to it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_920_1": "At first, the finals seem comfortably far away. A full thirty days until the competition. Surely there's time for anything.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_920_10": "By the time it sinks in, the calendar has crept right up to the finals. A whole month of preparation really has come and gone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_920_11": "One day the competition still seems far off. The next, the chatter in the room has already shifted to meeting times and reminders for the big day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_920_12": "And now, the National Music Competition finals are only one day away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_920_2": "But once the work really begins, the days race by as if someone has quietly wound the clock forward, leaving you no chance to savor any of them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_920_3": "All across the school, members of each orchestra section can be heard practicing their instruments.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_920_4": "You help everyone refine the repertoire time and again, keep rehearsal records organized, and coordinate the joint training schedule. Even with so much on your plate, you never let your own practice slip.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_920_5": "You watch Ciaccona and Cartethyia drill the same stubborn, off-pitch notes again and again, until the once-stiff passage finally smoothed into a lilting melody.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_920_6": "You're always on the move between the Orchestral Music Club's activity room and the Teaching Building.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_920_7": "Only when you happen to glance out the window do you realize the sunset has long faded and the sky has quietly gone dark.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_920_8": "But the busy days fly by so fast there's no time to stop and look back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_920_9": "Rehearsals bleed into rehearsals, pieces into pieces, accompanied by the lively discussions that spill past every session's end.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_1": "The National Music Competition finals is here as scheduled.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_10": "The moment you finish speaking, Abby seems to remember something else. It hurriedly grabs a golden square pastry and presses it into your hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_11": "The pastry is still faintly warm, and its neat square shape looks especially charming.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_12": "Here, one lucky osmanthus cake before you go! Osmanthus is the flower of victors, so first place is all yours!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_13": "Hehe, I made a batch for your friends in the Orchestral Music Club too! Let's bring them along so we can hand them out when we meet up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_14": "Thank you, Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_15": "Don't mention it! Come on, let's head out together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_16": "...Oh, right. Once the competition starts, where should I sit so you can spot me right away... Though you probably won't have time to look around while you're up there...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_17": "With Abby's quiet muttering in your ear and the faint sweetness of osmanthus cake still lingering in your mouth, your nerves melt away completely before you even notice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_18": "Now, it's time to join your friends on the finals stage and enjoy the performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_2": "You and your friends have agreed to meet at the school gate in the morning, then take the bus to the competition venue together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_3": "With your morning routine all wrapped up, you're about to head out when Abby suddenly bursts out of the study, out of breath. It looks you over, then eyes everything you're carrying.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_4": "I thought... I thought I'd overslept...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_5": "What's wrong, Abby?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_6": "Today's the Nationals finals, right? You're competing in something this big, so of course I'm going to be in the audience cheering you on!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_7": "Abby says it as if it were the most obvious thing in the world, then reaches up to straighten your collar.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_8": "Lookin' sharp! Full of pep! Did you check your instrument and everything for the competition? Sheet music, spares, and an energy drink to keep your stamina up...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_930_9": "Yeah, I've got everything ready.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_950_1": "The exam day, long and fleeting all at once, slips quietly away amid the rustle of turning pages and the scratch of pens.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_950_2": "You step out of the exam hall and stretch toward the setting sun, your back stiff and sore from sitting all day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_950_3": "\"{PlayerName}! Over here!\" \"That was a brutal day of exams, but you made it through! Let's go get some good food to celebrate.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_950_4": "Abby, who has been waiting outside the exam hall all along, clutches a bouquet even bigger than itself and waves at you with all its might.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_950_5": "With that, the Qualifying Exam comes to a close. Tomorrow, the National Music Competition finals await you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_950_6": "The Orchestral Music Club will represent Second Solaris School on the stage everyone has been dreaming of.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_950_7": "The new movement you've created together with your friends in the Orchestral Music Club is yours to bring to life.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_1": "As you leave through the school gates with the departing crowd, the setting spring sun bathes the campus and surrounding streets in warm gold.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_10": "I'd be lying if I said there's no pressure. But I'm already here, so I'll just take it one step at a time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_11": "That sounds tough... Then you probably won't have much time for club activities either, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_12": "Clubs, huh... I haven't really given it much thought.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_13": "If I get the chance, I'd like to give it a try.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_14": "Mm... We're only students once, after all. I think you should join at least one club and experience something you've never tried before.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_15": "So I do recommend giving it a try, {PlayerName}. Besides, all work and no play isn't good for anyone!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_16": "Our school has a pretty wide range of clubs. If you can't make up your mind, you can always bring me along and we'll check them out together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_17": "So you've already decided which club to join, Cartethyia?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_18": "Yep! I've officially joined the <color=#d19f27>Orchestral Music Club</color>. Leader Ciaccona's enthusiasm was just too hard to refuse...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_19": "As she speaks, she pulls a folded slip of paper from her pocket. It's crookedly stamped with the Orchestral Music Club seal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_2": "{PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_20": "Ciaccona really is eager... She got your registration sorted out that fast. Speaking of which, what instrument are you planning to play?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_21": "Care to guess, {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_22": "Violin?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_23": "Flute?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_24": "Triangle?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_25": "Nope! It's the trumpet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_26": "Nope! It's the trumpet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_27": "Nope! It's the trumpet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_28": "The trumpet? That's actually a pretty unique choice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_29": "Mm... maybe it's because I've always loved how a trumpet sounds. Bright and clear—every time I hear it, my mood lifts right along with it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_3": "A bright, cheerful voice calls out to you. You stop and notice a girl waving and hurrying toward you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_30": "And the club happened to be short a trumpeter, so I just went ahead and took the spot.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_31": "Hearing that, you can't help but recall the weekend rehearsal you saw in Central Square, with barely a handful of people there. And what Ciaccona said...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_32": "Is the Orchestral Music Club really that short on members?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_33": "...A \"disbandment crisis\"?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_34": "Yeah... Apparently the club's already at risk of being disbanded for not having enough members...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_35": "It can't be helped, I guess... With the numbers we have right now, we can barely put together a small ensemble.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_36": "Forget winning gold. Right now, we can't even say for sure whether we'll make it through the <color=#d19f27>Nationals qualifiers</color>.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_37": "Cartethyia's voice drops a little, and a flicker of disappointment crosses her face. But a moment later, she draws a breath and turns to you with her smile back in place, her voice ringing with its usual resolve and energy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_38": "But playing alongside everyone and sharing the music together... that joy is precious all on its own. It matters more than any gold prize, don't you think?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_39": "Oh, this is it. I live right around here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_4": "Cartethyia?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_40": "By the way, besides the Club Association's scheduled activities, the Orchestral Music Club is also holding a rehearsal the day after tomorrow. If you're interested, {PlayerName}, why not come watch?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_41": "That means the day after tomorrow is your first official trumpet practice?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_42": "Cartethyia freezes for a split second and blinks. Then, as if something has just dawned on her, she takes half a step back, her ears flushing red.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_43": "Huh? Oh... I—I suppose you're not wrong...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_44": "She lowers her head and nudges a pebble at her feet, then fusses with her hair, her gaze wandering as her words begin to falter.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_45": "Or... maybe wait a little while, {PlayerName}. You can come see us rehearse once you have more free time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_46": "Before you can even answer, Cartethyia turns and bolts into her apartment building.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_47": "Watching her flustered retreat, you shake your head with a helpless laugh, a smile tugging at your lips before you even realize it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_48": "{PlayerName}—",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_49": "Just as you turn to go, Cartethyia's voice rings out behind you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_5": "What a coincidence! Are you headed home this way too? If you don't mind, want to walk together?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_50": "?",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_51": "A second-floor window swings open, and Cartethyia leans halfway out, one hand braced on the sill while the other waves vigorously against the evening breeze.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_52": "The setting sun catches her eyes, outlining her bright, radiant grin in pale gold.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_53": "See you tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_54": "See you tomorrow, Cartethyia.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_55": "If you want to walk an artistic path in the future, the Orchestral Music Club, with its long and storied history, would make a fine starting point... But it would also mean devoting a great deal of time to club activities.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_56": "Most pressing of all, the \"disbandment crisis\" would have to be resolved first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_57": "Still, for now, you seem to have time yet to wait and decide where your future lies...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_6": "Though I don't think I've ever seen you around town before, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_7": "You nod and fill Cartethyia in on your situation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_8": "Oh? So you came from a big city, {PlayerName}...",
+  "EVENT_AVGmain_95_9": "But is it really okay to transfer in your final year? You have to adjust to a whole new environment while dealing with the pressure of your studies...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_100_1": "{PlayerName}, do you have plans for lunch break?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_100_2": "Nothing yet.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_100_3": "When you shake your head, the hint of a smile appears on Changli's face. She carefully puts away the books and stationery on her desk.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_100_4": "If you're free, would you like to join us for tea in the Student Council room?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_100_5": "Sure, I'll be there. Should I prepare anything?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_100_6": "Hmm? There's nothing to prepare, {PlayerName}. Just come as you are. We have nothing important to discuss. I simply thought we could all have a little tea party over lunch.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_100_7": "Changli rises. As she leaves, she glances down and gives you a playful wink.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_100_8": "Think of it as... sneaking a little break with me, for once.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_1": "Summer break has only just begun, but the whole campus already feels wrapped in the long, lazy hush of the holidays. The quiet is almost unfamiliar.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_10": "...Actually, apart from the four of us, no one's come at all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_100": "Place a stack of exam papers on the box.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_101": "Wait.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_102": "You hold out an arm to block their way to the box. As long as you're here, no one's getting any closer...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_103": "There are student records in there. No one can look through them without authorization.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_104": "If the records are damaged or a student's information is leaked, I doubt you can afford to take responsibility.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_105": "You silently apologize to Phoebe. Then, without betraying a thing, you pick up a freshly sorted stack of exam papers and gently place it on the box lid.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_106": "The gap you could have lifted disappears under the weight of the papers. There's nowhere to get a grip.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_107": "The guard's hand stops in midair. He eyes the papers, then looks at you suspiciously.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_108": "You simply straighten the papers in your hands, as though you've done nothing out of the ordinary.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_109": "Student, please stand aside. This is a routine check.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_11": "Perhaps they aren't used to coming to school on the first day of summer break.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_110": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_111": "If you keep objecting, you'll only make it obvious you have something to hide.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_112": "After some agonizing thought, you have no choice but to step away from the box.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_113": "Then, as if in a slow-motion close-up, the guard grips the lid and slowly raises it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_114": "The cardboard scrapes softly in the quiet corridor. Every eye follows the widening gap, and everyone holds their breath.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_115": "But... after a brief silence, your faces freeze at once.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_116": "All you see is the empty bottom of the box. Phoebe, who climbed in moments ago, is nowhere to be seen.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_117": "The air, taut with suspense, suddenly goes still.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_118": "After all that effort chasing Phoebe here, the guards surely didn't expect to find nothing but an empty box.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_119": "Off to one side, Roccia simply stretches with easy grace.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_12": "When you put it like that, we may be asking a bit much of them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_120": "Any more questions? If you're only looking for Phoebe, I suggest you search elsewhere.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_121": "Today is the first day of our summer study sessions. This is the Student Council's workplace, and we can't have outsiders disrupting it all day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_122": "The guards exchange looks, their expressions a sight to behold. After standing dumbfounded at the door for a moment, they can only slink away, disgruntled.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_123": "If you see Miss Phoebe, please notify us immediately.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_124": "Apologies for the disturbance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_125": "Please excuse me for not seeing you out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_126": "Only when the guards vanish down the corridor does Roccia approach the box. She bends down and removes a mirror propped at an angle inside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_127": "Good work, Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_128": "Nowhere to be seen just moments ago, Phoebe now climbs out of the box, seemingly unchanged apart from her slightly mussed hair.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_129": "That was amazing! They didn't find me...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_13": "Yeah... We told everyone about the boot camp in advance, but this is their one long break. Knowing about it and wanting to attend are two different things.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_130": "The box is magical, isn't it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_131": "...I see.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_132": "You offset \"where Phoebe actually was\" from \"where everyone thought the inside of the box was.\" Then, with the way the box blocks their view and the mirror creates a blind spot...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_133": "In other words, you angled the mirror to reflect the \"empty\" part of the box, so no one could see the space where Phoebe was hiding.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_134": "That's right. You're clever, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_135": "That's Roccia for you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_136": "Thank you, everyone. I just... I just didn't want to miss today's study session. But Mr. Fenrico...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_137": "Phoebe turns away, looking guilty. Her voice is faint, and her eyes are a little red.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_138": "I know he doesn't want me spending time with everyone at school anymore. But I...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_139": "It's all right, Phoebe. We understand. And none of this is your fault.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_14": "Xiangli Yao looks at the thick stack of workbooks on the table and spreads his hands helplessly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_140": "Don't blame yourself, Phoebe. You're a member of the Student Council now. This office is always open to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_141": "Yes. And you don't need to worry about the guards. Like I said, there's no safer place to hide than my cardboard box.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_142": "Phoebe looks at you all and sets down the pouch she's been holding. Inside are the study materials she prepared in advance, including plans for getting ahead on next semester's coursework, all sorted by subject.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_143": "She rubs at the corners of her reddened eyes with the back of her hand, takes a quiet breath, and looks up again. A bright smile spreads across her face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_144": "Thank you... Thank you, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_145": "With the commotion over, your study session has finally grown... from four people to five.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_146": "Now that everyone's here, let's return to our meeting.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_147": "As our specially invited Council member, would you like to speak first, {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_148": "Sure.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_149": "Why don't you go first, President Changli?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_15": "I agree. Summer is supposed to be a break. For many students, doing a little homework at home is far more relaxing than coming here to study every day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_150": "Over the summer, I'll be responsible for the boot camp's day-to-day operations and administration.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_151": "President Changli and I will handle all the arrangements together, from venue setup and maintaining a good study environment to refreshments, daily study plans, and coordinating everyone involved.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_152": "Changli turns her head slightly, and her gaze meets yours.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_153": "Her eyes linger on your face. She doesn't speak at once, simply watches you for a moment. Then her eyes soften, and the faintest smile touches her lips.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_154": "I'm grateful to you, {PlayerName}, for accepting my invitation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_155": "With {PlayerName}'s help, I'm sure everyone who attends the study sessions can settle in and make the most of the summer for revision.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_156": "Hehe... No need to be modest, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_157": "Thank you for accepting the Student Council's invitation, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_158": "Though, to be precise, it was a personal favor I asked of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_159": "Over the summer, {PlayerName} will be responsible for the boot camp's day-to-day operations and administration.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_16": "In their shoes, I probably wouldn't want to shut myself back inside the school on the first day of vacation either.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_160": "{PlayerName} and I will handle all the arrangements together, from venue setup and maintaining a good study environment to refreshments, daily study plans, and coordinating everyone involved.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_161": "As for the school's current situation and the problems we face, I won't go over them again here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_162": "Then allow me to explain a few more things.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_163": "The final Qualifying Exam at the end of the year isn't a conventional exam with separate subject papers. It's a selective, cross-disciplinary test.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_164": "Questions will draw on several subjects at once. Besides core knowledge, the exam tests practical application and judgment across disciplines.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_165": "Last-minute cramming in any one subject won't be enough to get a good result.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_166": "Looking at our current grades, getting at least five students to an A grade... won't be easy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_167": "The summer boot camp will mostly involve independent study, but we'll provide specific revision topics, group tutoring, answers to questions, and periodic tests.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_168": "Why does it feel like summer break is already over...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_169": "I think so too. Changli and Xiangli Yao sound like teachers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_17": "I'm good at studying. But studying all the time... gets tiring.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_170": "Teachers? That doesn't sound so bad.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_171": "But our greatest challenge right now is getting students interested in joining the summer boot camp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_172": "After all, even two \"teachers\" are no use if we have no \"students\" here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_173": "(We need more participants...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_174": "(First, I need to get the word out about the summer boot camp. Maybe the school forum can help... I should ask Buling before the weekend.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_175": "Everyone, leave the attendance problem to me for now. As a specially invited Council member, it's part of my job.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_176": "Whether we have a crowd or just a few students, please carry on with the study schedule as planned.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_18": "Changli doesn't argue. She studies the empty seats, lost in thought.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_19": "If so few students come on the first day, even the best study plan won't do much good.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_2": "The once-busy corridor stands mostly empty. Classroom doors and windows are shut, and the occasional figure in the distance soon disappears from view.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_20": "Let's not lose heart. As the saying goes, \"Better to spot a weak point early than get caught off guard when it counts.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_21": "It's better to see where we're falling short now than to scramble for a solution when it truly matters.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_22": "Since no one else has come today, why don't we relax a little and hold a strategy meeting instead?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_23": "Excuse me—",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_24": "Coming through—",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_25": "A familiar voice carries from the far end of the corridor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_26": "The next moment, Phoebe races past the doorway.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_27": "Gone is her usual calm elegance. Her skirt flutters as she runs, a document pouch clutched tight against her chest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_28": "Phoebe barely manages to stop at the door. She catches her breath against the frame, then looks up at everyone inside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_29": "Everyone... Please, help me!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_3": "There's no bell for morning study, no students hurrying down the hall. The sun blazes overhead, and cicadas drone outside the windows.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_30": "Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_31": "What's happened, Phoebe?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_32": "There's no time to explain. Please, I need your help!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_33": "With that, Phoebe squeezes past you all and dives into the office.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_34": "Before anyone can react, hurried footsteps ring out from the other end of the corridor. Several tall figures rush out of the shadows.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_35": "You barely have time to step back before the lead guard stops at the door. The others spread out to form a wall across your exit.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_36": "For a moment, all you can hear is ragged breathing. The black-clad figures block your view entirely.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_37": "Roccia stares wide-eyed for some time before she speaks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_38": "...It's like a movie set.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_39": "Phoebe has taken cover behind the group, trying to hide in your shadow. She answers in a tiny voice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_4": "Only the Student Council office hums with quiet conversation. Prepared study materials sit neatly on the tables, and today's revision schedule is already on the board.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_40": "My father sent them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_41": "All this commotion... Are you in some kind of trouble, Phoebe?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_42": "Don't tell me... Phoebe stole Celestial Steed Corp's company seal? Is this how we defeat Fenrico?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_43": "I would never do that!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_44": "I just wanted to join the study session... But they keep saying I mustn't \"damage the corporation's reputation.\" Surely that's an overreaction.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_45": "She answers so quickly that, even with your back to Phoebe, you can imagine the anxious, flustered look on her face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_46": "(Maybe I shouldn't tell her how over-the-top this looks right now.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_47": "Miss Phoebe, please don't make this difficult for us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_48": "The security chief's tone is respectful, but he leaves no room for negotiation.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_49": "Mr. Fenrico has made it clear: Milady, you are not to take part in any school activities over the summer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_5": "The office, which you expected to be packed, feels strangely spacious. Sorted notes and practice tests sit untouched on the shelves.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_50": "Please come with us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_51": "Phoebe instinctively shrinks back, covering her mouth without a word. She looks up with a frown and gently tugs Roccia's sleeve.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_52": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_53": "(I understand. Leave it to me.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_54": "(Ta-da! A portable cardboard box.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_55": "As if by magic, Roccia pulls a huge purple cardboard box from her tiny pocket. On closer inspection, a face drawn on it seems to be wearing a wicked grin...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_56": "(...Why are you carrying a cardboard box around, Roccia?!)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_57": "(Hide in my box, Phoebe.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_58": "(It's dark and warm inside. There's no safer place to hide than my cardboard box.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_59": "Roccia sounds so certain, so calm. And when you first met her, she popped out of a cardboard box herself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_6": "It's time for the study session to begin, but hardly anyone has shown up. The few people who pass the doorway hurry right by without stopping.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_60": "Honestly, even you start to...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_61": "Feel a strange fondness for the cardboard box...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_62": "No. I'm a mature student. I will not fall for a cardboard box.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_63": "If you climb into the box in front of everyone right now, it might actually be the perfect way to draw the guards' attention.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_64": "But for some reason, looking at the box gives you the sudden urge to play guitar.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_65": "Uh, better not. That would only make an even bigger scene...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_66": "Through sheer willpower, you resist the bizarre impulse.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_67": "Well done, {PlayerName}!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_68": "(Huh? A cardboard box?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_69": "(There's no time to explain, Phoebe. Please, just get in.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_7": "You sit at the table, gazing down the empty corridor until your thoughts begin to drift.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_70": "Phoebe eyes the box, hesitates for two seconds, then squeezes her eyes shut and climbs in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_71": "Everyone, please step aside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_72": "Hello. May I ask who you are...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_73": "We don't mean to disturb you. We're only looking for Miss Phoebe. Your cooperation is appreciated.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_74": "Oh? Phoebe? She isn't here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_75": "Changli remains perfectly composed and signals for you to clear the doorway.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_76": "You come here in force and block our door. Are you trying to drag us students into the commercial dispute between the school and Celestial Steed Corp?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_77": "If memory serves, Principal Abby's wager with Mr. Fenrico doesn't forbid students from organizing their own study sessions over summer break, does it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_78": "You say you \"don't mean to disturb us,\" but clearly, we can no longer concentrate on our work.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_79": "Hehe... I see.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_8": "What's on your mind, {PlayerName}?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_80": "Could this be Celestial Steed Corp's way of unfairly preventing us from meeting the final assessment requirements?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_81": "Perhaps Mr. Fenrico isn't quite as honorable as he appears.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_82": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_83": "Perhaps Changli's poise catches them off guard, or perhaps they know she's right. Either way, the guards are at a loss for words.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_84": "We have studying to do. If you want to search the room, go ahead. Otherwise, there's still time to continue your pursuit elsewhere. The choice is yours.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_85": "Changli gives you a look, then turns and takes her seat at the table.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_86": "Xiangli Yao follows, sorting through his papers. Roccia casually picks up a workbook and begins working intently on the final math problem.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_87": "The guards exchange glances, apparently ready to give up.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_88": "(Achoo!)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_89": "What was that?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_9": "No one seems very interested in the summer boot camp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_90": "Everyone freezes. The guards exchange a glance, then stride into the Student Council office.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_91": "Achoo!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_92": "Roccia, still working on her problem, sniffs. Her voice sounds a little stuffy when she speaks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_93": "Xiangli Yao, how old is this exam practice workbook? It's so dusty I can barely breathe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_94": "Oh, let me think. This one... must be about a hundred years old. Even that legendary student worked through these questions back then.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_95": "Achoo! Every time I turn a page, more dust comes out...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_96": "Roccia's acting is so convincing that even you start to wonder whether that first sneeze was hers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_97": "The guards clearly aren't fooled. They glance at Roccia, then head toward the box.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_98": "As they draw closer, it seems that waiting any longer will leave you no choice but to watch them find Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_10_99": "Speak up to stop the guards.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_1": "You push open the door to the Student Council room. Around the round table, everyone is already busy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_10": "No agenda, no meetings, no exercises to solve. It's almost strange to see the Student Council with nothing pressing to do.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_11": "Everyone settles in. Changli takes a small sip of tea and looks around the table.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_12": "It's been a little while since the semester began. How have you all been?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_13": "Perhaps because of the school, things have been a little busy at home lately...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_14": "Phoebe sets her cup back on its saucer, her voice calm.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_15": "Mr. Fenrico took me along to a dinner party the other day. I believe it had something to do with investment and acquisition agreements.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_16": "As Celestial Steed Corp's heiress, Phoebe has little time to call her own. Family matters, social obligations, and corporate dinners take up so much of it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_17": "There were quite a few familiar faces at the dinner, though plenty were unfamiliar to me. Everyone was engaged in conversations about market trends, investment strategies, and the like, but I could hardly summon any interest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_18": "I'm not yet involved in running the family business, of course. I've only just begun familiarizing myself with a few projects...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_19": "Still, sitting there listening to them discuss business, I honestly felt I'd be more at ease in a classroom.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_2": "Phoebe straightens up from sorting a few unfiled papers at the corner of the table and greets you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_20": "That... I can understand. At an event like that, even sitting there smiling takes a great deal out of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_21": "She can't help giving a rueful laugh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_22": "At least everyone at school genuinely listens to what I have to say... rather than interrupting me only to press me with questions about their own business interests.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_23": "It's not often you hear Phoebe complain like this.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_24": "As for me, I've been quite busy working on the Student Council's website lately.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_25": "Has someone been spamming the suggestion box?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_26": "Xiangli Yao shakes his head and answers with some reluctance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_27": "Not spam, exactly. The number of submissions suddenly shot up. Some discuss alleged leaks of exam questions, some review the cafeteria's new specials, and someone posts some great mysteries every day...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_28": "Sounds like they're using the suggestion box as the school forum.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_29": "Exactly. I asked Buling about it and found out someone had pulled a prank by swapping the two sites' domain names.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_3": "Greetings, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_30": "Fortunately, Buling acted fast. I hear she had the whole thing sorted out in less than half a day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_31": "You can't help picturing it. With Buling on the case, no one's IP address would stay hidden for long.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_32": "Still, it's rather fun to read these less serious submissions now and then.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_33": "Hmm... Lately, people keep asking the school store for toast you can copy text from a textbook onto, eat in one bite, and instantly memorize key exam facts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_34": "Others want an electric fan strong enough to blow the school away, or an animal lamp that turns teachers into monsters. Things like that.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_35": "I make all kinds of gadgets and often lend people a hand. But now everyone keeps asking me to lend them a 'round hand.' I have no idea what that means.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_36": "This feels like an episode I've seen before...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_37": "What about you, Changli? You hardly ever talk about yourself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_38": "...Me? Much the same as always. Classes, Student Council work, and helping out at home.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_39": "I happened upon an old book of Weiqi records. It put me in the mood to play a few games myself, and I've passed quite a few hours that way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_4": "Good afternoon, Phoebe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_40": "The weather's been pleasant, too. I've been taking a detour home after school. I've known this town for more than a decade, yet lately its familiar views have felt quite different.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_41": "Perhaps when your state of mind changes, the world will look different too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_42": "As you chat, the tea is refilled several times. Only a few treats remain.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_43": "We've all been working hard from summer break right through to now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_44": "Yes. It's too early to speak of results, and we still have much to review. New difficulties will surely arise as well.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_45": "But I have faith in everyone now... and in this school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_46": "If we keep this up, I believe we'll be all right.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_47": "Changli stands and pours you more tea. The tea swirls in your cup, and porcelain chimes against the saucer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_48": "The last few cookies on the table still give off a faint buttery scent. Cups and saucers clink softly around you. Resting your cheek on your hand, you slowly close your eyes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_49": "Keep moving forward together, toward your goal of earning an A.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_5": "A languid breeze drifts through the half-open window, stirring the curtains and casting slow-moving shadows across the floor. White porcelain cups dot the table, and fresh-baked treats sit neatly on their plates.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_6": "Xiangli Yao stands beside the table brewing tea. Its fragrance rises with the steam as he carefully turns each cup and sets it before the empty chairs.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_7": "Roccia passes you carrying a tray of cookies and gives you a nod.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_8": "{PlayerName}, you're here. Please sit down.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_110_9": "After greeting everyone, you take a seat at the table and accept a cup of tea from Xiangli Yao.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_1": "The summer sun beats down on the campus. Heat bleaches the air, and even the distant scenery seems veiled in a shimmering haze.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_10": "You lot, take the east stairwell. You, you, you, and you—circle around and block the west rear exit.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_11": "Copy that!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_12": "Everyone else, with me!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_13": "All for your safety, Milady!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_14": "Ngh...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_15": "Phoebe's already anxious eyes widen. Without another moment's rest, she starts running again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_16": "She rounds the corner without checking who's ahead, stumbles, then rushes on with a hand against the wall, nearly tripping several times.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_17": "Milady! Please stop!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_18": "Please be careful, Milady!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_19": "I won't!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_2": "S-stop going after me!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_20": "The words burst out of Phoebe, but her pace doesn't slow in the slightest.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_21": "Milady, the Chairman only wants you to leave the school for a little while.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_22": "As the heiress of Celestial Steed Corp, everything you say and do reflects on the corporation's reputation and image. Please conduct yourself with care at all times.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_23": "This school is no place for you. Remember who you are and where your loyalties lie. Put Celestial Steed Corp's interests first, and stop this willful behavior.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_24": "I've told you already! I! Won't! Go!!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_25": "Then you'll leave us no choice but to use force, Milady.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_26": "...You... Don't even think about it!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_27": "I'm staying at school today! No, I'm staying all summer!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_28": "As if her answer isn't forceful enough, Phoebe hugs the pouch tighter and runs faster.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_29": "But the footsteps behind her draw closer and closer, like a net tightening around her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_3": "A cry approaches amid a flurry of footsteps. The heels strike the ground in a frantic, uneven rhythm, nothing like the composure expected of a \"corporate heir.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_30": "Phoebe bites her lip. Sweat soaks the back of her shirt, and beads of it stream down her face.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_31": "She passes classroom after classroom, then brakes sharply at a fork, nearly colliding with the corner. The pouch almost slips from her grasp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_32": "Phoebe catches herself against the wall and scans her surroundings in a panic.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_33": "(Calm down, Phoebe... You've been here for a whole semester.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_34": "(You know which way leads to the Teaching Building's back door. You know the shortcuts better than they do.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_35": "For a moment, the corner hides her from the guards' sight. She slows, slips along the wall around a landscaped flowerbed, then darts out the other side.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_36": "Phoebe summons the last of her strength to sprint down the slope. Gritting her teeth, she turns into the Administration Building.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_37": "(I'm sorry, everyone on the Council...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_38": "(I'm sorry to put you all through this.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_39": "The Celestial Steed Corp guards stop at the fork. One crouches to examine the footprints on the ground for a couple of seconds.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_4": "Clearly, she has no time to worry about appearances.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_40": "The security chief shades his eyes from the glaring sun. Looking past the shifting patches of light, he soon spots the fleeing figure ahead.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_41": "He silently signals two guards to stay behind and make sure their lady can't double back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_42": "Mr. Fenrico's orders. We bring Milady back to the corporation today, no matter what.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_43": "Yes, sir! Mr. Fenrico's will is our command!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_44": "For Milady!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_45": "For Milady!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_5": "Her carefully styled hair is windblown and disheveled, loose strands clinging to her forehead. Exertion has flushed her pale cheeks pink.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_6": "Phoebe clutches a document pouch stuffed with study materials to her chest, her jacket draped over her other arm. She bends over, braces a hand on her knee, and gasps for breath.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_7": "In the confusion, Phoebe glances back. Several figures are closing in from the far end of the corridor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_8": "Celestial Steed Corp security guards pursue her, swift and silent in matching black uniforms, sunglasses hiding half their faces.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_1_9": "The guard in front raises a hand. At his signal, the others split up to block the corridor exits from both sides.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_1": "On a summer afternoon, the classroom is so quiet you can hear pages turning.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_10": "Even those who were sitting up straight begin to slump, leaning sideways in their chairs or resting their heads on their desks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_11": "Little by little, the seemingly endless afternoon wears away everyone's concentration.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_12": "Ah... I'm so tired. And so bored.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_13": "How much longer until today's study session is over...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_14": "For the first few days, the study sessions still feel fresh. Students flip quickly through their workbooks, pens scratching against paper almost nonstop.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_15": "But it's still a boot camp. The novelty melts away faster than ice in the midday sun.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_16": "Only two weeks in, you notice students drawing little stick-figure battles in the margins of their test papers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_17": "Why does time fly when I'm asleep, but drag forever when I'm studying...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_18": "Ugh... Young people like me are in our prime for falling asleep the second our heads hit the desk.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_19": "After complaining, the two close their books and bury their faces in their arms, as if they can hide from the work.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_2": "Sunlight splashes a blinding patch of white across the desks. Even with the air conditioning set low, a stifling heat still hangs over everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_20": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_21": "Changli leans back in her chair, idly twirling a pen as she watches in silence.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_22": "A moment later, she stands and lets out a barely audible sigh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_23": "Everyone, let's stop here for today. You've worked hard all week. Get some rest, and we'll continue as planned tomorrow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_24": "Of course, anyone who wants to stay and keep studying is welcome to do so.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_25": "The words have barely left her mouth when the lifeless room springs back to life.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_26": "Yes! We're finally done!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_27": "That's it, everyone. Let's go home!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_28": "Changli comes over to your desk, leans down slightly, and taps it gently with her knuckles.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_29": "{PlayerName}, come to the Council office with me. We need to have a quick meeting.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_3": "Outside and in the halls, hardly a voice is heard. The athletic field lies nearly empty, and the occasional burst of laughter is swallowed by the summer heat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_30": "Sure.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_4": "The students at the study session are absorbed in their books. All around them, the only sound is the soft rustling of pages turning, one after another.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_5": "At first, everyone manages to stay focused, poring over their books, working through practice questions, and occasionally flipping through their study materials to jot down a few notes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_6": "But as the afternoon wears on, something in the classroom always begins to shift.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_7": "The rustling of pages gradually dies away. Pens hover over the paper for longer and longer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_8": "One student stares blankly at the same question, cheek resting in hand, idly poking at the page with a pen, lost in a daydream.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_20_9": "Another steals a glance at the clock on the wall, then looks back down as though nothing happened, muttering about how slowly time is passing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_1": "The sunlight outside still burns hot. Shut windows muffle the cicadas' cries to a distant hum.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_10": "Um, President Changli... Sorry to interrupt...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_100": "If you ever have a question, {PlayerName}, you can ask me anytime. There's no need to wait for the Q&A session.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_101": "It was just a little nudge. More than anything, I want everyone to get something out of the boot camp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_102": "All right, it's getting late. Let's all head home early and get some rest...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_103": "Lady Phoebe! Lady Phoebe!!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_104": "H-huh?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_105": "Why am I involved now?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_106": "About the study-session rewards! I want a pastry handed to me by Lady Phoebe herself!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_107": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_108": "Before anyone can react, three dark figures come darting in through the doorway.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_109": "Take him away!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_11": "It's all right. Is something troubling you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_110": "Yes, sir! All for Milady!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_111": "Protect Milady!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_112": "Three guards in black suits step forward almost in unison. They seize the student by both arms and lift them clean off the floor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_113": "Lady Phoebe! I'll be back!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_114": "Ahaha... Sorry about that!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_115": "Phew... They're finally gone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_116": "Everyone exchanges a look, then glances at Roccia slumped wearily over the edge of her box. Laughter breaks out around the room.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_117": "They seem more interested than we thought. Maybe this is a good start.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_118": "Let's give it everything we've got, everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_12": "I want to... quit the summer boot camp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_13": "It's not that there's anything wrong with the boot camp. It's just... no matter how hard I study, I can't seem to make any progress.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_14": "Her voice dwindles. She clutches the books against her chest so tightly that her fingertips turn pale.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_15": "Everyone else has been improving these past two weeks, but half the time... I can't even follow what they're talking about. I just don't understand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_16": "If I stay, I'll only waste everyone's time. I don't see the point.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_17": "A student like me... will never get an A.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_18": "Changli looks at her, her voice softening.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_19": "You've been worrying about the distance between yourself and an A all this time, haven't you? Is that what's getting to you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_2": "A week's worth of schedules and records pile up on the Student Council office desk. The pages curl from handling, and several red pens lie scattered beside them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_20": "I remember your name.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_21": "Changli doesn't rush to continue. She glances at the crumpled workbooks in the girl's hands, her expression composed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_22": "When you first arrived, even the basic questions gave you trouble.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_23": "I remember how long it took you to work through a single problem from start to finish.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_24": "Mm...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_25": "But if you tried those problems again now, the ones you found so difficult two weeks ago...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_26": "Changli taps the desk lightly with a fingertip. The faintest smile touches her lips.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_27": "Would they still seem so hard?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_28": "I... I think I could...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_29": "The summer boot camp aims to help everyone earn an A. But practice and revision are only ways to get there, not what truly matters.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_3": "Changli sits beside you, turning through the attendance sheets from the past few days one page at a time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_30": "What matters more are the abilities you build along the way: thinking more broadly and quickly, and using what you've learned to understand the patterns behind things.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_31": "The drive to improve. The resilience to grow through setbacks. Learning to work with others and challenge one another... and finding the courage to keep pursuing your own goals.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_32": "Even if we don't get the results we hoped for, I want everyone to know they gave it their all.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_33": "If you find some satisfaction in that, why not keep at it for another week?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_34": "Okay...! I understand. Thank you, President Changli. And thank you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_35": "She bows deeply to you both, then leaves the Student Council office with a spring in her step.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_36": "The room falls quiet again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_37": "Mm. I think I get why fewer people are coming to the study sessions now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_38": "The goal of an A feels impossible to reach.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_39": "It takes too long to see the results of your hard work.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_4": "It seems fewer and fewer students are coming to the study sessions lately.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_40": "Huh? Who even likes studying?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_41": "When someone's only just begun trying, an A can feel impossibly far away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_42": "Take what happened today. A student can finish everything on their study plan and still see no hope of earning an A because they started so far behind...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_43": "Then the next day, they might feel like all that effort was for nothing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_44": "The Qualifying Exam matters, of course. But the prospect of a good score six months from now doesn't make today's practice problems any less tedious.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_45": "If we want everyone to see this through, the Qualifying Exam can't be their only chance to get feedback on their efforts.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_46": "That's why I think the girl we spoke to today needs a goal she can reach sooner.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_47": "Everyone knows their Qualifying Exam results will affect their chances of further study...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_48": "Mm. But not wanting to study during summer break is normal, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_49": "Maybe we don't hate learning itself. What we dislike is how much work it takes, how long we have to wait for results, and how discouraging it can be.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_5": "We haven't changed the schedule, and we announced all the topics in advance... It shouldn't be a communication problem.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_50": "Our brains naturally try to save effort. As we saw today, the less point students see in studying, the more they resist it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_51": "That would explain why someone might happily spend three hours researching something they love, yet struggle to sit at a desk for twenty minutes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_52": "It's not so much that they dislike learning. Rather...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_53": "People enjoy gaining knowledge and skills, but they don't necessarily enjoy the work it takes to acquire them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_54": "What if... we offered everyone a reward?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_55": "Something like an extra treat when they finish their study goals for the day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_56": "I know the owner of a dessert shop called Treats of the Deep. I could ask them to make some pastries for everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_57": "They're just ordinary little pastries, but at least everyone would feel their efforts had paid off.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_58": "...Treats of the Deep? Ordinary pastries?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_59": "Phoebe, you don't mean THE Treats of the Deep, do you? The place where you have to book six months in advance, they offer only thirty items a day, you have to prove your financial standing just to get in, and each customer gets a private appointment?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_6": "Some students were fairly enthusiastic last week, but they've started asking for leave this week. Their reasons are much the same, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_60": "Huh? Is it really that difficult? My family always orders our afternoon tea from there. I just thought it tasted quite nice...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_61": "Thank you, Phoebe...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_62": "A fine idea. It will do more to keep people going than simply telling them that hard work will eventually lead to good grades.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_63": "And everyone can set daily goals to suit their own level. Meet your own goal, earn a reward, regardless of your grades.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_64": "If someone goes beyond their goal by solving a problem they used to struggle with, or by helping a classmate after finishing their own work, they can earn an extra reward.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_65": "Uh, I wasn't eavesdropping! I was just passing by, that's all!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_66": "But did I hear right? If we come to the study sessions every day, we'll get a reward?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_67": "We'll try it for a week first. If attendance really improves, we'll make it a regular thing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_68": "I love the idea! But about the reward... could I have something other than pastries?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_69": "Are they too ordinary after all...?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_7": "I can't really blame them. Once the novelty of the first week wears off, what remains is studying day after day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_70": "The student waves her hands frantically and rushes to explain.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_71": "No, no! I've always wanted to try the pastries from Treats of the Deep! It's just that I... I...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_72": "I also really want a signed photo of Roccia!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_73": "...?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_74": "You've never mentioned it, Roccia, but I grew up watching your movies!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_75": "(...Roccia's movies?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_76": "The girl closes her eyes, takes a deep breath, and suddenly launches into a dramatic performance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_77": "\"Roccia, I'd give you anything! Even... my life.\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_78": "\"Every land beneath the sun shall be yours!\"",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_79": "D-don't recite that... Box...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_8": "For someone who didn't like studying to begin with, it's no different from regular classes. Willpower alone won't get them through a whole summer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_80": "In a flash, Roccia dives straight into her cardboard box. It's dark and warm inside, safer than anywhere else.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_81": "Huh? Roccia? Where did Roccia go?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_82": "Ahem. Sorry about that.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_83": "I know how exciting it is to meet someone you admire. You can love Roccia's films, but please give her some privacy at school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_84": "As for the signed photo... we'll see what we can do.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_85": "Wah... For Roccia, I'll be here rain or shine! Count me in for the summer boot camp!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_86": "You finally usher Roccia's devoted fan out the door. Just as you're about to breathe a sigh of relief, another figure pops up in the doorway.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_87": "Roccia, who has only just poked her head out of the box, immediately ducks back inside.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_88": "Me! I want something too!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_89": "If possible, could my reward be a chance to say a few words to Xiangli Yao?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_9": "So... as time goes on, fewer students will be willing to keep coming every day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_90": "...Huh?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_91": "Of course.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_92": "The Student Council organized the summer boot camp not just for the school, but because we genuinely want to help everyone.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_93": "In a few weeks, we'll hold a question-and-answer session on past exam papers. If you come across anything you can't solve while revising, or a question you can't quite figure out...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_94": "Feel free to ask me.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_95": "I-I'll work through every single past paper!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_96": "Thank you, Xiangli Yao! I'm going to buy some practice books and start working on them as soon as I get home!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_97": "You watch the student run off, practically skipping. When you turn to Xiangli Yao, you catch a hint of resignation in his eyes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_98": "I'll be counting on you at the past-paper Q&A too, Xiangli Yao.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_30_99": "That's Xiangli Yao for you. You knew just how to motivate them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_35_1": "You and Changli realize that the Qualifying Exam is too distant a goal. Willpower alone won't keep everyone going.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_35_2": "After talking it over with everyone, you decide to pilot a new reward system for one week, hoping it will bring more students to the summer boot camp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_35_3": "To your surprise, the rewards catch many students' interest. Some even come after hearing about them, tentatively asking for special prizes of their own.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_35_4": "Before long, everyone grows used to studying together and talking through problems side by side.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_35_5": "They work through hard problems, share a pastry, then walk home together, laughing and trading secrets with friends their own age.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_35_6": "Before you know it, half the long summer break is gone. The days fly by, filling the once-blank calendar with colorful squares.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_35_7": "Yet as they spend each day together, the gaps in their grades, present from the start, become ever more apparent.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_35_8": "In the blink of an eye, August arrives.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_35_9": "As time passes, the problems pushed aside by busy days and the feelings hidden beneath the laughter quietly rise to the surface...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_1": "By August, the Student Council's summer boot camp is in full swing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_10": "Hmm...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_11": "Roccia looks up from the pile of books, chews on her pencil for a moment, and says offhandedly:",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_12": "For a constrained extremum of a multivariable function, you can use Lagrange multipliers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_13": "See? Even Roccia says it's Lagrange! Come on, we're friends. You trust me, don't you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_14": "Huh? What are you babbling about? Lagrange's mean value theorem and Lagrange multipliers aren't even the same thing. You'd hardly ever use both in one problem!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_15": "Ugh... I have no idea what any of that means...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_16": "Who's Lagrange, anyway? Is he Roccia's friend? How does everyone know him? Nobody introduced me...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_17": "Everyone, you must be tired. Would anyone like a pastry?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_18": "(Chief, if someone turns down Milady's kindness, should we just...?)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_19": "(...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_2": "Phoebe's reward system is working, too. Nearly every day, the office used for the study sessions is packed with students.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_20": "(Never mind. Leave the kids be.)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_21": "At some point, the students who began as strangers get to know one another. Now they sit in little groups around the round table in the office.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_22": "Even the girl who used to sit alone in a corner and once asked to leave begins quietly offering her own thoughts during discussions.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_23": "The recent progress quiz shows how far everyone has come since arriving.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_24": "Looking back now, that first day of study sessions was only a few weeks ago.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_25": "Back then, most seats around the Student Council table stood empty. Whenever you looked up, you met only a handful of fellow Council members.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_26": "Now, as you take in the lively scene before you, that quiet day feels so distant it hardly seems real.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_27": "...Hehe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_28": "The Student Council President watches it all in silence. Now and then, a faint smile touches her lips.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_29": "Wrong again...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_3": "Heads bent over workbooks, they keep their pencils moving. Those who finish early drag their chairs over to classmates, gathering in small groups to discuss the problems in hushed voices.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_30": "The girl murmurs the answer under her breath, her brow furrowing deeper.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_31": "She has tried three times already. Her scratch paper is crowded with crossed-out calculations, and she can't tell where she's going wrong. Each attempt gives her a different answer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_32": "At last, she sighs, picks up her workbook, and walks over to the table where one of the top students sits.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_33": "Sorry, could you walk me through this problem one more time? I still don't think I get it...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_34": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_35": "But the other student is clearly still caught up in the Lagrange debate. The unexpected question brings their pen to a halt.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_36": "Xiangli Yao explained this yesterday, didn't he? Maybe try thinking it through on your own first?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_37": "I know, but I don't understand how to apply it to this question...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_38": "Ugh, I still have my own practice problems to finish today.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_39": "At the unmistakable chill in the student's voice, she freezes. Clutching her workbook, she takes a few awkward steps back and quietly returns to her seat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_4": "The once-quiet room gradually fills with conversation and grows livelier by the day. But as the discussion goes on, a few voices begin to rise without anyone noticing...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_40": "You put down your pen and walk over to her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_41": "What's wrong? Which problem is giving you trouble? Let me see.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_42": "Do you think she's even listening? We've explained it so many times already.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_43": "How should I know?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_44": "Their voices are low, but not low enough to keep you from hearing. The girl beside you flinches, then slowly bites down on her lip.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_45": "It's okay... I'll think about it some more. You should get back to studying, {PlayerName}. I don't want to bother you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_46": "Head bowed, her voice trembles. She grips her workbook until her knuckles turn white.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_47": "...But if I weren't trying, why would I come here every day? I ask because I don't know how to do it. I want to learn.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_48": "Her bangs fall across her eyes, hiding her expression from you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_49": "It's okay. Try not to take it to heart. The heat's been getting to everyone lately.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_5": "You can't just cancel out both sides like that!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_50": "Getting started is the hardest part. You've kept showing up and working toward your goal, and that takes real determination.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_51": "The problems themselves might not go away. Moving forward and growing doesn't necessarily mean you'll face fewer difficulties. But over time, the pain and helplessness you feel when facing them will gradually ease.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_52": "None of you need to be too hard on yourselves, or worry too much about it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_53": "Oh, how nice it must be to get good grades. You finish fast and then make snide remarks like it's nothing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_54": "Who are you talking about?!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_55": "Do you have any idea how much time I spend studying every day? It's easy for you to throw accusations around. What, do you think I'm a genius who was born knowing everything?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_56": "I have my own schedule, my own work, my own plans every day. Just because I get good grades, I'm supposed to give up my time to help you? Is that it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_57": "Tch. Did anyone beg you to explain anything?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_58": "Please, calm down!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_59": "Kindness is a virtue every student should uphold, and it makes tea break all the sweeter. Don't let this little disagreement keep you from enjoying your time at the study session.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_6": "Why not? Look here. The question gives you exactly the condition you need!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_60": "(...)",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_61": "Thanks to Phoebe, the arguing students fall silent at once, shivering in unison under the guards' menacing glares.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_62": "The blonde girl's smile is gentle and warm. All around her, no one says a word.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_63": "But I don't want this either...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_64": "A soft sob comes from beside you. You turn to see tears rolling down the girl's cheeks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_65": "Every time I ask a question, you tell me it's fine, that you don't mind. But the way you look at me... You really think I'm stupid and a nuisance, don't you?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_66": "I want to do better, too! But knowing I'll have to interrupt you again, take up your time just so you can help me... that hurts. It feels awful always needing someone else to teach me!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_67": "You're right. I really am different from the rest of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_68": "I'm not as smart, and my grades aren't as good. I'm the first one here every day and the last to leave, but what good has it done?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_69": "In the end, only five of us need to earn an A. So why should I spend so much time helping people who'll never get one?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_7": "The two argue until they're red in the face. Finally they lay the workbook between them and point at their answers, neither willing to budge.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_70": "Maybe you should look at what you're doing wrong. It's been weeks and you haven't improved at all. You're doing nothing to help us reach our goal of an A.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_71": "The words come out before the speaker can think. Even he freezes, realizing he's gone too far. But the words can't be taken back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_72": "The color drains from the girl's face. Her lips go pale. After standing there in a daze, she suddenly twists her mouth into a strained little smile.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_73": "Yes, you're all so capable, and I'm just that bad. Go on studying. I won't bother you anymore.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_74": "Exactly. If the goal is an A, I guess it had nothing to do with me anyway. I'm not worth your time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_75": "I just don't understand. Does getting poor grades mean we're worthless? If the future belongs to the students who earn an A, what happens to us?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_76": "Have our lives been a waste from the very beginning? Do they mean nothing?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_77": "...If that's how it is, then there's nothing more to say.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_78": "BANG!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_79": "The office door slams behind her. The sound bursts through the room and echoes down the corridor, taking a long while to fade.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_8": "What problem? Let me see... Ah, one look tells me: Lagrange's mean value theorem. Done!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_80": "Those who stood together only moments ago exchange uneasy glances. Nobody speaks. Someone opens their mouth as if to say something, then sighs and looks away.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_81": "Let's call it a day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_82": "A few small, grating scrapes come from chair legs dragging across the floor. The remaining students silently pack up their things and leave.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_83": "How did it come to this...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_84": "Perhaps there was never a clear right or wrong here.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_85": "Mm. No one really did anything wrong. Everyone is carrying their own pressures and facing problems they can't ignore.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_86": "Their hopes and hardships have collided. And we can't turn away from the reality in front of us.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_87": "...Five students must reach an A grade if we're to save the school.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_88": "At the same time, the Student Council has a goal of its own: to help everyone willing to try come away with better results than they had at the start of summer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_89": "I'll speak with her again.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_40_9": "Why do you bring up Lagrange every time you see a limit?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_45_1": "At the Student Council's summer boot camp, one student's long-buried feelings of inadequacy and hurt finally erupt when a math problem eludes her and her campmates turn cold...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_45_10": "The cicadas' calls grow sparse, and the sun sets earlier each day. The last golden light on the windowpane soon fades with the falling dusk.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_45_11": "The evening breeze is less stifling, and even the once-popular iced drinks lose some of their appeal.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_45_12": "One practice paper follows another. Now only one final night of the summer boot camp remains.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_45_2": "Yet the other students face real pressure to study, and their time for revision is limited.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_45_3": "Perhaps it isn't so easy to say who's right and who's wrong...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_45_4": "Overcome with self-doubt and uncertainty about her future, the girl leaves the summer boot camp.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_45_5": "For a time, the once-harmonious atmosphere of the study sessions sinks to a low point.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_45_6": "After the argument, Changli speaks to each side in private. But the girl who left does not return to the study sessions.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_45_7": "In the days that follow, studying still fills most of their summer schedule.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_45_8": "Everyone tacitly avoids the subject, as though keeping quiet could make it seem nothing ever happened.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_45_9": "But time does not stop for an argument.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_1": "You write the word \"Solution:\" on the last practice paper. When you look up, night has quietly fallen beyond the window.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_10": "Before classes begin, we ought to do something that has nothing to do with studying.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_11": "School starts next week. We've all studied so hard; we deserve a treat.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_12": "How about we all go out for dinner?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_13": "School starts next week. After all our hard work, this is our chance to make a special memory together.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_14": "Why not break the rules for once? A little rebellion is one of the privileges of being young.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_15": "Heh. You're not doing that without me!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_16": "What're you planning? Food? Where? Hotpot, maybe?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_17": "...Abby? What are you doing here?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_18": "The new semester's about to begin, and as the Principal, I've got to check all facilities in the school in advance.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_19": "They haven't been used in two months. If something breaks on the first day, it'll hold up your classes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_2": "Dusk creeps over the windowsill. In the Student Council's floor-to-ceiling windows, only the warm glow inside and your own reflection remain.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_20": "I was passing the Administration Building when I saw a light on up here. Thought some careless kid had gone home without turning it off. Didn't expect to find you still studying.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_21": "Hands on its hips, Abby slowly looks each of you over. The hint of a smile on its face gives way to a stern expression.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_22": "Still, whatever you're planning, you should head home soon.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_23": "The rules are clear: no students on campus at night, for any reason. Even during summer break, I'm still responsible for you kids.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_24": "And if any of you has nowhere to go, or a home you can't go back to, you can always stay at my place for the night.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_25": "Abby, what happens if someone breaks a school rule?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_26": "Depends how serious it is. School service, suspension from group activities, disciplinary probation, or suspension from classes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_27": "For students your grade, depending on the circumstances, expulsion is also on the table.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_28": "Wait. Why are you asking? You're not thinking of...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_29": "What if a student who's about to graduate breaks a rule?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_3": "The Teaching Building stands dark in the distance. The already spacious lounge is deserted, and even the square where students so often linger is nothing but a silent outline.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_30": "Abby opens its mouth, its face scrunching up, but gives no answer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_31": "The others catch your meaning and fall quiet. They look between you and Abby, full of questions no one quite dares to ask.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_32": "Uh... {PlayerName}, did you ask me something? Something about rules? My ears were full of fur. Didn't catch a word.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_33": "You know what they say: you can't be blamed for what you don't know. I'm not some stuffy old Principal who makes students memorize every rule at Second Solaris School.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_34": "So, um... Well...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_35": "Abby covers its eyes and shakes its head with theatrical vigor.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_36": "I can't see a thing! Not a thing! And I have no idea where you're going or what you're doing!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_37": "It's okay, Abby. This is my decision. I won't tell anyone you knew.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_38": "Everyone, how about we light some sparklers on the school building's rooftop tonight?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_39": "Now? The rooftop door must be locked by this hour.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_4": "Pens lie scattered among the pages. A sliver of moonlight slips between the buildings, bathing the scribbled scratch paper and half-empty glass on the desk in a cool blue.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_40": "A rare chance for a late-night school adventure. I'm in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_41": "I don't think this is really about whether it's an \"adventure\"...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_42": "Wouldn't that be... trespassing?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_43": "Still, just this once should be all right... shouldn't it?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_44": "Changli laughs softly and shakes her head with a sigh. Then she raises both hands in mock surrender.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_45": "If everyone agrees, who am I, as Student Council President, to object?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_46": "I agree too. After all, the Student Council exists to serve the students.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_47": "How about you joining us, Abby? After all...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_48": "They can't punish all of us. Isn't that right, Principal Abby?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_49": "D-don't ask me! I can't hear a thing, and I don't know a thing!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_5": "Xiangli Yao closes his book and leans back. Changli rolls her shoulders and begins sorting the last of the summer's records.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_50": "Come with us, Principal Abby. Phoebe brought plenty of pastries today. We can share them with you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_51": "Pastries... Mm. Pastries...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_52": "Faced with such a powerful temptation, Abby agonizes over the choice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_53": "No, no, I can't go. You kids have fun, and stay safe.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_54": "I'll call Ms. Galbrena and Ms. Verina to stay with you. I can't leave a bunch of kids alone at school this late...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_55": "Thank you, Principal Abby.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_56": "{PlayerName}, go on ahead with everyone. I have something to take care of. I'll join you shortly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_6": "Roccia dozes with her head on the desk. Phoebe tiptoes over and drapes a light blanket across her shoulders.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_7": "Study sessions, Q&As... You've spent most of nearly every day here this summer. Before you know it, summer break is almost over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_8": "Before you know it, summer break is almost over.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_50_9": "School starts next week. Let's relax tonight.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_1": "Under cover of night, you pry open the iron door and slip onto the Teaching Building's rooftop.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_10": "With preparations nearly done, you sit side by side near the edge of the rooftop, drifting from one topic to another while you wait for Changli.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_100": "Thank you... Thank you, all of you...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_101": "I won't keep running away... I don't want to live with regrets anymore.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_102": "All the pressure and exhaustion of these past weeks, all the hurt and sorrow she has had nowhere to share, finally find a way out.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_103": "She cries without holding back, letting out everything she's swallowed alone these past weeks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_104": "Phoebe gets up and slowly walks over. The blonde girl puts her arms around her in a gentle embrace.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_105": "Tiny sparks flare to life in Roccia's hand, their faint, warm glow blooming quietly in the night.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_106": "The wrappers scattered across the ground, the figures sitting side by side, and the distant town sinking into darkness are all briefly outlined in the brilliant light.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_107": "The little sparkler shimmers softly, as though a star has been lit within arm's reach on this summer night.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_108": "Hey! You lot!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_109": "Go! Leave the stuff! Just run!!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_11": "President Changli always seems so busy... I hardly ever see her rest. Come to think of it, she was the one who introduced me to the school when I first arrived.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_110": "...Principal Abby?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_111": "Before anyone can react, Abby comes scrambling through the rooftop doorway, breathless and stumbling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_112": "Celestial Steed Corp's security guards are coming! If you don't leave now, you're done for!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_113": "Huh?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_114": "Phoebe freezes, her eyes going wide. Then she remembers something, and her face turns rigid.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_115": "Oh no...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_116": "I forgot to tell my father I'd be home late today!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_117": "Forget that! They're locking down the school! They said if they don't see Phoebe, the school won't live to see the sunrise!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_118": "The warmth that has filled the rooftop vanishes in an instant. Everyone seated together a moment ago scrambles in all directions.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_119": "Galbrena reacts first. Without a word, she scoops up Verina and Roccia, hoists them over her shoulders, and charges ahead with both of them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_12": "I heard later that President Changli mistook someone for me that day. I don't know who it was, but I feel as though I caused them an awful lot of trouble...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_120": "Whoa! Ms. Galbrena!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_121": "I-I'm so sorry, everyone. I'll make it up to you when school starts!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_122": "Phoebe bows deeply to all of you, then hurries out the door, too flustered to worry about anything else.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_123": "The neatly arranged sparklers and water bucket are knocked askew in the rush. A few unlit sparklers roll across the ground.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_124": "Behind you, the girl who was sobbing only minutes ago stares blankly at the chaos, dabbing her still-damp eyes with the back of her hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_125": "Pfft...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_126": "Hahahaha...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_127": "Her cheeks are still wet with tears, but she's laughing now.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_128": "You, Changli, and Xiangli Yao exchange a look and shake your heads helplessly.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_129": "Don't just stand still! They're almost here!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_13": "Sigh... If I had my way, Mr. Fenrico wouldn't send so many people to follow me every day.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_130": "Off you go! I'll hold them off for as long as I can. Leave what's left to me!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_131": "Abby wheels around, fiercely rolls up its sleeves, and plants itself in the doorway, ready to face down Celestial Steed Corp's guards.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_132": "At Abby's urging, you race down the stairs too. Only when you reach the bend do you glance back.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_133": "The deep-blue night stretches away above the town's distant lights. Higher still, the stars look clearer than they do on any ordinary night.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_134": "They hang at the edge of the sky, one after another. Though each is far from the next, together they form a vast river of stars.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_135": "They look down on the lights and the people, watching this noisy, fleeting summer.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_136": "Beneath the still night sky, your summer together comes quietly to a close.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_14": "But when I first met Phoebe, I could tell she wasn't as hard to talk to as she looked. She's a good friend.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_15": "I'm more worried about Changli. She works so hard. It would be awful if she fell ill.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_16": "{PlayerName}, you should tell Changli to rest more too. She shouldn't push herself so hard.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_17": "The breeze slips between the rooftop railings, curling the sparklers' wrappers with a faint rustle against the ground.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_18": "After the conversation wanders through several more subjects, Changli finally pushes open the rooftop door. She steps aside to reveal someone behind her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_19": "A girl follows her out timidly. She hesitates by the door, looking toward your group with an uneasy, uncertain expression.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_2": "The moment you push open the metal door, the night breeze rushes over you, sweeping away much of the heat built up during the climb.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_20": "The conversation dies away. Phoebe is the first to recognize her.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_21": "...You?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_22": "I'm sorry. I...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_23": "The girl presses her lips together and swallows the rest of her words.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_24": "Since the argument, she's left the summer boot camp. You and Changli have each gone to talk to her a few times, but she hasn't returned to the study group.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_25": "Changli seems entirely at ease. She walks over unhurriedly and sets down the convenience-store bag she's carrying.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_26": "Sorry to keep you waiting. I stopped to buy some drinks on the way.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_27": "Please, sit with us. We needn't bring up what happened before. I only invited you because sparklers are more fun with company, nothing more.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_28": "After a long hesitation, the girl reaches out to take a sparkler from Roccia and cautiously sits beside you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_29": "Changli gives her own sparkler a little wave and turns to you with a gentle smile, as if she's been waiting for this moment for a long time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_3": "The stars... They're beautiful...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_30": "Now that everyone's here, the first sparkler of the night...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_31": "Is yours to light, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_32": "All eyes turn to you. You take the sparkler from Changli and nod at their expectant faces.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_33": "Sure.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_34": "Fsssh!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_35": "A tiny flame leaps up. Bright orange fire races along the sparkler, bursting into colorful streamers and a shower of sparks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_36": "Light ripples across the rooftop. Red, blue, and gold sparks flicker before your eyes, like a small patch of starry sky blossoming in your hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_37": "So close you could almost touch them, the sparks bloom, fade, and bloom again. Streamers ride the warm air, tumbling down, flashing briefly in the light before vanishing into the night.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_38": "The faint smell of burning hangs in the air, and a soft crackle fills your ears. The sparkler slowly shortens in your hand, but its glow remains bright.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_39": "Roccia's handiwork. Quality guaranteed.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_4": "The summer sky feels wider than you imagined. Only a few windows shine in the sleeping town below, little sparks scattered across the darkness.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_40": "The girl Changli brought along looks down at the sparkler in your hand and suddenly speaks.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_41": "About what happened before...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_42": "Her words bring a brief hush. She has rehearsed so many explanations, but now that she wants to speak, she doesn't know where to begin.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_43": "I'm so sorry for saying terrible, hurtful words that day! What I said must have shaken your confidence, and I've regretted it ever since.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_44": "But I've been thinking about it. President Changli, {PlayerName}... I can't see where my future is going. I don't know what I'm supposed to do.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_45": "You can't decide the path ahead on imagination or personal preference alone, you know. At your age, you can't yet know all that your choices will bring.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_46": "After all, there's never only one answer to what your future can be.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_47": "Our lives aren't set in stone. As you gain experience and skills and see more of the world, more paths and possibilities will open up to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_48": "Verina stands in the rooftop doorway holding a small wicker basket. She gives you all a wave.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_49": "Principal Abby called, so Ms. Galbrena and I came straight over. We're not too late, are we?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_5": "Kneeling beside a cardboard box, Roccia takes out slim sparklers one by one. She carefully untangles their wrappers and lays them in a neat row.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_50": "I wasn't sure what everyone liked, so I brought some light, healthy dried fruits and vegetables.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_51": "Here, it's hot out, so I brought some shaved ice with fresh fruit jam and milkshake topping. One serving for each of you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_52": "When you're facing a tough problem or an enemy, I'd rather see you cut straight through it. But when it comes to food, eat however you like.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_53": "Still, you kids... You do make it hard not to worry. Principal Abby is concerned about you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_54": "Ms. Galbrena is worried about you too, isn't she?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_55": "Galbrena doesn't argue. She only glances away, as if tacitly admitting it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_56": "Everyone settles down in little groups around the bucket for extinguishing the sparklers. The scattered seats gradually form a circle.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_57": "A bell sounds somewhere in the distance. Tiny sparks still spit from the sparklers in your hands, their flickering light playing across the faces around you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_58": "Now, where was I? Hmm...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_59": "Ms. Verina...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_6": "Xiangli Yao bends to lift a full bucket of water into the middle of the rooftop. Water sloshes against the sides, sending ripples across the surface and splashing his sleeve.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_60": "Well... In my experience, whether things are hard or going well right now, this is only a small part of a much longer journey.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_61": "So if something has left you anxious or discouraged, or you feel as though you can't go on, you don't have to decide so soon what the rest of your life will be.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_62": "You're all still young. This may be hard to understand, but many regrets in life don't come from having made the wrong choice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_63": "They come because you've grown into someone very different from the person who made it.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_64": "Sometimes, instead of rushing to figure out what the future holds, it's better to experience life as it unfolds and keep putting one foot in front of the other.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_65": "Nothing teaches you more than living through it yourself.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_66": "That's life. As long as your heart keeps beating, your future will keep unfolding.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_67": "Under the teachers' gentle gaze, the girl's eyelashes quiver. A faint redness gathers around her eyes.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_68": "She lowers her head, unwilling to let you see her face, and quickly wipes a glimmer of tears away with the back of her hand.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_69": "...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_7": "Everyone, keep your distance from one another when you light the sparklers.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_70": "Do you remember the two questions you asked at the study session? If the future belongs to the students who earn an A, then everyone else's lives—",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_71": "Heh... If a person's entire life could be decided by a single exam and a single score report, the very idea of a 'future' would seem terribly cheap.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_72": "...!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_73": "You can't recall ever hearing Changli speak with such an edge in her voice.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_74": "But perhaps that's because she has taken on responsibilities earlier than the rest of you, burdens no one her age should have to bear alone: the Council's affairs, duties to the school, obligations to her family...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_75": "Those early encounters with kindness and cruelty, those difficult choices, have shown her sooner than the rest of you that the world isn't always kind.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_76": "Perhaps she has already seen farther and into more tangled possibilities. She puts herself on the board, trying to think as many moves ahead as she can.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_77": "In this society, higher grades do give people more choices. There's no denying that.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_78": "That's why I want us to work hard now. It's why the Student Council organized the summer boot camp and brought everyone together to study.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_79": "I hope that when you... when we reach a crossroads, we'll have more than one map in our hands. More than one direction we could take.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_8": "When they burn out, put them in the bucket to extinguish any remaining embers. Safety comes first.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_80": "But having more choices and having a life that matters are not the same thing.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_81": "Just because you didn't get an A, does that mean there's nothing you're good at? That there's nothing you want to do, no one left to meet, nothing worth experiencing, and no chance to discover who you could become?",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_82": "Don't be absurd.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_83": "If one exam or ranking is all it takes to pin someone to the place others have chosen for them, that's passing sentence on a life they haven't even lived.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_84": "An A isn't the destination, and it isn't some threshold you must cross to have a future. At most, it's a marker along one road.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_85": "Even if you don't earn an A on the Qualifying Exam or win a prize, you can still learn new things, develop your strengths, and try again for the opportunities you missed at a later time.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_86": "Verina gently pats Changli's shoulder and picks up the thread.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_87": "That's right. You kids haven't even seen how big the world is yet, and you're being asked to decide what to do years from now. Of course it feels overwhelming.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_88": "Anyone would be frightened by that.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_89": "On the Qualifying Exam, there's often just one correct answer. If you can't solve the problem, you fail. That's harsh.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_9": "I modified all of tonight's sparklers myself. They'll burn a little longer than ordinary ones.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_90": "But as Principal Abby often says, life has many answers. Whatever your Qualifying Exam results, please don't dismiss what your future might hold.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_91": "Once you've gone a little further, met more people, experienced more of life, and had more choices to make for yourself, the answers that seem so unclear now will gradually come into focus.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_92": "Life isn't a test with all the answers already filled in.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_93": "Each of you has a long way to go. People and experiences you can't even imagine yet will enter your lives.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_94": "So hold your head high and live with pride.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_95": "What you learn in class, your grades, and the choices ahead all matter. But what will carry you farther is the courage to keep learning and trying, even in the face of the unknown.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_96": "A seed doesn't grow into a full-grown tree the moment it sprouts. It needs sunlight and rain, and sometimes it has to weather the cold.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_97": "But as long as it keeps growing, new branches will reach out, and fresh leaves will unfurl.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_98": "The girl sits motionless, and at last she can no longer hold back her tears. She bows her head and covers her face with both hands. The sobs she has suppressed for so long break free.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_60_99": "Her shoulders shake violently. Tears spill through her fingers, and she cannot stop them.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_1": "...Hah... Hah...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_10": "When I first came here, everyone seemed rather afraid of me. Even though I was a second-year transfer student, they chose me as the class president and the grade representative.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_11": "They did vote for me, but I know being the \"daughter of a school board member\" made them see me... differently.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_12": "It was like that when I was little, too... Lonely, anxious, never quite sure where I belonged. I never imagined I could find so many dear friends in just six months.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_13": "Thank you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_14": "The girl clasps her hands in front of her and bows to you.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_15": "Phoebe, come to the hotpot party tomorrow night. It's at Chisa's family restaurant.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_16": "I'm sure everyone would love to spend more time with you, too.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_17": "Mm... I'd love to!",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_2": "Phoebe bends over, hands on her knees, struggling to catch her breath.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_3": "I-I'm exhausted... I haven't run that hard in ages. But... that was so much fun.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_4": "She steadies herself against the edge of the table and straightens up. Taking a handkerchief from her uniform skirt pocket, she wipes the sweat from her brow.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_5": "Being a little less proper and getting carried away with everyone for once... I never imagined it could be so much fun.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_6": "This summer with everyone on the Student Council is completely unlike any summer I've known before...",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_7": "The same studying, the same tea parties, the same summer tutoring... But with friends beside me, even the dullest things make me happy.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_8": "I... truly treasure this feeling.",
+  "EVENT_AVGstudentCouncil_70_9": "Perhaps that's what this school is really about.",
   "EVENT_KXFY_1_1": "You're back, Passenger.",
