   "EpithetDesc_Role_6": "\"Sit, breathe, and find inner peace.\" She opens her eyes to perceive the gradual stabilization of frequencies, using pupils corroded by Tacet Discords. She had walked away, free from the blizzard.",
   "EpithetDesc_Role_60": "She has watched flowers bloom, listened to the falling rain, embraced the wind, and tread through deep snows. Like the crescent moon waxing to full, She journeys on, alongside the very Hold She strives to protect, until both have reached their fullness.\nOnce, the little fox moved step by step, guided only by the Sentinel's memories. Now, She carries the future of Mengzhou's civilization.",
   "EpithetDesc_Role_61": "The miasmic rains have subsided, yet the fallen never return. Still, she will never forget. She will never let them go. To the world, a lone girl walks beneath an umbrella. Yet beneath it, nine shadows walk beside her.",
+  "EpithetDesc_Role_62": "She weaves her dreams into a garden of souls, her immaculate heart becoming both sun and moon, bathing those who have lost their way in gentle light.\n\nMay your soul wander no more.\nMay your past sink into silence.\nMay you find peace in endless light.\n\nHer gentle prayers drift softly into the dreams of every soul.",
   "EpithetDesc_Role_7": "Being half a step slower also meant that Taoqi had more time to observe the world. She gradually began to notice subtle changes in the marketplace. A brick was missing here. A flower had wilted there. The next season would arrive when she was aware.",
   "EpithetDesc_Role_8": "Many people light fires they cannot hope to contain.\nBut he is the creator of fire, the master of fire, and the smotherer of fire.",
   "EpithetDesc_Role_9": "They say Yuanwu can best any challenger in three minutes. It takes him one minute to step into the ring, then another minute to perform a ceremonial bow, and one final minute before the kettle comes to a boil.\n\"Come now, all martial artists are friends. Do stay for a cup of tea.\"",
   "EpithetDesc_RoverRogue": "Come, the battle begins! The terms of victory are set!",
+  "EpithetDesc_RoverTower": "You find some little white flowers growing at the border of the dreamland. But before you can touch them, the alarm clock drags you back to reality, just as you're about to lose yourself.",
   "EpithetDesc_SuiBo": "Even amidst the shattered mirage, you still manage to build a haven of peace.",
   "EpithetDesc_Tafang": "Just as you once witnessed in the simulation, that towering tide will one day descend, engulfing all. But this time, you are ready to face it again.",
   "EpithetDesc_Tower_1": "You've reached the boarder of the Tower of Adversity. Truth lines beyond a thin wall.",
