   "Event_TMDZJ_2_7": "Who are you?",
   "Event_TMDZJ_2_8": "Dorothy falls silent, looking down at her toes.",
   "Event_TMDZJ_2_9": "Ah, you figured it out so fast. I guess a child's dream persona is still too naive.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_1_1": "Got a minute, {PlayerName}?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_1_2": "I'm here.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_1_3": "What's wrong? Did something happen in the Somnoire again?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_1_4": "It's a bit unusual this time... I don't think I can explain it clearly over WavesLine.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_1_5": "Could you come meet me at Shaftpost Yard?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_1": "You're here, {PlayerName}.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_10": "Either way, they can never be purged completely. Their remnants drift down like dust, settling at the bottom of the Somnoire.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_11": "We call this bottom layer the \"Desolate Dreamfield,\" an endlessly sprawling expanse.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_12": "Theoretically, it should safely isolate those hazardous fragments from the rest of the Somnoire, so we wouldn't normally need to pay it any mind.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_13": "So what went wrong?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_14": "As you can see, an entrance leading to the Desolate Dreamfield has appeared here out of nowhere.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_15": "By all rights, it shouldn't exist... The Dreamfield is a relatively isolated space. No passage connects it to the Somnoire, let alone Solaris.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_16": "This is an unprecedented anomaly. The boss is deeply concerned.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_17": "We Gatekeepers can't enter the Desolate Dreamfield from Solaris. Only you and your companions can.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_18": "I think I get the idea.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_19": "Anything I can do?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_2": "Is this an entrance to the Somnoire? Why is it here, with so many people milling around?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_20": "Yep, we need your help, once again. Please follow the guidance of the Marchstone and venture as deep into the Dreamfield as you can to find what's behind this anomaly.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_21": "We need your help, once again. Please follow the guidance of the Marchstone and venture as deep into the Dreamfield as you can to find what's behind this anomaly.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_22": "Oh, you probably shouldn't stay in the Desolate Dreamfield for long, or you'll be assimilated into it and sink into an eternal dream.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_23": "Take this, just to be safe.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_24": "Ivory Gatekeeper hands you an antique red alarm clock. It looks strikingly familiar, yet you can't recall where you've seen it before.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_25": "It's imbued with my boss's power. It will wake you from the dream whenever necessary.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_26": "Thank you.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_27": "That puts my mind at ease.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_28": "If you find anything, please let me know any time.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_3": "It is. I camouflaged it so the locals wouldn't notice.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_4": "However, where it leads... isn't the Somnoire you know.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_5": "What do you mean?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_6": "Umm... I'll try to keep it simple. As you know, the Somnoire is made up of the collective subconscious of the Solaris people.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_7": "Normally, most of these feelings are sealed away in the Somnoire, securely and permanently. But there are exceptions.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_8": "Self-destructive impulses, mad ravings, and all sorts of negative emotions—to the Somnoire, these are the primary destabilizing factors.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_2_9": "We clean up most of them ourselves. The rest might disintegrate on their own, or take shape as Nightmares of all kinds.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_3_1": "I can feel the entrance collapsing, the energy holding it together slowly fading away... Did you do something, {PlayerName}?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_3_10": "Thank you for your help, {PlayerName}. We'll keep monitoring the Desolate Dreamfield.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_3_11": "If a new entrance pops up, we'll reach out to you right away.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_3_2": "It might be connected to the last Nightmare we defeated.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_3_3": "Felt like we fought a long, long battle.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_3_4": "I have a frightening thought... What if that was the goal of whoever—or whatever—opened the entrance in the first place?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_3_5": "It deliberately opened a path just so you would fight the Nightmares roaming the Dreamfield.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_3_6": "Then it sat back to enjoy the show, like a spectator enjoying gladiators fight to the death. Now that it got what it wanted, there was no point in keeping the entrance up anymore.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_3_7": "...No, that's still too wild a thought. As far as I know, the only one lurking in the Dreamfield with that kind of power is...",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_3_8": "...Is who?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_3_9": "Nothing. The entrance should close up eventually. If you want to, you can keep searching the Dreamfield for answers before it does, but I doubt it'll lead to much.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_1": "Ah, you're here, {PlayerName}. Miss Lily... How is she doing now?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_10": "Normally, most of these feelings are sealed away in the Somnoire, securely and permanently. But there are exceptions.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_11": "Self-destructive impulses, mad ravings, and all sorts of negative emotions—to the Somnoire, these are the primary destabilizing factors.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_12": "We clean up most of them ourselves. The rest might disintegrate on their own, or take shape as Nightmares of all kinds.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_13": "Either way, they can never be purged completely. Their remnants drift down like dust, settling at the bottom of the Somnoire.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_14": "We call this bottom layer the \"Desolate Dreamfield,\" an endlessly sprawling expanse.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_15": "Theoretically, it should safely isolate those hazardous fragments from the rest of the Somnoire, so we wouldn't normally need to pay it any mind.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_16": "So what went wrong?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_17": "As you can see, an entrance leading to the Desolate Dreamfield has appeared here out of nowhere.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_18": "By all rights, it shouldn't exist... The Dreamfield is a relatively isolated space. No passage connects it to the Somnoire, let alone Solaris.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_19": "This is an unprecedented anomaly. The boss is deeply concerned.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_2": "Don't worry. Everyone at Startorch Academy is taking good care of her.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_20": "We Gatekeepers can't enter the Desolate Dreamfield from Solaris. Only you and your companions can.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_21": "I think I get the idea.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_22": "Anything I can do?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_23": "Yep, we need your help, once again. Please follow the guidance of the Marchstone and venture as deep into the Dreamfield as you can to find what's behind this anomaly.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_24": "We need your help, once again. Please follow the guidance of the Marchstone and venture as deep into the Dreamfield as you can to find what's behind this anomaly.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_25": "Oh, you probably shouldn't stay in the Desolate Dreamfield for long, or you'll be assimilated into it and sink into an eternal dream.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_26": "Take this, just to be safe.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_27": "Ivory Gatekeeper hands you an antique red alarm clock. It looks strikingly familiar, yet you can't recall where you've seen it before.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_28": "It's imbued with my boss's power. It will wake you from the dream whenever necessary.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_29": "Thank you.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_3": "Glad to hear. Ebby and I both hope she can enjoy a peaceful campus life. After all, she got swept into war when she should've been at school.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_30": "That puts my mind at ease.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_31": "If you find anything, please let me know any time.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_4": "Now that we know she's safe, let's get back to the matter at hand, {PlayerName}. Take a look at this...",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_5": "Is this an entrance to the Somnoire? Why is it here, with so many people milling around?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_6": "It is. I camouflaged it so the locals wouldn't notice.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_7": "However, where it leads... isn't the Somnoire you know.",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_8": "What do you mean?",
+  "Event_TSHJMY_4_9": "Umm... I'll try to keep it simple. As you know, the Somnoire is made up of the collective subconscious of the Solaris people.",
   "Event_TXCQDEBF_10_1": "Hmm... Let's try it here, {PlayerName}.",
   "Event_TXCQDEBF_10_2": "So we just set it on the ground, light it here... and ta-da! It's a fireworks show!",
