   "Farm_Toy_Effect_42": "At the start of each day, gold-rarity <te href=851000><color=#c79f49>Dream of Gradation</color></te> Echoes become immune to <te href=851006><color=#c79f49>Devouring</color></te>.\nWhen a Dream of Gradation Echo is <te href=851006><color=#c79f49>devoured</color></te>, <te href=851055><color=#c79f49>adjacent</color></te> Dream of Gradation Echoes will receive the devoured Echo's Gradation progress and gain an extra <color=#e15e5c>{n}</color> (Relic Level) points of Gradation progress.\n<te href=852000><color=#c79f49>Upgrade</color></te>: Current Relic Level is <color=#e15e5c>{n}</color>. The Relic will automatically level up for every <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=Echo P=Echoes SapTag=0} devoured.",
