   "Farm_Toy_Effect_44": "<te href=851001><color=#c79f49>Dream of Devouring</color></te> Echoes prioritize <te href=851006><color=#c79f49>devouring</color></te> <te href=851049><color=#c79f49>Chop Chop</color></te> Echoes.\nWhen Chop Chop Echoes are devoured, the devourer gains {0} more <te href=851009><color=#c79f49>Daily Coupon</color></te> yields and generates <SapTag=1>{1}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=copy P=copies SapTag=1} of itself in <te href=851045><color=#c79f49>Basic Form</color></te> on blank blocks.\nAfter <SapTag=2>{2}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=day P=days SapTag=2}, it removes itself and increases the Daily Coupons yield of the <te href=851055><color=#c79f49>adjacent</color></te> Echoes. The increase is equal to <color=#e15e5c>{n}%</color> (Relic Level) of the devourer's Daily Coupon yield.\n<te href=852000><color=#c79f49>Upgrade</color></te>: Current Relic Level is <color=#e15e5c>{n}</color>. The Relic will automatically level up for every <SapTag=3>{3}</SapTag> Chop Chop {Cus:Sap,S=Echo P=Echoes SapTag=3}  devoured.",
   "Farm_Toy_Effect_45": "When <te href=851003><color=#c79f49>Dream of Integration</color></te> Echoes are devoured, they trigger their <te href=851008><color=#c79f49>Integration</color></te> effect and will generate <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=copy P=copies SapTag=0} of itself on blank blocks. The <te href=851009><color=#c79f49>Daily Coupon</color></te> yield of the generated Echoes is increased by <color=#e15e5c>{n}%</color> (Relic Level).\n<te href=852000><color=#c79f49>Upgrade</color></te>: Current Relic Level is <color=#e15e5c>{n}</color>. The Relic will automatically level up for every <SapTag=1>{1}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=time P=times SapTag=1} Integration happened.",
   "Farm_Toy_Effect_46": "<te href=851002><color=#c79f49>Dream of Exchange</color></te> Echoes will be considered <te href=851003><color=#c79f49>Dream of Integration</color></te> Echoes. The number of Echoes allowed to undergo <te href=851008><color=#c79f49>Integration</color></te> is increased by <color=#e15e5c>{n}</color> (Relic Level).\nEchoes being integrated have a {0}% chance to generate <SapTag=1>{1}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=copy P=copies SapTag=1} of themselves in <te href=851045><color=#c79f49>Basic Form</color></te>, whose <te href=851009><color=#c79f49>Daily Coupon</color></te> yield is increased by {2} x <color=#e15e5c>{n}</color> (Relic Level).\nThere is a {4}% chance to generate <SapTag=5>{5}</SapTag> <te href=851016><color=#c79f49>Dream {Cus:Sap,S=Block P=Blocks SapTag=5}: Ice Shards</color></te> every <SapTag=3>{3}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=day P=days SapTag=3}.\n<te href=852000><color=#c79f49>Upgrade</color></te>: Current Relic Level is <color=#e15e5c>{n}</color>. The Relic will automatically level up for every <color=#e15e5c><SapTag=N>{n}</SapTag></color> {Cus:Sap,S=Echo P=Echoes SapTag=N} <te href=851041><color=#c79f49>removed</color></te>.",
