   "FavorGoods_151102_Title": "Braindance Wreath",
   "FavorGoods_151103_Content": "The Moon Tarot Card. It symbolizes fear, the subconscious, illusions, and truths waiting to be discovered. In the illustration, one wolf howls at the distant, unreachable moon. The other waits in silence, its gaze fixed on the first.\n \nThe card was a gift from Misty, who gave her a tarot reading. Lucy took it with her to the Moon—one of the few pieces of Night City she brought up there. It held a strong meaning to her. Almost magical.",
   "FavorGoods_151103_Title": "Tarot Card",
+  "FavorGoods_151201_Content": "The first perfume Lily ever got right. It was high summer, and she built it around lemon and citrus so that whoever opened the bottle would catch the sun at its strongest. Even on days when rain drummed against the windowpane, this scent would still fill the room with sunlight.",
+  "FavorGoods_151201_Title": "The First Perfume",
+  "FavorGoods_151202_Content": "The working notebook from Lily's perfumery days. When the war broke out, it became a journal instead, and what it holds now are the soldiers she knew, the years spent among them, and a piece of New Federation history that must not be forgotten.",
+  "FavorGoods_151202_Title": "Perfumer's Notebook",
+  "FavorGoods_151203_Content": "Dog tags worn by the Resonator soldiers of the Federated Cities. There was an unwritten pact among them: the last one standing gathers the fallen's tags and carries them forward.\nSo the weight fell to Lily, and she carried it without a word. She strung each tag onto the cord with care, as if that could keep their souls from scattering too far from home.\n\"I'll take you home. I promise.\"\nThe girl has kept that promise through every one of the long years since.",
+  "FavorGoods_151203_Title": "Proof They Once Lived",
   "FavorGoods_160101_Content": "\"The weight of <te href=850091>Jinzhou</te> is far beyond what a model can carry, but you can feel the weight of guarding Jinzhou up close by purchasing a Guardian Wall model.\" \nThe <te href=850085>Ministry of Development</te> partnered with a toy company to create this model, rumored to be a limited first edition obtained personally by Taoqi from a revered toy mogul.",
   "FavorGoods_160101_Title": "Guardian Wall Model",
   "FavorGoods_160102_Content": "The data module for Terminal loading contains Taoqi's observations and thoughts on <te href=850091>Jinzhou</te>, from her childhood musings to her current decisions to protect the city. Every detail has been meticulously documented in this small but powerful device. Perhaps one day, it will alter the fate of Jinzhou.",
