   "FavorRoleInfo_1511_TalentDoc": "[██ Record Modification Log]\n\nModification Target: Lucy Kushinada\nModification Code: RA2██-G\n\nThe subject is identified as a Mutant-Type Resonator, with the Tacet Mark located on the right shoulder.\n\nForte Manifestation:\nThe subject can hack targets within a five-meter radius to achieve objectives such as information retrieval, data manipulation, or target control. Testing indicates this Forte can affect up to three targets simultaneously, with more pronounced effectiveness against mechanical constructs.\n\nBio-organic Hacking:\nThis Forte can also be used against Tacet Discords. After hacking a Tacet Discord, the subject can inflict damage or exert control by disrupting its frequency. The underlying mechanism and upper limits are currently unknown. The scope of control is speculated to be affected by the Resonator's own physical and emotional state. \n\nUnder ███ guarantee, the Research Institute has agreed to limited ███ of the subject.\n\nCyberware Technology:\nThe subject exhibits multiple mechanical modifications grafted into her body. According to the subject's testimony, these modifications originate from ███ and are classified as cybernetic technology. Test results indicate this cyberware does not match any known existing technology, and this type of implant places significant strain on the user's body and psyche. On ██ ██, ███ intervened, canceling the research project on Night City technology.",
