+  "FavorRoleInfo_1512_Info": "A young perfumer swept up in the Federated Cities' Resonator War, whose rare Resonance Ability made her a psychotherapist to the soldiers around her.\nShe could not stop the war. What a gentle girl could do was save whoever stood in front of her, with everything she had.",
