+  "FavorRoleInfo_1512_TalentCertification": "This student's waveform graph shows elliptical fluctuations. The Time Domain pattern is regular, with no sign of abnormal fluctuation. Examination results are determined to be within normal parameters.\nResonant Criticality: High. This member demonstrates high stability with minimal risk of <te href=850073>Overclocking</te>. Records indicate no history of Overclocking.\nA solitary acute fluctuation is present in the subject's historical curve. Readings normalized thereafter.\nGiven the subject's background, the fluctuation is dated to the Resonator War, when an incident drove her to overuse her Forte to the verge of Overclocking. The subsequent rapid return to baseline remains unexplained and is pending further testing. Preliminary analysis suggests the involvement of an external force acting on her frequency.\n<i>\"This Overclock assessment has been re-tested and confirmed by <te href=851069>Startorch Academy</te>.\"</i>",
+  "FavorRoleInfo_1512_TalentDoc": "[Forte Examination Report: RA2777-G]\nForte Overview: Tests reveal a <te href=850067>Rabelle's Curve</te> with a pronounced periodic waveform. Therefore, the subject is classified as a <te href=850068>Congenital Resonator</te>. Her <te href=850072>Tacet Mark</te> is located on her chest.\nSubsequent testing, read alongside her work as a perfumer, indicates that the subject has an acute sense of smell and can induce dreams in others with specially prepared perfumes. Duration varies from dream to dream but falls within a range of 15 to 60 minutes.\n<i>\"What a rare gift. Talent like this is exactly what the Mental Health Care Center at the Clotho Doctors Alliance has been short of.\"</i>\n<i>\"This report was written by the Clotho Doctors Alliance and has now been confirmed valid by <te href=851069>Startorch Academy</te>.\"</i>",
