   "ItemInfo_42601640_BgDescription": "Originally a common tree of Mengzhou, it was corrupted by the Evil Miasma's Miasmic Thunder and reduced to a charred, blackened stump, upon which red lightning can still be seen pulsing along its surface. Though the Huaxu Academy and the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs have confirmed it poses no immediate danger, its contamination by the Evil Miasma has made it a scar upon the land, and few dare approach. Whether it is the remains of the Evil Miasma or the breeding ground of a new calamity has yet to be determined.",
   "ItemInfo_42601640_Name": "Miasmic Branch",
   "ItemInfo_42601640_ObtainedShowDescription": "Originally a common tree of Mengzhou, it was corrupted by the Evil Miasma and reduced to a Miasmic Branch. The Miasmic Thunder that split it still lingers within.",
+  "ItemInfo_42601650_AttributesDescription": "A material used for Resonator Ascension.",
+  "ItemInfo_42601650_BgDescription": "The petals of the Reverie Lily are as pure and flawless as moonlight. The slender flower sways and releases wisps of delicate fragrance with every gentle breeze that passes. The scent is not quite sweet but faintly bitter, like old dreams steeped in the night's dew. Those dreams hold a thousand unspoken words, yet the flower remains silent.\nIt stays rooted in the earth, lifting all its whiteness toward the heavens. A quiet compassion lives in that unblemished white, as though the flower has witnessed all the world's imperfections and still chooses, in the depths of night, to shine like a tiny \"moon\" for souls who have lost their way.",
+  "ItemInfo_42601650_Name": "Reverie Lily",
+  "ItemInfo_42601650_ObtainedShowDescription": "A dreamlike lily that sways gently through the shifting hours of day and night, a tiny \"moon\" guiding lost souls on their way.",
