   "ItemInfo_71030004_BgDescription": "\"No matter how late you show up, you're a detective.\nEverything leaves a trace and a detective must pursue it without end.\"\nThe story is far from over. Someone deep within the Somnoire has entrusted this to you, awaiting the day the story reaches its end.",
   "ItemInfo_71030004_Name": "Dream Imprint",
   "ItemInfo_71030004_ObtainedShowDescription": "\"You're a detective now.\"",
+  "ItemInfo_71110001_AttributesDescription": "<color=#c19f51>[Counterattack]</color>\nGrants a Shield equal to 50% of Max HP to all Resonators in the team for 15s, during which the Resonator becomes immune to interruption and continuously deals DMG to nearby targets. This DMG can trigger Counterattack. Cooldown: 20s.\nAvailable uses: 2",
+  "ItemInfo_71110001_BgDescription": "It stubbornly rejects all things, if only to protect what has yet to wither.",
+  "ItemInfo_71110001_Name": "Withered Shell",
+  "ItemInfo_71110002_AttributesDescription": "<color=#c19f51>[Traction]</color>\nGenerates a vortex that pulls in nearby targets and deals DMG each second, lasting for 8s. Each target hit by the vortex increases the team's total DMG by 20% for 8s, stacking up to 4 times. Cooldown: 10s.\nAvailable uses: 3",
+  "ItemInfo_71110002_BgDescription": "Upon its surface shimmer the lingering traces of countless splendors.",
+  "ItemInfo_71110002_Name": "Tainted Realm",
+  "ItemInfo_71110003_AttributesDescription": "<color=#c19f51>[RES Reduction]</color>\nDeals DMG to nearby targets and reduces their All-Attribute RES to 0 for 20s. Cooldown: 5s.\nPassive: Reduces a target's All-Attribute RES by 10% when dealing DMG to it.\nAvailable uses: 3",
+  "ItemInfo_71110003_BgDescription": "Twisting, multiplying, mindless... Such is the ultimate fate of endless life.",
+  "ItemInfo_71110003_Name": "Cruel Facade",
+  "ItemInfo_71110004_AttributesDescription": "<color=#c19f51>[Time Extension]</color>\nDeals DMG to targets in range. Each target hit adds 2s to the remaining time. Cooldown: 2s.\nAvailable uses: 3",
+  "ItemInfo_71110004_BgDescription": "The invention of firearms forever reshaped the very image of war and destruction.",
+  "ItemInfo_71110004_Name": "Echo of Destruction",
+  "ItemInfo_71110005_AttributesDescription": "<color=#c19f51>[Stagnation]</color>\nStagnates nearby targets and makes them take 50% more total DMG for 15s. Pauses the timer for 15s. Cooldown: 20s.\nAvailable uses: 2",
+  "ItemInfo_71110005_BgDescription": "Better to glimpse the void within the sphere than to behold a future long since perished.",
+  "ItemInfo_71110005_Name": "Hollow Splendor",
+  "ItemInfo_71110006_AttributesDescription": "<color=#c19f51>[Haste]</color>\nGreatly increases the Resonator's Movement Speed for 8s.\nPassive: Actions consume no STA.\nAvailable uses: 4",
+  "ItemInfo_71110006_BgDescription": "Wings may offer no hope of escape, but at least they can evoke a sense of warmth.",
+  "ItemInfo_71110006_Name": "Shattered Hope",
+  "ItemInfo_71110007_AttributesDescription": "<color=#c19f51>[DMG Boost]</color>\n<color=#b94f4e>Reduces the remaining time by 15s</color>. Increases the total DMG of all Resonators by 400% for 10s, stacking up to 3 times. Cooldown: 8s.\nAvailable uses: 3",
+  "ItemInfo_71110007_BgDescription": "For most, casting it is the only choice they have, even if the outcome is as unpredictable as fate itself.",
+  "ItemInfo_71110007_Name": "Chaotic Fate",
+  "ItemInfo_71110008_AttributesDescription": "<color=#c19f51>[Immobilization]</color>\nDeals DMG to targets in range and immobilizes targets that can be immobilized. Cooldown: 10s.\nPassive: Makes immobilized targets take 50% more total DMG.\nAvailable uses: 2",
+  "ItemInfo_71110008_BgDescription": "It helps people forget unpleasant memories, though in a rather crude way.",
+  "ItemInfo_71110008_Name": "Scattered Memory",
+  "ItemInfo_71110009_AttributesDescription": "<color=#c19f51>[Dodge]</color>\nSends all Resonators in the team into the Blink state for 12s, automatically dodging before taking DMG. Cooldown: 15s.\nPassive: Grants 1 stack of Berserk every 3s in combat. Each stack makes all Resonators in the team deal 5% more total DMG, stacking up to 20 times. Taking DMG removes all stacks.\nPauses the timer while Berserk is at 20 stacks.\nAvailable uses: 3",
+  "ItemInfo_71110009_BgDescription": "Nothing lies beneath the cloak, yet you can't shake the feeling that something inside is curiously watching everything around it.",
+  "ItemInfo_71110009_Name": "Eroding Reason",
+  "ItemInfo_71120001_AttributesDescription": "A relic found deep within the Desolate Dreamfield. Awarded for placing in the top 20% on Jinhsi's leaderboard in Dreamfield Odyssey when rankings are finalized. <color=Highlight>This is a limited-time item, valid until the end of Version 4.0.</color>",
