   "ItemInfo_71500099_ObtainedShowDescription": "Gaining Shield grants the Resonator 3% Fusion DMG Bonus and increases their total Heavy Attack DMG by 2.5% for 3s, stacking up to 15 times. Retriggering the effect refreshes the duration.",
+  "ItemInfo_71500100_AttributesDescription": "Inflicting Tunability - Shifting increases the ATK and Crit. DMG of all Resonators in the team by 30% and 60% respectively.\n\nThis Token can be used up to <color=#fee388>2</color> times in Whimpering Wastes.",
+  "ItemInfo_71500100_BgDescription": "Deaf since childhood, the fisherman spent his whole life adrift at sea, never once hearing the voice of the tide. When the entire village went mad at a roar that would not end, he finally understood: the silence was never a curse. It was a blessing.",
+  "ItemInfo_71500100_Name": "The Silence Adrift on the Waves",
+  "ItemInfo_71500100_ObtainedShowDescription": "Inflicting Tunability - Shifting increases the ATK and Crit. DMG of all Resonators in the team by 30% and 60% respectively.",
+  "ItemInfo_71500101_AttributesDescription": "After a Resonator casts Intro Skill, they deal 25% more total Fusion DMG for 15s.\nResonators deal 30% more total Basic Attack DMG.\n\nThis Token can be used up to <color=#fee388>2</color> times in Whimpering Wastes.",
+  "ItemInfo_71500101_BgDescription": "...A courier galloped past, throwing the tavern into an uproar. Invaders at the frontier, some swore. Warlords in revolt, said others. Not one of them guessed what future those hoofbeats, fading down the alley, truly heralded.",
+  "ItemInfo_71500101_Name": "The Echoes Shattering the Night",
