+  "ItemInfo_71500102_AttributesDescription": "Resonators deal 50% more total Echo Skill DMG.\n\nThis Token can be used up to <color=#fee388>2</color> times in Whimpering Wastes.",
+  "ItemInfo_71500102_BgDescription": "Poised at the prow, the scholar drew his bow taut as the full moon. As his arrow pierced the vicious flood dragon's skull, a voice breathed approval into his ear: the voice of the one who had volunteered as bait.",
