+  "ItemInfo_71500102_ObtainedShowDescription": "Resonators deal 50% more total Echo Skill DMG.",
   "ItemInfo_71500104_AttributesDescription": "Enemies take 30% more total Electro DMG.\nResonators deal 30% more total Electro DMG for 15s upon casting Intro Skill.\n\nThis Token can be used up to <color=#fee388>2</color> times in Whimpering Wastes.",
   "ItemInfo_71500104_BgDescription": "Once, a woodcutter set off alone into the mountains to fell a tree that scraped the sky. For decades, no one saw him again. When he finally returned, giant timber in hand, he found the city had grown into a forest of steel, and the wood he'd spent his life harvesting was worth nothing at all.",
