   "ItemInfo_80001061_BgDescription": "Endorsed by Gladiator Star Lupa, it's still a hit across Septimont.\nLightly sweet, refreshingly smooth, and coming in a variety of flavors, it is best enjoyed ice cold.\nFor Lupa, fighting in the arena is an indispensable part of her life. At the breaks of matches, she still takes a sip of this Heartpour, remembering the thrill of the fight and the laughter she shared with her partner during the Agon of Champions.",
   "ItemInfo_80001061_Name": "Heartpour",
   "ItemInfo_80001061_ObtainedShowDescription": "Increases Energy Regen of all Resonators in the team by 34% for 30m. Only effective on your own Resonators in Co-op Mode.",
+  "ItemInfo_80001062_AttributesDescription": "Increases ATK of all Resonators in the team by 28% for 30m. Only effective on your own Resonators in Co-op Mode.",
+  "ItemInfo_80001062_BgDescription": "A snack Lily came up with on a whim as a child. It's simple to make: wash the lily petals, coat them in egg and breadcrumbs, and fry until golden brown. Sprinkle with a light dusting of sea salt, or serve with a side of honey for dipping.\n\"Mm, it tastes just like it did when I was little. The outside is crisp and golden, while the inside retains the lilies' delicate, slightly bitter sweetness. It's almost like...\"\nShe trailed off, saying no more. A faint smile played on her lips, as though she were gently savoring a taste of those bygone days.",
+  "ItemInfo_80001062_Name": "Crispy Lilies",
+  "ItemInfo_80001062_ObtainedShowDescription": "Increases ATK of all Resonators in the team by 28% for 30m. Only effective on your own Resonators in Co-op Mode.",
   "ItemInfo_80001065_AttributesDescription": "Grants 55% Resonance Skill DMG Bonus to all Resonators in the team for 30m. Only effective on your own Resonators in Co-op Mode.",
   "ItemInfo_80001065_BgDescription": "Did someone pick these olives? Hardly. The branches, heavy with ripened fruit, simply yielded their bounty, dropping them gently into her waiting hands. No elaborate preparation could improve their natural, fresh flavor. A simple roll in honey is all it takes to satisfy her discerning palate: as the verdant aroma still clings to her fingertips, a wave of sweet freshness washes over her mouth.",
   "ItemInfo_80001065_Name": "Sweetened Olives",
