   "ItemInfo_85000008_AttributesDescription_0": "<color=Title>Effect</color>\nWhen Stability is above 30%, it depletes every second. When Stability is at or below 30%, the Resonator gains DMG Amplification.\n\n<color=Title>Support Skill</color>\nRecover 30% Stability.",
