   "JKXCCZST_9_5": "Apologies. Our creator, the one who gave us speech, has been gone for a long time. Our knowledge module... needs fine-tuning.",
   "JKXCCZST_9_6": "If you can help us... We will... Thank you.",
   "JKXCCZST_9_7": "That person... Taught us... The one who helps... Tell them thank you, big thank you.",
+  "JSZYH_1_1": "Arbiter! Good to see you again.",
+  "JSZYH_1_10": "Please rest assured, Mengzhou's Ministry affairs will be handled. It is our duty. And should anything require the Arbiter's assistance, we will inform you at once.",
+  "JSZYH_1_11": "Ah, we were only doing our duty, Arbiter. Think nothing of it.",
+  "JSZYH_1_12": "Still... after ten years here, it feels like leaving home...",
+  "JSZYH_1_13": "...But every festival comes to an end. Time to be on my way!",
+  "JSZYH_1_14": "All right, then... Safe travels. (End the Waking Moon Festival)",
+  "JSZYH_1_15": "Mm-hm. {PlayerName}... let me call you that, just this once. I wish you all the best from here on. May all be well in Hsin's keeping.",
+  "JSZYH_1_2": "Are you enjoying the Waking Moon Festival?",
+  "JSZYH_1_3": "I haven't seen much of you these past few days.",
+  "JSZYH_1_4": "That feels like my line... Haha, yes! I'm enjoying it very much. The Ministry's work here is nearly finished, and Jiqing and the others seem to be enjoying the festival just as much.",
+  "JSZYH_1_5": "Oh, that's because of Yao... the little girl next door. She hasn't been well and couldn't make it to the festival, so I've been spending more time with her, trying to lift her spirits.",
+  "JSZYH_1_6": "The Hold has never seen a livelier Waking Moon Festival... And now that the Sentinel has appeared, everyone is breathing a little easier. I'd say things in Xuanfang will only improve from here.",
+  "JSZYH_1_7": "One thing, though... now that the crisis here is over, it's time I returned to Mengzhou to give the Ministry my report. So I've come to say goodbye, Arbiter.",
+  "JSZYH_1_8": "About the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs...",
+  "JSZYH_1_9": "Thanks for all your hard work.",
+  "Jiabelinabuff_2": "Lower Fatigue Gain",
+  "Jiabelinabuff_3": "Aesthetics and Physique Gain Boost",
   "JijianTask_12903500_HintText": "Reach the Platform Phase",
   "JijianTask_12903501_HintText": "Reach the Overwatch Phase",
   "JijianTask_12903502_HintText": "Complete all Phases and fully rebuild the Spacetrek Observatory",
@@ -110883,6 +120125,289 @@
   "KKZKJZST_9_7": "It’s a shame we can only imagine them through slivers of time preserved in amber. Just thinking about it makes me a little sad...",
   "KKZKJZST_9_8": "Instead of getting sentimental, why not join the Upphaf Forest Restoration Project? I'd be happy to approve you.",
   "KKZKJZST_9_9": "But if this is just empty talk, then forget about it. Don't be someone who only dreams and never acts, Liubai",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_1": "B-Boss! They got out!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_10": "Cartethyia sighs.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_11": "Calm down, Cartethyia... Even with such power, one must guide others with noble virtue...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_12": "That said... some problems are meant to be solved with bare fists!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_13": "What follows is nothing short of a raging tempest.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_14": "Not that a real windstorm sweeps through the room. It's the sight of dozens of people rushing toward her, only to fall one after another from the center outward, as though they're being swept away by a colossal tempest.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_15": "Cartethyia steps into the swinging pipe, catches the attacker's wrist with one hand, and gives it a sharp upward pull. The assailant, pipe and all, crashes into the person behind him, sending an entire row of people slamming into the wall.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_16": "Then she kicks again, this time at the guy holding a pot lid. The poor fool goes flying just like the door earlier, tracing a graceful arc through the air.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_17": "Then come more movements too fast for the naked eye to follow. Those in the back try to fill the gaps, but they can't possibly keep up with the speed at which the front line collapses.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_18": "There is no roar of gunfire, no clash of weapons. But to the Celestial Steed Corp employees, this warehouse has unmistakably become a battlefield straight out of hell.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_19": "...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_2": "With a graceful rising kick from Cartethyia, the sturdy door is sent flying into the air. The unfortunate guard standing in front of it takes the full force of the blow and crashes to the ground along with the door.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_20": "A-Aaaaaaaaah—help me!!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_21": "Monster!!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_22": "Run!!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_23": "The crowd scatters in every direction. No one dares remain in the same room as Cartethyia now. She throws one punch at a straggler, clearing out the last of them.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_24": "Except for one person.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_25": "...?!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_26": "If I can't beat that blonde girl, then all I have to do is take you out—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_27": "Too close. The instant you realize the danger, the steel pipe in his hand is only a few centimeters from you.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_28": "Since they're all focused on Cartethyia, you let your guard down. The unhinged leader swings the steel pipe straight at your head. In a fraction of a second, your head will be battered and bloodied.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_29": "In this moment, you feel the imminent threat of death for real—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_3": "There are five or six people gathered around the doorway, with even more filling the corridor behind them. They're all dressed in blue-and-white employee uniforms and armed with things like helmets and pot lids. At the sight of what Cartethyia has just done, they all instinctively take half a step back.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_30": "Wicked souls... Show no mercy!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_31": "Cartethyia rolls the flyer bearing the knight's story into a paper tube.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_32": "No. It's only a paper tube, yet unmistakable traces of sword energy swirl around it.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_33": "As though wind and rain themselves answer her call, raging tides rise at her command. Amid the great tempest, the Queen of Gale and Tide descends upon the world.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_34": "Furious tides, split the heavens!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_35": "The world falls silent.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_36": "Not just the assailant, but everyone else present, too. The force of that strike seems to create a vacuum in the narrow corridor, leaving you and Cartethyia as the only two people still conscious.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_37": "Before you can react, something warm crashes into your arms.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_38": "{PlayerName}!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_39": "Thank goodness... You're alright!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_4": "D-Don't be scared! They're just two high school students!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_40": "I'm so sorry, it's all my fault for not keeping a closer eye on them! You almost got...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_41": "If you had gotten hurt because of me, I would've never forgiven myself... I'm just so glad that you're fine!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_42": "She cries and laughs as she speaks, her words tumbling out in a jumble without rhyme or reason. But you can feel the almost burning sincerity behind every one of them.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_43": "So you reach out and gently pat the girl's head to comfort her.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_44": "That line just now was pretty cool.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_45": "Oh, th-that's, um...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_46": "It's a victory chant I made up for myself... I've wanted to shout it out loud ever since I was little! Just don't tell anyone, okay?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_47": "Hmm... I'm afraid it's a little late for that.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_48": "Cartethyia finally looks up and glances around. At some point, several members of the Orchestral Music Club have gathered nearby, staring in awe at everything that's happened.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_49": "You did all this by yourself, Cartethyia?! That's awesome!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_5": "As long as we keep the Orchestral Music Club from competing in the National Music Competition, Chairman Fenrico will surely reward us!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_50": "We haven't been able to get in touch with you since last night, so everyone in the club got worried and came looking for you nearby.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_51": "But... what exactly happened here...?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_52": "You and Cartethyia exchange a glance. She realizes she's still in the same position as when she threw herself into your arms, and the tips of her ears turn faintly red.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_53": "Then, the two of you laugh together.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_54": "We just went on a knight's adventure.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_6": "With that, the man at the front grabs a pipe and swings it at Cartethyia.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_7": "His move emboldens the people behind him. They raise their weapons and surge forward, swarming toward the two of you from every direction.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_8": "Cartethyia—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1000_9": "...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_1": "Hooo... shhh... hooo...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_10": "The protagonist's father returns as a ghost, urging him to avenge his murder at the hands of his brother, who seized the throne. To uncover the truth, the protagonist stages a play reenacting the king's death before his uncle.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_11": "...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_12": "Cartethyia, could you tell us what story the play is about?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_13": "It's third period now, yet Cartethyia is still sprawled across her desk, showing no sign of waking up.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_14": "You can't let a tragedy like the one from earlier happen again. As the student sitting right behind Cartethyia, you give her back a gentle pat out of humanitarian concern.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_15": "Cartethyia, Miss Galbrena's asking what the troupe's play is about.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_16": "The p-play...?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_17": "Cartethyia rises groggily to her feet, but her mind still seems to be somewhere in a dream. You're pretty sure your hint went right over her head.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_18": "Just as you're about to give her the answer outright—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_19": "The story is... a righteous knight battling the evil sea monster!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_2": "Light, slow, and peaceful. Just from the sound of that breathing, it's clear its owner is an enviably sound sleeper.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_20": "What kind of world has she crossed into?!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_21": "...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_22": "Miss Galbrena's gaze turns sharp.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_23": "Miss Galbrena picks up a piece of chalk... Without a doubt, this is a sign that danger is closing in!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_24": "Everyone except the still-sleeping Cartethyia raises their textbooks in a defensive stance—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_25": "The piece of chalk thrown by Miss Galbrena hits Cartethyia square in the chest.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_26": "...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_27": "Cartethyia!!!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_28": "Thud. The girl topples backward. You reach out in utter anguish to catch her, only to find Cartethyia has already lost consciousness. All that remains is...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_29": "Hooo... shhh... hooo...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_3": "The only problem is, should that sound really be coming from the seat in front of you in the middle of second period?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_30": "Sorry you had to take me to the infirmary, {PlayerName}...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_31": "I'm just glad you're okay.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_32": "No worries. It got me out of class anyway.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_33": "Aww... Now I feel even more guilty...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_34": "Oh, right! That means you and I will have to catch up on the classes we missed, {PlayerName}!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_35": "Don't worry! The doctor said my checkup was fine. I just didn't get enough sleep!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_36": "(Sleep-deprived to the point of being impossible to wake? That's a bit of a stretch...)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_37": "Oh, right! We have Orchestral Music Club practice today. I need to hurry over!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_38": "You should be getting some rest!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_39": "Why don't you go home and get some sleep?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_4": "Um... Cartethyia?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_40": "I promised everyone I'd be there. As a knight... Ahem, as a member of the Orchestral Music Club, I have to keep my word!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_41": "(...Knight?)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_42": "(Come to think of it, Cartethyia said some pretty strange things in class, too. Is she still half-asleep?)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_43": "Hmm... Either way, you have to get some rest after Orchestral Music Club practice.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_44": "...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_45": "Honesty or duty... Hmm, duty has to come first, right? (Mumble, mumble...)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_46": "...What?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_47": "Haha, nothing! Oh, right! It's almost time for practice. I've got to go. Bye, {PlayerName}!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_48": "Cartethyia disappears down the hallway like a gust of wind.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_49": "...?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_5": "Could you tell us which law of physics explains why friction produces heat?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_50": "Somehow... Cartethyia seems a little off today.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_51": "Got some Orchestral Music Club stuff to take care of anyway. Better go check it out.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_6": "L-Law...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_7": "Maybe it's just your imagination, but as Cartethyia stands up after being called on, you can see her head slowly drooping as she tries to think.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_8": "The law is... Salvation, Unity, and Ascension...?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_1_9": "...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_1": "Stay calm, everyone. Let's follow Ciaccona's lead and find the rhythm again—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_10": "Just then, from your seat on the other side of the club room, you sense something off.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_11": "It comes from the same direction as the noises from earlier, but this time, it's not an invisible sound wave approaching. It's the sharp whistle of something with very real weight cutting through the air—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_12": "Oh no!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_13": "Cartethyia!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_14": "Ciaccona!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_15": "The moment you shout, the club room window shatters.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_16": "...!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_17": "A gust of wind sweeps through the crowd. In the blink of an eye, Cartethyia is already at the window, hands outstretched toward the incoming object like an ace catcher—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_18": "...Phew.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_19": "Cartethyia catches the object, and no one is hurt.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_2": "Da, da—da! Da, da—da!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_20": "For a split second, you think you see a look on Cartethyia's face you've never seen before... Something almost frightening?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_21": "Carty, are you hurt?!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_22": "Ciaccona hurries over to check on her, and the expression vanishes from Cartethyia's face.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_23": "It's nothing short of a miracle. Common sense says no one could catch something flying at that speed bare-handed and walk away unscathed. Yet the stone thrown as a weapon now rests quietly in Cartethyia's palm, as harmless as a piece of candy.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_24": "I'm fine! Thanks to {PlayerName}'s warning, I was able to stop it in time. Otherwise... who knows what might have happened.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_25": "Cartethyia gives you a grateful look. Only then does the fear catch up with you, along with the relief of a narrow escape.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_26": "Wait, wait, but this... Someone threw it up here on purpose, right?! Is this some kind of prank?!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_27": "Ciaccona, this is getting dangerous. I think everyone should go home for today.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_28": "Y-Yeah, you're right, Carty!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_29": "Everyone, that's enough practice for today. Be careful on your way home!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_3": "Something is strange at the Orchestral Music Club today.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_30": "At Ciaccona's instruction, the club members don't linger. They disperse in small groups, talking among themselves.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_31": "But Cartethyia, the star of the moment, doesn't join in. Lost in thought, she weaves against the flow of people to find you.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_32": "Um... {PlayerName}.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_33": "There's something I'd like you to help me with!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_34": "Cartethyia, {PlayerName}, I'm really sorry to trouble you both...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_35": "In an inconspicuous corner near the athletic field, Cartethyia introduces you to a member of the Orchestral Music Club.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_36": "You remember her as the string section's principal, the most gifted player in the club after Ciaccona. But for a while now, she's been missing rehearsals.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_37": "Lately, she keeps running into strange things on her way home. It's shaken her up so badly that she hasn't been able to come to club practice.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_38": "I think the harassment the Orchestral Music Club has been dealing with, and even the attack just now, might be connected to this. That's why I've been investigating!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_39": "But... I've spent several nights looking into it, and I still haven't found any clues...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_4": "Whenever the orchestra starts playing together, jarring noises blare in from outside the window. Sometimes it's the clang of metal, sometimes car horns, sometimes even a string of firecrackers. It's almost as if someone is deliberately trying to stop the club from rehearsing.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_40": "Cartethyia's voice trails off toward the end, turning hesitant, her eyes darting away.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_41": "(So that's why Cartethyia keeps falling asleep in class.)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_42": "I-I really can't afford to sleep through any more classes!!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_43": "But giving up on a promise before I've kept it... That's not what a knight does.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_44": "As the teachings say: \"A lone sword cannot hold back the long night. Only by walking with trusted companions can one light the path ahead.\"",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_45": "What is she even talking about...? You're a little baffled by Cartethyia's talk of knightly spirit and teachings, yet somehow, the hope in her voice lifts your spirits.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_46": "When your eyes meet, you see the blonde girl looking up at you expectantly.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_47": "So... {PlayerName}, will you fight alongside me?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_5": "Fortunately, Ciaccona can still pick out the beat amid the chaos, and with Cartethyia calling it out at the top of her lungs, practice limps along.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_6": "Aww, Carty, you're a lifesaver!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_7": "Everyone in the club keeps running into weird stuff lately! If we can't practice, then come Nationals, we might as well book ourselves a day tour of the Central Concert Hall!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_8": "It's my honor to help everyone!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_2_9": "Ciaccona, there's still one last piece to rehearse. We can start right—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_1": "I-It's right here...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_10": "You instinctively step forward to shield the two girls, staying alert for anything moving around you.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_11": "As you move forward, the lights begin to flicker faster and faster. At the same time, a dark shape seems to be taking form inside one of the buildings.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_12": "...(Gulp)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_13": "M-Maybe... we should take another route...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_14": "No. If there's really something dangerous here, then you're already being watched. You hold your breath and steel yourself as you approach the shadow.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_15": "(If anything happens, get everyone out of here immediately...!)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_16": "...With that thought in mind, you take one step after another toward the shadow.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_17": "Meow...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_18": "Oh, it's a kitty!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_19": "A black cat darts lightly past the window.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_2": "Taking Cartethyia up on her offer, you decide to team up with her to escort the Orchestral Music Club member home.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_20": "It's just a cat...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_21": "Of course. You're just ordinary students in a small town. Real life doesn't have that much drama. The knot in your chest loosens all at once, and you even feel a little sheepish about being so jumpy just now.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_22": "Suddenly, a blinding flash of white light erupts before you.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_23": "Aaaahhhhhhh!!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_24": "The sudden burst of light makes it impossible to keep your eyes open, while your schoolmate's scream echoes in your ears. You raise a hand and struggle to open your eyes just a sliver.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_25": "On the nearest building, a sign suddenly lights up, revealing a message written in red.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_26": "\"STOP OR DIE\"",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_27": "Sniff... sob...!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_28": "It's happening again... They're here for us again... Ever since our club decided to aim for the National Music Competition, it's always been like this...!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_29": "The club member you're escorting is clearly on the verge of a breakdown and can no longer hold back her sobs.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_3": "It's late, yet every streetlight along the road is dark, which is more than a little unnerving.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_30": "At the sight, something seems to occur to Cartethyia, and she steps forward alone.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_31": "Hyaah...!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_32": "A beautiful roundhouse kick.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_33": "A second later, the sign goes dark and comes crashing down, frame and all.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_34": "When you encounter an enemy, you face it without fear! If it's scaring my schoolmate, I just have to beat it!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_35": "Cartethyia turns around, pumps her fist triumphantly, and flashes a smile without a cloud in it.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_36": "But... what does the writing in that foreign language mean?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_37": "...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_38": "...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_39": "...Pfft.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_4": "Strange. Are they all broken? This isn't safe at all. I'll have to call maintenance tomorrow and get them fixed.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_40": "Cartethyia's clear voice sweeps away all the tension. The corners of your mouth twitch several times, but in the end, you can't hold it in and let out a laugh.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_41": "Huh?! Why are you laughing?! D-Did I mess something up?!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_42": "Waah... I'm from a really tiny village, and I only got into this school because of my athletic talent. I'm not good at anything except being strong, but... I still want to help everyone...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_43": "Does that message contain something really important? Is this all because I keep falling asleep in class...?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_44": "Cartethyia works herself into a panic all on her own. Oddly enough, that's what draws a small laugh from the club member who was falling apart moments ago.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_45": "Hehe... Thank you, Cartethyia.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_46": "I think everyone in the club feels the same way I do. Cartethyia, you've really inspired all of us.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_47": "Maybe it's because everyone has finally relaxed, but you don't run into anything else strange on the rest of the way home.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_48": "Well then, this is where we leave you—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_49": "Suddenly, something drops right in front of you. It glints silver under the streetlight... and it's flopping around.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_5": "Still deep in thought, Cartethyia leads the way.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_50": "Is this... a live fish? It looks like some animal has taken a few bites out of it, leaving some of its scales missing.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_51": "Just as you're wondering where it came from and reach out to deal with it—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_52": "Aaaaaaahhhhhhh!!!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_53": "What happened?!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_54": "Why are you screaming?!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_55": "F-Fish are heretical beings from the deep sea, wielding the wicked power to control minds...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_56": "I hate fish...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_6": "Ah...!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_7": "As if sensing your footsteps, the dark streetlights suddenly begin flickering at random.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_8": "Watch out!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_3_9": "Who's there?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_1": "...Ngh...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_10": "(Consider the streetlights and sign.)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_11": "(The streetlights and the sign are in the same area. It looks like they're controlled by the same mechanism.)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_13": "(The fish has bite marks, and it fell right where the cat was headed. The cat must have dropped it while carrying it off.)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_14": "(Consider how the two might be connected.)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_15": "(The streetlights flicker and the sign lights up at random, but there's no one in any of the nearby buildings.)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_16": "Someone could use the fish as bait to lure the cat into the control room. That would make the streetlights and sign flicker at random.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_17": "Cartethyia, your roundhouse kick scared the cat out of the control room. Then, a while later, it accidentally let go of the fish in its mouth, which fell right in front of us.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_18": "After all, you can't exactly control what a cat does.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_19": "Wow... That explains everything we ran into! That's incredible, {PlayerName}!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_2": "Cartethyia is trembling inside the cramped warehouse.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_20": "So our next goal is to find that control room! I feel like we're getting closer and closer to finding the culprit!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_21": "And so, after some time spent investigating, you find this warehouse.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_22": "The Celestial Steed Corp logo is emblazoned on its door. Hoping to find more clues, you push the door open and discover the culprits' plan.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_23": "{PlayerName}, look! It seems like they're trying to stop us from participating in the National Music Competition!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_24": "With this, we've got them dead to rights! Hehe, knightly quest: a smashing success!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_25": "Neither of you notices the footsteps coming from outside the door.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_26": "Let's go home for today. Tomorrow, we can take this to a teacher at school—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_27": "...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_28": "Huh?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_29": "The door... won't open.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_3": "She sits huddled in a corner against the wall, wrapping her arms tightly around her knees. Her lips are pale, and she can't even respond to you.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_30": "Back to the present. Ever since you were locked in the warehouse, Cartethyia hasn't been herself.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_31": "The usual light in her eyes is completely gone, replaced by a fear that looks as though she's trapped in a nightmare.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_32": "Now, she remains curled up in the corner, trembling slightly.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_33": "Are you okay?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_34": "Is there anything I can do?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_35": "(Say nothing and quietly stay by her side.)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_36": "{PlayerName}...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_37": "Could you... sit a little closer to me...?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_38": "You nod and sit down right beside Cartethyia against the wall.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_39": "Perhaps sensing you beside her, she finally loosens her grip around her knees and slowly reaches for your hand. Her palm feels ice-cold.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_4": "The golden-haired girl who's always so bright and lively, lifting everyone up with her cheer and energy... You've never seen her look like this before.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_40": "I'm sorry... I-I can't quite control myself...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_41": "You know she means the fear that has suddenly gripped her. Of course, you don't blame Cartethyia. You smile and shake your head, then take her cold hand in yours.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_42": "It's okay. Whatever happened, you can tell me.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_43": "Perhaps sensing your sincerity, Cartethyia lets out a breath of relief and slowly relaxes.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_44": "Thank you, {PlayerName}.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_45": "Actually... I'm very afraid of being locked in a room.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_46": "For some reason, you feel like you've heard a similar story before.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_47": "A golden-haired Blessed Maiden, imprisoned in solitude. But where have you heard this story before?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_48": "I never met my birth parents. I grew up in an orphanage... But all the adults there were busy, so I was always locked in my room.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_49": "There was nothing in the room. No toys, no decorations, no light. Just one tiny little window, through which I could hear the noisy world outside.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_5": "Cartethyia...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_50": "Why was I the only one who had to suffer? Why wasn't I one of the children laughing outside...? The longer I stayed there, the more those thoughts filled my mind.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_51": "Luckily, I still had that story.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_52": "You know which story she means.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_53": "\"A righteous knight battling the evil Threnodian!\" I imagined myself as the knight in the story and fought those dark thoughts in my heart as if I were dueling an enemy.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_54": "Only by doing that could I... keep living with the same hope as everyone else.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_55": "You understand now. Cartethyia has sunk into this gloom because the cramped, closed-off warehouse has trapped her back in a past she'd rather not remember.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_56": "In that case—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_57": "Let's continue that story.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_58": "Huh?",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_59": "This warehouse stores printed materials, so there are plenty of loose sheets of paper and paints lying around. You grab a handful and spread them out before Cartethyia.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_6": "It all goes back to that investigation.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_60": "After defeating the Threnodian, the knight begins a new adventure.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_61": "She befriends a great dragon, who invites her to ride upon its back and soar through the skies. The dragon says its name is—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_62": "Gehinnom!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_63": "As the two of you talk, Cartethyia picks up a pen and begins drawing the pale dragon.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_64": "The knight and Gehinnom continue their journey and meet a powerful swordsman named Cadanto. The knight trains under him, and after years of grueling practice, she becomes the number one swordswoman in the kingdom!",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_65": "And then—",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_66": "Cartethyia's hand pauses for a moment as she draws. Then she looks up at you with a smile.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_67": "The knight comes to a small town, where she meets an adventurer dressed in black.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_68": "Then the knight and the adventurer become friends.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_69": "And their journey will go on forever.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_7": "Cartethyia's panic over the fish that fell from the sky soon subsides. After seeing the Orchestral Music Club member home, you begin analyzing everything you've encountered along the way.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_70": "...That's right.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_71": "They'll travel across every mountain and river in the world, journey through every season, through day and night, listening to the whispers of the wind and the roar of the tides, watching flowers bloom and snow fall...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_72": "Until their deeds are praised in song in every corner of the world.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_73": "...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_74": "No longer trembling, the girl closes her eyes and lets out a soft breath. Then she gets to her feet and walks toward the door imprisoning you both.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_75": "I'm not afraid anymore.",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_76": "(Consider the cat and the fish.)",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_8": "Flickering streetlights... the illuminated sign... the cat in the room... and that fish that suddenly fell from the sky...",
+  "KTXY_AVGcharacter_4_9": "Do you think all these things we encountered might be connected, {PlayerName}?",
   "Kanxingxing_10_1": "You're back. Um... got any news about Sanna?",
   "Kanxingxing_10_10": "As long as we went up to the Spacetrek Observatory at the time set by the Sky Projection Array, we'd always see the stars just as we expected.",
   "Kanxingxing_10_11": "...Turns out she got tired of the stars here.",
@@ -111008,6 +120533,8 @@
   "Kanxingxing_9_7": "She said you were her senior.",
   "Kanxingxing_9_8": "She said Sanna went to the frostlands with you.",
   "Kanxingxing_9_9": "Heh… Yeah. They actually met through a research project I led a while back.",
