   "LoadingTipsText_613901_Title": "Cubie Wars",
   "LoadingTipsText_614001_TipsText": "Deep within the Heart Realms, the heart finds peace.",
   "LoadingTipsText_614001_Title": "Hsin's Courtyard",
+  "LoadingTipsText_614301_TipsText": "The lounge where the souls of fallen soldiers linger.\nThe voices of the past have fallen silent. For them, this is both a farewell and a new beginning.",
+  "LoadingTipsText_614301_Title": "Train of Souls: Lounge",
+  "LoadingTipsText_614302_TipsText": "Lily's abode in the Somnoire.\nShe hopes that all who enter can find, in their own way, a path to redemption.",
+  "LoadingTipsText_614302_Title": "Train of Souls: Conservatory",
+  "LoadingTipsText_614401_TipsText": "A mysterious expanse hidden in the deepest reaches of the Somnoire, formed from fragments of the subconscious that have settled here. Time and space fold into one another, endlessly unraveling their own meaning.",
+  "LoadingTipsText_614401_Title": "Desolate Dreamfield",
   "LoadingTipsText_80020101_TipsText": "A mysterious gateway has appeared, leading to a realm known as Somnoire. Legend has it that it hosts the dreams of all beings in Solaris...",
   "LoadingTipsText_80020101_Title": "Somnoire, the Illusive Realm",
   "LoadingTipsText_900101_TipsText": "In broad daylight, Daemons once devoured in a great fire whisper through the streets of Ragunna. They wield beloved poetry and music as weapons of their curse. A confrontation, wrapped in the language of art, begins to unfold on the stage of Rinascita.\nRemnants of past sins resurge. From deep beneath the earth, they scheme and plot. When the flames that once ripped through the night return, a silent war will begin.",
@@ -168148,6 +178322,8 @@
   "LoadingTipsText_901301_Title": "Lamplight in Mirage, Sword's Resolve in Heart",
   "LoadingTipsText_901401_TipsText": "The Prism unveils countless forms. Dreams reflect the mortal world.\nOld covenants endure, and beneath the umbrella, shadows of the past still follow.\nThe Waking Moon arrives in its appointed hour, and in her palm, a city is held aloft, never to fall.\nThe Fox Shadow drifts through the rise and fall of all things, through endless simulations, seeking the road yet unseen.",
   "LoadingTipsText_901401_Title": "Prism's Illusion, Heart's Illumination",
+  "LoadingTipsText_901501_TipsText": "Beyond the door lies a battlefield long past. A train bearing its countless mysteries rolls ever deeper into dreamland.\n\"May your soul wander no more...\"\nHeed this heartfelt prayer. Listen, too, for the echoes of a past long buried by time.",
+  "LoadingTipsText_901501_Title": "Lilies in a Dying Dream",
   "LoadingTipsText_920101_TipsText": "The Priestesses have forgotten. Augusta has forgotten... Even though the world has forgotten, you remember Iuno. After all, you see her once again.\nWith her bracelet and the moonlight to guide you, you walk on. You don't know where the path leads, only that you must keep going, until the moonlight finally falls.",
   "LoadingTipsText_920101_Title": "Where Moonlight Falls",
   "LoadingTipsText_920201_TipsText": "Humble and unadorned, this place offers a transitory respite in the looping Lament.",
@@ -168252,6 +178428,16 @@
   "LoadingTipsText_925701_Title": "Heart of Frost",
   "LoadingTipsText_925801_TipsText": "Since the Fox Shadow's true face stays hidden, let it think it guides.\nWhen the old bonds finally break, Suoming sees what is...",
   "LoadingTipsText_925801_Title": "Heart of Bloom: Suoming",
+  "LoadingTipsText_926001_TipsText": "A battlefield shrouded in the Somnoire. The voices of fallen soldiers still haunt its fields, some sighing in helpless despair, others raging with bitter resentment. All remain frozen in time, as though awaiting a train to carry them away.",
+  "LoadingTipsText_926001_Title": "Somnoire: Resonator War Battlefield",
+  "LoadingTipsText_926101_TipsText": "The Fifth Sector, also known as the \"Domain of Death,\" was the deadliest battleground of the Resonator War. What transpired there remains a mystery. No tales ever returned from that place.",
+  "LoadingTipsText_926101_Title": "Somnoire: Resonator War Battlefield",
+  "LoadingTipsText_926201_TipsText": "A mysterious train that carries lost souls to their final rest. Shaped by the Somnoire, its interiors take on an idealized splendor that is lavish, warm, and almost too perfect to be real.\nThe Lounge Carriage is where Resonator soldiers gather to dine, make music, and share a little laughter. For a fleeting moment, the war and its sorrows seem far away.",
+  "LoadingTipsText_926201_Title": "Train of Souls: Lounge",
+  "LoadingTipsText_926301_TipsText": "A mysterious train that carries lost souls to their final rest. Shaped by the Somnoire, its interiors take on an idealized splendor that is lavish, warm, and almost too perfect to be real.\nGentle prayers drift from the conservatory: \"May your soul wander no more...\"\nLike a lullaby, they lull the train into a deep and dreamless slumber.",
+  "LoadingTipsText_926301_Title": "Train of Souls: Conservatory",
+  "LoadingTipsText_926401_TipsText": "An endless expanse within the Somnoire, like some colossal repository where fragments of dreams lie scattered in haphazard disarray. Familiar objects from forgotten dreams linger here, stripped of context and meaning.",
+  "LoadingTipsText_926401_Title": "Somnoire: Endless Dreamscape",
   "LoadingTipsText_UGC01_TipsText": "When a Resonator's mental strength and Forte are pushed beyond their limits for an extended period, it can lead to a rare state called \"Overclocking.\" While this condition can be managed, there's no permanent cure. In extreme cases, the Tacet Mark can expand uncontrollably, devouring everything around it, with the Overclocked Resonators ultimately becoming a Tacet Discord of the Tacet Field.",
   "LoadingTipsText_UGC01_Title": "Overclock I",
   "LoadingTipsText_UGC02_TipsText": "Formed from Tacetite and hidden in the Stormy Sea, this archipelago is a sanctuary for the world's most talented individuals. With a mission to combat the destructive Lament, it has fostered extensive partnerships across Solaris-3. While its advanced technologies are shared with the outside world, their origins remain a mystery, even to its members.",
@@ -168655,7 +178841,32 @@
