   "Luuk_Shengtai_2_5": "Then it sounds like it's time you gave yourself a proper break.",
   "Luuk_Shengtai_2_6": "In fact, you're not alone. I meant to tidy up my room once I wrapped up my work… but somehow, one thing after another kept getting in the way.",
   "Luuk_Shengtai_2_7": "I suppose that's just life. Plans rarely keep up with change. All we can really do is find a way to breathe comfortably in the spaces between the chaos.",
+  "LyricsText_700001_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700001_Translation": "<i>The home I knew</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700002_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700002_Translation": "<i>now towers tall with light</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700003_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700003_Translation": "<i>The pale-walled ward</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700004_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700004_Translation": "<i>now pours with golden wine</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700005_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700005_Translation": "<i>I walk that empty wasteland</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700006_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700006_Translation": "<i>no one remembers</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700007_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700007_Translation": "<i>no one recalls</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700008_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700008_Translation": "<i>who we were</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700017_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700017_Translation": "<i>Through the hurt move on now</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700018_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700018_Translation": "<i>Fear no more, the morn comes to call</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700019_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700019_Translation": "<i>Face the day, you've always been</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700020_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700020_Translation": "<i>The starlight you longed to embrace</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700021_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700021_Translation": "<i>Away you wander into dark endless night</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700022_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700022_Translation": "<i>Aglow petals drift round you like light</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700023_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700023_Translation": "<i>Aware what it costs but you let it go</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700024_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700024_Translation": "<i>Just let them fall</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700025_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700025_Translation": "<i>Your love never fades</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700026_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700026_Translation": "<i>In the souls you held your spring is still alive</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700027_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700027_Translation": "<i>Now our turn our side will bring you back to life</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700028_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700028_Translation": "<i>All of the light you gave</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700029_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700029_Translation": "<i>now find its way to you</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700030_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700030_Translation": "<i>May you now bloom once again</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700031_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700031_Translation": "<i>Hope remains</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700032_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700032_Translation": "<i>All of the dreams we keep</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700033_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700033_Translation": "<i>Rising as light for YOU, into the sky</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700035_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700035_Translation": "<i>Let it shine anew</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700036_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700036_Translation": "<i>Leave all of that behind. Let me see what life brings to me, what a simple day can feel like</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700039_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700039_Translation": "<i>For once can take my time (Maybe I Want to be here just a while more with you now)</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700040_Original": "{KeepOrigin}",
+  "LyricsText_700040_Translation": "<i>So this is what the days can be these fleeting moments stay in my dream~</i>",
   "LyricsText_750001_Original": "",
   "LyricsText_750001_Translation": "",
   "LyricsText_750002_Original": "",
