+  "OrnamentAttrDes_80870003": "A monitoring device used to keep Resonators in Ashinohara under surveillance. Due to Hiyuki's unique status, this one is specially designed to regulate her abilities.",
   "OrnamentAttrDes_80870004": "A headpiece inspired by a certain flower, and the only accessory she ever chose for herself.",
