   "OrnamentAttrDes_80871005": "A doll crafted jointly by Rover and Abby after attending a concert. Its design draws inspiration from Rover, and its movement from Abby. Humming softly, it dances with love and starlight.",
   "OrnamentAttrDes_80871006": "A special souvenir from the Pioneer Association. For the Rover, and for the little hero who travels beside them, leaving footprints for civilization to follow.",
   "OrnamentBgDes_80870001": "Soft, round, and soothing to the touch... Take Fleet Snowfluff's favorite mascot with you on your journey to save the world!",
+  "OrnamentBgDes_80870003": "A constraint from Ashinohara, as well as the Miko of Flaming Sakura's symbol.\n\nThere is no need to seek an answer to everything. What really matters is to carry everything until the day the answer presents itself.",
   "OrnamentBgDes_80870004": "She knows full well that carrying the mantle of a miko means surrendering the ordinary life she once longed for.\nYet, before the last traces of the first snow melt away, she, too, deserves a fleeting moment to bloom, like any other flowers.",
   "OrnamentBgDes_80870005": "Denia sometimes finds herself wishing for a sharper divide between day and night, as if that might separate what is seen from what is true.",
