   "PhotographHandBook_170_Name": "\"Hsin, the Moon Fox\"",
   "PhotographHandBook_171_Descrtption": "May the world's warmth linger forever.",
   "PhotographHandBook_171_Name": "Joy Beneath the Waking Moon",
+  "PhotographHandBook_172_Descrtption": "Deep within the dream, a girl's blurry silhouette flickers before your eyes. Is it her? Or someone else entirely?",
+  "PhotographHandBook_172_Name": "Flickering Silhouette",
+  "PhotographHandBook_173_Descrtption": "Countless stars shimmer in your eyes. Hidden in the night sky of this dream are their dazzling colors and the words she wishes to share with you.",
+  "PhotographHandBook_173_Name": "A Stroll Beneath the Stars",
+  "PhotographHandBook_174_Descrtption": "\"May your soul wander no more.\" Thank you for joining me in offering them one final blessing.",
+  "PhotographHandBook_174_Name": "A Journey of Repose",
+  "PhotographHandBook_175_Descrtption": "Even the longest journey must come to an end. But at least she has discovered the tenderness that lies beyond the world she once knew.",
+  "PhotographHandBook_175_Name": "The Final Trip",
+  "PhotographHandBook_176_Descrtption": "Burning tears flowed down amidst the cold rain. She turned her gun upon herself, plunging into death with a broken soul.",
+  "PhotographHandBook_176_Name": "The Withering of a Flower",
+  "PhotographHandBook_177_Descrtption": "She once imagined the journey home would be long and arduous, only to discover that \"home\" no longer existed. What should have been a homecoming became an exile without end.",
+  "PhotographHandBook_177_Name": "Those Left Behind by Time",
+  "PhotographHandBook_178_Descrtption": "The time has come for this lonely flower to wither. Even if no one is there to bid her farewell, she wishes to leave this world in her most beautiful bloom.",
+  "PhotographHandBook_178_Name": "Farewell, Lily",
+  "PhotographHandBook_179_Descrtption": "\"The happiness you brought us has finally come full circle. Now, it's our turn to place that happiness in your hands.\"",
+  "PhotographHandBook_179_Name": "Flowers and Blessings for You",
   "PhotographHandBook_17_Descrtption": "Ooh, Here You Are",
   "PhotographHandBook_17_Name": "Visitor from the Shores",
+  "PhotographHandBook_180_Descrtption": "Leave all the pain and farewells in yesterday. Now run, run to your own tomorrow.",
+  "PhotographHandBook_180_Name": "A Smile in Countless Tomorrows",
+  "PhotographHandBook_181_Descrtption": "A phone call, a game, a lie woven out of love.",
+  "PhotographHandBook_181_Name": "One Last Call",
+  "PhotographHandBook_182_Descrtption": "The blue night will pass, and the dawn we've been waiting for will rise.",
+  "PhotographHandBook_182_Name": "Finale",
+  "PhotographHandBook_183_Descrtption": "If there is no place left for her in this world, then the Somnoire shall be her final home.",
+  "PhotographHandBook_183_Name": "A Beginning of Your Own",
   "PhotographHandBook_18_Descrtption": "Cosmos, Cloudy, Encore Tagging Along!",
