+  "RoleTowerLevel_VedioName_2": "Xiangli Yao can handle different types of enemies with different skills.\nAgainst multiple enemies, cast <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Law of Reigns</color> to pull them in and improve survivability.\nAgainst a single enemy, cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Charged Shot</color> to deal more DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerLevel_VedioName_3": "Jinhsi can adapt to different situations with different skills.\nWhen survivability is less of a concern, cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Soaring Loong</color> and <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Diving Loong</color> for steadier DMG output.\nWhen survivability is a greater concern, cast <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illuminous Epiphany</color> for higher burst DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerLevel_VedioName_4": "Changli has a higher cap on <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color> stacks and can accumulate <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color> faster.\nCast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Flaming Sacrifice</color> a certain number of times to unlock the more powerful <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Heavenfire Dominion</color>.",
+  "RoleTowerLevel_VedioName_5": "Camellya can enter <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color> to deal more DMG, but the remaining time counts down faster.\nOutside <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Cluster Blossoms</color> becomes available, dealing high DMG.\n<color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> and <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color> are also enhanced.",
+  "RoleTowerLevel_VedioName_6": "When Carlotta is in <color=Highlight>Twilight Tango</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> resets the charges of <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color> at close range reduces more of the target's Vibration Strength. <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Fatal Finale</color> deals greatly increased DMG to immobilized targets.",
