+  "RoleTowerStageShortTitle_OneFloor": "(Node {0})",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_100_1": "None",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_100_2": "Casting Resonance Liberation restores {0} points of Concerto Energy.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_100_3": "Casting Outro Skill grants all Resonators in the team {0} All-Attribute DMG Amplification for {1}s.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_101_1": "None",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_101_2": "Casting Resonance Liberation restores {0} Max Resonance Energy for Resonators in the team.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_101_3": "Start with {0} points of Concerto Energy by default. Restore <SapTag=2>{2}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=2} of Concerto Energy every {1}s. Casting Outro Skill grants the incoming Resonator {3} All-Attribute DMG Amplification for {4}s or until they are switched out.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_1_1": "Xiangli Yao deals more total DMG.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> fully restores <color=Highlight>Capacity</color>.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Decipher</color> deals more total DMG. After casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill-  Decipher</color>, cast <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Revamp</color> to immediately enter <color=Highlight>Intuition</color>.\n<size=10></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Intuition</color>, <color=Highlight>hold Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack: Charged Shot</color>.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_1_2": "Xiangli Yao deals more total DMG after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color>.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_1_3": "<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Law of Reigns</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Charged Shot</color>, and Convolution Matrix deal more total DMG.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Law of Reigns</color> grants Xiangli Yao interruption immunity against the next attack he takes and reduces the DMG he takes from that attack.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_2_1": "Jinhsi deals more total DMG.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illuminous Epiphany</color> deals more total DMG.\nWhen a Resonator in the team defeats a target, Jinhsi gains <color=Highlight>Evanescence</color>, stacking up to <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=time P=times SapTag=0}.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crescent Divinity</color> removes all stacks of <color=Highlight>Evanescence</color> to increase the total DMG of this <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crescent Divinity</color> and restore <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Incarnation</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Soaring Loong</color> and <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Diving Loong</color>. <color=Highlight>Hold Normal Attack</color> to consume <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color> and generate <color=Highlight>Lightning Smite</color> and <color=Highlight>Thunder Shock</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crescent Divinity</color> has increased travel distance.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_2_2": "When a Resonator in the team deals Coordinated Attack DMG, Jinhsi restores additional <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color>.\nJinhsi's <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> deals more total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_2_3": "Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> fully restores <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color>.\n<color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Soaring Loong</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Diving Loong</color>, <color=Highlight>Lightning Smite</color>, <color=Highlight>Thunder Shock</color>, and <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illuminous Epiphany</color> deal more total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_3_1": "Changli deals more total DMG.\nWhen <color=Highlight>True Sight: Conquest</color> or <color=Highlight>True Sight: Charge</color> hits a target, Changli gains extra <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color>.\nExcess <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color> can be converted to <color=Highlight>Flaming Feather</color>. After casting <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Flaming Feather</color> can be converted to <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color>.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Flaming Sacrifice</color>, Changli enters True Sight.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Flaming Sacrifice</color> 3 times, <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Heavenfire Dominion</color> becomes available.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_3_2": "Defeating enemy targets grants extra <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color>.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> deals more total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_3_3": "<color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Flaming Sacrifice</color> deals more total DMG.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Heavenfire Dominion</color> grants <color=Highlight>Lone Feather</color>. If Changli is hit or launched while holding <color=Highlight>Lone Feather</color>, she immediately and automatically recovers from the attack. <color=Highlight>Lone Feather</color> is removed after this effect is triggered.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_4_1": "Camellya deals more total DMG.\n<size=10></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, Camellya gains the following effects:\n- Remaining time counts down faster.\n- <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> deals more total DMG.\n<size=10></size>\nOutside <color=Highlight>Blossom</color> Mode, Camellya gains the following effects:\n- Dealing DMG stacks <color=Highlight>Creeping Vines</color>.\n- <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill: Cluster Blossoms</color> becomes available once <color=Highlight>Creeping Vines</color> reaches a certain number of stacks.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_4_2": "While in <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> and <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color> deal DMG multiple times and add extra DMG to subsequent attacks.\nOutside <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> and <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color> deal more total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_4_3": "While in <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> deals more total DMG.\nOutside <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Cluster Blossoms</color> deals more total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_5_1": "Carlotta deals more total DMG.\nOutside the <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> enhanced state, casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> fully restores Carlotta's <color=Highlight>Substance</color>.\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> enhanced state, Carlotta gains the following effects:\n- <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color> deals additional DMG and reduces more Vibration Strength. It also increases the total DMG of <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Fatal Finale</color>, with a greater increase against immobilized targets.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> resets the charges of <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color>.\n- When <color=Highlight>Forte Gauge</color> is full, reset the Cooldown of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_5_2": "Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Imminent Oblivion</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Containment Tactics</color> grants Carlotta <color=Highlight>Iridescent Prism</color>, which increases her total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDesc_5_3": "<color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Imminent Oblivion</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Containment Tactics</color>, and <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color> deal more total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_1_1": "Xiangli Yao deals {0} more total DMG.\n<size=10></size>\nWhen Xiangli Yao casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, he gains <SapTag=1>{1}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=1} of <color=Highlight>Capacity</color>.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Decipher</color> and <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Revamp</color> deal {2} more total DMG. After casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Decipher</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Revamp</color> is considered casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Cogitation Model</color> and sends Xiangli Yao directly into <color=Highlight>Intuition</color>, granting him <SapTag=3>{3}</SapTag> <color=Highlight>{Cus:Sap,S=Hypercube P=Hypercubes SapTag=3}</color> and <SapTag=4>{4}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=4} of <color=Highlight>Performance Capacity</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Cogitation Model</color> no longer sends Xiangli Yao into <color=Highlight>Intuition</color>.\nCasting Intro Skill - Chain Rule ends <color=Highlight>Intuition</color>.\n<size=10></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Intuition</color>, Xiangli Yao gains the following enhancements:\n- If <color=Highlight>Performance Capacity</color> is not at {5} points, <color=Highlight>hold Normal Attack</color> to consume <SapTag=6>{6}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=6} of <color=Highlight>Performance Capacity</color> and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack: Charged Shot</color>, restoring {7} points of Concerto Energy and dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> with a DMG Multiplier equal to {8} of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill: Law of Reigns</color>'s, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> DMG.\n- <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Law of Reigns</color> pulls in nearby enemies.\n- <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Divergence</color> and <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Law of Reigns</color> have increased travel distance.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_1_2": "Xiangli Yao deals {0} more total DMG for {1}s upon casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color>.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_1_3": "<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Law of Reigns</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Charged Shot</color>, and Convolution Matrix deal {0} more total DMG.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Law of Reigns</color> grants <SapTag=1>{1}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=1} of <color=Highlight>Gross Analysis</color>, stacking up to <SapTag=2>{2}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=time P=times SapTag=2}.\nXiangli Yao can hold up to {3} stacks of <color=Highlight>Gross Analysis</color>. Taking DMG from an enemy consumes <SapTag=4>{4}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=4} of <color=Highlight>Gross Analysis</color> to grant interruption immunity and reduce DMG taken by {5} for {6}s. This effect can be triggered once per second.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_2_1": "Jinhsi deals {0} more total DMG.\n<size=10></size>\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illuminous Epiphany</color> deals {1} more total DMG.\nIf Jinhsi is in <color=Highlight>Incarnation</color> and has at least {2} points of <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color>, <color=Highlight>hold Normal Attack</color> to consecutively cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Soaring Loong</color> and <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Diving Loong</color>.\n- <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Soaring Loong</color> deals DMG with a DMG Multiplier equal to {3} of <color=Highlight>Incarnation - Basic Attack Stage 3</color>'s, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> DMG. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Soaring Loong</color> consumes <SapTag=4>{4}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=4} of <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color> and generates <SapTag=5>{5}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=bolt P=bolts SapTag=5} of <color=Highlight>Lightning Smite</color> and <SapTag=6>{6}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=bolt P=bolts SapTag=6} of <color=Highlight>Thunder Shock</color> nearby.\n- <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Diving Loong</color> deals DMG with a DMG Multiplier equal to {7} of <color=Highlight>Incarnation - Basic Attack Stage 4</color>'s, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> DMG. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Diving Loong</color> consumes <SapTag=8>{8}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=8} of <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color> and generates <SapTag=9>{9}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=bolt P=bolts SapTag=9} of <color=Highlight>Lightning Smite</color> and <SapTag=A>{10}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=bolt P=bolts SapTag=A} of <color=Highlight>Thunder Shock</color> nearby.\nEach bolt of <color=Highlight>Lightning Smite</color> deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> equal to {11} of Jinhsi's ATK, and each bolt of <color=Highlight>Thunder Shock</color> deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> equal to {12} of Jinhsi's ATK, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> DMG.\n<color=Highlight>Lightning Smite</color> and <color=Highlight>Thunder Shock</color> benefit from the additional DMG Multiplier granted by consuming <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color> through Jinhsi's Resonance Chain Thawing Triumph.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crescent Divinity</color> has increased travel distance.\n<size=10></size>\nWhen a Resonator in the team defeats an enemy, Jinhsi gains <SapTag=B>{13}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=B} of <color=Highlight>Evanescence</color>, stacking up to {14} times.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crescent Divinity</color> removes all stacks of <color=Highlight>Evanescence</color>. For every <SapTag=C>{15}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=C} removed, this <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crescent Divinity</color> deals {16} more total DMG and restores <SapTag=D>{17}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=D} of <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color>, up to {18} more total DMG and <SapTag=E>{19}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=E} of <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color>.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_2_2": "When a Resonator in the team deals Coordinated Attack DMG, Jinhsi restores an additional <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color>. This effect can be triggered once every {1}s.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Purge of Light</color> deals {2} more total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_2_3": "Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Loong's Halo</color> restores {0} of Max <color=Highlight>Incandescence</color>.\n<color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Soaring Loong</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Diving Loong</color>, <color=Highlight>Lightning Smite</color>, <color=Highlight>Thunder Shock</color>, and <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illuminous Epiphany</color> deal {1} more total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_3_1": "Changli deals {0} more total DMG.\n<size=10></size>\n<color=Highlight>True Sight: Conquest</color> or <color=Highlight>True Sight: Charge</color> grants Changli an extra <SapTag=1>{1}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=1} of <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color> on hit.\n<size=10></size>\nIf Changli has at least {2} stacks of <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color>, any <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color> she gains is replaced with <color=Highlight>Flaming Feather</color>, up to {3} stacks.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Flaming Sacrifice</color>, Changli consumes <color=Highlight>Flaming Feather</color> and gains the same number of <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color> stacks, up to {4} stacks of <color=Highlight>Flaming Feather</color>.\n<size=10></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Flaming Sacrifice</color> grants Changli <SapTag=5>{5}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=5} of <color=Highlight>Ardent Feather</color>, then sends her into True Sight.\nWhen Changli has {6} stacks of <color=Highlight>Ardent Feather</color>, she consumes all <color=Highlight>Ardent Feather</color> stacks to unlock <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Heavenfire Dominion</color>. <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Heavenfire Dominion</color> deals DMG with a DMG Multiplier equal to {7} of <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Radiance of Fealty</color>'s.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Heavenfire Dominion</color> can be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nWhile <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Heavenfire Dominion</color> is available, Changli cannot gain <color=Highlight>Ardent Feather</color>.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Heavenfire Dominion</color> benefits from the DMG increases, Fusion DMG Bonus increases, and DEF ignore effects of Changli's Resonance Chains Learned Secrets and Realized Plans and Inherent Skill Sweeping Force.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_3_2": "Defeating enemy targets grants an extra <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Enflamement</color>.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Radiance of Fealty</color> and <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Heavenfire Dominion</color> deal {1} more total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_3_3": "<color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Flaming Sacrifice</color> deals {0} more total DMG.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Heavenfire Dominion</color> grants <color=Highlight>Lone Feather</color>. If Changli is hit or launched while holding <color=Highlight>Lone Feather</color>, she immediately and automatically recovers from the attack. If she is on the ground at that moment, this is considered a successful Dodge. <color=Highlight>Lone Feather</color> is removed after this effect is triggered.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_4_1": "Camellya deals {0} more total DMG.\n<size=10></size>\nThe Cooldown of <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> is reduced to {1}s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> or <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color> no longer sends Camellya into <color=Highlight>Budding Mode</color>.\nWhen Camellya enters <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, she can immediately enter <color=Highlight>Budding Mode</color> and remove all <color=Highlight>Crimson Bud</color> stacks. Each <color=Highlight>Crimson Bud</color> stack removed increases the DMG Multiplier boost granted by <color=Highlight>Sweet Dream</color> by an additional {2}, up to {3}.\nDepleting all <color=Highlight>Crimson Pistil</color> does not end <color=Highlight>Budding Mode</color> anymore.\nWhen Camellya exits <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, she can immediately exit <color=Highlight>Budding Mode</color>.\nWithin a certain period after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Cluster Blossoms</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Floral Ravage</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 4</color>.\n<size=10></size>\nOutside <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, hitting an enemy grants Camellya <color=Highlight>Creeping Vines</color> for {5}s, stacking up to {6} times. This effect can be triggered once every {4}s.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Creeping Vines</color> reaches {7} stacks, remove all stacks of  <color=Highlight>Creeping Vines</color> to unlock <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Cluster Blossoms</color> for {8}s, during which Camellya cannot gain <color=Highlight>Creeping Vines</color>. <color=Highlight>{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} Resonance Skill</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Cluster Blossoms</color>. If Camellya is in <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, casting it ends <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Cluster Blossoms</color> also grants <SapTag=9>{9}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=9} of <color=Highlight>Crimson Pistil</color> and deals <color=Dark>Havoc DMG</color> with a DMG Multiplier equal to {10} of <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color>'s, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Cluster Blossoms</color> has a Cooldown of {11}s.\n<size=10></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, Camellya gains the following effects:\n- Every {12}s, gain <SapTag=B>{13}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=B} of <color=Highlight>Mania</color>. When <color=Highlight>Mania</color> reaches {14} stacks, remove all <color=Highlight>Mania</color> stacks and deduct {15}s from the remaining challenge time.\n- <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Vining Waltz</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Blazing Waltz</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Atonement</color>, and <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crimson Blossom</color> deal {16} more total DMG.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> grants {17} points of Concerto Energy and raises the DMG Multiplier boost granted by <color=Highlight>Sweet Dream</color> to its maximum.\n- <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Vining Waltz Stage 3</color> and <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Blazing Waltz</color> pull in nearby enemies and have increased attack range.\n- <color=Highlight>Hold Resonance Skill</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crimson Blossom</color> and gain <SapTag=G>{18}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=G} of <color=Highlight>Crimson Pistil</color>. Shortly after casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Vining Waltz Stage 2</color>.\n- When <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> or <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color> becomes available, <color=Highlight>hold Resonance Skill</color> to exit <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color> and cast <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> or <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color>.\nWithin a certain period after casting <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> or <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Vining Waltz Stage 2</color>.\n<size=10></size>\nOutside <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, Camellya gains the following effects:\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> grants {19} points of Concerto Energy and <SapTag=I>{20}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=I} of <color=Highlight>Crimson Bud</color>.\n- <color=Highlight>{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold Resonance Skill</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crimson Blossom</color> and gain <SapTag=J>{21}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=J} of <color=Highlight>Crimson Pistil</color>. Shortly after casting this skill, <color=Highlight>{Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Vining Waltz Stage 2</color>.\n- When <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> or <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color> becomes available, <color=Highlight>hold Resonance Skill</color> to enter <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color> and cast <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> or <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color>.\nWithin a certain period after casting <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> or <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 4</color>.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_4_2": "Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Fervor Efflorescent</color> grants Camellya <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Crimson Pistil</color>.\n<size=10></size>\nWhile Camellya is in <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> and <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color> gain the following effects:\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> or <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color> generates additional <color=Highlight>Secondary Blossoms</color> to attack the target, dealing DMG equal to {1} of Camellya's ATK, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n- Shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> or <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color>, when Camellya deals DMG to a target, she generates <color=Highlight>Secondary Blossoms</color> to attack it. This effect can be triggered once every {2}s, dealing DMG equal to {3} of Camellya's ATK, considered Basic Attack DMG.\n- <color=Highlight>Secondary Blossoms</color> benefit from the DMG Multiplier increase of Camellya's Resonance Chain Calling Upon the Silent Rose.\n<size=10></size>\nOutside <color=Highlight>Blossom Mode</color>, <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> and <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color> gains the following effects:\n- <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Ephemeral</color> and <color=Highlight>Forte Circuit - Perennial</color> deal {4} more total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_4_3": "<color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Vining Waltz</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Blazing Waltz</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Atonement</color>, and <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Crimson Blossom</color> deal {0} more total DMG.\n<size=10></size>\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Cluster Blossoms</color> deals {1} more total DMG.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_5_1": "Carlotta deals {0} more total DMG.\n<size=10></size>\nOutside <color=Highlight>Twilight Tango</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> restores <SapTag=1>{1}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=1} of <color=Highlight>Substance</color>.\n<size=10></size>\nWhile Carlotta is in <color=Highlight>Twilight Tango</color>, she gains the following effects:\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Art of Violence</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Chromatic Splendor</color> removes all <color=Highlight>Meta Vector</color>, grants <color=Highlight>Final Bow</color>, and refreshes the duration of <color=Highlight>Twilight Tango</color>.\n- When <color=Highlight>Meta Vector</color> reaches {2} points, the Cooldowns of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Art of Violence</color> and <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Chromatic Splendor</color> are reset.\n- <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color> is cast faster. Casting <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color> generates <color=Highlight>Glimmer Shards</color> around Carlotta, in total dealing <color=Ice>Glacio DMG</color> to enemies with a DMG Multiplier equal to {3} of <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color>'s, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> DMG. <color=Highlight>Glimmer Shards</color> also reduce more of enemies' Vibration Strength.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color> shortly after <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Chromatic Splendor</color> generates <color=Highlight>Glimmer Shards</color>, restores {4} points of Concerto Energy, and grants <SapTag=5>{5}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=5} of <color=Highlight>Meta Vector</color>, in total dealing <color=Ice>Glacio DMG</color> with a DMG Multiplier equal to {6} of <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color>'s, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> DMG.\n- Shortly after a successful Dodge or <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>{Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color>.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color> grants <SapTag=7>{7}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=7} of <color=Highlight>Glorious Finale</color>. Each stack of <color=Highlight>Glorious Finale</color> increases the total DMG of <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Fatal Finale</color> by {8}, up to {9}. Against immobilized targets, the increase becomes {10} per stack, up to {11}. Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Fatal Finale</color> removes <color=Highlight>Glorious Finale</color>.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_5_2": "Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Imminent Oblivion</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Containment Tactics</color> grants Carlotta <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Iridescent Prism</color>.\nEach stack of <color=Highlight>Iridescent Prism</color> increases Carlotta's total DMG by {1}, up to {2}.",
+  "RoleTowerStarDetailDesc_5_3": "<color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Imminent Oblivion</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Containment Tactics</color>, and <color=Highlight>Death Knell</color> deal {0} more total DMG.",
