+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_3_Content": "As <color=#d19f27>Miss Galbrena</color> hands you the exam papers that need copying, a <color=#d19f27>strange sheet of paper</color> slips out.\nIt is... the wanted notice for the ringleader of a shooting that shocked the world two years ago? The name has been crossed out, and <color=#d19f27>the mark looks like the handwriting Miss Galbrena uses to grade tests</color>...\nShe says nothing. She simply folds the sheet and tucks it into her pocket.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_3_Title": "A Dark and Heavy Secret",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_4_Content": "During <color=#d19f27>Miss Verina</color>'s class, Cartethyia quietly slips you a note inviting you to go exploring on the streets after school.\nWhat you do not notice is that, while you read it, Miss Verina has come to stand right behind you.\n<color=#d19f27>\"{PlayerName}, what are you reading?\"</color>",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_4_Title": "Class Shenanigans",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_5_Content": "To prepare for the Nationals, you extend today's rehearsal by two hours.\nBut you are not the only ones who know how hard everyone has worked. During a short break, <color=#d19f27>Roccia</color> quietly calls you over to the school store.\n\"Seeing everyone try so hard really touched me. I baked some cookies for them. Could you help me hand them out, {PlayerName}?\"\nRoccia's kindness warms you through. But after a whole afternoon of rehearsal, everyone is parched, and would probably like a <color=#d19f27>cold drink</color> better than cookies...",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_5_Title": "A Special Treat",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_6_Content": "<color=#d19f27>Chisa</color> wants to bring more customers into the family restaurant. Which <color=#d19f27>marketing strategy</color> would work best?",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_6_Title": "Marketing Strategy",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_7_Content": "A customer wants to pick out a Teachers' Day gift for <color=#d19f27>Miss Verina</color>. What should you recommend?",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_7_Title": "Here Comes a Customer!",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_8_Content": "A customer asks for something <color=#d19f27>with a real kick</color>. What should you recommend?",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_8_Title": "Here Comes a Customer!",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_9_Content": "A classmate asks you to help find some references for his <color=#d19f27>physical training plan</color>. Since he is a beginner, who do you think he should learn from?",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_9_Title": "Time to Train!",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_3_1": "Take the papers and pretend you did not see a thing.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_3_2": "Gasp in shock and beg Miss Galbrena to spare you.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_3_3": "Casually bring up your brutal battle with a giant sandworm.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_4_1": "Come clean and apologize together with Cartethyia.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_4_2": "Eat the note and say Miss Verina must be seeing things.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_4_3": "Claim it's your own notes and find a way out of trouble.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_5_1": "Say nothing to Roccia, and buy two more cases of drinks to hand out together.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_5_2": "Suggest Roccia wrap up the cookies for everyone to take home.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_5_3": "Explain honestly and stay with Roccia to get some drinks ready.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_6_1": "Develop new dishes.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_6_2": "Run a promotion.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_6_3": "Upgrade the cooking tools.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_7_1": "A music box.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_7_2": "A Namipon keychain.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_7_3": "A pot of flowers.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_8_1": "The jumbo ice cream Miss Galbrena always orders.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_8_2": "The Laurus Salad Cartethyia always orders.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_8_3": "The Jinzhou Maocai Changli always orders.",
+  "SolarSchoolAffairs_Opt_9_1": "Miss Galbrena's heavy-weight training!",
