+  "SolarSchoolItem99": "Item limit reached",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_01": "A graduation gift from Phoebe. A commemorative keepsake from Celestial Steed Corp, crafted from costly materials and worth a great deal. Phoebe gives it to you in the hope that the bluebird will make its way through wind and waves to bring happiness your way.\nWhen you own this item, the Intimacy level with Phoebe will be automatically raised to Close in the next playthrough.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_02": "A graduation gift from Xiangli Yao. Beep-Boop was the first creation he completed as a child. Now modified, it says \"Happy graduation\" when you gently pat its head.\nWhen you own this item, the Intimacy level with Xiangli Yao will be automatically raised to Close in the next playthrough.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_03": "A graduation gift from Ciaccona. The pages contain every piece of music she composed while at school. Bring them to her for a little bonus: she will hum the pieces recorded in them for you.\nWhen you own this item, the Intimacy level with Ciaccona will be automatically raised to Close in the next playthrough.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_04": "A graduation gift from Buling. Wear these to block out as much outside sound as possible and concentrate on what you are doing.\nWhen you own this item, the Intimacy level with Buling will be automatically raised to Close in the next playthrough.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_05": "A graduation gift from Galbrena. Every feather in this handwoven dreamcatcher comes from a bird of prey. With it watching over you through the night, trust that even the fiercest nightmare will not dare come near.\nWhen you own this item, the Intimacy level with Galbrena will be automatically raised to Close in the next playthrough.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_06": "A graduation gift from Roccia. The figurine on the music box is from a film she once appeared in. Music plays as the gears turn, wishing you a night filled with starlight.\nWhen you own this item, the Intimacy level with Roccia will be automatically raised to Close in the next playthrough.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_07": "A graduation gift from Cartethyia. She sewed these hand puppets herself at the orphanage, and they kept her company through countless lonely nights. Now she gives them to you, hoping the Blessed Maiden's blessing will light your way.\nWhen you own this item, the Intimacy level with Cartethyia will be automatically raised to Close in the next playthrough.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_08": "A graduation gift from Changli. The envelope is adorned with red feathers and carries a refreshing fragrance. It must be her way of reminding you to think of her often as you continue your journey.\nWhen you own this item, the Intimacy level with Changli will be automatically raised to Close in the next playthrough.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_09": "A graduation gift from Verina. She nurtured the plant in this specimen herself and chose its loveliest leaves for you, hoping good fortune will follow you on your travels.\nWhen you own this item, the Intimacy level with Verina will be automatically raised to Close in the next playthrough.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_10": "A graduation gift from Chisa. She made this kirigami artwork herself, capturing everything she holds dear about her hometown. A keepsake for you to take along as you set off on your travels.\nWhen you own this item, the Intimacy level with Chisa will be automatically raised to Close in the next playthrough.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_11": "A planner for keeping track of your schedule and to-do list, specially gifted to you by Abby. Use it to plan your week at a glance.\nManage your time wisely and find your own answers as you navigate school life.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_12": "An ID issued by the school to every student. Use it to view your personal details and Friends List. This little card is essential for getting in and out of school and enjoying student-exclusive perks.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_13": "A special cookie handmade by Roccia, available only for a limited time during school events. Made in the shape of Principal Abby, it comes in a range of flavors.\nPero says you should try it if you get the chance!",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_14": "A painting by the renowned artist \"SubmittingTomorrow.\" Its loose brushwork exudes a serene, ethereal grace. Mist seems to drift from the scroll amid faint silhouettes of distant mountains, transporting the viewer beyond worldly cares.\nIncreases Aesthetics when obtained.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_15": "A simply designed necklace set with a clear, brilliant gemstone. Its color evokes a cloudless sky, leaving your mind feeling just as clear.\nIncreases Thinking when obtained.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_16": "After you got Buling to publish a \"legendary post\" on the forum, you became a school legend. Someone gave you this oddly familiar-looking item as a token of admiration.\nFor some reason, carrying it seems to increase your Popularity.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_17": "A notebook of unknown origin. It contains detailed notes on commonly misunderstood question types, with clear explanations and helpful illustrations that make it a valuable study aid.\nIncreases Knowledge when obtained.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_18": "A seal given to you by Abby. Technically, it's reserved for the Principal alone. Abby must trust you a great deal to give it to you.\nIncreases all stats when obtained.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_19": "The grand prize from the <b>Special Scratch-Off Event</b>. The pen's obsidian barrel has a luxurious sheen, and the nib is gold-plated. Its weight feels reassuring in your hand. Write your homework with it, and the paper beneath your nib might as well be a contract worth tens of millions.\nIncreases all stats when obtained.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_20": "A gift from Changli. \nBehind her composed smile, she keeps her true feelings hidden, content to wander alone at the edges of the crowd. Yet all she really longs for is the warmth of companionship, the simple joy of being among friends, and a heart that no longer has to face the world alone.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_21": "A gift from Cartethyia. \nIf you can't do something, work hard until you can. If you want something, go out and claim it! Her earnestness has an endearingly awkward edge, but she never holds back. And when she finally reached the end of her determined sprint, it was your hand she grasped.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_23": "The grand prize from the <b>Lucky Draw Event</b>. This record features classical music performed under the baton of a renowned conductor. The sweeping, melancholy melody is enough to bring even the hardest heart to tears.\nIncreases all stats when obtained.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_24": "A brooch styled after Ciaccona, awarded for reaching the max level in the <b>Club Association</b>.\nOn Club Leader Ciaccona's go—three, two, one! A few wrong notes won't hurt. As long as we're all playing together, we'll make beautiful music!",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_25": "A brooch styled after Changli, awarded for reaching the max level in the <b>Student Council</b>.\nAnswering student emails, organizing campus events, standing up for students' rights, and bringing people together... For many students, the Student Council is a place to turn when they need support.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_26": "[Spring Exclusive] Green tea made from tender spring buds and infused with the delicate fragrance of jasmine. Each sip leaves a sweet aftertaste, with floral notes that linger on the palate.\nThe tea leaves it uses is extremely rare. It will probably take 28 days to restock the item...",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_27": "[Summer Exclusive] An extra-large ice cream featuring three classic flavors: vanilla, strawberry, and chocolate. One bite is all it takes to beat the summer heat and shake off your fatigue.\nThe cream it uses is extremely rare. It will probably take 28 days to restock the item...",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_28": "[Autumn Exclusive] A hearty, crisp biscuit baked with freshly harvested wheat, nuts, and dried fruit. Its rich, toasty flavor makes you appreciate the bounty of the harvest.\nThe nuts and fruits needed to make the biscuit are extremely rare. It will probably take 28 days to restock the item...",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_29": "[Winter Exclusive] A calorie-packed dessert in a compact, portable package, topped with candied fruit. A quick burst of energy to keep you going, even in the middle of winter.\nThe honey it uses is extremely rare. It will probably take 28 days to restock the item...",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_30": "A bottle of sour soy milk with a rather peculiar smell.\nReduces Fatigue when consumed.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_31": "Fresh bread, rich with the aroma of wheat.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_32": "The very soul of a late-night snack.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_33": "For many students, this is the last resort before an all-nighter turns into an exam-day disaster.\nReduces Fatigue when consumed.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_34": "Just water and jam, yet somehow an extraordinary treat.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_35": "Who says you need a movie to enjoy popcorn?",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_36": "It's just a sour plum drink. Nothing more, nothing less.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_37": "Learning to love \"Dr. Chili Pepper\" is the first step to becoming a top-tier brainiac.\nReduces Fatigue when consumed.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_38": "It's just sugar and saline, but the placebo effect is powerful. Many students swear they feel more alert after drinking it.\nReduces Fatigue when consumed.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_39": "A wholesome, well-balanced meal.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_40": "Some savor every sip. Others drink it to make their suffering last a little longer.\nReduces Fatigue when consumed.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_41": "A mouthwatering wood-fired pizza piled high with sliced sausage. Its golden crust is lightly puffed around the edges, and every topping is smothered in melted cheese. One look is enough to work up an appetite.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_42": "Every noodle is tossed in a rich, savory sauce, sending a mouthwatering aroma wafting through the air with the rising steam.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_43": "A friendly reminder: no drink can replace a good night's sleep.\nReduces Fatigue when consumed.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_44": "A satisfying meal.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_45": "A quick and convenient meal.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_46": "The sauce art on top is what makes Omelette Rice truly special.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_47": "The jolt of snapping open the bottle perks you up more than the tonic itself.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_48": "A special ticket issued by Eekky Logistics for school events. Take part in eligible events to redeem your rewards. As one of the school's biggest sponsors, Eekky Logistics has long supported the school's growth and activities.\nEek eek! Feeling lucky? Give it a try! Eek eek!",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_49": "The school store's signature treat, baked by Roccia herself.\nInfused with a rich coffee aroma as they bake, these biscuits are crisp and fragrant, with a deep, lingering finish. Pair them with your favorite drink during a break between classes or a lazy afternoon, and savor a little moment of indulgence.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_50": "After what they've been through, these ingredients deserve a proper burial.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_51": "A special concoction served at the Student Council Cafe during the School Anniversary.\nYou choose the ingredients and decide how hard to stir, with a little \"Student Council Magic\" thrown in. All you need to crack it open is a straw and a whole lot of courage. The taste? Let's just say you'll never forget it!",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_52": "An abstract painting of your own creation.\nGeometric shapes and bold blocks of color fill the canvas. Some might call it worthless; others see a reflection of their own soul. Art has no right or wrong answers. Only you can decide what your work means.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_53": "A landscape painting of your own creation.\nA quiet bay unfolds across the canvas, its gentle hues soothing the soul. You can almost hear the waves lapping against the shore.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_54": "A sketch drawn by your own hand.\nBlack, white, and gray strokes dance across the page, stripping away the distractions of color to reveal the subject in its simplest form. A perfect way to hone your artistic fundamentals.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_55": "A cassette packed with pop hits.\nMaybe someone out there would like this.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_56": "A writing instrument with a distinctly old-fashioned charm.\nMaybe someone out there would like this.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_57": "After the cookies are gone, the tin would make for a handy little storage box.\nMaybe someone out there would like this.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_58": "A handicraft enthusiast's most trusted partner.\nMaybe someone out there would like this.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_59": "Crunchy biscuit sticks dipped in chocolate, perfect for sharing with friends.\nMaybe someone out there would like this.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_60": "A once-popular handheld game that lets you raise your very own pixelated Namipon. All the joy of having a pet, without a single stray hair on your clothes.\nMaybe someone out there would like this.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_61": "A whole box of rich, creamy matcha ice pops with refreshing coolness.\nMaybe someone out there would like this.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_62": "Crispy, deep-fried flat bamboo flowers. Each bag comes with a handful of flowers and enough fragrant air to fill the rest.\nMaybe someone out there would like this.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_63": "A tiny world where life flourishes without bounds.\nMaybe someone out there would like this.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_64": "A home gaming console that was once all the rage. Years later, it's not the games you remember, but the afternoons spent laughing and playing with friends.\nMaybe someone out there would like this.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_65": "Thin slices of potato, fried to a perfect crunch. Somehow, they're even more tempting at half price.\nMaybe someone out there would like this.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_66": "A fragrant brew with a hint of bitterness up front and a lingering sweetness. A true tea connoisseur might even uncover layers of flavor hidden beneath the first sip.\nMaybe someone out there would like this.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_67": "Proof of your intent to acquire the school and the funds to back it up.\nWith Phoebe's help, you negotiate with the School Board, complete asset reviews, and clear the legal hurdles before signing the acquisition agreement. You acquire the school for a sum close to Celestial Steed Corp's evaluation, promising to preserve its educational philosophy for years to come.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_68": "A graduation yearbook filled with the bright smiles of your classmates and snapshots of ordinary yet unforgettable days.\nAll the time spent together is preserved between its pages, turning every encounter and shared memory into a cherished keepsake.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_69": "A sheet of music left behind by a girl with aqua-blue hair. There's something about her that feels strangely familiar, as though you've known her for years. And yet... you've barely met, haven't you?\nThe melody looks playable on the piano. You're still struggling to read sheet music, but perhaps one day you'll be able to play it yourself...",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_70": "A proposal obtained after successfully securing sponsorship for the Liaison Center. Proof of an Emergency Event well done.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_71": "A Bluetooth speaker awarded after the Student Council's successful presentation. Proof of an Emergency Event well done.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_72": "A metronome awarded for successfully holding the joint performance for the Club Association. Proof of an Emergency Event well done.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_73": "Proof that your Reputation and Influence have reached their peak.\nWith Buling spearheading the publicity campaign, your rising fame has drawn the media's attention. The school's reputation is on the mend, and enrollment is looking up. As public confidence in the school's future grows, so do opportunities for corporate partnerships and sponsorships.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemDescription_74": "A gift from the Shorekeeper. This delicate flower-shaped brooch seems to be modeled after a particular plant.\nThrough years of lonely watch, she has treasured every moment you've shared, every meeting and reunion beneath the endless night sky. She'll remember them all, always, until the day she once again lights your way home along the shore.",
+  "SolarSchoolItemGetDescription_01": "[Memento]: The effect of the item is active when owned. <color=#d19f27>Carries over directly to the next playthrough</color>.",
