+  "SolarSchool_CharacterSkill_ShouAnRen1": "That uniform suits you well.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterSkill_ShouAnRen2": "Please, call me \"Shorekeeper.\" It stands for a meaning, and a resolve, that exist because of you.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterSkill_ShouAnRen3": "Because I was always the one waiting for you to return... Let me be the one who keeps watch this time, too.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterSkill_ShouAnRen4": "I want more of you. I want to stay by your side always. This longing I feel... I am certain now. This is love.",
