+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_10_1": "Good day... I mean, hello, {PlayerName}. I'm just out for a stroll. Oh, and don't mind my bodyguards...",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_10_2": "Hello, {PlayerName}. I've heard that close friends text each other in their free time to stay in touch... Would it be a bother if I started messaging everyone?",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_10_3": "{PlayerName}, I've prepared gifts for everyone! They're property deeds from Celestial Steed Corp, to thank you all for taking such good care of me... H-huh? Is that... not an appropriate gift?",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_10_4": "May the gentle breeze bring a bountiful catch, and may the divinities bring every ship safely home. Mm, I learned that at my old school church. Somehow, it's stuck with me ever since...",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_10_5": "Livia, Brenno, over here— Ah, {PlayerName}! P-please don't tell Father about this. He doesn't allow me to get too close to stray cats...",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_11_1": "If you're interested, {PlayerName}, please come by my family's restaurant often. My parents have been experimenting with new dishes lately, and they both think very highly of you.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_11_2": "The blueprint for my \"Fully Automatic Precision Cake Divider\" could still use some work... It's meant to solve that pesky problem where every slice gets smaller the further you cut. Interested in hearing the details, {PlayerName}?",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_11_3": "My parents say we must have you over for another meal before you graduate, {PlayerName}. I've recently designed a kitchen tool that cuts carrots and potatoes into equal portions at the same time. Please do come and try it, {PlayerName}.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_11_4": "Welcome. Today's special is miso ramen with octopus dumplings. I've saved a seat for you, {PlayerName}. I'll go tell Dad to start cooking.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_11_5": "Would you like some chocolate biscuit sticks? They're a quick way to replenish your energy, and they taste good, too. But of course, the more important thing is to balance work and rest.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_1_1": "If you ever need a hand settling in, just come see us at the Student Council. Don't worry about being a bother. It's always a pleasure talking with you.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_1_2": "Like shopping? There are some lovely spots around town. Let's take a walk around together when you're free. I know one shop with a pair of earrings that would really bring out your eyes.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_1_3": "When did I get so used to you walking beside me? Hehe... Whatever the road ahead, having someone at my side like this... I suppose I don't mind it.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_1_4": "The square is so lively. Everyone's just going about their day. It always warms my heart to see. Hehe, as the saying goes, \"A peaceful land makes for happy homes.\"",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_1_5": "It's rare that you get a free moment to stop by. I've just finished with the students' letters, so if you're in no hurry, care for a game of Weiqi?",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_2_1": "I'm so excited to see what campus life has in store! What about you, {PlayerName}? Got any plans? Maybe we can make some together!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_2_2": "I heard that every summer break, everyone goes to the beach together! Swimming, beach volleyball, tests of courage, ghost stories at pajama parties.... I can't wait! I wanna do it all with everyone!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_2_3": "When I think about you graduating soon, {PlayerName}, I just... Sniff. No, no! Times like this are exactly when I have to keep my chin up! {PlayerName}, let's have another adventure today!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_2_4": "Never skip your warm-up! Before I run 20 laps around the field, I usually jog two easy laps to warm up first... Huh? {PlayerName}, why are you running away?",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_2_5": "I think my trumpet playing's getting better! Want to hear, {PlayerName}? I don't have any accompaniment right now, but... Hmm, that's fine! Playing solo makes it easier to hear what I still need to work on!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_4_1": "Ta-da—a cookie, perfectly paired with your coffee. Are you here to study, work, shop, or see me, {PlayerName}?",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_4_2": "Ah, you found me! As a reward—ta-da! A Disguise Sleep Mask. With this, you can doze off in class without anyone noticing.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_4_3": "Ah, you found me! As a reward—ta-da! Vacation Sunglasses. With these, you can go to the beach no matter how bright the sun gets.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_4_4": "Ah, you found me! As a reward—ta-da! A Fate Eraser. If an exam question really has you stumped, toss it and let fate decide.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_4_5": "Um... I didn't bring any reward items today, and I have nothing to sell you, {PlayerName}. But I did bring my box. If you get tired, {PlayerName}, you can curl up inside for a little rest.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_5_1": "An assassin lives by three rules: precision, composure, and patience. Wait for the opening, then strike once. Reading comprehension is no different.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_5_2": "Damn, it's hot... Time to cool off with a Forte-astic Fizz & Freeze.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_5_3": "When you're chasing a target, clearing obstacles is only half the job. The real trick is keeping your head clear. Think like a sniper: steady breath, steady aim, one perfect shot.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_5_4": "All clear. No threats in sight. Seems like today's pop quiz can proceed as planned.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_5_5": "Even when there's no danger around, you still need to exercise to keep your heart healthy and body fat in check. How about a lap around the field with me?",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_6_1": "All I want is to see every one of you grow up healthy and strong, like Starflowers pushing their way through the soil!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_6_2": "Schoolwork matters, but so does staying healthy! Drink plenty of water, eat your veggies, and... hmm, drink lots of milk to help you grow tall!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_6_3": "Every summer, seeds from faraway places drift into town on the breeze, take root, and bloom into lovely flowers. Hehe, a little like you, {PlayerName}!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_6_4": "\"Why aren't you home studying at this hour?\" Hehe, as if I'd ever say that! Whatever shape or color my nursery flowers grow into, every single one makes me proud!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_6_5": "Did you know, {PlayerName}, that the mushrooms in this hot pot dish aren't really plants? They're fungi! ...Oh dear, there I go turning everything into a lesson again...",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_7_1": "You dare talk to me like that? I'll have your—Ahaha, if it isn't {PlayerName}! What account? Boss, you must be seeing things, hahaha.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_7_2": "Eerie music, flipped mirrors, mannequins that move on their own... Ugh, clickbait, clickbait, clickbait! Where am I supposed to find anything actually worth posting?",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_7_3": "Hey, I DO log off the forum sometimes!! Look, Ciaccona just posted a new song. Here, take these headphones. Wanna listen together?",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_7_4": "Hey, everybody! Today I'm taking you all to... Oh, it's {PlayerName}? Wanna join my stream? We'll split the gifts fifty-fifty!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_7_5": "*Furious keyboard clacking* \"You've got no proof, and you still have the nerve to say...\" Hah! Blocked me already? That's it? Come back and argue when you've practiced for another two years!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_8_1": "Everyone, follow my lead— Da, da-la da-da-la da-da, da-da-la da-da!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_8_2": "Hello there! Want to join the Orchestral Music Club? Oh, it's {PlayerName}... Hehe, sorry about that. It's a reflex. I shout that at pretty much everyone I see.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_8_3": "Today's theme is freedom and life! Hey, {PlayerName}, want to join my impromptu street concert? It'll be a lot of fun, I promise!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_8_4": "Every meeting ends in a farewell, and every farewell brings a new beginning... Sigh, just thinking about graduation is making my music all mushy. What if I start crying in the middle of a performance?",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_8_5": "Being by the beach always makes me want to sing something romantic! C'mon, follow the rhythm of the waves with me— Lulala, lululala, lulala!",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_9_1": "The Student Council gets such lovely natural light. Somehow, I think more clearly here. If something is troubling you, you're welcome to sit with me here for a while.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_9_2": "When I'm working on a research topic, I'd rather get out and stretch my legs now and then than spend hours cooped up in the lab. Even if I don't stumble on a new idea, a chat with you is interesting in its own right.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_9_3": "If you get stuck on a problem, you can have \"Xiang-LEE\" help you. In return, though, you'll have to keep it company and chat a little. After all, talking with someone as special as you is a learning experience for it, too.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_9_4": "For both me and \"Xiang-LEE,\" the feelings we experience when talking with people are a precious frame of reference. I treasure moments when I get to feel something new.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUI_FixedLocation_9_5": "Oh, you like this place too? What a coincidence. Heh heh. It's not exactly a balanced meal, but sometimes it's nice to forget all those rules and just enjoy something delicious.",
+  "SolarSchool_CharacterUpgrade_Abu1": "Complete the related story with Abby",
