+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1101": "The School Anniversary is the school's chance to show everyone what it's really like. Organize the records of its history, explain its educational philosophy, put student work and everyday school life on display... It's fiddly work, but it gives guests a fuller picture of the school. Chances like this don't come often, so get ready properly with everyone at the Student Council!",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1104": "While going through the Student Council's recent applications, Changli found one that has been stuck for some time. A first check shows nothing wrong with the application itself. Required materials were simply left out during a handover, so it never moved on to the next stage. She asks you to help find out where it currently stands, contact the person in charge to confirm the details, and supply the missing materials so the application can move forward.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1106": "While going through the Student Council's recent applications, Changli found one that has been stuck for some time. A first check shows nothing wrong with the application itself. Required materials were simply left out during a handover, so it never moved on to the next stage. She asks you to help find out where it currently stands, contact the person in charge to confirm the details, and supply the missing materials so the application can move forward.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1107": "The Student Council is planning a school event, but the students in charge of the discussion cannot agree on any of several alternative plans, each with its own pros and cons. Changli has reviewed the existing materials, yet she is in no hurry to decide. She wants to hear everyone's thoughts first. She has contacted the people involved and invites you to join her in hearing their views on the different plans and the reasoning behind them, as a reference for settling on the final one.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1108": "The Student Council is planning a school event, but the students in charge of the discussion cannot agree on any of several alternative plans, each with its own pros and cons. Changli has reviewed the existing materials, yet she is in no hurry to decide. She wants to hear everyone's thoughts first. She has contacted the people involved and invites you to join her in hearing their views on the different plans and the reasoning behind them, as a reference for settling on the final one.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1201": "Act submissions for the School Anniversary's Arts Gala are officially open! Next comes collecting sign-ups, fitting each club's rehearsals into the schedule, confirming the lineup, and reviewing the acts... Every step needs careful handling. Help the Club Association get it all ready, so everyone gets a chance to show what they've got on stage.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1203": "Help the Orchestral Music Club go through all its instruments and accessories. Count them, note what shape each one's in, check the fragile parts one at a time, and finish with whatever cleaning and maintenance they need. This is the last round of preparations before the performance, so make sure every instrument is in good condition for the upcoming qualifiers!",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1204": "Help the Orchestral Music Club go through all its instruments and accessories. Count them, note what shape each one's in, check the fragile parts one at a time, and finish with whatever cleaning and maintenance they need. This is the last round of preparations before the performance, so make sure every instrument is in good condition for the upcoming qualifiers!",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1207": "Humility, honesty, compassion, valor, justice, sacrifice, honor, spirit! A true knight trains in more than swordplay and the battlefield. Help those in need, protect the weak, settle disputes, return lost belongings, keep order on the street and in the community... Live the way of the knight, starting with the small things around you.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1208": "Humility, honesty, compassion, valor, justice, sacrifice, honor, spirit! A true knight trains in more than swordplay and the battlefield. Help those in need, protect the weak, settle disputes, return lost belongings, keep order on the street and at the school... Live the way of the knight, starting with the small things around you.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1401": "Help Roccia out and get a taste of running the school store day-to-day. Based on the store's sales and what customers like, pick out some sparkly new products with Roccia that can impress customers, and get ready for the store's next restock!",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1403": "Help Roccia out and get a taste of running the school store day-to-day. Based on the store's sales and what customers like, pick out some sparkly new products with Roccia that can impress customers, and get ready for the store's next restock!",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1404": "Every detail on stage can affect how the performance turns out. Go with Roccia to the Drama Fan Club and help everyone fine-tune their pacing and emotional delivery. Or join in yourself—improvise alongside the Drama Fan Club members, then add a dash of special coaching, \"Roccia style.\"",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_14041": "Every detail on stage can affect how the performance turns out. Go with Roccia to the Drama Fan Club and help everyone fine-tune their pacing and emotional delivery. Or join in yourself—improvise alongside the Drama Fan Club members, then add a dash of special coaching, \"Roccia style.\"",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1407": "Every detail on stage can affect how the performance turns out. Go with Roccia to the Drama Fan Club and help everyone fine-tune their pacing and emotional delivery. Or join in yourself—improvise alongside the Drama Fan Club members, then add a dash of special coaching, \"Roccia style.\"",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1501": "Galbrena plans to weave a batch of dreamcatchers by hand as gifts for the students. She asks you to help prepare the materials, picking out suitable feathers, beads and colored thread, then weaving them carefully into one-of-a-kind dreamcatchers. Weave good wishes into every strand, so that these little charms keep everyone's nights peaceful and carry away worries, stress and bad dreams.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1502": "While grading reading assignments, Galbrena noticed that students had offered many different interpretations of the same literary work. She plans to use the chance to teach everyone to read a work from different angles. She asks you to help check the relevant passages, find the textual evidence behind each reading, and organize it all in preparation for the coming class discussion.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_15021": "Coursework and daily routines have been keeping everyone busy lately, so Galbrena has decided to set her tasks aside for a while and treat herself to a cool dessert break. She has collected several flavors of milkshake shaved ice and invites you to sample each one. Compare their sweetness, texture, and flavor with care, then choose your favorite to recommend to the other students.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1504": "While grading reading assignments, Galbrena noticed that students had offered many different interpretations of the same literary work. She plans to use the chance to teach everyone to read a work from different angles. She asks you to help check the relevant passages, find the textual evidence behind each reading, and organize it all in preparation for the coming class discussion.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_15041": "Coursework and daily routines have been keeping everyone busy lately, so Galbrena has decided to set her tasks aside for a while and treat herself to a cool dessert break. She has collected several flavors of milkshake shaved ice and invites you to sample each one. Compare their sweetness, texture, and flavor with care, then choose your favorite to recommend to the other students.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1507": "While grading reading assignments, Galbrena noticed that students had offered many different interpretations of the same literary work. She plans to use the chance to teach everyone to read a work from different angles. She asks you to help check the relevant passages, find the textual evidence behind each reading, and organize it all in preparation for the coming class discussion.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1604": "Verina has been trying to grow different varieties of plants and vegetables, choosing seeds and adjusting how they are raised to observe the different traits that show up as they grow. She would like you to join in, tend each plant carefully, and record how every one of them grows. Once there are enough observations, compile the new findings into the school's ecological plant guide together!",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1606": "Lately, Verina has noticed that one student in her class often skips group activities after school and rarely joins in discussions with classmates. She is concerned about this student, but does not want to jump to conclusions without knowing the facts. She asks you to help find out how they have been doing recently and whether they are having trouble with their studies or daily life, and then to talk together about whether they need help.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1607": "Lately, Verina has noticed that one student in her class often skips group activities after school and rarely joins in discussions with classmates. She is concerned about this student, but does not want to jump to conclusions without knowing the facts. She asks you to help find out how they have been doing recently and whether they are having trouble with their studies or daily life, and then to talk together about whether they need help.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1608": "After the science lab class, Verina found while checking the lab records that several groups were missing key data, and some students had not noted their exact experimental conditions, making the follow-up lesson harder to prepare. She asks you to help organize the lab materials, check for the missing information, and ask the students involved to confirm their procedures so you can complete the records as fully as possible.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1610": "After the science lab class, Verina found while checking the lab records that several groups were missing key data, and some students had not noted their exact experimental conditions, making the follow-up lesson harder to prepare. She asks you to help organize the lab materials, check for the missing information, and ask the students involved to confirm their procedures so you can complete the records as fully as possible.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_16101": "After the science lab class, Verina found while checking the lab records that several groups were missing key data, and some students had not noted their exact experimental conditions, making the follow-up lesson harder to prepare. She asks you to help organize the lab materials, check for the missing information, and ask the students involved to confirm their procedures so you can complete the records as fully as possible.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1702": "The school forum has received an anonymous post. The poster claims that strange noises have been coming from somewhere at the school lately, along with figures nobody can explain, and students were soon discussing it eagerly. To get to the bottom of it, Buling has decided to investigate the location herself. She invites you to work out where these odd occurrences come from and uncover the truth behind the campus ghost story.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1703": "The school forum has received an anonymous post. The poster claims that strange noises have been coming from somewhere at the school lately, along with figures nobody can explain, and students were soon discussing it eagerly. To get to the bottom of it, Buling has decided to investigate the location herself. She invites you to work out where these odd occurrences come from and uncover the truth behind the campus ghost story.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_17031": "Unresolved posts have been piling up in the forum's lost-and-found section. In some cases the owners have already recovered their belongings, but nobody has updated the listing. Buling wants to use this cleanup to verify each outstanding post. Join Buling in contacting the students involved, confirming who owns each item and whether it has been collected, and updating the posts promptly to get the lost-and-found section back in order.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1706": "Unresolved posts have been piling up in the forum's lost-and-found section. In some cases the owners have already recovered their belongings, but nobody has updated the listing. Buling wants to use this cleanup to verify each outstanding post. Join Buling in contacting the students involved, confirming who owns each item and whether it has been collected, and updating the posts promptly to get the lost-and-found section back in order.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1707": "Unresolved posts have been piling up in the forum's lost-and-found section. In some cases the owners have already recovered their belongings, but nobody has updated the listing. Buling wants to use this cleanup to verify each outstanding post. Join Buling in contacting the students involved, confirming who owns each item and whether it has been collected, and updating the posts promptly to get the lost-and-found section back in order.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1802": "While sorting through the Orchestral Music Club's files, Ciaccona was surprised to find that the score she has been revising lately is missing. It is the orchestral piece she prepared specially for upcoming ensemble practice, and it still has several revision marks that are not final. With rehearsal fast approaching, she hurried to find you and asks for your help tracking down the mysteriously vanished score...",
