+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1808": "In the Orchestral Music Club's recent ensemble pieces, a few measures have never sounded quite in sync. Ciaccona has listened to the rehearsal recordings over and over and tried rearranging the parts, but still cannot find the root of the problem. She suspects the instruments themselves may be at fault. She invites you to listen to the recordings with her when you have free time and pick out the instrument whose tone sounds off in that passage.",
