+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_1901": "Something odd has been happening with the Student Council's website portal lately. Some event information won't update properly, while a few pages keep displaying outdated data. Yet routine checks have turned up nothing unusual. Xiangli Yao plans to review the site's maintenance and edit logs to get to the bottom of it. Help him track when the issues first appeared, which pages are affected, and how the errors show up to pinpoint the cause.",
