+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_19031": "To be ready for Celestial Steed Corp, the school will soon run routine checks on some public equipment, and the Council is compiling reports on how the equipment at each site is running. Since the sites are scattered, Xiangli Yao wants your help recording each device's operating status and flagging the problems that need further repair, so the school can handle all repairs together afterward.",
