+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_2101": "School events have wrapped up for now, but the Liaison Center still has to prepare ahead. Material support and long-term partnerships alike are valuable resources that take time to build up. Help Chisa seek out new partners who might work with the school, and lay the groundwork for more opportunities in future events!",
