+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_2107": "To enrich its menu, the family restaurant is preparing several brand-new dishes. Join Chisa for a tasting and take careful notes on everyone's views of the seasoning and texture! And yes, \"This is delicious. Could I have one more?\" is valuable feedback too. A few extra mouthfuls are part of the job, after all!",
