+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_2201": "Lately, the school has been receiving student feedback on class schedules, club activities, public facilities and more. Some of the issues cut across several departments and are hard to settle properly all at once. Abby wants to understand what the students actually need before arranging the follow-up work. Help Abby collect student feedback and verify the details.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_2202": "An event at the school is about to begin, but the planned venue has suddenly fallen through, affecting the students and clubs who had already coordinated for it. With so many people involved, Abby is reworking the current event plans and asks you to help contact the students and clubs concerned, keeping the event running as smoothly as possible without causing needless trouble for anyone else's plans.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_2203": "Abby has been so busy lately that it cannot spare even the time to eat at the family restaurant, yet it keeps thinking about the restaurant's new dish. With one job after another piling up, Abby asks you to make a trip to the restaurant and bring a portion of the new dish back. There is no time to lose. Get there before the new dish sells out, and try it on behalf of the busy principal.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalDescription_2204": "Abby has been busy handling all sorts of school affairs lately and rarely gets the chance to catch its breath. Looking at the mountain of work, it could not help sighing that it would be nice if someone could fill in as principal for a while. Just joking, of course! Put the work aside for a bit and spend some relaxed, happy time with Abby, so the busy principal can enjoy a moment of leisure too.",
