+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalFailDialogue_1": "There's no need to dwell on the result, {PlayerName}. One misstep doesn't undo everything you've put in, and experience counts as a gain, too.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalFailDialogue_10": "If you're tired, please take a break. Don't force yourself. I'm sure you'll manage it next time, {PlayerName}.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalFailDialogue_11": "A disappointing result doesn't disprove the method. Next time, just adjust it to the situation.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalFailDialogue_12": "Hm? Bet you're hungry, {PlayerName}. C'mon, let's go get something good to eat together! Heh heh, can't do a thing on an empty stomach, right?",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalFailDialogue_2": "It's fine! Even the knights in stories miss a swing now and then. Let's get our footing back and give it another go together!",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalFailDialogue_3": "Aw, no biggie, no biggie! With Boss's skills, you'll make it back next time, no doubt!",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalFailDialogue_4": "No rush. I'll keep at it with you, {PlayerName}. But right now, I think what you really need is a rest.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalFailDialogue_5": "Didn't see that coming... Relax, it hasn't come to special interrogation methods. Not yet, anyway. A failed operation still has lessons to teach.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalFailDialogue_6": "Just as breeding flowers doesn't always go smoothly, everyone hits a rough patch sometimes. Next time, let's figure it out together.",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalFailDialogue_8": "Don't worry, a curtain call isn't the end of the show, you know. Besides, a story needs a few bumps along the way, or the later chapters wouldn't be half as fun!",
+  "SolarSchool_SpecialApprovalFailDialogue_9": "Thank you for trying. It looks like something went wrong at one of the steps. If you're free, we could track down the cause together.",
