   "Luuk_Shengtai_2_5": "じゃあ、今が一息つく時だね。",
   "Luuk_Shengtai_2_6": "実はワタシも同じさ、今やっている仕事を終わらせたら、部屋の片付けをしようと思っていたのに……いつも別のタスクが割り込んできてね。",
   "Luuk_Shengtai_2_7": "まあ、人生とはこういうものかな～何もかもが計画通りにとはいかないさ。ワタシたちにできるのは、忙しい合間を縫って、一息つける隙間を見つけ出すことくらいだと思うよ。",
+  "LyricsText_700001_Original": "<i>The home I knew</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700001_Translation": "<i>私の知る家も</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700002_Original": "<i>now towers tall with light</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700002_Translation": "<i>今は光を放つ高い塔となり</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700003_Original": "<i>The pale-walled ward</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700003_Translation": "<i>青白い壁の病棟も</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700004_Original": "<i>now pours with golden wine</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700004_Translation": "<i>今や黄金の酒があふれる</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700005_Original": "<i>I walk that empty wasteland</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700005_Translation": "<i>私はあの荒涼とした荒野を歩く</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700006_Original": "<i>no one remembers</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700006_Translation": "<i>誰も覚えていない</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700007_Original": "<i>no one recalls</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700007_Translation": "<i>誰も思い出せない</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700008_Original": "<i>who we were</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700008_Translation": "<i>私たちが何者だったのかを</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700017_Original": "<i>Through the hurt move on now</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700017_Translation": "<i>痛みを乗り越え 前へ進んで</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700018_Original": "<i>Fear no more, the morn comes to call</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700018_Translation": "<i>もう恐れないで 夜明けが訪れを告げる</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700019_Original": "<i>Face the day, you've always been</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700019_Translation": "<i>新たな一日を迎え入れて あなたは最初から</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700020_Original": "<i>The starlight you longed to embraced</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700020_Translation": "<i>あなたがなりたかった光なのだから</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700021_Original": "<i>Away you wander into dark endless night</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700021_Translation": "<i>あなたは暗く果てしない夜へと歩み出す</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700022_Original": "<i>Aglow petals drift round you like light</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700022_Translation": "<i>光を帯びた花びらが 光の粒のように 周りを漂う</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700023_Original": "<i>Aware what it costs but you let it go</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700023_Translation": "<i>代価を知りながらも 気にも留めずに</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700024_Original": "<i>Just let them fall</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700024_Translation": "<i>ただ 散りゆくままに</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700025_Original": "<i>Your love never fades</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700025_Translation": "<i>その愛は決して色褪せない</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700026_Original": "<i>In the souls you held your spring is still alive</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700026_Translation": "<i>あなたが抱きしめた魂には 今も春が鮮やかに息づく</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700027_Original": "<i>Now our turn our side will bring you back to life</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700027_Translation": "<i>今度は私たちの番 あなたに再び命を吹き込む</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700028_Original": "<i>All of the light you gave</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700028_Translation": "<i>あなたがくれた光が</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700029_Original": "<i>now find its way to you</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700029_Translation": "<i>今 あなたのもとへとたどり着く</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700030_Original": "<i>May you now bloom once again</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700030_Translation": "<i>再び咲き誇れますように</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700031_Original": "<i>Hope remains</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700031_Translation": "<i>希望はまだ残っている</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700032_Original": "<i>All of the dreams   we keep</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700032_Translation": "<i>私たちが大切に抱いてきた夢が</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700033_Original": "<i>Rising as light for YOU, into the sky</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700033_Translation": "<i>あなたのために光となり 空高く昇って</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700035_Original": "<i>Let it shine anew</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700035_Translation": "<i>再び輝きを放つ</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700036_Original": "<i>Leave all of that behind. Let me see what life brings to me, what a simple day can feel like</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700036_Translation": "<i>悩みなんて忘れて 何気ない日々の彩りを楽しもう</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700039_Original": "<i>For once can take my time （Maybe I Want to be here just a while more with you now）</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700039_Translation": "<i>たまにはゆっくりでもいいよね（もう少し ここにいたい あと少し 君といたい）</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700040_Original": "<i>So this is what the days can be these fleeting moments stay in my dream~</i>",
+  "LyricsText_700040_Translation": "<i>毎日ってこんなに素敵 過ぎゆく瞬間も夢に残る</i>",
   "LyricsText_750001_Original": "",
   "LyricsText_750001_Translation": "",
   "LyricsText_750002_Original": "",
